values
  ('164838704171112369', 'My Angel', 2004, 'Drama', 'Serge Frydman, Vilko Filač', 'Serge Frydman', 'Vanessa Paradis, Vincent Rottiers, Eduardo Noriega, Eric Ruf, Claude Perron, Thomas Fersen, Anne-Marie Loop, Jean-Benoît Ugeux', null, 'Colette, a prostitute in love, receives a phone call in the middle of the night. An unknown colleague asks her for a favour in the form of a cry for help: to pick up her boy and bring him to her. She, herself, needs a child to make her loved ex return to her.', 'Colette, a prostitute in love, receives a phone call in the middle of the night. An unknown colleague asks her for a favour in the form of a cry for help: to pick up her boy and bring him to her. She, herself, needs a child to make her loved ex return to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAFvlEDBVCxzfRxFvF5QIMQK8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68873'),
  ('373851941508385297', 'My Animal', 2023, 'Horror, Romance, Fantasy', 'Jacqueline Castel, Bryn McCashin, Brandon Cabral', 'Jae Matthews', 'Bobbi Salvör Menuez, Amandla Stenberg, Heidi von Palleske, Stephen McHattie, Cory Lipman, Joe Apollonio, Charles F Halpenny, Harrison W Halpenny', 'R', 'Tormented by a hidden family curse, Heather lives in seclusion on the outskirts of a small town. When she falls for the rebellious Jonny, their connection threatens to unravel Heather''s suppressed desires, tempting her to unleash the animal within.', 'Tormented by a hidden family curse, Heather lives in seclusion on the outskirts of a small town. When she falls for the rebellious Jonny, their connection threatens to unravel Heather''s suppressed desires, tempting her to unleash the animal within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp0fLOf30L2pUA5gxEp0ZoUHPg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058689'),
  ('773642775198252180', 'My Annoying Brother', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ki Se-hun, Kwon Soo-kyung, Kim Sung-kwan', 'Yu Young-ah', 'Cho Jung-seok, Doh Kyung-soo, Park Shin-hye, Kim Kang-hyun, Ji Dae-han, Im Cheol-hyung, Lee Do-yeon, Lee Yeon-su', null, 'A jailed swindler leaps at the chance to earn parole in return for taking care of his estranged brother, an athlete who recently lost his sight.', 'A jailed swindler leaps at the chance to earn parole in return for taking care of his estranged brother, an athlete who recently lost his sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Cxrt3gSH9VAKDvsuk6Tx1IShJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426166'),
  ('711871065325355966', 'My Apologies', 2023, 'Comedy', 'İbrahim Büyükak', 'İbrahim Büyükak', 'İbrahim Büyükak, Oğuzhan Koç, Gizem Karaca, Metin Coşkun, Müfit Kayacan, Mert Turak, Yeliz Kuvancı, Gümeç Alpay Aslan', null, 'Erkin, who works as a watchman at the lighthouse, is a lonely man in his mid-thirties. Erkin, crushed under his credit debts, one day receives the news of his grandfather''s death. A big surprise awaits Erkin, who immediately goes to his grandfather, who is staying in the nursing home. He asks his grandfather Erkin to apologize to his brother Koray and ex-fiancee Merve, whose heart he broke years ago. Having to fulfill his grandfather''s wish in order to get rid of his loan debts, Erkin finds himself in a great adventure in this process.', 'Erkin, who works as a watchman at the lighthouse, is a lonely man in his mid-thirties. Erkin, crushed under his credit debts, one day receives the news of his grandfather''s death. A big surprise awaits Erkin, who immediately goes to his grandfather, who is staying in the nursing home. He asks his grandfather Erkin to apologize to his brother Koray and ex-fiancee Merve, whose heart he broke years ago. Having to fulfill his grandfather''s wish in order to get rid of his loan debts, Erkin finds himself in a great adventure in this process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjA8vqKnHHHbGOllVTcL2gwBvus.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101410'),
  ('998252202988907379', 'My Apprenticeship', 1939, 'Drama', 'Mark Donskoy, Pyotr Yermolov', 'Mark Donskoy, Ilya Gruzdev', 'Aleksei Lyarsky, Irina Zarubina, Varvara Massalitinova, Elizaveta Lilina, Ivan Kudryavtsev, N. Berezovskaya, Ye. Seleznyov, Darya Zerkalova', null, 'Second entry in Ukrainian director Mark Donskoy''s "Maxim Gorki" trilogy. Picking up where 1938''s My Childhood left off, the story covers the years in Gorki''s life when the future writer (Alexei Lyarsky) was on his own, looking for a purpose and place in life.', 'Second entry in Ukrainian director Mark Donskoy''s "Maxim Gorki" trilogy. Picking up where 1938''s My Childhood left off, the story covers the years in Gorki''s life when the future writer (Alexei Lyarsky) was on his own, looking for a purpose and place in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOSsqzcuZeB0hC7UegMorP0zwVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148536'),
  ('437503320569429624', 'My Architect: A Son''s Journey', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Nathaniel Kahn, Robert Richman', 'Nathaniel Kahn', 'Edmund Bacon, Edwina Pattison Daniels, Balkrishna Doshi, Frank Gehry, Philip Johnson, Louis Kahn, Nathaniel Kahn, Sue Ann Kahn', null, 'World-famous architect Louis Kahn (Exeter Library, Salk Institute, Bangladeshi Capitol Building) had two illegitimate children with two different women outside of his marriage. Son Nathaniel always hoped that someday his father would come and live with him and his mother, but Kahn never left his wife. Instead, Kahn was found dead in a men''s room in Penn Station when Nathaniel was only 11.', 'World-famous architect Louis Kahn (Exeter Library, Salk Institute, Bangladeshi Capitol Building) had two illegitimate children with two different women outside of his marriage. Son Nathaniel always hoped that someday his father would come and live with him and his mother, but Kahn never left his wife. Instead, Kahn was found dead in a men''s room in Penn Station when Nathaniel was only 11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flpuP2Y2qUkVGghsOYkxj0HkgB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50314'),
  ('325799578983569710', 'My Aunt', 1986, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Halit Refiğ, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Müjde Ar, Yaşar Alptekin, Mehmet Akan, Ayşe Demirel, Necati Bilgiç, Tomris Oğuzalp, Haldun Ergüvenç, Ferit Ferman', null, 'Üftade has long been the object of men’s fury. Her only hope is to marry the young man she is in love with and escape her traumatic life in the home of her abusive stepfather. However, when her lover suddenly leaves her, Üftade''s despair increases exponentially, and she begins to lose her mental balance due to the traumas of her childhood. Throughout the years, her suffering is witnessed by her nephew, who feels helpless to do anything about her condition.', 'Üftade has long been the object of men’s fury. Her only hope is to marry the young man she is in love with and escape her traumatic life in the home of her abusive stepfather. However, when her lover suddenly leaves her, Üftade''s despair increases exponentially, and she begins to lose her mental balance due to the traumas of her childhood. Throughout the years, her suffering is witnessed by her nephew, who feels helpless to do anything about her condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFq4PPEsoc309Go8yunRtoy7r1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300207'),
  ('1072317207946146349', 'My Aunt the Hippie', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Giorgos Petridis, Aris Stavrou', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Andreas Barkoulis, Nora Valsami, Giannis Michalopoulos, Vasilis Tsivilikas, Maria Martika, Popi Alva, Anthi Gounari', null, 'Mama Leni, a poor widow, works as a cleaner in a large hotel, while studying in America the only daughter Catherine. The daughter of ignoring their financial situation and believes that her mother is a hotel guest. Suddenly Mama Leni gets a letter from her daughter, she says coming to Athens for vacation with his fiancé Johnny and his father in law of Pete.', 'Mama Leni, a poor widow, works as a cleaner in a large hotel, while studying in America the only daughter Catherine. The daughter of ignoring their financial situation and believes that her mother is a hotel guest. Suddenly Mama Leni gets a letter from her daughter, she says coming to Athens for vacation with his fiancé Johnny and his father in law of Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgg6QGklSVZLP55TUuWTEge1jZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391551'),
  ('232309915968656271', 'My Awkward Sexual Adventure', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sean Garrity, Gavin Smith', 'Jonas Chernick', 'Jonas Chernick, Emily Hampshire, Sarah Manninen, Vik Sahay, Melissa Marie Elias, Marina Stephenson Kerr, Mike Bell, Andrea del Campo', 'R', 'A hyper-repressed and schlubby accountant (Jonas Chernick) strikes a deal with a worldly but disorganized stripper (Emily Hampshire): he''ll help her with her crushing debt if she helps him become a better lover.', 'A hyper-repressed and schlubby accountant (Jonas Chernick) strikes a deal with a worldly but disorganized stripper (Emily Hampshire): he''ll help her with her crushing debt if she helps him become a better lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLFXD0GrJhrRlvNpWbmecEiRADy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128136'),
  ('1637297652069397', 'My Baby''s Daddy', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Cheryl Dunye, Glen MacPherson', 'David Wagner, Brent Goldberg, Eddie Griffin', 'Eddie Griffin, Anthony Anderson, Michael Imperioli, Method Man, Paula Jai Parker, Amy Sedaris, Marsha Thomason, Bai Ling', 'PG-13', 'A trio of young men are forced to grow up quick when their girlfriends all become pregnant around the same time.', 'A trio of young men are forced to grow up quick when their girlfriends all become pregnant around the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lah4ZvLmjxwF8Pa1UHIm3u2xNuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26710'),
  ('762944101540384804', 'My Babysitter''s a Vampire', 2010, 'Comedy, Horror, Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Bruce McDonald, Rudolf Blahacek, John Pace', null, 'Matthew Knight, Vanessa Morgan, Atticus Mitchell, Cameron Kennedy, Kate Todd, Joe Dinicol, Ella Jonas Farlinger, Ari Cohen', 'PG', 'Geeky 14-year old Ethan is left to babysit his younger sister, Jane, with his best friend Benny but after Ethan inadvertently puts Jane in harm''s way, his parents hire a professional babysitter, the beautiful yet mysterious 17-year-old Sarah who, unbeknownst to them, is actually a fledgling vampire.', 'Geeky 14-year old Ethan is left to babysit his younger sister, Jane, with his best friend Benny but after Ethan inadvertently puts Jane in harm''s way, his parents hire a professional babysitter, the beautiful yet mysterious 17-year-old Sarah who, unbeknownst to them, is actually a fledgling vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUWPPf9kCmnO5TxP08zsa6u0YmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63700'),
  ('619939724120730720', 'My Beautiful Broken Brain', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Sophie Robinson, Lotje Sodderland', null, 'Lotje Sodderland, Sophie Robinson, Jan Sodderland, Hente Sodderland, David Lynch', null, 'A profoundly personal voyage into the complexity, fragility and wonder of the human brain, after Lotje Sodderland miraculously survives a hemorrhagic stroke and finds herself starting again in an alien world, bereft of language and logic. This feature documentary takes us on a genre-twisting tale that is by turns excruciating and exquisite - from the devastating consequences of a first-time neurological experiment, through to the extraordinary revelations of her altered sensory perception.', 'A profoundly personal voyage into the complexity, fragility and wonder of the human brain, after Lotje Sodderland miraculously survives a hemorrhagic stroke and finds herself starting again in an alien world, bereft of language and logic. This feature documentary takes us on a genre-twisting tale that is by turns excruciating and exquisite - from the devastating consequences of a first-time neurological experiment, through to the extraordinary revelations of her altered sensory perception.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onm7B851Jk90Krcw9cfBdkTRhyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381071'),
  ('569685147935044238', 'My Beautiful Country', 2012, 'Drama, War', 'Michaela Kezele', 'Michaela Kezele', 'Zrinka Cvitešić, Mišel Matičević, Miloš Timotijević, Andrija Nikčević, Miloš Mesarović, Ena Simović, Ana Marković, Nebojša Đorđević', null, 'A moving love story in a time of hatred: During the civil war in Kosovo, the young Serbian widow Danica falls in love with Ramiz, a Albanian soldier who, wounded in battle, seeks refuge in her home on the Serbian side of the River Ibar.', 'A moving love story in a time of hatred: During the civil war in Kosovo, the young Serbian widow Danica falls in love with Ramiz, a Albanian soldier who, wounded in battle, seeks refuge in her home on the Serbian side of the River Ibar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPU6sHxvns5mybZt1tRGRhsgY0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241140'),
  ('670625143765724595', 'My Beautiful Days', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Im Jong-jae, Kang Keon-hyang, Ham Soon-ho', 'Choi Heung-seok', 'Hyun Sung, Byun Eun-jung, Kim Gyu-ri, Pang Eun-jin, Dong Bang-woo, Kim Young-jae, Jeong Woo-hyuk, Lee Dae-yeon', null, 'While approaching the end of his mundane military service, directionless 24-year-old Joon attempts to sort out his complicated feelings for an older married woman, his ex-girlfriend and her vivacious sister.', 'While approaching the end of his mundane military service, directionless 24-year-old Joon attempts to sort out his complicated feelings for an older married woman, his ex-girlfriend and her vivacious sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6O6TiCPvLFBoRA4A0umaiXelnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69600'),
  ('441398673577929802', 'My Beautiful Girl, Mari', 2002, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lee Sung-gang', 'Kang Su-jeong, Lee Sung-gang, Seo Mi-ae', 'Ryu Deok-hwan, Gong Hyung-jin, Ahn Sung-ki, Bae Jong-ok, Na Moon-hee, Jang Hang-seon, Lee Byung-hun, Lee Seok-jun', null, 'Two boys find a beautiful world of magic and wonder when they find a magic marble in an old lighthouse. There they meet Mari and can escape from the growing hardships of their home lives.', 'Two boys find a beautiful world of magic and wonder when they find a magic marble in an old lighthouse. There they meet Mari and can escape from the growing hardships of their home lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siks37YeobnEWiJxgxc3VyHE5nL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105280'),
  ('506625499082993991', 'My Beautiful Laundrette', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Oliver Stapleton, Stephen Frears, Alison Dominitz', 'Hanif Kureishi', 'Gordon Warnecke, Daniel Day-Lewis, Roshan Seth, Saeed Jaffrey, Derrick Branche, Rita Wolf, Souad Faress, Shirley Anne Field', 'R', 'A young Pakistani Briton manages a rundown laundrette with his lover while dealing with tension in his family, the local Pakistani community, and a persistent mob of skinheads.', 'A young Pakistani Briton manages a rundown laundrette with his lover while dealing with tension in his family, the local Pakistani community, and a persistent mob of skinheads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfGWxrtbRnxg19ouEYBtQKtMZcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11240'),
  ('1052398364755980642', 'My Beautiful Man: Eternal', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mai Sakai, Rei Hirano', 'Fumi Tsubota', 'Riku Hagiwara, Yusei Yagi, Nimura Sawa, Soko Wada, Motoki Ochiai, Akira Takano, Kentaro Maeda, Dai Ikeda', 'NR', 'As college graduation nears, Hira struggles with Kiyoi''s growing fame as an actor, while Kiyoi just wants an equal relationship. Can their love survive?', 'As college graduation nears, Hira struggles with Kiyoi''s growing fame as an actor, while Kiyoi just wants an equal relationship. Can their love survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttGWPx69IfxkZUKAW2aqVBPG2Ad.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064662'),
  ('599269452352921038', 'My Beloved Enemy', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Denis Rabaglia, Markus Hürsch', 'Luca de Benedittis, Denis Rabaglia, Heidrun Schleef', 'Diego Abatantuono, Antonio Folletto, Mirko Trovato, Sandra Milo, Roberto Ciufoli, Massimo Ghini, Antonio Catania, Ugo Conti', null, 'A professor saves the life of a wounded hitman who, in exchange, promises to find and kill his enemy. Even though the professor says he has no enemies, the killer goes on a mission and transforms the professor''s life.', 'A professor saves the life of a wounded hitman who, in exchange, promises to find and kill his enemy. Even though the professor says he has no enemies, the killer goes on a mission and transforms the professor''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3yMJOOr6Ps05uQBRONWOsWbEQ2m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541011'),
  ('599775355571714055', 'My Beloved Stranger', 2025, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Mitsuru Komiyama', 'Hugo Gélin, Yuichi Toyone', 'Kento Nakajima, milet, Kenta Kiritani, Jun Fubuki, Hidekazu Mashima, Yurika Nakamura, Norito Yashima, Wan Marui', null, 'College sweethearts Riku and Minami marry. He becomes a novelist while her singing dreams fade. After a fight, she vanishes. Suddenly, he''s just an editor, and a singer named Minami Maezono exists-but he''s never met her.', 'College sweethearts Riku and Minami marry. He becomes a novelist while her singing dreams fade. After a fight, she vanishes. Suddenly, he''s just an editor, and a singer named Minami Maezono exists-but he''s never met her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o9ST6KFOHHrzZSUA9ajkJpWj58B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1323008'),
  ('313042154869643315', 'My Best Enemy', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Verdone, Danilo Desideri', 'Pasquale Plastino, Silvia Ranfagni, Silvio Muccino', 'Carlo Verdone, Silvio Muccino, Ana Caterina Morariu, Agnese Nano, Paolo Triestino, Corinne Jiga, Sara Bertelà, Leonardo Petrillo', null, 'When a neurotic hotel manager fires a maid for allegedly stealing a laptop, her son swears revenge and begins to expose his deepest secrets — only to regret it after falling for his daughter.', 'When a neurotic hotel manager fires a maid for allegedly stealing a laptop, her son swears revenge and begins to expose his deepest secrets — only to regret it after falling for his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gI5kiWur7p2TcdFXB741Cl1xnqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38327'),
  ('1036259302111070559', 'My Best Enemy', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wolfgang Murnberger', 'Paul Hengge', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Georg Friedrich, Ursula Strauss, Marthe Keller, Udo Samel, Rainer Bock, Uwe Bohm, Karl Fischer', null, 'Poland 1943: An unlikely pair - a concentration camp prisoner and a captain in Hitler''s notorious SS - free themselves from the wreckage of a crashed SS airplane. The two appear to be strangely familiar with each other and the extent of their extraordinary relationship is thrillingly revealed.', 'Poland 1943: An unlikely pair - a concentration camp prisoner and a captain in Hitler''s notorious SS - free themselves from the wreckage of a crashed SS airplane. The two appear to be strangely familiar with each other and the extent of their extraordinary relationship is thrillingly revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4pa1tVAC17uUsD5pQzW1CCv4kj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78463'),
  ('529580739574424809', 'My Best Fiend', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog, Klaus Kinski, Claudia Cardinale, Eva Mattes, Baron van der Recke, José Koechlin von Stein, Bill Pence, Baronin van der Recke', null, 'A film that describes the love-hate relationship between Werner Herzog and Klaus Kinski, the deep trust between the director and the actor, and their independently and simultaneously hatched plans to murder one another.', 'A film that describes the love-hate relationship between Werner Herzog and Klaus Kinski, the deep trust between the director and the actor, and their independently and simultaneously hatched plans to murder one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aipkPgZVlTqqACWHHeHbIHqoQbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8672'),
  ('361701773285350592', 'My Best Friend', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Yorgos Lanthimos, Lakis Lazopoulos', 'Lakis Lazopoulos', 'Lakis Lazopoulos, Antonis Kafetzopoulos, Smaragda Karydi, Vera Krouska, Maria Kavoyianni, Yannis Bostantzoglou, Elisavet Moutafi, Dimitris Tzoumakis', null, 'My Best Friend is the outrageous story of two men, friends since childhood, who have spent their lives tormenting one another. It is only when Constantinos discovers Alekos in bed with his wife that their friendship and their respective marriages finally collapse into a death spiral of sex, deceit and irrepressible humor. As events unfold another deception, one concealed by both men''s wives, opens the door to incredible erotic intrigue.', 'My Best Friend is the outrageous story of two men, friends since childhood, who have spent their lives tormenting one another. It is only when Constantinos discovers Alekos in bed with his wife that their friendship and their respective marriages finally collapse into a death spiral of sex, deceit and irrepressible humor. As events unfold another deception, one concealed by both men''s wives, opens the door to incredible erotic intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eBNNmhaeLua0nH4W6cafExD1LM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173385'),
  ('722430563905001091', 'My Best Friend', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Patrice Leconte, Hubert Engammare', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Patrice Leconte', 'Daniel Auteuil, Dany Boon, Julie Gayet, Julie Durand, Henri Garcin, Jacques Mathou, Marie Pillet, Élisabeth Bourgine', null, 'Catherine refuses to believe that her business partner, the unlikeable François, has a best friend, so she challenges him to set up an introduction. Scrambling to find someone willing to pose as his best pal, François enlists the services of a charming taxi driver to play the part.', 'Catherine refuses to believe that her business partner, the unlikeable François, has a best friend, so she challenges him to set up an introduction. Scrambling to find someone willing to pose as his best pal, François enlists the services of a charming taxi driver to play the part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPqtG8L5fj9PUlW7Gldb218FyIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4516'),
  ('1130643981080017612', 'My Best Friend', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martín Deus', 'Martín Deus', 'Angelo Mutti Spinetta, Lautaro Rodríguez, Guillermo Pfening, Mariana Anghileri, Benicio Mutti Spinetta, Romana Aleksandra Gulich, Renata Lizzi, Maite Lucía Valero', null, 'Lorenzo, a quiet teenager lives in a small town at the edge of the world in beautiful Patagonia. He’s a good student and a curious and smart person, more skilled in music and literature than sports. Lorenzo’s father decides to host Caito, the son of a friend from Buenos Aires who had to go to hospital for a long stay. Caito has obviously a different family background and seems to be a tough kid. Lorenzo finds Caito very intriguing in many ways as they start spending a lot of time together…', 'Lorenzo, a quiet teenager lives in a small town at the edge of the world in beautiful Patagonia. He’s a good student and a curious and smart person, more skilled in music and literature than sports. Lorenzo’s father decides to host Caito, the son of a friend from Buenos Aires who had to go to hospital for a long stay. Caito has obviously a different family background and seems to be a tough kid. Lorenzo finds Caito very intriguing in many ways as they start spending a lot of time together…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dI5O02ytg6ooMu4WUcEqw4ZelHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477666'),
  ('690619641696265368', 'My Best Friend Anne Frank', 2021, 'History, War, Drama', 'Ben Sombogaart, Jan Moeskops', 'Marian Batavier, Paul Ruven', 'Josephine Arendsen, Aiko Beemsterboer, Roeland Fernhout, Hans Peterson, Rein Hofman, Joep Paddenburg, Lottie Hellingman, Ariane Schluter', 'PG-13', 'Based on the real-life friendship between Anne Frank and Hannah Goslar, from Nazi-occupied Amsterdam to their harrowing reunion in a concentration camp.', 'Based on the real-life friendship between Anne Frank and Hannah Goslar, from Nazi-occupied Amsterdam to their harrowing reunion in a concentration camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6codIHEKVYwbQ9Ey6CNoqWA9yxD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788045'),
  ('133135516251229088', 'My Best Friend Is a Vampire', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jimmy Huston, James Bartle, Spiro Razatos', 'Tab Murphy', 'Robert Sean Leonard, Evan Mirand, Leeanne Locken Emberlin, Cheryl Pollak, Cecilia Peck, Fannie Flagg, Kenneth Kimmins, David Warner', 'PG', 'Shortly after high school student Jeremy Capello goes on a hot date, he finds he can''t stand garlic or see his reflection in mirrors.', 'Shortly after high school student Jeremy Capello goes on a hot date, he finds he can''t stand garlic or see his reflection in mirrors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfoacxKdHbl2ph2Dj2sAq8Tx8Zy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21151'),
  ('1106134920115491950', 'My Best Friend''s Breakfast', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Du Zheng-zhe, Tseng Hsien-chung', 'Du Zheng-zhe', 'Eric Chou, Moon Lee, Jean Ho, Edison Song, Shou Lou, Lee Yu, Huang Li-feng, Ko Cheng', null, 'Xiang Wei-xin, a 17-year-old high school sophomore, regards eating as the most important and most healing thing in life. The first time she met her senior Tao You-quan was in the school''s welfare agency. At that time, Xiang Wei-xin lost 5 yuan and could not buy her favorite pineapple bread. Tao You-quan made up the money for her, which made her feel deeply indebted to her.', 'Xiang Wei-xin, a 17-year-old high school sophomore, regards eating as the most important and most healing thing in life. The first time she met her senior Tao You-quan was in the school''s welfare agency. At that time, Xiang Wei-xin lost 5 yuan and could not buy her favorite pineapple bread. Tao You-quan made up the money for her, which made her feel deeply indebted to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cJKWoxpgihe97L51O0cNTVBHD85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839294'),
  ('724393477037692506', 'My Best Friend''s Exorcism', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Damon Thomas, John Bonaccorse, Stephen W. Moore', null, 'Elsie Fisher, Amiah Miller, Rachel Ogechi Kanu, Cathy Ang, Clayton Royal Johnson, Chris Lowell, Nathan Anderson, Cynthia Evans', 'R', 'The year is 1988. Abby and Gretchen have been best friends since fourth grade. After an evening of skinny-dipping goes disastrously wrong, Gretchen begins to act…different, which leads Abby to suspect her best friend may be possessed by a demon. With help from some unlikely allies, Abby embarks on a quest to save Gretchen. But is their friendship powerful enough to beat the devil?', 'The year is 1988. Abby and Gretchen have been best friends since fourth grade. After an evening of skinny-dipping goes disastrously wrong, Gretchen begins to act…different, which leads Abby to suspect her best friend may be possessed by a demon. With help from some unlikely allies, Abby embarks on a quest to save Gretchen. But is their friendship powerful enough to beat the devil?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIXICkqthsqbNtvtEd6rpIt3cT4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:816952'),
  ('1034410027159846862', 'My Best Friend''s Girl', 1983, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bertrand Blier, Jean Penzer', 'Bertrand Blier, Gérard Brach', 'Coluche, Isabelle Huppert, Thierry Lhermitte, François Perrot, Daniel Colas, Frédérique Michot, Farid Chopel', null, 'The charming Pascal, owner of a clothing store in Courchevel, and the chubby and scruffy Micky, disc jockey in a nearby club, are best of friends. Pascal accumulates women, much to the chagrin of Micky, who is consoled of his failures by listening to his friend talk about his successes. Viviane arises, ravishing and icy, but she''s seasonal. Pascal, sincerely in love, seduces her and then leaves. This is a dire situation for Micky: Pascal is far away and the beauty is so kind to him. Complications arise once Pascal returns.', 'The charming Pascal, owner of a clothing store in Courchevel, and the chubby and scruffy Micky, disc jockey in a nearby club, are best of friends. Pascal accumulates women, much to the chagrin of Micky, who is consoled of his failures by listening to his friend talk about his successes. Viviane arises, ravishing and icy, but she''s seasonal. Pascal, sincerely in love, seduces her and then leaves. This is a dire situation for Micky: Pascal is far away and the beauty is so kind to him. Complications arise once Pascal returns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCHc6v0XIggcRlkvWkbXCDejKYL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64504'),
  ('235169694142483988', 'My Best Friend''s Girl', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Howard Deutch, Jack N. Green', 'Jordan Cahan', 'Dane Cook, Kate Hudson, Jason Biggs, Alec Baldwin, Lizzy Caplan, Diora Baird, Taran Killam, Riki Lindhome', 'R', 'Lovestruck Dustin is dating Alexis, his ideal girlfriend, but when she dumps him for coming on too strong, Dustin takes drastic measures to win her back. He asks his best friend Tank to take her on the worst rebound date imaginable - his side job - so that she will come running back to him, and Tank reluctantly agrees. However, Alexis is more than a match for Tank''s shock tactics and he begins to really fall for her, leaving him torn between loyalty to Dustin and his growing attraction toward Alexis.', 'Lovestruck Dustin is dating Alexis, his ideal girlfriend, but when she dumps him for coming on too strong, Dustin takes drastic measures to win her back. He asks his best friend Tank to take her on the worst rebound date imaginable - his side job - so that she will come running back to him, and Tank reluctantly agrees. However, Alexis is more than a match for Tank''s shock tactics and he begins to really fall for her, leaving him torn between loyalty to Dustin and his growing attraction toward Alexis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Zn149rIsfIwBZZwIwuryRzVbon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13596'),
  ('89307792827471224', 'My Best Friend''s Wedding', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'László Kovács, P.J. Hogan, Eric Heffron', 'Ronald Bass', 'Julia Roberts, Dermot Mulroney, Cameron Diaz, Rupert Everett, Philip Bosco, M. Emmet Walsh, Rachel Griffiths, Carrie Preston', 'PG-13', 'When she receives word that her longtime platonic pal Michael O''Neal is getting married to debutante Kimberly Wallace, food critic Julianne Potter realizes her true feelings for Michael -- and sets out to sabotage the wedding.', 'When she receives word that her longtime platonic pal Michael O''Neal is getting married to debutante Kimberly Wallace, food critic Julianne Potter realizes her true feelings for Michael -- and sets out to sabotage the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5g4bp8gS5ovMyR5439AII6zQ3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8874'),
  ('357361017145682289', 'My Best Friend''s Wedding', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Celso R. García, Emiliano Villanueva', 'Ronald Bass', 'Ana Serradilla, Miguel Ángel Silvestre, Carlos Ferro, Natasha Dupeyrón, Minnie West, Mónica Huarte, Patricia Bernal, Pedro Mira', null, 'A woman is determined to stop the wedding of her best friend, since she has been secretly in love with him.', 'A woman is determined to stop the wedding of her best friend, since she has been secretly in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGeT2u8jCWhIVIB5eZUExbgSoPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:555801'),
  ('810914077928250233', 'My Best Friend''s Wife', 1998, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Italo Petriccione, Pierluigi Ciriaci', 'Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Eva Herzigová, Carlo Buccirosso, Maurizio Casagrande, Nando Paone, Biagio Izzo, Emanuela Grimalda, Jinny Steffan', null, 'Roberto is a doctor in a small town near Naples. He suffers from a severe heart disease and he is heading toward an American hospital for a dangerous surgery with little or no hope of surviving. Therefore he talks to his best friend since childhood, Michele, a columnist at the local newspaper, explaining his last and long-wanted desire: having sex once with his Swedish beautiful wife, Frida.', 'Roberto is a doctor in a small town near Naples. He suffers from a severe heart disease and he is heading toward an American hospital for a dangerous surgery with little or no hope of surviving. Therefore he talks to his best friend since childhood, Michele, a columnist at the local newspaper, explaining his last and long-wanted desire: having sex once with his Swedish beautiful wife, Frida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btY5lTmtuDVuEmRRRNUB44UM8Jx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63067'),
  ('1026790343432583818', 'My Best Girl', 1927, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Sam Taylor, H. Bruce Humberstone, Charles Rosher', 'Hope Loring', 'Mary Pickford, Charles ''Buddy'' Rogers, Sunshine Hart, Lucien Littlefield, Carmelita Geraghty, Hobart Bosworth, Evelyn Hall, Avonne Taylor', null, 'Joe Merrill, son of the millionaire owner of a chain of 5 and 10 cent stores, poses as Joe Grant, and takes a job in the stockroom of one of his father''s stores, to prove that he can be a success without his father''s influence. There he meets stockroom girl Maggie Johnson, and they fall in love. This causes problems, because Mrs. Merrill had planned for her son to marry Millicent Rogers, a high society girl.', 'Joe Merrill, son of the millionaire owner of a chain of 5 and 10 cent stores, poses as Joe Grant, and takes a job in the stockroom of one of his father''s stores, to prove that he can be a success without his father''s influence. There he meets stockroom girl Maggie Johnson, and they fall in love. This causes problems, because Mrs. Merrill had planned for her son to marry Millicent Rogers, a high society girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30K2vL1L4TnTmAlZQj3ArUxHdgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73969'),
  ('1088446485900856693', 'My Best Holidays', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Philippe Lellouche, Alain Braconnier, Grégoire Brigand', 'Frédéric Petitjean, Philippe Lellouche', 'Philippe Lellouche, Julie Gayet, Gérard Darmon, Vanessa Demouy, Christian Vadim, Julie Bernard, Alain Doutey, Nicole Calfan', null, 'Over this long hot summer, Claude and Isabelle get their marriage back on track, while Bibou and Simon, spend a memorable summer discovering the world of grown-ups.', 'Over this long hot summer, Claude and Isabelle get their marriage back on track, while Bibou and Simon, spend a memorable summer discovering the world of grown-ups.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGP18eOSjtyf1uLJPTY6u7PyGIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93847'),
  ('783818632891082609', 'My Best Pals', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Claude Agostini, Françoise Menidrey', 'Christian Clavier, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Gérard Lanvin, Christian Clavier, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Philippe Khorsand, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Louise Portal, Marie-Anne Chazel, Elisabeth Margoni', null, 'They are the best friends of the world. Five friends who shared everything: may 68, hippies years, the rock and their love for Bernadette. This Bernadette has left them to become a rock-star, and is back 15 years later for a weekend. Jean-Marie Poire describes with this movie the portrait of a generation with lots of humor served by excelent actors.', 'They are the best friends of the world. Five friends who shared everything: may 68, hippies years, the rock and their love for Bernadette. This Bernadette has left them to become a rock-star, and is back 15 years later for a weekend. Jean-Marie Poire describes with this movie the portrait of a generation with lots of humor served by excelent actors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noc88VmiOh2RD4OuXH6MlspoYdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51326'),
  ('152108903667906276', 'My Best Part', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nicolas Maury, Raphaël Vandenbussche', 'Nicolas Maury, Sophie Fillières, Maud Ameline', 'Nicolas Maury, Nathalie Baye, Jean-Marc Barr, Arnaud Valois, Théo Christine, Laurent Capelluto, Laure Calamy, Astrid Whettnall', null, 'Jérémie, a young man reaching a breaking point on all fronts, decides to leave behind Paris and return to Limosin, to the home of his intrusive mother.', 'Jérémie, a young man reaching a breaking point on all fronts, decides to leave behind Paris and return to Limosin, to the home of his intrusive mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uG2tIGzwIxYcBOexgZxApdebooi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661229'),
  ('366796486762099579', 'My Best Summer', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Disha Zhang, Deng Xu', 'Huang Mo Qi', 'Arthur Chen, He Landou, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Zhou Chuchu, Wang Lingyu, Fang Wenqiang, Gao Wenfeng, Silence Wang', null, 'Geng Geng had been an ordinary girl before her entry to the best high school in the province by chance. She doesn''t like her life there until she meets Yu Huai, her seatmate - their names make up the word "Geng geng yu huai", meaning "Unforgettable memories". They don''t like each other at the beginning, but soon they start to understand each other.', 'Geng Geng had been an ordinary girl before her entry to the best high school in the province by chance. She doesn''t like her life there until she meets Yu Huai, her seatmate - their names make up the word "Geng geng yu huai", meaning "Unforgettable memories". They don''t like each other at the beginning, but soon they start to understand each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh2qGAwNUxNY3QzeJy78q402CGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602663'),
  ('11810567405831518', 'My Big Fat Father', 1992, 'Drama', 'Kjell-Åke Andersson, Per Källberg', 'Magnus Nilsson, Kjell-Åke Andersson', 'Nick Börjlind, Rolf Lassgård, Ann Petrén, Gunilla Röör, Krister Henriksson, Leif Andrée, Tomas Norström, Halvar Björk', null, 'Summer of 1959. 11-year old Osvald spend his summer holiday with his parents in the countryside of Södermanland. His father has promised to play soccer with him and get some exercise. He also promised the locals to teach the church choir an Argentine mass. The father has a slight alcohol problem, so will he be able to do it?', 'Summer of 1959. 11-year old Osvald spend his summer holiday with his parents in the countryside of Södermanland. His father has promised to play soccer with him and get some exercise. He also promised the locals to teach the church choir an Argentine mass. The father has a slight alcohol problem, so will he be able to do it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5OezLJBiiegM4xET4eAZaXRJg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103901'),
  ('658761584793695131', 'My Big Fat Greek Wedding', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joel Zwick, Jeffrey Jur, Wayne Wightman', 'Nia Vardalos', 'Nia Vardalos, John Corbett, Lainie Kazan, Michael Constantine, Andrea Martin, Joey Fatone, Louis Mandylor, Gia Carides', 'PG', 'A young Greek woman falls in love with a non-Greek and struggles to get her family to accept him while she comes to terms with her heritage and cultural identity.', 'A young Greek woman falls in love with a non-Greek and struggles to get her family to accept him while she comes to terms with her heritage and cultural identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ztc05ym0T3stnBpRHdxEs3Zwsmp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8346'),
  ('88486223050794229', 'My Big Fat Greek Wedding 2', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kirk Jones, Jim Denault, Jonathan Gotfryd', 'Nia Vardalos', 'Nia Vardalos, John Corbett, Elena Kampouris, Michael Constantine, Lainie Kazan, Andrea Martin, Gia Carides, Joey Fatone', 'PG-13', 'The continuing adventures of the Portokalos family. A follow-up to the 2002 comedy, "My Big Fat Greek Wedding."', 'The continuing adventures of the Portokalos family. A follow-up to the 2002 comedy, "My Big Fat Greek Wedding."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfPqApnLVPsYfdbpSHNnHIxTdmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302688'),
  ('271170389073638349', 'My Big Fat Greek Wedding 3', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marco Ciglia, Emmelia Chatziandreou, Matthew Kerly', 'Nia Vardalos', 'Nia Vardalos, John Corbett, Louis Mandylor, Elena Kampouris, Lainie Kazan, Andrea Martin, Maria Vacratsis, Gia Carides', 'PG-13', 'Following the death of their patriarch Gus, the Portokalos family travels to Greece for a family reunion, and to deliver Gus'' journal to his old friends.', 'Following the death of their patriarch Gus, the Portokalos family travels to Greece for a family reunion, and to deliver Gus'' journal to his old friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yO8okCs9iohJ0iDVls6QYfu6l6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001811'),
  ('718025952301617009', 'My Big Gay Italian Wedding', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Federico Masiero, Lorenzo Grasso, Francesco Lorenzano', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Giovanni Bognetti', 'Diego Abatantuono, Monica Guerritore, Salvatore Esposito, Cristiano Caccamo, Dino Abbrescia, Diana Del Bufalo, Beatrice Arnera, Rosaria D''Urso', null, 'A father, who calls himself "open" and tolerant and fights against any form of discrimination, reveals himself as not so liberal when his son announces the engagement to his partner. Overwhelmed by the news, he regresses into the most fierce opponent of same-sex marriage, and tries to undermine his son''s happiness with a series of embarrassing situations.', 'A father, who calls himself "open" and tolerant and fights against any form of discrimination, reveals himself as not so liberal when his son announces the engagement to his partner. Overwhelmed by the news, he regresses into the most fierce opponent of same-sex marriage, and tries to undermine his son''s happiness with a series of embarrassing situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjiX79FqxONv0qVixtyfusIbKYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:486103'),
  ('85242366253303172', 'My Big Night', 2015, 'Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Ángel Amorós, Carlos Bernases', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Raphael, Mario Casas, Pepón Nieto, Blanca Suárez, Hugo Silva, Carmen Machi, Santiago Segura, Carlos Areces', null, 'Coslada, near Madrid, Spain, October 2015. Hundreds of extras are trapped in a huge stage where they pretend with hysterical joy that they are celebrating a party that will be broadcast on television on New Year''s Eve. But more than a week later, the clash between several staff members threatens to prolong indefinitely such a maddening nightmare.', 'Coslada, near Madrid, Spain, October 2015. Hundreds of extras are trapped in a huge stage where they pretend with hysterical joy that they are celebrating a party that will be broadcast on television on New Year''s Eve. But more than a week later, the clash between several staff members threatens to prolong indefinitely such a maddening nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcXv39wbVtx9uU756M6yg5GrPgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335053'),
  ('581821129421992944', 'My Birthday Romance', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jan Klompje, Michael Bishop, Naomi Polk', 'John Hartman', 'Ali Cobrin, Jesse Hutch, Charles Cottier, P. Lynn Johnson, Garry Chalk, Mika Mitchell', 'G', 'Callie Fitzgerald is tired of her family fixing her up and questioning her single status. She is determined to find a pretend boyfriend for her 35th birthday party just so her family will leave her alone. What she didn’t expect was to actually fall for him.', 'Callie Fitzgerald is tired of her family fixing her up and questioning her single status. She is determined to find a pretend boyfriend for her 35th birthday party just so her family will leave her alone. What she didn’t expect was to actually fall for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykv6UUZJromsMaCZxONvAtuiR0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715725'),
  ('898652363791189246', 'My Blind Brother', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sophie Goodhart, Eric Lin', 'Sophie Goodhart', 'Nick Kroll, Adam Scott, Jenny Slate, Zoe Kazan, Talia Tabin, Heidi Lewandowski, Charlie Hewson, Kellen Boyle', 'R', 'Love for the same woman causes conflict between an over-achieving blind athlete and the brother who made him that way.', 'Love for the same woman causes conflict between an over-achieving blind athlete and the brother who made him that way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD1YeAGlYvdxab3PZV66wAyd2Dx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381040'),
  ('596457218580258697', 'My Blind Date with Life', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marc Rothemund, Benedict Hoermann, Angie Luise Jordan', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg, Ruth Toma', 'Kostja Ullmann, Anna Maria Mühe, Jacob Matschenz, Ludger Pistor, Michael Grimm, Uwe Preuss, Johann von Bülow, Alexander Held', null, 'An ambitious young man struggles to achieve his dream of becoming an employee in a Munich luxury hotel despite being strongly visually impaired.', 'An ambitious young man struggles to achieve his dream of becoming an employee in a Munich luxury hotel despite being strongly visually impaired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCzny6egV7NPV7bR6rOzYpZg41F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379019'),
  ('527725565106561380', 'My Blood and Bones in a Flowing Galaxy', 2021, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Tomoo Ezaki, Hayato Kawai, SABU', 'SABU', 'Taishi Nakagawa, Anna Ishii, Kai Inowaki, Kaya Kiyohara, Airi Matsui, Takumi Kitamura, Akiko Yada, Hana Kino', null, 'Kiyosumi''s affection for his schoolmate Hari grows after he saves her from bullying, but a dark secret she''s unwilling to share threatens their bond.', 'Kiyosumi''s affection for his schoolmate Hari grows after he saves her from bullying, but a dark secret she''s unwilling to share threatens their bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWp8DwRWuctYhGP6Q1diNcCdX0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698840'),
  ('865229617177820376', 'My Bloody Valentine', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'George Mihalka, Rodney Gibbons, Ray Sager', 'John Beaird', 'Paul Kelman, Lori Hallier, Neil Affleck, Keith Knight, Cynthia Dale, Alf Humphreys, Helene Udy, Carl Marotte', 'R', 'Twenty years after a Valentine''s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.', 'Twenty years after a Valentine''s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl3mewFceFtYIavvGts2atzB0e0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39874'),
  ('95166347275633748', 'My Bloody Valentine', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Lussier, Brian Pearson, Michael McCue', 'John Beaird', 'Jensen Ackles, Jaime King, Kerr Smith, Betsy Rue, Edi Gathegi, Tom Atkins, Kevin Tighe, Megan Boone', 'R', 'Ten years after a Valentine''s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.', 'Ten years after a Valentine''s Day tragedy claimed the lives of five miners, Harry Warden returns for a vengeful massacre among teen sweethearts gearing up for another party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9biIVOMTdvv4aj4a5HClmrK5EHB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14435'),
  ('958643619692161350', 'My Blue Heaven', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Herbert Ross, Ariel Levy, John Bailey', 'Nora Ephron', 'Steve Martin, Rick Moranis, Joan Cusack, Melanie Mayron, Bill Irwin, Carol Kane, William Hickey, Deborah Rush', 'PG-13', 'FBI agent Barney Coopersmith is assigned to protect former Mafia figure turned informant Vincent Antonelli. In the witness protection program one is supposed to keep a low profile, but that is something that Antonelli has trouble doing. Coopersmith certainly has his hands full keeping Antonelli away from the Mafia hitmen who want to stop him testifying, not to mention the nightclubs...', 'FBI agent Barney Coopersmith is assigned to protect former Mafia figure turned informant Vincent Antonelli. In the witness protection program one is supposed to keep a low profile, but that is something that Antonelli has trouble doing. Coopersmith certainly has his hands full keeping Antonelli away from the Mafia hitmen who want to stop him testifying, not to mention the nightclubs...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggk34Nr1e8LOeAdVncuYz6pyYDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16384'),
  ('1143998427836837469', 'My Blueberry Nights', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Darius Khondji, Kwan Pung-Leung', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Lawrence Block', 'Norah Jones, Jude Law, David Strathairn, Rachel Weisz, Natalie Portman, Cat Power, Frankie Faison, Michael Delano', 'PG-13', 'Elizabeth has just been through a particularly nasty breakup, and now she''s ready to leave her friends and memories behind as she chases her dreams across the country. In order to support herself on her journey, Elizabeth picks up a series of waitress jobs along the way. As Elizabeth crosses paths with a series of lost souls whose yearnings are even greater than her own, their emotional turmoil ultimately helps her gain a greater understanding of her own problems...', 'Elizabeth has just been through a particularly nasty breakup, and now she''s ready to leave her friends and memories behind as she chases her dreams across the country. In order to support herself on her journey, Elizabeth picks up a series of waitress jobs along the way. As Elizabeth crosses paths with a series of lost souls whose yearnings are even greater than her own, their emotional turmoil ultimately helps her gain a greater understanding of her own problems...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w9w3m2IB9QRZXxi6R51ZamKv3HS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1989'),
  ('536534628565475659', 'My Body is Political', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Alice Riff, Vinícius Berger', 'Alice Riff', 'Linn da Quebrada, Paula Beatriz, Giu Nonato, Fernando Ribeiro', null, 'Paula, Beatriz, Giu and Fernando live in one of the poorest favelas of São Paulo. A world of marginalization and despair, in which they struggle for their rights as transgenders, but also for survival: according to the statistics from the Transgender Europe NGO, Brazil is the nation with the highest number of murders of transgender people each year. The choice to experience your body in complete freedom is a revolutionary concept and highly risky in this context. It is an affirmation of one''s being. it is no coincidence that one of them, who has begun the transition phase writes in his diary: "Each hormone pill is a declaration of ownership of my body. After each pill, I feel much better in my own skin". This movie shows their daily life, their struggles and protests in a world where ignorance becomes oppression and hate: in a word transphobia.', 'Paula, Beatriz, Giu and Fernando live in one of the poorest favelas of São Paulo. A world of marginalization and despair, in which they struggle for their rights as transgenders, but also for survival: according to the statistics from the Transgender Europe NGO, Brazil is the nation with the highest number of murders of transgender people each year. The choice to experience your body in complete freedom is a revolutionary concept and highly risky in this context. It is an affirmation of one''s being. it is no coincidence that one of them, who has begun the transition phase writes in his diary: "Each hormone pill is a declaration of ownership of my body. After each pill, I feel much better in my own skin". This movie shows their daily life, their struggles and protests in a world where ignorance becomes oppression and hate: in a word transphobia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRsZUa2XWSXQPBZGAnr7gmSxkiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453956'),
  ('1000372902009720774', 'My Body Will Bury You', 2021, 'Drama, Action, Western', 'Marco Bassano, Flavia Carimini, Simone Rosso', 'Alessia Lepore, Giovanni La Pàrola', 'Guido Caprino, Margareth Madè, Miriam Dalmazio, Filippo Pucillo, Giuseppe Schillaci, Giovanni Calcagno, Antonia Truppo, Alberto Albertino', null, '1860, Kingdom of the Two Sicilies. While Garibaldi''s troops are invading this lawless territory, four female bandits nicknamed the "Drudes" are looking for their own personal revenge.', '1860, Kingdom of the Two Sicilies. While Garibaldi''s troops are invading this lawless territory, four female bandits nicknamed the "Drudes" are looking for their own personal revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHcJ4ng4bmcWNh57kjhwploKdTs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592479'),
  ('997628966357802997', 'My Bodyguard', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Tony Bill, Michael D. Margulies, Michael Daves', 'Alan Ormsby', 'Chris Makepeace, Adam Baldwin, Matt Dillon, Paul Quandt, Hank Salas, Joan Cusack, Dean R. Miller, Tim Reyna', 'PG', 'Clifford Peache, an easygoing teenager, is finding less than easy to fit in at his new high school, where a tough-talking bully terrorizes his classmates and extorts their lunch money. Refusing to pay up, Clifford enlist the aid of an overgrown misfit whose mere presence intimidates students and teachers alike. But their "business relationship" soon turns personal as Clifford and the troubled loner forge a winning alliance against their intimidators - and a very special friendship with each other.', 'Clifford Peache, an easygoing teenager, is finding less than easy to fit in at his new high school, where a tough-talking bully terrorizes his classmates and extorts their lunch money. Refusing to pay up, Clifford enlist the aid of an overgrown misfit whose mere presence intimidates students and teachers alike. But their "business relationship" soon turns personal as Clifford and the troubled loner forge a winning alliance against their intimidators - and a very special friendship with each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agk3tSS6OLiSdyrieDhPpuQ7CEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21873'),
  ('797302023815942369', 'My Boo', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Khomkrit Treewimol, Ratthapon Chantararuangthong, Nattaphon Liamwinit', 'Khomkrit Treewimol, Kirati Kumsat, Chai-a-nan Soijumpa', 'Maylada Susri, Sutthirak Subvijitra, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Tatchaya Supatanyasatit, Timethai, Punyawee Jungcharoen, Narttida Pitakwararat, Arunphong Naraphan', null, 'Joe finds a way to make some cash out of the creepy old house he inherited. But he didn''t think he''d find love with one of the ghosts haunting it.', 'Joe finds a way to make some cash out of the creepy old house he inherited. But he didn''t think he''d find love with one of the ghosts haunting it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0QqNbfO5YLcZs066RrRiph10zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1257388'),
  ('650505975159493492', 'My Boo 2', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Horror', 'Khomkrit Treewimol, Paveena Thakrainate, Wichaya Ratanachumnong', 'Kirati Kumsat, Khomkrit Treewimol, Chai-a-nan Soijumpa', 'Sutthirak Subvijitra, Maylada Susri, Timethai, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Tatchaya Supatanyasatit, Puang Kaewprasert, Fon Thanasoonthorn, Itkron Pungkiatrussamee', null, 'Witness the deep bond between Joe and Anong, which has been long-lasting through many lifetimes and reincarnations.', 'Witness the deep bond between Joe and Anong, which has been long-lasting through many lifetimes and reincarnations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EVZqugrpUY2RTRdQgKXgE3vZ8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1418302'),
  ('550197952272210221', 'My Boss, My Hero', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Hwang Cheol-hyeon, JK Youn, Won Myeong-jun', 'JK Youn', 'Jung Jun-ho, Jung Woong-in, Jung Woon-taek, Oh Seung-eun, Song Sun-mi, Park Jun-gyu, Kang Sung-pil, Ki Joo-bong', null, 'When a young gang leader seems to be just a bit too stupid to effectively carry out his daily tasks, his superiors order him to go back to school for his high school diploma. Posing as a 19-year-old, he soon learns that the school is even more corrupt and vicious. Wrath is unleashed.', 'When a young gang leader seems to be just a bit too stupid to effectively carry out his daily tasks, his superiors order him to go back to school for his high school diploma. Posing as a 19-year-old, he soon learns that the school is even more corrupt and vicious. Wrath is unleashed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOyWhkeDJ7GY2VcA93KF0oLzLV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19588'),
  ('116470239805478336', 'My Boss, My Teacher', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Kim Dong-won, Lee Hu-kon', 'Kang Suk-bum, Kim Dong-won', 'Jung Jun-ho, Jung Woong-in, Jung Woon-taek, Kim Sang-joong, Kang Sung-pil, Choi Yoon-young, Han Hyo-joo, Lee Soo-hyuk', null, 'A mobster must complete college and spend some time as an ethics teacher in order to receive a promotion to a coveted territory.', 'A mobster must complete college and spend some time as an ethics teacher in order to receive a promotion to a coveted territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1owq6HSDPOO2FCYTb0lFCWcwl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19609'),
  ('242161561164395553', 'My Boss''s Daughter', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Zucker, Martin McGrath, Brian Pearson', 'David Dorfman', 'Ashton Kutcher, Tara Reid, Andy Richter, Jeffrey Tambor, Michael Madsen, Jon Abrahams, David Koechner, Carmen Electra', 'PG-13', 'When a young man agrees to housesit for his boss, he thinks it''ll be the perfect opportunity to get close to the woman he desperately has a crush on – his boss''s daughter. But he doesn''t plan on the long line of other houseguests that try to keep him from his mission. And he also has to deal with the daughter''s older brother, who''s on the run from local drug dealers.', 'When a young man agrees to housesit for his boss, he thinks it''ll be the perfect opportunity to get close to the woman he desperately has a crush on – his boss''s daughter. But he doesn''t plan on the long line of other houseguests that try to keep him from his mission. And he also has to deal with the daughter''s older brother, who''s on the run from local drug dealers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z6ehjP1GyMLFeja9pHGGZb9B2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2830'),
  ('877099075767620740', 'My Bossy Girl', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lee Jang-hee', 'Lee Jang-hee', 'Lee Elijah, Ji Il-ju, Heo Jung-min, Kim Ki-doo, Lee Jini, Ko Gun-han, Chung Ye-jin, Ryu Hye-rin', null, 'One day, during a university festival where people are often known to find a partner, the 3 incredibly single members of the robot club decide to attend. There the sloppy and timid Hwi-so meets a very aggressive girl by the name of Hye-jin. His romantic advances, which he learned through reading books and watching YouTube, finally wake up to make their move. But will two finally become one this fall?', 'One day, during a university festival where people are often known to find a partner, the 3 incredibly single members of the robot club decide to attend. There the sloppy and timid Hwi-so meets a very aggressive girl by the name of Hye-jin. His romantic advances, which he learned through reading books and watching YouTube, finally wake up to make their move. But will two finally become one this fall?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6V1GlUpH1hlICJf2wdAPwOtmzi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640793'),
  ('624991250041870057', 'My Boy Jack', 2007, 'Drama, History', 'Brian Kirk, David Odd', 'David Haig', 'Daniel Radcliffe, David Haig, Kim Cattrall, Carey Mulligan, Julian Wadham, Robbie Kay, John-Paul Macleod, Bill Milner', null, 'Author Rudyard Kipling and his wife search for their 17-year-old son after he goes missing during WWI.', 'Author Rudyard Kipling and his wife search for their 17-year-old son after he goes missing during WWI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugsEKXt0VVlUfns0VUUgggFPbmh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25143'),
  ('868110670035409886', 'My Boyfriend Is Type B', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Choi Seok-won', 'Shin Jung-Goo, Kang Cheol-Woo, Choi Seok-won', 'Han Ji-hye, Lee Dong-gun, Jung Ryeo-won, Shin Yi, Kwon Hae-sung, Kim Min-su', null, 'My Boyfriend is Type B is a South Korean romantic comedy film from the year 2005. The basic premise of the film comes from the Japanese blood type theory of personality, which claims that a person''s blood type can determine their personality traits. The heroine is type A (conservative and introverted) while her love interest is type B (passionate and irresponsible).', 'My Boyfriend is Type B is a South Korean romantic comedy film from the year 2005. The basic premise of the film comes from the Japanese blood type theory of personality, which claims that a person''s blood type can determine their personality traits. The heroine is type A (conservative and introverted) while her love interest is type B (passionate and irresponsible).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dISkKjKJcGy8eKyVt05vQ4mGu5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49206'),
  ('119396971936550252', 'My Boyfriend''s Back', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance, Horror', 'Bob Balaban, Mac Ahlberg, Donald P.H. Eaton', 'Dean Lorey', 'Andrew Lowery, Traci Lind, Danny Zorn, Edward Herrmann, Mary Beth Hurt, Jay O. Sanders, Libby Villari, Matthew Fox', 'PG-13', 'Missy McCloud is the most beautiful girl in school and Johnny Dingle has been in love with her for years. One night, as Johnny tries to stop an armed robbery and save Missy from danger, he''s killed, but resurrected as a zombie not long after. Now, with the help of his mentor, self-proclaimed Zombie Expert Maggie, Johnny must control his flesh-eating urges while trying to win the heart of Missy.', 'Missy McCloud is the most beautiful girl in school and Johnny Dingle has been in love with her for years. One night, as Johnny tries to stop an armed robbery and save Missy from danger, he''s killed, but resurrected as a zombie not long after. Now, with the help of his mentor, self-proclaimed Zombie Expert Maggie, Johnny must control his flesh-eating urges while trying to win the heart of Missy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euXyMbBT2QaxiYZf1jJrsa5yGon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31503'),
  ('76429263642239486', 'My Boyfriend''s Meds', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Diego Kaplan', 'Diego Kaplan, Gary Marks', 'Jaime Camil, Sandra Echeverría, Brooke Shields, Brian Baumgartner, Jason Alexander, Ana Belena, Daniel Tovar, Kevin Holt', null, 'A Woman''s island getaway with her boyfriend is thrown for a loop when he forgets to take his prescription medications along.', 'A Woman''s island getaway with her boyfriend is thrown for a loop when he forgets to take his prescription medications along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVSOXCBuPXw8yXqbNfwU9ogIp88.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:557940'),
  ('752916064620629480', 'My Breakfast with Blassie', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Johnny Legend, Mark Shepard, Linda Lautrec', 'Johnny Legend, Linda Lautrec', 'Andy Kaufman, Freddie Blassie, Linda Lautrec, Laurie Burton, Linda Hirsch, Bob Zmuda, Lynne Margulies', 'NR', 'My Breakfast with Blassie is a movie starring Andy Kaufman and professional wrestler "Classy" Freddie Blassie. It is a mostly improvised parody of the popular art film My Dinner with Andre and is set in a restaurant where Kaufman and Blassie have a discussion over breakfast. Also featured is Kaufman''s partner Bob Zmuda, who plays a nosy fan. Lynne Margulies, who would later become Kaufman''s girlfriend, also plays a role; in fact, she and Kaufman met for the first time on camera.', 'My Breakfast with Blassie is a movie starring Andy Kaufman and professional wrestler "Classy" Freddie Blassie. It is a mostly improvised parody of the popular art film My Dinner with Andre and is set in a restaurant where Kaufman and Blassie have a discussion over breakfast. Also featured is Kaufman''s partner Bob Zmuda, who plays a nosy fan. Lynne Margulies, who would later become Kaufman''s girlfriend, also plays a role; in fact, she and Kaufman met for the first time on camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igTeW7rDxDISU8ysoEW7rgIUYc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63624'),
  ('517443823308309584', 'My Brilliant Career', 1979, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gillian Armstrong, Donald McAlpine', 'Eleanor Witcombe', 'Judy Davis, Sam Neill, Wendy Hughes, Robert Grubb, Max Cullen, Aileen Britton, Peter Whitford, Patricia Kennedy', 'G', 'A young woman who is determined to maintain her independence finds herself at odds with her family who wants her to tame her wild side and get married.', 'A young woman who is determined to maintain her independence finds herself at odds with her family who wants her to tame her wild side and get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s89ZolmE0tD5stOJhy6Jh4V3txZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16659'),
  ('307042077584577963', 'My Brilliant Life', 2014, 'Drama', 'E J-yong, Lee Jae-hyeok, Kim Hee-tae', 'E J-yong, Oh Hyo-jin, Choi Min-Suk', 'Song Hye-kyo, Gang Dong-won, Jo Sung-mok, Baek Il-seob, Heo Joon-seok, Kim So-jin, Cha Eun-woo, Chae Seo-jin', null, 'A couple of teenagers have a son who suffers from progeria, a rare genetic disorder which makes one age exponentially faster than normal. 16 years later, the child has the body of an 80 year old in the final days of his life writing a book about his parents'' love story.', 'A couple of teenagers have a son who suffers from progeria, a rare genetic disorder which makes one age exponentially faster than normal. 16 years later, the child has the body of an 80 year old in the final days of his life writing a book about his parents'' love story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fldt44893UNkPmGwXoSqL8ajs7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282058'),
  ('1123972094448344368', 'My Broken Mariko', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yuki Tanada, Daika Matsukura, Fūta Takagi', 'Kosuke Mukai, Yuki Tanada', 'Mei Nagano, Nao, Masataka Kubota, Yoh Yoshida, Toshinori Omi, Tsugu Sasaki, Mei Yokoyama', null, 'Shiino one day finds out that her best friend Mariko has committed suicide. After snatching Mariko''s urn from her abusive father, Shiino heads to Marigaoka Cape, a place Mariko always wanted to go.', 'Shiino one day finds out that her best friend Mariko has committed suicide. After snatching Mariko''s urn from her abusive father, Shiino heads to Marigaoka Cape, a place Mariko always wanted to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gV9qptms4S1wVa1vIML2bKVAyt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929739'),
  ('184926611728784413', 'My Bromance', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nitchapoom Chaianun', 'Nitchapoom Chaianun', 'Teerapat Lohanan, Natouch Siripongthon, Withawat Thaokhamlue, Naradon Namboonjit, Worakamon Nokkaew, Wachiraporn Attawut, Varatchaya Comemamoon, Phantphin T. Chiangmai', null, 'Golf never wanted a brother. Bank just wanted to be loved. What grew between them changed both boys forever.', 'Golf never wanted a brother. Bank just wanted to be loved. What grew between them changed both boys forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1waRePGb1KzgFV2zxqAm6FNU1z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285307'),
  ('148439882070947576', 'My Brother', 2004, 'Drama', 'Ahn Kwon-tae, Hwang Ki-suk, Shin Kyung-man', 'Ahn Kwon-tae', 'Won Bin, Shin Ha-kyun, Kim Hae-sook, Lee Bo-young, Jung Ho-bin, Cho Jin-woong, Kim Jong-man, Kim Kwang-kyu', null, 'The story of two brothers, growing up in 1970s Korea, who each take two completely different paths. One goes to school to become a doctor, the other becomes a gangster. Their story is told through flashbacks after one of them is murdered.', 'The story of two brothers, growing up in 1970s Korea, who each take two completely different paths. One goes to school to become a doctor, the other becomes a gangster. Their story is told through flashbacks after one of them is murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyHyomQX9dMGkYXPdZ2giuq7v2L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49213'),
  ('561600183050699223', 'My Brother', 2016, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mert Baykal', 'Zafer Külünk', 'Burak Özçivit, Murat Boz, Aslı Enver, Nazan Kesal, Ahmet Gülhan, Ferdi Sancar, Burak Satıbol, Gözde Mutluer', null, 'Two resentful, singer brothers Hakan and Ozan who can''t get along well. Meet again in their father''s funeral. Even though they want to get back to their daily lives after the funeral, their father''s will won''t allow it. They will take a journey with their dead father''s old car in order to carry out his bequest which is to sing at a wedding in Urla.', 'Two resentful, singer brothers Hakan and Ozan who can''t get along well. Meet again in their father''s funeral. Even though they want to get back to their daily lives after the funeral, their father''s will won''t allow it. They will take a journey with their dead father''s old car in order to carry out his bequest which is to sing at a wedding in Urla.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/75vVvpgzpNTaptYmQoyLMzvvF1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381938'),
  ('765189290996915655', 'My Brother 2', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mert Baykal', 'Zafer Külünk', 'Burak Özçivit, Murat Boz, Ferdi Sancar, Leyla Feray, Pınar Deniz, Korhan Herduran, Hakan Karsak, Ozan Çelik', null, 'Two famous brothers, Hakan and Ozan''s friends Tato died. Two days later, Hakan''s wedding was held, but they went to a friend''s house to fulfill their last duties. Hakan will marry Didem, the daughter of Muzaffer, one of Rize''s leading tea merchants. Muzaffer is a reaction to this marriage because Hakan is a famous singer. They find themselves in the Black Sea from the Aegean to Central Anatolia, beyond the borders as if they are not enough, and at the end of the journey filled with surprises.', 'Two famous brothers, Hakan and Ozan''s friends Tato died. Two days later, Hakan''s wedding was held, but they went to a friend''s house to fulfill their last duties. Hakan will marry Didem, the daughter of Muzaffer, one of Rize''s leading tea merchants. Muzaffer is a reaction to this marriage because Hakan is a famous singer. They find themselves in the Black Sea from the Aegean to Central Anatolia, beyond the borders as if they are not enough, and at the end of the journey filled with surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58VhE6SG6mVX6IrTu75FsKG9RLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477300'),
  ('1075419117181973779', 'My Brother and I', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Luca Lucini, Manfredo Archinto', 'Marta Storti, Ilaria Storti, Luca Lucini', 'Denise Tantucci, Cristiano Caccamo, Greta Ferro, Teresa Mannino, Claudio Colica, Paola Lavini, Antonino Bruschetta, Marco Leonardi', null, 'Sofia is the black sheep of her family. She is a 28-year-old gay girl who can’t help but cheat on her partner and struggles to find a stable job. She has left a little town in Calabria, her homeland in Southern Italy, to move to Milan, where she lives with her roommate Alessandro. Mauro is Sofia''s brother. Reliable and loving, unlike Sofia with whom he has a troubled relationship, Mauro has never left Calabria and runs the family winery. Despite their opposite attitudes, Sofia and Mauro has one thing in common. Michela is Sofia''s first and only love, but she is Mauro’s bride-to-be. When Sofia realizes that she is about to lose the woman of her life, she decides to go back home to Calabria and win back her true love. This unexpected return will break the delicate balance of Mauro and Sofia’s family and will force the two siblings to a showdown, when they will choose who they really want to be when they grow up. A story of rekindled loves, friendship, growth, and family.', 'Sofia is the black sheep of her family. She is a 28-year-old gay girl who can’t help but cheat on her partner and struggles to find a stable job. She has left a little town in Calabria, her homeland in Southern Italy, to move to Milan, where she lives with her roommate Alessandro. Mauro is Sofia''s brother. Reliable and loving, unlike Sofia with whom he has a troubled relationship, Mauro has never left Calabria and runs the family winery. Despite their opposite attitudes, Sofia and Mauro has one thing in common. Michela is Sofia''s first and only love, but she is Mauro’s bride-to-be. When Sofia realizes that she is about to lose the woman of her life, she decides to go back home to Calabria and win back her true love. This unexpected return will break the delicate balance of Mauro and Sofia’s family and will force the two siblings to a showdown, when they will choose who they really want to be when they grow up. A story of rekindled loves, friendship, growth, and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d29bZlMiPqBk2MoLqPFpaV2XSGs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852665'),
  ('814816127304482370', 'My Brother Chases Dinosaurs', 2019, 'Comedy, Family', 'Stefano Cipani, Sergi Bartrolí', 'Fabio Bonifacci, Giacomo Mazzariol', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Isabella Ragonese, Rossy de Palma, Francesco Gheghi, Roberto Nocchi, Gea Dall''Orto, Maria Vittoria Dallasta, Lorenzo Sisto', null, 'As a child, Jack believed the tender lie his parents told him, that Gio was a special being with superpowers, as in a comic book. Now that he is about to go to high school, however, Jack no longer believes that his brother is a superhero, in fact, he is almost ashamed of him, especially since he met Arianna, the first love of his life.', 'As a child, Jack believed the tender lie his parents told him, that Gio was a special being with superpowers, as in a comic book. Now that he is about to go to high school, however, Jack no longer believes that his brother is a superhero, in fact, he is almost ashamed of him, especially since he met Arianna, the first love of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWdaKaodaBxYEIv31xJ5J7pf8rn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593660'),
  ('450634247753503575', 'My Brother Is an Only Child', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, History', 'Gianni Costantino, Gianni Costantino, Gianluca Mizzi', 'Daniele Luchetti, Sandro Petraglia, Stefano Rulli', 'Elio Germano, Riccardo Scamarcio, Angela Finocchiaro, Massimo Popolizio, Ascanio Celestini, Diane Fleri, Alba Rohrwacher, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio', 'R', 'Accio and Manrico are siblings from a working-class family in 1960s Italy: older Manrico is handsome, charismatic, and loved by all, while younger Accio is sulky, hot-headed, and treats life as a battleground — much to his parents'' chagrin. After the former is drawn into left-wing politics, Accio joins the fascists out of spite, but his flimsy beliefs are put to test when he falls for Manrico''s like-minded girlfriend.', 'Accio and Manrico are siblings from a working-class family in 1960s Italy: older Manrico is handsome, charismatic, and loved by all, while younger Accio is sulky, hot-headed, and treats life as a battleground — much to his parents'' chagrin. After the former is drawn into left-wing politics, Accio joins the fascists out of spite, but his flimsy beliefs are put to test when he falls for Manrico''s like-minded girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSOjjhIY9OidNPqgJcguGfHeTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9789'),
  ('774844294242334574', 'My Brother Loves Me Too Much', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hayato Kawai, Makino Sho, Shinya Kimura', 'Yuko Matsuda', 'Tao Tsuchiya, Ryota Katayose, Yudai Chiba, Takuya Kusakawa, Yosuke Sugino, Ito Ohno, Fuju Kamio, YOU', null, 'Setoka Tachibana is a female high school student who has confessed her feelings to other boys 12 times, but has been rebuffed each time. Her older brother Haruka Tachibana cares for his younger sister deeply, but he keeps secret from her that they are not blood related. One day, Setoka''s first love Takane Serikawa appears after many years and approaches her.', 'Setoka Tachibana is a female high school student who has confessed her feelings to other boys 12 times, but has been rebuffed each time. Her older brother Haruka Tachibana cares for his younger sister deeply, but he keeps secret from her that they are not blood related. One day, Setoka''s first love Takane Serikawa appears after many years and approaches her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtSguACVTiZM6jZ1Lj6XaDo12Lb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465365'),
  ('122717790188564385', 'My Brother Simple', 2017, 'Drama', 'Markus Goller, Ueli Steiger', 'Markus Goller, Dirk Ahner', 'David Kross, Frederick Lau, Emilia Schüle, Devid Striesow, Axel Stein, Annette Frier, Tim Wilde, Ludger Pistor', null, 'Ben and Barnabas are unseparatable since they are small. The two of them, however, are no ordinary pair of brothers, for Barnabas, with his twenty-two years, remained mentally at the age of three.', 'Ben and Barnabas are unseparatable since they are small. The two of them, however, are no ordinary pair of brothers, for Barnabas, with his twenty-two years, remained mentally at the age of three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37mLKLKlNYVUPIpHHaTGIkU2nok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423422'),
  ('322862250097867179', 'My Brother the Pig', 1999, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Michael Stone, Erik Fleming', 'Matthew Flynn', 'Scarlett Johansson, Eva Mendes, Judge Reinhold, Alex D. Linz, Romy Walthall, Renée Victor, Nick Fuoco, Marco Rodríguez', 'PG', 'When a spell turns an 8-year-old boy into a swine, his sister and best friend race to find the cure.', 'When a spell turns an 8-year-old boy into a swine, his sister and best friend race to find the cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v21boSM424AT1J5dC5ugWr7zwqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73257'),
  ('1093607997414949226', 'My Brother the Vampire', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sven Taddicken, Daniela Knapp', 'Matthias Pacht', 'Roman Knižka, Hinnerk Schönemann, Marie-Luise Schramm, Julia Jentsch, Alexander Scheer, Marie-Lou Sellem, Barbara Stoll, Gottfried Breitfuß', null, 'Josh is about to turn 30; he''s mentally retarded, and likes to play at being a vampire. His sister Nicole is 15, and dealing with her impending womanhood; middle brother Mike is the "normal" one, but in some ways the most childish - his latest conquest is Nadine, who runs the dog kennel at his security guard job. Nic is fixated on getting laid, and watches Mike and Nadine through the skylight with Josh. Josh also gets fixated on sex, though he has no clear idea what it''s all about, and in particular on Nadine; to Mike''s chagrin, she seems more interested in Josh than in him.', 'Josh is about to turn 30; he''s mentally retarded, and likes to play at being a vampire. His sister Nicole is 15, and dealing with her impending womanhood; middle brother Mike is the "normal" one, but in some ways the most childish - his latest conquest is Nadine, who runs the dog kennel at his security guard job. Nic is fixated on getting laid, and watches Mike and Nadine through the skylight with Josh. Josh also gets fixated on sex, though he has no clear idea what it''s all about, and in particular on Nadine; to Mike''s chagrin, she seems more interested in Josh than in him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GQ63hXwiabiOdYGz9ia0YB3QVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96727'),
  ('1076033652571562534', 'My Brother Tom', 2001, 'Drama', 'Dom Rotheroe, Robby Müller', 'Alison Beeton-Hilder, Dom Rotheroe', 'Jenna Harrison, Ben Whishaw, Honeysuckle Weeks, Michael Erskine, Adrian Rawlins, Michael Tucek, Michael Power, Daniel Bliss', 'R', 'A teenage girl, Jessica, befriends a teenage boy called Tom, who is bullied by a local gang. She is abused by Jack, who is both her neighbour and school teacher, and Tom is sexually abused by his father. Together they bond in the woods, creating a private reality that no-one else can enter.', 'A teenage girl, Jessica, befriends a teenage boy called Tom, who is bullied by a local gang. She is abused by Jack, who is both her neighbour and school teacher, and Tom is sexually abused by his father. Together they bond in the woods, creating a private reality that no-one else can enter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/As8XfSgzm2ZUZItwuGlvLepBJdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89280'),
  ('486386198112595814', 'My Brother-in-Law', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Alasya', 'Umur Bugay', 'Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Gölgen Bengü, Perran Kutman, Cevat Kurtuluş, Turgut Boralı, Atilla Pekdemir, Erol Keskin', null, 'Selim, a minibus driver, moves to a new neighborhood. After a while, he falls in love with Zeynep, who lives in the neighborhood, and proposes to her. She accepts on the condition that he convinces her brother. Selim will try to convince her brother Halim, a bully, so that he can marry Zeynep.', 'Selim, a minibus driver, moves to a new neighborhood. After a while, he falls in love with Zeynep, who lives in the neighborhood, and proposes to her. She accepts on the condition that he convinces her brother. Selim will try to convince her brother Halim, a bully, so that he can marry Zeynep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3TQ9tvJQWvA0lWiAibUu18AGLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453494'),
  ('70041770811973393', 'My Brother-in-Law', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Piva, Dino Giarrusso, Gian Enrico Bianchi', 'Alessandro Piva, Andrea Piva, Salvatore De Mola', 'Sergio Rubini, Luigi Lo Cascio, Mariangela Arcieri, Alessandra Sarno, Gigi Angelillo, Vito Cassano, Mino Barbarese, Carolina Felline', null, 'A man recruits the help of his gangster brother-in-law to retrieve his stolen car.', 'A man recruits the help of his gangster brother-in-law to retrieve his stolen car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJjOIZBaYG58V5SKw7w3C1qQThz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59046'),
  ('104564405234505796', 'My Brother, My Sister', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alessio De Leonardis, Giuseppe Costantino, Roberto Capucci', 'Roberto Capucci, Paola Mammini', 'Alessandro Preziosi, Claudia Pandolfi, Ludovica Martino, Stella Egitto, Caterina Murino, Frank Gerrish, Fausto Morciano, Francesco Cavallo', null, 'When their father''s will forces them to live together, siblings Nik and Tesla — and Tesla''s kids — try to overcome their differences to become a family.', 'When their father''s will forces them to live together, siblings Nik and Tesla — and Tesla''s kids — try to overcome their differences to become a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzeHk2Cmszec4fscgPEGVLVg8O6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:770742'),
  ('375833566357138699', 'My Brother... Nikhil', 2005, 'Drama', 'Arvind Kannabiran, Onir', 'Onir', 'Juhi Chawla Mehta, Sanjay Suri, Victor Banerjee, Lillete Dubey, Purab Kohli, Dipannita Sharma, Shayan Munshi, Peeya Rai Chowdhary', null, 'Nikhil, a bright young swimmer, finds his life falling apart after getting diagnosed with HIV. In his troubled times, he finds the support of his sister, Anamika, and his boyfriend, Nigel.', 'Nikhil, a bright young swimmer, finds his life falling apart after getting diagnosed with HIV. In his troubled times, he finds the support of his sister, Anamika, and his boyfriend, Nigel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wk3bdtdcBnMDGA0jU03R9WdtK7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137303'),
  ('1141874851795422476', 'My Brother''s Keeper', 2021, 'Drama, Family', 'Joe Narode, Kevan Otto, Brian Shanley', 'Ty Manns', 'T.C. Stallings, Keshia Knight Pulliam, Joey Lawrence, Robert Ri''chard, Gregory Alan Williams, Blue Kimble, Jeff Rose, Shannen Fields', 'PG-13', 'Returning war veteran SFC Travis Fox has one more battle to fight – PTSD. Following an improvised explosive device attack that killed his best friend and their entire Ranger platoon, Travis returns to his hometown to settle the mysterious affairs of his late parents. In searching for answers, he uncovers a new obstacle and finds support from church counselor Tiffany Robertson. Slowly beginning to rediscover his faith in God, Travis uncovers a secret hidden by his friend Donnie that threatens his newfound faith, restores his guilt, and causes him to consider the unthinkable.', 'Returning war veteran SFC Travis Fox has one more battle to fight – PTSD. Following an improvised explosive device attack that killed his best friend and their entire Ranger platoon, Travis returns to his hometown to settle the mysterious affairs of his late parents. In searching for answers, he uncovers a new obstacle and finds support from church counselor Tiffany Robertson. Slowly beginning to rediscover his faith in God, Travis uncovers a secret hidden by his friend Donnie that threatens his newfound faith, restores his guilt, and causes him to consider the unthinkable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SJsEwa1pwL7FMmsgSvebxBZT9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769165'),
  ('403101303159370582', 'My Brother’s Name Is Robert and He Is an Idiot', 2019, 'Drama', 'Philip Gröning, Philip Gröning', 'Philip Gröning, Sabine Timoteo', 'Julia Zange, Josef Mattes, Urs Jucker, Stefan Konarske, Zita Aretz, Karolina Porcari, Daniel Zillmann, Vitus Zeplichal', null, 'For teenage twins Robert and Elena, a weekend can seem endless yet still fly by. Time almost stands still while discussing philosophy, lying in a blissful cornfield near a remote gas station. They are in their own little world, a twin world of twin games and twin love. A confined world where emotions rise, where pressure mounts into rage… The turmoil of adolescence.', 'For teenage twins Robert and Elena, a weekend can seem endless yet still fly by. Time almost stands still while discussing philosophy, lying in a blissful cornfield near a remote gas station. They are in their own little world, a twin world of twin games and twin love. A confined world where emotions rise, where pressure mounts into rage… The turmoil of adolescence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaKraAceWHp2lIkSrfw9XcdDjJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493656'),
  ('281184069519202214', 'My Brother''s Wedding', 1983, 'Drama', 'Charles Burnett, Julie Dash, Camelia Frieberg', 'Charles Burnett', 'Everett Silas, Jessie Holmes, Gaye Shannon-Burnett, Ronnie Bell, Dennis Kemper, Sally Easter, Hobert Durham Jr., Angela Burnett', 'NR', 'A young African-American man, living in Los Angeles without direction in his life, reluctantly agrees to be the best man for his brother, an upwardly mobile lawyer.', 'A young African-American man, living in Los Angeles without direction in his life, reluctantly agrees to be the best man for his brother, an upwardly mobile lawyer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HgIj3CHMZQI3a3wl1rOULwpFPU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91735'),
  ('95755652764872208', 'My Brother''s Wife', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Doris Wishman, C. Davis Smith, Tony Spalla', 'Doris Wishman', 'June Roberts, Sam Stewart, Bob Oran, Darlene Bennett, Joni Roberts, Dawn Bennett, Louis Silverman', 'NR', 'A man''s wife starts having an affair with her brother-in-law, who is temporarily staying at their apartment.', 'A man''s wife starts having an affair with her brother-in-law, who is temporarily staying at their apartment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiYXZSDNkG5RCNTidYClchT62O9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106489'),
  ('845839827553352228', 'My Brother''s Wife', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Andrés Sánchez, Ricardo de Montreuil', 'Jaime Bayly', 'Bárbara Mori, Manolo Cardona, Christian Meier, Gaby Espino, Beto Cuevas, Bruno Bichir, Angélica Aragón', 'R', 'After almost 10 years of marriage, attractive Zoe discovers that her marriage lacks passion and surprise, and is seduced by the possibility of finding those sensations already forgotten in her husband''s brother. From this premise a series of events lead these three characters to a dangerous game of revenges, secrets and passions. Two brothers and one woman: the triangle is outlined in a disquieting way. It is a bomb that triggers family secrets, the contained rage of desire and the unmanageable power of love. An exciting story that subjugates the viewer from beginning to end. Even though Zoe/Sonia has been married to Ignacio/Ishan for about a decade, they are unable to have children. She wants to be intimate but he prefers to be ready for intimacy on Saturdays only, and she gets physically drawn to his artistic brother, Gonzalo/Rohan. Then things get complicated for her after she tests positive for motherhood and finds that her husband may be gay.', 'After almost 10 years of marriage, attractive Zoe discovers that her marriage lacks passion and surprise, and is seduced by the possibility of finding those sensations already forgotten in her husband''s brother. From this premise a series of events lead these three characters to a dangerous game of revenges, secrets and passions. Two brothers and one woman: the triangle is outlined in a disquieting way. It is a bomb that triggers family secrets, the contained rage of desire and the unmanageable power of love. An exciting story that subjugates the viewer from beginning to end. Even though Zoe/Sonia has been married to Ignacio/Ishan for about a decade, they are unable to have children. She wants to be intimate but he prefers to be ready for intimacy on Saturdays only, and she gets physically drawn to his artistic brother, Gonzalo/Rohan. Then things get complicated for her after she tests positive for motherhood and finds that her husband may be gay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTfrtrBjmJABhC0micyNUEjzyv4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50724'),
  ('324156653085406157', 'My Brother''s Wife 3: The Woman Downstairs', 2017, 'Drama', 'Lee Dol', 'Lee Dol', 'Ahn So-hee, Sang Woo, Wi Ji-Woong, Lee Eun-mi, Hayashi Risa, Jeon Ji-hak', null, 'My sister and I moved into a new house. We didn''t do much but the woman downstairs came up to ask us to keep it down. She said she was sensitive so we decided to keep it down. Her gangster husband would beat her when he came home drunk. Every time I heard her suffer from the beatings, I couldn''t stand it and would stomp the floor to create a distraction. She would come up telling us to be quiet. I told her I did it intentionally. I also decided to do something about the woman who showed interest in me by memorizing my number.', 'My sister and I moved into a new house. We didn''t do much but the woman downstairs came up to ask us to keep it down. She said she was sensitive so we decided to keep it down. Her gangster husband would beat her when he came home drunk. Every time I heard her suffer from the beatings, I couldn''t stand it and would stomp the floor to create a distraction. She would come up telling us to be quiet. I told her I did it intentionally. I also decided to do something about the woman who showed interest in me by memorizing my number.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YFrjGe4jm5geExd5iRpcpeTPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453133'),
  ('826926674499556208', 'My Brothers and I', 2022, 'Drama', 'Yohan Manca, Marco Graziaplena, Natalie Engelstein', 'Yohan Manca', 'Maël Rouin Berrandou, Sofian Khammes, Dali Benssalah, Moncef Farfar, Judith Chemla, Luc Schwarz, Olivier Loustau, Olga Milshtein', null, 'Nour, a 14-year-old boy, is enjoying the summer holidays in the South of France. He is the youngest of four brothers. They live together in a council estate, caring for their mother who is in a coma. Nour dreams of escaping to a faraway place. When he crosses paths with Sarah, an Opera singer teaching summer classes, he finds the opportunity to come out of his shell and explore new horizons.', 'Nour, a 14-year-old boy, is enjoying the summer holidays in the South of France. He is the youngest of four brothers. They live together in a council estate, caring for their mother who is in a coma. Nour dreams of escaping to a faraway place. When he crosses paths with Sarah, an Opera singer teaching summer classes, he finds the opportunity to come out of his shell and explore new horizons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46NAd9b0ZdzZYnkpI32VWkkFNEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838885'),
  ('496957843901378387', 'My Brothers and Sisters in the North', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Eirich-Schneider, Julia Daschner, Sung Hyung Cho', null, 'Sung Hyung Cho', null, 'The Democratic People''s Republic of Korea is a country with a very strong social cohesion and the unprecedented admiration of the people for their leader, which is absolutely unique and incomprehensible especially from a Western point of view. The native Korean director Sung-Hyung Cho tries to understand this by accompanying several Koreans from different backgrounds in their daily lives. The film shows the country and its people in a way, as it is rarely done in Western media, non-judgmental and respectful towards the people.', 'The Democratic People''s Republic of Korea is a country with a very strong social cohesion and the unprecedented admiration of the people for their leader, which is absolutely unique and incomprehensible especially from a Western point of view. The native Korean director Sung-Hyung Cho tries to understand this by accompanying several Koreans from different backgrounds in their daily lives. The film shows the country and its people in a way, as it is rarely done in Western media, non-judgmental and respectful towards the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEHfIO5vmTtTyqkUTWivElvz91R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393967'),
  ('573030024327089137', 'My Bunny Lies Over the Sea', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'In Scotland, Bugs Bunny rescues a woman from a monster. The "woman" is a kilted Scotsman, and the "monster" is his bagpipe. The Scotsman then challenges Bugs to a game of golf.', 'In Scotland, Bugs Bunny rescues a woman from a monster. The "woman" is a kilted Scotsman, and the "monster" is his bagpipe. The Scotsman then challenges Bugs to a game of golf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXDjbfMHe4FDEp5HErsEhSZ9ghb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53051'),
  ('912289141943940455', 'My Chauffeur', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Beaird, David M. Robertson, Scott Javine', 'David Beaird', 'Deborah Foreman, Sam J. Jones, Sean McClory, Penn Jillette, Teller, Howard Hesseman, E.G. Marshall, John O''Leary', 'R', 'A feisty young woman accepts a mysterious offer to become a chauffeur for a Beverly Hills limousine business, much to the chagrin of her older male coworkers and the disbelief of her customers.', 'A feisty young woman accepts a mysterious offer to become a chauffeur for a Beverly Hills limousine business, much to the chagrin of her older male coworkers and the disbelief of her customers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfNxWVRUuJbdRswHlxYf7XAUJD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39406'),
  ('616615962816863617', 'My Child', 2013, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Can Candan, Boysan Yakar', 'Can Candan', 'Sule Ceylan, Ömer Ceylan, Pınar Özer, Sema Yakar, H. Metehan Ozkan, Mehmet Tarhan, Günseli Dum, Nilgül Yalcinoglu', null, 'What happens when your child comes out to you? In this feature documentary, parents of lesbian, gay, bisexual and trans-gender individuals in Turkey intimately share their experiences with the viewer, as they redefine what it means to be parents in this conservative society.', 'What happens when your child comes out to you? In this feature documentary, parents of lesbian, gay, bisexual and trans-gender individuals in Turkey intimately share their experiences with the viewer, as they redefine what it means to be parents in this conservative society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIP2KqBQhQDte7VTSzAyRRgRxIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263958'),
  ('5830861846067964', 'My Childhood', 1972, 'Drama', 'Bill Douglas', 'Bill Douglas', 'Stephen Archibald, Hughie Restorick, Jean Taylor Smith, Karl Fieseler, Bernard McKenna, Paul Kermack, Helena Gloag, Ann Smith', 'NR', 'The first part of Bill Douglas'' influential trilogy harks back to his impoverished upbringing in early-''40s Scotland. Cinema was his only escape - he paid for it with the money he made from returning empty jam jars - and this escape is reflected most closely at this time of his life as an eight-year-old living on the breadline with his half-brother and sick grandmother in a poor mining village.', 'The first part of Bill Douglas'' influential trilogy harks back to his impoverished upbringing in early-''40s Scotland. Cinema was his only escape - he paid for it with the money he made from returning empty jam jars - and this escape is reflected most closely at this time of his life as an eight-year-old living on the breadline with his half-brother and sick grandmother in a poor mining village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQ57rkuYVkQ31aDpmjVTw7erh6w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114444'),
  ('124863428522186234', 'My Christmas Dream', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Randal Platt, James Head, Jelena Popovic', 'Don Perez, Ron Oliver', 'Danica McKellar, David Haydn-Jones, Deidre Hall, Bruce Dawson, Christine Lee, Christian Convery, Colleen Winton, Eric Pollins', 'PG', 'A department store manager sets out to create an amazing holiday display window to impress the owner. She asks a recently-fired employee to help her make the display, and as they work together, they start to fall in love.', 'A department store manager sets out to create an amazing holiday display window to impress the owner. She asks a recently-fired employee to help her make the display, and as they work together, they start to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCrE3Twc7PeLev4sCHkMtOPdrA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415962'),
  ('702591770039235058', 'My Christmas Family Tree', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jason Bourque, Shawn Seifert', 'Mark Hefti', 'Aimee Teegarden, Andrew W. Walker, James Tupper, Kendall Cross, Georgia Orchard, Ava Telek, Colby McClendon, Lisa Paxton', 'G', 'When Vanessa receives the results from her Family Tree DNA test, she discovers a family she didn''t know existed and travels to their home for Christmas.', 'When Vanessa receives the results from her Family Tree DNA test, she discovers a family she didn''t know existed and travels to their home for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXnDMbSCKWQfH8WDkEc5kTbXZX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874194'),
  ('896771685645535881', 'My Christmas Guide', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Max McGuire, Juan Carlos Montalvo, Mallory Horsman', 'Keith Hemstreet', 'Amber Marshall, Ben Mehl, Ava Weiss, Justin Nurse, Pete Soucy, Bridget Wareham, Vox Smith, Jonathan Valvano', 'G', 'A college professor connects with a guide dog trainer after losing his eyesight and adopting a seeing eye dog.', 'A college professor connects with a guide dog trainer after losing his eyesight and adopting a seeing eye dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sh2DjlKELUbSTGmYEnOrZ2rgfMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180661'),
  ('1083762032958165580', 'My Christmas Inn', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Sullivan', null, 'Tia Mowry, Jackée Harry, Tim Reid, Erin Gray, Rob Mayes, Kai Findley, Melanie Nelson, Tanya Wright', null, 'With the holiday season in full swing, Jen Taylor is about to score a big promotion at the San Francisco ad agency where she works. But her life is unexpectedly turned upside down when she inherits a cozy inn in Alaska from her aunt. When she goes to inspect the property and meets handsome town attorney Steve Anderson, she''s surprised to find that nothing is what she expected. The small town community is full of fun and festive Christmas traditions and soon, Jen starts wondering if the inn might just be the place she belongs, and if Steve could be the Mr. Right she has been waiting for.', 'With the holiday season in full swing, Jen Taylor is about to score a big promotion at the San Francisco ad agency where she works. But her life is unexpectedly turned upside down when she inherits a cozy inn in Alaska from her aunt. When she goes to inspect the property and meets handsome town attorney Steve Anderson, she''s surprised to find that nothing is what she expected. The small town community is full of fun and festive Christmas traditions and soon, Jen starts wondering if the inn might just be the place she belongs, and if Steve could be the Mr. Right she has been waiting for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSsJ68MHxtmnMOIaqafPm9SvfDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551603'),
  ('447187494811495469', 'My Christmas Love', 2016, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Robert Hayes, Jeff Fisher', 'Brian Turner, Garrett Frawley', 'Meredith Hagner, Bobby Campo, Aaron O''Connell, Gregory Harrison, Megan Park, Ben Gavin, Jeremy Glazer, Anne Sward', null, 'A hopeless romantic who can’t ever seem to give a guy a real chance begins receiving each of the "12 Days of Christmas” as gifts anonymously at her door. As she tries to figure out who is sending the gifts, she begins to believe that the mystery suitor could finally live up to her expectations.', 'A hopeless romantic who can’t ever seem to give a guy a real chance begins receiving each of the "12 Days of Christmas” as gifts anonymously at her door. As she tries to figure out who is sending the gifts, she begins to believe that the mystery suitor could finally live up to her expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LSB2LDYEQLXYQkdk98MKsrfLTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421625'),
  ('142431440680830699', 'My Christmas Prince', 2017, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Theo Angell, Sam Irvin', 'Hanz Wasserburger', 'Alexis Knapp, Callum Alexander, Pamela Sue Martin, Charles Shaughnessy, Jane Carr, Catriona Toop, Marina Sirtis, Aimee-Lynn Chadwick', null, 'Samantha, a dedicated teacher in Manhattan, returns to her home town of Maple Falls, Wyoming every year for Christmas. This year, she’s delighted when her boyfriend Alex, a European diplomat from the tiny country of Madelvia, decides to joins her. Samantha later discovers Alex is actually a prince destined for the throne, turning her entire world upside down. Realizing that staying with Alex means spending her life in the constant glare of publicity and giving up the job opportunity of a lifetime, Samantha must decide if she loves Alex enough to make the transition from teacher to royal – or will it be too big a leap', 'Samantha, a dedicated teacher in Manhattan, returns to her home town of Maple Falls, Wyoming every year for Christmas. This year, she’s delighted when her boyfriend Alex, a European diplomat from the tiny country of Madelvia, decides to joins her. Samantha later discovers Alex is actually a prince destined for the throne, turning her entire world upside down. Realizing that staying with Alex means spending her life in the constant glare of publicity and giving up the job opportunity of a lifetime, Samantha must decide if she loves Alex enough to make the transition from teacher to royal – or will it be too big a leap', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5WmD3FEnk8WxwhmYCBsg45J2Ht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488063'),
  ('599177651436498813', 'My Cinemas', 1990, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Füruzan, Gülsün Karamustafa, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Füruzan', 'Hülya Avşar, Yaman Okay, Sema Aybars, Ülkü Ülker, Yaman Tarcan, Güzin Çorağan', null, 'Nesibe lives with her poor family in a slum in Istanbul. Her father, who can''t hold down a job, often takes out his anger on his family. Knowing that this is not all there is to life, Nesibe finds solace in movies.', 'Nesibe lives with her poor family in a slum in Istanbul. Her father, who can''t hold down a job, often takes out his anger on his family. Knowing that this is not all there is to life, Nesibe finds solace in movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/us6DzBuHVJco1em2Hym83JxcGpQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287017'),
  ('973983812443343908', 'My Class', 2014, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Daniele Gaglianone', 'Gino Clemente, Claudia Russo', 'Valerio Mastandrea, Bassirou Ballde', null, 'The ostensibly simple story of a sympathetic veteran teacher giving Italian lessons to a weekly class of diverse immigrants is given infinitely more depth and complexity by the manner in which director Daniele Gaglianone renders his story. Blurring the lines between fact and fiction, truth and artifice, and between documentary and drama, Gaglianone has created a film within a film. You see the apparent artifice of Gaglianone’s crew using professionals, including the noted film actor Valerio Mastandrea as the teacher, interlinked with ‘real’ immigrant protagonists, studying the language to improve their chances of employment and of gaining a permanent residence permit. Thus in the course of the lessons there is simultaneously the painful and upsetting relation of the students’ personal stories but also humour, as they interact and share their humanity, bridging cultural differences, united in their striving to make a better life for themselves. (Source: LFF programme)', 'The ostensibly simple story of a sympathetic veteran teacher giving Italian lessons to a weekly class of diverse immigrants is given infinitely more depth and complexity by the manner in which director Daniele Gaglianone renders his story. Blurring the lines between fact and fiction, truth and artifice, and between documentary and drama, Gaglianone has created a film within a film. You see the apparent artifice of Gaglianone’s crew using professionals, including the noted film actor Valerio Mastandrea as the teacher, interlinked with ‘real’ immigrant protagonists, studying the language to improve their chances of employment and of gaining a permanent residence permit. Thus in the course of the lessons there is simultaneously the painful and upsetting relation of the students’ personal stories but also humour, as they interact and share their humanity, bridging cultural differences, united in their striving to make a better life for themselves. (Source: LFF programme)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpCOQcwo4B51nRATaDTqJfONSLy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231020'),
  ('734460484459485472', 'My Country, My Parents', 2021, 'Drama', 'Wu Jing, Zhang Ziyi, Xu Zheng', 'Li Yuan, He Keke, Yu Baimei', 'Wu Jing, Zhang Ziyi, Xu Zheng, Teng Shen, Huang Xuan, Song Jia, Zhang Yuqi, Tao Hong', null, 'This anthology drama presents four short films honoring Chinese families, spotlighting the struggles of key groups across four pivotal eras: the revolution, construction, reform and opening up, and the new era, while highlighting their perseverance, dedication to ideals, and commitment to passing on the national spirit through generations.', 'This anthology drama presents four short films honoring Chinese families, spotlighting the struggles of key groups across four pivotal eras: the revolution, construction, reform and opening up, and the new era, while highlighting their perseverance, dedication to ideals, and commitment to passing on the national spirit through generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opRlkb2A1L83hawv4vkHTFIFEav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869724'),
  ('68889995361793290', 'My Cousin', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Anne-Sophie Versnaeyen, Jan Kounen', 'Fabrice Roger-Lacan, Vincent Lindon, Jan Kounen', 'Vincent Lindon, François Damiens, Pascale Arbillot, Alix Poisson, Séverine Vasselin, Dominique Bettenfeld, Olivia Gotanègre, Eric Laugérias', null, 'Pierre is the highly successful CEO of a large family-owned company. Before signing the deal of the century, he has to settle one last formality: obtain the signature of his cousin Adrien who owns 50% of his firm. This sweet, idealistic dreamer, who makes one blunder after another, is so happy to see Pierre again that he wants to spend time with him and delay the moment of signing. So Pierre has no choice but to take his cousin with him on a turbulent business trip during which his patience will be put to the test.', 'Pierre is the highly successful CEO of a large family-owned company. Before signing the deal of the century, he has to settle one last formality: obtain the signature of his cousin Adrien who owns 50% of his firm. This sweet, idealistic dreamer, who makes one blunder after another, is so happy to see Pierre again that he wants to spend time with him and delay the moment of signing. So Pierre has no choice but to take his cousin with him on a turbulent business trip during which his patience will be put to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60aFZEEUxp3FjqZZPHFoFLY49OL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601297'),
  ('1128633123009644762', 'My Cousin Rachel', 1952, 'Mystery, Romance, Drama', 'Henry Koster, Joseph LaShelle', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Olivia de Havilland, Richard Burton, Audrey Dalton, Ronald Squire, George Dolenz, John Sutton, Tudor Owen, J.M. Kerrigan', 'NR', 'A young man plots revenge against the woman he believes murdered his cousin, but his plans are shaken when he comes face to face with the enigmatic beauty.', 'A young man plots revenge against the woman he believes murdered his cousin, but his plans are shaken when he comes face to face with the enigmatic beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ki5RsrRByusjYOBFM6cK6SAo12.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94529'),
  ('1135606330375895675', 'My Cousin Rachel', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Michell, Mike Eley, Barrie McCulloch', 'Roger Michell', 'Rachel Weisz, Sam Claflin, Holliday Grainger, Iain Glen, Pierfrancesco Favino, Simon Russell Beale, Vicki Pepperdine, Tim Barlow', 'PG-13', 'A young Englishman plots revenge against his mysterious, beautiful cousin, believing that she murdered his guardian. But his feelings become complicated as he finds himself falling under the beguiling spell of her charms.', 'A young Englishman plots revenge against his mysterious, beautiful cousin, believing that she murdered his guardian. But his feelings become complicated as he finds himself falling under the beguiling spell of her charms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLPm7mjg8a8Y5veds4fhSWwvlFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413998'),
  ('191078015395229072', 'My Cousin Sister', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', 'Yoon Joong-boo', null, 'Ahn So-hee, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo, Yoo Hae-na, Lee Mi-na', null, 'Cousins who work at a single workplace, the man having sex with her older cousin who is angry at him, his younger cousin he loves before who visits, and a hot love story that begins again. The story of a woman who wants to leave the countryside falls into the charm of an uncle who lives with her in town, and a new story written with entangled desires.', 'Cousins who work at a single workplace, the man having sex with her older cousin who is angry at him, his younger cousin he loves before who visits, and a hot love story that begins again. The story of a woman who wants to leave the countryside falls into the charm of an uncle who lives with her in town, and a new story written with entangled desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I05riVnrH0IHxIvkIfyXCfTQyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505283'),
  ('1026471607255997918', 'My Cousin the Sexologist 2', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Manuela Castillo, Miguel Chávez, Laura Sáenz', 'Miguel Chávez', 'Stephanie Herela, Milena Granados, Andrés Salvatierra, Majelo Quiróz, David Ramírez', null, 'After six months of dating, Malena and Manuel decide it''s time to move to the next level and create a Cousins Club where members will learn about sex.', 'After six months of dating, Malena and Manuel decide it''s time to move to the next level and create a Cousins Club where members will learn about sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7JbIS90ZpwRFphsk8qSzQPe96EO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1305194'),
  ('1148277133890009071', 'My Cousin Vinny', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonathan Lynn, Peter Deming, Frank Capra III', 'Dale Launer', 'Joe Pesci, Marisa Tomei, Ralph Macchio, Mitchell Whitfield, Fred Gwynne, Lane Smith, Austin Pendleton, Bruce McGill', 'R', 'Two carefree pals traveling through rural Alabama on their way back to college are mistakenly arrested and charged with murder. Fortunately, one of them has a cousin who''s a lawyer - Vincent Gambini, a former auto mechanic from Brooklyn who has just passed his bar exam after his sixth try. When he arrives with his leather-clad girlfriend to try his first case, it''s a real shock - for him and the Deep South!', 'Two carefree pals traveling through rural Alabama on their way back to college are mistakenly arrested and charged with murder. Fortunately, one of them has a cousin who''s a lawyer - Vincent Gambini, a former auto mechanic from Brooklyn who has just passed his bar exam after his sixth try. When he arrives with his leather-clad girlfriend to try his first case, it''s a real shock - for him and the Deep South!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwSURa8nS2ujwrU3s1lfxxX7voH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10377'),
  ('693189159096846808', 'My Cousin, the Ghost', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance', 'Wu Ma, Ng Min-Kan, Au Kam-Hung', 'Joyee Cheung Lai-Ling', 'Kenny Bee, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Mang Hoi, Wu Ma, Tai Bo, Teddy Yip Wing-Cho, James Tien Chun, Billy Ching Sau-Yat', null, 'Cousin Big returns home from the UK in order to find a wife and settle down. He has previously driven out his illegal immigrant friend Ma from the UK and the scores aren''t settled. That is all cast aside when not only one, not two but three ghosts are to be dealt with and one is Cousin Big who has fallen in love with one of the ghosts.', 'Cousin Big returns home from the UK in order to find a wife and settle down. He has previously driven out his illegal immigrant friend Ma from the UK and the scores aren''t settled. That is all cast aside when not only one, not two but three ghosts are to be dealt with and one is Cousin Big who has fallen in love with one of the ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCGmoQWrkMVVp4uufB6ThdSjWUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198075'),
  ('1149170665658579273', 'My Dad Is a Heel Wrestler', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Kyohei Fujimura, Hironori Yamasaki', 'Masahiro Itabashi, Hisanori Yoshida, Kyohei Fujimura', 'Hiroshi Tanahashi, Yoshino Kimura, Kokoro Terada, Riisa Naka, Kazuchika Okada, Ryusuke Taguchi, Togi Makabe, Satoshi Kojima', null, 'Takashi Omura (Hiroshi Tanahashi) was once a popular professional wrestler, but he isn''t popular anymore. He now wears a cockroach mask and wrestles as a villain. He is married to Shiori (Yoshino Kimura) and they have an elementary school aged son named Shota (Kokoro Terada). Takashi and Shiori have not yet told their son what Takashi does for a living. One day, Shota finds out that Takashi is a professional wrestler and a villain with a cockroach mask. Shota is shocked and tells a lie to his classmate that his dad is a popular professional wrestler.', 'Takashi Omura (Hiroshi Tanahashi) was once a popular professional wrestler, but he isn''t popular anymore. He now wears a cockroach mask and wrestles as a villain. He is married to Shiori (Yoshino Kimura) and they have an elementary school aged son named Shota (Kokoro Terada). Takashi and Shiori have not yet told their son what Takashi does for a living. One day, Shota finds out that Takashi is a professional wrestler and a villain with a cockroach mask. Shota is shocked and tells a lie to his classmate that his dad is a popular professional wrestler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iMfsUKpC3itKG4w9obDyikC3tv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525830'),
  ('155455697251756364', 'My Dad, the Socialist Kulak', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Matjaž Klopčič, Živko Zalar', 'Tone Partljič', 'Ivo Ban, Polde Bibič, Janez Bermez, Urška Hlebec, Milena Zupančič, Ivan Godnič, Anica Kumer, Anton Petje', null, 'Year 1945. The second World War is over and the soldiers from the disbanded army are returning home. Yet there is still no sign of Joze Malek.', 'Year 1945. The second World War is over and the soldiers from the disbanded army are returning home. Yet there is still no sign of Joze Malek.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSFI36Dcz8Gnz9bzL1kee57MsZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70528'),
  ('572031479211570724', 'My Dad''s Christmas Date', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Mick Davis, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Toby Torlesse, Brian Marchetti, Jack Marchetti', 'Jeremy Piven, Olivia-Mai Barrett, Hadar Cats, Joely Richardson, Megan Brown, Felix Butterwick, Sophie Corcoran, Janine Craig', 'NR', 'It’s Christmas and the charming city of York, home to Jules, 16, and her dad, David, is decked out ready for the festive season. In many ways, David and Jules’ relationship is no different from that of most fathers and their sixteen-year-old daughters. He struggles to understand her, she refuses to communicate with him. He wants to be involved in her life, she wants her own space. In one important respect, however, David and Jules share a profound bond: the death of Jules’ mum, and David’s wife, in a car crash two years before. With both struggling to cope with everyday life in the shadow of their loss, Jules, inspired by happy memories of her mum, decides to take matters into her own hands.', 'It’s Christmas and the charming city of York, home to Jules, 16, and her dad, David, is decked out ready for the festive season. In many ways, David and Jules’ relationship is no different from that of most fathers and their sixteen-year-old daughters. He struggles to understand her, she refuses to communicate with him. He wants to be involved in her life, she wants her own space. In one important respect, however, David and Jules share a profound bond: the death of Jules’ mum, and David’s wife, in a car crash two years before. With both struggling to cope with everyday life in the shadow of their loss, Jules, inspired by happy memories of her mum, decides to take matters into her own hands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAfeEGYIwEG4YmVk77pv8fk0Dpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754053'),
  ('620778194619626695', 'My Darling Clementine', 1946, 'Western, Drama, Romance, History', 'John Ford, Joseph MacDonald, Lloyd Bacon', 'Samuel G. Engel, Winston Miller', 'Henry Fonda, Linda Darnell, Victor Mature, Cathy Downs, Walter Brennan, Tim Holt, Ward Bond, Alan Mowbray', null, 'Three brothers stop off for a night in the town of Tombstone. The next morning they find one of their brothers dead and their cattle stolen. They decide to take revenge on the culprits.', 'Three brothers stop off for a night in the town of Tombstone. The next morning they find one of their brothers dead and their cattle stolen. They decide to take revenge on the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7G5klSt9i8LQZdUNvrWUJbbxAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3088'),
  ('643790321575221793', 'My Darling Is a Foreigner', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Kazuaki Ue', 'Saori Oguri, Satomi Oshima', 'Mao Inoue, Jonathan Sherr, Ryoko Kuninaka, Naho Toda, Jun Kunimura, Shinobu Otake', null, 'Based on a true story. A Japanese girl and an American guy, fall in love in Japan. Their relationship will not be easy to manage, with their different cultures and their different langages.', 'Based on a true story. A Japanese girl and an American guy, fall in love in Japan. Their relationship will not be easy to manage, with their different cultures and their different langages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36M3tAXS8Z9rTuJUHPMltj6gEFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48410'),
  ('851531785675669153', 'My Darling Slave', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Giorgio Capitani, Alessandro D''Eva', 'Sandro Continenza, Giulio Scarnicci, Raimondo Vianello', 'Lando Buzzanca, Catherine Spaak, Adriana Asti, Veronica Merin, Gordon Mitchell, Gianni Bonagura', null, 'Demetrio Cultrera, is a young rich car dealership Sicilian bachelor who becomes engaged to the beautiful and rich Rosalba Giordano. After their wedding, Rosalba''s attitude changes when she decides to try turning Demetrio into the modern husband she''d like. This causes a problem, as Demetrius prefers sticking to what he sees as more traditional gender roles. Despite her attempts, Rosalba''s persistent attempts to convert him to the rituals of high society, enlightened, or feminine tastes do little more than annoy him. Strongly determined to build a stable relationship with a woman who can fulfill his visions of peaceful married life, he leaves for the Amazon, where he is offered the opportunity to choose and buy a new wife as a slave. The choice falls on the beautiful and docile Manua that he trains to act the way he''d like, then proudly shows to friends and to his former wife, attracting curiosity, envy, and his ex-wife''s resentment.', 'Demetrio Cultrera, is a young rich car dealership Sicilian bachelor who becomes engaged to the beautiful and rich Rosalba Giordano. After their wedding, Rosalba''s attitude changes when she decides to try turning Demetrio into the modern husband she''d like. This causes a problem, as Demetrius prefers sticking to what he sees as more traditional gender roles. Despite her attempts, Rosalba''s persistent attempts to convert him to the rituals of high society, enlightened, or feminine tastes do little more than annoy him. Strongly determined to build a stable relationship with a woman who can fulfill his visions of peaceful married life, he leaves for the Amazon, where he is offered the opportunity to choose and buy a new wife as a slave. The choice falls on the beautiful and docile Manua that he trains to act the way he''d like, then proudly shows to friends and to his former wife, attracting curiosity, envy, and his ex-wife''s resentment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ETYLc4nCZ25VvG6kz4kCpJIlec.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73073'),
  ('22393552018055071', 'My Date with Drew', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Jon Gunn, Brian Herzlinger, Brett Winn', null, 'Drew Barrymore, Brian Herzlinger, Corey Feldman, Eric Roberts, Bill D''Elia, Lily Rains, George DelHoyo, Andrea Logan White', 'PG', 'Ever since the second grade when he first saw her in E.T. The Extraterrestrial, Brian Herzlinger has had a crush on Drew Barrymore. Now, 20 years later he''s decided to try to fulfill his lifelong dream by asking her for a date. There''s one small problem: She''s Drew Barrymore and he''s, well, Brian Herzlinger, a broke 27-year-old aspiring filmmaker from New Jersey.', 'Ever since the second grade when he first saw her in E.T. The Extraterrestrial, Brian Herzlinger has had a crush on Drew Barrymore. Now, 20 years later he''s decided to try to fulfill his lifelong dream by asking her for a date. There''s one small problem: She''s Drew Barrymore and he''s, well, Brian Herzlinger, a broke 27-year-old aspiring filmmaker from New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19ChghJMN72BG9mQeDK0D209whF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25975'),
  ('183447686962668834', 'My Date with the President''s Daughter', 1998, 'TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Albert J. Dunk, Alex Zamm', 'Alex Zamm, William Robertson', 'Dabney Coleman, Will Friedle, Elisabeth Harnois, Mimi Kuzyk, Wanda Cannon, Jay Thomas, Paulo Costanzo, Nicole De Boer', 'G', 'Duncan is just an ordinary high school student. Hallie dreams of an ordinary life, but is actually the daughter of the president of the United States, living with a high profile and a rigid schedule. The unlikely pair happen to meet at the local mall, and Duncan nervously asks Hallie out, unaware of her family situation. When their eventual date is ruined by the intrusive Secret Service, the young lovebirds cut loose for a night of mischief.', 'Duncan is just an ordinary high school student. Hallie dreams of an ordinary life, but is actually the daughter of the president of the United States, living with a high profile and a rigid schedule. The unlikely pair happen to meet at the local mall, and Duncan nervously asks Hallie out, unaware of her family situation. When their eventual date is ruined by the intrusive Secret Service, the young lovebirds cut loose for a night of mischief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9at6NYvT5Z6jZRS27ZrCGPCM54c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32195'),
  ('1019780031368069594', 'My Daughter Hildegart', 1977, 'Drama, History', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Cecilio Paniagua', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Rafael Azcona', 'Amparo Soler Leal, Carmen Roldán, Manuel Galiana, Carles Velat, Pedro Díez del Corral, José María Mompín, Ricardo Tundidor, Maribel Ayuso', null, 'Madrid 1933. Aurora Rodriguez kills her daughter Hildegart and turn herself over to the police. In jail she remember the circumstances that made her committing the crime...', 'Madrid 1933. Aurora Rodriguez kills her daughter Hildegart and turn herself over to the police. In jail she remember the circumstances that made her committing the crime...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwPUegDpzee3Se1uwRIZNG7KF4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83370'),
  ('131057085010324604', 'My Daughter Is a Zombie', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pil Gam-seong, Lee Yong-chul, Kim Tae-soo', 'Kim Hyun', 'Cho Jung-seok, Lee Jung-eun, Cho Yeo-jeong, Yoon Kyung-ho, Choi Yu-ri, Geum-dong, Jeon Su-ji, Kim Beong-choun', 'NR', 'Jung-hwan is a gruff but loving zookeeper who specializes in training wild beasts. His teenage daughter, Soo-ah, is going through puberty and a full-blown dance obsession. Their days are full of bickering and bonding... until one day, Soo-ah becomes infected by a zombie virus that has swept across the globe. Refusing to give up on his daughter, Jung-hwan takes her to a quiet seaside village called Eunbong-ri, where his mother Bam-soon lives. In a world obsessed with rooting out the infected, Soo-ah shows strange signs of awareness - responding to music, her grandmother''s sharp taps with a back scratcher, and even faint traces of human language. Determined to protect her at all costs, Jung-hwan draws on his years of experience training tigers and begins a secret mission to tame and retrain... his zombie daughter.', 'Jung-hwan is a gruff but loving zookeeper who specializes in training wild beasts. His teenage daughter, Soo-ah, is going through puberty and a full-blown dance obsession. Their days are full of bickering and bonding... until one day, Soo-ah becomes infected by a zombie virus that has swept across the globe. Refusing to give up on his daughter, Jung-hwan takes her to a quiet seaside village called Eunbong-ri, where his mother Bam-soon lives. In a world obsessed with rooting out the infected, Soo-ah shows strange signs of awareness - responding to music, her grandmother''s sharp taps with a back scratcher, and even faint traces of human language. Determined to protect her at all costs, Jung-hwan draws on his years of experience training tigers and begins a secret mission to tame and retrain... his zombie daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4wk90VHnjy9dWRZPkXMMyphftLG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1306816'),
  ('997451195682995242', 'My Daughter Was Taken', 2026, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Mystery', 'Roxanne Boisvert, Bill St. John, Abbey Chapman, Macrae Martin, Kristen McNaule, Amarige Trottier, Ilona Smyth', 'Roxanne Boisvert, Alexandre Carrière', 'Dennis Andres, Ash Catherwood, Eric Davis, Dana Fradkin, Brett Geddes', null, 'After witnessing her daughter''s abduction during a video call, a former prosecutor races home from Spain, only to become the next target. Hunted by someone who thinks she saw too much, she must risk everything to stay alive... and save the one person she can''t live without.', 'After witnessing her daughter''s abduction during a video call, a former prosecutor races home from Spain, only to become the next target. Hunted by someone who thinks she saw too much, she must risk everything to stay alive... and save the one person she can''t live without.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsuceHraL2wJHssGDRxrEEYXNFEG.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-daughter-was-taken'),
  ('505104711277775867', 'My Daughter, My Angel', 2007, 'Crime', 'Alexis Durand-Brault, Yves Bélanger', 'Pierre Szalowski, Martin Girard', 'Michel Côté, Karine Vanasse, Dominique Leduc, Laurence Leboeuf, Christian Bégin, Serge Houde, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Alain Fournier', null, 'Nathalie Dagenais is a 19 year old girl studying to be a lawyer. New to the city of Montreal, she will soon discover the world of porn. One day, her father (Michel Côté) comes across her picture on the Internet and wants to find her and before she makes what he thinks is a mistake. The story goes from past to present, when a police officer investigates the death of Max, a man who Nathalie knew.', 'Nathalie Dagenais is a 19 year old girl studying to be a lawyer. New to the city of Montreal, she will soon discover the world of porn. One day, her father (Michel Côté) comes across her picture on the Internet and wants to find her and before she makes what he thinks is a mistake. The story goes from past to present, when a police officer investigates the death of Max, a man who Nathalie knew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJvlhFcK6JQaid25t1s2FC4GI0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17193'),
  ('1067277958480446916', 'My Daughter, the Socialist', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Takis Vougiouklakis, Dimos Sakelariou', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Aliki Vougiouklaki, Dimitris Papamichael, Labros Konstadaras, Stavros Xenidis, Nikitas Platis, Petros Lohaitis, Hronis Exarhakos, Aliki Zaverdinou', null, 'Liza falls in love with one of her father''s employees. Her socialistic ideas about employment drive her to collide with her father and the sociopolitical status of the time.', 'Liza falls in love with one of her father''s employees. Her socialistic ideas about employment drive her to collide with her father and the sociopolitical status of the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Wyr5LSh68VKGwpsIjlA9QVKhzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266549'),
  ('999859205705177122', 'My Daughter''s First Time', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Rossi, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Riccardo Rossi', 'Riccardo Rossi, Anna Foglietta, Fabrizia Sacchi, Stefano Fresi, Benedetta Gargari, Bettina Giovannini, Giampiero Mancini, Roberta Fiorentini', null, 'Panicked after finding out that his teenage daughter wants to lose her virginity, an overprotective father comes up with a plan to dissuade her.', 'Panicked after finding out that his teenage daughter wants to lose her virginity, an overprotective father comes up with a plan to dissuade her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMBzGyWnlVA8bqaXDHri8qzXOGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331116'),
