  ('845774959799068766', 'My Dear Desperado', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Kwang-sik, Go Rak-sun', 'Kim Kwang-sik, Hong Seo-yeong', 'Park Joong-hoon, Jung Yu-mi, Park Won-sang, Jeong Woo-hyuk, Jeong In-gi, Kwon Yul, Min Kyung-jin, Yang Eun-yong', null, 'Dong-chul, a thug who cannot fight but acts like a tough guy, meets Han Se-jin, his new neighbor. Dong-chul is intrigued by her spitfire personality, and the bickering duo realize they may be perfect for each other.', 'Dong-chul, a thug who cannot fight but acts like a tough guy, meets Han Se-jin, his new neighbor. Dong-chul is intrigued by her spitfire personality, and the bickering duo realize they may be perfect for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sJRTXrvXhYoWA7MhGnrbNeRvnqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43212'),
  ('48343217848494349', 'My Dear Dolly', 2026, null, 'A.Aravinth Raj, Balaji K Sekar, A Aravinth Raj', 'A.Aravinth Raj, A Aravinth Raj', 'Anupama, V.J. Pappu, Rajavelu, Sudha', null, 'Boss Karthik and subordinate Sumithra fake a marriage to satisfy family, planning to separate in six months. After a fight, she leaves permanently. Karthik copes with a mannequin of her, until Sumithra learns of his obsession.', 'Boss Karthik and subordinate Sumithra fake a marriage to satisfy family, planning to separate in six months. After a fight, she leaves permanently. Karthik copes with a mannequin of her, until Sumithra learns of his obsession.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzQ0YTE0YmEtNjJmZC00OTUzLTlhOTUtMjhmMjZlYjU1YzQ0XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-dear-dolly'),
  ('747083040209921761', 'My Dear Enemy', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Lee Yoon-ki, Choi Sang-ho', 'Lee Yoon-ki', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Ha Jung-woo, Kim Hye-ok, Oh Ji-eun, Choi Il-hwa, Ki Joo-bong, Jang So-yeon, Jo Si-nae', null, 'Hee-soo is desperate for money and finds her ex-boyfriend who owes her money. He goes around to various ex-girlfriends to get cash and she trails along to make sure he does not cheat her.', 'Hee-soo is desperate for money and finds her ex-boyfriend who owes her money. He goes around to various ex-girlfriends to get cash and she trails along to make sure he does not cheat her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J1iqxPen4K2mCmPzDjTA4rGc96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19482'),
  ('776254025287893587', 'My Dear Killer', 1972, 'Thriller, Mystery, Horror', 'Tonino Valerii, Manuel Rojas', 'Roberto Leoni, Franco Bucceri', 'George Hilton, Salvo Randone, William Berger, Marilù Tolo, Manuel Zarzo, Patty Shepard, Piero Lulli, Helga Liné', null, 'Following the mysterious decapitation of an insurance investigator, Police Inspector Peretti is put onto the case, but all the clues lead to an unsolved case of kidnapping and murder.', 'Following the mysterious decapitation of an insurance investigator, Police Inspector Peretti is put onto the case, but all the clues lead to an unsolved case of kidnapping and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rV4Wh0CAe226fAwXMRLbzZY7Upe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69579'),
  ('704627373973897088', 'My Dear Kuttichathan', 1984, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jijo Punnoose, Ashok Kumar Agarwal, T. K. Rajeev Kumar', 'Raghunath Paleri', 'M.P. Ramnath, Sonia Bose Venkat, Suresh, Arvind, Kottarakkara Sreedharan Nair, Dalip Tahil, Dominic Alummoodan, Jagathy Sreekumar', null, 'The story revolves around a mystical indigenous goblin called "Kuttichathan" who is under the spell of an evil sorcerer; however, it gets released by three children and then befriends them.', 'The story revolves around a mystical indigenous goblin called "Kuttichathan" who is under the spell of an evil sorcerer; however, it gets released by three children and then befriends them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r8s7MdmOtU79olhABBx4IsjnoVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284162'),
  ('943916779031331748', 'My Dear Liar', 2019, 'Drama', 'Rui Zhong, Shen Ao', 'Xu Luyang, Shen Ao', 'Dong Chengpeng, Liu Yan, Zhang Zixian, Li Ji, Peng Bo, Leng Haoze, Su Na, Xu Yukun', null, 'In order to treat his 6-year-old son suffering from asthma, Wu Hai''s friend Zhong Zhenjiang encourages him to get deliberately acquainted with Miaomiao. She is a network anchor who is also at the bottom and determined to brew a marriage scam with ulterior motives..', 'In order to treat his 6-year-old son suffering from asthma, Wu Hai''s friend Zhong Zhenjiang encourages him to get deliberately acquainted with Miaomiao. She is a network anchor who is also at the bottom and determined to brew a marriage scam with ulterior motives..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbo8WlZB9GKqZk9CsnGf0f1MQ6J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635425'),
  ('901750916516846527', 'My Dear Secretary', 1948, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Charles Martin, Joseph F. Biroc, Maurie M. Suess', 'Charles Martin', 'Laraine Day, Kirk Douglas, Keenan Wynn, Helen Walker, Rudy Vallee, Florence Bates, Alan Mowbray, Irene Ryan', 'NR', 'A budding young writer thinks it''s her lucky day when she is chosen to be the new secretary for Owen Waterbury, famous novelist. She is soon disppointed, however, when he turns out to be an erratic, immature playboy. Opposites attract, of course, but not without sub-plots that touch on competitiveness within marriage and responsibility.', 'A budding young writer thinks it''s her lucky day when she is chosen to be the new secretary for Owen Waterbury, famous novelist. She is soon disppointed, however, when he turns out to be an erratic, immature playboy. Opposites attract, of course, but not without sub-plots that touch on competitiveness within marriage and responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfwdZE4JQLgXbNfQmER25RY1Knv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18703'),
  ('875868766608223594', 'My Dearest Senorita', 1972, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jaime de Armiñán, Luis Cuadrado, José Luis Borau', 'José Luis Borau, Jaime de Armiñán', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Julieta Serrano, Antonio Ferrandis, Lola Gaos, Chus Lampreave, Enrique Ávila, Cristina Suriani, Ana Suriani', null, 'A woman living in a small town discovers after fifty years that she is actually a man. Will she change her sex and suffer the reaction of a narrow-minded society?', 'A woman living in a small town discovers after fifty years that she is actually a man. Will she change her sex and suffer the reaction of a narrow-minded society?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LkvQraMTioGvjJxHoyaI3KVVrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185417'),
  ('958475004545540881', 'My Dearly Beloved Detective', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Aurelius Jacinevicius, Aleksei Simonov', 'Arkadiy Khayt, Grigori Gorin', 'Valentin Gaft, Galina Shchepetnova, Yekaterina Vasilyeva, Aleksandr Kuznetsov, Vladimir Belousov, Vyacheslav Nevinnyy, Zhanri Lolashvili, Mikhail Danilov', null, 'The conceit is that Sherlock Holmes is, as in reality, a fictional creation of Arthur Conan Doyle, but that the place where his office would be is maintained by the brilliant detective Shirley Holmes, who both solves crimes and maintains a museum for people who think Sherlock Holmes is real -- accompanied by a phonograph playing music from the Livanov series which had not long ended. She is accompanied, as might be expected, by a woman Watson, and must fight off the affections of both a Scotland Yard inspector an a parody Latin lover from Spain.', 'The conceit is that Sherlock Holmes is, as in reality, a fictional creation of Arthur Conan Doyle, but that the place where his office would be is maintained by the brilliant detective Shirley Holmes, who both solves crimes and maintains a museum for people who think Sherlock Holmes is real -- accompanied by a phonograph playing music from the Livanov series which had not long ended. She is accompanied, as might be expected, by a woman Watson, and must fight off the affections of both a Scotland Yard inspector an a parody Latin lover from Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/recgwM0P7a6dohZlwNEF5R4SnsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143878'),
  ('415521752653936062', 'My Demon Lover', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Charlie Loventhal, Jacques Haitkin', 'Leslie Ray', 'Scott Valentine, Michele Little, Robert Trebor, Gina Gallego, Alan Fudge, Peewee Piemonte, Tasia Valenza, James Gleason', 'PG-13', 'Denny has yet again been left by her thug boyfriend Chip. It seems as if she is doomed to be stuck with awful guys, this time she has to choose between nerdy Charles and the strange Kaz, who turns into a monster when sexually aroused.', 'Denny has yet again been left by her thug boyfriend Chip. It seems as if she is doomed to be stuck with awful guys, this time she has to choose between nerdy Charles and the strange Kaz, who turns into a monster when sexually aroused.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKUZUfy8rnNTJYRysMG21lpK5oc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51521'),
  ('327840852737622344', 'My Dictator', 2014, 'Drama', 'Kim Sung-han, Lee Hae-jun, Kim Byung-seo', 'Lee Hae-jun, Baek Chul-hyun', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Park Hae-il, Yoon Je-moon, Lee Byung-joon, Ryu Hye-young, Jang So-yeon, Lee Kyoo-hyung, Park Min soo', null, 'Sung-geun is an untalented actor who makes a living playing minor roles. He happens to land on the role as Kim Il-sung, the former leader of North Korea, for the rehearsal of the South-North Korea Summit. Sung-geun becomes passionately immersed in his role, motivated by his son who looks up to him. However, the summit is not realized, and Sung-geun ends up lost in the delusion that he really is Kim Il-sung.', 'Sung-geun is an untalented actor who makes a living playing minor roles. He happens to land on the role as Kim Il-sung, the former leader of North Korea, for the rehearsal of the South-North Korea Summit. Sung-geun becomes passionately immersed in his role, motivated by his son who looks up to him. However, the summit is not realized, and Sung-geun ends up lost in the delusion that he really is Kim Il-sung.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTdK8BqPUfiIWuWFNieRhfVPFle.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303967'),
  ('384924341597860947', 'My Dinner with Andre', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Louis Malle, Jeri Sopanen, Norman Berns', 'Andre Gregory, Wallace Shawn', 'Andre Gregory, Wallace Shawn, Jean Lenauer, Roy Butler, Cindy Lou Adkins', 'PG', 'Two old friends meet for dinner; as one tells anecdotes detailing his experiences, the other notices their differing worldviews.', 'Two old friends meet for dinner; as one tells anecdotes detailing his experiences, the other notices their differing worldviews.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Dqga73kzWoitm9ML8lMzx1VK5O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25468'),
  ('498496895316866828', 'My Dinner with Hervé', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Sacha Gervasi, Maryse Alberti', 'Sean Macaulay, Sacha Gervasi', 'Jamie Dornan, Peter Dinklage, Mireille Enos, Oona Chaplin, Harriet Walter, Jim Sturgeon, Andy Garcia, Helena Mattsson', null, 'An unlikely friendship evolves over one wild night in LA between a struggling journalist and actor Hervé Villechaize, the world''s most famous gun-toting dwarf, resulting in life-changing consequences for both.', 'An unlikely friendship evolves over one wild night in LA between a struggling journalist and actor Hervé Villechaize, the world''s most famous gun-toting dwarf, resulting in life-changing consequences for both.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sb7Pr5mS4l37gWOWcwVaFNclhZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463158'),
  ('718331525384481158', 'My Dog Skip', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Jay Russell, James L. Carter, Chris Stoia', 'Gail Gilchriest', 'Frankie Muniz, Diane Lane, Kevin Bacon, Caitlin Wachs, Harry Connick Jr., Luke Wilson, Bradley Coryell, Daylan Honeycutt', 'PG', 'A shy boy is unable to make friends in Yazoo City, Mississippi in 1942, until his parents give him a terrier puppy for his ninth birthday. The dog, which he names Skip, becomes well known and loved throughout the community and enriches the life of the boy, Willie, as he grows into manhood. Based on the best-selling Mississippi memoir by the late Willie Morris.', 'A shy boy is unable to make friends in Yazoo City, Mississippi in 1942, until his parents give him a terrier puppy for his ninth birthday. The dog, which he names Skip, becomes well known and loved throughout the community and enriches the life of the boy, Willie, as he grows into manhood. Based on the best-selling Mississippi memoir by the late Willie Morris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnPv7RuSn6UaPjZussIFljZdWS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17908'),
  ('951130489991721058', 'My Dog Stupid', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Rémy Chevrin, Yvan Attal', 'Yaël Langmann, Dean Craig, Yvan Attal', 'Yvan Attal, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Eric Ruf, Pascale Arbillot, Ben Attal, Adèle Wismes, Pablo Venzal, Panayotis Pascot', null, 'Henri is a middle-aged writer with fading inspiration who has published nothing worthy of note in years. Feeling increasingly misunderstood by his wife and four grown up deadbeat kids, he dreams of running away to start over again. Yet when he discovers an unattractive, bad-mannered dog in his garden, he decides to adopt him and both start developing an unexpected friendship that inevitably upsets Henri’s family and neighbors.', 'Henri is a middle-aged writer with fading inspiration who has published nothing worthy of note in years. Feeling increasingly misunderstood by his wife and four grown up deadbeat kids, he dreams of running away to start over again. Yet when he discovers an unattractive, bad-mannered dog in his garden, he decides to adopt him and both start developing an unexpected friendship that inevitably upsets Henri’s family and neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bObDrMrpJz6rVbM1vk21QkEvOPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536506'),
  ('679171652258236763', 'My Dog, the Thief', 1969, 'Family, Comedy', 'Robert Stevenson, Christopher Hibler, William E. Snyder', 'Myles Wilder, William Raynor', 'Dwayne Hickman, Mary Ann Mobley, Elsa Lanchester, Joe Flynn, John van Dreelen, Mickey Shaughnessy, Roger C. Carmel, Vaughn Taylor', 'G', 'As ratings for Jack Crandall''s lifeless airborne traffic reports plummet, a super-size St. Bernard on the lam stows away in his chopper. Crandall''s new co-pilot helps send ratings sky-high, but the canine''s chronic kleptomania generates girl trouble, jewel thievery, and loads of laughs.', 'As ratings for Jack Crandall''s lifeless airborne traffic reports plummet, a super-size St. Bernard on the lam stows away in his chopper. Crandall''s new co-pilot helps send ratings sky-high, but the canine''s chronic kleptomania generates girl trouble, jewel thievery, and loads of laughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gaReUSZ4F2VM56agHfzqETFnY25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64277'),
  ('146721254150338365', 'My Donkey, My Lover & I', 2020, 'Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Caroline Vignal, Nicolas Cambois, Simon Beaufils', 'Caroline Vignal', 'Laure Calamy, Benjamin Lavernhe, Olivia Côte, Marc Fraize, Jean-Pierre Martins, Louise Vidal, Lucía Sánchez, Maxence Tual', null, 'Antoinette, a school teacher, is looking forward to her long planned summer holidays with her secret lover Vladimir, the father of one of her pupils. When learning that Vladimir cannot come because his wife organized a surprise trekking holiday in the Cévennes National Park with their daughter and a donkey to carry their load, Antoinette decides to follow their track, by herself, with Patrick, a protective donkey.', 'Antoinette, a school teacher, is looking forward to her long planned summer holidays with her secret lover Vladimir, the father of one of her pupils. When learning that Vladimir cannot come because his wife organized a surprise trekking holiday in the Cévennes National Park with their daughter and a donkey to carry their load, Antoinette decides to follow their track, by herself, with Patrick, a protective donkey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSb2pe2GwI42K56UfsCRC7zbZof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669664'),
  ('702124118520880376', 'My Dream Is Yours', 1949, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Friz Freleng, Ernest Haller', 'Dane Lussier, Harry Kurnitz', 'Jack Carson, Doris Day, Lee Bowman, Adolphe Menjou, Eve Arden, S.Z. Sakall, Selena Royle, Edgar Kennedy', 'NR', 'Conceited singer Garry Mitchell refuses to renew his radio contract, so agent Doug Blake decides to find a new personality to replace him. In New York, he finds Martha Gibson, a single mother with a great voice. He arranges for her to move to Hollywood, but then has a problem trying to sell her to the show''s sponsor. Doug tries every trick he can think of to make Martha a star, and as the two work more closely, he falls in love with her. Complicating matters further, Martha meets and becomes attracted to Garry.', 'Conceited singer Garry Mitchell refuses to renew his radio contract, so agent Doug Blake decides to find a new personality to replace him. In New York, he finds Martha Gibson, a single mother with a great voice. He arranges for her to move to Hollywood, but then has a problem trying to sell her to the show''s sponsor. Doug tries every trick he can think of to make Martha a star, and as the two work more closely, he falls in love with her. Complicating matters further, Martha meets and becomes attracted to Garry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mj0Fzma5Bfn1XzBaKwPN00ACbXO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24040'),
  ('220599920650738964', 'My Dreams, My Love, and You', 1987, 'Fantasy, Romance, Drama', 'Atıf Yılmaz', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Türkan Şoray, Oğuz Tunç, Müşfik Kenter, Engin İnal, Fatoş Sezer, Elif Yücesan, Cihat Tamer, Tuncay Akça', null, 'Coşkun has been in love with the famous star Derya Altınay since his childhood. So much so that the fictional melodrama film heroines, who have opposite characters, have infiltrated the young man’s life. Coşkun has the opportunity to meet Derya; he pens an imaginary love story with her in mind. This script is eventually made into a film, and Derya plays the lead role, but the resulting film is far from his expectations.', 'Coşkun has been in love with the famous star Derya Altınay since his childhood. So much so that the fictional melodrama film heroines, who have opposite characters, have infiltrated the young man’s life. Coşkun has the opportunity to meet Derya; he pens an imaginary love story with her in mind. This script is eventually made into a film, and Derya plays the lead role, but the resulting film is far from his expectations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjNd9kr0Sm248uwrNQQxjbeYQrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330756'),
  ('236817265796076538', 'My Emptiness and I', 2022, 'Drama', 'Adrián Silvestre, Laura Herrero Garvín', 'Adrián Silvestre, Raphaëlle Perez, Carlos Marques-Marcet', 'Raphaëlle Perez, Alberto Díaz, Marc Ribera, Isabel Rocatti, Carlos Fernández Guía, Carmen Moreno, Sergio Reverón', null, 'Raphi, from France, fantasises about romances with princes, and about starting a traditional family. But in reality, things aren’t like that. She works in a call centre in Barcelona, struggles with at times embarrassing dates, and is diagnosed by her therapist as having gender dysphoria. During this confusing, yet valuable period, we follow this trans woman as she makes her transition, as well as in her everyday life. She talks candidly with colleagues, queer friends, and the men she meets through apps. In spite of all the advice she receives, it turns out that it is mostly time and experience that will help her embrace her place in this world.', 'Raphi, from France, fantasises about romances with princes, and about starting a traditional family. But in reality, things aren’t like that. She works in a call centre in Barcelona, struggles with at times embarrassing dates, and is diagnosed by her therapist as having gender dysphoria. During this confusing, yet valuable period, we follow this trans woman as she makes her transition, as well as in her everyday life. She talks candidly with colleagues, queer friends, and the men she meets through apps. In spite of all the advice she receives, it turns out that it is mostly time and experience that will help her embrace her place in this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvLjZ3YC2Yte45J0TWRMLFAVph8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924125'),
  ('138148403342528445', 'My Everything', 2024, 'Drama', 'Nader Chalhoub, Anne-Sophie Bailly, Sandie Galan Perez', 'Anne-Sophie Bailly', 'Laure Calamy, Charles Peccia-Galletto, Geert Van Rampelberg, Julie Froger, Véronique Vanonckelen, Romane Parc, Madison Maire, Elizabeth Dutreilh', null, 'Mona lives with her adult son, Joël, who is "slow," as they say. He works in a specialized facility and is passionately in love with his coworker, Océane, who is also disabled. While Mona knows nothing of their relationship, she eventually learns that Océane is pregnant, and the symbiotic bond between mother and son falters.', 'Mona lives with her adult son, Joël, who is "slow," as they say. He works in a specialized facility and is passionately in love with his coworker, Océane, who is also disabled. While Mona knows nothing of their relationship, she eventually learns that Océane is pregnant, and the symbiotic bond between mother and son falters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dRlQIDKaLJUiGaej6u8asad8Id.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032765'),
  ('880664239209898475', 'My Fair Lady', 1964, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Cukor, Harry Stradling Sr., David S. Hall', 'Alan Jay Lerner', 'Audrey Hepburn, Rex Harrison, Stanley Holloway, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Gladys Cooper, Jeremy Brett, Theodore Bikel, Mona Washbourne', 'G', 'A snobbish phonetics professor agrees to a wager that he can take a flower girl and make her presentable in high society.', 'A snobbish phonetics professor agrees to a wager that he can take a flower girl and make her presentable in high society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTXVc29lGSNclf94VIZ49W4gGKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11113'),
  ('486357778134291868', 'My Fair Son', 2007, 'Drama', 'Zi''en Cui, Jin Yang', 'Zi''en Cui', 'Apollo Yu, Wang Guifeng, Weiming Wang, Wang Junrui, Li Ziqiang', null, 'When young art student Ray moves in with his estranged businessman father after years of separation, the two tentatively begin to reconcile their many differences -- including Ray''s revelation that he''s gay, which his father struggles to accept.', 'When young art student Ray moves in with his estranged businessman father after years of separation, the two tentatively begin to reconcile their many differences -- including Ray''s revelation that he''s gay, which his father struggles to accept.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/842xq3wHwrw0YByE1C7EVlvBFhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255967'),
  ('995482689766344876', 'My Fairy Troublemaker', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Caroline Origer', 'Pamela Hickey, Dennys McCoy', 'Jella Haase, Lisa-Marie Koroll, Mary Murray, Tim Grobe, Stephan Benson, Julian Mau, Justin Daniels Anene, Alex Avenell', null, 'Violetta (337), a curious and cheeky fairy, gets lost in the human world. To find her way back to the fairy world, she teams up with the human girl Maxie (12) and discovers her true destiny.', 'Violetta (337), a curious and cheeky fairy, gets lost in the human world. To find her way back to the fairy world, she teams up with the human girl Maxie (12) and discovers her true destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXsCtzppdU1SUvTtxznJyi9hiXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681303'),
  ('997324253854863686', 'My Fake Boyfriend', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rose Troche, Stephen Chandler Whitehead', 'Luke Albright, Joe Wanjai Ross', 'Keiynan Lonsdale, Dylan Sprouse, Samer Salem, Marcus Rosner, Karen Robinson, Sarah Hyland, Rachel Risen, Dean McDermott', 'R', 'A young man in a tricky situation follows the advice of his unconventional best friend and uses social media to create a fake boyfriend to keep his awful ex-lover out of his life. But everything backfires when he meets the real love of his life, and breaking up with his fake boyfriend proves hard to do.', 'A young man in a tricky situation follows the advice of his unconventional best friend and uses social media to create a fake boyfriend to keep his awful ex-lover out of his life. But everything backfires when he meets the real love of his life, and breaking up with his fake boyfriend proves hard to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7l9qEWdSzki33Q3SKD1d5uvJBEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:908762'),
