  ('1026134827397881832', 'My Fat Arse and I', 2020, 'Animation', 'Yelyzaveta Pysmak, Yelyzaveta Pysmak', 'Yelyzaveta Pysmak', 'Yelyzaveta Pysmak, Anna Dłużniewska, Zuzanna Stach, Julia Benedyktowicz', null, 'One morning, a girl tries on a pair of new pants, but they won’t zip up. In the mirror she sees herself as the fattest piglet the world has ever seen. To change this, she decides to go on a strict diet. Hunger quickly turns her into a kind of zombie, stumbling blindly to the fridge that seems to haunt her at night. In one of those moments, the Angel of the United Bitches of Slimbuttlandia appears, carrying a royal invitation to visit the kingdom and take part in a mysterious royal ceremony.', 'One morning, a girl tries on a pair of new pants, but they won’t zip up. In the mirror she sees herself as the fattest piglet the world has ever seen. To change this, she decides to go on a strict diet. Hunger quickly turns her into a kind of zombie, stumbling blindly to the fridge that seems to haunt her at night. In one of those moments, the Angel of the United Bitches of Slimbuttlandia appears, carrying a royal invitation to visit the kingdom and take part in a mysterious royal ceremony.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaGrOBWYsiA5JczJUPuTxWTTXXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741770'),
  ('576390215589045369', 'My Father and My Son', 2005, 'Drama', 'Çağan Irmak, Yelkan Iskorkutan, Ugur Aygan', 'Çağan Irmak', 'Fikret Kuşkan, Ege Tanman, Çetin Tekindor, Hümeyra, Şerif Sezer, Yetkin Dikinciler, Binnur Kaya, Mahmut Gökgöz', null, 'A left-wing journalist whose wife died while giving birth to his son during a military coup returns to his family''s farm. Estranged from his father for turning his back on the family and wasting his life with political activism instead, he tries to reconnect with him so that his son will have a place to live as his health is deteriorating due to the extensive torture he had to endure.', 'A left-wing journalist whose wife died while giving birth to his son during a military coup returns to his family''s farm. Estranged from his father for turning his back on the family and wasting his life with political activism instead, he tries to reconnect with him so that his son will have a place to live as his health is deteriorating due to the extensive torture he had to endure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ephCcqJYZFUnkQC7Oudah2qUL6O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13393'),
