  ('63694894987201478', 'My Father''s Dragon', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Mark Mullery, Giovanna Ferrari, Fabian Erlinghäuser', 'Meg LeFauve', 'Jacob Tremblay, Golshifteh Farahani, Gaten Matarazzo, Dianne Wiest, Rita Moreno, Chris O''Dowd, Judy Greer, Alan Cumming', 'PG', 'Struggling to cope after a move to the city with his mother, Elmer runs away in search of Wild Island and a young dragon who waits to be rescued. Elmer’s adventures introduce him to ferocious beasts, a mysterious island and the friendship of a lifetime.', 'Struggling to cope after a move to the city with his mother, Elmer runs away in search of Wild Island and a young dragon who waits to be rescued. Elmer’s adventures introduce him to ferocious beasts, a mysterious island and the friendship of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hgEe1w0An5fKi3ZqIUBwOyIN2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560052'),
  ('991011676764640280', 'My Father''s Glory', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Yves Robert, Robert Alazraki, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Louis Nucéra, Yves Robert', 'Philippe Caubère, Nathalie Roussel, Didier Pain, Thérèse Liotard, Julien Ciamaca, Victorien Delamare, Joris Molinas, Benoit Martin', 'G', 'Raised by his science teacher father, Joseph Pagnol, and seamstress mother Augustine, young Marcel grows up during the turn of the century in awe of his rationalist dad. When the family takes a summer vacation in the countryside, Marcel becomes friends with Lili, who teaches him about rural life.', 'Raised by his science teacher father, Joseph Pagnol, and seamstress mother Augustine, young Marcel grows up during the turn of the century in awe of his rationalist dad. When the family takes a summer vacation in the countryside, Marcel becomes friends with Lili, who teaches him about rural life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zwgcaKqIJ5GB6kCPpyMLZuNyoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12716'),
  ('868094476747403681', 'My Father''s Guests', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Anne Le Ny', null, 'Fabrice Luchini, Karin Viard, Michel Aumont, Valérie Benguigui, Véronica Novak, Olivier Rabourdin, Raphaël Personnaz, Anne Le Ny', null, 'A human-rights activist takes in an illegal immigrant and her daughter, then shocks his family when they learn that he has married the sexy 28-year-old.', 'A human-rights activist takes in an illegal immigrant and her daughter, then shocks his family when they learn that he has married the sexy 28-year-old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaxTj7sPBaEC1m0BjCySphwg5Or.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56424'),
  ('247323662785363023', 'My Father''s Mexican Wedding', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alfonso Albacete', 'Alfonso Albacete', 'Miren Ibarguren, Ginés García Millán, Pol Monen, Eduardo Casanova, La Terremoto de Alcorcón, Christian Vazquez, Diana Bovio, Maribel Guardia', null, 'Ana, a young Spanish woman who has just been dumped by her boyfriend, and her brother Tono, receive a call from their father to tell him that he is getting married in Mexico to a woman he met on the Internet. When they get there, they discover that the girl is 30 years younger than her father and they begin to live with her new in-laws, with the inevitable cultural clashes that this will entail.', 'Ana, a young Spanish woman who has just been dumped by her boyfriend, and her brother Tono, receive a call from their father to tell him that he is getting married in Mexico to a woman he met on the Internet. When they get there, they discover that the girl is 30 years younger than her father and they begin to live with her new in-laws, with the inevitable cultural clashes that this will entail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yrgAKpM4IdYpBMJxdnIcUVm0Cp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809363'),
  ('168709331002164598', 'My Father''s Private Secretary', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Laurenti, Pasquale Rachini, Filiberto Fiaschi', 'Francesco Milizia', 'Maria Rosaria Omaggio, Renzo Montagnani, Stefano Patrizi, Alvaro Vitali, Anita Strindberg, Aldo Massasso, Giuliana Calandra, Enzo Cannavale', null, 'Ponziani Armando, the owner of a thriving chemical industry, lives in a beautiful villa on Lake Como with his wife and his son Franco Ersilia.', 'Ponziani Armando, the owner of a thriving chemical industry, lives in a beautiful villa on Lake Como with his wife and his son Franco Ersilia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLmho8dybgeJ6lpHuF0qKTDEuMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66075'),
  ('149700222367522253', 'My Father''s Scent', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mohamed Siam, Omar Abou Doma', 'Mohamed Siam, Ahmad Amer', 'Ahmed Malek, Kamel El Basha, Mayan ElSayed, Donia Maher, Abed Anany', null, 'A tense night where father and son are forced to sit with their memories, grievances and their idea of one another in a desperate attempt to settle their scores and a trial to mend what time has broken.', 'A tense night where father and son are forced to sit with their memories, grievances and their idea of one another in a desperate attempt to settle their scores and a trial to mend what time has broken.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FskBYIpsHv2b1czSrcvZs7JrQkun.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-fathers-scent-2026'),
  ('582013287455180794', 'My Father''s Secrets', 2022, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Véra Belmont', 'Véra Belmont, Valerie Zenatti', 'Michèle Bernier, Jacques Gamblin, Arthur Dupont, Esteban Oertli, Gabin Guenoun, Ilan Galkoff', null, 'Brussels, Belgium, 1959. Michel and Charly Kichka, two Jewish brothers, enjoy a happy childhood with their parents and their two sisters. Henri, their discreet and usually silent father, does not speak at all about his past, so they imagine that as a young man he was an adventurer, a pirate or a treasure hunter.', 'Brussels, Belgium, 1959. Michel and Charly Kichka, two Jewish brothers, enjoy a happy childhood with their parents and their two sisters. Henri, their discreet and usually silent father, does not speak at all about his past, so they imagine that as a young man he was an adventurer, a pirate or a treasure hunter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8z2o548WZzUTCWThVq34HKKEiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947549'),
  ('377819557448731487', 'My Father''s Stories', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Pierre Milon', 'Murielle Magellan, Sorj Chalandon, Jean-Pierre Améris', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Audrey Dana, Jules Lefebvre, Tom Levy, Nicolas Bridet, Martine Schambacher, Jean-Michel Molé, Blandine Costaz', null, 'Lyon, 1960s. Emile is twelve years old. His father is a hero. He says he is a judo champ, a parachutist, a soccer player and even a personal advisor to General de Gaulle. Now he wants to save French Algeria! Fascinated and proud, Emile willingly follows his father in missions of utmost danger: tailing, spying, delivering top-secret letters. Emile carries out his orders in all seriousness. He even recruits Luca, a new classmate, into his secret combat. But what if the father’s exploits were all phony, and far too dangerous for children?', 'Lyon, 1960s. Emile is twelve years old. His father is a hero. He says he is a judo champ, a parachutist, a soccer player and even a personal advisor to General de Gaulle. Now he wants to save French Algeria! Fascinated and proud, Emile willingly follows his father in missions of utmost danger: tailing, spying, delivering top-secret letters. Emile carries out his orders in all seriousness. He even recruits Luca, a new classmate, into his secret combat. But what if the father’s exploits were all phony, and far too dangerous for children?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNddN6PgjDHnj38hkrw9wbj1GCZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749087'),
  ('145999931500785737', 'My Father''s Wings', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kıvanç Sezer, Jörg Gruber', null, 'Menderes Samancılar, Musab Ekici, Kübra Kip, Tansel Öngel, Mustafa Kirantepe, Sarp Aydınoğlu, Kerem Karaboğa, Güllü Özalp Ulusoy', null, 'Set against the backdrop of construction activity promising to fill in the empty spaces of the urban landscape with entirely new neighborhoods, a story unfolds of an aging construction worker who, unlike his peers, has to drop all plans for the future after being diagnosed with a malignant tumor. This self-assured debut contemplates the dignity of the individual within the context of modern Turkish society.', 'Set against the backdrop of construction activity promising to fill in the empty spaces of the urban landscape with entirely new neighborhoods, a story unfolds of an aging construction worker who, unlike his peers, has to drop all plans for the future after being diagnosed with a malignant tumor. This self-assured debut contemplates the dignity of the individual within the context of modern Turkish society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jam6ORO6UfADG0HtCGutgHJPTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412672'),
  ('918202616432265518', 'My Fault', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Domingo González, Hermes Marco, Eneko Botana', 'Domingo González', 'Nicole Wallace, Gabriel Guevara, Marta Hazas, Iván Sánchez, Eva Ruiz, Víctor Varona, Fran Berenguer, Adriana Ubani', 'NR', 'Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister''s mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.', 'Noah must leave her city, boyfriend, and friends to move into William Leister''s mansion, the flashy and wealthy husband of her mother Rafaela. As a proud and independent 17 year old, Noah resists living in a mansion surrounded by luxury. However, it is there where she meets Nick, her new stepbrother, and the clash of their strong personalities becomes evident from the very beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w46Vw536HwNnEzOa7J24YH9DPRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1010581'),
  ('246679331089139529', 'My Fault: London', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dani Girdwood, Charlotte Fassler, Ed Moore', 'Domingo González', 'Asha Banks, Matthew Broome, Eve Macklin, Ray Fearon, Enva Lewis, Jason Flemyng, Kerim Hassan, Sam Buchanan', 'PG-13', '18-year-old Noah moves from America to London, with her mother who''s recently fallen in love with William, a wealthy British businessman. Noah meets William’s son, bad-boy Nick, and soon discovers there is an attraction between them neither can avoid. As Noah spends the summer adjusting to her new life, her devastating past will catch up with her while falling in love for the first time.', '18-year-old Noah moves from America to London, with her mother who''s recently fallen in love with William, a wealthy British businessman. Noah meets William’s son, bad-boy Nick, and soon discovers there is an attraction between them neither can avoid. As Noah spends the summer adjusting to her new life, her devastating past will catch up with her while falling in love for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttN5D6GKOwKWHmCzDGctAvaNMAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294203'),
  ('971790845713009317', 'My Favorite Blonde', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Sidney Lanfield, William C. Mellor', 'Frank Butler, Don Hartman', 'Bob Hope, Madeleine Carroll, Gale Sondergaard, George Zucco, Lionel Royce, Walter Kingsford, Victor Varconi, Otto Reichow', null, 'Larry Haines, a mediocre vaudeville entertainer, boards a train for Los Angeles. Aboard, he meets an attractive, blonde British agent carrying a coded message hidden in a brooch—and is being pursued by Nazi agents.', 'Larry Haines, a mediocre vaudeville entertainer, boards a train for Los Angeles. Aboard, he meets an attractive, blonde British agent carrying a coded message hidden in a brooch—and is being pursued by Nazi agents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pnEnkJO2N5nzfD0SxuqhSSRN3u8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97648'),
  ('1085397751487436925', 'My Favorite Brunette', 1947, 'Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'Mel Epstein, Lionel Lindon, Elliott Nugent', 'Bob Hope', 'Bob Hope, Dorothy Lamour, Peter Lorre, Lon Chaney Jr., John Hoyt, Charles Dingle, Reginald Denny, Frank Puglia', 'NR', 'Ronnie Jackson is a lowly baby photographer who secretly fantasizes about being a private detective. When a lovely baroness actually mistakes him for one and asks him to help locate her missing husband, Baron Montay, Ronnie finds himself agreeing. Several days later he is on death row whiling away the hours until his execution by recounting to a group of reporters the bizarre tale of how he ended up there.', 'Ronnie Jackson is a lowly baby photographer who secretly fantasizes about being a private detective. When a lovely baroness actually mistakes him for one and asks him to help locate her missing husband, Baron Montay, Ronnie finds himself agreeing. Several days later he is on death row whiling away the hours until his execution by recounting to a group of reporters the bizarre tale of how he ended up there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTI4QFLQirmIw6YLR5kRAKyDKvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18649'),
  ('411831539553384570', 'My Favorite Christmas Tree', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jason Bourque', 'Shannon Latimer', 'Emma Johnson, Giles Panton, Marnie Mahannah, Roark Critchlow, Lucas Penner, Harrison Coe, Laura Yenga, Melanie Walden', 'G', 'Kyla is a skilled genealogy researcher who’s made a thriving business of putting together family trees. When she comes across new information regarding her mother’s mysterious extended family, she and her sister travel to the charming town of Conifer, hoping to piece together their ancestry. The search leads Kyla to a generations-old Christmas tree farm, its stubborn but handsome owner… and, possibly, love.', 'Kyla is a skilled genealogy researcher who’s made a thriving business of putting together family trees. When she comes across new information regarding her mother’s mysterious extended family, she and her sister travel to the charming town of Conifer, hoping to piece together their ancestry. The search leads Kyla to a generations-old Christmas tree farm, its stubborn but handsome owner… and, possibly, love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhbdyKdFNWJv0MPWsq1kFTQXQ4b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971464'),
  ('148527770557825205', 'My Favorite Duck', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky tries to relax on a hunting and fishing trip, but Daffy, smugly pointing out the "No Duck Hunting" signs, subjects him to constant irritation. Then the "Duck Hunting Season Open" signs start going up.', 'Porky tries to relax on a hunting and fishing trip, but Daffy, smugly pointing out the "No Duck Hunting" signs, subjects him to constant irritation. Then the "Duck Hunting Season Open" signs start going up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1NbDBV9N0L6zoNigNu1NXpJNfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205139'),
