  ('738099899538277027', 'My First 40 Years', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Enrico Vanzina, Marina Ripa di Meana, Carlo Vanzina', 'Carol Alt, Elliott Gould, Jean Rochefort, Pierre Cosso, Capucine, Teo Teocoli, Isabel Russinova, Riccardo Garrone', null, 'Marina is a woman who never says no...to men, money and fame! Determined to climb the social ladder, she works her way up from a marriage of a millionaire prince. At last, she''s living the life of wealth and glamour she''s always dreamed of. Then Love comes along and ruins everything! A starving artist steals her heart and seduces her away to his bohemian world. Will Marina manage to stay happy living a lifestyle out of the fast lane?', 'Marina is a woman who never says no...to men, money and fame! Determined to climb the social ladder, she works her way up from a marriage of a millionaire prince. At last, she''s living the life of wealth and glamour she''s always dreamed of. Then Love comes along and ruins everything! A starving artist steals her heart and seduces her away to his bohemian world. Will Marina manage to stay happy living a lifestyle out of the fast lane?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qr7uVv6HYuvWBsU7UfMmWdKYMy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239416'),
