  ('464517381496499106', 'My First Love', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mari Storstein, Tomas Myklebost', 'Mari Storstein, Tomas Myklebost', 'Marie Flaatten, Niels Halstensen Skåber, Silje Breivik, Jan Gunnar Røise, Haakon Johannes Kjølberg Hauge', null, 'When Ella, who has lived her whole life in a wheelchair, moves to study, she doesn''t get her own dorm room, but is instead placed in an institution. This happens at the same time that she meets her first love. A story based on true events.', 'When Ella, who has lived her whole life in a wheelchair, moves to study, she doesn''t get her own dorm room, but is instead placed in an institution. This happens at the same time that she meets her first love. A story based on true events.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FUNqNhASruqWJ1kfYeeDNAEKbQ6.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-first-love-2026'),
  ('1103639244770088881', 'My First Mister', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Christine Lahti, Jeffrey Jur', 'Jill Franklyn', 'Albert Brooks, Leelee Sobieski, Desmond Harrington, Carol Kane, Mary Kay Place, Michael McKean, Rutanya Alda, Natasha Braisewell', 'R', 'Leelee Sobieski is brash, abrasive and vulnerable as a teenage child of divorce who hides her pain behind a mask of hard-edged gothic rebellion. Albert Brooks plays a man who is her total opposite, a precise and well-ordered menswear store owner of forty-nine who manages limited expectations and protects lonely secrets with pleasant ritual and quiet, ironic reserve. These two total opposites collide in conflict then come together in a surprising alliance, changing each other''s lives forever.', 'Leelee Sobieski is brash, abrasive and vulnerable as a teenage child of divorce who hides her pain behind a mask of hard-edged gothic rebellion. Albert Brooks plays a man who is her total opposite, a precise and well-ordered menswear store owner of forty-nine who manages limited expectations and protects lonely secrets with pleasant ritual and quiet, ironic reserve. These two total opposites collide in conflict then come together in a surprising alliance, changing each other''s lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xP2JKtdq77aWWZ1LCGsR68co5Jw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25641'),
  ('748033020289014594', 'My First Suit', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Stewart Main', 'Peter Wells', 'Conrad Crawte, Heather Lindsay, Martyn Sanderson, Terry Bacon, David Telford, Don Kjestrup, Heather Pitt, Peter England', null, '14-year old Steve is caught between creatures he does not fully understand: two parents with very different ideas about the suit he should wear to his first school dance. Meanwhile everywhere he seems to look, images of men are taking control of his imagination. In Stewart Main''s comical coming of age story Steve escapes his parents'' good wishes, to discover his true desires. They aren''t quite what his no-nonsense father had in mind.', '14-year old Steve is caught between creatures he does not fully understand: two parents with very different ideas about the suit he should wear to his first school dance. Meanwhile everywhere he seems to look, images of men are taking control of his imagination. In Stewart Main''s comical coming of age story Steve escapes his parents'' good wishes, to discover his true desires. They aren''t quite what his no-nonsense father had in mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vm9OMMCLe0QL45VRgLCrsXE9X3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472884'),
  ('166067147801978849', 'My First Summer', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Katie Found, Matthew Chuang, Thuy Vy', 'Katie Found', 'Markella Kavenagh, Maiah Stewardson, Edwina Wren, Harvey Zielinski, Steve Mouzakis, Arthur Angel, Katherine Tonkin', null, 'Isolated on a remote property, 16-year-old Claudia finds her world transformed when a spirited girl named Grace wanders into her garden.', 'Isolated on a remote property, 16-year-old Claudia finds her world transformed when a spirited girl named Grace wanders into her garden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GBMVO09clB7HUgfqbjZmOVAPOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741011'),
