  ('260420054503336816', 'My Friend An Delie', 2026, 'Drama', 'Dong Zijian', 'Weizhong Zhang, Dong Zijian', 'Liu Haoran, Dong Zijian, Yin Tao', null, 'Li Mo and Andre, who have different personalities, became close friends because of football, an accident caused Andre to disappear from Li Mo''s memory along with his youth. Years later, Li Mo "meet" Andre on his way to father''s funeral.', 'Li Mo and Andre, who have different personalities, became close friends because of football, an accident caused Andre to disappear from Li Mo''s memory along with his youth. Years later, Li Mo "meet" Andre on his way to father''s funeral.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqDSV1sDGCsBZjhs8EucZqIrw4TO.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-friend-an-delie'),
  ('817855647219581593', 'My Friend Barry', 2026, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Markus Welter, Marco Barberi', 'Jan Poldervaart', 'Dani Mangisch, Christoph Gaugler, Yousef Sweid, Paco von Wyss, Alma Büchenbacher', null, 'Late 18th century: In the midst of the picturesque but unforgiving Swiss mountains, 12-year-old Georg finds himself stranded with the monks on the Great St. Bernard Pass. His new life consists of cold, loneliness, and work—until he rescues a puppy from starvation.', 'Late 18th century: In the midst of the picturesque but unforgiving Swiss mountains, 12-year-old Georg finds himself stranded with the monks on the Great St. Bernard Pass. His new life consists of cold, loneliness, and work—until he rescues a puppy from starvation.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2rOU8dLLguCwQ70xO9EtGUAo9EG.jpg', 'plex:movie:barry-and-me'),
  ('786236147639811252', 'My Friend Dahmer', 2017, 'History, Drama, Crime', 'Marc Meyers, Daniel Katz, Andrew Shepherd', 'Marc Meyers', 'Ross Lynch, Alex Wolff, Anne Heche, Dallas Roberts, Liam Koeth, Nancy Telzerow, Tommy Nelson, Harrison Holzer', 'R', 'Jeffrey Dahmer struggles with a difficult family life as a young boy. During his teenage years he slowly transforms, edging closer to the serial killer he was to become.', 'Jeffrey Dahmer struggles with a difficult family life as a young boy. During his teenage years he slowly transforms, edging closer to the serial killer he was to become.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6HoPIBcRv9l2tPB8hbivq71Nw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445040'),
  ('431698956136807313', 'My Friend Eva', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Cesc Gay, Andreu Rebés, Daniela Forn', 'Cesc Gay, Eduard Sola', 'Nora Navas, Rodrigo de la Serna, Juan Diego Botto, Àgata Roca, Fernanda Orazi, Francesco Carril, Marian Álvarez, Miki Esparbé', null, 'Eva has just turned 50. She’s been married for over 20 years and has two, teenage children. So far, nothing remarkable. But on a business trip to Rome something happens that turns her life upside down. She meets Alex, a scriptwriter who’s spending a few days in the Italian city. The instant attraction she feels for him, the butterflies in her tummy, the seductive hint of possibility… After all this time, she remembers what it feels like to fall in love and it shifts something inside of her. It reignites a fire that had long been extinguished.', 'Eva has just turned 50. She’s been married for over 20 years and has two, teenage children. So far, nothing remarkable. But on a business trip to Rome something happens that turns her life upside down. She meets Alex, a scriptwriter who’s spending a few days in the Italian city. The instant attraction she feels for him, the butterflies in her tummy, the seductive hint of possibility… After all this time, she remembers what it feels like to fall in love and it shifts something inside of her. It reignites a fire that had long been extinguished.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bQtzFJoLelplIgfIe2i37JGGls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1297953'),
  ('614091767382425832', 'My Friend Flicka', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family, Western', 'Harold D. Schuster', 'Lillie Hayward', 'Roddy McDowall, Preston Foster, Rita Johnson, James Bell, Patti Hale, Jeff Corey, Arthur Loft', 'NR', 'Ken McLaughlin is a precocious 10-year-old who lives with his family on a remote Wyoming ranch. When Ken returns home from school with failing grades, his father, Rob, blames the boy''s lack of personal responsibility. At the suggestion of his wife, Nell, Rob allows Ken to choose a single colt from the herd to raise as his own. Much to his father''s dismay, Ken chooses a fiery mustang filly -- but the two soon become fast friends.', 'Ken McLaughlin is a precocious 10-year-old who lives with his family on a remote Wyoming ranch. When Ken returns home from school with failing grades, his father, Rob, blames the boy''s lack of personal responsibility. At the suggestion of his wife, Nell, Rob allows Ken to choose a single colt from the herd to raise as his own. Much to his father''s dismay, Ken chooses a fiery mustang filly -- but the two soon become fast friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anKDH2is0CZfENkqj0pA0KwZMCP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18992'),
  ('974407666425803168', 'My Friend from Faro', 2008, 'Drama', 'Nana Neul, Leah Striker', 'Nana Neul', 'Anjorka Strechel, Lucie Hollmann, Manuel Cortez, Florian Panzner, Tilo Prückner, Isolda Dychauk-Ott, Anna Stieblich, Kai-Peter Malina', null, 'Eternal daydreamer Mel can''t wait to quit her sucky catering job and fly to her dream destination: Portugal. Things change when the beautiful Jenny literally crashes into her life when Mel nearly runs her over in her classic BMW. It is love at first sight, however there is just one problem: Jenny mistakenly assumes Mel to be a boy. Despite this, the pair become boyfriend and girlfriend. With Mel attempting to disguise her true gender at every turn, her journey from tomboy to out lesbian is fraught with life-defining dilemmas and sweet surprises.', 'Eternal daydreamer Mel can''t wait to quit her sucky catering job and fly to her dream destination: Portugal. Things change when the beautiful Jenny literally crashes into her life when Mel nearly runs her over in her classic BMW. It is love at first sight, however there is just one problem: Jenny mistakenly assumes Mel to be a boy. Despite this, the pair become boyfriend and girlfriend. With Mel attempting to disguise her true gender at every turn, her journey from tomboy to out lesbian is fraught with life-defining dilemmas and sweet surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQpeqqSHCZ1vpcOIMpsenxo3muv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12588'),
  ('949523405009572534', 'My Friend from the Park', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Adriana Vior, Ana Katz, Victoria Firgueredo', 'Ana Katz, Inés Bortagaray', 'Julieta Zylberberg, Ana Katz, Maricel Álvarez, Daniel Hendler, Andrés Milicich, Mirella Pascual, Tomás Newkirk, Manuela García Dudiuk', null, 'While her filmmaker husband works in Chile, harried young mother Liz struggles to take care of her infant son. Feeling out of place amongst the tight-knit group of other parents at the park, doubted by her husband, and judged by her newly hired nanny, Liz is drawn to factory worker Rosa, a plain-talking single mother she meets at the swings one day. Despite Liz’s liberation upon finding a bold new confidante, the friends’ increasingly apparent class differences, along with swirling rumors about Rosa’s motives and muddy family situation, feed Liz’s suspicions that her new pal might be a sinister influence on her already fragile life.', 'While her filmmaker husband works in Chile, harried young mother Liz struggles to take care of her infant son. Feeling out of place amongst the tight-knit group of other parents at the park, doubted by her husband, and judged by her newly hired nanny, Liz is drawn to factory worker Rosa, a plain-talking single mother she meets at the swings one day. Despite Liz’s liberation upon finding a bold new confidante, the friends’ increasingly apparent class differences, along with swirling rumors about Rosa’s motives and muddy family situation, feed Liz’s suspicions that her new pal might be a sinister influence on her already fragile life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5J4ch5gBDcuXPrq2m4cEnMaa1sY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361744'),
  ('383904599248713303', 'My Friend Irma', 1949, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Marshall, Leo Tover', 'Cy Howard, Parke Levy', 'Marie Wilson, Diana Lynn, Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, John Lund, Don DeFore, Hans Conried, Kathryn Givney', null, 'Prototype dumb blonde Irma and her slacker, wheeler-dealer boyfriend Al interfere in the love life of Irma''s level-headed room mate Jane.', 'Prototype dumb blonde Irma and her slacker, wheeler-dealer boyfriend Al interfere in the love life of Irma''s level-headed room mate Jane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7mNkoLDstiYPUELgaRD5jXPtmA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96432'),
  ('181081387724553301', 'My Friend Irma Goes West', 1950, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Hal Walker, Lee Garmes, Francisco Day', 'Parke Levy, Cy Howard', 'Marie Wilson, Diana Lynn, Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, John Lund, Corinne Calvet, Lloyd Corrigan, Don Porter', 'NR', 'Singer Steve, friend Seymour and fiance Jane, along with her dizzy blonde room mate Irma, have a series of misadventures on a California-bound train and end up involved with a gang of murderous gangsters in Las Vegas.', 'Singer Steve, friend Seymour and fiance Jane, along with her dizzy blonde room mate Irma, have a series of misadventures on a California-bound train and end up involved with a gang of murderous gangsters in Las Vegas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zALaC7mNC6Px6hmxvTxXjb8G99x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96433'),
  ('495680850367173446', 'My Friend Ivan Lapshin', 1985, 'Drama', 'Aleksei German, Valery Fedosov, Viktor Aristov', 'Aleksei German', 'Andrei Boltnev, Nina Ruslanova, Andrey Mironov, Aleksei Zharkov, Aleksandr Filippenko, Yuriy Kuznetsov, Semyon Farada, Nina Usatova', null, 'Russian provincial town in the middle of the 1930s Stalin''s Great Purge. Ivan Lapshin, the head of the local police, does what he has to do. And he does it well.', 'Russian provincial town in the middle of the 1930s Stalin''s Great Purge. Ivan Lapshin, the head of the local police, does what he has to do. And he does it well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cFz8PUfnEtN1KaNFnkhqJCB4FIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83491'),
  ('988214062108999478', 'My Friend Nietzsche', 2012, 'Comedy', 'André Lavenère, Fáuston da Silva', 'Tatianne da Silva, Fáuston da Silva', 'André Araújo Bezerra, Juliana Drummond, Abaetê Queiroz, André Deca, Andrade Jr., Mariana Nunes, Alessandra da Silva, Simone Marcelo', null, '11-year-old Lucas finds a philosophy book by Nietzsche in the city dump, discarded by its previous owner. This improbable meeting will be the beginning of a violent revolution in his mind, within his family and within society. In the end, Lucas will be no longer a boy -- He will be dynamite.', '11-year-old Lucas finds a philosophy book by Nietzsche in the city dump, discarded by its previous owner. This improbable meeting will be the beginning of a violent revolution in his mind, within his family and within society. In the end, Lucas will be no longer a boy -- He will be dynamite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zw4GLLd5JKOJqP6hIffdHGRyL1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369131'),
