  ('959482694150050368', 'My Friend Victoria', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jean-Paul Civeyrac, David Chambille', 'Jean-Paul Civeyrac', 'Guslagie Malanda, Nadia Moussa, Catherine Mouchet, Pierre Andrau, Pascal Greggory, Tony Harrisson, Moussa Sylla, Alexis Loret', null, 'Victoria, a little black girl aged 8 from a humble background, happens to spend the night with the bourgeois family of Thomas, one of her classmates. Years later, they see each other again and Marie is the fruit of their fleeting relationship. But Victoria decides not to tell Thomas and raises her child alone. When Marie turns seven, Victoria decides that her daughter must have a better future and again turns to this family that she lost sight of long ago.', 'Victoria, a little black girl aged 8 from a humble background, happens to spend the night with the bourgeois family of Thomas, one of her classmates. Years later, they see each other again and Marie is the fruit of their fleeting relationship. But Victoria decides not to tell Thomas and raises her child alone. When Marie turns seven, Victoria decides that her daughter must have a better future and again turns to this family that she lost sight of long ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fugjV9Ilqyp7hVcPfCiKJcfBytW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290316'),
  ('277213660136806019', 'My friend, Lefterakis', 1963, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Kostas Lyhnaras, Markos Zervas', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Dinos Iliopoulos, Kostas Voutsas, Maro Kodou, Giorgos Konstantinou, Ketty Panou, Katerina Yioulaki, Nikitas Platis, Margarita Athanasiou', null, 'Theodoros in order to be able to go out with his occasional lovers, he "invented" a non-existent friend from Patras, Lefterakis, and use him as an alibi in wife Fofo. When one day arrives at home, quite suddenly, the non-existent friend Lefterakis Tsampardis, Theo will welcome him with surprise and terror.', 'Theodoros in order to be able to go out with his occasional lovers, he "invented" a non-existent friend from Patras, Lefterakis, and use him as an alibi in wife Fofo. When one day arrives at home, quite suddenly, the non-existent friend Lefterakis Tsampardis, Theo will welcome him with surprise and terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocLDfoOuGJCg7Cewd1jByEP2qT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165710'),
  ('74265597616572401', 'My Friend''s Older Sister', 2016, 'Romance', 'Chae Gil-byeong', null, 'Park Cho-hyeon, Min Joon, Ahn So-yoon, Joo In-cheol, Seo Joon-yeol, Lee Kyeong-joon, Hong Doo-ri, Ah Ri', null, 'Joon-soo learns that his friend Hee-gyu''s sister Hee-jin has no where to go after being scammed, so he suggests living with him. The two start living together. They are close like brother and sister but they can never be that. The two start getting funny and Joon-soo can''t go to sleep at the thought of Hee-jin sleeping just a wall away from him. Mi-na, Joon-soo''s girlfriend notices Joon-soo changing and seduces Joon-soo at his house where Hee-jin is. Is it the girlfriend or the sister?', 'Joon-soo learns that his friend Hee-gyu''s sister Hee-jin has no where to go after being scammed, so he suggests living with him. The two start living together. They are close like brother and sister but they can never be that. The two start getting funny and Joon-soo can''t go to sleep at the thought of Hee-jin sleeping just a wall away from him. Mi-na, Joon-soo''s girlfriend notices Joon-soo changing and seduces Joon-soo at his house where Hee-jin is. Is it the girlfriend or the sister?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yJ8iVpaGofCNYbbv9NjFBCBMBG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387847'),
  ('161246815934496128', 'My Friend''s Sister 4', 2020, 'Romance', 'Lee Min-woo', null, 'Min Do-yoon, Kim Ji-ah, Kang Min-woo, Yoo Jung', null, 'Minsu quits the company if he takes it because he is far from home. So, as a special measure, I will stay at my friend''s house for a while. Min-soo falls in love with Jae-seok''s older sister Yoon-jung at first sight. Meanwhile, Jae-seok decides to start living with her girlfriend Hae-ju at home. Min-soo and Yoon-jung are alone, and love grows...', 'Minsu quits the company if he takes it because he is far from home. So, as a special measure, I will stay at my friend''s house for a while. Min-soo falls in love with Jae-seok''s older sister Yoon-jung at first sight. Meanwhile, Jae-seok decides to start living with her girlfriend Hae-ju at home. Min-soo and Yoon-jung are alone, and love grows...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1W5QphPMJNe3hWmwM3e7Lter51K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685092'),
  ('164823454860026557', 'My Friend''s Wife', 2015, 'Romance', 'Tak Seung-oh', null, 'Jeong Tae-min, Hee-jeong, Je Dong-hwa, Lim Song-yi, Joo Ye-bin', null, 'I want to spend all night with my friend''s wife who is extremely sexy. Jeong-woo is a husband who can''t get an erection while his marriage is going down the drain. A friend and his wife from the States suggest a couples trip and Jeong-woo meets his friend''s wife Hye-sook who is extremely sexy. His ''package'' keeps getting stimlated every time he sees her. He tries to ignore it but every time he sees her, he gets sexual fantasies. Finally, he suggests to his friend, to ''switch'' partners...', 'I want to spend all night with my friend''s wife who is extremely sexy. Jeong-woo is a husband who can''t get an erection while his marriage is going down the drain. A friend and his wife from the States suggest a couples trip and Jeong-woo meets his friend''s wife Hye-sook who is extremely sexy. His ''package'' keeps getting stimlated every time he sees her. He tries to ignore it but every time he sees her, he gets sexual fantasies. Finally, he suggests to his friend, to ''switch'' partners...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BZKRq3bvTOuG4G01H1jcE0F5TG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372049'),
  ('373535077855268089', 'My Friends Act III', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Nanni Loy, Claudio Cirillo, Roberto Pariante', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Tullio Pinelli', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Gastone Moschin, Adolfo Celi, Renzo Montagnani, Mario Feliciani, Franca Tamantini, Enzo Cannavale, Caterina Boratto', null, 'This time the "amici" (friends) are just four: Necchi, Meandri, Mascetti and Sassaroli. Nevertheless they are older they still love to spend their time mainly organizing irresistible jokes to everyone in every kind of situation. Mascetti is hospitalized in a geriatric clinic. Of course the place become immediately the main stage for all their jokes. After some jokes they decided to place an ultimate incredible and farcical joke to the clinic guests.', 'This time the "amici" (friends) are just four: Necchi, Meandri, Mascetti and Sassaroli. Nevertheless they are older they still love to spend their time mainly organizing irresistible jokes to everyone in every kind of situation. Mascetti is hospitalized in a geriatric clinic. Of course the place become immediately the main stage for all their jokes. After some jokes they decided to place an ultimate incredible and farcical joke to the clinic guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zefd273r73rKAap75OGhMIMP3Cs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24161'),
  ('59631167575911866', 'My Friends: Act IV – How It All Began', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Luciano Tovoli, Filippo Orobello', 'Piero De Bernardi, Neri Parenti, Marco Martani', 'Christian De Sica, Michele Placido, Paolo Hendel, Giorgio Panariello, Massimo Ghini, Massimo Ceccherini, Pamela Villoresi, Barbara Enrichi', null, 'Jacopo, Duccio, Cecco, Manfredo and Filippo are five friends who live in Florence of the fifteenth century, during a plague epidemic.', 'Jacopo, Duccio, Cecco, Manfredo and Filippo are five friends who live in Florence of the fifteenth century, during a plague epidemic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DDYFWsSnYmoKM4ssouD47EYV7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59415'),
  ('577150171984495179', 'My Führer', 2007, 'War, Comedy, Drama', 'Dani Levy, Carsten Thiele', null, 'Helge Schneider, Ulrich Mühe, Sylvester Groth, Adriana Altaras, Stefan Kurt, Ulrich Noethen, Lambert Hamel, Udo Kroschwald', null, 'Hitler no longer believes in himself, and can barely see himself as an equal to even his sheep dog. But to seize the helm of the war he would have to create one of his famous fiery speeches to mobilize the masses. Goebbels therefore brings a Jewish acting teacher Grünbaum and his family from the camps in order to train the leader in rhetoric. Grünbaum is torn, but starts Hitler in his therapy ...', 'Hitler no longer believes in himself, and can barely see himself as an equal to even his sheep dog. But to seize the helm of the war he would have to create one of his famous fiery speeches to mobilize the masses. Goebbels therefore brings a Jewish acting teacher Grünbaum and his family from the camps in order to train the leader in rhetoric. Grünbaum is torn, but starts Hitler in his therapy ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTQMykCLzJ2jtagyXGSqX0ieAKf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6172'),
  ('764744505919621969', 'My Future Boyfriend', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael Lange', null, 'Sara Rue, Barry Watson, Valerie Harper, Jordan Wall, Enisha Brewster, Cara Mantella, Fred Willard, Mike Pniewski', 'NR', 'P-A-X-497/341, aka “Pax” , a curious young man from the well-ordered but loveless future, travels to present day New Orleans in search of romance novelist Elizabeth Barrett – whose book he has come upon during an archeological dig in the year 3127. Hoping Elizabeth can explain the concept of love to him, which is now nonexistent in his time, Pax embarks on an adventure filled with new discoveries. Elizabeth introduces Pax to life in the year 2011, filled with love, music and of course, destiny. When Pax doesn’t return to the future by the given deadline, Bob, his fellow scientist, travels back in time to find him. Meanwhile, as Elizabeth helps Pax learn about love, she ends up confiding in her colleague, played by Valerie Harper, about her own upcoming “surprise” engagement.', 'P-A-X-497/341, aka “Pax” , a curious young man from the well-ordered but loveless future, travels to present day New Orleans in search of romance novelist Elizabeth Barrett – whose book he has come upon during an archeological dig in the year 3127. Hoping Elizabeth can explain the concept of love to him, which is now nonexistent in his time, Pax embarks on an adventure filled with new discoveries. Elizabeth introduces Pax to life in the year 2011, filled with love, music and of course, destiny. When Pax doesn’t return to the future by the given deadline, Bob, his fellow scientist, travels back in time to find him. Meanwhile, as Elizabeth helps Pax learn about love, she ends up confiding in her colleague, played by Valerie Harper, about her own upcoming “surprise” engagement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HTpNqBRpoB7SmVY1tTdG6dpp62.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65892'),
  ('132049092738423215', 'My Gal Sal', 1942, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Irving Cummings, Alfred Newman', 'Seton I. Miller, Darrell Ware, Karl Tunberg', 'Rita Hayworth, Victor Mature, John Sutton, Carole Landis, James Gleason, Phil Silvers, Walter Catlett, Mona Maris', null, 'Biopic chronicling the early life of gay nineties-era songwriter Paul Dresser as he outgrows his job as carnival entertainer and moves up into New York society, writing one hit song after another. Despite his egotistical behavior, he manages to woo and win Sally Elliott, one of the more popular songstresses of the day', 'Biopic chronicling the early life of gay nineties-era songwriter Paul Dresser as he outgrows his job as carnival entertainer and moves up into New York society, writing one hit song after another. Despite his egotistical behavior, he manages to woo and win Sally Elliott, one of the more popular songstresses of the day', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQBwtUrndutZaktXpVeNwcfOOMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109933'),
  ('102230896964502719', 'My Geisha', 1962, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jack Cardiff, Harry Kratz, Ikuo Kobayashi', 'Norman Krasna', 'Shirley MacLaine, Yves Montand, Edward G. Robinson, Robert Cummings, Yoko Tani, Tatsuo Saitō, Alex Gerry, Tamae Kiyokawa', null, 'Famed movie director Paul Robaix breaks with tradition by not casting his actress-comedienne wife, Lucy Dell, in his latest film production, a version of Madame Butterfly. Undaunted, the resourceful Lucy wings her way to Tokyo and, masquerading as a Japanese geisha, lands the coveted role from her unsuspecting husband! But in front of the cameras (and behind the pancake makeup), Lucy faces greater challenges: her lecherous leading man - and a husband who is beginning to realize that his talented new "discovery" seems vaguely familiar...', 'Famed movie director Paul Robaix breaks with tradition by not casting his actress-comedienne wife, Lucy Dell, in his latest film production, a version of Madame Butterfly. Undaunted, the resourceful Lucy wings her way to Tokyo and, masquerading as a Japanese geisha, lands the coveted role from her unsuspecting husband! But in front of the cameras (and behind the pancake makeup), Lucy faces greater challenges: her lecherous leading man - and a husband who is beginning to realize that his talented new "discovery" seems vaguely familiar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIFrL4TKONYvfnZApzAxveysNTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43006'),
  ('549446798717685413', 'My General''s Wives', 1951, 'Drama, Romance, War, Comedy', 'Ismael Rodríguez', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Pedro de Urdimalas, Celestino Gorostiza', 'Pedro Infante, Lilia Prado, Chula Prieto, Miguel Manzano, Miguel Inclán, Arturo Soto Rangel, Lupe Inclán, Alberto Catalá', null, 'The encounter with an old lover puts a revolutionary general in great danger of death.', 'The encounter with an old lover puts a revolutionary general in great danger of death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgJpEl0hW8TEMNYlczEojPVmJUh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84088'),
