  ('108653889539048279', 'My Giant', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Michael Lehmann, Michael Coulter', 'David Seltzer', 'Billy Crystal, Gheorghe Mureșan, Kathleen Quinlan, Joanna Pacula, Jere Burns, Harold Gould, Dan Castellaneta, Raymond O''Connor', 'PG', 'Sammy, an agitated agent lost in the forest of the modern world, happens upon a gentle giant with a tall talent for friendship named Max.', 'Sammy, an agitated agent lost in the forest of the modern world, happens upon a gentle giant with a tall talent for friendship named Max.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mUkKKzQTPB7lnvoy9RFEXngdhgj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47881'),
  ('500096695792274133', 'My Girl', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Howard Zieff, Paul Elliott', 'Laurice Elehwany', 'Anna Chlumsky, Macaulay Culkin, Dan Aykroyd, Jamie Lee Curtis, Richard Masur, Griffin Dunne, Ann Nelson, Peter Michael Goetz', 'PG', 'Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is "allergic to everything", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada''s father hires Shelly, and begins to fall for her, things take a turn to the worse...', 'Vada Sultenfuss is obsessed with death. Her mother is dead, and her father runs a funeral parlor. She is also in love with her English teacher, and joins a poetry class over the summer just to impress him. Thomas J., her best friend, is "allergic to everything", and sticks with Vada despite her hangups. When Vada''s father hires Shelly, and begins to fall for her, things take a turn to the worse...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qyJJNHteA7BUwQSey05t7qP4vRV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4032'),
  ('630352663878106578', 'My Girl', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Songyos Sugmakanan, Adisorn Trisirikasem, Khomkrit Treewimol', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Songyos Sugmakanan, Vijjapat Kojew', 'Charlie Trairat, Focus Jirakul, Chaleumpol Tikumpornteerawong, Thana Vichayasuranan, Triwarat Chutiwatkajornchai, Aphichan Chaleumchainuwong, Yok Teeranitayatarn, Hattaya Ratananon', null, 'Jeab, a young man working in Bangkok, receives word that his childhood sweetheart, Noi-Naa is to be married. While driving back to his hometown, the memories from his childhood come flooding back.', 'Jeab, a young man working in Bangkok, receives word that his childhood sweetheart, Noi-Naa is to be married. While driving back to his hometown, the memories from his childhood come flooding back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2bnH1j5kOw0GvABqhMcE1AXsrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18486'),
  ('1018592739952803255', 'My Girl 2', 1994, 'Comedy, Family', 'Paul Elliott, Howard Zieff, David Ticotin', 'Janet Kovalcik', 'Anna Chlumsky, Austin O''Brien, Dan Aykroyd, Jamie Lee Curtis, Richard Masur, Christine Ebersole, JD Souther, Angeline Ball', 'PG', 'Vada Sultenfuss has a holiday coming up, and an assignment: to do an essay on someone she admires and has never met. She decides she wants to do an assignment on her mother, but quickly realises she knows very little about her. She manages to get her father to agree to let her go to LA to stay with her Uncle Phil and do some research on her mother.', 'Vada Sultenfuss has a holiday coming up, and an assignment: to do an essay on someone she admires and has never met. She decides she wants to do an assignment on her mother, but quickly realises she knows very little about her. She manages to get her father to agree to let her go to LA to stay with her Uncle Phil and do some research on her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEZ6L72eBORRnoUxf4pip5U76pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11317'),
  ('311283419752789800', 'My Girl and I', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jeon Yun-su', 'Jeon Yun-su, Hwang Sung-goo', 'Song Hye-kyo, Cha Tae-hyun, Lee Soon-jae, Kim Hae-sook, Song Chang-eui, Moon Jeong-hee, Park Hyo-joon, Kim Shin-young', null, 'Su-ho is a plain high school boy, and Su-eun is a bright and beautiful girl in the same school. For some unknown reason, Su-eun has a crush on the boy, and for equally mysterious reasons she rescues Su-ho in the sea though he doesn''t know who actually saved him.', 'Su-ho is a plain high school boy, and Su-eun is a bright and beautiful girl in the same school. For some unknown reason, Su-eun has a crush on the boy, and for equally mysterious reasons she rescues Su-ho in the sea though he doesn''t know who actually saved him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGzQ4xmUQ6RaRVQ16pLzyZh7Sz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13407'),
  ('189947670056093029', 'My Girlfriend Is a Serial Killer', 2019, 'Crime, Romance', 'Kayoko Asakura', 'Izumi Takahashi', 'Haruka Fukuhara, Yosuke Sugino, Noriko Eguchi, Manami Enosawa, Show Kasamatsu, Naoya Shimizu, Wataru Ichinose, Hajime Okayama', null, 'Etsuro Kurosu faills getting into a university and becomes a hikikomori. One day, he tries to hang himself from a hook on the wall in his apartment. He fails, but his attempt leaves a hole in the wall. Through the hole wall, Etsuro Kurosu can now see Rio Miyaichi. He becomes fascinated with the girl that lives next door. Later, while peeping at her through the wall, Etsuro Kurosu sees her in the process of brutally murdering someone. He screams and is caught by her. Etsuro Kurosu confesses that he loves her and they start to date. Etsuro Kurosu feels happiness in his life, but what will happen to him? Will he be murdered by Rio Miyaichi?', 'Etsuro Kurosu faills getting into a university and becomes a hikikomori. One day, he tries to hang himself from a hook on the wall in his apartment. He fails, but his attempt leaves a hole in the wall. Through the hole wall, Etsuro Kurosu can now see Rio Miyaichi. He becomes fascinated with the girl that lives next door. Later, while peeping at her through the wall, Etsuro Kurosu sees her in the process of brutally murdering someone. He screams and is caught by her. Etsuro Kurosu confesses that he loves her and they start to date. Etsuro Kurosu feels happiness in his life, but what will happen to him? Will he be murdered by Rio Miyaichi?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWp3hIsnq94FVDPb41oFPGPbXsv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638210'),
  ('690789200361781534', 'My Girlfriend Is an Agent', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'Choi Joo-young, Shin Terra, Lee Jae-hyuk', 'Chun Sung-il', 'Kim Ha-neul, Kang Ji-hwan, Ryu Seung-ryong, Jang Young-nam, Kang Shin-il, Yoo Seung-mok, Jeong Woo-hyuk, Kim Jung-pal', null, 'Ahn Soo-ji and Lee Jae-joon, who are oblivious to each other''s real profession as secret agents, are in an ill-fated relationship. Three years later, they accidentally meet targeting the same enemy.', 'Ahn Soo-ji and Lee Jae-joon, who are oblivious to each other''s real profession as secret agents, are in an ill-fated relationship. Three years later, they accidentally meet targeting the same enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Z9hqDYhOL0uY3cFi9zGLo9WIrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18374'),
