  ('220417957779941452', 'My God Father', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arnon Chanprasert, Surakij Natho, Panicha Pannasirichard', 'Torphong Kul-on, Jatuporn Boonkode, Pirat Tatone', 'Thanawat Wattanaputi, Chantavit Dhanasevi, Sammy Cowell, Bhuripat Vejvongsatechavat, Chawinroj Likitchareonsakul, Siripon Sirinattakul, Sarunyoo Prachakit, Naphat Chumchittri', null, 'Got, a young and energetic racing man who hates his father. There is a reason for him to warp back in the year 1998, just a year before he was born, Got met his young father when he was Godfather.', 'Got, a young and energetic racing man who hates his father. There is a reason for him to warp back in the year 1998, just a year before he was born, Got met his young father when he was Godfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jsCtxwvwfrRA4cdKGTNXL3Ij3iw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752879'),
  ('163632006699528890', 'My God, My God, Why Hast Thou Forsaken Me?', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Music', 'Shinji Aoyama, Fumio Nomoto, Masaki Tamura', 'Shinji Aoyama', 'Tadanobu Asano, Aoi Miyazaki, Masaya Nakahara, Masahiro Toda, Yasutaka Tsutsui, Mariko Okada, Erika Oda, Yūsuke Kawazu', null, 'A.D. 2015: A virus has been spreading in many cities worldwide. It is a suicidal disease and the virus is infected by pictures. People, once infected, come down with the disease, which leads to death. They have no way of fighting against this infection filled with fear and despair. The media calls the disease the "Lemming Syndrome".', 'A.D. 2015: A virus has been spreading in many cities worldwide. It is a suicidal disease and the virus is infected by pictures. People, once infected, come down with the disease, which leads to death. They have no way of fighting against this infection filled with fear and despair. The media calls the disease the "Lemming Syndrome".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9mgyCJjgB9cS5JqV0cktwQgLuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95240'),
