  ('537750693934722034', 'My Grandmother Ironed the King''s Shirts', 1999, 'Animation', 'Torill Kove', 'Torill Kove', 'Mag Ruffman', null, 'A personal interpretation of Norwegian history - starring a grandmother who during the Second World War loses her job ironing the King''s shirts. Instead she gains access to the enemy''s uniforms, and inspires her own brand of resistance fighters, the "Shirt Guerillas".', 'A personal interpretation of Norwegian history - starring a grandmother who during the Second World War loses her job ironing the King''s shirts. Instead she gains access to the enemy''s uniforms, and inspires her own brand of resistance fighters, the "Shirt Guerillas".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XnWTKY4GHpz0AioAIPZp29NvYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215509'),
