  ('15351023404027544', 'My Heart Can''t Beat Unless You Tell It To', 2020, 'Drama, Horror', 'Matthew Wride, Joshua Oman, Jonathan Cuartas', 'Jonathan Cuartas', 'Patrick Fugit, Ingrid Sophie Schram, Owen Campbell, Moises L. Tovar, Judah Bateman, Katie Preston, Waine Riches, Nancy Fong', null, 'Dwight and his sister Jessie reach a crossroads over what to do about their little brother Thomas, a sickly child with a mysterious affliction.', 'Dwight and his sister Jessie reach a crossroads over what to do about their little brother Thomas, a sickly child with a mysterious affliction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2E9firwz4tqDLedpvtS0byyDek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:690248'),
  ('584907421003398237', 'My Heart Goes Boom!', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Nacho Álvarez, Juan Carlos Gómez', 'David Esteban Cubero, Nacho Álvarez, Eduardo Navarro', 'Ingrid García Jonsson, Verónica Echegui, Fernando Guallar, Natalia Millán, Pedro Casablanc, Fernando Tejero, Giuseppe Maggio, Fran Morcillo', null, 'Spain, 1970s. While a cruel dictatorship rules an eternally grey country through fear, violence, repression and censorship, María, a young dancer, dreams of bringing bright colours into her life and the lives of others, as she makes her way towards personal freedom and pursues her crazy dream of becoming a TV star; a very funny journey in which she will be comforted by the pop songs of the incomparable Italian singer and dancer Raffaella Carrà.', 'Spain, 1970s. While a cruel dictatorship rules an eternally grey country through fear, violence, repression and censorship, María, a young dancer, dreams of bringing bright colours into her life and the lives of others, as she makes her way towards personal freedom and pursues her crazy dream of becoming a TV star; a very funny journey in which she will be comforted by the pop songs of the incomparable Italian singer and dancer Raffaella Carrà.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSfwZlSSffa8Cak70S6xWzebnnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681509'),
  ('188323897793080825', 'My Heart Is That Eternal Rose', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Patrick Tam Kar-Ming, Christopher Doyle, David Chung', 'John Chan Koon-Chung, Tsang Kan-Cheong', 'Kenny Bee, Joey Wong, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Kwan Hoi-San, Michael Chan Wai-Man, Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Gam Lui', null, 'The fallout resulting from a botched Triad gang smuggling job forces a young couple to separate - she becomes a kingpin’s unwilling moll and he travels to the Philippines to work as a contract killer. Six years later, the two are reunited in a chance encounter, but their rekindled emotions and people from their past lead them into extreme danger.', 'The fallout resulting from a botched Triad gang smuggling job forces a young couple to separate - she becomes a kingpin’s unwilling moll and he travels to the Philippines to work as a contract killer. Six years later, the two are reunited in a chance encounter, but their rekindled emotions and people from their past lead them into extreme danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igW5rfwv0BBMu3ogmbjxUMQxm6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78033'),
  ('649623733817793683', 'My Heart Puppy', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Kim Yong-seong, Kim Tae-hun, Jason Kim', 'Jason Kim', 'Yoo Yeon-seok, Cha Tae-hyun, Ryu Soo-young, Jung Ji-hoon, Lee Seung-hee, Park Jin-joo, Kang Shin-il, Kim Yoo-jung', null, 'Min-soo is about to get married when his fiancée suddenly admits that she is allergic to dogs. Now the guy''s best friend, the golden retriever Rooney, needs a new family. With the help of his cousin and social media, Min-soo starts looking for a new home for Rooney.', 'Min-soo is about to get married when his fiancée suddenly admits that she is allergic to dogs. Now the guy''s best friend, the golden retriever Rooney, needs a new family. With the help of his cousin and social media, Min-soo starts looking for a new home for Rooney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seJvs2UQtlYufD2WaJ43yrszbsf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:610249'),
  ('6969523224717994', 'My Hero', 1990, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Nico Wong Man-Wan', 'Hoh Dung, Joh Chung-Sing, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan', 'Stephen Chow, Wilson Lam Chun-Yin, Ann Bridgewater, Shing Fui-On, Peter Yang Kwan, Bryan Leung Kar-Yan, Tung Chi, Albert Cheung Miu-Hau', null, 'Sing loves to read cartoons and often daydreams of becoming a tycoon and celebrity. By accident, he becomes a follower of Wai, a gang leader, and makes a friend of Wai''s adopted son, Chun. The series of successes made by Sing and Chun breed contempt in Wai''s heart. Wai plans to get rid of them so as to pave the way for his son to succeed to his own business. Still, his son kills him..', 'Sing loves to read cartoons and often daydreams of becoming a tycoon and celebrity. By accident, he becomes a follower of Wai, a gang leader, and makes a friend of Wai''s adopted son, Chun. The series of successes made by Sing and Chun breed contempt in Wai''s heart. Wai plans to get rid of them so as to pave the way for his son to succeed to his own business. Still, his son kills him..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Wqu0wXD9mRMJhsEBTr6TWLtvjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160182'),
  ('245024920050277528', 'My Hero Academia: World Heroes'' Mission', 2021, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Yuki Hayashi, Kenji Nagasaki, Tomo Ookubo', 'Hitoshi Nagai', 'Daiki Yamashita, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuki Kaji, Ryo Yoshizawa, Kazuya Nakai, Megumi Hayashibara, Kenta Miyake, Tetsu Inada', 'PG-13', 'A mysterious group called Humarize strongly believes in the Quirk Singularity Doomsday theory which states that when quirks get mixed further in with future generations, that power will bring forth the end of humanity. In order to save everyone, the Pro-Heroes around the world ask UA Academy heroes-in-training to assist them and form a world-class selected hero team. It’s up to the heroes to save the world and the future of heroes in what is the most dangerous crisis to take place yet in My Hero Academia.', 'A mysterious group called Humarize strongly believes in the Quirk Singularity Doomsday theory which states that when quirks get mixed further in with future generations, that power will bring forth the end of humanity. In order to save everyone, the Pro-Heroes around the world ask UA Academy heroes-in-training to assist them and form a world-class selected hero team. It’s up to the heroes to save the world and the future of heroes in what is the most dangerous crisis to take place yet in My Hero Academia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzP5rPwwNqUGERlrUzKKljfyulf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768744'),
  ('782230681346531672', 'My Hero Academia: You''re Next', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Tensai Okamura, Hitomi Odashima, Masafumi Mima', 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Daiki Yamashita, Meru Nukumi, Mamoru Miyano, Kenta Miyake, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Yuki Kaji, Ayane Sakura, Kaito Ishikawa', 'PG-13', 'In a society devastated by the effects of an all-out war between heroes and villains, a mysterious giant fortress suddenly appears, engulfing towns and people one after another. Then, a man reminiscent of All Might, the ''symbol of peace'', stands in front of Izuku and his friends...', 'In a society devastated by the effects of an all-out war between heroes and villains, a mysterious giant fortress suddenly appears, engulfing towns and people one after another. Then, a man reminiscent of All Might, the ''symbol of peace'', stands in front of Izuku and his friends...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTrI6PwqzxkgO3dvQ7BEKXM7SYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159311'),
  ('1114123375318063400', 'My Hindu Friend', 2016, 'Drama', 'Héctor Babenco, Mauro Pinheiro Jr.', 'Héctor Babenco', 'Willem Dafoe, Maria Fernanda Cândido, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Selton Mello, Bárbara Paz, Guilherme Weber, Dan Stulbach, Gilda Nomacce', 'NR', 'Diego is a film director who, when he is told that he has a malignant disease which could be fatal, marries his girlfriend of many years, says goodbye to his friends and begins a routine of long days of treatment in hospital. While learning to live with the pain and also conversing with death, he meets a Hindu boy who is a fellow patient and who becomes his friend. But one day the boy disappears. Diego is discharged, but his life has changed forever. His marriage fails and, living alone, he begins to wonder whether he may in fact be dying and no one has told him. He tries to find out what happened to his Hindu friend, and eventually meets another woman.', 'Diego is a film director who, when he is told that he has a malignant disease which could be fatal, marries his girlfriend of many years, says goodbye to his friends and begins a routine of long days of treatment in hospital. While learning to live with the pain and also conversing with death, he meets a Hindu boy who is a fellow patient and who becomes his friend. But one day the boy disappears. Diego is discharged, but his life has changed forever. His marriage fails and, living alone, he begins to wonder whether he may in fact be dying and no one has told him. He tries to find out what happened to his Hindu friend, and eventually meets another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EO8w0Ci6uhxaSvTzv93hAsSk2f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362314'),
  ('231615422619947595', 'My Home Hero the Movie', 2024, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Takahiro Aoyama, Naoki Sakakibara, Hirofumi Morikawa', 'Susumu Funahashi', 'Kuranosuke Sasaki, Asuka Saito, Kyohei Takahashi, Ryubi Miyase, Toshiyuki Itakura, Shunsuke Daitoh, Yasushi Fuchikami, Sho Nishigaki', 'R', 'Seven years have passed since family man Tetsuo Tosu survived a fierce battle with a criminal organization. However, Tetsuo''s peaceful family life begins to crumble once again when a sudden landslide uncovers an old sin.', 'Seven years have passed since family man Tetsuo Tosu survived a fierce battle with a criminal organization. However, Tetsuo''s peaceful family life begins to crumble once again when a sudden landslide uncovers an old sin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WbFInonIAwoDiKGHslNSsEx8UF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1238472'),
  ('155747460328131376', 'My House', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nick Norman-Butler', 'Nick Norman-Butler', 'Francis Magee, Mirren Mack, Aki Omoshaybi, Michelle Collins, Kaisa Hammarlund, Nigel Hastings, Muki Zubis, Macadie Amoroso', null, 'Carla lives life locked inside her house with her kind but tyrannical father. When their isolation is interrupted by a mysterious stranger, Carla questions the reasons for her family''s withdrawal from the outside world and discovers dark secrets that redefine their existence.', 'Carla lives life locked inside her house with her kind but tyrannical father. When their isolation is interrupted by a mysterious stranger, Carla questions the reasons for her family''s withdrawal from the outside world and discovers dark secrets that redefine their existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1JUhyzjrQzsC3aewLRPjRsry1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104771'),
  ('74514805539188203', 'My House in Umbria', 2003, 'Drama, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Richard Loncraine', null, 'Maggie Smith, Ronnie Barker, Chris Cooper, Benno Fürmann, Giancarlo Giannini, Timothy Spall, Libero De Rienzo, Emmy Clarke', null, 'Emily Delahunty is an eccentric British romance novelist who lives in Umbria in central Italy. One day while travelling, the train she is on is bombed by terrorists. After she wakes up in a hospital, she invites three of the other survivors of the disaster to stay at her Italian villa for recuperation. Of these are The General, a retired British Army veteran, Werner, a young German man, and Aimee, a young American girl who has now become mute after her parents were both killed in the explosion.', 'Emily Delahunty is an eccentric British romance novelist who lives in Umbria in central Italy. One day while travelling, the train she is on is bombed by terrorists. After she wakes up in a hospital, she invites three of the other survivors of the disaster to stay at her Italian villa for recuperation. Of these are The General, a retired British Army veteran, Werner, a young German man, and Aimee, a young American girl who has now become mute after her parents were both killed in the explosion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Qa8b99kco74Kk4UNWKUHc0VX8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36730'),
  ('429065830035419744', 'My House My House...', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Andrea Straziota, Cristiano Pogany', 'Domenico Matteucci, Gaetano Audino', 'Renato Pozzetto, Paola Onofri, Athina Cenci, Gianfranco Agus, Patrizia Loreti, Stefano Antonucci, Antonio Allocca, Clarissa Burt', null, 'Bartoloni from Milan exchanges apartments with his colleague from Rome and moves toa new place. And everything could be good, if not unexpected trouble with which he will have to face ..', 'Bartoloni from Milan exchanges apartments with his colleague from Rome and moves toa new place. And everything could be good, if not unexpected trouble with which he will have to face ..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LiwxKzy1GscvsBhLmq8u1FSVTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45025'),
  ('1140463440575781469', 'My Husband, An Assassin', 2013, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Lancelot von Naso', 'Kai-Uwe Hasenheit, Lancelot von Naso', 'Veronica Ferres, Ulrich Noethen, Esther Zimmering, Mehdi Nebbou, Ulrike Kriener, Ulrike Arnold, Stephan Bissmeier, Michael Brandner', null, 'Minette and Paul are married and seem to lead a happy family life. But when Paul began gradually to move away from his wife, it decides to spin and managed to watch the tryst he gave Nora, his new conquest, in a hotel room. The betrayed wife keeps to herself what she witnessed, even when it crosses the opera which was favored by her husband. Following a violent altercation between two lovers, the master mysteriously disappears. The former partner it makes contact with Minette and claims that Paul murdered Nora. To support his point, he shows Minette photo of a dead body could be that of the missing young woman ... A crossover lover-like thriller, where the characters and spectators alike struggle to discern truth from falsehood.', 'Minette and Paul are married and seem to lead a happy family life. But when Paul began gradually to move away from his wife, it decides to spin and managed to watch the tryst he gave Nora, his new conquest, in a hotel room. The betrayed wife keeps to herself what she witnessed, even when it crosses the opera which was favored by her husband. Following a violent altercation between two lovers, the master mysteriously disappears. The former partner it makes contact with Minette and claims that Paul murdered Nora. To support his point, he shows Minette photo of a dead body could be that of the missing young woman ... A crossover lover-like thriller, where the characters and spectators alike struggle to discern truth from falsehood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84bUbttvAI3epFjPkZyWGEXlohI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220239'),
  ('554073403472186602', 'My Husband''s Double Life', 2018, 'TV Movie, Drama, Thriller', 'Dušan Joksimović, Jonathan English', 'Jenny Paul', 'Daniel Lapaine, Chloe Sweetlove, Dragan Mićanović, Amy Nuttall, Tamara Aleksić, Katarina Korša, Jakov Jevtović, Tiana Upcheva', null, 'A married woman discovers her husband is living a double life in Paris, jeopardizing not only her marriage but her life.', 'A married woman discovers her husband is living a double life in Paris, jeopardizing not only her marriage but her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpUjYgwJq1laBhU8y9owC6aLu69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543490'),
  ('834971464018194700', 'My Husband''s Husband', 2019, 'TV Movie, Comedy', 'Charles Nemes', 'Alexandra Echkenazi, Alexandra Julhiet', 'Julie Depardieu, Mathias Mlekuz, Jérôme Robart, Evelyne Buyle, Benoît Pétré, Hubert Saint-Macary, Cédric Chevalme', null, 'Juliette broke up with her husband Christophe but now he is about to marry a man, one year later. And she is in charge of organizing the wedding.', 'Juliette broke up with her husband Christophe but now he is about to marry a man, one year later. And she is in charge of organizing the wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5foQnY0todwbIXRgYvTGzuH5xB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:622597'),
  ('282280792420751466', 'My Hustler', 1966, 'Drama', 'Andy Warhol, Chuck Wein', 'Ronald Tavel', 'Paul America, Joseph Campbell, Genevieve Charbon, Dorothy Dean, Ed Hood, J.D. McDermott', null, 'Set on Fire Island, My Hustler depicts competition over the affections of a young male hustler among a straight woman, a former male hustler, and the man who hired the boy''s companionship via a "Dial-A-Hustler" service.', 'Set on Fire Island, My Hustler depicts competition over the affections of a young male hustler among a straight woman, a former male hustler, and the man who hired the boy''s companionship via a "Dial-A-Hustler" service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgsqVItspsWWO0zazR34IYfiaMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121797'),
  ('689853134285308224', 'My Imaginary Country', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Patricio Guzmán, Samuel Lahu', 'Patricio Guzmán', 'Patricio Guzmán', null, 'This documentary explores the protests that exploded onto the streets of Chile’s capital of Santiago in 2019 as the population demanded more democracy and social equality around education, healthcare and job opportunities.', 'This documentary explores the protests that exploded onto the streets of Chile’s capital of Santiago in 2019 as the population demanded more democracy and social equality around education, healthcare and job opportunities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKUfSLK1w5qCmC3lmHOP7VEVPGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958496'),
  ('942820410474850440', 'My Internship in Canada', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Falardeau, Ronald Plante', 'Philippe Falardeau', 'Patrick Huard, Irdens Exantus, Clémence Dufresne-Deslières, Sonia Cordeau, Paul Doucet, Jules Philip, Robin Aubert, Micheline Lanctôt', null, 'Guibord is an independent Member of Parliament who represents Prescott-Makadewà-Rapides-aux Outardes, a vast county in Northern Quebec. As the entire country watches, Guibord unwillingly finds himself in the awkward position of holding the decisive vote to determine whether Canada will go to war. Accompanied by his wife, his daughter and an idealistic intern from Haiti named Sovereign, Guibord travels across his district in order to consult his constituents. While groups of lobbyists get involved in a debate that spins out of control, the MP will have to face his own conscience. ''My Internship in Canada'' is a biting political satire in which politicians, citizens and lobbyists go head-to-head tearing democracy to shreds. Film starring Suzanne Clément, Patrick Huard and Mardy Men', 'Guibord is an independent Member of Parliament who represents Prescott-Makadewà-Rapides-aux Outardes, a vast county in Northern Quebec. As the entire country watches, Guibord unwillingly finds himself in the awkward position of holding the decisive vote to determine whether Canada will go to war. Accompanied by his wife, his daughter and an idealistic intern from Haiti named Sovereign, Guibord travels across his district in order to consult his constituents. While groups of lobbyists get involved in a debate that spins out of control, the MP will have to face his own conscience. ''My Internship in Canada'' is a biting political satire in which politicians, citizens and lobbyists go head-to-head tearing democracy to shreds. Film starring Suzanne Clément, Patrick Huard and Mardy Men', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dk4CqSj4HSwyC1X922Dj26TTddu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304126'),
