  ('136926724056749352', 'My Kid Could Paint That', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Amir Bar-Lev', null, 'Laura Olmstead, Mark Olmstead, Marla Olmstead, Elizabeth Cohen, Anthony Brunelli, Amir Bar-Lev, Zane Olmstead, Michael Kimmelman', 'PG-13', 'A look at the work and surprising success of a four-year-old girl whose paintings have been compared to the likes of Picasso and has raked in hundreds of thousands of dollars.', 'A look at the work and surprising success of a four-year-old girl whose paintings have been compared to the likes of Picasso and has raked in hundreds of thousands of dollars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJiYxHp3aqFbq3LOSLK8qM6EIp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14279'),
  ('1138909757555317580', 'My King', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Claire Mathon, Maïwenn, Frédéric Gérard', 'Étienne Comar, Maïwenn', 'Vincent Cassel, Emmanuelle Bercot, Louis Garrel, Isild Le Besco, Chrystèle Saint-Louis Augustin, Patrick Raynal, Paul Hamy, Yann Goven', 'NR', 'Tony is admitted to a rehabilitation center after a serious ski accident. Dependent on the medical staff and pain relievers, she takes time to look back on a turbulent relationship that she experienced with Georgio.', 'Tony is admitted to a rehabilitation center after a serious ski accident. Dependent on the medical staff and pain relievers, she takes time to look back on a turbulent relationship that she experienced with Georgio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOhRkC7J3jpAgHGC0Uh3SoCqU4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329805'),
  ('186497128914954050', 'My Korean Teacher', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yukihiro Okimura, Yuzo Asahara', 'Yuzo Asahara, Kevin D.C. Chang', 'Yesung, Nozomi Sasaki, Masahiro Sato, Eri Fuse, Isao Takeno, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Kazuha Sakiyama, Kensaku Nagata', null, 'Young-Ung was dumped by his girlfriend. While he is in Okinawa, Japan on a business trip, the company he works for goes bankrupt. Sakura is a single mother and works for a travel agency. She needs to learn Korean for her job. At a Korean language institute, Sakura meets Young-Ung and their romance begins.', 'Young-Ung was dumped by his girlfriend. While he is in Okinawa, Japan on a business trip, the company he works for goes bankrupt. Sakura is a single mother and works for a travel agency. She needs to learn Korean for her job. At a Korean language institute, Sakura meets Young-Ung and their romance begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiA93ns0WEMquQhLZ7PKWRW6882.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429699'),
  ('390097287062928375', 'My Kung Fu 12 Kicks', 1979, 'Action', 'To Man-Bo', null, 'Bruce Leung Siu-Lung, Ku Feng, Hon Kwok-Choi', null, 'This film adds a sense of humor to the normal Kung-Fu battles as our hero fights in a most unusual and funny manner (something Jackie Chan as well made use of in many films). This film is clearly one of many imitators of Drunken Master. Although a little slow moving, Bruce Leung shows his stuff in this one. He gets trained from three masters who wants revenge on the villain that cripples them. But, as good as they train him, he still isn''t good enough. So he finds out that his roommate knows the Tan Tao style. Bruce Leung is very good to watch in this one. An invincible villain in the end tops off this genuine classic.', 'This film adds a sense of humor to the normal Kung-Fu battles as our hero fights in a most unusual and funny manner (something Jackie Chan as well made use of in many films). This film is clearly one of many imitators of Drunken Master. Although a little slow moving, Bruce Leung shows his stuff in this one. He gets trained from three masters who wants revenge on the villain that cripples them. But, as good as they train him, he still isn''t good enough. So he finds out that his roommate knows the Tan Tao style. Bruce Leung is very good to watch in this one. An invincible villain in the end tops off this genuine classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujroiGLeGTC8tqGmL3e4cW7Hmv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75829'),
  ('978241138266277499', 'My Lady of Whims', 1925, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dallas M. Fitzgerald, Jack Young', 'Doris Schroeder', 'Clara Bow, Donald Keith, Carmelita Geraghty, Lee Moran, Francis McDonald, Betty Baker, John Cossar, Lux MacBride', null, 'Aspiring author Prudence "Prue" Severn leaves her staid home for the wild life in New York''s artistic Greenwich Village community. Her concerned family hires two thrill-seeking ex-doughboys, bow-tied Bartley "Bart" Greer and his trigger-happy buddy Lee, to look after her and, hopefully, persuade her to come home. They move into Prue''s apartment building, where she lives with a sculptress pal. Although interested in Bart, Prue senses he is being paid to watch over her-- so she decides to elope with the handsome Rolf.', 'Aspiring author Prudence "Prue" Severn leaves her staid home for the wild life in New York''s artistic Greenwich Village community. Her concerned family hires two thrill-seeking ex-doughboys, bow-tied Bartley "Bart" Greer and his trigger-happy buddy Lee, to look after her and, hopefully, persuade her to come home. They move into Prue''s apartment building, where she lives with a sculptress pal. Although interested in Bart, Prue senses he is being paid to watch over her-- so she decides to elope with the handsome Rolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyCpjfTydUBS0lrccBBtOcniowc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184480'),
  ('377668769367114272', 'My Last Best Friend', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Filippo M. Prandi', 'Filippo M. Prandi', 'Eric Roberts, Carol Alt, Rico Simonini, Brian Byus, Adrienne Laurén, Nathaniel Ryan, Christopher Romero Wilson, Ken Driesslein', 'NR', 'New York City. March - April 2020. At the beginning of the COVID-19 pandemic, two men, both named Walter Stoyanov, watch their lives getting turned upside down, as one of them falls ill and the other one is being investigated by FBI Special Agent John McCallany.', 'New York City. March - April 2020. At the beginning of the COVID-19 pandemic, two men, both named Walter Stoyanov, watch their lives getting turned upside down, as one of them falls ill and the other one is being investigated by FBI Special Agent John McCallany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziWtSmNthDv5BXkOqwREZqxB6Kw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1157251'),
  ('423780107923485694', 'My Last Day Without You', 2011, 'Music, Romance', 'Stefan C. Schaefer', 'Chris Silber, Stefan C. Schaefer', 'Ken Duken, Nicole Beharie, Reg E. Cathey, Marlene Forte, Laith Nakli', null, 'On a one-day business trip to New York, a German business executive falls in love with a singer-songwriter who exposes him to her Brooklyn world and emotions he''s never experienced before.', 'On a one-day business trip to New York, a German business executive falls in love with a singer-songwriter who exposes him to her Brooklyn world and emotions he''s never experienced before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uS4Eh5aVG34B05EHiBQPHbZEYjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96534'),
  ('700808811698682734', 'My Last Love', 2017, 'Family, Drama', 'Jin Kwang-kyo', 'Jin Kwang-kyo', 'Sung Ji-ru, Jeon Mi-seon, Kwon So-hyun, Yang Hong-seok, Lee Ye-won, Jeong Soo-young', null, 'Bong-yong Kim is one of a modest Korean dad who struggles to survive from the work place without any time to get along with his family. He has to work over than he had to, since the boss treat him like his servant – drink late every night, drive the boss to his home. His wife, Hwayeon, blames him for his indifference to family, and twins in puberty, Woo-joo and Dal-nim, also in trouble with their father. The late child ‘Byeol-nim’ is his only one who acts charm and shows cuteness to him.. MY LAST LOVE, when every family member starts to share with caring each other at last…', 'Bong-yong Kim is one of a modest Korean dad who struggles to survive from the work place without any time to get along with his family. He has to work over than he had to, since the boss treat him like his servant – drink late every night, drive the boss to his home. His wife, Hwayeon, blames him for his indifference to family, and twins in puberty, Woo-joo and Dal-nim, also in trouble with their father. The late child ‘Byeol-nim’ is his only one who acts charm and shows cuteness to him.. MY LAST LOVE, when every family member starts to share with caring each other at last…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbVqXklqK9wOroKjTTuswD6FQ6g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487252'),
  ('336965352018483817', 'My Last Round', 2011, 'Drama', 'Julio Jorquera, Sergio Armstrong, Rosario Onetto', 'Julio Jorquera', 'Roberto Farías, Héctor Morales, Manuela Martelli, Tamara Acosta, Alejandro Trejo, Luis Dubó, Gonzalo Robles, Ramón Llao', 'NR', 'Hugo becomes captivated with Octavio, a middle-aged local boxing champion, but their relationship is tested when Hugo finds a new job in the city.', 'Hugo becomes captivated with Octavio, a middle-aged local boxing champion, but their relationship is tested when Hugo finds a new job in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0lOBUBClz6lFji6sNsbg0GQGpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106294'),
  ('146635985900375587', 'My Learned Friend', 1943, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Will Hay, Basil Dearden, Wilkie Cooper', 'Angus MacPhail, John Dighton', 'Will Hay, Claude Hulbert, Mervyn Johns, Laurence Hanray, Aubrey Mallalieu, Charles Victor, Ernest Thesiger, Eddie Phillips', null, 'An insane murderer is on the loose, and gunning for the men who put him away. Will Hay is on the list, and co-opts Claude Hulbert to try and stop him from meeting a grisly end.', 'An insane murderer is on the loose, and gunning for the men who put him away. Will Hay is on the list, and co-opts Claude Hulbert to try and stop him from meeting a grisly end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVZiOU8UxtDqe4VwPcVFw0cG92K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123422'),
  ('76116517271637029', 'My Left Eye Sees Ghosts', 2002, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Wai Ka-Fai, Au Kin-Yee', 'Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Cherrie Ying Choi-Yi, Lee San-San, Simon Yam, Lam Suet, Wong Tin-Lam, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei', null, 'A car accident gives a spoiled, troubled young woman the ability to see ghosts, including one of a former classmate.', 'A car accident gives a spoiled, troubled young woman the ability to see ghosts, including one of a former classmate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqg4I0EXEd1cb2SGngyZ8e6vaTk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45397'),
  ('491171337720133303', 'My Left Foot: The Story of Christy Brown', 1989, 'Drama', 'Jack Conroy, Jim Sheridan, Michael Rowland', 'Shane Connaughton, Jim Sheridan', 'Daniel Day-Lewis, Brenda Fricker, Alison Whelan, Kirsten Sheridan, Declan Croghan, Eanna MacLiam, Marie Conmee, Cyril Cusack', 'R', 'No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.', 'No one expects much from Christy Brown, a boy with cerebral palsy born into a working-class Irish family. Though Christy is a spastic quadriplegic and essentially paralyzed, a miraculous event occurs when, at the age of 5, he demonstrates control of his left foot by using chalk to scrawl a word on the floor. With the help of his steely mother — and no shortage of grit and determination — Christy overcomes his infirmity to become a painter, poet and author.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GRAAl0bMQFoFIjV3aunc5jsM5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10161'),
  ('233389072137489663', 'My Life', 1972, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Grigori Nikulin, Viktor Sokolov, Dmitriy Dolinin', 'Viktor Sokolov, Grigori Nikulin', 'Stanislav Lyubshin, Margarita Terekhova, Alisa Freyndlikh, Yuriy Solomin, Nonna Terentyeva, Nikolai Sergeyev, Leonid Gallis, Viktor Sergachyov', null, 'Man is trying to find simple human happiness. He decides for himself the question of what this happiness consists of - wealth, high social status, or something else.', 'Man is trying to find simple human happiness. He decides for himself the question of what this happiness consists of - wealth, high social status, or something else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2E8LKRNQzi5CTCc2T1hf7jYVYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:887855'),
  ('158570645219959623', 'My Life', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruce Joel Rubin, Peter James, William M. Elvin', 'Bruce Joel Rubin', 'Michael Keaton, Nicole Kidman, Bradley Whitford, Michael Constantine, Rebecca Schull, Haing S. Ngor, Mark Lowenthal, Lee Garlington', 'PG-13', 'It seems that Bob Jones has everything a man could want, namely a fulfilling job and a beautiful, pregnant wife, Gail. But Bob''s life is turned upside-down when he is diagnosed with cancer and given four months to live -- not even enough time to see his first child''s birth. To cleanse himself of demons in his remaining days, Bob makes a video diary, hoping to pass along some wisdom to his future child. Along the way, he discovers a lot about himself.', 'It seems that Bob Jones has everything a man could want, namely a fulfilling job and a beautiful, pregnant wife, Gail. But Bob''s life is turned upside-down when he is diagnosed with cancer and given four months to live -- not even enough time to see his first child''s birth. To cleanse himself of demons in his remaining days, Bob makes a video diary, hoping to pass along some wisdom to his future child. Along the way, he discovers a lot about himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eF8wNMMqY3kukUTTAVXLLx94UhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41659'),
  ('934410196038058089', 'My Life and Times with Antonin Artaud', 1993, 'Drama', 'Gérard Mordillat', null, 'Sami Frey, Marc Barbé, Julie Jézéquel, Valérie Jeannet', null, 'May, 1946, in Paris young poet Jacques Prevel meets Antonin Artaud, the actor, artist, and writer just released from a mental asylum. Over ten months, we follow the mad Artaud from his cruel coaching of an actress in his "theatre of cruelty" to his semi-friendship with Prevel who buys him drugs and hangs on his every word. Meanwhile, Prevel divides his time between Jany, his blond, young, drug-hazed mistress, and Rolande, his dark-haired, long-suffering wife, who has a child during this time. Cruelty, neglect, poverty, egoism, madness, and the pursuit of art mix on the Left Bank.', 'May, 1946, in Paris young poet Jacques Prevel meets Antonin Artaud, the actor, artist, and writer just released from a mental asylum. Over ten months, we follow the mad Artaud from his cruel coaching of an actress in his "theatre of cruelty" to his semi-friendship with Prevel who buys him drugs and hangs on his every word. Meanwhile, Prevel divides his time between Jany, his blond, young, drug-hazed mistress, and Rolande, his dark-haired, long-suffering wife, who has a child during this time. Cruelty, neglect, poverty, egoism, madness, and the pursuit of art mix on the Left Bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDqebKxUMKbIzLKTKeCLXpK5QFW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124306'),
  ('281644089628257220', 'My Life as a Dog', 1985, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jörgen Persson, Lasse Hallström', 'Brasse Brännström, Reidar Jönsson, Lasse Hallström', 'Anton Glanzelius, Tomas von Brömssen, Anki Lidén, Melinda Kinnaman, Kicki Rundgren, Lennart Hjulström, Ing-Marie Carlsson, Leif Ericson', null, 'A boy, obsessed with comparing himself with those less fortunate, experiences a different life at the home of his aunt and uncle in 1959 Sweden.', 'A boy, obsessed with comparing himself with those less fortunate, experiences a different life at the home of his aunt and uncle in 1959 Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVg9IsX2HtR1BNYH0UAhF4JPHi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8816'),
  ('823413966504582373', 'My Life as McDull', 2001, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Toe Yuen', 'Brian Tse, Alice Mak', 'Lee Chun-Wai, Jan Lam Hoi-Fung, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Dejay Choi, Lung Tin-Sang, May Che Yuet-Mei, Ng Cheuk-Lung', null, 'McDull is not the brightest kid on the block, but he continuously tries to do his best to please his mother. Still it seems he may not be destined for great things like she wishes, but McDull strives to try anyway.', 'McDull is not the brightest kid on the block, but he continuously tries to do his best to please his mother. Still it seems he may not be destined for great things like she wishes, but McDull strives to try anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iyMQFIzidWRnjSjpPps1y5nFOPj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73884'),
  ('1005699359873437267', 'My Life Directed by Nicolas Winding Refn', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Liv Corfixen', 'Liv Corfixen', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Liv Corfixen, Ryan Gosling, Alejandro Jodorowsky, Kristin Scott Thomas, Lola Corfixen, Lizzielou Corfixen', null, 'A documentary directed by Winding Refn''s wife, Liv Corfixen, and it follows the Danish-born filmmaker during the making of his 2013 film Only God Forgives.', 'A documentary directed by Winding Refn''s wife, Liv Corfixen, and it follows the Danish-born filmmaker during the making of his 2013 film Only God Forgives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tH83eBJ10SrhJhOPnl4mv0ofp23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291868'),
  ('523745030594508365', 'My Life in Orange', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Marcus H. Rosenmüller, Stefan Biebl', 'Ursula Gruber', 'Oliver Korittke, Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Georg Friedrich, Amber Bongard, Brigitte Hobmeier, Chiem van Houweninge, Gundi Ellert, Bettina Mittendorfer', null, 'A look at a Bavarian commune of the Indian Bhagwan cult.', 'A look at a Bavarian commune of the Indian Bhagwan cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ot6gk5rU6gcCRJfx5s7fZJzRAiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84857'),
  ('616714133801768933', 'My Life in Pink', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alain Berliner, Yves Cape, Manu Kamanda', 'Chris Vander Stappen, Alain Berliner', 'Georges Du Fresne, Michèle Laroque, Jean-Philippe Écoffey, Hélène Vincent, Cristine Barget, Daniel Hanssens, Laurence Bibot, Julien Rivière', 'R', 'Ludovic is waiting for a miracle. With six-year-old certainty, she believes she was meant to be a little girl -- and that the mistake will soon be corrected. But where she expects the miraculous, Ludo finds only rejection, isolation, and guilt -- as the intense reactions of family, friends, and neighbors strip away every innocent lace and bauble.', 'Ludovic is waiting for a miracle. With six-year-old certainty, she believes she was meant to be a little girl -- and that the mistake will soon be corrected. But where she expects the miraculous, Ludo finds only rejection, isolation, and guilt -- as the intense reactions of family, friends, and neighbors strip away every innocent lace and bauble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SwZaSDy1DR80QXKdvp6iSTawK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27103'),
  ('385982096339113852', 'My Life in Ruins', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Donald Petrie, José Luis Alcaine, Jack Gill', 'Mike Reiss', 'Nia Vardalos, Richard Dreyfuss, Alexis Georgoulis, Alistair McGowan, Harland Williams, Rachel Dratch, Caroline Goodall, Ian Ogilvy', 'PG-13', 'A Greek tour guide named Georgia attempts to recapture her kefi (Greek for mojo) by guiding a ragtag group of tourists around Greece and showing them the beauty of her native land. Along the way, she manages to open their eyes to the wonders of an exotic foreign land while beginning to see the world through a new set of eyes in the process.', 'A Greek tour guide named Georgia attempts to recapture her kefi (Greek for mojo) by guiding a ragtag group of tourists around Greece and showing them the beauty of her native land. Along the way, she manages to open their eyes to the wonders of an exotic foreign land while beginning to see the world through a new set of eyes in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f695mVyU0LyBb99rx7zkrtFcpxR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23049'),
  ('665126935026483313', 'My Life Inside', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Lucía Gajá', 'Lucía Gajá', null, null, 'Rosa is a Mexican woman who, at the age of 17, migrated illegally to Austin, Texas. Some years later, she was jailed under suspicion of murder and then taken to trial. This film demonstrates how the judicial process, the verdict, the separation from her family, and the helplessness of being imprisoned in a foreign country make Rosa’s story an example of the hard life of Mexican migrants in the United States.', 'Rosa is a Mexican woman who, at the age of 17, migrated illegally to Austin, Texas. Some years later, she was jailed under suspicion of murder and then taken to trial. This film demonstrates how the judicial process, the verdict, the separation from her family, and the helplessness of being imprisoned in a foreign country make Rosa’s story an example of the hard life of Mexican migrants in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOxzAHbpmdroGlC5aiEcQ2RXaa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267044'),
  ('911218513635463344', 'My Life Is Hell', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Josiane Balasko, Dominique Chapuis', 'Joël Houssin, Josiane Balasko', 'Daniel Auteuil, Josiane Balasko, Richard Berry, Catherine Hiegel, Catherine Samie, Jean Benguigui, Jessica Forde, Luis Rego', null, 'The naive and self-conscious Leah mistakenly signs a pact with the devil Abargadon. But she''s on Heaven''s hit list, so the Archangel Gabriel intervenes to bring about the demon''s demise. But Leah begins to find Abargadon attractive and not so bad. She decides to save his soul.', 'The naive and self-conscious Leah mistakenly signs a pact with the devil Abargadon. But she''s on Heaven''s hit list, so the Archangel Gabriel intervenes to bring about the demon''s demise. But Leah begins to find Abargadon attractive and not so bad. She decides to save his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neXNMggGa43m3lBkX65EOaj2WbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4272'),
  ('255451595464480365', 'My Life on Ice', 2003, 'Drama', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Olivier Ducastel, Jacques Martineau', 'Jimmy Tavares, Ariane Ascaride, Jonathan Zaccaï, Hélène Surgère, Lucas Bonnifait, Frédéric Gorny, Nicolas Pontois, Frédéric Sendon', null, 'Etienne is crazy about ice skating and videoing his daily life with a digital camera. He records his mother, friends, and geography teacher. Initially his intention is to setup a date between his mother and his teacher, however, he starts to realize that he is infatuated with the teacher himself.', 'Etienne is crazy about ice skating and videoing his daily life with a digital camera. He records his mother, friends, and geography teacher. Initially his intention is to setup a date between his mother and his teacher, however, he starts to realize that he is infatuated with the teacher himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmmViolNp6xg3udvirmKbaAdxOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27143'),
  ('866522849531347023', 'My Life So Far', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hugh Hudson, Bernard Lutic', 'Simon Donald', 'Colin Firth, Rosemary Harris, Irène Jacob, Mary Elizabeth Mastrantonio, Malcolm McDowell, Robert Norman, Tchéky Karyo, Kelly Macdonald', 'PG-13', 'A memoir of the lives of a family growing up on a post World War I British estate headed up by a strong disciplinarian, her daughter, her inventor husband, their ten year old son and his older sister. Through the household comes a number of suitors hoping to impress the young woman, including an aviator. When the elder woman''s son shows up at the estate with his French fiancé, everything gets thrown into turmoil. The young boy takes a sudden interest in her sexual allure and his father is disturbed by his own non-Victorian feelings.', 'A memoir of the lives of a family growing up on a post World War I British estate headed up by a strong disciplinarian, her daughter, her inventor husband, their ten year old son and his older sister. Through the household comes a number of suitors hoping to impress the young woman, including an aviator. When the elder woman''s son shows up at the estate with his French fiancé, everything gets thrown into turmoil. The young boy takes a sudden interest in her sexual allure and his father is disturbed by his own non-Victorian feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lXglg96vfFuHCDdmNof1bdyd0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48958'),
  ('55331530492147341', 'My Life with James Dean', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Dominique Choisy', 'Dominique Choisy', 'Johnny Rasse, Mickaël Pelissier, Nathalie Richard, Juliette Damiens, Bertrand Belin, Marie Vernalde, Yannick Bequelin, Tancredi Volpert', null, 'Still pining for his ex-boyfriend, Géraud has come to a French seaside town to present his new experimental film, but the only person keen on seeing it is the cinema''s underage projectionist who becomes smitten with the handsome director.', 'Still pining for his ex-boyfriend, Géraud has come to a French seaside town to present his new experimental film, but the only person keen on seeing it is the cinema''s underage projectionist who becomes smitten with the handsome director.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSRzYNtw835xECTtQAlYVcc2GbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511793'),
  ('58857018673844757', 'My Life Without Me', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isabel Coixet, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Isabel Coixet', 'Sarah Polley, Amanda Plummer, Scott Speedman, Mark Ruffalo, Leonor Watling, Debbie Harry, Maria de Medeiros, Julian Richings', 'R', 'A fatally ill mother with only two months to live creates a list of things she wants to do before she dies without telling her family of her illness.', 'A fatally ill mother with only two months to live creates a list of things she wants to do before she dies without telling her family of her illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFEtVPW88pWflYV84UFL0h1iJr3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20'),
  ('993127634507144476', 'My Little Baby, Jaya', 2017, 'Crime, Drama', 'Yun Hak-ryeol', 'Yun Hak-ryeol', 'Kim Jeong-gyun, Oh Ye-seol, Hwang Do-won, Kim Saet-byeol, Lee Cheol-hee, Park Na-Ye, Yoon Ra-young, Jeong Ui-cheol', null, 'Won-Sool is an adult man with cerebral palsy. His daughter Jaya is his pride and joy. Jaya though is bullied at school and even worse things happen to her. Won-Sool later decides to get revenge on his daughter''s tormentors.', 'Won-Sool is an adult man with cerebral palsy. His daughter Jaya is his pride and joy. Jaya though is bullied at school and even worse things happen to her. Won-Sool later decides to get revenge on his daughter''s tormentors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdydMpIqhTTwh8iWuEGYv0BuiTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456413'),
  ('100279342778871096', 'My Little Big Man', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Ricardo Garfias, Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Jorge Ramírez Suárez', 'Fernanda Castillo, Jorge Salinas, Arleth Terán, José Carriedo, Vico Escorcia, Sylvia Pasquel, André Real', null, 'A successful and somewhat vain lawyer loses her mobile phone and is contacted by a stranger who wants to give it back. Charming and interesting, their instant connection blossoms but everything changes when they meet and she discovers a tiny little detail about him: he''s rather short.', 'A successful and somewhat vain lawyer loses her mobile phone and is contacted by a stranger who wants to give it back. Charming and interesting, their instant connection blossoms but everything changes when they meet and she discovers a tiny little detail about him: he''s rather short.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufBxs5lpq5XuTazs83A4GMNotc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553668'),
  ('617151700549688838', 'My Little Bride', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Ho-joon', 'Yoo Sun-il', 'Moon Geun-young, Kim Rae-won, Kim Bo-kyung, Ahn Sun-Young, Kim In-mun, Song Ki-Yoon, Han Jin-hee, Sunwoo Eun-Sook', null, 'A teenage girl tries to continue her normal social and school life, after her grandfather forces her into an arranged marriage with a man in his twenties.', 'A teenage girl tries to continue her normal social and school life, after her grandfather forces her into an arranged marriage with a man in his twenties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFE1fhmj57bidgHQCKuGcprYjjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44656'),
  ('143388345189247615', 'My Little Brother', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Je-woo, Ma Dae-yun, Jo Yeong-sang', 'Yoon Pil-joon', 'Lee Yo-won, Jeong Man-sik, Esom, Jeong Joon-won, Kim Hye-eun, Jeong Ae-hwa, Yoon Kyung-ho, Lee Do-gyeong', null, 'Soo-kyung works as a reporter. She has an older brother, Sung-ho, and younger sister, Joo-mi. She thinks of her two siblings as burdens. One day, Nak appears in front of them. He is their youngest sibling.', 'Soo-kyung works as a reporter. She has an older brother, Sung-ho, and younger sister, Joo-mi. She thinks of her two siblings as burdens. One day, Nak appears in front of them. He is their youngest sibling.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muxH6D8u6w5I0jsWipgI0HuBWpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436992'),
  ('192606054876511400', 'My Little Business', 1999, 'Comedy', 'Pierre Jolivet', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Vincent Lindon, François Berléand, Zabou Breitman, Roschdy Zem, Albert Dray, Catherine Mouchet, Françoise Sage, Pascal Leguennec', null, 'A wood worker is trying hard to make his company survive every day... But a fire in his workshop leaves him in a lot of trouble when he realizes his insurer was swindling him - he does not have any insurance... That''s when a crazy idea grows in his mind - he will need all his friends and their different talents to make it work...', 'A wood worker is trying hard to make his company survive every day... But a fire in his workshop leaves him in a lot of trouble when he realizes his insurer was swindling him - he does not have any insurance... That''s when a crazy idea grows in his mind - he will need all his friends and their different talents to make it work...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eEAfwmf0MqzQCMBe42PJZBnBn1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65081'),
  ('1063255155598594160', 'My Little Chickadee', 1940, 'Comedy, Western', 'Edward F. Cline, Joseph A. McDonough, Charles Previn', 'Mae West, W.C. Fields', 'Mae West, W.C. Fields, Joseph Calleia, Dick Foran, Ruth Donnelly, Margaret Hamilton, Donald Meek, Fuzzy Knight', 'NR', 'On her way by stagecoach to visit relatives out west, Flower Belle Lee is held up by a masked bandit who also takes the coach''s shipment of gold. When he abducts Flower Belle and they arrive in town, Flower Belle is suspected of being in collusion with the bandit.', 'On her way by stagecoach to visit relatives out west, Flower Belle Lee is held up by a masked bandit who also takes the coach''s shipment of gold. When he abducts Flower Belle and they arrive in town, Flower Belle is suspected of being in collusion with the bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bB0ewfiQCrtpdRTd5DQs3cLSigg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29353'),
  ('413113095120369629', 'My Little Duckaroo', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy, Western, Family', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Daffy Duck is a Wild West outlaw named "The Masked Avenger", righter of wrongs and doer of heroic deeds. Porky Pig is his sidekick. Together, they seek to arrest Nasty Canasta, a villain whose crimes include gag-stealing and square dancing in a round house.', 'Daffy Duck is a Wild West outlaw named "The Masked Avenger", righter of wrongs and doer of heroic deeds. Porky Pig is his sidekick. Together, they seek to arrest Nasty Canasta, a villain whose crimes include gag-stealing and square dancing in a round house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QPteQzlT5hdHStr0RO1leZxks7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188801'),
