  ('828728797587264820', 'My Little Goat', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tomoki Misato', null, 'Kaori Yamashita, Ami Fukuhara, Mizuho Misato, Tomoki Misato', null, 'A mother goat rescues her kids from the belly of a wolf, but where is her eldest son Toruku?', 'A mother goat rescues her kids from the belly of a wolf, but where is her eldest son Toruku?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6ao6At9oMsKeJigaRaHQmwRx0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550321'),
  ('325249824108778542', 'My Little Loves', 1974, 'Drama', 'Jean Eustache, Denys Granier-Deferre, Luc Béraud', 'Jean Eustache', 'Martin Loeb, Ingrid Caven, Henri Martinez, Jacqueline Dufranne, Dionys Mascolo, Maurice Pialat, Jacques Romain, Vincent Testanière', null, 'Daniel lives with his grandmother and, after a year of high school, goes to live with his mother in the south of France; a harsher environment which rapidly changes his perception of friends, work, and women.', 'Daniel lives with his grandmother and, after a year of high school, goes to live with his mother in the south of France; a harsher environment which rapidly changes his perception of friends, work, and women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/roR2cQdgg6wXoAl99D2Dw9JDNxd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64296'),
  ('159354363011837970', 'My Little Monster', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Sho Tsukikawa, Makino Sho', 'Arisa Kaneko', 'Masaki Suda, Tao Tsuchiya, Yuki Furukawa, Yuki Yamada, Elaiza Ikeda, Minami Hamabe, Gaku Sano, Mokomichi Hayami', null, 'Problem student Haru Yoshida sits next to the cold and studious Shizuku Mizutani in class. Without any other friends to turn to, both of them start to get to know each other and grow closer. Haru eventually develop feelings for Shizuku and confesses his feelings to her. Will Haru and Shizuku get their happily ever after?', 'Problem student Haru Yoshida sits next to the cold and studious Shizuku Mizutani in class. Without any other friends to turn to, both of them start to get to know each other and grow closer. Haru eventually develop feelings for Shizuku and confesses his feelings to her. Will Haru and Shizuku get their happily ever after?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPxHH7onQ090ygTx5G5erQmQCSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507612'),
  ('734998492198557743', 'My Little Pony', 1984, 'Animation, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'John Gibbs', 'George Arthur Bloom', 'Sandy Duncan, Tony Randall, Charlie Adler, Tammy Amerson, Fran Brill, Victor Caroli, Laura Dean, Lani Groves', null, 'The story begins as the peaceful ponies of Dream Valley are attacked by monsters, led by Scorpan, who kidnap several ponies and take them away to Midnight Castle. Enraged, Firefly, a Pegasus pony, takes to the skies to try to find someone who can help them defeat Tirek, a centaur-like demon whose plan is to use these ponies to pull his chariot of darkness. On her way, she crashes into 12-year-old Megan''s well and asks her for her help. Megan is at first reluctant to go but after being confronted by the monsters, she sets out with the ponies to rescue them.', 'The story begins as the peaceful ponies of Dream Valley are attacked by monsters, led by Scorpan, who kidnap several ponies and take them away to Midnight Castle. Enraged, Firefly, a Pegasus pony, takes to the skies to try to find someone who can help them defeat Tirek, a centaur-like demon whose plan is to use these ponies to pull his chariot of darkness. On her way, she crashes into 12-year-old Megan''s well and asks her for her help. Megan is at first reluctant to go but after being confronted by the monsters, she sets out with the ponies to rescue them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zad8hKb4RRVlD78LZnG09T1alCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359878'),
  ('860602807946418425', 'My Little Pony: Best Gift Ever', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Music', 'Jim Miller, Denny Lu, Mike Myhre', 'Michael Vogel', 'Tara Strong, Andrea Libman, Ashleigh Ball, Cathy Weseluck, Tabitha St. Germain, John de Lancie, Andrew Francis, Britt McKillip', 'PG', 'As the ponies prepare for another Hearth''s Warming, families come together to celebrate the holiday; Pinkie Pie, Fluttershy, Applejack, Rarity, and Rainbow Dash are ready for the big day, but Princess Twilight Sparkle doesn''t have time to celebrate.', 'As the ponies prepare for another Hearth''s Warming, families come together to celebrate the holiday; Pinkie Pie, Fluttershy, Applejack, Rarity, and Rainbow Dash are ready for the big day, but Princess Twilight Sparkle doesn''t have time to celebrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiVMet36PEDZqbXmjSwRh8dYNVS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564638'),
  ('357377125046096153', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Jayson Thiessen', 'Meghan McCarthy', 'Tara Strong, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Rebecca Shoichet, Britt McKillip, Lee Tockar', 'G', 'Via a magic mirror, Twilight Sparkle travels into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.', 'Via a magic mirror, Twilight Sparkle travels into an alternate universe in order to recover a crown that was stolen from the Crystal Empire. Upon her arrival she is horrified to learn that she has turned into a human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3tQM3PUDn9i2iq0HP7yLlQsQ0ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201676'),
  ('346287495002722263', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Forgotten Friendship', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy', 'Ishi Rudell, Katrina Hadley', 'Nick Confalone', 'Rebecca Shoichet, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Tara Strong, Kathleen Barr, Cathy Weseluck, Nicole Oliver', 'G', 'The story follows Sunset Shimmer, who (using her powers) finds out that her friends'' memories of her have been mysteriously erased, resulting in them getting amnesia. Determined to set things straight, she''ll need Princess Twilight''s help from Equestria in order to find out the source of what caused her friends'' memory loss.', 'The story follows Sunset Shimmer, who (using her powers) finds out that her friends'' memories of her have been mysteriously erased, resulting in them getting amnesia. Determined to set things straight, she''ll need Princess Twilight''s help from Equestria in order to find out the source of what caused her friends'' memory loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dY7pdaPfbTnJnfnZBjRFprgRuUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505832'),
  ('518015740954083393', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Friendship Games', 2015, 'Animation, Music, Family', 'Ishi Rudell', 'Josh Haber', 'Tara Strong, Rebecca Shoichet, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Iris Quinn, Nicole Oliver', 'G', 'Canterlot High meets its rival school, Crystal Prep Academy, in a competition that’s a long-standing tradition – The Friendship Games. Sunset Shimmer is tasked with keeping magic out of the games to avoid the appearance of impropriety while she and her friends compete against Crystal Prep’s top students led by someone with an equal amount of interest in Equestrian magic – this world’s TWILIGHT SPARKLE.', 'Canterlot High meets its rival school, Crystal Prep Academy, in a competition that’s a long-standing tradition – The Friendship Games. Sunset Shimmer is tasked with keeping magic out of the games to avoid the appearance of impropriety while she and her friends compete against Crystal Prep’s top students led by someone with an equal amount of interest in Equestrian magic – this world’s TWILIGHT SPARKLE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ih6vNDVWAeSYJYoQAk03Gykl1DJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349158'),
  ('761521080424174587', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Legend of Everfree', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Music, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ishi Rudell, Katrina Hadley', 'Joanna Lewis, Kristine Songco', 'Tara Strong, Rebecca Shoichet, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Enid-Raye Adams, Brian Doe', 'G', 'When Canterlot Highschool goes on a trip to Camp Everfree, they’re surprised to find a magical force is causing strange things to happen around camp. With the help of the Mane 6 and especially Sunset Shimmer, Twilight Sparkle must confront the dark “Midnight Sparkle” within herself and embrace her newfound magical abilities to save the camp.', 'When Canterlot Highschool goes on a trip to Camp Everfree, they’re surprised to find a magical force is causing strange things to happen around camp. With the help of the Mane 6 and especially Sunset Shimmer, Twilight Sparkle must confront the dark “Midnight Sparkle” within herself and embrace her newfound magical abilities to save the camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fo9LoPjqK7wLv7g7zZM1LcnqsVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405314'),
  ('484756405037966463', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Rollercoaster of Friendship', 2018, 'Animation, Family, Music', 'Ishi Rudell, Katrina Hadley', 'Nick Confalone', 'Rebecca Shoichet, Tabitha St. Germain, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tara Strong, Tegan Moss, James Kirk, Sam Vincent', 'G', 'Rarity''s friendship with Applejack is tested when Vignette Valencia hires her as her new designer for a theme park parade.', 'Rarity''s friendship with Applejack is tested when Vignette Valencia hires her as her new designer for a theme park parade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjDE0bioRTxD4k9ICdL50sTZXnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537170'),
  ('822614134004471523', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls - Spring Breakdown', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Katrina Hadley, Ishi Rudell', 'Nick Confalone', 'Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tara Strong, Rebecca Shoichet, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Shannon Chan-Kent, Kazumi Evans', 'PG', 'The Equestria Girls spend their spring break on a yacht. It''s Spring Break and the Mane 7 are about to board the most glorious yacht ever for a relaxing cruise. But Rainbow Dash is convinced that Equestrian Magic is on the loose and won''t let anyone rest until she finds it.', 'The Equestria Girls spend their spring break on a yacht. It''s Spring Break and the Mane 7 are about to board the most glorious yacht ever for a relaxing cruise. But Rainbow Dash is convinced that Equestrian Magic is on the loose and won''t let anyone rest until she finds it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0rzWc7m4GXTLNHsgibYW2Fsrp9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592316'),
  ('53161879747501904', 'My Little Pony: Equestria Girls – Rainbow Rocks', 2014, 'Family, Animation, Music', 'Jayson Thiessen, Ishi Rudell', 'Meghan McCarthy', 'Tara Strong, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Rebecca Shoichet, Kazumi Evans, Maryke Hendrikse', 'G', 'Music rules and rainbows rock as Twilight Sparkle and pals compete for the top spot in the Canterlot High "Mane Event" talent show. The girls must rock their way to the top, and outshine rival Adagio Dazzle and her band The Dazzlings, to restore harmony back to Canterlot High.', 'Music rules and rainbows rock as Twilight Sparkle and pals compete for the top spot in the Canterlot High "Mane Event" talent show. The girls must rock their way to the top, and outshine rival Adagio Dazzle and her band The Dazzlings, to restore harmony back to Canterlot High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA0QBMZEulH7TJHkyxFw5mXVTPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292177'),
  ('898724345442877018', 'My Little Pony: Escape from Catrina', 1985, 'Animation, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'John Gibbs, Vincent Davis', 'George Arthur Bloom', 'Tammy Grimes, Paul Williams, Charlie Adler, Tammy Amerson, Laura Dean, Ivy Austin', null, 'All the little ponies and their young friend Megan must save Baby Surprise and their ponies, magical rainbow locket from the evil Cartrina. If they don''t, Catrina will force all the baby ponies to become her slaves. It''s a battle the little ponies must win or life in Dream Valley will never be the same!', 'All the little ponies and their young friend Megan must save Baby Surprise and their ponies, magical rainbow locket from the evil Cartrina. If they don''t, Catrina will force all the baby ponies to become her slaves. It''s a battle the little ponies must win or life in Dream Valley will never be the same!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvIkC97BsclPCLx2ujg89kbzhWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276311'),
  ('56399192408080758', 'My Little Pony: The Movie', 1986, 'Animation, Family', 'Mike Joens, Milton Gray', 'George Arthur Bloom', 'Madeline Kahn, Danny DeVito, Cloris Leachman, Rhea Perlman, Tony Randall, Tammy Amerson, Alice Playten, Sheryl Bernstein', 'G', 'The first day of Spring is on its way and the Little Ponies are preparing for it with a big festival. But all the fun may come to an end if the witch Hydia has her way! Can the Ponies defeat Hydia and her evil daughters, Reeka and Draggle? More importantly, can they save Ponyland from the witches’ concoction, the strange purple goo called Smooze, that’s threatening to bury the whole town?', 'The first day of Spring is on its way and the Little Ponies are preparing for it with a big festival. But all the fun may come to an end if the witch Hydia has her way! Can the Ponies defeat Hydia and her evil daughters, Reeka and Draggle? More importantly, can they save Ponyland from the witches’ concoction, the strange purple goo called Smooze, that’s threatening to bury the whole town?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB0nNtMedX30xiymlGxArmh2BQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25400'),
  ('814871472407922420', 'My Little Pony: The Movie', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jayson Thiessen, Anthony Di Ninno', 'Meghan McCarthy, Michael Vogel, Rita Hsiao', 'Tara Strong, Ashleigh Ball, Andrea Libman, Tabitha St. Germain, Cathy Weseluck, Emily Blunt, Michael Peña, Liev Schreiber', 'PG', 'A new dark force threatens Ponyville, and the Mane 6 – Twilight Sparkle, Applejack, Rainbow Dash, Pinkie Pie, Fluttershy and Rarity – embark on an unforgettable journey beyond Equestria where they meet new friends and exciting challenges on a quest to use the magic of friendship and save their home.', 'A new dark force threatens Ponyville, and the Mane 6 – Twilight Sparkle, Applejack, Rainbow Dash, Pinkie Pie, Fluttershy and Rarity – embark on an unforgettable journey beyond Equestria where they meet new friends and exciting challenges on a quest to use the magic of friendship and save their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiJRCzcZSVs9xPHoEKZRp80TyTA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335360'),
  ('407542931864191164', 'My Little Pony: The Runaway Rainbow', 2006, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Victor Dal Chele', 'Jeanne Romano', 'Kathleen Barr, Maryke Hendrikse, Janyse Jaud, Adrienne Carter, Brian Drummond, Andrea Libman, Britt McKillip, Kelly Sheridan', 'G', 'Rainbow Dash loves the time of year when Ponyville and Breezie Blossom are all about celebrating rainbows. Meanwhile in a new magical place called Unicornia, Rarity is being taught how to be a Unicorn Princess and the importance of making the first rainbow of the season. But she is quite a little rascal and embarks on an incredible ride, a huge adventure (with lots of mishaps) as she tries to get back to Unicornia. Rarity soon realizes that getting home in time to create the first rainbow of season is not an easy thing to do --- but it is fun!', 'Rainbow Dash loves the time of year when Ponyville and Breezie Blossom are all about celebrating rainbows. Meanwhile in a new magical place called Unicornia, Rarity is being taught how to be a Unicorn Princess and the importance of making the first rainbow of the season. But she is quite a little rascal and embarks on an incredible ride, a huge adventure (with lots of mishaps) as she tries to get back to Unicornia. Rarity soon realizes that getting home in time to create the first rainbow of season is not an easy thing to do --- but it is fun!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnEqkXi0oUo9jlQCUzhCN0Vxyx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256439'),
  ('1085625071239539315', 'My Little Princess', 2011, 'Drama', 'Éva Ionesco, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Philippe Le Guay, Marc Cholodenko, Éva Ionesco', 'Isabelle Huppert, Anamaria Vartolomei, Georgetta Leahu, Denis Lavant, Jethro Cave, Louis-Do de Lencquesaing, Pascal Bongard, Anne Benoît', null, 'Young Violetta and her mother Hannah are a peculiar couple. Ten-year-old Violetta lives a quiet life with her grandmother, while her mother Hannah is an unpredictable photographer who lives off of the generosity of others. When Hannah forces her daughter to pose as a model, Violetta finds her life with her loving grandmother turned upside down.The resulting pictures quickly become a sensation for the trendy 70''s Paris art scene, and Violetta finds herself caught in between her new stature as an art muse and her dull childhood.', 'Young Violetta and her mother Hannah are a peculiar couple. Ten-year-old Violetta lives a quiet life with her grandmother, while her mother Hannah is an unpredictable photographer who lives off of the generosity of others. When Hannah forces her daughter to pose as a model, Violetta finds her life with her loving grandmother turned upside down.The resulting pictures quickly become a sensation for the trendy 70''s Paris art scene, and Violetta finds herself caught in between her new stature as an art muse and her dull childhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uHBBHx7AXfk3tNhy3zYgF8DttYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78363'),
  ('1031827015759191108', 'My Little Sister', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jérôme Dassier, Géraldine Rod, Roman Hüben', 'Stéphanie Chuat, Véronique Reymond', 'Nina Hoss, Lars Eidinger, Marthe Keller, Jens Albinus, Thomas Ostermeier, Linne-Lu Lungershausen, Noah Tscharland, Isabelle Caillat', null, 'Berlin playwright Lisa follows her husband Martin to Switzerland, where he manages a private school. However, when her twin brother Sven’s leukaemia begins to wreak havoc on his health, she decides she must return to her roots, which has significant consequences for her relationship.', 'Berlin playwright Lisa follows her husband Martin to Switzerland, where he manages a private school. However, when her twin brother Sven’s leukaemia begins to wreak havoc on his health, she decides she must return to her roots, which has significant consequences for her relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1vBPNlmpfn7TPuwMgoutfA6N2bZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659967'),
  ('817959239440574346', 'My Little Sweet Pea', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Takayuki Shida, Kensuke Tsukuda', 'Keisuke Yoshida, Ryo Nishihara', 'Maki Horikita, Ryuhei Matsuda, Kimiko Yo, Yoichi Nukumizu, Yumi Aso, Guadalcanal Taka, Eri Fuse, Amane Okayama', null, 'It isn''t easy to find a dream to chase when you''re young, but Mugiko has one: she can''t wait to become an anime voice actress. Saving up for classes while she works part time in a manga store, she lives with her older, gambler brother after her father''s death. When the mother she never knew turns up out of nowhere and moves in, it only causes irritation for the aspiring otaku. But when her mother just as quickly disappears, it leaves Mugiko (or "Sweet Pea") searching for answers, bringing her back to her mother''s hometown to discover what happened to her mother''s own dream.', 'It isn''t easy to find a dream to chase when you''re young, but Mugiko has one: she can''t wait to become an anime voice actress. Saving up for classes while she works part time in a manga store, she lives with her older, gambler brother after her father''s death. When the mother she never knew turns up out of nowhere and moves in, it only causes irritation for the aspiring otaku. But when her mother just as quickly disappears, it leaves Mugiko (or "Sweet Pea") searching for answers, bringing her back to her mother''s hometown to discover what happened to her mother''s own dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FiyCLKL1p5XQV1ai1Cs1T71ZZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279180'),
  ('425298186798837598', 'My Lord', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Family', 'Raju Murugan, Nirav Shah, Arunmozhi Pandian', 'Raju Murugan', 'M. Sasikumar, Chaithra J Achar, R Muruganatham, Prasath Somasekar, Knack Studios', null, 'A man and his wife battle bureaucracy after being wrongly declared dead, while he confronts a kidney trafficking ring connected to corrupt politicians that destroyed his life.', 'A man and his wife battle bureaucracy after being wrongly declared dead, while he confronts a kidney trafficking ring connected to corrupt politicians that destroyed his life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4KeSDSdO327dOYcjbkeQPJ9c73I.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-lord-2026'),
  ('224459253111263153', 'My Love', 2006, 'Animation, Drama, Romance', 'Aleksandr Petrov, Sergey Reshetnikov', 'Aleksandr Petrov, Mikhail Tumelya, Tatyana Pavlovich', 'Alexandra Zhivova, Yevgeniya Kryukova, Nina Ruslanova, Sergey Garmash, Aleksandr Palamishev, Oleg Shcherbinin, Aleksandr Oleshko, Mikhail Gheorghiu', null, 'In nineteenth-century Russia, a teenage boy in search of love is drawn to two very different women.', 'In nineteenth-century Russia, a teenage boy in search of love is drawn to two very different women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFy7fz3P7TDb0XTHjLF7zkQzCLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104522'),
  ('178701772269363447', 'My Love', 2021, 'Romance, Drama', 'Xiaozhu Long, Tian Han', 'Tian Han, Tingting Jiao', 'Greg Hsu, Zhang Ruonan, Ding Guansen, Liang Jingkang, Li Wai-Sing', null, 'Tells the 15-year love story between Zhou Xiao Qi, a long-time swimming student and You Yong Ci, a transfer student. In high school, Zhou Xiao Qi fell in love at first sight with You Yong Ci. A young and ignorant pure love, the boy silently guarded, but the girl left without saying goodbye. Life after that, 15 years of love long-distance race. Your wedding is also my coming-of-age gift.', 'Tells the 15-year love story between Zhou Xiao Qi, a long-time swimming student and You Yong Ci, a transfer student. In high school, Zhou Xiao Qi fell in love at first sight with You Yong Ci. A young and ignorant pure love, the boy silently guarded, but the girl left without saying goodbye. Life after that, 15 years of love long-distance race. Your wedding is also my coming-of-age gift.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2nsoI0iS0ToExEvIoKIR9G9NSSy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723640'),
  ('643335846941221356', 'My Love Story!!', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Hayato Kawai, Go KINOMOTO', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Ryohei Suzuki, Mei Nagano, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Yasufumi Terawaki, Sawa Suzuki, Kentaro Ito, Ryo Shinoda, Mao Nakagawa', null, 'Takeo Goda is a high school student 2 m tall and weighting more than 100 kg. He has a righteous character. The male students adore him, but female students do not like him. All of the girls Takeo likes prefer his handsome friend Makoto Sunakawa.', 'Takeo Goda is a high school student 2 m tall and weighting more than 100 kg. He has a righteous character. The male students adore him, but female students do not like him. All of the girls Takeo likes prefer his handsome friend Makoto Sunakawa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7Mj61wQpsp55Yqvvx9pktG3ZDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356156'),
  ('623533159507387781', 'My Love, Don''t Cross That River', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Jin Mo-young, Jin Mo-young, Park Hyuck-jee', 'Jin Mo-young', 'Cho Byeong-man, Kang Gye-yeol', null, 'There lives a couple known as "100-year-old lovebirds". They''re like fairy tale characters: the husband is strong like a woodman, and the wife is full of charms like a princess. They dearly love each other, wear Korean traditional clothes together, and still fall asleep hand in hand. However, death, quietly and like a thief, sits between them. This film starts from that moment, and follows the last moments of 76 years of their marriage.', 'There lives a couple known as "100-year-old lovebirds". They''re like fairy tale characters: the husband is strong like a woodman, and the wife is full of charms like a princess. They dearly love each other, wear Korean traditional clothes together, and still fall asleep hand in hand. However, death, quietly and like a thief, sits between them. This film starts from that moment, and follows the last moments of 76 years of their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoTf5oXlG8mkTV6eOwu0H04Vlud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306598'),
  ('1009195258861487478', 'My Love, My Bride', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Choi Joo-young, Lim Chan-sang, Na Jun-o', 'Kim Ji-hye', 'Shin Min-a, Cho Jung-seok, Seo Kang-joon, Yoon Jung-hee, Bae Sung-woo, Ra Mi-ran, Lee Si-eon, Ko Kyu-pil', null, 'When Young-min and Mi-young marry each other after they graduate college, they experience different challenges that test their relationship.', 'When Young-min and Mi-young marry each other after they graduate college, they experience different challenges that test their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bR8wSU3PjUQCB76fvQXBSjy8S7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297558'),
  ('932927043299986205', 'My Lovely Angel', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lee Chang-won, Oh Sung-taek, Kwon Sung-mo', 'Lee Chang-won', 'Jin Goo, Jung Seo-yeon, Kang Shin-il, Jang Hye-jin, Park Ye-ni, Bang Eun-jeong, Park Hui-eun, Jang Yoon-jung', null, 'A life-changing story of a man who has lived as a loner his entire life. Jae Shik begins to live together with a child with a hearing-visual disability, as they change each other''s lives and try to find a way to communicate.', 'A life-changing story of a man who has lived as a loner his entire life. Jae Shik begins to live together with a child with a hearing-visual disability, as they change each other''s lives and try to find a way to communicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE3cQo7f9voSaCKDb7GeIjobw4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:817485'),
  ('303442902910905262', 'My Lover, My Son', 1970, 'Drama', 'John Newland, David Muir', 'Jenni Hall, William Marchant, Wilbur Stark', 'Romy Schneider, Donald Houston, Dennis Waterman, Patricia Brake, Peter Sallis, William Dexter, Alexandra Bastedo, Mark Hawkins', 'R', 'A woman deals with an unhappy marriage, the death of her lover, and her son''s involvement in a crime.', 'A woman deals with an unhappy marriage, the death of her lover, and her son''s involvement in a crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQTASCy90UIaJztaNgvbyouttFB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4373'),
  ('78585794650878154', 'My Loves', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Franco Di Giacomo, Neri Parenti', 'Jaja Fiastri', 'Monica Vitti, Johnny Dorelli, Enrico Maria Salerno, Edwige Fenech, Pietro Zardini, Maria Tedeschi', null, 'Annalisa is married to Marco, a journalist too busy with her career, who neglects her even though she loves him deeply. He therefore decides to find another husband, the university professor Antonio, who marries without the first being able to notice it. Until she gets pregnant.', 'Annalisa is married to Marco, a journalist too busy with her career, who neglects her even though she loves him deeply. He therefore decides to find another husband, the university professor Antonio, who marries without the first being able to notice it. Until she gets pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7odrkRgQMSMp1DqNEjCLniSQJ6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195390'),
  ('579785678815920694', 'My Lucky Star', 2012, 'Drama', 'Anne Fassio', 'Ariane Fert', 'Christopher Lambert, Claude Brasseur, Fleur Lise, Juliette de Prigny, Franck Gourlat, Antoine Berry Roger', null, 'In Normandy, Louise lives happily in the horse world. Suddenly, fate strikes. Louise left alone with his father and a family friend to Ferronnière the stud where she has always lived. Business is bad, they are on the verge of bankruptcy ... Fortunately there Marquise, a young mare Louise high. Against all odds, the girl and Marquise will fight against the fate that seems hell-bent ...', 'In Normandy, Louise lives happily in the horse world. Suddenly, fate strikes. Louise left alone with his father and a family friend to Ferronnière the stud where she has always lived. Business is bad, they are on the verge of bankruptcy ... Fortunately there Marquise, a young mare Louise high. Against all odds, the girl and Marquise will fight against the fate that seems hell-bent ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLQbvmP40paRTmha8gBWjhexYEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123018'),
  ('630091176118885289', 'My Lucky Star', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Dennie Gordon, Armando Salas, Wu Gang', 'Chris Chow, Amy Snow, Sean Huang', 'Zhang Ziyi, Leehom Wang, Ruby Lin, Yao Chen, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Terri Kwan, Ryan Zheng, Jack Kao', null, 'A bumbling amateur cartoonist tags along on a secret agent''s mission to retrieve a priceless diamond.', 'A bumbling amateur cartoonist tags along on a secret agent''s mission to retrieve a priceless diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szLwgjHmmrDdFfDVnFnboNoex8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:220488'),
  ('66430183061962987', 'My Lucky Stars', 1985, 'Action, Comedy', 'Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wu Shih', 'Barry Wong Ping-Yiu', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Jackie Chan, Yuen Biao, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Charlie Chin Chiang-Lin, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Sibelle Hu Hui-Chung', null, 'Two Hong Kong cops are sent to Tokyo to catch an ex-cop who stole a large amount of money in diamonds. After one is captured by the Ninja-gang protecting the rogue cop, the other one gets his old Orphanage gang, dubbed the "Five Lucky Stars," to help him. They don''t like this much, but they do it.', 'Two Hong Kong cops are sent to Tokyo to catch an ex-cop who stole a large amount of money in diamonds. After one is captured by the Ninja-gang protecting the rogue cop, the other one gets his old Orphanage gang, dubbed the "Five Lucky Stars," to help him. They don''t like this much, but they do it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZzHBIcJsld2XMvwR75OZGf4NM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10044'),
  ('194375074246745409', 'My Magical Friend Sams', 2003, 'Family', 'Ben Verbong, Jan Fehse', 'Ulrich Limmer', 'Ulrich Noethen, Christine Urspruch, Dominique Horwitz, Armin Rohde, Eva Mattes, Ina Weisse, Jasmin Tabatabai, Constantin Gastmann', null, 'Sams in danger, it is said, when Mr. Taschenbier''s son Martin brings the Sams back into the household, which, however, is kidnapped shortly afterwards by the sports teacher because of his special skills.', 'Sams in danger, it is said, when Mr. Taschenbier''s son Martin brings the Sams back into the household, which, however, is kidnapped shortly afterwards by the sports teacher because of his special skills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pKh44yc0TUlkJt947qPaal8KQni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75897'),
  ('743465767960803306', 'My Man', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Pierre Lhomme, Bertrand Blier', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Anouk Grinberg, Gérard Lanvin, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Olivier Martinez, Dominique Lollia, Dominique Valadié, Jacques François, Robert Hirsch', null, 'In Lyon, where many are unemployed, Marie is a prostitute who loves her work: she''s thoughtful and exuberant toward clients old and young, slim or flabby. One night, a homeless man sleeps in the foyer of her apartment house; she gives him a hot meal, then a place on the floor to sleep by her radiator, then she offers herself. She falls in love, giving him new life, clothes, a place to live. When he grouses that he must bar hop while she uses the flat for her work, she finds them a larger flat. He grows restless, seducing a manicurist and pressing her to prostitution. He''s arrested for procuring, so Marie must decide what to do; he, too, must face the consequences of his choices.', 'In Lyon, where many are unemployed, Marie is a prostitute who loves her work: she''s thoughtful and exuberant toward clients old and young, slim or flabby. One night, a homeless man sleeps in the foyer of her apartment house; she gives him a hot meal, then a place on the floor to sleep by her radiator, then she offers herself. She falls in love, giving him new life, clothes, a place to live. When he grouses that he must bar hop while she uses the flat for her work, she finds them a larger flat. He grows restless, seducing a manicurist and pressing her to prostitution. He''s arrested for procuring, so Marie must decide what to do; he, too, must face the consequences of his choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2vNKPMD1JnsgOV0Adimhd9vIPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48709'),
  ('701300012561400479', 'My Man', 2014, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Kazuyoshi Kumakiri, Ryuto Kondo, Atsushi Unno', 'Takashi Ujita', 'Tadanobu Asano, Fumi Nikaido, Tatsuya Fuji, Kengo Kora, Moro Morooka, Aoba Kawai, Mochika Yamada, Taiga Nakano', null, 'As a young child, Hana loses her family to a devastating tsunami that wipes out her town. At a shelter, distant relative Jungo sees her wandering and adopts her as his daughter.', 'As a young child, Hana loses her family to a devastating tsunami that wipes out her town. At a shelter, distant relative Jungo sees her wandering and adopts her as his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74GsGG2geJF3axg1Djw8cmzWdto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273096'),
  ('213749052649829466', 'My Man Godfrey', 1936, 'Comedy', 'Charles Previn, Gregory La Cava, Ted Tetzlaff', 'Morrie Ryskind, Eric Hatch', 'William Powell, Carole Lombard, Alice Brady, Gail Patrick, Eugene Pallette, Jean Dixon, Alan Mowbray, Mischa Auer', 'NR', 'Fifth Avenue socialite Irene Bullock needs a "forgotten man" to win a scavenger hunt, and no one is more forgotten than Godfrey Park, who resides in a dump by the East River. Irene hires Godfrey as a servant for her riotously unhinged family, to the chagrin of her spoiled sister, Cornelia, who tries her best to get Godfrey fired. As Irene falls for her new butler, Godfrey turns the tables and teaches the frivolous Bullocks a lesson or two.', 'Fifth Avenue socialite Irene Bullock needs a "forgotten man" to win a scavenger hunt, and no one is more forgotten than Godfrey Park, who resides in a dump by the East River. Irene hires Godfrey as a servant for her riotously unhinged family, to the chagrin of her spoiled sister, Cornelia, who tries her best to get Godfrey fired. As Irene falls for her new butler, Godfrey turns the tables and teaches the frivolous Bullocks a lesson or two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtfOW7fIxBZWY78rvUoPpWhMSiR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13562'),
  ('422637102199211313', 'My Man Godfrey', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Henry Koster, Frank Shaw, William H. Daniels', 'William Bowers, Peter Berneis, Everett Freeman', 'June Allyson, David Niven, Jessie Royce Landis, Robert Keith, Eva Gabor, Jay Robinson, Martha Hyer, Jeff Donnell', null, 'The eccentric Bullock household again need a new butler. Daughter Irene encounters bedraggled Godfrey Godfrey at the docks and, fancying him and noticing his obviously good manners, gets him the job. He proves a great success, but keeps his past to himself. When an old flame turns up Irene''s sister Cordelia starts making waves.', 'The eccentric Bullock household again need a new butler. Daughter Irene encounters bedraggled Godfrey Godfrey at the docks and, fancying him and noticing his obviously good manners, gets him the job. He proves a great success, but keeps his past to himself. When an old flame turns up Irene''s sister Cordelia starts making waves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qXWyhDDoQH2WEc3KecjRmu6QC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52470'),
  ('443155979272497437', 'My Massive Cock', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Mike Nicholls, Ruben Pracas, Steve Robson', null, 'Matt Barr, Julia Davis, Andy Lee', null, 'An extra-large penis is an object of desire for many. But for some men, extra-large seriously complicates their lives and relationships, and penis reduction surgery seems the only answer.', 'An extra-large penis is an object of desire for many. But for some men, extra-large seriously complicates their lives and relationships, and penis reduction surgery seems the only answer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlvj1XbkHVItYE0ko4Xg4L08Ycj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1040159'),
  ('199915380862759891', 'My Masterpiece', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Verónica Biasin, Renata Biagiola, Mariano Biasin', 'Gastón Duprat, Andrés Duprat', 'Guillermo Francella, Luis Brandoni, Raúl Arévalo, Andrea Frigerio, María Soldi, Santiago Korovsky, Mucio Manchini, Julio Marticorena', null, 'Arturo, the successful owner of an art gallery, and Renzo, a talented but decadent painter, are old friends who cannot stop bickering. One day, Arturo comes up with a solution to all their problems, but the plan they concoct turns out to be crazier and riskier than they originally expected.', 'Arturo, the successful owner of an art gallery, and Renzo, a talented but decadent painter, are old friends who cannot stop bickering. One day, Arturo comes up with a solution to all their problems, but the plan they concoct turns out to be crazier and riskier than they originally expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYlCD0fyYlKHQytjsWhFZivaNE1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535692'),
  ('1006683070202862969', 'My Memories of Old Beijing', 1983, 'Drama', 'Cao Weiye, Wu Yigong', 'Ming Yi', 'Shen Jie, Zhang Fengyi, Zheng Zhenyao, Zhang Min, Yan Xiang, Qin Yan, Hong Rong, Yuan Jiayi', null, 'It is the late 1920s when six-year-old Yingzi and her family move to Beijing. As Yingzi explores the busy streets and alleys, she befriends a widow who, driven mad by grief, stands vigil at the entrance of her hutong, waiting for her missing daughter to return.', 'It is the late 1920s when six-year-old Yingzi and her family move to Beijing. As Yingzi explores the busy streets and alleys, she befriends a widow who, driven mad by grief, stands vigil at the entrance of her hutong, waiting for her missing daughter to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRVAOXMCgvLN3Hl2UoScviwIZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195237'),
  ('526150257062901772', 'My Mexican Bretzel', 2020, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'Nuria Giménez, Frank A. Lorang', 'Nuria Giménez', 'Ilse G. Ringier, Frank A. Lorang', null, 'Lies are just another way of telling the truth. The desire to believe is the hand of the man hanging from a cliff and clinging to the only stone that would seem to save him. But he always ends up falling because the stone is a mirage, just as the cliff is. Death is awakening from this dream in which the essential can be said and in which the continuous and infinite has a beginning, an end and a meaning.', 'Lies are just another way of telling the truth. The desire to believe is the hand of the man hanging from a cliff and clinging to the only stone that would seem to save him. But he always ends up falling because the stone is a mirage, just as the cliff is. Death is awakening from this dream in which the essential can be said and in which the continuous and infinite has a beginning, an end and a meaning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23CxfKLM0vI9mhSm6i6rtPbDkTL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662922'),
  ('672127002264297620', 'My Mighty Princess', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kwak Jae-yong, Choi Seok-jae', 'Kwak Jae-yong', 'On Ju-wan, Shin Min-a, Yoo Gun, Jung Ho-bin, Im Ye-jin, Choi Jae-sung, Cha Tae-hyun, Park Hwi-soon', null, 'So-hwi is a martial arts prodigy and college student. Realizing that her superhuman strength is holding back her love life, she decides to quit martial arts to pursue handsome hockey player Joon-mo. But Joon-mo is in love with an older woman, and when So-hwi''s mystical martial arts community comes under threat from an old enemy, Heuk-bong, her childhood friend Il-yeong must persuade her to return.', 'So-hwi is a martial arts prodigy and college student. Realizing that her superhuman strength is holding back her love life, she decides to quit martial arts to pursue handsome hockey player Joon-mo. But Joon-mo is in love with an older woman, and when So-hwi''s mystical martial arts community comes under threat from an old enemy, Heuk-bong, her childhood friend Il-yeong must persuade her to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFpZjurGhtvBa1Jyzfw58Me7ZQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19627'),
  ('910224669670289635', 'My Missing Valentine', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Chou Yi-hsien, Chen Yu-hsun', 'Chen Yu-hsun', 'Liu Kuan-ting, Patty Lee, Duncan Chow, Joanne Missingham, Lian-yu Huang, Mei Zhao-Lin, Tai-Jui Wu, Bai Xiao-Ying', null, 'Xiao Chi, a driven girl who''s been looking for love, gets asked out by a hot guy on the eve of Valentine''s Day. As she anticipates her first date, she wakes up the next morning and finds that the Valentine''s Day has mysteriously passed.', 'Xiao Chi, a driven girl who''s been looking for love, gets asked out by a hot guy on the eve of Valentine''s Day. As she anticipates her first date, she wakes up the next morning and finds that the Valentine''s Day has mysteriously passed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BLrHWfQ3Tz39GpyBRL2qM53dEl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733573'),
  ('598234591298628325', 'My Mistress', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Geoffrey Simpson, Stephen Lance', 'Stephen Lance, Gerard Lee', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Harrison Gilbertson, Rachael Blake, Socratis Otto, Leah Purcell, John Reynolds, Malcolm Kennard, Robyn Moore', null, 'After the death of his father, a 16-year-old boy struggles with anger and instability, distancing himself from his mother. His search for escape leads him to a lonely dominatrix living nearby, a woman accustomed to giving and controlling pain. Drawn to her world, he seeks both solace and love, while she finds herself pulled into a bond that neither expected but both need.', 'After the death of his father, a 16-year-old boy struggles with anger and instability, distancing himself from his mother. His search for escape leads him to a lonely dominatrix living nearby, a woman accustomed to giving and controlling pain. Drawn to her world, he seeks both solace and love, while she finds herself pulled into a bond that neither expected but both need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5hLODk4cnYZ7OQGBhs1EpulZDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282672'),
  ('15032301052395384', 'My Mom Jayne', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Mariska Hargitay, Tony Hardmon', null, 'Jayne Mansfield, Mariska Hargitay, Jayne Marie Mansfield, Mickey Hargitay Jr., Zoltan Hargitay, Tony Cimber, Ellen Hargitay, Rusty Strait', 'NR', 'Through deeply personal interviews with her siblings and an examination of the photographs, letters, and belongings left behind, Mariska assembles a new portrait of her mother Jayne Mansfield, an extraordinary and complex woman.', 'Through deeply personal interviews with her siblings and an examination of the photographs, letters, and belongings left behind, Mariska assembles a new portrait of her mother Jayne Mansfield, an extraordinary and complex woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6KpfMouMavYr1UwTz6612YhYjbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1461714'),
  ('418768558092902524', 'My Mom''s a Werewolf', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Bryan England, Michael Fischa, Eric Davies', 'Mark Pirro', 'Susan Blakely, John Saxon, Tina Caspary, John Schuck, Diana Barrows, Ruth Buzzi, Marcia Wallace, Geno Silva', 'PG', 'The frustrated housewife Leslie visits an animal shop to purchase a flea-collar. Unknowing that the owner is a werewolf, she accepts his invitation to lunch and later in his apartment. Through a bite in her toe he starts her slow transformation in a werewolf. Home again, she desperately tries to hide the often disgusting process from her family, but her daughter Jennifer and her - from horror magazines well educated - friend recognize what''s going on, and help to kill the non-human.', 'The frustrated housewife Leslie visits an animal shop to purchase a flea-collar. Unknowing that the owner is a werewolf, she accepts his invitation to lunch and later in his apartment. Through a bite in her toe he starts her slow transformation in a werewolf. Home again, she desperately tries to hide the often disgusting process from her family, but her daughter Jennifer and her - from horror magazines well educated - friend recognize what''s going on, and help to kill the non-human.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Wu3uPNbmmaAsZI1CFK6PY87XGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2199'),
  ('650346022381176748', 'My Mom''s Letter from Heaven', 2019, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Michael M. Scott', 'Lisa Di Trolio', 'Barry Watson, Jordyn Ashley Olson, Karen Holness, Cindy Busby, Jaime M. Callica, Jasmine Miriguay, Heather-Claire Nortey, Beverley Breuer', null, 'A single father has a fractious relationship with his rebellious teenage daughter. When a lost letter written to the daughter from her dying mother is miraculously found, everything starts to turn around.', 'A single father has a fractious relationship with his rebellious teenage daughter. When a lost letter written to the daughter from her dying mother is miraculously found, everything starts to turn around.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppT0B7R5VYY8BykxHPqQJTaWMKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:646391'),
  ('812658728003013886', 'My Mom''s New Boyfriend', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'George Gallo, Michael Negrin, Andrea V. Rossotto', 'George Gallo', 'Meg Ryan, Antonio Banderas, Colin Hanks, Selma Blair, John Valdetero, Eli Danker, Tom Adams, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'After several years away, FBI agent Henry Durand returns to find his mother, Marty, a much different person: Having long mourned for Henry''s father, she is now embracing single life. One day, while Marty, Henry and his new fiancée, Emily, are out for a walk, they meet Tommy, a mysterious stranger with whom Marty then becomes involved. However, through his FBI contacts, Henry learns that Tommy is suspected of being an art thief. As a young federal agent, Henry is given a difficult assignment: spy on his mother and her boyfriend who is suspected of leading a gang of art thieves.', 'After several years away, FBI agent Henry Durand returns to find his mother, Marty, a much different person: Having long mourned for Henry''s father, she is now embracing single life. One day, while Marty, Henry and his new fiancée, Emily, are out for a walk, they meet Tommy, a mysterious stranger with whom Marty then becomes involved. However, through his FBI contacts, Henry learns that Tommy is suspected of being an art thief. As a young federal agent, Henry is given a difficult assignment: spy on his mother and her boyfriend who is suspected of leading a gang of art thieves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7EBefmFo8H6MdmbQ10lTlKXX1DA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9262'),
  ('567164975281700681', 'My Mommy is in America and She Met Buffalo Bill', 2013, 'Animation, Family', 'Thibaut Chatel, Marc Boreal', 'Stéphane Bernasconi, Jean Regnaud', 'Marc Lavoine, Julie Depardieu, Tom Trouffier, Alice Orsat, Théo Benhamour, Anatole Lebon, Alexandre Aubry, Évelyne Grandjean', null, 'Jean’s father is always busy at work, so he spends most of his time with his nanny Yvette and neighbour Michelle. His mother is away but nobody talks about her. Luckily Michelle is on hand to read postcards about Mum’s Wild West escapades and, even though they seem far fetched at times, they keep Jean happy. At school, the steel marbles Jean takes from his father’s factory are valuable playground currency but their removal has unexpected consequences.', 'Jean’s father is always busy at work, so he spends most of his time with his nanny Yvette and neighbour Michelle. His mother is away but nobody talks about her. Luckily Michelle is on hand to read postcards about Mum’s Wild West escapades and, even though they seem far fetched at times, they keep Jean happy. At school, the steel marbles Jean takes from his father’s factory are valuable playground currency but their removal has unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMqur5lFpmdESgKbgKPuREANiPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228492'),
  ('788850910306821611', 'My Mother', 2019, 'Family, Drama', 'Mustafa Kotan', 'Evren Erdoğan, Bener Karaçor, Ayşe Balıbey Tanıl', 'Sumru Yavrucuk, Özge Gürel, Sercan Badur, Tuna Orhan, Itır Esen, Fatma Toptaş, Fulya Özcan, Zuhal Acar', null, 'A self sacrificing, selfless mother who makes the impossible "possible" for her daughter - a daughter who is ashamed of her mother and wants to run away from her mother and her life with her. Her journey to the college drives Nazli away from the village she has grown up - but years later, she wants to go back to the village where she was born, back to her mother - after all those years passed by with tons of "I wish". Candan Ercetin performed her song "Annem - Mom" once again for the movie twenty years later.', 'A self sacrificing, selfless mother who makes the impossible "possible" for her daughter - a daughter who is ashamed of her mother and wants to run away from her mother and her life with her. Her journey to the college drives Nazli away from the village she has grown up - but years later, she wants to go back to the village where she was born, back to her mother - after all those years passed by with tons of "I wish". Candan Ercetin performed her song "Annem - Mom" once again for the movie twenty years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jgF7lAjTD2i3ctUkm5BKy9FWrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630191'),
  ('175709535711595061', 'My Mother Is Crazy', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Henry, Diane Kurys', 'Sacha Sperling, Pietro Caracciolo', 'Fanny Ardant, Vianney, Arielle Dombasle, Patrick Chesnais, Bart Harder, Ella Leyers, François Neycken, Georges Siatidis', null, 'A road trip comedy about a crazy mother who has a tense relationship with her son.', 'A road trip comedy about a crazy mother who has a tense relationship with her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6mf2OT05ybIqpWbzl1G3ZucUlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500902'),
  ('196576693186459521', 'My Mother Likes Women', 2002, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Omedes, Inés París, Daniela Féjerman', 'Inés París, Daniela Féjerman', 'Leonor Watling, Rosa María Sardà, María Pujalte, Silvia Abascal, Eliška Sirová, Chisco Amado, Álex Angulo, Xabier Elorriaga', null, 'Sofia introduces her three adult daughters to her new lover who is their age and happens to be a woman. The women, in particular Elvira find it extremely difficult to accept their mothers sudden apparent sexual reversal. The news pushes the neurotic Elvira to the point of nervous breakdown. Sol, the youngest daughter, writes a lude rock song about it and performs in front of them at a concert. The daughters plot together on how to get their mothers new girlfriend, a native Czech, and brilliant pianist, out of her life. Their plot goes terribly wrong and turns the film from a light-hearted comedy, into mildly amusing drama.', 'Sofia introduces her three adult daughters to her new lover who is their age and happens to be a woman. The women, in particular Elvira find it extremely difficult to accept their mothers sudden apparent sexual reversal. The news pushes the neurotic Elvira to the point of nervous breakdown. Sol, the youngest daughter, writes a lude rock song about it and performs in front of them at a concert. The daughters plot together on how to get their mothers new girlfriend, a native Czech, and brilliant pianist, out of her life. Their plot goes terribly wrong and turns the film from a light-hearted comedy, into mildly amusing drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afSbeXchTDtZ1TapTNLGcxT4lkm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97754'),
  ('1125889978872509664', 'My Mother the Mermaid', 2004, 'Romance, Fantasy', 'Park Heung-sik', 'Song Hye-jin, Park Heung-sik', 'Jeon Do-yeon, Park Hae-il, Goh Doo-shim, Park Myung-shin, Shin Dong-hwan, Kim Choo-wol, Lee Sun-kyun, Yoon Ga-hyun', null, 'Na-young works at a post office and is sick and tired of being around her shamefully unyielding mother and her pushover father who''s excessively nice. The only thing that she can look forward to is her trip abroad in a few days. But one day, her father leaves home without any notice. Her mother doesn''t care what happens to him and doesn''t care to look for him. Na-young has no choice but to give up her dream trip abroad and to search for her father instead. Once she arrives at her parents'' hometown, Na-young is shocked to meet someone she''d never expect, even in her dreams.', 'Na-young works at a post office and is sick and tired of being around her shamefully unyielding mother and her pushover father who''s excessively nice. The only thing that she can look forward to is her trip abroad in a few days. But one day, her father leaves home without any notice. Her mother doesn''t care what happens to him and doesn''t care to look for him. Na-young has no choice but to give up her dream trip abroad and to search for her father instead. Once she arrives at her parents'' hometown, Na-young is shocked to meet someone she''d never expect, even in her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yjLps4IPgtzoGahlPnyiM0tI5G8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137298'),
  ('655483061183045628', 'My Mother-in-law Hates Me', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Andrés Feddersen, David Bravo, Jorge González Vasquez', 'Andrés Feddersen, Loretto Bernal', 'Loretto Bernal, Itatí Cantoral, Jerry Velazquez, Willy Semler, Alexis de Anda, Monserrat Jerez, Alejandro Velasco, Ricardo Badillo', null, 'Clara is a woman who has been rejected all her life for being extremely neat and clean. When the love of her life invites her to meet his family, Clara will do everything possible to win her approval without knowing that they are polar opposites: her mother-in-law is a compulsive hoarder, a nudist and an extreme vegetarian.', 'Clara is a woman who has been rejected all her life for being extremely neat and clean. When the love of her life invites her to meet his family, Clara will do everything possible to win her approval without knowing that they are polar opposites: her mother-in-law is a compulsive hoarder, a nudist and an extreme vegetarian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNiTmEqdA6mHn5ukswxHRF4z12r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049038'),
  ('164858503494297414', 'My Mother''s Castle', 1990, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Yves Robert, Robert Alazraki', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Yves Robert', 'Philippe Caubère, Nathalie Roussel, Didier Pain, Thérèse Liotard, Julien Ciamaca, Victorien Delamare, Joris Molinas, Pierre Maguelon', null, 'To his chagrin, young Marcel Pagnol and his family move back to their home in Marseille, France, far from their pastoral holiday cottage in the hills. Determined, Marcel makes the long voyage back to the cottage on foot and lands himself in trouble. One day Marcel''s father discovers a shortcut to the cottage, but it requires trespassing. Despite their trepidations, Marcel and his family begin using the secret trail to reach their cottage.', 'To his chagrin, young Marcel Pagnol and his family move back to their home in Marseille, France, far from their pastoral holiday cottage in the hills. Determined, Marcel makes the long voyage back to the cottage on foot and lands himself in trouble. One day Marcel''s father discovers a shortcut to the cottage, but it requires trespassing. Despite their trepidations, Marcel and his family begin using the secret trail to reach their cottage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw8Ec4jFuxSNCMUZiUpBKOMl65G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12717'),
  ('502651032582096730', 'My Mother''s Eyes', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Takeshi Kushida', null, 'Akane Ono, Shitara Mone, Takuma Izumi, Shusaku Uchida, Hidemasa Mase, Toki Koinuma, Kosuke Hoshi', null, 'Both Hitomi and her daughter Eri are cellists. One day, they are involved in a traffic accident and Hitomi loses her sight. She wears camera-equipped contact lenses and Eri, injured and hospitalized, wears VR goggles, and the two share one vision.', 'Both Hitomi and her daughter Eri are cellists. One day, they are involved in a traffic accident and Hitomi loses her sight. She wears camera-equipped contact lenses and Eri, injured and hospitalized, wears VR goggles, and the two share one vision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63QRcmHE4fiToVFY6Ds19nqIOoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152004'),
  ('219021838286976986', 'My Mother’s Friend 2', 2019, 'Romance', 'Lee Dong-hyun', null, 'Jeong-yeon, Do Mo-se, Han Jae-kyung, Park Joo-bin, Shin Yeon-woo, Lee Yoo-rin, Han Se-hee, Sang Woo', null, 'Tai Run is not satisfied with the cohabitation of his father who has been living again after two months of divorce and his young and sexy stepmother. But due to the failure of my father''s career and living alone with my stepmother, she began to become more and more like a woman. The two, who were getting closer and closer, eventually fell into an irreparable desire.', 'Tai Run is not satisfied with the cohabitation of his father who has been living again after two months of divorce and his young and sexy stepmother. But due to the failure of my father''s career and living alone with my stepmother, she began to become more and more like a woman. The two, who were getting closer and closer, eventually fell into an irreparable desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIN2PxRJd951ZKo4Vnf4NFzhcDB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068844'),
  ('266387899333856898', 'My Mother''s Lovers', 2020, 'Drama', 'Samuel Montes de Oca León', 'Lorena Moleres', 'César Acosta, Sandra Burgos, Alonso Esponda, Francisco Torres', null, 'Luisa has a habit of bringing her dates home, irritating her son, Cesar. When Cesar invites his best friend Pablo over for a sleepover, Luisa''s flirtations become too much to bear, especially as Cesar has his own feelings towards Pablo.', 'Luisa has a habit of bringing her dates home, irritating her son, Cesar. When Cesar invites his best friend Pablo over for a sleepover, Luisa''s flirtations become too much to bear, especially as Cesar has his own feelings towards Pablo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc3pngmysXdQswutyxr7LZxr9Eq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:705559'),
  ('130519683080794565', 'My Mother''s Smile', 2002, 'Drama', 'Pasquale Mari, Marco Bellocchio, Daniela Ceselli', 'Marco Bellocchio', 'Sergio Castellitto, Jacqueline Lustig, Chiara Conti, Gigio Alberti, Alberto Mondini, Gianfelice Imparato, Gianni Schicchi, Maurizio Donadoni', null, 'A celebrated painter receives a visit from a cardinal''s assistant, who informs him that his mother could become a saint.', 'A celebrated painter receives a visit from a cardinal''s assistant, who informs him that his mother could become a saint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8u1NKcKcNVhBEUxMeQL4WIggBps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65045'),
  ('480445417010475600', 'My Mother''s Tits', 2015, 'Drama', 'Carlos Zapata, Lucas Cristo', 'Samuel Pinazo', 'Billy Heins, Santiago Heins, Joseph Barrios, Paula Matura, Alejandro Aguilar, Héctor García, Angélica Blandón, Yuri Vargas', null, 'A young boy discovers his mom works as an exotic dancer in a local bar, so he decides to find the money to take her to Disney.', 'A young boy discovers his mom works as an exotic dancer in a local bar, so he decides to find the money to take her to Disney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfLeMXiZBhrMGQjNJffqFxBD2ms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417415'),
  ('522944477001201357', 'My Mother''s Wedding', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, Yves Bélanger, Zoe Liang', 'Kristin Scott Thomas, John Micklethwait', 'Scarlett Johansson, Sienna Miller, Emily Beecham, Kristin Scott Thomas, Freida Pinto, James Fleet, Mark Stanley, Sindhu Vee', null, 'Three sisters return to their home for the third wedding of their twice-widowed mother. But the mother and daughters are forced to revisit the past and confront the future, with help from a colorful group of unexpected wedding guests.', 'Three sisters return to their home for the third wedding of their twice-widowed mother. But the mother and daughters are forced to revisit the past and confront the future, with help from a colorful group of unexpected wedding guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feHTwv3BplNlLW3o9LtW2kqZLJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:985602'),
  ('1147274009158283063', 'My Mother''s Wound', 2016, 'Drama, War, Mystery', 'Ozan Açıktan, Bogumił Godfrejów', 'Fethi Kantarcı, Funda Çetin, Ozan Güven', 'Ozan Güven, Meryem Uzerli, Belçim Bilgin, Okan Yalabık, Bora Akkaş, Sabina Toziya, Sermet Yeşil, Koray Şahinbaş', null, 'Upon turning eight-teen, Salih leaves the orphanage to find his lost family and begins working in a Serbian farm. Suddenly, at the most unexpected moment he has found a home. Will he ever be able to let go of the ghosts of his past and be happy in this new life? As tension escalates disquieting secrets surface. A gripping tale of family, love and identity, My Mother''s Wound follows Salih as he searches for a trail of hope amongst war-torn lives.', 'Upon turning eight-teen, Salih leaves the orphanage to find his lost family and begins working in a Serbian farm. Suddenly, at the most unexpected moment he has found a home. Will he ever be able to let go of the ghosts of his past and be happy in this new life? As tension escalates disquieting secrets surface. A gripping tale of family, love and identity, My Mother''s Wound follows Salih as he searches for a trail of hope amongst war-torn lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3HX8UG0Pcrkz8A9kSFjYxbMhLGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:386591'),
  ('463465622958313056', 'My Motherland', 2023, 'Drama', 'Benoît Cohen, Bertrand Mouly, Bruce Isler', 'Eléonore Pourriat, Jim Birmant, Benoît Cohen', 'Fanny Ardant, Pierre Deladonchamps, Elisabeth Margoni, Suzy Bemba, Nawid Elham, Aurore Broutin, Jérôme Kircher, Jules Sagot', null, 'France has been living alone in her apartment since the death of her husband. When she hears on the radio that the Singa association puts homeless migrants in contact with people who can take them in, she decides, against the advice of her family, led by her son, to take in Reza, a young Afghan broken by war and exodus. This is the story of two worlds that collide, get used to each other and end up reaching out to each other.', 'France has been living alone in her apartment since the death of her husband. When she hears on the radio that the Singa association puts homeless migrants in contact with people who can take them in, she decides, against the advice of her family, led by her son, to take in Reza, a young Afghan broken by war and exodus. This is the story of two worlds that collide, get used to each other and end up reaching out to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGHak4pK4CDZ7sWg9jIm3sqZZn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049168'),
  ('78221710038660106', 'My Mystery Romance', 2026, 'Romance', 'Maude von Ehrenkrook', 'Maude Von Ehrenkrook', 'Charli St. Joan, Patrick M. Johnston, Suzanne Allen, Lasure Jones, Heather Bayles', null, 'Cora''s make-or-break mystery dinner erupts into chaos, but Liam steps in to help save the night, and maybe win her heart. When a real theft and a troubling rumor surface, she must decide if she can trust him before everything falls apart.', 'Cora''s make-or-break mystery dinner erupts into chaos, but Liam steps in to help save the night, and maybe win her heart. When a real theft and a troubling rumor surface, she must decide if she can trust him before everything falls apart.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fe%2Fgracenote%2Fe570778b49925a478d88d095b32bbed5.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-mystery-romance'),
  ('1144418641438611150', 'My Name Ain''t Johnny', 2008, 'Crime, Drama', 'Mauro Lima, Uli Burtin, Joana Cooper', 'Mauro Lima, Mariza Leão', 'Selton Mello, Cleo, Júlia Lemmertz, Cássia Kis, Eva Todor, André De Biase, Giulio Lopes, Felipe Severo', null, 'The true story of João Guilherme Estrella ("Johnny"), a young middle-class bon vivant who became a big-time cocaine dealer in Rio de Janeiro in the early 1990s.', 'The true story of João Guilherme Estrella ("Johnny"), a young middle-class bon vivant who became a big-time cocaine dealer in Rio de Janeiro in the early 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKDKutX0bCvg401k68U9Nt7EG0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17358'),
  ('290037675098342150', 'My Name Is Bernadette', 2011, 'Drama', 'Jean Sagols, Bernard Malaisy', 'Serge Lascar', 'Katia Miran, Michel Aumont, Francis Huster, Francis Perrin, Alessandra Martines, Alain Doutey, Gilles Lemaire, Nicolas Jouhet', null, 'Between February and July 1858, in the Massabielle cave, the Virgin appeared eighteen times to Bernadette Soubirous, a miserable little girl from Lourdes. A true revolution in the heart of the Second Empire that shakes the established order by his universal message of love and prayer.', 'Between February and July 1858, in the Massabielle cave, the Virgin appeared eighteen times to Bernadette Soubirous, a miserable little girl from Lourdes. A true revolution in the heart of the Second Empire that shakes the established order by his universal message of love and prayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rOk6PCpKKoN9XQW84yR9YuSVpbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397074'),
  ('1118206362746912718', 'My Name Is Bill W.', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Neil Roach, Daniel Petrie', 'William G. Borchert', 'James Woods, JoBeth Williams, James Garner, Gary Sinise, George Coe, Robert Harper, Ray Reinhardt, Fritz Weaver', null, 'Based on the true story of Bill W. (James Woods), a successful stock broker whose life falls apart after the stock crash of the 20''s and how he comes to grips with his alcoholism. Along with a fellow alcoholic (James Garner) he forms a support group that would eventually become Alcoholics Anonymous.', 'Based on the true story of Bill W. (James Woods), a successful stock broker whose life falls apart after the stock crash of the 20''s and how he comes to grips with his alcoholism. Along with a fellow alcoholic (James Garner) he forms a support group that would eventually become Alcoholics Anonymous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54Ggd8vaWs7PzGuTKLDsWP38OAv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15727'),
  ('410522948276674696', 'My Name Is Bruce', 2007, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy', 'Bruce Campbell, Kurt Rauf', 'Mark Verheiden', 'Bruce Campbell, Taylor Sharpe, Grace Thorsen, Ted Raimi, Ellen Sandweiss, Ben McCain, Timothy Patrick Quill, Logan Martin', 'R', 'B-movie Legend Bruce Campbell is mistaken for his character Ash from the Evil Dead trilogy and forced to fight a real monster in a small town in Oregon.', 'B-movie Legend Bruce Campbell is mistaken for his character Ash from the Evil Dead trilogy and forced to fight a real monster in a small town in Oregon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et2f1JBW533ZzYiCEA2T7nwzcs1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1961'),
  ('602772470041151382', 'My Name Is Francesco Totti', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Silvia Leonardo Muccino, Giorgio Melidoni, Alex Infascelli', 'Alex Infascelli, Vincenzo Scuccimarra', 'Francesco Totti, Ilary Blasi, Cafú, Alisson Becker, Gabriel Batistuta, Gianluigi Buffon, Andrea Pirlo, Fabio Cannavaro', null, 'Francesco Totti retraces his entire life while watching it on the silver screen together with the audience. Images and emotions flow among key moments of his career, scenes from his personal life and memories he has never shared before.', 'Francesco Totti retraces his entire life while watching it on the silver screen together with the audience. Images and emotions flow among key moments of his career, scenes from his personal life and memories he has never shared before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvB1CpIwqeyNPbuljkFjFl7OIU7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605255'),
  ('950928705125210970', 'My Name Is Harlequin', 1988, 'Drama, Crime', 'Valeri Rybarev, Boris Shangin, Feliks Kuchar', 'Valeriy Ribarev, Yuri Shchekochikhin', 'Oleg Fomin, Vitaly Alexeyev, Svetlana Kopylova, Lyudmila Gavrilova, Vladimir Pozhidayev, Olegar Fedoro, Serhiy Pidhornyi, Pyotr Kuleshov', null, 'A guy called Harlequin and his company, who call themselves "wolves", live at a stop near the city, where they often go to "relax" - in search of thrills. And they''re not just bullies, at least they think they are. They beat metalheads and fascists for ideological reasons, assert their simple order based on a special kind of justice and the right of the strong. In addition, Harlequin himself tries to think about complex universal values and connect them with the way of life he leads. However, he is faced with people who have their own order, not the same as the main character. And then the party life turns into a real tragedy.', 'A guy called Harlequin and his company, who call themselves "wolves", live at a stop near the city, where they often go to "relax" - in search of thrills. And they''re not just bullies, at least they think they are. They beat metalheads and fascists for ideological reasons, assert their simple order based on a special kind of justice and the right of the strong. In addition, Harlequin himself tries to think about complex universal values and connect them with the way of life he leads. However, he is faced with people who have their own order, not the same as the main character. And then the party life turns into a real tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddxts5olJpG1cxPfCKSequSUYHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222736'),
  ('994652579340480420', 'My Name Is Joe', 1998, 'Drama', 'Ken Loach, Barry Ackroyd, Mark Murdoch', 'Paul Laverty', 'Peter Mullan, Louise Goodall, David McKay, Gary Lewis, David Hayman, Lorraine McIntosh, Anne-Marie Kennedy, Stephen McCole', null, 'Two thirtysomethings, unemployed former alcoholic Joe and community health worker Sarah, start a romantic relationship in one of the toughest Glasgow neighbourhoods.', 'Two thirtysomethings, unemployed former alcoholic Joe and community health worker Sarah, start a romantic relationship in one of the toughest Glasgow neighbourhoods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9awu6tsCyWPAUA2eEoelFSTbcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8129'),
  ('17985128158154895', 'My Name Is Juani', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bigas Luna, Santiago Garrido Rua, Loreto Ormad', 'Bigas Luna, Carmen Chaves Gastaldo', 'Verónica Echegui, Dani Martín, Laya Martí, Gorka Lasaosa, José Chaves, Mercedes Hoyos, Ferran Madico, Marcos Campos', null, 'A pair of women leave their small town and dud boyfriends behind for fun in Madrid.', 'A pair of women leave their small town and dud boyfriends behind for fun in Madrid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVXnFjjiboNHsN9aE7Qy7K1k9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74052'),
  ('578099589347499373', 'My Name Is Julia Ross', 1945, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Burnett Guffey, Milton Feldman', 'Muriel Roy Bolton', 'Nina Foch, May Whitty, George Macready, Roland Varno, Anita Sharp-Bolster, Doris Lloyd, Queenie Leonard, Joy Harington', 'NR', 'Julia Ross secures employment with a wealthy widow and goes to live at her house. Two days later, she awakens in a different house in different clothes and with a new identity.', 'Julia Ross secures employment with a wealthy widow and goes to live at her house. Two days later, she awakens in a different house in different clothes and with a new identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofUTB5ojMTr6mndUxVQan5p8p2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42077'),
  ('1070005262865637498', 'My Name Is Loh Kiwan', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jung Hae-ji, Lim Won-geun, Kim Hee-jin', 'Kim Hee-jin', 'Song Joong-ki, Choi Sung-eun, Waël Sersoub, Cho Han-cheul, Kim Sung-ryung, Lee Il-hwa, Lee Sang-hee, Seo Hyun-woo', 'R', 'After defecting from North Korea, Loh Kiwan struggles to obtain refugee status in Belgium, where he encounters a dejected woman who has lost all hope.', 'After defecting from North Korea, Loh Kiwan struggles to obtain refugee status in Belgium, where he encounters a dejected woman who has lost all hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4BkphLO6abbGhceYEMhJERkvHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1039882'),
  ('247920569903069455', 'My Name Is Love', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Färdmar, Erik Persson, Joen Windahl', 'David Färdmar', 'Adam Lundgren, Jonas Rimeika, Alicia Vikander, Johan Carlberg, Poyan Karimi, Anna-Maria Lundberg, Ida Jensen, Johnny Johansson', null, 'Love and Sebastian meet each other by a coincidence at a street in the romantic Swedish summer night. They happen to share the same secret, but their encounter is going to cause severe consequences for the both of them. An innocent flirt soon turns in to a dangerously liaison.', 'Love and Sebastian meet each other by a coincidence at a street in the romantic Swedish summer night. They happen to share the same secret, but their encounter is going to cause severe consequences for the both of them. An innocent flirt soon turns in to a dangerously liaison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgnVgwrb4sSGhJGDnag3HgmUUTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100586'),
  ('1117945934767189116', 'My Name Is Modesty: A Modesty Blaise Adventure', 2004, 'Action, Thriller', 'Scott Spiegel, Vivi Drăgan Vasile', 'Janet Scott Batchler, Lee Batchler', 'Alexandra Staden, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Raymond Cruz, Fred Pearson, Valentin Teodosiu, Eugenia Yuan, Dragoș Bucur, Stephen Apostolina', null, 'Modesty, raised by a casino owner after being abandoned by her parents, has become skilled in the ways of fighting and now acts as the casino owner''s bodyguard. When she''s unable to prevent the owner''s murder at the hands of an old foe, Modesty is hell-bent on seeking revenge. --- An adaptation of the Modesty Blaise novels and comic strip by Peter O''Donnell.', 'Modesty, raised by a casino owner after being abandoned by her parents, has become skilled in the ways of fighting and now acts as the casino owner''s bodyguard. When she''s unable to prevent the owner''s murder at the hands of an old foe, Modesty is hell-bent on seeking revenge. --- An adaptation of the Modesty Blaise novels and comic strip by Peter O''Donnell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k2xL9z1Bwh7s4WLE9uNF6CE27Mo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20013'),
  ('723175134025591456', 'My Name Is Nobody', 1973, 'Comedy, Western', 'Tonino Valerii, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Ennio Morricone', 'Ernesto Gastaldi', 'Terence Hill, Henry Fonda, Jean Martin, R.G. Armstrong, Karl Braun, Leo Gordon, Steve Kanaly, Geoffrey Lewis', 'PG', 'Jack Beauregard, an aging gunman of the Old West, only wants to retire in peace and move to Europe, but a young gunfighter known as "Nobody" who idolizes Beauregard wants him to go out in a blaze of glory. So, he arranges for Jack to face the 150-man gang known as The Wild Bunch and earn his place in history.', 'Jack Beauregard, an aging gunman of the Old West, only wants to retire in peace and move to Europe, but a young gunfighter known as "Nobody" who idolizes Beauregard wants him to go out in a blaze of glory. So, he arranges for Jack to face the 150-man gang known as The Wild Bunch and earn his place in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJQEVI1p00Jh9TUgNEI623iu7ST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9474'),
  ('1000768586785231341', 'My Name Is Oona', 1969, null, 'Gunvor Nelson, Gunvor Nelson', null, 'Oona Nelson', null, 'Experimental film with Gunvor Nelson''s daughter Oona. The sound consists of Nelson’s daughter, Oona, repeating the names of the days of the week and of her saying “my name is Oona”. The latter is edited into an expressive rythmical structure that accompanies the visual structure of the film that plunges into the experience of a child where both bliss and fear reigns.', 'Experimental film with Gunvor Nelson''s daughter Oona. The sound consists of Nelson’s daughter, Oona, repeating the names of the days of the week and of her saying “my name is Oona”. The latter is edited into an expressive rythmical structure that accompanies the visual structure of the film that plunges into the experience of a child where both bliss and fear reigns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r64pBiG4urYy424xvFkpHMrYfyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128312'),
  ('262665462129132683', 'My Name Is Pecos', 1966, 'Western', 'Maurizio Lucidi, Franco Villa', 'Adriano Bolzoni', 'Robert Woods, Pier Paolo Capponi, Lucia Modugno, George Eastman, Peter Carsten, Luigi Casellato, Umberto Raho, Giuliano Raffaelli', null, 'Pecos Martinez rides into Houston looking to settle an old score with gang leader Clane, who is after the money that disappearred from a recent robbery. The hunt for the loot and Pecos'' quest become intertwined with the efforts of the locals to stay alive long enough for help to arrive.', 'Pecos Martinez rides into Houston looking to settle an old score with gang leader Clane, who is after the money that disappearred from a recent robbery. The hunt for the loot and Pecos'' quest become intertwined with the efforts of the locals to stay alive long enough for help to arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QtPp0S7hFTVte7v6Wo4crhIqd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144354'),
  ('172597924475466125', 'My Name Is Rocco Papaleo', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Claudio Cirillo, Giorgio Scotton', 'Ettore Scola, Ruggero Maccari', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Lauren Hutton, Tom Reed, Margot Novak, Umberto Travaglini, Paola Natale, Peter Goldfarb, André Farwagi', null, 'Rocco Papaleo, an optimistic and kind man from a mining town in Alaska, gets away from his company during a trip to Chicago and is increasingly disillusioned in the face of the city''s hostility.', 'Rocco Papaleo, an optimistic and kind man from a mining town in Alaska, gets away from his company during a trip to Chicago and is increasingly disillusioned in the face of the city''s hostility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VHs3TMDKJEAywBfUkHqyEY3z9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103942'),
  ('949036118463858615', 'My Name Is Sara', 2020, 'History, Drama', 'Joanna Ślesicka, Steven Oritt, Marian Prokop', 'David Himmelstein', 'Zuzanna Surowy, Konrad Cichon, Michalina Olszańska, Eryk Lubos, Iwona Bielska, Wiesław Komasa, Ryszard Ronczewski, Anna Korzeniecka', null, 'The true life-story of Sara Góralnik, a 13 year-old Polish Jew whose entire family was killed by Nazis in September of 1942. After a grueling escape to the Ukrainian countryside, Sara steals her Christian best friend’s identity and finds refuge in a small village, where she is taken in by a farmer and his young wife. She soon discovers the dark secrets of her employers’ marriage, compounding the greatest secret she must strive to protect, her true identity.', 'The true life-story of Sara Góralnik, a 13 year-old Polish Jew whose entire family was killed by Nazis in September of 1942. After a grueling escape to the Ukrainian countryside, Sara steals her Christian best friend’s identity and finds refuge in a small village, where she is taken in by a farmer and his young wife. She soon discovers the dark secrets of her employers’ marriage, compounding the greatest secret she must strive to protect, her true identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytazXDPHkEpIXYjaIBSaaQeoi5x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614764'),
  ('709484601342472285', 'My Name Is Tanino', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Paolo Virzì, Arnaldo Catinari, Karen McGarroch', 'Paolo Virzì, Francesco Piccolo, Francesco Bruni', 'Corrado Fortuna, Rachel McAdams, Jessica De Marco, Frank Crudele, Barry Flatman, Lori Hallier, Don Francks, Mary Long', null, 'During a sun-soaked Sicilian summer, aimless filmmaking undergrad and back-seat radical Tanino has a fling with Sally, a dreamy American tourist from an upper background. When summer ends, Sally flies back home, without ever reaching out. Clueless, a smitten Tanino decides to pay her a surprise visit under the pretense of returning a camera she left behind. But when he gets there, he quickly realizes the reality of America—and his relationship with Sally''s—is far from the idealized version his small-town boy imagination conjured.', 'During a sun-soaked Sicilian summer, aimless filmmaking undergrad and back-seat radical Tanino has a fling with Sally, a dreamy American tourist from an upper background. When summer ends, Sally flies back home, without ever reaching out. Clueless, a smitten Tanino decides to pay her a surprise visit under the pretense of returning a camera she left behind. But when he gets there, he quickly realizes the reality of America—and his relationship with Sally''s—is far from the idealized version his small-town boy imagination conjured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTjHTKPxZruhSW5g5bfHWvPq3nD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56378'),
  ('70196694246527285', 'My Name Is Thomas', 2018, 'Drama', 'Roberta Allegrini, Terence Hill', 'Terence Hill, Luisa Tonon', 'Terence Hill, Veronica Bitto, Guia Jelo, Eva Basteiro-Bertoli, Andy Luotto, Francesca Beggio, Giovanni Malafronte, Giuseppe Gandini', null, 'The story of a man who sets out on his motorcycle from Italy on a trip to the Spanish desert to find himself there. But the encounter with the young Maryam changes the plans of the adventure sustainable.', 'The story of a man who sets out on his motorcycle from Italy on a trip to the Spanish desert to find himself there. But the encounter with the young Maryam changes the plans of the adventure sustainable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVNwARMJvMHc737pgXzyVFF3GPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429710'),
  ('980334246980462218', 'My Name Is Vendetta', 2022, 'Action, Crime, Adventure, Thriller', 'Cosimo Gomez, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Enrico Mastracchi Manes', 'Cosimo Gomez, Sandrone Dazieri, Andrea Nobile', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Ginevra Francesconi, Remo Girone, Alessio Praticò, Francesco Villano, Gabriele Falsetta, Marcello Mazzarella, Mauro Lamanna', 'R', 'After old enemies kill his family, a former mafia enforcer and his feisty daughter flee to Milan, where they hide out while plotting their revenge.', 'After old enemies kill his family, a former mafia enforcer and his feisty daughter flee to Milan, where they hide out while plotting their revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7l3war94J4tRyWUiLAGokr3ViF2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873126'),
  ('787283454482492420', 'My Neighbor Adolf', 2022, 'Drama', 'Leon Prudovsky, Radek Ładczuk', 'Leon Prudovsky, Dmitry Malinsky', 'David Hayman, Udo Kier, Olivia Silhavy, Kineret Peled, Jaime Correa, Tomasz Sobczak, Danharry Colorado Cortes, Eyvar Fardi', null, 'South America, 1960. A lonely and grumpy Holocaust survivor convinces himself that his new neighbor is none other than Adolf Hitler. Not being taken seriously, he starts an independent investigation to prove his claim, but when the evidence still appears to be inconclusive, Polsky is forced to engage in a relationship with the enemy in order to obtain irrefutable proof.', 'South America, 1960. A lonely and grumpy Holocaust survivor convinces himself that his new neighbor is none other than Adolf Hitler. Not being taken seriously, he starts an independent investigation to prove his claim, but when the evidence still appears to be inconclusive, Polsky is forced to engage in a relationship with the enemy in order to obtain irrefutable proof.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa0wBvNVpawluKM8QRAVnP3QNbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997669'),
  ('925424515452822009', 'My Neighbor Totoro', 1988, 'Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Hisao Shirai, Tetsuya Endo', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Noriko Hidaka, Chika Sakamoto, Hitoshi Takagi, Shigesato Itoi, Sumi Shimamoto, Tanie Kitabayashi, Toshiyuki Amagasa, Yuko Maruyama', 'G', 'Two sisters move to the country with their father in order to be closer to their hospitalized mother, and discover the surrounding trees are inhabited by Totoros, magical spirits of the forest. When the youngest runs away from home, the older sister seeks help from the spirits to find her.', 'Two sisters move to the country with their father in order to be closer to their hospitalized mother, and discover the surrounding trees are inhabited by Totoros, magical spirits of the forest. When the youngest runs away from home, the older sister seeks help from the spirits to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rtGDOeG9LzoerkDGZF9dnVeLppL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8392'),
  ('671391997881728911', 'My Neighbor''s Wife', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jung Dae-man', null, 'Kim Jin-seon, Kim Geon, Min Jae-ha, Im So-mi, Oh Mi-seon, Lee Jae-soon, Yoo Seung-hyeon', null, 'Yoon-jeong asks her mother to take care of her daughter and then she leaves on a secret romantic trip with a man in her neighborhood while her husband is away from home for a business trip. The man and the woman on their secret two night three day trip forget about anything about law, morals, or common sense. They follow their instinct to satisfy the desire for each other’s body all day long. The endless desire would not drive away from her body.', 'Yoon-jeong asks her mother to take care of her daughter and then she leaves on a secret romantic trip with a man in her neighborhood while her husband is away from home for a business trip. The man and the woman on their secret two night three day trip forget about anything about law, morals, or common sense. They follow their instinct to satisfy the desire for each other’s body all day long. The endless desire would not drive away from her body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpW0myP5nCSZbSmOS0IhMJYXVkF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408349'),
  ('367373802833133897', 'My Neighbors the Yamadas', 1999, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Isao Takahata, Kenichi Konishi, Noboru Yoshida', 'Isao Takahata', 'Hayato Isohata, Masako Araki, Naomi Uno, Toru Masuoka, Yukiji Asaoka, Akiko Yano, Kosanji Yanagiya, Tamao Nakamura', 'PG', 'The Yamadas are a typical middle class Japanese family in urban Tokyo and this film shows us a variety of episodes of their lives. With tales that range from the humorous to the heartbreaking, we see this family cope with life''s little conflicts, problems, and joys in their own way.', 'The Yamadas are a typical middle class Japanese family in urban Tokyo and this film shows us a variety of episodes of their lives. With tales that range from the humorous to the heartbreaking, we see this family cope with life''s little conflicts, problems, and joys in their own way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj0ijnOozQtu52r0ncut769G1FX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16198'),
  ('599962768261899948', 'My New Friends', 2024, 'Drama', 'André Téchiné, Tam Slimani, Georges Lechaptois', 'André Téchiné, Emily Barnett, Régis de Martrin-Donos', 'Isabelle Huppert, Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Hafsia Herzi, Romane Meunier, Stéphane Rideau, Moustapha Mbengue, Elyjah Timera, Emmanuelle Hiron', null, 'Police officer Lucie’s solitary daily life is disturbed by the arrival of a young couple and their little girl who move in next door. As she grows fond of them, she discovers that the father is an anti-police activist.', 'Police officer Lucie’s solitary daily life is disturbed by the arrival of a young couple and their little girl who move in next door. As she grows fond of them, she discovers that the father is an anti-police activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xyYowd5EVXyGxdUlz3GQUW6ELWS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:961082'),
  ('1115159586001313503', 'My New Gun', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Stacy Cochran, Eric Heffron, Todd Pfeiffer', 'Stacy Cochran', 'Diane Lane, James Le Gros, Tess Harper, Bruce Altman, Maddie Corman, Bill Raymond, Stephen Collins, Suzzy Roche', 'R', 'Debbie Bender is a New Jersey housewife whose husband gives her a gun for self-protection; soon her life is turned upside down when their cute but wacky neighbor Skippy "borrows" it.', 'Debbie Bender is a New Jersey housewife whose husband gives her a gun for self-protection; soon her life is turned upside down when their cute but wacky neighbor Skippy "borrows" it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otj5KPxlmEMhAobjR9ozaziTeOL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55730'),
  ('535131609235832879', 'My New Partner', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Claude Zidi, Didier Kaminka', 'Philippe Noiret, Thierry Lhermitte, Régine, Grace de Capitani, Claude Brosset, Albert Simono, Jacques Santi, Pierre Frag', null, 'A streetwise Paris policeman who takes kickbacks from the minor criminals on his beat to allow them to continue is assigned an idealistic new partner fresh from police academy. He sets out to corrupt him...', 'A streetwise Paris policeman who takes kickbacks from the minor criminals on his beat to allow them to continue is assigned an idealistic new partner fresh from police academy. He sets out to corrupt him...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvILcin1mGcEyu0rrME8MlmD9b3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10260'),
  ('513568545948528649', 'My New Partner II', 1990, 'Action, Comedy', 'Claude Zidi, Jean-Jacques Tarbès', 'Didier Kaminka', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Philippe Noiret, Grace de Capitani, Guy Marchand, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Line Renaud, Michel Aumont, Jean-Claude Brialy', null, 'The partners are back and are in a tight spot! Francois is going through a moral crisis, and Rene is experiencing the same. But, honesty is not always the best policy. After being suspended for their actions, they return to face their far more crooked replacements.', 'The partners are back and are in a tight spot! Francois is going through a moral crisis, and Rene is experiencing the same. But, honesty is not always the best policy. After being suspended for their actions, they return to face their far more crooked replacements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exiz9yOOHEjdjo36x3Ic4YMSgc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22240'),
  ('279170280025846094', 'My New Partner III', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Claude Zidi', 'Simon Michaël, Claude Zidi', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Philippe Noiret, Lorànt Deutsch, Chloé Flipo, Jean-Luc Bideau, Raoul Billerey, Laurence Boccolini, Jean-François Balmer', null, 'It''s been ten years since the paths of René and François parted ways. From the glorious era when, as cops, they roamed the Montmartre district, they only have a handful of memories left, the money from their cronies having evaporated over time. Everything comes to an end. Until it starts again.', 'It''s been ten years since the paths of René and François parted ways. From the glorious era when, as cops, they roamed the Montmartre district, they only have a handful of memories left, the money from their cronies having evaporated over time. Everything comes to an end. Until it starts again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1xHhUux28lemC990bH5KCqWS0Er.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22623'),
  ('756203313463066579', 'My New Sassy Girl', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joh Keun-shik, Yu Cheol, Kang Seung-gi', 'Lee Dong-ha, Park Eun-kyung, Lee Jae-yun', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Victoria Song, Bae Sung-woo, Mina Fujii, Song Ok-suk, Choi Jin-ho, Jeong Jong-jun, Chang Hang-jun', null, 'Gyun-woo is having difficulty forgetting the sassy girl. He then reunites with his childhood sweetheart, an elementary school classmate from China who was often teased about her broken Korean. They marry despite family opposition, and Gyun-woo has no idea what marriage has in store for him.', 'Gyun-woo is having difficulty forgetting the sassy girl. He then reunites with his childhood sweetheart, an elementary school classmate from China who was often teased about her broken Korean. They marry despite family opposition, and Gyun-woo has no idea what marriage has in store for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaSksImeP2HLmVoNM4tlaUkmzcy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394110'),
  ('604241649309602544', 'My Next Life as a Villainess: All Routes Lead to Doom! The Movie', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Keisuke Inoue, Keisuke Inoue, Junya Koshiba', 'Daichi Kagawa', 'Maaya Uchida, Shouta Aoi, Miho Okasaki, Tetsuya Kakihara, Inori Minase, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Saori Hayami, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', 'PG', 'Catarina comes across a traveling circus and meets Aaqil. She must uncover the truth and avoid doom flags!', 'Catarina comes across a traveling circus and meets Aaqil. She must uncover the truth and avoid doom flags!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBirCFcv4T0WMLo5pXRAplH9PDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997086'),
  ('823221019528440852', 'My Night', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Antoinette Boulat, Laetitia de Montalembert', 'François Choquet, Anne-Louise Trividic, Antoinette Boulat', 'Lou Lampros, Tom Mercier, Carmen Kassovitz, Angelina Woreth, Lucie Saada, Emmanuelle Bercot, Maya Sansa', null, 'Marion faces Paris at night with a feeling of vulnerability linked to the loss of her sister. She crosses paths with Alex. Their encounter will evolve at the rhythm of their wanderings through the city, like a journey through the night.', 'Marion faces Paris at night with a feeling of vulnerability linked to the loss of her sister. She crosses paths with Alex. Their encounter will evolve at the rhythm of their wanderings through the city, like a journey through the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rm12Gi7epSX6upo0miWQeCd5E8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854363'),
  ('156152834166315148', 'My Nightmare', 1993, null, 'Richard Kern', 'Richard Kern', 'Richard Kern, Susan McNamara', null, 'Director Richard Kern and model Susan McNamara engage in a chaotic fast-cut blend of fantasy and reality. A satire of some of Kern''s own early work.', 'Director Richard Kern and model Susan McNamara engage in a chaotic fast-cut blend of fantasy and reality. A satire of some of Kern''s own early work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o0dgHVrXu2u6dBUcvyfqlHqSelv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143457'),
  ('325484983737469644', 'My Nightmare Landlord', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Bryan Koss, Dylan Vox', 'Naomi L. Selfman', 'Caroline Harris, Ignacyo Matynia, Sinéad D''arcy, Spencer Belko, Willow Hale, LaShan Anderson, Lucy Boryer, Harwood Gordon', null, 'Lydia moves into a new apartment after breaking up with her long-term boyfriend, finding herself more and more isolated as her apartment manager Drew becomes obsessed with her. Caroline Harris, Ignacyo Matynia , Sinéad D''arcy and Spencer Belko Star. (2020)', 'Lydia moves into a new apartment after breaking up with her long-term boyfriend, finding herself more and more isolated as her apartment manager Drew becomes obsessed with her. Caroline Harris, Ignacyo Matynia , Sinéad D''arcy and Spencer Belko Star. (2020)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8VduiTPank0pSoyXFECG0lAiml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682583'),
  ('360349638448256534', 'My Nights Are More Beautiful Than Your Days', 1989, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrzej Żuławski, Patrick Blossier, Leslie Tabuteau', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Jacques Dutronc, Sophie Marceau, Valérie Lagrange, Myriam Mézières, Laure Killing, François Chaumette, Sady Rebbot, Salim Talbi', null, 'Lucas has invented a new computer language but at the same time he has been informed about his strange terminal illness during which he has been gradually losing his memory. Shortly after that he meets Blanche who acts as a medium in a bizarre traveling show. Dying Lucas follows her to the sea resort where they spend together several days and nights.', 'Lucas has invented a new computer language but at the same time he has been informed about his strange terminal illness during which he has been gradually losing his memory. Shortly after that he meets Blanche who acts as a medium in a bizarre traveling show. Dying Lucas follows her to the sea resort where they spend together several days and nights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrQHMMVBRIlGREEvPzvgC5HkVd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73764'),
  ('174824692748749912', 'My Nights with Susan, Sandra, Olga & Julie', 1975, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Marc Felperlaan, Pim de la Parra, Olga Madsen', 'Harry Kümel, Charles Gormley, David Kaufman', 'Willeke van Ammelrooy, Hans van der Gragt, Nelly Frijda, Jerry Brouer, Franulka Heyermans, Marja de Heer, Serge-Henri Valcke, Marieke van Leeuwen', null, 'Susan has chosen a hermit''s life on a dilapidated farm over the shallowness of her previous jet set modeling life. When Anton, a hunky courier, comes along to pick her up for an assignment on the French Riviera, he''s so fascinated by Susan''s odd assortment of house guests that he decides to stay with them for a couple of days.', 'Susan has chosen a hermit''s life on a dilapidated farm over the shallowness of her previous jet set modeling life. When Anton, a hunky courier, comes along to pick her up for an assignment on the French Riviera, he''s so fascinated by Susan''s odd assortment of house guests that he decides to stay with them for a couple of days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cS5iiQrIuRNQE7L4t69eGx68utm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425282'),
  ('1026751101535716987', 'My Octopus Teacher', 2020, 'Documentary', 'James Reed, Philippa Ehrlich, Roger Horrocks', 'Philippa Ehrlich, James Reed', 'Craig Foster, Tom Foster', null, 'After years of swimming every day in the freezing ocean at the tip of Africa, Craig Foster meets an unlikely teacher: a young octopus who displays remarkable curiosity. Visiting her den and tracking her movements for months on end he eventually wins the animal’s trust and they develop a never-before-seen bond between human and wild animal.', 'After years of swimming every day in the freezing ocean at the tip of Africa, Craig Foster meets an unlikely teacher: a young octopus who displays remarkable curiosity. Visiting her den and tracking her movements for months on end he eventually wins the animal’s trust and they develop a never-before-seen bond between human and wild animal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvTVZb7hBC8tZAGoEhH5eiMJu2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682110'),
  ('262852578991271431', 'My Old Ass', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Megan Park, Kristen Correll, Sarah Campbell', 'Megan Park', 'Maisy Stella, Aubrey Plaza, Percy Hynes White, Maddie Ziegler, Kerrice Brooks, Maria Dizzia, Alain Goulem, Seth Isaac Johnson', 'R', 'An 18th birthday mushroom trip brings free-spirited Elliott face-to-face with her wisecracking 39-year-old self. But when Elliott’s "old ass" starts handing out warnings about what her younger self should and shouldn''t do, Elliott realizes she has to rethink everything about family, love, and what''s becoming a transformative summer.', 'An 18th birthday mushroom trip brings free-spirited Elliott face-to-face with her wisecracking 39-year-old self. But when Elliott’s "old ass" starts handing out warnings about what her younger self should and shouldn''t do, Elliott realizes she has to rethink everything about family, love, and what''s becoming a transformative summer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUs4Sw9AyTg2sA1qWBkNpD2mGSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947891'),
  ('898668812397122769', 'My Old Classmate', 2014, 'Romance', 'Frant Gwo, Liu Yin', 'Gao Xiaosong', 'Zhou Dongyu, Lin Gengxin, Michael Kai Sui, Zhang Zifeng', null, 'In the summer of 1993, timid and shy Zhou Xiao Zhi meets her table partner. Sitting in the classroom’s infamous back row is troublemaker Lin Yi. They go through junior high, high school, and college years together. Lin Yi said to Zhou Xiaozhi: "One day, I’ll take you to a place that only belongs to us." Fast forward ten years...', 'In the summer of 1993, timid and shy Zhou Xiao Zhi meets her table partner. Sitting in the classroom’s infamous back row is troublemaker Lin Yi. They go through junior high, high school, and college years together. Lin Yi said to Zhou Xiaozhi: "One day, I’ll take you to a place that only belongs to us." Fast forward ten years...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2XlGqAqykYYvvtHt44Pymem214c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290217'),
  ('218738232294813986', 'My Old Lady', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Israel Horovitz, Michel Amathieu', 'Israel Horovitz', 'Maggie Smith, Kevin Kline, Kristin Scott Thomas, Dominique Pinon, Michael Burstin, Elie Wajeman, Noémie Lvovsky, Stéphane De Groodt', 'PG-13', 'Mathias Gold is a down-on-his-luck New Yorker who inherits a Parisian apartment from his estranged father. But when he arrives in France to sell the vast domicile, he''s shocked to discover a live-in tenant who is not prepared to budge. His apartment is a viager—an ancient French real estate system with complex rules pertaining to its resale—and the feisty Englishwoman Mathilde Girard, who has lived in the apartment with her daughter Chloé for many years, can by contract collect monthly payments from Mathias until her death.', 'Mathias Gold is a down-on-his-luck New Yorker who inherits a Parisian apartment from his estranged father. But when he arrives in France to sell the vast domicile, he''s shocked to discover a live-in tenant who is not prepared to budge. His apartment is a viager—an ancient French real estate system with complex rules pertaining to its resale—and the feisty Englishwoman Mathilde Girard, who has lived in the apartment with her daughter Chloé for many years, can by contract collect monthly payments from Mathias until her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPLAUrmJkXdv1sEtIqk9EwXvmbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282296'),
  ('140810072204798602', 'My One and Only', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Loncraine, Marco Pontecorvo', 'Charlie Peters', 'Renée Zellweger, Logan Lerman, Kevin Bacon, Troy Garity, David Koechner, Eric McCormack, Chris Noth, Molly C. Quinn', 'PG-13', 'A mother takes her two sons on an unusual road trip from New York to Pittsburgh, St. Louis and eventually Hollywood in her quest to find a man to take care of them all.', 'A mother takes her two sons on an unusual road trip from New York to Pittsburgh, St. Louis and eventually Hollywood in her quest to find a man to take care of them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niwRJ18nJurSFEVHoeVaPsJVWoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26820'),
  ('761808984766081847', 'My Oni Girl', 2024, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Tomotaka Shibayama, Eriko Kimura, Tsukasa Saito', 'Atsuyuki Yukawa, Tomohiko Kon', 'Kensho Ono, Miyu Tomita, Shintaro Asanuma, Aya Yamane, Tomoko Shiota, Shirou Saitou, Miou Tanaka, Satsuki Yukino', 'PG', 'A shy teenage boy''s inability to say no is tested when a headstrong girl drags him on a mystical journey amid summer snow to find her missing mom.', 'A shy teenage boy''s inability to say no is tested when a headstrong girl drags him on a mystical journey amid summer snow to find her missing mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k69kkwsipkPn7Nzq488kHGQTPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1231574'),
  ('106973856509101535', 'My Only Love', 2004, 'Drama', 'Claude Fournier, René Verzier', 'Claude Fournier', 'Michel Forget, Noémie Godin-Vigneau, Dorothée Berryman, Jean-Nicolas Verreault, France Castel, Normand Chouinard, Louis-José Houde, Louis-Olivier Mauffette', null, 'The unexpected acquaintance with a young prostitute helps the venerable writer to overcome writer''s block. Quite shocking story of her life inspires him for a new book.', 'The unexpected acquaintance with a young prostitute helps the venerable writer to overcome writer''s block. Quite shocking story of her life inspires him for a new book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/K5cIptFRXpgX5t9O51pkq0WnHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152657'),
  ('44386898104407845', 'My Only Sunshine', 2009, 'Drama', 'Reha Erdem, Selcen Ergun, Florent Herry', 'Reha Erdem', 'Elit İşcan, Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Levend Yılmaz, Banu Fotocan, Handan Karaadam, Nebil Sayın, Ertan Tekin, Metin Yıldırım', null, 'Hayat, her father and bedridden grandfather live in a riverside shack near the dangerously dark but breathtakingly beautiful waters of the Bosphorus. Hayat''s father owns a small boat that secures the family''s survival through a miscellany of not always lawful ventures. Beyond the motion and romance of the water, Hayat''s life is harsh and unrelenting. But Hayat has an instinct for survival. Her capacity for courage, endurance and hope in the face of these trials suggest that there is Life despite the manifold injustices of an unjust world.', 'Hayat, her father and bedridden grandfather live in a riverside shack near the dangerously dark but breathtakingly beautiful waters of the Bosphorus. Hayat''s father owns a small boat that secures the family''s survival through a miscellany of not always lawful ventures. Beyond the motion and romance of the water, Hayat''s life is harsh and unrelenting. But Hayat has an instinct for survival. Her capacity for courage, endurance and hope in the face of these trials suggest that there is Life despite the manifold injustices of an unjust world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gYp4yvLEKH59OhGZGektlubUgZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37573'),
  ('932707250582475533', 'My Otaku Girlfriend', 2023, 'Drama', 'Edio Raven, Fernando Díaz, Javier Ávila', 'Edio Raven', 'Miguel Ángel Hidalgo, Karla Vieira, Frank Coello, Subotic Kelliens, Pedro Armando Medina', null, '"Get ready for an unforgettable experience where love and the anime world intertwine in "My Otaku Girlfriend"! An anonymous mangaka is discovered by a beautiful otaku influencer, and he must choose between finishing his manga with her or leaving everything behind for graduate studies abroad."', '"Get ready for an unforgettable experience where love and the anime world intertwine in "My Otaku Girlfriend"! An anonymous mangaka is discovered by a beautiful otaku influencer, and he must choose between finishing his manga with her or leaving everything behind for graduate studies abroad."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cn5Dnh6H2h6uCU31ghTcS8GInyV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175107'),
