  ('662198151937887268', 'My Own Private Hell', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Victor de Melo, Pedro Diógenes, Guto Parente', 'Rafael Martins, Guto Parente, Pedro Diógenes', 'Yuri Yamamoto, Démick Lopes, Samya de Lavor, Rafael Martins, Galba Nogueira, Pedro Domingues, Gustavo Lopes, Tatiana Amorim', null, 'Deusimar is the owner of Inferninho, a dark and run-down bar that is refuge of dreams and fantasies. Her dream is to leave everything behind and go away to any distant land, as far as possible from that place. Falling in love with Jarbas, the handsome sailor that arrives at the bar, dreaming of finding home, will completely change her life and the lives of the bar employees: Luizianne, the singer; Rabbit, the waiter; and Caixa-Preta, the cleaning lady.', 'Deusimar is the owner of Inferninho, a dark and run-down bar that is refuge of dreams and fantasies. Her dream is to leave everything behind and go away to any distant land, as far as possible from that place. Falling in love with Jarbas, the handsome sailor that arrives at the bar, dreaming of finding home, will completely change her life and the lives of the bar employees: Luizianne, the singer; Rabbit, the waiter; and Caixa-Preta, the cleaning lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Mw2adZxcrFw1VSXprfzdlnXqzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:471291'),
  ('1065759606922229138', 'My Own Private Idaho', 1991, 'Drama', 'Gus Van Sant, Kris Krengel, D-J Haanraadts', 'Gus Van Sant', 'River Phoenix, Keanu Reeves, James Russo, William Richert, Rodney Harvey, Chiara Caselli, Michael Parker, Jessica Makinson', 'R', 'In this loose adaptation of Shakespeare''s "Henry IV," Mike Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy. Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor. Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike''s estranged mother. Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.', 'In this loose adaptation of Shakespeare''s "Henry IV," Mike Waters is a hustler afflicted with narcolepsy. Scott Favor is the rebellious son of a mayor. Together, the two travel from Portland, Oregon to Idaho and finally to the coast of Italy in a quest to find Mike''s estranged mother. Along the way they turn tricks for money and drugs, eventually attracting the attention of a wealthy benefactor and sexual deviant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9TF90Pb5yg2MNb2UztzyXktMm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468'),
