  ('1066366855315750371', 'My Penguin Friend', 2024, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'David Schurmann, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Kristen Lazarian, Paulina Lagudi', 'Jean Reno, Adriana Barraza, Nicolás Francella, Alexia Moyano, Rocío Hernández, Ravel Cabral, Pedro Caetano, Amanda Magalhães', 'PG', 'A lost penguin rescued from an oil spill transforms the life of a heartbroken fisherman. They become unlikely friends, so bonded that even the vast ocean cannot divide them.', 'A lost penguin rescued from an oil spill transforms the life of a heartbroken fisherman. They become unlikely friends, so bonded that even the vast ocean cannot divide them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65ll0fwaCMDHuD5XMJk4f4Olc5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1159799'),
