  ('1002781096826908243', 'My Perfect Romance', 2018, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Martin Buzora, Justin G. Dyck', 'Amanda McNeice', 'Kimberly-Sue Murray, Christopher Russell, Jodie Sweetin, Lauren Holly, Morgan Fairchild, Josh Dean, Andy Yu, Zarrin Darnell-Martin', 'PG-13', 'Newly appointed CEO of Robinson Tech, Wes Robinson, is looking for new ideas to boost the company''s sales. Vivian Blair, a program developer, shares a dating algorithm she has been working on called My Perfect Match. Wes sees potential and an opportunity to turn the company around and launches the service. When the pair is challenged to use My Perfect Match themselves to find love, this algorithm shows some interesting results.', 'Newly appointed CEO of Robinson Tech, Wes Robinson, is looking for new ideas to boost the company''s sales. Vivian Blair, a program developer, shares a dating algorithm she has been working on called My Perfect Match. Wes sees potential and an opportunity to turn the company around and launches the service. When the pair is challenged to use My Perfect Match themselves to find love, this algorithm shows some interesting results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWcRlzSUOxMtLlp35zfWGAfpfno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503403'),
  ('518168151863420835', 'My Pet Dinosaur', 2017, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Action', 'Matt Drummond', null, 'Jordan Dulieu, Joanne Samuel, David Roberts, Tiriel Mora, Sam Winspear-Schillings, Annabel Wolf, Darius Williams-Watt, Beth Champion', 'PG', 'When a young boy named Jake accidentally makes a new friend in an experiment gone wrong a troubled town is plunged into chaos. But with the creature rapidly evolving every day, Jake finds it increasingly difficult to keep his new pet secret. Jake''s friends and new girl Abbie realize they are not the only ones interested in this strange, mischievous little dinosaur and soon discover that the only thing more mysterious than what it is, is who is looking for it.', 'When a young boy named Jake accidentally makes a new friend in an experiment gone wrong a troubled town is plunged into chaos. But with the creature rapidly evolving every day, Jake finds it increasingly difficult to keep his new pet secret. Jake''s friends and new girl Abbie realize they are not the only ones interested in this strange, mischievous little dinosaur and soon discover that the only thing more mysterious than what it is, is who is looking for it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IqrMLYLC11Z5W5eZkgeejabLj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449700'),
  ('444667697788166989', 'My Pet Monster', 1986, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Timothy Bond, Douglas Kiefer', null, 'Sunny Besen Thrasher, Alyson Court, Yannick Bisson, Colin Fox, Jayne Eastwood, David Fox, Kelly Rowan, Michael J. Reynolds', null, 'Synder, the historian who has spent many years trying to unlock the powers of the statue, wishes to capture Max for validation of his life''s work.', 'Synder, the historian who has spent many years trying to unlock the powers of the statue, wishes to capture Max for validation of his life''s work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBYdMOQN535k0Um2ulgC6xYpEVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82395'),
  ('396463490885534037', 'My Piece of the Pie', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Cédric Klapisch, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Cédric Klapisch', 'Karin Viard, Gilles Lellouche, Audrey Lamy, Jean-Pierre Martins, Zinedine Soualem, Raphaële Godin, Fred Ulysse, Kevin Bishop', null, 'France, a factory worker, lives with her three daughters in Dunkirk. The factory where she worked has been closed, leaving France and all of her workmates without a job. She decides to go to Paris to look for work. There she finds a cleaning job at the home of a rich man, Steve, whose world is radically different from her own. As their paths keep crossing, she discovers that her employer played a part in closing the factory in Dunkirk...', 'France, a factory worker, lives with her three daughters in Dunkirk. The factory where she worked has been closed, leaving France and all of her workmates without a job. She decides to go to Paris to look for work. There she finds a cleaning job at the home of a rich man, Steve, whose world is radically different from her own. As their paths keep crossing, she discovers that her employer played a part in closing the factory in Dunkirk...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWaG5iXaYpl8MmSvMVYhuiAinMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58043'),
  ('646047964096105148', 'My Place is Here', 2024, 'Drama', 'Cristiano Bortone, Daniela Porto', 'Cristiano Bortone, Daniela Porto', 'Ludovica Martino, Marco Leonardi, Giorgia Arena, Francesco Biscione, Biancamaria D''Amato, Anna Maria De Luca, Francesco Aricò, Francesco Aiello', null, 'Marta, a single mother promised to an older farmer in the aftermath of WWII, forges an unlikely friendship with Lorenzo, the village''s openly gay "wedding planner." In the conservative backdrop of rural Southern Italy, Lorenzo introduces her to a hidden community of gays, sparking Marta''s journey to challenge societal prejudices. In the first year of women''s suffrage in Italy, Marta navigates her evolving role as a woman, breaking barriers and finding her place in a changing world.', 'Marta, a single mother promised to an older farmer in the aftermath of WWII, forges an unlikely friendship with Lorenzo, the village''s openly gay "wedding planner." In the conservative backdrop of rural Southern Italy, Lorenzo introduces her to a hidden community of gays, sparking Marta''s journey to challenge societal prejudices. In the first year of women''s suffrage in Italy, Marta navigates her evolving role as a woman, breaking barriers and finding her place in a changing world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gFANbx2mOaj1W2oYm0YvARYjBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096805'),
  ('223225468083625582', 'My Polish Honeymoon', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Élise Otzenberger, Jordane Chouzenoux', 'Élise Otzenberger', 'Judith Chemla, Arthur Igual, Brigitte Roüan, Isabelle Candelier, Antoine Chappey, André Wilms, Gloria Manca, Evelyn Askolovitch', null, 'Anna and Adam, a young couple from Paris with Polish Jewish origins, leave for the first time of their lives in Poland. They were invited to commemorate the seventy-fifth anniversary of the destruction of the birth village community of Adam''s grandfather. If Adam is not very excited about this trip, Anna is excited to discover the land that is also her grandmother''s. Finally - from what little she knows. Here they are, looking for their origins in a journey full of surprises, during which they will not find exactly what they came for.', 'Anna and Adam, a young couple from Paris with Polish Jewish origins, leave for the first time of their lives in Poland. They were invited to commemorate the seventy-fifth anniversary of the destruction of the birth village community of Adam''s grandfather. If Adam is not very excited about this trip, Anna is excited to discover the land that is also her grandmother''s. Finally - from what little she knows. Here they are, looking for their origins in a journey full of surprises, during which they will not find exactly what they came for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ql6PvRU9xVfb2KBvRMEDLijxPfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544519'),
