  ('309732737754397769', 'My Precious', 2023, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Naphat Chitveerapat, Chai Topiyabut, Tanai Nimcharoenpong', 'Naphat Chitveerapat, Lalil Kittitanaphan', 'Korapat Kirdpan, Rachanun Mahawan, Pawat Chittsawangdee, Wachirawit Ruangwiwat, Trai Nimtawat, Thanaset Suriyapornchaikul, Benyapa Jeenprasom, Jaturong Mokjok', null, 'Tong and his group of friends are in love with the same girl, Lin. Tong is forced to be supervised by another student due to his bad behavior. And his school life changes learning, playing and finding the first love.', 'Tong and his group of friends are in love with the same girl, Lin. Tong is forced to be supervised by another student due to his bad behavior. And his school life changes learning, playing and finding the first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZLPotDQ2DYFuLnXy3w5Hn8Yoo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:976125'),
  ('974341064666746288', 'My Pretend Girlfriend', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Saiji Yakumo, Shuhei Umene', 'Kyoko Inukai', 'Akari Hayami, Taro Takeuchi, Anna Ishibashi, Osamu Mukai, Asuka Kudo, Hiromi, Manato Ota, Riko Awano', null, 'Noboru is a high school student who isn''t popular at all. He looks up to senior student Miyazaki who is one of the most popular guys at school. Miyazaki has two girlfriends: Momose and Tetsuko. Momose and Tetsuko have totally different personalities. Momose is bright and Tetsuko is a popular student from a wealthy family. One day, Miyazaki is caught with Momose. To keep his relationship with Tetsuko, Miyazaki asks Noboru and Momose to pretend they are dating. They both agree due to their affections for Miyazaki. Noboru and Momose begin to act like a couple in front others and soon Noboru begins to develop feelings for Momose, who is still in love with Miyazaki.', 'Noboru is a high school student who isn''t popular at all. He looks up to senior student Miyazaki who is one of the most popular guys at school. Miyazaki has two girlfriends: Momose and Tetsuko. Momose and Tetsuko have totally different personalities. Momose is bright and Tetsuko is a popular student from a wealthy family. One day, Miyazaki is caught with Momose. To keep his relationship with Tetsuko, Miyazaki asks Noboru and Momose to pretend they are dating. They both agree due to their affections for Miyazaki. Noboru and Momose begin to act like a couple in front others and soon Noboru begins to develop feelings for Momose, who is still in love with Miyazaki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95ftcKeI3d3MyxsmDHJHyQoVdOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303224'),
  ('403750200550560005', 'My Prince Edward', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Pong Ho-wai, Norris Wong Yee-Lam, Yu-Shan Li', 'Norris Wong Yee-Lam', 'Stephy Tang Lai-Yan, Tommy Chu Pak-Hong, Jin Kaijie, Nina Paw Hei-Ching, Sham Ka-Ki, Eman Lam Yi-Man, Hui So-Ying, Chan Kin-Long', null, 'Making a living from selling cheap wedding supplies doesn''t free Fong from pressure to marry. She''s been pushed beyond limits by unaffordable housing, archaic customs, and intrusive in-laws since engagement. More worrying is the comeback of a mainlander she''s supposed to divorce out of a sham marriage.', 'Making a living from selling cheap wedding supplies doesn''t free Fong from pressure to marry. She''s been pushed beyond limits by unaffordable housing, archaic customs, and intrusive in-laws since engagement. More worrying is the comeback of a mainlander she''s supposed to divorce out of a sham marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlLXo6G3wpkDylDZqbriI5gIc35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639445'),
  ('198258328819456261', 'My Prison Yard', 2008, 'Drama', 'Belén Macías', 'Arantxa Cuesta', 'Verónica Echegui, Candela Peña, Ana Wagener, Ledicia Sola, Violeta Pérez, Adriana Ugarte, Tatiana Astengo, Susi Sánchez', null, 'In Madrid, a petty thief who cannot adjust to life outside of jail puts together a theater troupe her friends -- a prostitute, a gypsy, and a Colombian immigrant -- in an attempt to make a go at a relatively straight life.', 'In Madrid, a petty thief who cannot adjust to life outside of jail puts together a theater troupe her friends -- a prostitute, a gypsy, and a Colombian immigrant -- in an attempt to make a go at a relatively straight life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddjBBhWzOucqGhwqcpuiAxJ44GA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34883'),
  ('1148411854154851347', 'My Prostitute Love', 1968, 'Drama, Romance', 'Erdoğan Avcı, Çetin İnanç, Lütfi Akad', 'Safa Önal', 'Türkan Şoray, İzzet Günay, Ayfer Feray, Semih Sezerli, Aydemir Akbaş, Hakkı Kıvanç, Behçet Nacar, Aynur Akarsu', null, 'Halil the greengrocer goes to a nightclub with his friends one day to break the monotony of his life. There he meets Sabiha, one of the women working at the nightclub. They fall in love at first sight and begin living together. While Sabiha is making plans for the future with Halil, she learns a truth about him that she didn''t know, and the forbidden love that began at the nightclub turns into a dead end filled with lies.', 'Halil the greengrocer goes to a nightclub with his friends one day to break the monotony of his life. There he meets Sabiha, one of the women working at the nightclub. They fall in love at first sight and begin living together. While Sabiha is making plans for the future with Halil, she learns a truth about him that she didn''t know, and the forbidden love that began at the nightclub turns into a dead end filled with lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4KqrE0ryPlBPRgqn4vKnNz0COz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257261'),
  ('749713602699463193', 'My Punch-Drunk Boxer', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Seung-ho, Jung Hyuk-ki, Kang Min-woo', 'Cho Hyun-chul, Jung Hyuk-ki', 'Um Tae-goo, Lee Hye-ri, Kim Hie-won, Choi Jun-young, Lee Sul, Choi Deok-moon, Im Seong-mi, Im Han-bin', null, 'Byung-gu, a once-famous former professional boxer, makes ends meet doing odd jobs at the gym. While eager to start boxing again, he gets diagnosed with "punch drunk syndrome," a condition caused by cerebral concussions. One day, a new member of the gym arrives and volunteers to help Byung-gu.', 'Byung-gu, a once-famous former professional boxer, makes ends meet doing odd jobs at the gym. While eager to start boxing again, he gets diagnosed with "punch drunk syndrome," a condition caused by cerebral concussions. One day, a new member of the gym arrives and volunteers to help Byung-gu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naAbiQYJCM2LrYaT5pgRLf9PjxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:578211'),
  ('188641632713772722', 'My Queen Karo', 2009, 'Drama', 'Dorothée Van Den Berghe, Jan Vancaillie', 'Dorothée Van Den Berghe', 'Anna Franziska Jäger, Matthias Schoenaerts, Déborah François, Nico Sturm, Maria Kraakman, Ward Weemhoff, Cezanne Q. Cuypers, Samuel Du Chatinier', null, 'Nine-year-old Karo grows up with her parents in an Amsterdam commune in the Seventies. She leads a carefree existence in this utopia-for-adults. Everything is shared in the squat, but not everyone is able to honor these ideals. Karo gets confused because of the internal conflicts that start to divide the group. Karo slowly realizes that nothing can stay the same forever.', 'Nine-year-old Karo grows up with her parents in an Amsterdam commune in the Seventies. She leads a carefree existence in this utopia-for-adults. Everything is shared in the squat, but not everyone is able to honor these ideals. Karo gets confused because of the internal conflicts that start to divide the group. Karo slowly realizes that nothing can stay the same forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXVCMy1xqzRYapNsfGj9OLQjR85.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53103'),
  ('20242727836700757', 'My Quick Way Out', 2006, 'Drama, Action', 'Miguel Albaladejo', 'Miguel Albaladejo, Juan Carlos Delgado', 'Borja Navas, Fernando Tejero, Mariola Fuentes, Àlex Casanovas, Mar Regueras, Juan Carlos Delgado, José Luis García Pérez, Christian Nájera', null, 'Biopic of Spain''s Juan Carlos Delgado "El Pera", a young delinquent in the 1980''s who is a car pilot and a sport journalist nowadays.', 'Biopic of Spain''s Juan Carlos Delgado "El Pera", a young delinquent in the 1980''s who is a car pilot and a sport journalist nowadays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdhy43Kp8RtXzut8Mc3jb8nzlMY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74345'),
  ('163441765065117223', 'My Rainy Days', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yuri Kanchiku, Shinichi Tsunoda', 'Yuri Kanchiku', 'Nozomi Sasaki, Shosuke Tanihara, Hikaru Yamamoto, Mitsuki Oishi, Araki Nanaki, Saki Kagami, Motoki Fukami, Wakana Sakai', null, 'Because of her past, 17-year-old Rio lives her days filling the emptiness in her heart with money—until one day, she meets a university professor named Kouki and falls in love.', 'Because of her past, 17-year-old Rio lives her days filling the emptiness in her heart with money—until one day, she meets a university professor named Kouki and falls in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6ZIjEs81jJp2CleidgPsfLq1eA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43635'),
