  ('351425584009583199', 'My Scene Goes Hollywood: The Movie', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Eric Fogel', 'Elise Allen', 'Kathleen Barr, Kelly Sheridan, Nicole Bouma, Tegan Moss, Meghan Black, Saffron Henderson, Terry Klassen, Alessandro Juliani', null, 'Barbie and her friends stumble onto a movie set and get cast as extras. But their friendship is tested when one of the girls makes a quick rise to stardom.', 'Barbie and her friends stumble onto a movie set and get cast as extras. But their friendship is tested when one of the girls makes a quick rise to stardom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIhE8VxvKejTknEZjC7NLSnDkjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103434'),
  ('702079541406360796', 'My Science Project', 1985, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'David M. Walsh, Jonathan R. Betuel, Carole Keligian', 'Jonathan R. Betuel', 'John Stockwell, Danielle von Zerneck, Fisher Stevens, Raphael Sbarge, Richard Masur, Barry Corbin, Ann Wedgeworth, Dennis Hopper', 'PG', 'His high school teacher issues an ultimatum: turn in a science project or flunk. So Mike Harlan scavenges a military base''s junk pile for a suitable gizmo. He finds one... and unwittingly unleashes the awesome power and energy of the unknown. Twisted dimensions. Time warps. A fantastic realm where the past, present, and future collide in a whirling vortex of startling adventure and superlative special effects.', 'His high school teacher issues an ultimatum: turn in a science project or flunk. So Mike Harlan scavenges a military base''s junk pile for a suitable gizmo. He finds one... and unwittingly unleashes the awesome power and energy of the unknown. Twisted dimensions. Time warps. A fantastic realm where the past, present, and future collide in a whirling vortex of startling adventure and superlative special effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fbVPx5VVEsgJ7M9sTzvbDjhgks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18252'),
  ('1128518424760474718', 'My Scientology Movie', 2016, 'Documentary', 'John Dower', 'Louis Theroux, John Dower', 'Louis Theroux, Tom De Vocht, Marty Rathbun, Jefferson Hawkins, Andrew Perez, Marc Headley, Paz de la Huerta, Rob Alter', null, 'After being denied access to the Church of Scientology''s headquarters, documentarian Louis Theroux teams up with ex-Scientology official Marty Rathbun to stage re-enactments of alleged abuses within the organization. Theroux soon discovers that the church is watching his every move.', 'After being denied access to the Church of Scientology''s headquarters, documentarian Louis Theroux teams up with ex-Scientology official Marty Rathbun to stage re-enactments of alleged abuses within the organization. Theroux soon discovers that the church is watching his every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTAZFb79cum6bfU41C96DwMCp6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359871'),
  ('450029028484956953', 'My Seawoman', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Anatoly Eyramdzhan, Vadim Alisov', 'Anatoly Eyramdzhan', 'Lyudmila Gurchenko, Mikhail Derzhavin, Tatyana Vasileva, Georgi Martirosyan, Roksana Babayan, Lyubov Polishchuk, Roman Ryazantsev, Anastasiya Nemolyaeva', null, 'At a popular vacation destination in Crimea every evening the entertainer Lyudmila Pashkova hosts "Where are you, talents?" - a friendly competition designed to amuse vacationers. Michael Gudkov, a vacationer from the northern Russian city of Murmansk, takes up the challenge performing his favorite song "My Female Sailor". In spite of a well-received performance the host did not award a victory to him. Feeling slighted Michael decides to compete every evening with his song until he gets his well-deserved prize becoming a favorite fixture of the local competition.', 'At a popular vacation destination in Crimea every evening the entertainer Lyudmila Pashkova hosts "Where are you, talents?" - a friendly competition designed to amuse vacationers. Michael Gudkov, a vacationer from the northern Russian city of Murmansk, takes up the challenge performing his favorite song "My Female Sailor". In spite of a well-received performance the host did not award a victory to him. Feeling slighted Michael decides to compete every evening with his song until he gets his well-deserved prize becoming a favorite fixture of the local competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPr75k8qa5qABI1hr0NxTlXtChl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103307'),
