  ('942841680488161679', 'My Sex Life... or How I Got Into an Argument', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Arnaud Desplechin, Éric Gautier, Dominique Perrier-Royer', 'Emmanuel Bourdieu, Arnaud Desplechin', 'Mathieu Amalric, Emmanuelle Devos, Emmanuel Salinger, Marianne Denicourt, Thibault de Montalembert, Chiara Mastroianni, Denis Podalydès, Jeanne Balibar', null, 'Paul Dedalus is at a crossroads in his life. He has to make several decisions; should he complete his doctorate, does he want to become a full professor, does he really love his long-standing girlfriend, or should he re-start with one of his other lovers?', 'Paul Dedalus is at a crossroads in his life. He has to make several decisions; should he complete his doctorate, does he want to become a full professor, does he really love his long-standing girlfriend, or should he re-start with one of his other lovers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWGTIBFAVoYki1wCnlLqTPc6xZX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83994'),
