  ('236844357845731199', 'My Side of the Mountain', 1969, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'James B. Clark, Ray Freeborn', 'Joanna Crawford, Jane Klove, Ted Sherdeman', 'Ted Eccles, Theodore Bikel, Tudi Wiggins, Paul Hébert, Cosette Lee, Ralph Endersby, George Allan, Dan McIlravey', 'G', 'Thirteen-year-old Sam Gribley, a devotee of Thoreau, decides to leave the city to spend a sabbatical in the Canadian woods and see if he can make it as a self-sufficient spirit after his parents promise a summer trip that doesn''t pan out.', 'Thirteen-year-old Sam Gribley, a devotee of Thoreau, decides to leave the city to spend a sabbatical in the Canadian woods and see if he can make it as a self-sufficient spirit after his parents promise a summer trip that doesn''t pan out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne8InrFiWu6lbP4CgTuEX6u2sUc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37437'),
  ('303895370086558276', 'My Sister and I', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Danilo Desideri, Carlo Verdone, Roberto Giandalia', 'Piero De Bernardi, Carlo Verdone, Leonardo Benvenuti', 'Carlo Verdone, Ornella Muti, Elena Sofia Ricci, Mariangela Giordano, Galeazzo Benti, Tomas Arana, Veronica Lazăr, Maurizio Fardo', null, 'Carlo is a responsible sibling who deals with his black-sheep sister Silvia in this situation comedy. When Silvia returns after many years to attend her mother''s funeral, Carlo deals with the fallout caused by her many love affairs. Carlo is convinced to kidnap Silvia''s child whom she left in a Hungarian children''s home, but she soon abandons Carlo and the baby when she takes up with a British rock star.', 'Carlo is a responsible sibling who deals with his black-sheep sister Silvia in this situation comedy. When Silvia returns after many years to attend her mother''s funeral, Carlo deals with the fallout caused by her many love affairs. Carlo is convinced to kidnap Silvia''s child whom she left in a Hungarian children''s home, but she soon abandons Carlo and the baby when she takes up with a British rock star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzVrzAgf2Ea8KoVGFNNe4eEptBY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62491'),
  ('821910453755409796', 'My Sister Eileen', 1942, 'Comedy', 'Alexander Hall, Cary Odell, Joseph Walker', 'Jerome Chodorov, Joseph Fields', 'Rosalind Russell, Brian Aherne, Janet Blair, George Tobias, Allyn Joslyn, Grant Mitchell, Gordon Jones, Elizabeth Patterson', 'NR', 'Sisters Ruth and Eileen Sherwood move from Ohio to New York in the hopes of building their careers. Ruth wants to get a job as a writer, while Eileen hopes to succeed on the stage. The two end up living in a dismal basement apartment in Greenwich Village, where a parade of odd characters are constantly breezing in and out. The women also meet up with magazine editor Bob Baker, who takes a personal interest in helping both with their career plans.', 'Sisters Ruth and Eileen Sherwood move from Ohio to New York in the hopes of building their careers. Ruth wants to get a job as a writer, while Eileen hopes to succeed on the stage. The two end up living in a dismal basement apartment in Greenwich Village, where a parade of odd characters are constantly breezing in and out. The women also meet up with magazine editor Bob Baker, who takes a personal interest in helping both with their career plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3e1zXt4hFh4sHqfmiYPIWQAU6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33052'),
  ('176670402795019863', 'My Sister Eileen', 1955, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Quine, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Richard Quine, Blake Edwards', 'Janet Leigh, Jack Lemmon, Betty Garrett, Bob Fosse, Kurt Kasznar, Dick York, Lucy Marlow, Barbara Brown', 'NR', 'Ruth and her beautiful sister Eileen come to New York''s Greenwich Village looking for "fame, fortune and a ''For Rent'' sign on Barrow Street". They find an apartment, but fame and fortune are a lot more elusive. Ruth gets the attention of playboy publisher Bob Baker when she submits a story about her gorgeous sister Eileen. She tries to keep his attention by convincing him that she and the gorgeous, man-getting Eileen are one and the same person.', 'Ruth and her beautiful sister Eileen come to New York''s Greenwich Village looking for "fame, fortune and a ''For Rent'' sign on Barrow Street". They find an apartment, but fame and fortune are a lot more elusive. Ruth gets the attention of playboy publisher Bob Baker when she submits a story about her gorgeous sister Eileen. She tries to keep his attention by convincing him that she and the gorgeous, man-getting Eileen are one and the same person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihJqUHuY9ypnWjXfzrPEAIYvK0T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60966'),
  ('803284138145218968', 'My sister is a hot girl, so cute 2', null, 'Romance, Animation', null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1153194'),
  ('419675101523619817', 'My Sister My Love', 1966, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Vilgot Sjöman, Lasse Björne, Bertil Ohlsson', 'Vilgot Sjöman', 'Bibi Andersson, Per Oscarsson, Jarl Kulle, Tina Hedström, Gunnar Björnstrand, Kjerstin Dellert, Berta Hall, Lena Hansson', null, 'Sweden, 1782. Jacob, a young noble, somewhat wild and vehement, returns from his studies in France. After his absence, he returns home happy, but is even happier of meeting his beloved sister Charlotte again. However, she has been promised to the Baron Alsmeden, a man of great influence at court, and this fact will awake a feeling like jealousy in Jacob.', 'Sweden, 1782. Jacob, a young noble, somewhat wild and vehement, returns from his studies in France. After his absence, he returns home happy, but is even happier of meeting his beloved sister Charlotte again. However, she has been promised to the Baron Alsmeden, a man of great influence at court, and this fact will awake a feeling like jealousy in Jacob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ojw0Za6VLqekJjoMBEnMVgrx7eK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102497'),
  ('453682376418578320', 'My Sister-in-law''s Job', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'No Hyun-jin', null, 'Park Joo-bin, Min Do-yoon, Ji Soo-I, Jung Jae-sik', null, 'An erotic film that depicts the dangerous relationship between a man and a co-worker''s wife.', 'An erotic film that depicts the dangerous relationship between a man and a co-worker''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGrwb0WE2ARfIOBlon67tx20kqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:482204'),
  ('839104074891188026', 'My Sister-in-law''s Secret', 2019, 'Drama', 'Choi Jae-hoo', null, 'Kim Ji-ah, Sae Bom, Jo Wan-jin', null, 'A sister-in-law goes to a motel with her girlfriend. She runs into her brother-in-law, who is cheating on her sister. The sister-in-law''s blood boils, but there''s nothing she can do about it, because now he knows she''s a lesbian. They make a deal to keep each others'' secrets, but the sister-in-law ends up having a threesome with her brother-in-law and her girlfriend.', 'A sister-in-law goes to a motel with her girlfriend. She runs into her brother-in-law, who is cheating on her sister. The sister-in-law''s blood boils, but there''s nothing she can do about it, because now he knows she''s a lesbian. They make a deal to keep each others'' secrets, but the sister-in-law ends up having a threesome with her brother-in-law and her girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ib7jFLnrI7KLbGa1GeZ9ZCuoWgO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671622'),
  ('121795549960670921', 'My Sister, My Love', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hiroshi Ando, Kazuhiro Suzuki, Tomohiro Kubo', 'Saeki Nejime, Hiroshi Ando', 'Jun Matsumoto, Nana Eikura, Yuta Hiraoka, Ayaka Komatsu, Yuko Asano, Makiko Watanabe', null, 'It is a taboo story about love and incest between twins. It''s not about sex, it''s about the feelings the two have for one another and how society views them.', 'It is a taboo story about love and incest between twins. It''s not about sex, it''s about the feelings the two have for one another and how society views them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r6EjvHRshDnZZu398QYenmiOgQ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80650'),
  ('302786107167778796', 'My Sister, Sister, Sister...', 2019, 'Romance, Drama', null, null, 'Yoo Sul-young, Ah Ri, Min Do-yoon, Kim Min-jeong, Jung In', null, 'I was once a novelist who was looking forward to the future, but now I am living in a house that is just a handful. I have to write, but the enthusiasm for writing has long been lost. One day when I was bored every day, my friend (Jane) of Sukjep (exponent) comes home. Jane pulls the hair out of her face with a sweaty face on a hot summer day and sits on the front door. When I saw Jane who seemed innocent and innocent and sexy, my heart was rocked ...', 'I was once a novelist who was looking forward to the future, but now I am living in a house that is just a handful. I have to write, but the enthusiasm for writing has long been lost. One day when I was bored every day, my friend (Jane) of Sukjep (exponent) comes home. Jane pulls the hair out of her face with a sweaty face on a hot summer day and sits on the front door. When I saw Jane who seemed innocent and innocent and sexy, my heart was rocked ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ebq7uYRnmYqtrOjGdrfJDkyJewG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763633'),
  ('259044067674311861', 'My Sister''s Bones', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Heidi Greensmith, Joel Devlin, Colin Jones', 'Naomi Gibney', 'Jenny Seagrove, Anna Friel, Ben Miles, David Bradley, Lovi Poe, Melissa Advani, Erin Ainsworth, Audrey Azuzu', null, 'Kate Rafter is back to home after a horrific incident in war-torn Iraq and the death of her mother. While packing up her mother''s belongings she comes to believe there is something strange and terrifying happening in the house next door.', 'Kate Rafter is back to home after a horrific incident in war-torn Iraq and the death of her mother. While packing up her mother''s belongings she comes to believe there is something strange and terrifying happening in the house next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gr9WexfjVIji7LIH3D5zq4qAPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1215919'),
  ('148519148474433878', 'My Sister’s Good Fortune', 1995, 'Drama', 'Angela Schanelec, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Angela Schanelec', 'Anna Bolk, Wolfgang Michael, Angela Schanelec, Michael Maertens, Margit Bendokat, Thomas Blum, Lukas Confurius, Oliver Kamrast', null, 'A young photographer has fallen in love with his girlfriend''s sister, throwing the trio into chaos.', 'A young photographer has fallen in love with his girlfriend''s sister, throwing the trio into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prGhVrgsSxIlTFBNH8ITGwTnfbh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376844'),
  ('446966278197781342', 'My Sister''s Keeper', 2009, 'Drama', 'Nick Cassavetes, Caleb Deschanel', 'Jeremy Leven, Nick Cassavetes', 'Cameron Diaz, Abigail Breslin, Sofia Vassilieva, Alec Baldwin, Jason Patric, Joan Cusack, Heather Wahlquist, Evan Ellingson', 'PG-13', 'Sara and Brian live an idyllic life with their young son and daughter. But their family is rocked by sudden, heartbreaking news that forces them to make a difficult and unorthodox choice in order to save their baby girl''s life. The parents'' desperate decision raises both ethical and moral questions and rips away at the foundation of their relationship. Their actions ultimately set off a court case that threatens to tear the family apart, while revealing surprising truths that challenge everyone''s perceptions of love and loyalty and give new meaning to the definition of healing.', 'Sara and Brian live an idyllic life with their young son and daughter. But their family is rocked by sudden, heartbreaking news that forces them to make a difficult and unorthodox choice in order to save their baby girl''s life. The parents'' desperate decision raises both ethical and moral questions and rips away at the foundation of their relationship. Their actions ultimately set off a court case that threatens to tear the family apart, while revealing surprising truths that challenge everyone''s perceptions of love and loyalty and give new meaning to the definition of healing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atRGqnG7pe0hZP97RWDLrT2hRGZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10024'),
  ('432299871401514649', 'My Small Land', 2022, 'Drama', 'Emma Kawawada, Hidetoshi Shinomiya, Keijirô Akiyama', 'Emma Kawawada', 'Lina Arashi, Daiken Okudaira, Arashi Kahafizadeh, Lilly Kahafizadeh, Lion Kahafizadeh, Takashi Fujii, Chizuru Ikewaki, Hanae Kan', null, 'Sarya lives between three worlds: Having fled from Turkey to Japan, her small family tries to maintain their Kurdish traditions. On the other hand, Sarya, who arrived when she was five, feels at home in Japan. But then, the family loses its refugee-status. Life becomes unpredictable and their days in Japan seem numbered. A haunting story about the balancing act of finding your place in the world.', 'Sarya lives between three worlds: Having fled from Turkey to Japan, her small family tries to maintain their Kurdish traditions. On the other hand, Sarya, who arrived when she was five, feels at home in Japan. But then, the family loses its refugee-status. Life becomes unpredictable and their days in Japan seem numbered. A haunting story about the balancing act of finding your place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ks8vISF2m3ApnkECGDyBseDLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:918101'),
  ('1090281002178532106', 'My Smurfy Valentine', 1983, 'Animation', 'Gerard Baldwin', 'Len Janson, Chuck Menville', 'June Foray, Paul Winchell, Lucille Bliss, Amanda McBroom, Don Messick, Joe Besser, William Callaway, Michael Bell', null, 'What could be more smurfy than spending Valentine''s Day with the most lovable little blue creatures in all of the forest? In this half-hour animated special from Hanna-Barbera, the residents of Smurf Village cheerfully await Cupid''s arrival ... but evil lurks nearby. Can Cupid''s arrow make a dent in the stone-hard heart of Gargamel, the evil wizard? Will Smurfette''s Prince Smurfing ever arrive?', 'What could be more smurfy than spending Valentine''s Day with the most lovable little blue creatures in all of the forest? In this half-hour animated special from Hanna-Barbera, the residents of Smurf Village cheerfully await Cupid''s arrival ... but evil lurks nearby. Can Cupid''s arrow make a dent in the stone-hard heart of Gargamel, the evil wizard? Will Smurfette''s Prince Smurfing ever arrive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j93fi3NU0IfqyP4mD1gHNW6n2iN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358180'),
  ('900363589727130718', 'My SO Has Got Depression', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kiyoshi Sasabe, Takeshi Hamada, Masaya Takahashi', 'Tenten Hosokawa', 'Aoi Miyazaki, Masato Sakai, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Kanji Tsuda, Hiroshi Inuzuka, Ren Osugi, Kimiko Yo', null, 'Mikio is a married man and works hard for the company where he is employed. Then one day Mikio is diagnosed with depression. Mikio''s wife is Haruko. They have been married for 5 years. Haruko draws comics for work, but they do not sell well. She mainly relied on Mikio for support. Meanwhile, Haruko did not notice any changes in her husband. She begins to blame herself for not noticing any signs. Mikio''s depression derived from his work. His company has been pressing him to quit the company. After Mikio quits his job his condition improves, but the dynamics of their relationship changes.', 'Mikio is a married man and works hard for the company where he is employed. Then one day Mikio is diagnosed with depression. Mikio''s wife is Haruko. They have been married for 5 years. Haruko draws comics for work, but they do not sell well. She mainly relied on Mikio for support. Meanwhile, Haruko did not notice any changes in her husband. She begins to blame herself for not noticing any signs. Mikio''s depression derived from his work. His company has been pressing him to quit the company. After Mikio quits his job his condition improves, but the dynamics of their relationship changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dpltzEBHYrDJaKJsQZAXmr6S3EF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85575'),
  ('567076820356135296', 'My Sole Desire', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Lucie Borleteau', 'Clara Bourreau, Lucie Borleteau, Laure Giappiconi', 'Zita Hanrot, Louise Chevillotte, Laure Giappiconi, Pedro Casablanc, Sième Miladi, Yuliya Abiss, Tokou Bogui, Céline Fuhrer', null, 'When aimless Manon begins work at À mon seul désir, a strip club that offers high concept performances, she instantly bonds with her fellow strippers, particularly Mia, an aspiring actress with a boyfriend and child. Manon learns that it is “not easy money, but fast money” and when she finds herself falling for Mia, she is forced to question her priorities as she explores her newfound erotic life.', 'When aimless Manon begins work at À mon seul désir, a strip club that offers high concept performances, she instantly bonds with her fellow strippers, particularly Mia, an aspiring actress with a boyfriend and child. Manon learns that it is “not easy money, but fast money” and when she finds herself falling for Mia, she is forced to question her priorities as she explores her newfound erotic life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds0tapugknJAD6ClBI3cD6Z4CiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960292'),
  ('14909020362153064', 'My Son', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Martial Fougeron', 'Florence Eliakim, Martial Fougeron', 'Nathalie Baye, Olivier Gourmet, Victor Sévaux, Marie Kremer, Valentine Stach, Emmanuelle Riva, Michèle Moretti, Thomas Silberstein', null, 'Julien and his mum care for each other very much. But Julien has committed a deadly sin: he is growing into a teenager! Worse, he has found himself a girlfriend of his age. "Mummy" is not going to tolerate such an ignominy. Julien is HER baby and will remain HERS for ever, encouraged in her "crusade" by her bovine husband and barely thwarted by the more courageous interventions of Suzanne, Julien''s sympathetic big sister.', 'Julien and his mum care for each other very much. But Julien has committed a deadly sin: he is growing into a teenager! Worse, he has found himself a girlfriend of his age. "Mummy" is not going to tolerate such an ignominy. Julien is HER baby and will remain HERS for ever, encouraged in her "crusade" by her bovine husband and barely thwarted by the more courageous interventions of Suzanne, Julien''s sympathetic big sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNcmkD0aowU3yD9TF5v2duoHPdx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76268'),
  ('400040383026659983', 'My Son', 2014, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Alain Berliner, Philippe Lardon', 'Raphaëlle Roudaut', 'Michèle Laroque, Philippe Lefebvre, Maxence Perrin, Victor Meutelet, Liah O''Prey, Roxane Bret, Audrey Chamot, Marie Abidine', null, 'Mathilde, a mother-of-three, thoughtful consultant in a Planned Parenthood Center, is visited by a 16-year-old girl who was raped at a party. Shattered when she finds out her son is being accused, she now faces a great dilemma.', 'Mathilde, a mother-of-three, thoughtful consultant in a Planned Parenthood Center, is visited by a 16-year-old girl who was raped at a party. Shattered when she finds out her son is being accused, she now faces a great dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evPxIWMyZJSP5Lzds7PhlR9Ghdu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374926'),
  ('94084605725358949', 'My Son', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Barbara Dupont, Christian Carion, Alice Di Giacomo', 'Christian Carion, Laure Irrmann', 'Guillaume Canet, Mélanie Laurent, Olivier de Benoist, Antoine Hamel, Marc Robert, Mohamed Brikat, Lino Papa, Tristan Pagès', null, 'The story of a busy man, who fills his time travelling to Africa, South America and the Middle East. His passion for his job has distanced him from his loved ones. He’s been divorced for three years and has since seen his son very little. When the latter disappears, he is forced to stand still, and soon discovers things about his ex-wife and, above all, his son. A terrible feeling of guilt overwhelms him and he decides to find his son at all costs...', 'The story of a busy man, who fills his time travelling to Africa, South America and the Middle East. His passion for his job has distanced him from his loved ones. He’s been divorced for three years and has since seen his son very little. When the latter disappears, he is forced to stand still, and soon discovers things about his ex-wife and, above all, his son. A terrible feeling of guilt overwhelms him and he decides to find his son at all costs...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uBXvbR3HmIimsz8NOf9yJJWnfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451646'),
  ('670524206757114933', 'My Son', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Éric Dumont, Christian Carion', 'Christian Carion, Laure Irrmann', 'James McAvoy, Claire Foy, Tom Cullen, Gary Lewis, Michael Moreland, Paul Rattray, Robert Jack, Rosalind Sydney', 'R', 'When a man''s only son goes missing, he travels to the town where his ex-wife lives in search of answers. To play a man whose life is clouded by mystery, McAvoy will not be given a script of dialogue.', 'When a man''s only son goes missing, he travels to the town where his ex-wife lives in search of answers. To play a man whose life is clouded by mystery, McAvoy will not be given a script of dialogue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jrnCkZnktMTNYOEN5uo63nKKKHN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750253'),
