  ('13881256138027850', 'My Son John', 1952, 'Drama', 'Leo McCarey, Harry Stradling Sr., Alvin Ganzer', 'Leo McCarey, Myles Connolly', 'Helen Hayes, Van Heflin, Dean Jagger, Robert Walker, Minor Watson, Frank McHugh, Richard Jaeckel, James Young', 'NR', 'In this Cold War drama, a woman suspects her son is a Communist spy.', 'In this Cold War drama, a woman suspects her son is a Communist spy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ljWPm1ELgpHXxvidOFQhff0cD8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52991'),
