  ('1067603241676510561', 'My Son, My Son, What Have Ye Done', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Werner Herzog, Peter Zeitlinger', 'Werner Herzog, Herbert Golder', 'Michael Shannon, Willem Dafoe, Chloë Sevigny, Brad Dourif, Michael Peña, Loretta Devine, Udo Kier, Grace Zabriskie', 'R', 'Brad has committed murder and barricaded himself inside his house. With the help of his friends and neighbours, the cops piece together the strange tale of how this nice young man arrived at such a dark place.', 'Brad has committed murder and barricaded himself inside his house. With the help of his friends and neighbours, the cops piece together the strange tale of how this nice young man arrived at such a dark place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUS8WNlJblq2GMCFPKBHzhu0XDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44027'),
  ('302752123794042438', 'My Son, the Hero', 1961, 'Drama, Western', 'Ismael Rodríguez, Antonio Solano, Raúl Lavista', 'Ricardo Garibay', 'Antonio Aguilar, Julio Alemán, Columba Domínguez, Patricia Conde, David Reynoso, Luis Aragón, Dolores Camarillo, Pancho Córdova', null, 'Northern Mexico, early 20th century. Reynaldo del Hierro is murdered while riding with his sons Reynaldo and Martín, whose mother instills in them the need for revenge.', 'Northern Mexico, early 20th century. Reynaldo del Hierro is murdered while riding with his sons Reynaldo and Martín, whose mother instills in them the need for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHQh54v5jLTvaBbqhVWZxYCtV59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116986'),
  ('358623001447294222', 'My Son, the Hero', 1962, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Duccio Tessari, Odoardo Fiory, Nino Zanchin', 'Duccio Tessari, Ennio De Concini', 'Antonella Lualdi, Pedro Armendáriz, Jacqueline Sassard, Giuliano Gemma, Serge Nubret, Gérard Séty, Tanya Lopert, Ingrid Schoeller', null, 'Krios, the youngest of the Titans, may be the least strong of the seven brothers whose strength comes from their mother, earth-goddess Gaia, but is by far the smartest, and thus their natural leader. He arrives on Crete, the kingdom of the mighty king Minos, impresses him as gladiator, gains his trust, falls in love with a mortal girl and discovers both Minos''s human sacrifice-cult and a foreign conspiracy to seize power with a hidden army.', 'Krios, the youngest of the Titans, may be the least strong of the seven brothers whose strength comes from their mother, earth-goddess Gaia, but is by far the smartest, and thus their natural leader. He arrives on Crete, the kingdom of the mighty king Minos, impresses him as gladiator, gains his trust, falls in love with a mortal girl and discovers both Minos''s human sacrifice-cult and a foreign conspiracy to seize power with a hidden army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aqs3LEmJYn421tJHGCvZMPwGBME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145472'),
