  ('734880564356462667', 'My Sons', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yoji Yamada, Tetsuo Takaha', 'Yoji Yamada, Yoshitaka Asama', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Masatoshi Nagase, Emi Wakui, Mieko Harada, Ryuzo Tanaka, Miyoko Asada, Kunie Tanaka, Ryoichi Yamaguchi', null, 'Tetsuo is a young man living in Tokyo, who falls in love with a deaf-mute factory girl. He has always felt jealous of his college-educated brother, but ultimately wins both the girl and his father''s acceptance and support in a touching and refreshing way.', 'Tetsuo is a young man living in Tokyo, who falls in love with a deaf-mute factory girl. He has always felt jealous of his college-educated brother, but ultimately wins both the girl and his father''s acceptance and support in a touching and refreshing way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Fp8GiGAC2uohvanWq5nibTpDJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225614'),
  ('636498172301846100', 'My Soul to Take', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Wes Craven, Petra Korner, Francisco Ortiz', 'Wes Craven', 'Max Thieriot, John Magaro, Denzel Whitaker, Zena Grey, Nick Lashaway, Paulina Olszynski, Emily Meade, Jeremy Chu', 'R', 'On the day the Riverton Ripper vanished without a trace, seven children were born. Today, they''re all turning 16... and turning up dead.', 'On the day the Riverton Ripper vanished without a trace, seven children were born. Today, they''re all turning 16... and turning up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dOFUWCue0ovlGpUhuEDmOikTPk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43931'),
  ('874920124909632229', 'My Southern Family Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Matt S. Bell, Emily Moss Wilson, Steve Lasky', 'Alys Murray, Emily Moss Wilson', 'Jaicy Elliot, Ryan Rottman, Brian McNamara, Gralen Bryant Banks, Anniston Almond, Adeleine Whittle, Moira Kelly, Bruce Campbell', 'G', 'Under the guise of a journalist, Campbell has a chance to get to know her biological father for the first time – without him ever knowing who she really is. As she spends time with him and his family, as well as with the town’s record keeper, she realizes that families are messy, wonderful things. In the end, Campbell must decide if she’s going to keep her identity a secret or reveal the truth to her father – a decision that will change their family Christmas forever.', 'Under the guise of a journalist, Campbell has a chance to get to know her biological father for the first time – without him ever knowing who she really is. As she spends time with him and his family, as well as with the town’s record keeper, she realizes that families are messy, wonderful things. In the end, Campbell must decide if she’s going to keep her identity a secret or reveal the truth to her father – a decision that will change their family Christmas forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c318CHh7DeyfORPhDUASRQIoSSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028558'),
  ('159766049402964680', 'My Spy', 2020, 'Family, Action, Comedy', 'Aric Dupere, Urs Hirschbiegel, Andrea Sheppard', 'Jon Hoeber, Erich Hoeber', 'Dave Bautista, Chloe Coleman, Parisa Fitz-Henley, Kristen Schaal, Greg Bryk, Ken Jeong, Nicola Correia Damude, Devere Rogers', 'PG-13', 'A hardened CIA operative finds himself at the mercy of a precocious 9-year-old girl, having been sent undercover to surveil her family.', 'A hardened CIA operative finds himself at the mercy of a precocious 9-year-old girl, having been sent undercover to surveil her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2C6jRK9PtPIs99RQhKtqGlsnsO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592834'),
