  ('629419162341623588', 'My Stars', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Laetitia Colombani, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Laetitia Colombani', 'Kad Merad, Catherine Deneuve, Mélanie Bernier, Emmanuelle Béart, Maria de Medeiros, Rufus, Antoine Duléry, Juliette Lamboley', null, 'Robert, a fan of three French actresses is a bald-headed, potbellied man on the fifties, but fully devotes himself to them, and sometimes works for them without being recognized. But those star actresses find him a simple stalker fan and make fun of him, but later recognize he is sincere and genuine.', 'Robert, a fan of three French actresses is a bald-headed, potbellied man on the fifties, but fully devotes himself to them, and sometimes works for them without being recognized. But those star actresses find him a simple stalker fan and make fun of him, but later recognize he is sincere and genuine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMqfxX6tUzXysOsXD0IYRguPLsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15438'),
  ('532918089088246873', 'My Step Dad: The Hippie', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Meltem Bozoflu', 'Eray Akyamaner, Uğur Güvercin, Murat Kepez', 'Onur Buldu, Mahir İpek, Derya Karadaş, Onur Atilla, Meltem Yılmazkaya, Yasemin Baştan, Burak Topaloğlu, Uğur Bilgin', null, 'When three adult siblings meet the offbeat man who their widowed mom fawns over, they take drastic actions to stop them from ever getting married.', 'When three adult siblings meet the offbeat man who their widowed mom fawns over, they take drastic actions to stop them from ever getting married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVF83dIFXCekvR2YoXt5hTHF0DM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522828'),
  ('1034124782540568592', 'My Stepmother Is an Alien', 1988, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Richard Benjamin, Richard H. Kline, Dick Ziker', 'Herschel Weingrod, Timothy Harris, Jonathan Reynolds', 'Dan Aykroyd, Kim Basinger, Jon Lovitz, Alyson Hannigan, Joseph Maher, Seth Green, Ann Prentiss, Wesley Mann', 'PG-13', 'Trying to rescue her home planet from destruction, a gorgeous extraterrestrial named Celeste arrives on Earth and begins her scientific research. She woos quirky scientist Dr. Steve Mills, a widower with a young daughter. Before long, Celeste finds herself in love with Steve and her new life on Earth, where she experiences true intimacy for the first time. But when she loses sight of her mission, she begins to question where she belongs.', 'Trying to rescue her home planet from destruction, a gorgeous extraterrestrial named Celeste arrives on Earth and begins her scientific research. She woos quirky scientist Dr. Steve Mills, a widower with a young daughter. Before long, Celeste finds herself in love with Steve and her new life on Earth, where she experiences true intimacy for the first time. But when she loses sight of her mission, she begins to question where she belongs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQtd0q7hJnlol2DYdSEJyZAyMCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12120'),
  ('1072975866355688355', 'My Straight Son', 2012, 'Drama', 'Miguel Ferrari, Alexandra Henao', 'Miguel Ferrari', 'Guillermo García, Ignacio Montes, Hilda Abrahamz, Elba Escobar, Sócrates Serrano, Carolina Torres, Alexander Da Silva, Beatriz Valdés', null, 'The story of Diego, a young and successful photographer that lives in the glamorous world of fashion, shallowness and excess. A tragic accident turns his world around; his partner is now in a coma. Unexpectedly, and right at this terrible time, Diego must take care of his son, Armando. Now, both of them have to adapt to each other; Armando to the unknown, homosexual world of his father, and Diego to the closed attitude of his teenage son.', 'The story of Diego, a young and successful photographer that lives in the glamorous world of fashion, shallowness and excess. A tragic accident turns his world around; his partner is now in a coma. Unexpectedly, and right at this terrible time, Diego must take care of his son, Armando. Now, both of them have to adapt to each other; Armando to the unknown, homosexual world of his father, and Diego to the closed attitude of his teenage son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlAtgCDpCea5s4X7JrV6TS88vsX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168379'),
  ('896414645557429521', 'My Suicide', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Lee Miller, Lisa Wiegand, Steven Buhai', 'David Lee Miller, Eric J. Adams, Gabriel Sunday', 'Gabriel Sunday, David Carradine, Mariel Hemingway, Joe Mantegna, Brooke Nevin, Nora Dunn, Michael Welch, Sandy Martin', null, 'After declaring that he''s going to film himself committing suicide for a school project, Archie videotapes his surprising interactions with worried family members, interested classmates, unreliable medical experts and the hottest girl in school.', 'After declaring that he''s going to film himself committing suicide for a school project, Archie videotapes his surprising interactions with worried family members, interested classmates, unreliable medical experts and the hottest girl in school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgLWcqUkmV0u9xUcFBF3vPqhrIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81434'),
  ('582988439231722526', 'My Summer in Provence', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roselyne Bosch, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Roselyne Bosch', 'Jean Reno, Lukas Pelissier, Hugo Dessioux, Chloé Jouannet, Anna Galiena, Aure Atika, Tom Leeb, Jean-Michel Noirey', null, 'In the wake of their parent''s separation, three siblings spend the summer in the south of France with their estranged Grandfather. In less than 24 hours, a clash of generations has occurred between the teenagers and the old man. During this turbulent summer, both generations will be transformed by one another.', 'In the wake of their parent''s separation, three siblings spend the summer in the south of France with their estranged Grandfather. In less than 24 hours, a clash of generations has occurred between the teenagers and the old man. During this turbulent summer, both generations will be transformed by one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQPr7SXQosEeoT0ownuAONtszHT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263281'),
  ('1007853634947812556', 'My Summer of Love', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Paweł Pawlikowski, Ryszard Lenczewski, Michael Elliott', 'Michael Wynne', 'Natalie Press, Emily Blunt, Paddy Considine, Dean Andrews, Michelle Byrne, Paul Antony-Barber, Lynette Edwards, Kathryn Sumner', 'R', 'In the Yorkshire countryside, working-class tomboy Mona meets the exotic, pampered Tamsin. To seal their friendship, Mona introduces Tamsin to her born-again Christian brother and helps her spy on her adulterous father. Bound together by their secrets, the two girls see their friendship deepen and enter into dangerous waters.', 'In the Yorkshire countryside, working-class tomboy Mona meets the exotic, pampered Tamsin. To seal their friendship, Mona introduces Tamsin to her born-again Christian brother and helps her spy on her adulterous father. Bound together by their secrets, the two girls see their friendship deepen and enter into dangerous waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47eozMel2wZgEASToUzScsPVpDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9709'),
  ('1139250979573614331', 'My Summer Prince', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Theo Angell, Peter Sullivan', 'Topher Payne', 'Taylor Cole, Jack Turner, Lauren Holly, Marina Sirtis, Vanessa Angel, Kassandra Clementi, Brian Dare, Ash Santos', null, 'When a prince, and heir to the throne, finds himself in some hot water for his partying ways, the royal family decides to hire a top notch PR consultant to work with him.', 'When a prince, and heir to the throne, finds himself in some hot water for his partying ways, the royal family decides to hire a top notch PR consultant to work with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPBNr3T8kxRZJJ9SL9TpbZCuzqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407334'),
  ('927703692744202004', 'My Summer With Irène', 2024, 'Drama', 'Carlo Sironi', 'Silvana Tamma, Carlo Sironi', 'Noée Abita, Maria Camilla Brandenburg, Claudio Segaluscio, Gabriele Rollo, Beatrice Puccilli, Anna di Luzio, Maurizio Grassia', null, 'Italy, 1997. When Clara and Irène, both 17, meet they are nothing like each other but get on marvellously well. They run away together to a faraway island off the coast of Sicily to live their summer freely, and to hide from a reality they want to forget.', 'Italy, 1997. When Clara and Irène, both 17, meet they are nothing like each other but get on marvellously well. They run away together to a faraway island off the coast of Sicily to live their summer freely, and to hide from a reality they want to forget.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2DR0po3l3zsu75c5QszwFDoZLKL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1151173'),
  ('176425423272130048', 'My Summer with the Shark', 2023, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Davide Gentile, Ivan Casalgrandi', 'Gianluca Leoncini, Valerio Cilio', 'Tiziano Menichelli, Stefano Rosci, Virginia Raffaele, Claudio Santamaria, Edoardo Pesce, Matteo Scattaretico, Alberto Testone, Roberto Fazioli', null, 'School''s out and 13-year-old Walter has lost his father. In his seemingly aimless wanderings around the Roman coast, a fascinating and mysterious place catches his eye: an abandoned villa with a huge, murky swimming pool. But the villa is not unguarded...', 'School''s out and 13-year-old Walter has lost his father. In his seemingly aimless wanderings around the Roman coast, a fascinating and mysterious place catches his eye: an abandoned villa with a huge, murky swimming pool. But the villa is not unguarded...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxapw8Ee2xfim4dL1PFVPJn2JE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1055406'),
  ('11826475605444938', 'My Sunshine', 2024, 'Drama', 'Hiroshi Okuyama, Hiroshi Okuyama, Tomohiro Kubo', 'Hiroshi Okuyama', 'Keitatsu Koshiyama, Kiara Nakanishi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Ryuya Wakaba, Maho Yamada, Yunho, Atsushi Shinohara, Kentaro Tamura', 'NR', 'Two young skaters, polar opposites in personality, team up to train for an ice-dancing competition, their growing bond blurring the lines between partners and more as winter unfolds.', 'Two young skaters, polar opposites in personality, team up to train for an ice-dancing competition, their growing bond blurring the lines between partners and more as winter unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdBfHxQnaXifIatOpwX7IZvhsiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1267822'),
  ('442703818628898594', 'My Super Ex-Girlfriend', 2006, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Don Burgess, Ivan Reitman, G.A. Aguilar', 'Don Payne', 'Uma Thurman, Luke Wilson, Anna Faris, Eddie Izzard, Rainn Wilson, Stelio Savante, Mike Iorio, Wanda Sykes', 'PG-13', 'When New York architect Matt Saunders dumps his new girlfriend Jenny Johnson—a smart, sexy, and reluctant superhero known as G-Girl—she uses her powers to make his life a living hell.', 'When New York architect Matt Saunders dumps his new girlfriend Jenny Johnson—a smart, sexy, and reluctant superhero known as G-Girl—she uses her powers to make his life a living hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j4NCuEfLHzIjaWDns5fz6nGH2FD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4474'),
  ('1074360108934852819', 'My Super Psycho Sweet 16', 2009, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Jacob Gentry', 'Scott Thomas, Jed Elinoff', 'Lauren McKnight, Julianna Guill, Chris Zylka, Matt Angel, Alex Van, Maia Osman, Joey Nappo, Leandra Terrazzano', 'NR', 'A spoiled teen’s birthday bash turns killer after she convinced her parents to re-open a roller skating rink where a series of brutal murders took place and the killer comes back to wreak havoc during her party.', 'A spoiled teen’s birthday bash turns killer after she convinced her parents to re-open a roller skating rink where a series of brutal murders took place and the killer comes back to wreak havoc during her party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EeYLxKgrcaLq52BnPo7noVpTXc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35759'),
  ('721493354410085516', 'My Sweet Holiday', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Sandra L. Martin', 'Sandra L. Martin', 'Malone Thomas, Jason Burkey, Alexandra Ficken, Patty Lambert, Naddya Alicea, Gina Hiraizumi, George Cron, Kristen Vaganos', null, 'When Sadie''s (Malone Thomas) boyfriend cancels their holiday plans, she decides to spend Christmas with her parents back in her hometown, only to find out they''ve sold the family''s beloved chocolate store to a stranger who knows nothing about chocolate. Begrudgingly, her father convinces her that she''d be the obvious choice to help teach the new owner everything she knows about chocolate. In the middle of planning the perfect retirement party for her parents, she discovers that not everything has to be perfect. And sometimes, when you least expect it, you find love.', 'When Sadie''s (Malone Thomas) boyfriend cancels their holiday plans, she decides to spend Christmas with her parents back in her hometown, only to find out they''ve sold the family''s beloved chocolate store to a stranger who knows nothing about chocolate. Begrudgingly, her father convinces her that she''d be the obvious choice to help teach the new owner everything she knows about chocolate. In the middle of planning the perfect retirement party for her parents, she discovers that not everything has to be perfect. And sometimes, when you least expect it, you find love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DpvLtnDDcJeebn4sZ1zxhsl1pZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767350'),
  ('982599919206603160', 'My Sweet Little Village', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Věra Pištěková', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'János Bán, Marián Labuda, Rudolf Hrušínský, Petr Čepek, Libuše Šafránková, Jan Hartl, Miloslav Štibich, Rudolf Hrušínský', null, 'The movie''s main storyline follows the life of Otík, a young man, in a tight-knit village community. The sweet-tempered Otík works as an assistant truck driver with Mr. Pávek, his older colleague and practical-minded neighbor. Pávek''s family takes care of Otík, whose parents are dead. However, the two coworkers become at odds over Otík''s inability to perform even the simplest tasks. Pávek demands that Otík be transferred to assist another driver, who happens to be a choleric and suspicious man named Turek (Turk in Czech). Rather than work with Turek, Otík decides to accept an offer of employment in Prague, but finds he does not fit in to the city life. After discovering that the transfer of Otík to Prague was a trick by a crooked politician to get a deal on Otík''s large inherited house, Pávek agrees to give Otík a second chance and retrieves him from the city to resume their work together.', 'The movie''s main storyline follows the life of Otík, a young man, in a tight-knit village community. The sweet-tempered Otík works as an assistant truck driver with Mr. Pávek, his older colleague and practical-minded neighbor. Pávek''s family takes care of Otík, whose parents are dead. However, the two coworkers become at odds over Otík''s inability to perform even the simplest tasks. Pávek demands that Otík be transferred to assist another driver, who happens to be a choleric and suspicious man named Turek (Turk in Czech). Rather than work with Turek, Otík decides to accept an offer of employment in Prague, but finds he does not fit in to the city life. After discovering that the transfer of Otík to Prague was a trick by a crooked politician to get a deal on Otík''s large inherited house, Pávek agrees to give Otík a second chance and retrieves him from the city to resume their work together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WAv3g9UbBw7kd4ikOSGxgVjRGf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31410'),
  ('982951155384661063', 'My Sweet Monster', 2021, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Viktor Glukhushin, Maksim Volkov', 'Dmitry Novoselov', 'Lyubov Aksyonova, Aleksey Chumakov, Alyona Doletskaya, Timur Rodriguez, Prokhor Chekhovskoy, Vladislav Kopp, Pyotr Ivaschenko', 'PG', 'A scandal in the royal family: the wayward princess Barbara escaped from the palace and went through the forest in search of a handsome prince. However, instead of the cherished meeting with her beloved, she is captured by Buka, the most dangerous robber of the kingdom. But it quickly becomes clear that the brisk princess is ready to turn Buka''s life into a nightmare, just to reach her goal. So the restless Varvara begins to establish her own order in the forest.', 'A scandal in the royal family: the wayward princess Barbara escaped from the palace and went through the forest in search of a handsome prince. However, instead of the cherished meeting with her beloved, she is captured by Buka, the most dangerous robber of the kingdom. But it quickly becomes clear that the brisk princess is ready to turn Buka''s life into a nightmare, just to reach her goal. So the restless Varvara begins to establish her own order in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xIbEHAqwK5N7PJJYmbwmxuvC7fL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:576925'),
  ('509507728894702143', 'My Sweet Orange Tree', 2012, 'Drama, Family', 'Marcos Bernstein, Marcos Guttmann, Gustavo Hadba', 'Marcos Bernstein, Melanie Dimantas', 'João Guilherme Ávila, José de Abreu, Caco Ciocler, Eduardo Dascar, Fernanda Vianna, Emiliano Queiroz, Julia de Victa, Tino Gomes', null, 'Zezé is an 8 year old boy who, although a naughty boy, has a good heart. He leads a very modest life, due to the fact that his father has been unemployed for a long time, and has the habit of having long conversations with a sweet orange tree which is in his backyard. Until one day he meets Portuga, a man who begins to help him and soon becomes his best friend.', 'Zezé is an 8 year old boy who, although a naughty boy, has a good heart. He leads a very modest life, due to the fact that his father has been unemployed for a long time, and has the habit of having long conversations with a sweet orange tree which is in his backyard. Until one day he meets Portuga, a man who begins to help him and soon becomes his best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Q6FpTfJYiZZHSe8C9jcopFLptt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191185'),
  ('447437838028219358', 'My Sweet Satan', 1994, 'Crime, Horror', 'Jim Van Bebber, Mike King', 'Jim Van Bebber', 'Jim Van Bebber, Terek Puckett, Alydra Kelly, Sherri Rickman, Tamara Bell, Michael T. Capone, Pete Ludlow, Mike Moore', 'NR', 'A group of directionless, bored, drug-using teenagers get involved in a cult, resulting in a murder.', 'A group of directionless, bored, drug-using teenagers get involved in a cult, resulting in a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV1EVFhpsK8Fuq3wZkkvhNoFo6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99110'),
  ('1129489576005852655', 'My Teacher', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Kosuke Yamada', 'Mari Okada', 'Toma Ikuta, Suzu Hirose, Ryo Ryusei, Aoi Morikawa, Kentaro Ito, Tomoya Nakamura, Manami Higa, Akiko Yagi', null, 'Hibiki Shimada, a normal 17-year-old high-school student, still does not know how to fall in love—although surrounded by love "experts"—until one day she realizes she''s fallen in love with her hot and nice 26-year-old teacher, Itō. She then takes a path to make her teacher understand how she feels for him.', 'Hibiki Shimada, a normal 17-year-old high-school student, still does not know how to fall in love—although surrounded by love "experts"—until one day she realizes she''s fallen in love with her hot and nice 26-year-old teacher, Itō. She then takes a path to make her teacher understand how she feels for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/An1er9gMQZMVdamZI2Un8sd3FbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:447180'),
  ('34831055824908786', 'My Teacher, Mr. Kim', 2003, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jang Kyu-sung, Kim Yun-su, Kim Sung-wook', 'Jang Kyu-sung, Lee Won-hyeong', 'Cha Seung-won, Byun Hee-bong, Sung Ji-ru, Lee Jae-eung, Lee Young-suk, Lee Bom, Seo Hui-seung', 'PG', 'A teacher attempts to lure his handful of students in a small, rural school to Seoul so that he can move on to a better school. His efforts backfire however, and his school becomes one of the highest ranked in the nation.', 'A teacher attempts to lure his handful of students in a small, rural school to Seoul so that he can move on to a better school. His efforts backfire however, and his school becomes one of the highest ranked in the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kCHaC2j8RfyLXMdTtlOr3nIC4CV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63247'),
  ('692117026856840351', 'My Teacher, My Love', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sho Tsukikawa, Yasushi Hanamura, Kohtaro Goto', 'Erika Yoshida', 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Minami Hamabe, Taiki Sato, Rina Kawaei, Yua Shinkawa, Yuma Yamoto, Yuki Saso, Riko Fukumoto', null, 'Ayuha Samaru is a high school student. She is honest and works hard at everything, no matter what. One day, she has trouble at a gyudon restaurant due to money. A man at the restaurant, Yoshitaka Hiromitsu, helps her out. The next day, she finds that Yoshitaka Hiromitsu has come to her school as a substitute teacher for her ill homeroom teacher. Ayuha Samaru now believes that Yoshitaka Hiromitsu is her fate in love. She keeps expressing her feelings to him.', 'Ayuha Samaru is a high school student. She is honest and works hard at everything, no matter what. One day, she has trouble at a gyudon restaurant due to money. A man at the restaurant, Yoshitaka Hiromitsu, helps her out. The next day, she finds that Yoshitaka Hiromitsu has come to her school as a substitute teacher for her ill homeroom teacher. Ayuha Samaru now believes that Yoshitaka Hiromitsu is her fate in love. She keeps expressing her feelings to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QxmWtam3m8ZUw4HPqZDJMINZgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:527281'),
  ('176852710519127407', 'My Teacher, My Obsession', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Mariella Pérez, Juan Hernández, Damián Romay', 'Patrick Robert Young', 'Rusty Joiner, Lucy Loken, Laura Bilgeri, Jana Lee Hamblin, Alexandria DeBerry, Bruno Rose, Lestonja Diaz, David Ditmore', null, 'Riley is struggling to make friends after transferring to a new high school where her father, Chris, is an English teacher. When she meets Kyla, they quickly becomes close friends. However, the friendship takes a strange turn when Riley learns that Kyla is obsessed with her dad. Will Kyla successfully seduce Chris and start a twisted new life with him by removing everyone in her path, or will Riley be able to save her father from Kyla’s treacherous plot before it’s too late?', 'Riley is struggling to make friends after transferring to a new high school where her father, Chris, is an English teacher. When she meets Kyla, they quickly becomes close friends. However, the friendship takes a strange turn when Riley learns that Kyla is obsessed with her dad. Will Kyla successfully seduce Chris and start a twisted new life with him by removing everyone in her path, or will Riley be able to save her father from Kyla’s treacherous plot before it’s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrdhT7Mkk23M59cdV0aaiHLYQWs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530442'),
  ('344441326632752625', 'My Teacher''s Wife', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bruce Leddy, Zoltán David', 'Seth Greenland', 'Jason London, Tia Carrere, Alexondra Lee, Zak Orth, Leslie Lyles, Jeffrey Tambor, Christopher McDonald, Joanna Canton', 'R', 'Todd Boomer is a college student aspiring to get into University. His chances are looking poor when his maths teacher, fails him in every maths test. Help arrives in the guise of the gorgeous Vicki, a mathematical genius who decides to tutor Todd. As the relationship develops,Todd finds himself in an affair with Vicki unknowing of her marriage to his math teacher.', 'Todd Boomer is a college student aspiring to get into University. His chances are looking poor when his maths teacher, fails him in every maths test. Help arrives in the guise of the gorgeous Vicki, a mathematical genius who decides to tutor Todd. As the relationship develops,Todd finds himself in an affair with Vicki unknowing of her marriage to his math teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4esN7mSfMoDUF9Y3fWP0TeUvZW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39001'),
  ('690802009298596087', 'My Tender and Affectionate Beast', 1978, 'Romance, Drama', 'Emil Loteanu, Anatoly Petritsky, Vladimir Kurgansky', 'Emil Loteanu', 'Galina Belyaeva, Oleg Yankovskiy, Leonid Markov, Kirill Lavrov, Grigore Grigoriu, Svetlana Toma, Olegar Fedoro, Aleksandr Zvenigorskiy', null, 'An aristocrat falls for a young woman who brings him ruin. Based on Chekhov''s story. AKA A Hunting Accident, The Shooting Party.', 'An aristocrat falls for a young woman who brings him ruin. Based on Chekhov''s story. AKA A Hunting Accident, The Shooting Party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJAtWyIEV3aFUUKy0nYXJQwS2OZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61266'),
  ('814559777901942814', 'My Tender Matador', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rodrigo Sepúlveda, Sergio Armstrong, Haroldo Muñoz', 'Juan Elías Tovar, Rodrigo Sepúlveda', 'Alfredo Castro, Leonardo Ortizgris, Julieta Zylberberg, Amparo Noguera, Sergio Hernández, Paulina Urrutia, Luis Gnecco, Daniel Antivilo', null, 'Among gunshots and boleros, a passionate relationship flourishes between a lonely transvestite and a young guerrilla during the Pinochet dictatorship.', 'Among gunshots and boleros, a passionate relationship flourishes between a lonely transvestite and a young guerrilla during the Pinochet dictatorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mM9PVIqMJh37pocDuuJH5Q56mt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651170'),
  ('60793815929420986', 'My Tennis Maestro', 2025, 'Drama', 'Andrea Di Stefano, Matteo Cocco', 'Andrea Di Stefano, Ludovica Rampoldi', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Tiziano Menichelli, Giovanni Ludeno, Dora Romano, Valentina Bellè, Astrid Meloni, Chiara Bassermann, Paolo Briguglia', null, 'Italy, 1989. After years of hard training, 13-year-old Felice, carrying his father''s expectations on his shoulders, finally sets out to compete in the national tennis tournaments. While dreaming of a simple summer vacation, he''s instead placed under the wing of ex tennis champion Raul, an unconventional coach hired by his father. Match after match, the two embark on a journey that will lead Felice to discover the taste of freedom, and Raul to glimpse the possibility of a fresh start. As they travel along the Italian coast, an unexpected, deep, and sincere bond between them develops.', 'Italy, 1989. After years of hard training, 13-year-old Felice, carrying his father''s expectations on his shoulders, finally sets out to compete in the national tennis tournaments. While dreaming of a simple summer vacation, he''s instead placed under the wing of ex tennis champion Raul, an unconventional coach hired by his father. Match after match, the two embark on a journey that will lead Felice to discover the taste of freedom, and Raul to glimpse the possibility of a fresh start. As they travel along the Italian coast, an unexpected, deep, and sincere bond between them develops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDucYHSU6iDlRKAj0tJmvNBgoq0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1143973'),
  ('1050270507213091657', 'My Thoughts Are Silent', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Antonio Lukich, Novruz Hikmet, Illya Yehorov', 'Valeria Kalchenko, Antonio Lukich', 'Andrii Lidahovskyi, Irma Vitovska, Iryna Verenych-Ostrovska, Serhii Volosovets, Viktor Shevchenko, Istan Rozumny, Pavlo Dovhan-Levytskyi, Roland Mishko', null, 'Twenty-five-year-old Vadym earns a living recording and selling all kinds of different sounds; nevertheless, he’d rather exchange his life in Kyiv for a better future in far-flung Canada. Thus, when he gets a generous job offer which might help him realise his dream, he jumps at the chance; he soon sets off to record the sounds of animals indigenous to Ukraine and also a rare bird native to the Carpathians. The situation proves somewhat more complicated when Vadym’s companion on the trip turns out to be his mother… To the sounds of a synthesized music score, debuting Ukrainian director Antonio Lukich unfolds a visually creative road movie, in which he demonstrates a highly unusual talent for constructing tragicomic situations.', 'Twenty-five-year-old Vadym earns a living recording and selling all kinds of different sounds; nevertheless, he’d rather exchange his life in Kyiv for a better future in far-flung Canada. Thus, when he gets a generous job offer which might help him realise his dream, he jumps at the chance; he soon sets off to record the sounds of animals indigenous to Ukraine and also a rare bird native to the Carpathians. The situation proves somewhat more complicated when Vadym’s companion on the trip turns out to be his mother… To the sounds of a synthesized music score, debuting Ukrainian director Antonio Lukich unfolds a visually creative road movie, in which he demonstrates a highly unusual talent for constructing tragicomic situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DOmWktaCDJtUfXq3hT7RQ8QUkg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609031'),
  ('625084466610881972', 'My Tomorrow, Your Yesterday', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Kosuke Yamada', 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Sota Fukushi, Nana Komatsu, Masahiro Higashide, Yuki Yamada, Kaya Kiyohara, Akira Otaka, Yoshiko Miyazaki', null, 'Takatoshi Minamiyama majors in art at an university in Kyoto. On the train to the school, he sees Emi Fukuju and falls in love with her at first sight. Gathering up all his courage, he speaks to her. They begin to date and enjoy happy days together, but Emi reveals her secret to him.', 'Takatoshi Minamiyama majors in art at an university in Kyoto. On the train to the school, he sees Emi Fukuju and falls in love with her at first sight. Gathering up all his courage, he speaks to her. They begin to date and enjoy happy days together, but Emi reveals her secret to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtRJKkspD4pv3fd2lO2cT93dpzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428099'),
  ('872641902545620495', 'My Travel Buddy', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Bedran Güzel, Serkan Güler', 'İbrahim Büyükak', 'İbrahim Büyükak, Oğuzhan Koç, Eda Ece, Aslı Bekiroğlu, Emre Kınay, Dilber Ay, Bahar Şahin, Muharrem Bayrak', null, 'Days before Eid, a salesman fired from his job drives to meet his girlfriend''s family, but the trip goes astray due to his zany travel buddy.', 'Days before Eid, a salesman fired from his job drives to meet his girlfriend''s family, but the trip goes astray due to his zany travel buddy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TZUXLdXusbak3GspmvprQQ0CZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477274'),
  ('470988119513636580', 'My Travel Buddy 2', 2018, 'Comedy, Family', 'Yasar Aksoy, Emine Arslan, Ahmet Burçin Kılıç', null, 'İbrahim Büyükak, Oğuzhan Koç, Ezgi Eyüboğlu, Olgun Toker, Bahar Şahin, Kadir Polatçı, Dilber Ay, Aycan Koptur', null, 'Onur and Seref have become both housemates and colleagues within a year. Seref is not successful in managing the song career of Onur.', 'Onur and Seref have become both housemates and colleagues within a year. Seref is not successful in managing the song career of Onur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mAaT4gqrvwGpvZ29dvpgkb8esTf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549650'),
  ('321279583259527772', 'My Trip with Che', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Nareubadee Wetchakam, Khajohnsak Kaewkalong, Kritsana Jitnaowarat', 'Kritsana Jitnaowarat', 'Willie McIntosh, Nakorn Silachai, Jaroenporn Onlamai, Kiattisak Udomnak, Araya A. Hargate, Mario Maurer, Patteera Sarutipongpokin, Channarong Khuntee-tao', null, 'Ake is a growing young adult but still not mature enough, acording to his father. To master all the necessary qualities of a man he wants him to visit Uncle Che during school holiday.', 'Ake is a growing young adult but still not mature enough, acording to his father. To master all the necessary qualities of a man he wants him to visit Uncle Che during school holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxYihMzvOeJCI6lXkTDgFudifFN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77853'),
  ('347735300722102851', 'My True Brilliant Friend', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Clarissa Cappellani, Marie Gioanni, Clarissa Cappellani', 'Clarissa Cappellani', 'Gaia Girace, Margherita Mazzucco, Saverio Costanzo, Ludovica Nasti, Elisa del Genio', null, 'A unique portrayal of two young amateur actresses embarking on a journey that will forever change their lives as they star in the most eagerly anticipated new show of 2018, Elena Ferrante''s My Brilliant Friend.', 'A unique portrayal of two young amateur actresses embarking on a journey that will forever change their lives as they star in the most eagerly anticipated new show of 2018, Elena Ferrante''s My Brilliant Friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hACib0TjpLnva43qNeozKkSpGtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567837'),
  ('396187629712810015', 'My True Friend', 2012, 'Drama, Action', 'Adsajun Sattagovit, Phanomphorn Kutthajan, Prasit Roswan', 'Adsajun Sattagovit', 'Mario Maurer, Natcha Jantapan, Monchanok Saengchaipiangpen, Navapaibool Sukwutthinanons, Kamolned Ruengsri, Siripob Dao-Ngeun, Kritsana Maroukasonti, Poom Rungsrithananon', null, 'A student who is bullied repeatedly develops a deep bond with the leader of a youth gang. As they grow closer, he understands the true meaning of friendship.', 'A student who is bullied repeatedly develops a deep bond with the leader of a youth gang. As they grow closer, he understands the true meaning of friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6kAHIrkTeZ86FLjhqMYiL8H2Kaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128893'),
  ('1051919172885343402', 'My Tutor', 1983, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mac Ahlberg, George Bowers, Tom Stockfisch', 'Joe Roberts', 'Caren Kaye, Matt Lattanzi, Kevin McCarthy, Bruce Bauer, Clark Brandon, Arlene Golonka, Crispin Glover, Amber Denyse Austin', 'R', 'High school senior Bobby Chrystal fails his French class, which will block him from entering Yale. His rich, authoritarian father hires an attractive 29-year-old to tutor Bobby over the summer and help him pass a make-up exam. While Bobby''s friends lead him away into strange excursions aimed at losing their virginity, Bobby finds all the extracurricular activities he needs with his new tutor.', 'High school senior Bobby Chrystal fails his French class, which will block him from entering Yale. His rich, authoritarian father hires an attractive 29-year-old to tutor Bobby over the summer and help him pass a make-up exam. While Bobby''s friends lead him away into strange excursions aimed at losing their virginity, Bobby finds all the extracurricular activities he needs with his new tutor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMIEasZXQImHpRHos5XsVg80ERV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2193'),
  ('337473597207477585', 'My Tutor Friend', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Kyung-hyung, Han Ki-eop, Ji Gil-woong', 'Soo-Wan Choi, Choi Soo-Wan, Park Yeon-seon', 'Kim Ha-neul, Kwon Sang-woo, Kim Ji-woo, Gong Yoo, Baek Il-seob, Kim Hye-ok, Kim Ja-ok, Lee Sung-jin', null, 'A touching story of two completely different students from two completely different worlds. One is a rich male repeating his third year of high school and the other a poor girl in her second year of university struggling to make ends meet.', 'A touching story of two completely different students from two completely different worlds. One is a rich male repeating his third year of high school and the other a poor girl in her second year of university struggling to make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b0P50XbHewuq2GStOyVGyFHWOEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18371'),
  ('27631343154524357', 'My Tutor Friend 2', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ji Kil-wong, Kim Ho-jung, Han Ki-eop', 'Choi Won, Jo Joong-hoon', 'Lee Chung-ah, Park Ki-woong, Lee Yeong-ha, Yoon Young-sam, Julian Quintart, Choi Il-hwa, Lee Ju-yeon, Baek Seung-woo', null, 'Junko, a Japanese exchange student, goes to Korea where she unexpectedly finds herself forced to share a room with Jong-man, a disagreeable young man, who has been forced to tutor her.', 'Junko, a Japanese exchange student, goes to Korea where she unexpectedly finds herself forced to share a room with Jong-man, a disagreeable young man, who has been forced to tutor her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQtHPU8ob35k3ltW7tRfzbLnfBO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92488'),
  ('516704250534405761', 'My Twentieth Century', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Ildikó Enyedi', 'Ildikó Enyedi', 'Dorota Segda, Paulus Manker, Péter Andorai, Gábor Máté, Eszter Kovács, Oleg Yankovskiy, Sándor Czvetkó, Gyula Kéry', null, 'A tale of twin girls, Dóra and Lili, who are born in 1880 Budapest at the same moment Thomas Edison presents his electric lightbulb to the world. The sisters are soon orphaned and separated in childhood, and follow different paths: one grows up to be a naïvely idealistic, bomb-toting anarchist, the other a pampered, hedonistic courtesan. Their paths cross once again on the Orient Express on New Year''s Eve 1899...', 'A tale of twin girls, Dóra and Lili, who are born in 1880 Budapest at the same moment Thomas Edison presents his electric lightbulb to the world. The sisters are soon orphaned and separated in childhood, and follow different paths: one grows up to be a naïvely idealistic, bomb-toting anarchist, the other a pampered, hedonistic courtesan. Their paths cross once again on the Orient Express on New Year''s Eve 1899...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXdS2zI9cRnZzwyxbjduvxPoj64.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49978'),
  ('779884006430338576', 'My Tyrano: Together, Forever', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lin Zhenzhao, Kobun Shizuno', 'Dai Sato', 'Shin-ichiro Miki, Aoi Yuuki, Kaori Ishihara, Katsuyuki Konishi, Kikuko Inoue, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Tatsuya Miyanishi', 'G', 'A tremendous tyrannosaurus—who does not eat meat—and a pterodactyl who cannot fly run into each other and begin their journey to find ‘Paradise’.', 'A tremendous tyrannosaurus—who does not eat meat—and a pterodactyl who cannot fly run into each other and begin their journey to find ‘Paradise’.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mx68fLvMEmkUP28b1Sauml762P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:562464'),
  ('142525774935949000', 'My Uncle', 1999, 'Drama', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', null, 'Ahmet Uğurlu, Halil Tatari, Sibel Voskay, Suna Tekeli', null, '“My Uncle” tells the story of a man who realizes his passion for flying one day and descends into the desert 42 years later, through his nephew’s mouth.', '“My Uncle” tells the story of a man who realizes his passion for flying one day and descends into the desert 42 years later, through his nephew’s mouth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbik9DLtLPDhfL8E5cZ2S3grS4e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:659298'),
  ('193682553518769597', 'My Uncle Benjamin', 1969, 'Comedy, History', 'Alain Levent, Édouard Molinaro', 'Édouard Molinaro, André Couteaux, Jean-François Hauduroy', 'Jacques Brel, Claude Jade, Bernard Alane, Rosy Varte, Paul Frankeur, Lyne Chardonnet, Robert Dalban, Bernard Blier', null, 'Benjamin is in love with Manette, the innkeeper''s beautiful daughter, but she has no intention of giving in to the young doctor until she sees the marriage contract, and marriage does not fit in with Benjamin''s spirit of independence. For the same reason he resists the efforts of his sister Bettine to marry him off to Arabelle, the daughter of old Dr. Minxit. Benjamin does agree to go and meet the girl. But that evening his sister finds him at the inn together with Manette, who is arrested by her father. So she decides to go with Benjamin herself. But as result of an incident with the fat Marquis puts paid to the expedition. Benjamin is subjected by the Marquis to a humiliating practical joke. Benjamin is determined to got his revenge. He succeeds thanks to the gorgeous Vicomte Hector de Pont-Cassé, who also helps Manette with her problems against her father. But Benjamin is now arrested by the Marquis...', 'Benjamin is in love with Manette, the innkeeper''s beautiful daughter, but she has no intention of giving in to the young doctor until she sees the marriage contract, and marriage does not fit in with Benjamin''s spirit of independence. For the same reason he resists the efforts of his sister Bettine to marry him off to Arabelle, the daughter of old Dr. Minxit. Benjamin does agree to go and meet the girl. But that evening his sister finds him at the inn together with Manette, who is arrested by her father. So she decides to go with Benjamin herself. But as result of an incident with the fat Marquis puts paid to the expedition. Benjamin is subjected by the Marquis to a humiliating practical joke. Benjamin is determined to got his revenge. He succeeds thanks to the gorgeous Vicomte Hector de Pont-Cassé, who also helps Manette with her problems against her father. But Benjamin is now arrested by the Marquis...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCdz98aYr5sY8y709QjzGjIPJv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2373'),
  ('996069976232273934', 'My Uncle Killed a Guy', 2004, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Jorge Furtado, André Moraes, Alex Sernambi', 'Guel Arraes, Jorge Furtado', 'Darlan Cunha, Sophia Reis, Lázaro Ramos, Deborah Secco, Dira Paes, Aílton Graça, Renan Augusto, Júlio Andrade', null, 'Éder is arrested after confessing the murder of a man. Duca, his nephew, is sure that his uncle confessed the crime to protect his girlfriend, Soraya, ex-wife of the deceased, so he enlists two of his friends to help prove his theory.', 'Éder is arrested after confessing the murder of a man. Duca, his nephew, is sure that his uncle confessed the crime to protect his girlfriend, Soraya, ex-wife of the deceased, so he enlists two of his friends to help prove his theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJS0v5sjb7LaVMBCSzjll5lB7d7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77710'),
  ('73368661841760412', 'My Undesirable Friends: Part I - Last Air in Moscow', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Julia Loktev', 'Julia Loktev', 'Anna Nemzer, Ksenia Mironova, Sofya Groysman', 'Not Rated', 'Julia Loktev documents independent journalists in Moscow facing government crackdown as Russia invades Ukraine, capturing their fight for speech amid risks of being branded "foreign agents" and the country''s drift towards authoritarianism.', 'Julia Loktev documents independent journalists in Moscow facing government crackdown as Russia invades Ukraine, capturing their fight for speech amid risks of being branded "foreign agents" and the country''s drift towards authoritarianism.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F290La7BM5CLhLTwa7QsJQVGthok.jpg', 'plex:movie:my-undesirable-friends-part-i-last-air-in-moscow-2026'),
  ('220762118751244942', 'My Universities', 1940, 'Drama', 'Mark Donskoy, Pyotr Yermolov, V. Dmitriev', 'Ilya Gruzdev, Mark Donskoy', 'Nikolai Valbert, Stepan Kayukov, Nikolai Dorokhin, Nikolai Plotnikov, Lev Sverdlin, Daniil Sagal, Mikhail Povolotsky, Mikhail Povolotsky', null, 'My Universities (Moi universiteti) is the last installment of Russian director Mark Donskoy''s "Maxim Gorki" trilogy. Having endured a painful youth in My Childhood and a torturous sojourn as a serf in My Apprenticeship, future writer Gorki reaches maturity with an insatiable desire for personal and artistic freedom. The "university" of the title is actual the school of Hard Knocks, as Gorky goes to work in the shipyards and commisserates with the hard-drinking, philosophical dockworkers.', 'My Universities (Moi universiteti) is the last installment of Russian director Mark Donskoy''s "Maxim Gorki" trilogy. Having endured a painful youth in My Childhood and a torturous sojourn as a serf in My Apprenticeship, future writer Gorki reaches maturity with an insatiable desire for personal and artistic freedom. The "university" of the title is actual the school of Hard Knocks, as Gorky goes to work in the shipyards and commisserates with the hard-drinking, philosophical dockworkers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQVUE3UswDijfagWtyyhxguKwM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148943'),
  ('446365277612415585', 'My Valentine', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Damian Drago, Duncan White, Oscar Zisman', 'Maggie Levin', 'Britt Baron, Anna Lore, Benedict Samuel, Tiffany Smith, Sachin Bhatt, Anna Akana, Shaun Brown, Alan Chow', 'NR', 'A pop singer''s artistic identity is stolen by her ex-boyfriend/manager and shamelessly pasted onto his new girlfriend/protégé. Locked together late one night in a concert venue, the three reconcile emotional abuses of the past...until things turn violent.', 'A pop singer''s artistic identity is stolen by her ex-boyfriend/manager and shamelessly pasted onto his new girlfriend/protégé. Locked together late one night in a concert venue, the three reconcile emotional abuses of the past...until things turn violent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJsn2KNUnmQtLY9jEfcdyAb1yEM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:670466'),
  ('280294545790659553', 'My Very Best Friend', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Isabelle Doval', 'Olivier Dague, Isabelle Doval', 'Jean Senejoux, Martin Jobert, Anne Brochet, Ángela Molina, Eyal Hamou, Guillaume Delorme, Laurène Doval, Isabelle Doval', null, 'Esteban and Maxime are inseparable. Their families have always lived in the same Parisian building and Maxime, who has lived alone with his mother, a hard-working attorney, since his father died, has always felt part of Esteban''s happy, friendly family. The boys have known each other since birth and consider themselves more than friends, they are brothers. The two friends have secretly made a small attic room the center of their world, where they invent characters and store their disguises and most treasured possessions. But their friendship is threatened when Maxime learns to his dismay that Esteban and his Spanish-born family are moving back to Spain. The two boys dream up a plan that they must soon put into action.', 'Esteban and Maxime are inseparable. Their families have always lived in the same Parisian building and Maxime, who has lived alone with his mother, a hard-working attorney, since his father died, has always felt part of Esteban''s happy, friendly family. The boys have known each other since birth and consider themselves more than friends, they are brothers. The two friends have secretly made a small attic room the center of their world, where they invent characters and store their disguises and most treasured possessions. But their friendship is threatened when Maxime learns to his dismay that Esteban and his Spanish-born family are moving back to Spain. The two boys dream up a plan that they must soon put into action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgWGwnpRutb45xGxPVPAcxzieB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58687'),
  ('1093161706561993365', 'My Virgin', 1993, null, 'Dik Choh-Sai', null, 'Yvonne Yung Hung', null, 'May and Danny tried their first karaoke in a certain karaoke. They accidentally pushed down the flowerpot and broke the underworld stalls downstairs due to a karaoke check. They were entangled by the gang. May’s brother-in-law Yalong came forward and offended the gang project Mark Brother, Yalong is finally abandoned in the wilderness. May was also captured and returned to show. When A-Lian went out to find her husband and returned, she found that her husband and sister had disappeared, so she went out to find her husband and sister. Seeing that Mark is interested in her, A-Lian hopes to replace her as a supporter, but she is eventually raped by Mark. Danny took the opportunity to escape and went downstairs to rescue May and Ren, the three of them fought with Mark.', 'May and Danny tried their first karaoke in a certain karaoke. They accidentally pushed down the flowerpot and broke the underworld stalls downstairs due to a karaoke check. They were entangled by the gang. May’s brother-in-law Yalong came forward and offended the gang project Mark Brother, Yalong is finally abandoned in the wilderness. May was also captured and returned to show. When A-Lian went out to find her husband and returned, she found that her husband and sister had disappeared, so she went out to find her husband and sister. Seeing that Mark is interested in her, A-Lian hopes to replace her as a supporter, but she is eventually raped by Mark. Danny took the opportunity to escape and went downstairs to rescue May and Ren, the three of them fought with Mark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br9ocDWFRJwViv9hIECtq0PA4Cr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775560'),
