  ('848010255491698558', 'My Wife''s Murder', 2005, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Jijy Philip, P. S. Vinod', 'Atul Sabharwal', 'Anil Kapoor, Suchitra Krishnamoorthi, Nandana Sen, Rajesh Tandon, Master Zain Ansari, Boman Irani, Manish Khanna, Abhijit Lahiri', null, 'After his wife, Sheela goes missing, Ravi Patwardhan files a missing persons report. When her body is discovered in a pond, police Detective Tejpal Randhawa investigates the murder and tries to narrow down the suspects, which include her husband and her father. Despite finding no clear motive or evidence, Randhawa slowly begins to piece together the mystery and draws closer to uncovering the identity of Sheela''s killer.', 'After his wife, Sheela goes missing, Ravi Patwardhan files a missing persons report. When her body is discovered in a pond, police Detective Tejpal Randhawa investigates the murder and tries to narrow down the suspects, which include her husband and her father. Despite finding no clear motive or evidence, Randhawa slowly begins to piece together the mystery and draws closer to uncovering the identity of Sheela''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvAFzEv394aIH05EGdRwEVmLjxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206376'),
  ('196746134439322517', 'My Wife''s Name Is Maurice', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Kalinka Weiler', 'Raffy Shart, Jean-Marie Poiré', 'Régis Laspalès, Alice Evans, Götz Otto, Philippe Chevallier, Virginie Lemoine, Martin Lamotte, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Benjamin Castaldi', null, 'Georges, a wealthy Parisian, has a mistress who wants to marry him, but he has no intention of divorcing his wife, the source of his money. The mistress, meanwhile, has a jealous boyfriend, so when Georges dumps her, two people are angry with him. Add Georges'' wife, who suspects the affair. The mistress calls Georges to say she''s coming to tell his wife everything, so Georges asks Maurice, a stranger who''s passing by, to pose as his wife and scare off the mistress. In this farce, nothing goes as Georges plans.', 'Georges, a wealthy Parisian, has a mistress who wants to marry him, but he has no intention of divorcing his wife, the source of his money. The mistress, meanwhile, has a jealous boyfriend, so when Georges dumps her, two people are angry with him. Add Georges'' wife, who suspects the affair. The mistress calls Georges to say she''s coming to tell his wife everything, so Georges asks Maurice, a stranger who''s passing by, to pose as his wife and scare off the mistress. In this farce, nothing goes as Georges plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFRDubBQ77uUAeQrnuegoA33Ay5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59085'),
