  ('882361122953119574', 'My World', 2013, 'Drama', 'Uğur Yücel', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali', 'Beren Saat, Uğur Yücel, Ayça Bingöl, Turgay Kantürk, Hazar Ergüçlü, Melis Mutluç, Yasemin Baştan, Erdal Küçükkömürcü', null, 'At 2 Ela lost her ability of seeing and hearing because of a severe illness. And then she became a total disappointment of her family due to her untamed behaviors. But everything changed after an unorthodox teacher stepped into their lives to educate Ela while healing himself.', 'At 2 Ela lost her ability of seeing and hearing because of a severe illness. And then she became a total disappointment of her family due to her untamed behaviors. But everything changed after an unorthodox teacher stepped into their lives to educate Ela while healing himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/16CH0y0YatQfkSmVfLoRy7PeWK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236317'),
