  ('1125321945996721411', 'My Zoe', 2019, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Julie Delpy, Stéphane Fontaine', 'Julie Delpy', 'Julie Delpy, Gemma Arterton, Richard Armitage, Daniel Brühl, Sophia Ally, Lindsay Duncan, Saleh Bakri, Jördis Triebel', null, 'Isabelle, a geneticist recovering from a toxic marriage, is raising her only daughter, Zoe, with her contentious ex-husband. Zoe means everything to her mother and so when tragedy strikes the fractured family, Isabelle travels to Russia in seeking the help of a world-renowned fertility physician who Isabelle believes can help bring back her little girl.', 'Isabelle, a geneticist recovering from a toxic marriage, is raising her only daughter, Zoe, with her contentious ex-husband. Zoe means everything to her mother and so when tragedy strikes the fractured family, Isabelle travels to Russia in seeking the help of a world-renowned fertility physician who Isabelle believes can help bring back her little girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLhNcVOXWfYLP6XpUSPvtVdU4UP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477657'),
  ('220232509201882404', 'Mylanji', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ajayan Bala, Chezhian Ra', 'Ajayan Bala', 'Sreeram Karthik, Krisha Kurup, Munishkanth, Singampuli, R. Nandakumar', null, 'Surya, a National Geographic photographer with a speech disorder, travels to Ooty to photograph a rare bird. He meets Charu, an orphan escaping forced marriage by choosing another man, but she unknowingly falls for him instead.', 'Surya, a National Geographic photographer with a speech disorder, travels to Ooty to photograph a rare bird. He meets Charu, an orphan escaping forced marriage by choosing another man, but she unknowingly falls for him instead.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FatrTLqZWj3Mpck8ZkbmzMBkoTB0.jpg', 'plex:movie:mylanji-2026'),
  ('429466823747112278', 'Mylène Farmer: Nevermore - The Movie', 2024, 'Music', 'François Hanss, Olivier Schultheis, Yvan Cassar', null, 'Mylène Farmer, Yvan Cassar, Simon Buret, Olivier Coursier, Eric Chevalier, Johan Dalgaard, Joel Shearer, Sébastien Chouard', null, 'Released exclusively in cinemas for one night only, the new concert film of Mylène Farmer offers a gripping immersive experience on the big screen at the heart of a monumental show. With fourteen stadiums in France, "Nevermore" is the biggest stadium tour by an artist in French music history.', 'Released exclusively in cinemas for one night only, the new concert film of Mylène Farmer offers a gripping immersive experience on the big screen at the heart of a monumental show. With fourteen stadiums in France, "Nevermore" is the biggest stadium tour by an artist in French music history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7rplx2L3YUrRlxpwCmpsFBldD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183923'),
  ('1004730644459313605', 'Mylove Lost', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Angie Paul Risque, Juan Molina', 'Clara Martínez-Lázaro Alameda, Miguel Esteban', 'Dani Rovira, Michelle Jenner, Vito Sanz, Pablo Carbonell, María Hinojosa, Will Shepard, Antonio Dechent, Maite Sandoval', null, 'Mario and Olivia fall madly in love. One afternoon, considering that every relationship ends, they end up breaking up. During the big fight, Miamor, the street cat adopted by both, escapes and disappears, like the love that united them.', 'Mario and Olivia fall madly in love. One afternoon, considering that every relationship ends, they end up breaking up. During the big fight, Miamor, the street cat adopted by both, escapes and disappears, like the love that united them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kULYM5oKad5qn3lsxeBIIHtkcEw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:510088'),
  ('249990951891031228', 'Myra Breckinridge', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Sarne, Richard Moore, Richard Glassman', 'Michael Sarne, David Giler', 'Raquel Welch, Rex Reed, Mae West, John Huston, Farrah Fawcett, Roger C. Carmel, Roger Herren, George Furth', 'R', 'Myron Breckinridge flies to Europe to get a sex-change operation and is transformed into the beautiful Myra. She travels to Hollywood, meets up with her rich Uncle Buck and, claiming to be Myron''s widow, demands money. Instead, Buck gives Myra a job in his acting school. There, Myra meets aspiring actor Rusty and his girlfriend, Mary Ann. With Myra as catalyst, the trio begin to outrageously expand their sexual horizons.', 'Myron Breckinridge flies to Europe to get a sex-change operation and is transformed into the beautiful Myra. She travels to Hollywood, meets up with her rich Uncle Buck and, claiming to be Myron''s widow, demands money. Instead, Buck gives Myra a job in his acting school. There, Myra meets aspiring actor Rusty and his girlfriend, Mary Ann. With Myra as catalyst, the trio begin to outrageously expand their sexual horizons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOGo2iLGuR1bkEsZamj4HSMbjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40973'),
  ('47718220935219193', 'Mysteries', 1978, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Paul de Lussanet, Robby Müller, Jean-Paul Feuillebois', 'Paul de Lussanet', 'Rutger Hauer, Sylvia Kristel, David Rappaport, Rita Tushingham, Andréa Ferréol, Kees Brusse, Liesbeth List, Fons Rademakers', null, 'In the winter of 1891 a stranger arrives in a small coastal town on the Isle of Man. His presence soon disturbs the lives of the local inhabitants, especially the beautiful daughter of the parson.', 'In the winter of 1891 a stranger arrives in a small coastal town on the Isle of Man. His presence soon disturbs the lives of the local inhabitants, especially the beautiful daughter of the parson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wX2V0Lkea3b7ytuEZJPvMfh9CDM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139341'),
  ('1018213387202008597', 'Mysteries of the Terracotta Warriors', 2024, 'Documentary', 'James Tovell', null, 'Dr. Hui Ming Tak Ted, Dr. Li Janice Xiuzhen, Zhu Sihong, Lan Desheng, Fu Jian, Prof. Lo Yuet Keung, Prof. Chen Liang, Jiang Wenxiao', 'PG-13', 'Thousands of terracotta warriors guarded the first Chinese emperor''s tomb. This is their story, told through archeological evidence and reenactments.', 'Thousands of terracotta warriors guarded the first Chinese emperor''s tomb. This is their story, told through archeological evidence and reenactments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snl9dddlnu2yKXXix2ua7G8UWoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255028'),
