  ('419284200361272800', 'Mysterious Island', 1941, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Eduard Pentslin, Mikhail Belsky, Boris Shelontsev', 'Mikhail Kalinin, Boris Shelontsev', 'Aleksey Krasnopolsky, Pavlo Kyiansky, Andrey Andriyenko-Zemskov, Ivan Kozlov, Robert Ross, Yuri Grammatikati, Andrii Sova, Nikolai Komissarov', null, 'Based on Verne''s book The Mysterious Island, five POWs escape from a camp in a balloon during the Civil War and crash-land on an uninhabited island in the Pacific. Trying to settle with their lives they find someone is helping them.', 'Based on Verne''s book The Mysterious Island, five POWs escape from a camp in a balloon during the Civil War and crash-land on an uninhabited island in the Pacific. Trying to settle with their lives they find someone is helping them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mwfZaIdLzV2mCG1TbCPLTeoMhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3590'),
  ('939644776131009263', 'Mysterious Island', 1961, 'Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Wilkie Cooper, Cy Endfield, René Dupont', 'Crane Wilbur, Daniel B. Ullman, John Prebble', 'Michael Craig, Joan Greenwood, Michael Callan, Gary Merrill, Herbert Lom, Beth Rogan, Percy Herbert, Dan Jackson', null, 'During the US Civil War, Union POWs escape in a balloon and end up stranded on a South Pacific island, inhabited by giant plants and animals. They must use their ingenuity to survive the dangers, and to devise a way to return home. Sequel to ''20,000 Leagues Under the Sea'' .', 'During the US Civil War, Union POWs escape in a balloon and end up stranded on a South Pacific island, inhabited by giant plants and animals. They must use their ingenuity to survive the dangers, and to devise a way to return home. Sequel to ''20,000 Leagues Under the Sea'' .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqLIpwISJEvERlS5fSWe8xbQDFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18993'),
  ('419307187575779545', 'Mysterious Island', 2011, 'Horror', 'Rico Chung Kai-Cheong', 'Lan Yang', 'Jordan Chan Siu-Chun, Yang Mi, Hiro Hayama, Janel Tsai, Wong Yau-Nam, Chui Tien-You, Anya, Shaun Tam Chun-Yin', null, 'In the 1970s on the Binlusai islands, a young mother is killed when she was running with her son run from an evil presence in an abandoned Roman Catholic leper colony. In the present day, a group of four young men and women are travelling to the island to take part in a survival game run by TV channel Search Planet headed by Chen Jiadong (Philip Keung). Also on the boat is the television presenter Stanley (Jessica Xu) and cameraman Ken (Shaun Tam). The eight people have been split into four pairs where they are given a map which leads to a flag; their aim is to survive without any supplies, and the winning duo gets a grand prize of one-million dollars. As they approach the island, their ship is attacked by something unknown under the water and most of their luggage is lost. Shen Yilin (Mini Yang) has preserved her map which she gives to her partner Peng Fei (Jordan Chan).', 'In the 1970s on the Binlusai islands, a young mother is killed when she was running with her son run from an evil presence in an abandoned Roman Catholic leper colony. In the present day, a group of four young men and women are travelling to the island to take part in a survival game run by TV channel Search Planet headed by Chen Jiadong (Philip Keung). Also on the boat is the television presenter Stanley (Jessica Xu) and cameraman Ken (Shaun Tam). The eight people have been split into four pairs where they are given a map which leads to a flag; their aim is to survive without any supplies, and the winning duo gets a grand prize of one-million dollars. As they approach the island, their ship is attacked by something unknown under the water and most of their luggage is lost. Shen Yilin (Mini Yang) has preserved her map which she gives to her partner Peng Fei (Jordan Chan).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3JnjrO4auzulvXukSI253EjKya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18754'),
