  ('184524429431489218', 'Mystery Date', 1991, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jonathan Wacks, Oliver Wood, Dennis M. White', 'Parker Bennett, Terry Runte', 'Ethan Hawke, Teri Polo, Brian McNamara, Fisher Stevens, Tony Rosato, Don S. Davis, James Hong, Victor Wong', null, 'Tom McHugh quickly learns that his perfect big brother Craig isn''t all he''s cracked up to be while on a night on the town with the girl next door, during which Tom is harassed by unpleasant strangers, threatened by mobsters, pursued by police, attacked by an irate florist, accused of murder, and has his date kidnapped—all because everyone thinks he''s Craig...and the classic 1959 DeSoto Firesweep he borrowed off his brother has two dead bodies in the trunk.', 'Tom McHugh quickly learns that his perfect big brother Craig isn''t all he''s cracked up to be while on a night on the town with the girl next door, during which Tom is harassed by unpleasant strangers, threatened by mobsters, pursued by police, attacked by an irate florist, accused of murder, and has his date kidnapped—all because everyone thinks he''s Craig...and the classic 1959 DeSoto Firesweep he borrowed off his brother has two dead bodies in the trunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vof40ryhBNTEvtjHl1somhdrXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53027'),
  ('851680443149461539', 'Mystery in Mexico', 1948, 'Crime, Mystery, Adventure', 'Robert Wise, Jack Draper, Jaime Contreras', 'Lawrence Kimble', 'William Lundigan, Jacqueline White, Ricardo Cortez, Tony Barrett, Jacqueline Dalya, Walter Reed, José Torvay, Jaime Jiménez Pons', 'NR', 'Insurance detective Steve Hastings is sent by his company to investigate the disappearance of a fellow agent. His first lead is the agent''s fetching sister, Victoria, whom he trails to Mexico City. After charming his way into her confidence, Steve helps Vicki unravel the mystery.', 'Insurance detective Steve Hastings is sent by his company to investigate the disappearance of a fellow agent. His first lead is the agent''s fetching sister, Victoria, whom he trails to Mexico City. After charming his way into her confidence, Steve helps Vicki unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81UwVaY6XZJWiYuMvmupPXjDwVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213570'),
  ('790237463389504145', 'Mystery in the Bermuda Triangle', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Adolfo Martínez Solares', null, 'El Santo, Blue Demon, Aarón Rodríguez Arellano, Silvia Manríquez, Sandra Duarte, Carlos Suárez, Ernesto Solís, Gaynor Kote', null, 'Beautiful Silvia and Sandra disappear mysteriously at the Bermuda Triangle. Santo, Blue Demon and Mil Mascaras, a team of super-heroes, go into action to try to find them. Soon they find out that evil Scientist Dr. Gro has developed a device to make people and objects to disappear blaming the famous vanishings of ships, airplanes and human beings on Mother Nature. Cast: Santo el Enmascarado de Plata, Blue Demon, Mil Mascaras, Silvia Manrquez and, Sandra Duarte', 'Beautiful Silvia and Sandra disappear mysteriously at the Bermuda Triangle. Santo, Blue Demon and Mil Mascaras, a team of super-heroes, go into action to try to find them. Soon they find out that evil Scientist Dr. Gro has developed a device to make people and objects to disappear blaming the famous vanishings of ships, airplanes and human beings on Mother Nature. Cast: Santo el Enmascarado de Plata, Blue Demon, Mil Mascaras, Silvia Manrquez and, Sandra Duarte', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8Kp05q9x4zKPFb6R7Ar63oCaGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113968'),
  ('894219563628823737', 'Mystery Island', 2023, 'TV Movie, Mystery', 'Nicholas Humphries, Lars Lindstrom, Dave T. Nall', 'John Christian Plummer', 'Elizabeth Henstridge, Charlie Weber, Kezia Burrows, Matthew Chambers, Randy Domínguez, Robert Getman, Francisco Labbe, Kara Lane', 'PG', 'London Police psychiatrist Dr. Emilia Priestly needs to take a relaxing break from her stressful job, so her wealthy friend, Baroness Jane Alcott, invites her to Mystery Island, an immersive murder-mystery-themed resort hosting a special retreat for the original investors. As the mystery game begins, tragedy strikes: John Murtaugh the resort’s reclusive founder, is murdered. The visitors are confined to the island as local detective Jason Trent investigates the case. Once Emilia proves her innocence, she makes use of her special skills to help Jason find the murderer. The lines between game and reality are blurred as they unravel the web of romance, revenge, and betrayal behind the resort, its guests, and its elusive founder.', 'London Police psychiatrist Dr. Emilia Priestly needs to take a relaxing break from her stressful job, so her wealthy friend, Baroness Jane Alcott, invites her to Mystery Island, an immersive murder-mystery-themed resort hosting a special retreat for the original investors. As the mystery game begins, tragedy strikes: John Murtaugh the resort’s reclusive founder, is murdered. The visitors are confined to the island as local detective Jason Trent investigates the case. Once Emilia proves her innocence, she makes use of her special skills to help Jason find the murderer. The lines between game and reality are blurred as they unravel the web of romance, revenge, and betrayal behind the resort, its guests, and its elusive founder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXjCRw02lLhzV1XtPjafNOSHfqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158706'),
  ('285464921906573946', 'Mystery Junction', 1951, 'Drama, Crime', 'Michael McCarthy, Robert LaPresle, Ted Holliday', 'Michael McCarthy', 'Sydney Tafler, Barbara Murray, Patricia Owens, Martin Benson, Christine Silver, David Davies, Charles Irwin, Philip Dale', null, 'In this crime drama, an escaped convict is recaptured and charged with killing two people in a lonely waystation during a snowstorm. Fortunately, a novelist is around to prove him innocent.', 'In this crime drama, an escaped convict is recaptured and charged with killing two people in a lonely waystation during a snowstorm. Fortunately, a novelist is around to prove him innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY3iyjvl8Rn1Y5KPvXpmCuG72qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167825'),
  ('146087897156831936', 'Mystery Men', 1999, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Kinka Usher, Stephen H. Burum, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Neil Cuthbert', 'Ben Stiller, Hank Azaria, William H. Macy, Greg Kinnear, Kel Mitchell, Paul Reubens, Janeane Garofalo, Wes Studi', 'PG-13', 'When Champion City''s hero Captain Amazing is kidnapped by the recently paroled supervillain Casanova Frankenstein, a trio of average, everyday superheroes -- Mr. Furious, the Shoveler and the Blue Raja -- assemble a new super team to save him.', 'When Champion City''s hero Captain Amazing is kidnapped by the recently paroled supervillain Casanova Frankenstein, a trio of average, everyday superheroes -- Mr. Furious, the Shoveler and the Blue Raja -- assemble a new super team to save him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ciVSbFmDecOIwlxl9F6GhHVgCVJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9824'),
  ('211144701555203896', 'Mystery of the Maya', 1995, 'Documentary, History', 'Barrie Howells, Roberto Rochín, Savas Kalogeras', 'Barrie Howells, Óscar Montero', 'Susan Glover, Nicolas Alonso, Juan Carlos Colombo, Blanca Guerra, Juan Antonio Llanes, Alberto Ruz Buenfil, Francois Tormos, Oscar Traven', 'G', 'Filmed in IMAX, a young Mayan boy who lives close to the ruins becomes acquainted with an archaeologist (Guerra) and asks her to tell him about his ancestors. The crew travelled to over 15 locations in Mexico and Guatemala, including Tulum and Chichén Itzá.', 'Filmed in IMAX, a young Mayan boy who lives close to the ruins becomes acquainted with an archaeologist (Guerra) and asks her to tell him about his ancestors. The crew travelled to over 15 locations in Mexico and Guatemala, including Tulum and Chichén Itzá.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MNlbpf7Z0GKVhWBdPde152bVip.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20716'),
  ('814591271045586281', 'Mystery of the Wax Museum', 1933, 'Horror, Mystery, Comedy', 'Michael Curtiz, Ray Rennahan, Frank Shaw', 'Carl Erickson, Don Mullaly', 'Lionel Atwill, Glenda Farrell, Allen Vincent, Fay Wray, Frank McHugh, Edwin Maxwell, Arthur Edmund Carewe, Gavin Gordon', null, 'A wax sculptor opens a new museum years after he is severely injured during a fire that destroyed his original collection. The disappearance of both people and corpses coincides with this grand reopening and leads a reporter to start investigating.', 'A wax sculptor opens a new museum years after he is severely injured during a fire that destroyed his original collection. The disappearance of both people and corpses coincides with this grand reopening and leads a reporter to start investigating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs4FJ6F5gY0wDqNGzGqV5OU7VzS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32652'),
  ('651266518140660118', 'Mystery on Mistletoe Lane', 2023, 'Mystery', 'Allan Harmon, Anthony C. Metchie', null, 'Erica Cerra, Victor Webster, Fred Henderson, Jeanie Cloutier, Juliette Hawk, Benjamin Jacobson, Logan Pierce', 'G', 'When moving to a new town, Heidi and her kids discover a Christmas mystery with the help of the local handyman.', 'When moving to a new town, Heidi and her kids discover a Christmas mystery with the help of the local handyman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QQBgZxhcjWfy3VXap52WGNobD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180844'),
  ('613859800798574137', 'Mystery on Monster Island', 1981, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror', 'Juan Piquer Simón, Andrés Berenguer, Kuki López Rodero', 'Joaquín Grau, Juan Piquer Simón, Ron Gantman', 'Terence Stamp, Peter Cushing, Blanca Estrada, Ana Obregón, Paul Naschy, Gérard Tichy, Ian Sera, David Hatton', null, 'A young European boy living in San Francisco is reluctant to marry his long-term girlfriend because he wants to travel around the world first. His wealthy uncle agrees to send him on a global expedition aboard his ship, but en route the boy and his travelling companion are shipwrecked on a remote island, populated by countless prehistoric creatures as well as gold-hunting bandits.', 'A young European boy living in San Francisco is reluctant to marry his long-term girlfriend because he wants to travel around the world first. His wealthy uncle agrees to send him on a global expedition aboard his ship, but en route the boy and his travelling companion are shipwrecked on a remote island, populated by countless prehistoric creatures as well as gold-hunting bandits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8GKTE9fLFoVSPCQr0oXGfPFL2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28440'),
  ('467261556694097448', 'Mystery Road', 2013, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Ivan Sen, Ivan Sen', 'Ivan Sen', 'Aaron Pedersen, Hugo Weaving, Jack Thompson, Ryan Kwanten, Tony Barry, Bruce Spence, Damian Walshe-Howling, Tasma Walton', null, 'A murdered girl is found under a bridge on a remote road and indigenous detective Jay Swan gets the case. Jay finds that no-one is that interested in solving the murder of an indigenous teenager and he is forced to work alone.', 'A murdered girl is found under a bridge on a remote road and indigenous detective Jay Swan gets the case. Jay finds that no-one is that interested in solving the murder of an indigenous teenager and he is forced to work alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1jCUWJZAYVgPW2lyUJoSXkDl6C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199818'),
  ('720447095522619346', 'Mystery Science Theater 3000: The Movie', 1996, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Jim Mallon, Jeff Stonehouse, Bix Skahill', 'Paul Chaplin, Michael J. Nelson, Bridget Jones Nelson', 'Michael J. Nelson, Trace Beaulieu, Kevin Murphy, Jim Mallon, John Brady', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Clayton Forrester figures he can rule the world if he deadens his subjects'' brains by making them endure terrible movies. Exploiting his access to nearby satellite-dwellers Mike Nelson and his robot pals, Crow T. Robot and Tom Servo, Forrester makes them watch "This Island Earth", a cheesy 1950s spaceship film. But when Mike and friends make funny comments throughout the movie and others that follow, Forrester''s plan looks increasingly flimsy.', 'Dr. Clayton Forrester figures he can rule the world if he deadens his subjects'' brains by making them endure terrible movies. Exploiting his access to nearby satellite-dwellers Mike Nelson and his robot pals, Crow T. Robot and Tom Servo, Forrester makes them watch "This Island Earth", a cheesy 1950s spaceship film. But when Mike and friends make funny comments throughout the movie and others that follow, Forrester''s plan looks increasingly flimsy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlakU3uwNiUgd7aOlb2RoAsGTnY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3065'),
  ('234792158041439338', 'Mystery Street', 1950, 'Crime, Thriller', 'John Sturges, John Alton, Sid Sidman', 'Richard Brooks, Sydney Boehm', 'Ricardo Montalban, Sally Forrest, Bruce Bennett, Elsa Lanchester, Marshall Thompson, Jan Sterling, Edmon Ryan, Betsy Blair', null, 'When a young woman''s skeletal remains turn up on a Massachusetts beach, Barnstable cop Peter Moralas teams with Boston police and uses forensics, with the help of a Harvard professor, to determine the woman''s identity, how she died, and who killed her.', 'When a young woman''s skeletal remains turn up on a Massachusetts beach, Barnstable cop Peter Moralas teams with Boston police and uses forensics, with the help of a Harvard professor, to determine the woman''s identity, how she died, and who killed her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxabjdOtyugFdT4E9s3AI4ISjqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19170'),
  ('598343518526834160', 'Mystery Team', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Dan Eckman', 'Donald Glover, D.C. Pierson, Dominic Dierkes', 'Donald Glover, Aubrey Plaza, Dominic Dierkes, D.C. Pierson, Matt Walsh, Glenn Kalison, Peter Saati, Kay Cannon', 'R', 'A group of former Encyclopedia Brown-style child-detectives struggle to solve an adult mystery.', 'A group of former Encyclopedia Brown-style child-detectives struggle to solve an adult mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AbqRb1hlCb8jPVqFXL5hwrj8hQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38087'),
  ('121421162913377369', 'Mystery Train', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jim Jarmusch, Robby Müller, Eric Heffron', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Youki Kudoh, Masatoshi Nagase, Screamin'' Jay Hawkins, Cinqué Lee, Nicoletta Braschi, Elizabeth Bracco, Joe Strummer, Rick Aviles', 'R', 'In Memphis, Tennessee, over the course of a single night, the Arcade Hotel, run by an eccentric night clerk and a clueless bellboy, is visited by a young Japanese couple traveling in search of the roots of rock; an Italian woman in mourning who stumbles upon a fleeing charlatan girl; and a comical trio of accidental thieves looking for a place to hide.', 'In Memphis, Tennessee, over the course of a single night, the Arcade Hotel, run by an eccentric night clerk and a clueless bellboy, is visited by a young Japanese couple traveling in search of the roots of rock; an Italian woman in mourning who stumbles upon a fleeing charlatan girl; and a comical trio of accidental thieves looking for a place to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f11xq7dBGhz9UDc3dabldAGeXVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11305'),
  ('988181316308209139', 'Mystery Woman: Vision of a Murder', 2005, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Kellie Martin, Maximo Munzi, Lance Lanfear', 'Joyce Burditt', 'Kellie Martin, Clarence Williams III, Nina Siemaszko, Casey Sander, Charles Shaughnessy, Felicia Day, Lisa Dean Ryan, Allison Smith', null, 'Sam lands a job photographing a new spa in Southern California for their brochure and brings her best friend Cassie along to enjoy some pampering. When one of the guests staying at the upscale retreat turns up dead, Sam is once again on the trail of a murderer. As the investigation progresses, Sam uncovers a scam that the spa Dr was testing unapproved drugs on the patrons.. filler implants, etc. without the patients'' informed consent.', 'Sam lands a job photographing a new spa in Southern California for their brochure and brings her best friend Cassie along to enjoy some pampering. When one of the guests staying at the upscale retreat turns up dead, Sam is once again on the trail of a murderer. As the investigation progresses, Sam uncovers a scam that the spa Dr was testing unapproved drugs on the patrons.. filler implants, etc. without the patients'' informed consent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AqZLv3zdmaPqgXAc5v0mBsOx4ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125801'),
  ('420679557581611885', 'Mystery, Alaska', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jay Roach, Richard Cowan, Eddy Santos', 'Sean O''Byrne, David E. Kelley', 'Russell Crowe, Hank Azaria, Mary McCormack, Burt Reynolds, Lolita Davidovich, Ron Eldard, Colm Meaney, Maury Chaykin', 'R', 'In Mystery, Alaska, life revolves around the legendary Saturday hockey game at the local pond. But everything changes when the hometown team unexpectedly gets booked in an exhibition match against the New York Rangers. When quirky small-towners, slick promoters and millionaire athletes come together.', 'In Mystery, Alaska, life revolves around the legendary Saturday hockey game at the local pond. But everything changes when the hometown team unexpectedly gets booked in an exhibition match against the New York Rangers. When quirky small-towners, slick promoters and millionaire athletes come together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmg4sjOQswcrP5mPL9YzNom9cXx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15198'),
