  ('449355147845907720', 'Mystics in Bali', 1981, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Kasdullah, H. Tjut Djalil, Jimmy Atmaja', 'Jimmy Atmaja', 'Ilona Agathe Bastian, Yos Santo, Sofia W.D., Debbie Cynthia Dewi, W.D. Mochtar, Itje Trisnawati, Ketut Suwita, Dis I Gusti Ngurah Lanang Jugutkarana', null, 'An anthropologist named Cathy travels to Bali with her lover to conduct research on black magic. There, they encounter the queen of the Leák cult, a shapeshifting witch who feasts on blood and soon makes Cathy carry out her evil deeds.', 'An anthropologist named Cathy travels to Bali with her lover to conduct research on black magic. There, they encounter the queen of the Leák cult, a shapeshifting witch who feasts on blood and soon makes Cathy carry out her evil deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wilJzt8iRKXbgOf2w5cN6khbWuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71821'),
  ('334616479158544535', 'Mystify: Michael Hutchence', 2019, 'Documentary, Music', 'Richard Lowenstein, Andrew de Groot', 'Richard Lowenstein', 'Michael Hutchence, Kylie Minogue, Helena Christensen, Bono, Noel Gallagher, Michele Bennett, Liam Gallagher, Dennis Farriss', null, 'Michael Hutchence was flying high as the lead singer of the legendary rock band INXS until his untimely death in 1997. Richard Lowenstein’s documentary examines Hutchence’s deeply felt life through his many loves and demons.', 'Michael Hutchence was flying high as the lead singer of the legendary rock band INXS until his untimely death in 1997. Richard Lowenstein’s documentary examines Hutchence’s deeply felt life through his many loves and demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpxLFHp9B9EHKM96JZXJ8uf7ObG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586534'),
  ('468271356472347581', 'Mythica: A Quest for Heroes', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Anne K. Black, A. Todd Smith, A. Todd Smith', 'Jason Faller, Anne K. Black, Kynan Griffin', 'Melanie Stone, Adam Johnson, Jake Stormoen, Nicola Posener, Christopher Robin Miller, Natalie Devine Riskas, Kevin Sorbo, Robert Jayne', 'NR', 'Stuck in a life of indentured servitude, Marek dreams of becoming a wizard. When she meets the beautiful priestess Teela in need of help, she offers her assistance and provides a motley troupe. Together they go in search of Teela''s sister, who was kidnapped by a wild ogre.', 'Stuck in a life of indentured servitude, Marek dreams of becoming a wizard. When she meets the beautiful priestess Teela in need of help, she offers her assistance and provides a motley troupe. Together they go in search of Teela''s sister, who was kidnapped by a wild ogre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n75lUF6T2uvy1ZhVyjmdfaTfDT5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321068'),
  ('1044265821535417920', 'Mythica: The Darkspore', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Anne K. Black, A. Todd Smith, Clare Niederpruem', 'Anne K. Black, Jason Faller, Liska Ostojic', 'Melanie Stone, Adam Johnson, Jake Stormoen, Nicola Posener, Rocky Myers, Christopher Robin Miller, Kevin Sorbo, Natalie Devine Riskas', 'NR', 'Fighting through creature-infested lands and pursued by bounty hunters, Marek and her company are in a race to recover all the shards of the Darkspore before it falls into the hands of an evil wizard.', 'Fighting through creature-infested lands and pursued by bounty hunters, Marek and her company are in a race to recover all the shards of the Darkspore before it falls into the hands of an evil wizard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Al0ncYtEh0frfCm52pALJGR7z8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347096'),
  ('843238172204948238', 'Mythica: The Godslayer', 2016, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'John Lyde, John Lyde', 'Jason Faller, Kynan Griffin', 'Melanie Stone, Adam Johnson, Jake Stormoen, Nicola Posener, Matthew Mercer, Bailee Michelle Johnson, Ethan Hunt, Christopher Robin Miller', 'NR', 'As the Lich King''s zombie legions ravage the world, a cursed young sorceress embarks on a quest to obtain a weapon from the gods. But when she joins her sworn enemy in a desperate attempt to save the world, she must recover the good in herself before her friends are all dead, and defeat the Lich King before the gods are destroyed and the world forever enslaved.', 'As the Lich King''s zombie legions ravage the world, a cursed young sorceress embarks on a quest to obtain a weapon from the gods. But when she joins her sworn enemy in a desperate attempt to save the world, she must recover the good in herself before her friends are all dead, and defeat the Lich King before the gods are destroyed and the world forever enslaved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2RjGmJPfk3Wcb8wMoLe5dkxeMj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401689'),
  ('460362517434706639', 'Mythica: The Iron Crown', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'John Lyde', 'Jason Faller', 'Melanie Stone, Adam Johnson, Jake Stormoen, Nicola Posener, Christopher Robin Miller, Paris Warner, James Gaisford, Ash Santos', 'PG-13', 'When a team of unlikely heroes hijacks a steam-powered battle wagon, a daring young wizard (Marek) steals the final piece of the all-powerful Darkspore and embarks on a desperate quest to deliver the cursed artifact to the gods for safe keeping; but when they are caught in a death race between a ruthless team of elite mercenaries and a trinity of demons, Marek must learn to believe in herself before her friends are killed and the Darkspore is lost, to stop the evil necromancer (Szorlok) from uniting the Darkspore and flooding the living world with his legions of undead.', 'When a team of unlikely heroes hijacks a steam-powered battle wagon, a daring young wizard (Marek) steals the final piece of the all-powerful Darkspore and embarks on a desperate quest to deliver the cursed artifact to the gods for safe keeping; but when they are caught in a death race between a ruthless team of elite mercenaries and a trinity of demons, Marek must learn to believe in herself before her friends are killed and the Darkspore is lost, to stop the evil necromancer (Szorlok) from uniting the Darkspore and flooding the living world with his legions of undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8y3G8g7E7SXZ74XDt6gaxyfELse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388191'),
  ('487551165695535087', 'Mythica: The Necromancer', 2015, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Casey Wilson, A. Todd Smith, Vanessa Winter', 'Liska Ostojic, Justin Partridge, Jason Faller', 'Melanie Stone, Adam Johnson, Jake Stormoen, Nicola Posener, Philip Brodie, Matthew Mercer, Robert Jayne, Kevin Sorbo', null, 'The young wizard Marek is forced to lead her band of would-be heroes on a mission for the corrupt Thieves Guild, which has taken her friend hostage. Their journey will take them straight into the wicked clutches of Szorlok, their greatest enemy.', 'The young wizard Marek is forced to lead her band of would-be heroes on a mission for the corrupt Thieves Guild, which has taken her friend hostage. Their journey will take them straight into the wicked clutches of Szorlok, their greatest enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlAda6yYXQXXrzSUQC4Wl9QyFV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370687'),
  ('354585259099998482', 'MZ College Student and Young Aunt', 2025, 'Romance', 'Won Myeong-jun', null, 'Ah Rang, Sae Bom, Park Do-jin, Gil Dong, Yoon Yool, Ah Reum, Kang Min-woo', null, 'The thrilling and suspicious cohabitation of a young and sexy aunt and a lustful MZ college student begins. Tae-hoon, who has been accepted to college in Seoul, comes to the city imagining his college life by himself but becomes disappointed when his mother calls him to stay at her friend Kyeong-sook’s house. However, he is delighted when he sees the middle-aged woman Kyeong-sook’s young and sexy body, so he happily settles in. While imagining sex with his mother’s friend, who has fair skin and seductive eyes, Tae-hoon, who comes home early, witnesses the mature woman performing an adult broadcast in her room and relieves his sexual desires by watching her stream. However, Tae-hoon gets worried about how to deal with Kyeong-sook and confides in his friend Min-wook, who suggests using her broadcast as a weapon to have sex with her.', 'The thrilling and suspicious cohabitation of a young and sexy aunt and a lustful MZ college student begins. Tae-hoon, who has been accepted to college in Seoul, comes to the city imagining his college life by himself but becomes disappointed when his mother calls him to stay at her friend Kyeong-sook’s house. However, he is delighted when he sees the middle-aged woman Kyeong-sook’s young and sexy body, so he happily settles in. While imagining sex with his mother’s friend, who has fair skin and seductive eyes, Tae-hoon, who comes home early, witnesses the mature woman performing an adult broadcast in her room and relieves his sexual desires by watching her stream. However, Tae-hoon gets worried about how to deal with Kyeong-sook and confides in his friend Min-wook, who suggests using her broadcast as a weapon to have sex with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAiUDIONFnsQD14CyoPASZuxTNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1460811'),
  ('635219503566838496', 'N:O:T:H:I:N:G', 1968, null, 'Paul Sharits', null, null, null, '“The screen, illuminated by Paul Sharits’ N:O:T:H:I:N:G, seems to assume a spherical shape, at times – due, I think, to a pearl-like quality of light his flash-frames create … a baroque pearl, one might say – wondrous! … One of the most beautiful films I’ve seen.” – Stan Brakhage', '“The screen, illuminated by Paul Sharits’ N:O:T:H:I:N:G, seems to assume a spherical shape, at times – due, I think, to a pearl-like quality of light his flash-frames create … a baroque pearl, one might say – wondrous! … One of the most beautiful films I’ve seen.” – Stan Brakhage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2s5je2tkXcEJeOQpAbQUVuD6TxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191132'),
  ('1010190320887272294', 'N. Took the Dice', 1972, 'Drama', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Alain Robbe-Grillet', 'Sylvain Corthay, Catherine Jourdan, Richard Leduc, Lorraine Rainer, Pierre Zimmer, Catherine Robbe-Grillet, Juraj Kukura, Jarmila Koleničová', null, 'N Took the Dice is essentially a reworking of Eden and After made possible by the roll of a dice (scenes from the 1970 film were combined with outtakes and additional footage in an aleatory way). Robbe-Grillet was always interested in music and since he perceived Eden and After to be serial in nature, it only made sense that its sister film would stand in opposition to that.', 'N Took the Dice is essentially a reworking of Eden and After made possible by the roll of a dice (scenes from the 1970 film were combined with outtakes and additional footage in an aleatory way). Robbe-Grillet was always interested in music and since he perceived Eden and After to be serial in nature, it only made sense that its sister film would stand in opposition to that.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPaJJ0W1TlfRFuKeaOcUe7E9TjD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70128'),
  ('118853762712793255', 'N.U.', 1948, 'Documentary', 'Giovanni Ventimiglia, Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Michelangelo Antonioni', 'Guido Notari', null, 'This 1948 film by Antonioni documents the lives of street cleaners in Rome. N.U. is short for Nettezza urbana, the Italian municipal cleaning service.', 'This 1948 film by Antonioni documents the lives of street cleaners in Rome. N.U. is short for Nettezza urbana, the Italian municipal cleaning service.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDOPHKrdLJ4gDWR4CaVmkXHmpN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159222'),
