  ('762303618310820356', 'Na Quebrada', 2014, 'Drama', 'Fernando Grostein Andrade', null, 'Kaire Jorge, Felipe Simas, Ayomi Domenica, Daiana Andrade, Jean Luís Amorim, Gero Camilo, Alvise Camozzi, Clarisse Abujamra', null, 'In the ghettos of the greatest metropolis in Brazil, a midst flying bullets, love and any number of hurdles, young people''s stories mingle and collide in the search for dreams and choices. Inspired by true stories, the feature film ''Broken Town'' reveals the struggle faced and the choices made by teenagers who have always been surrounded by weapons, crime, and hardship.', 'In the ghettos of the greatest metropolis in Brazil, a midst flying bullets, love and any number of hurdles, young people''s stories mingle and collide in the search for dreams and choices. Inspired by true stories, the feature film ''Broken Town'' reveals the struggle faced and the choices made by teenagers who have always been surrounded by weapons, crime, and hardship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d6HIauSSQvybsmBkAXx0JPrqAG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297278'),
  ('940529336099045470', 'Na Tum Jaano Na Hum', 2002, 'Romance, Drama', 'Arjun Sablok, Ana Tiwary, Anagha Dwivedi', 'Arjun Sablok', 'Saif Ali Khan, Hrithik Roshan, Esha Deol, Alok Nath, Ashima Bhalla, Bhavna Ruparel, Shilarna Vaze, Anang Desai', null, 'Esha and Rahul start a letter based friendship that blossoms into love. They don''t exchange names or pictures. Her parents would like Esha to marry Akshay who''s eager to tie the knot, so Esha is forced to make a decision...', 'Esha and Rahul start a letter based friendship that blossoms into love. They don''t exchange names or pictures. Her parents would like Esha to marry Akshay who''s eager to tie the knot, so Esha is forced to make a decision...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOIrm9WvMGvbliNZ88bK8hVYUc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83902'),
  ('1029910508400932861', 'Na Wewe', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Ivan Goldschmidt, Guy Maezelle', null, 'Floris Kubwimana, Renaud Rutten, Ismail Kaposho, Issa Rugendo, Ciza Muhirwa, Purcheline Matega', null, 'Na Wewe is a 2010 Belgian short film directed by Ivan Goldschmidt, set in Burundi in 1994 or thereabouts. There is a civil war on, a genocidal conflict opposing Hutus and Tutsis. The film follows an attack by rebels of a minibus transporting ordinary passengers -- but who is a Hutu and who is a Tutsi? The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'Na Wewe is a 2010 Belgian short film directed by Ivan Goldschmidt, set in Burundi in 1994 or thereabouts. There is a civil war on, a genocidal conflict opposing Hutus and Tutsis. The film follows an attack by rebels of a minibus transporting ordinary passengers -- but who is a Hutu and who is a Tutsi? The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bKKVhMm9Rlqj8oM4UVsXhUkQTug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95468'),
  ('409737389782702108', 'Na Willa', 2026, 'Drama, Family', 'Ryan Adriandhy, Yadi Sugandi, Widya Fajriah', 'Ryan Adriandhy', 'Luisa Adreena, Freya Mikhayla, Ibrahim Arsenio, Azamy Syauqi, Irma Novita Rihi, Junior Liem, Mbok Tun, Ira Wibowo', null, 'Willa, a six-year-old girl, believes that her little world in an alley in Surabaya is the most perfect and magical place. However, when her best friend has an accident and, one by one, her playmates begin going to school, Willa''s world slowly changes and starts to feel lonelier.', 'Willa, a six-year-old girl, believes that her little world in an alley in Surabaya is the most perfect and magical place. However, when her best friend has an accident and, one by one, her playmates begin going to school, Willa''s world slowly changes and starts to feel lonelier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riEj3yUEzvom6od0zuF5NONapC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476928'),
  ('726188724245261575', 'Naai Sekar Returns', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Suraj, Vignesh Vasu, S. B. Ramadoss', 'Suraj', 'Vadivelu, Rao Ramesh, Anandaraj, Munishkanth, Redin Kingsley, Sivaangi Krishnakumar, Shivani Narayanan, Lollu Sabha Maaran', null, 'Naai Sekar, who decides to make money by kidnapping dogs, learns about his pet dog which was taken away from their family during his childhood. Can he rescue his dog, which is considered as a lucky charm?', 'Naai Sekar, who decides to make money by kidnapping dogs, learns about his pet dog which was taken away from their family during his childhood. Can he rescue his dog, which is considered as a lucky charm?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUEFAV28aUzHmde24JmlgvBaHSg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882397'),
  ('980008258206671711', 'Naam Shabana', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Sudhir Palsane, Vicky Sidana, Shivam Nair', 'Neeraj Pandey', 'Taapsee Pannu, Prithviraj Sukumaran, Manoj Bajpayee, Akshay Kumar, Anupam Kher, Veerendra Saxena, Manav Vij, Bhuvan Arora', null, 'Shabana Khan, a special agent, is entrusted with the task of assassinating a deadly arms dealer by the Indian Intelligence Agency.', 'Shabana Khan, a special agent, is entrusted with the task of assassinating a deadly arms dealer by the Indian Intelligence Agency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFHeFrOYzsHgAiZeGAjwJmDMen6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441071'),
  ('370976043158026396', 'Naane Varuvean', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Om Prakash, Dhilip Subbarayan, Selvaraghavan', 'Selvaraghavan', 'Dhanush, Indhuja Ravichandran, Elli Avram, Yogi Babu, Prabhu, Hiya Davey, Prabhav, Pranav', null, 'A father finds out that his teenager daughter is possessed, and the only way he can save her is by doing the ghost''s bidding, which will mean an encounter with his long-separated twin - who happens to be a psycho killer.', 'A father finds out that his teenager daughter is possessed, and the only way he can save her is by doing the ghost''s bidding, which will mean an encounter with his long-separated twin - who happens to be a psycho killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pfiAftin05Rw8XhIdxG9wkAwJIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785664'),
  ('574240049880292664', 'Naari Naari Naduma Murari', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Ram Abbaraju, J. Yuvaraj, Gnana Shekar V. S.', 'Ram Abbaraju, Bhanu Bogavarapu, Nandu Savirigana', 'Sharwanand, Sakshi Vaidya, Samyuktha, Naresh, Sampath Raj', null, 'A young man''s life turns upside down when he finds himself caught between two women, leading to an unexpected love triangle filled with emotions, misunderstandings, and tough decisions. As relationships intertwine, he must confront his feelings, face reality, and choose what truly matters, blending romance with heartfelt family drama.', 'A young man''s life turns upside down when he finds himself caught between two women, leading to an unexpected love triangle filled with emotions, misunderstandings, and tough decisions. As relationships intertwine, he must confront his feelings, face reality, and choose what truly matters, blending romance with heartfelt family drama.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F6d19fbdf8bc9b9ae8efbfa0768f23b0c.jpg', 'plex:movie:nari-nari-naduma-murari-2026'),
  ('854173036748442875', 'Nabbie''s Love', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yuji Nakae, Kenji Takama, Shotaro Kobayashi', 'Motoko Nakae, Yuji Nakae', 'Naomi Nishida, Jun Murakami, Tomi Taira, Reiko Kaneshima, Rinshô Kadekaru, Misako Ôshiro, Rinji Kadekaru, Ashley MacIsaac', null, 'Nanako returns to her hometown on the tiny island of Aguni to meet her grandmother Nabbie. However, when Nanako''s ferry arrives, it is also carrying Nabbie''s former lover, who has returned to Aguni after a long absence.', 'Nanako returns to her hometown on the tiny island of Aguni to meet her grandmother Nabbie. However, when Nanako''s ferry arrives, it is also carrying Nabbie''s former lover, who has returned to Aguni after a long absence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMXhaKavImG4KflWn17skniUaDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207704'),
  ('461019141359833255', 'Nabonga', 1944, 'Adventure, Mystery, Crime', 'Robert E. Cline, Sam Newfield, Melville De Lay', 'Fred Myton', 'Buster Crabbe, Fifi D''Orsay, Barton MacLane, Julie London, Bryant Washburn, Herbert Rawlinson, Jackie Newfield, Ray Corrigan', 'NR', 'When a treasure hunter seeks a downed airplane in the jungles of Africa, he encounters one of the passenger''s young daughter, now fully grown, and with a gorilla protector.', 'When a treasure hunter seeks a downed airplane in the jungles of Africa, he encounters one of the passenger''s young daughter, now fully grown, and with a gorilla protector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssbU9fbrfvaW3f1VdXgsyY5HCrz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7268'),
  ('341064505678408901', 'Nacho Libre', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Jared Hess, Xavier Grobet, Christopher Lagunes', 'Jared Hess, Jerusha Hess, Mike White', 'Jack Black, Ana de la Reguera, Héctor Jiménez, Darius Rose, Moisés Arias, Carlos Maycotte, Richard Montoya, César Barrón', 'PG', 'Ignacio, a disrespected cook at a Mexican monastery, can barely afford to feed the orphans who live there. Inspired by a local wrestling hero, he decides to moonlight as the not-so-famous Luchador "Nacho Libre" to earn money for the monastery -- not to mention the admiration of beautiful nun Sister Encarnación.', 'Ignacio, a disrespected cook at a Mexican monastery, can barely afford to feed the orphans who live there. Inspired by a local wrestling hero, he decides to moonlight as the not-so-famous Luchador "Nacho Libre" to earn money for the monastery -- not to mention the admiration of beautiful nun Sister Encarnación.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kh7B91bMl2lZ0mH9WhPfaNUIEQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9353'),
  ('1007113719870895861', 'Nacht über Berlin', 2013, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Friedemann Fromm, Jo Heim', 'Friedemann Fromm, Rainer Berg', 'Anna Loos, Jan Josef Liefers, Sven Lehmann, Claudia Eisinger, Ingrid Mülleder, Franz Dinda, Stella Hilb, Christian Erdmann', null, 'Berlin, 1932. The Weimar Republic is torn apart in the struggle between right- and left-wing extremists and Berlin is a powder keg. Nightclub singer Henny Dalgow get to know the Social Democratic congressman and Jewish doctor Albert Goldman, and the two become a slightly odd couple. Albert is a sworn pacifist after his experiences in the First World War. Contrary to his beliefs he agrees to act as courier for his brother Edwin, who belongs to a radical communist cell.', 'Berlin, 1932. The Weimar Republic is torn apart in the struggle between right- and left-wing extremists and Berlin is a powder keg. Nightclub singer Henny Dalgow get to know the Social Democratic congressman and Jewish doctor Albert Goldman, and the two become a slightly odd couple. Albert is a sworn pacifist after his experiences in the First World War. Contrary to his beliefs he agrees to act as courier for his brother Edwin, who belongs to a radical communist cell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYiW4Q7aYU1oysYWyjQn63rvgSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170286'),
  ('77071907546142350', 'Nada que ver', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Juan Pablo Ojeda, Kenya Marquez, Anilú Pardo', 'Patricio Saiz, Alfonso Suárez', 'Memo Villegas, Fiona Palomo, Rebecca Jones, Nora Velázquez, Jorge Zárate, Camila Calónico, Mauricio Barrientos, Arap Bethke', 'PG-13', 'After Carlos is tasked to care for Paola, both characters must work out their differences to make their time together more pleasant. As time goes on, they are faced with lessons about trust, mutual respect, and perhaps love.', 'After Carlos is tasked to care for Paola, both characters must work out their differences to make their time together more pleasant. As time goes on, they are faced with lessons about trust, mutual respect, and perhaps love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brpncE7IUmXFhZ6kELmyChvHKel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087771'),
  ('1024799530457510695', 'Nadaaniyan', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Shauna Gautam, Anuj Samtani, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Riva Razdan Kapoor, Ishita Moitra, Jehan Handa', 'Ibrahim Ali Khan, Khushi Kapoor, Mahima Chaudhry, Suniel Shetty, Dia Mirza, Jugal Hansraj, Apoorva Mukhija, Aaliyah Qureishi', 'PG-13', 'A privileged Delhi socialite hires a middle-class student to pose as her boyfriend to maintain her social status. Their pretense becomes complicated when genuine feelings develop between them.', 'A privileged Delhi socialite hires a middle-class student to pose as her boyfriend to maintain her social status. Their pretense becomes complicated when genuine feelings develop between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQsGkLx68lmAdGwNapaaq3qqwKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216780'),
  ('523397353759578692', 'Nadia', 1984, 'Drama', 'Alan Cooke', 'Jim McGinn', 'Jonathan Banks, Talia Balsam, Carrie Snodgress, Leslie Weiner, Johann Carlo, Karrie Ullman, Simone Blue, Simon Adams', null, 'Story about gymnast Nadia Comaneci from her childhood beginning as a gymnast and how she was discovered by Belya Karolyi. Nadia received 7 perfect 10''s in the Montreal Olympics.', 'Story about gymnast Nadia Comaneci from her childhood beginning as a gymnast and how she was discovered by Belya Karolyi. Nadia received 7 perfect 10''s in the Montreal Olympics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhDHYd8Tn8fwlwLUDvvShWfUhe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60066'),
  ('786534791100494065', 'Nadia, Butterfly', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pascal Plante, Stéphanie Weber Biron', 'Pascal Plante', 'Katerine Savard, Ariane Mainville, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Marie-José Turcotte, John Ralston, Kaoru Matsui, Eli Jean Tahchi, Albert Kwan', null, 'While young and in her prime, Nadia decides to retire from pro swimming after the Olympic Games; to escape a rigid life of sacrifice. After her very last race, Nadia drifts into nights of excess punctuated by episodes of self-doubt. But even this transitional numbness cannot conceal her true inner quest: defining her identity outside the world of elite sports.', 'While young and in her prime, Nadia decides to retire from pro swimming after the Olympic Games; to escape a rigid life of sacrifice. After her very last race, Nadia drifts into nights of excess punctuated by episodes of self-doubt. But even this transitional numbness cannot conceal her true inner quest: defining her identity outside the world of elite sports.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTnFdP5xlrKzXpwV5V9oby20kBJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702654'),
  ('101711027639586987', 'Nadia: The Secret of Blue Water - The Motion Picture', 1991, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Sho Aono, Kouichi Takada, Katsunori Shimizu', 'Yuu Kou', 'Yoshino Takamori, Noriko Hidaka, Kumiko Takizawa, Kenyu Horiuchi, Toshiharu Sakurai, Tsukasa Itou, Chikao Ohtsuka, Tamio Ohki', null, 'Three years after the defeat of Gargoyle and Neo-Atlantis, a new threat has surfaced bent on bringing the world under his control. Geiger, using advanced robot technology, is attempting to begin a world war, and take control of the devistated world after the destruction has stopped. Once again, Nadia and Jean must fight to save the world, only this time from itself.', 'Three years after the defeat of Gargoyle and Neo-Atlantis, a new threat has surfaced bent on bringing the world under his control. Geiger, using advanced robot technology, is attempting to begin a world war, and take control of the devistated world after the destruction has stopped. Once again, Nadia and Jean must fight to save the world, only this time from itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnih9Ql8vp8YH1TMN2QSmJdLBhD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121139'),
  ('1148094849787478380', 'Nadie te habla: Manos libres', 2005, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'José Buil', 'José Buil', 'Alejandro Calva, Luis Gerardo Méndez, José Carlos Femat, Ana Paula Corpus, Gloria Stalina, Yuriria del Valle, Jorge Zárate, Verónica Merchant', null, 'Two students at a Mexico City university are desperate to attend an Acapulco rave — so desperate that they’ll kidnap a girl to raise the funds to get there.', 'Two students at a Mexico City university are desperate to attend an Acapulco rave — so desperate that they’ll kidnap a girl to raise the funds to get there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xu9A1JIH3NlaP3hWOYcbufuDVv0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326858'),
  ('578605000313784450', 'Nadie te ve: La niña en la piedra', 2007, 'Drama', 'Maryse Sistach', null, 'Gabino Rodríguez, Sofía Espinosa, Ricardo Polanco, Silverio Palacios, Alejandro Calva, Ximena Ayala, Arcelia Ramírez, Luis Gerardo Méndez', null, 'Gabino, a very dedicated and hardworking young high school student, he is infatuated with Maty and tries to make her fall in love with him. After an incident in the school, where Gabino and his two friends are suspended for harassing Maty, she rejects him for the last time causing Gabino to plan a revenge against Maty.', 'Gabino, a very dedicated and hardworking young high school student, he is infatuated with Maty and tries to make her fall in love with him. After an incident in the school, where Gabino and his two friends are suspended for harassing Maty, she rejects him for the last time causing Gabino to plan a revenge against Maty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZWQNkqbyMh1rU4Zdsx7kjyaaer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98456'),
  ('332307615231300801', 'Nadine', 1987, 'Romance, Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Robert Benton, Néstor Almendros', 'Robert Benton', 'Jeff Bridges, Kim Basinger, Rip Torn, Gwen Verdon, Glenne Headly, Jerry Stiller, Jay Patterson, William Youmans', 'PG', 'Hairdresser Nadine Hightower wants to retrieve the risqué photos she once posed for, but when she visits the photographer at his office, he''s murdered by an intruder. Nadine talks her estranged husband, Vernon, into going along when she returns to the office, where they stumble across plans for a less than legal construction project. But when Vernon tries to turn the documents into a cash windfall, he and Nadine are pursued by goons with guns.', 'Hairdresser Nadine Hightower wants to retrieve the risqué photos she once posed for, but when she visits the photographer at his office, he''s murdered by an intruder. Nadine talks her estranged husband, Vernon, into going along when she returns to the office, where they stumble across plans for a less than legal construction project. But when Vernon tries to turn the documents into a cash windfall, he and Nadine are pursued by goons with guns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mim8TLLXmD3ui03f9jVmOXGACv8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61178'),
  ('399009541368589511', 'Nadja', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Almereyda, Jim Denault', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Elina Löwensohn, Suzy Amis, Galaxy Craze, Martin Donovan, Peter Fonda, Karl Geary, Jared Harris, Nic Ratner', 'R', 'In a contemporary New York City, members of a dysfunctional family of vampires are trying to come to terms with each other, in the wake of their father''s death. Meanwhile, they are being hunted by Dr. Van Helsing and his hapless nephew. As in all good vampire movies, forces of love are pitted against forces of destruction.', 'In a contemporary New York City, members of a dysfunctional family of vampires are trying to come to terms with each other, in the wake of their father''s death. Meanwhile, they are being hunted by Dr. Van Helsing and his hapless nephew. As in all good vampire movies, forces of love are pitted against forces of destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwo3iDfPNdZoSNGAgQDXEM7xMu8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34574'),
  ('256605393563043452', 'Nadja in Paris', 1964, 'Documentary', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros, Pierre-Richard Bré', 'Nadja Tesich', 'Nadja Tesich, Jean-Pierre Léaud', null, 'Nadja is a guest student, who stays at Cité Universitaire and visits the Sorbonne, while preparing a thesis on Proust; she also likes to stroll about Paris.', 'Nadja is a guest student, who stays at Cité Universitaire and visits the Sorbonne, while preparing a thesis on Proust; she also likes to stroll about Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JXXfItp874i0QqKdvpDSUZL34B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47451'),
  ('336647143662410636', 'Nadodikkattu', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Sathyan Anthikad', 'Sreenivasan', 'Mohanlal, Sreenivasan, Shobana, Thilakan, Innocent, Janardhanan, Captain Raju, Mamukkoya', null, 'After losing their jobs, Dasan and Vijayan have no hope of finding work in Kerala. They plan to escape to Dubai, but end up in Chennai. Can they find luck there?', 'After losing their jobs, Dasan and Vijayan have no hope of finding work in Kerala. They plan to escape to Dubai, but end up in Chennai. Can they find luck there?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePuAtxBT6DDMHmk6eusFpIWi64A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275366'),
  ('344293752048935223', 'Naga', 2023, 'Thriller', 'Ibraheem Alshangeeti, Qamar Khanum, Maxime Meyronin', 'Meshal Aljaser', 'Adwa Bader, Yazeed Almajyul, Jubran Al Jubran, Khalid Bin Shaddad, Amal Alharbi, Mutlaq Althubaiti, Ali Alduwian, Oumkalthoum Sarah Bard', 'R', 'Stranded amid Riyadh''s desert dunes, Sarah, a local Saudi girl, escapes heartaches and the vengeance of a vigorous camel after discreetly sneaking out of her parent''s home for a romantic date that landed her astray.', 'Stranded amid Riyadh''s desert dunes, Sarah, a local Saudi girl, escapes heartaches and the vengeance of a vigorous camel after discreetly sneaking out of her parent''s home for a romantic date that landed her astray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QOYVE6zS0tyQ3qeGaECD7WWoaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160025'),
  ('353919250726639077', 'Nagasaki: Memories of My Son', 2015, 'Drama', 'Yoji Yamada, Masashi Chikamori', 'Yoji Yamada, Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Sayuri Yoshinaga, Kazunari Ninomiya, Haru Kuroki, Tadanobu Asano, Isao Hashizume, Yuriko Hirooka, Miyu Honda, Kenichi Kato', null, 'Nobuko works in Nagasaki, Japan as a midwife. Her son died 3 years earlier from the atomic bomb. On August 9, 1948, her son appears in front of her again. Since that time, Koji appears in front of her and they reminiscence about pleasant times. These happy, but bizarre moments seem eternal.', 'Nobuko works in Nagasaki, Japan as a midwife. Her son died 3 years earlier from the atomic bomb. On August 9, 1948, her son appears in front of her again. Since that time, Koji appears in front of her and they reminiscence about pleasant times. These happy, but bizarre moments seem eternal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/33NEFoAUJcqIG32JIRZjrBT6FKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380341'),
  ('168683074373837376', 'Nagina', 1986, 'Romance, Fantasy, Action, Horror, Mystery', 'Harmesh Malhotra', 'Ravi Kapoor', 'Sridevi, Rishi Kapoor, Prem Chopra, Amrish Puri, Sushma Seth, Rupini, Jagdeep, Pinchoo Kapoor', null, 'The story follows Rajni, a shape-shifting cobra (Ichchadhari Naagin) who marries a civilian, Rajiv, to avenge the death of her spouse at the hands of an evil saint. Rajiv, who comes from a wealthy family, returns to India after studying in London. His mother wants him to marry Vijaya Singh, but he falls in love with Rajni, an orphan. His mother initially opposes the marriage but later agrees. Their happiness is disrupted when Bhairon Nath, a sadhu with the ability to control snakes, arrives and reveals that Rajni is actually a Naagin seeking revenge. Bhairon Nath has his own sinister motives—he wants to capture Rajni because she knows the location of a hidden Mani, a sacred jewel that would grant him immense power. A dramatic battle ensues, leading to Bhairon Nath’s defeat, and Rajiv and Rajni live happily ever after.', 'The story follows Rajni, a shape-shifting cobra (Ichchadhari Naagin) who marries a civilian, Rajiv, to avenge the death of her spouse at the hands of an evil saint. Rajiv, who comes from a wealthy family, returns to India after studying in London. His mother wants him to marry Vijaya Singh, but he falls in love with Rajni, an orphan. His mother initially opposes the marriage but later agrees. Their happiness is disrupted when Bhairon Nath, a sadhu with the ability to control snakes, arrives and reveals that Rajni is actually a Naagin seeking revenge. Bhairon Nath has his own sinister motives—he wants to capture Rajni because she knows the location of a hidden Mani, a sacred jewel that would grant him immense power. A dramatic battle ensues, leading to Bhairon Nath’s defeat, and Rajiv and Rajni live happily ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zzv7ZAwTEDyVgcmbEOZMjqBpG9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143889'),
  ('67477471819662338', 'Nagisa''s Big Breast Milk Fight', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yoshikazu Katō, Masakazu Sô, Yûjirô Ozeki', 'Daisuke Gotô', 'Meguri Fujiura, Ren Fukusaki, Rei Ayana, Masahiro Kotaki, Masamitsu Kani, Seiji Nakamitsu', null, 'Kohei Hayasaka''s lover, Kohei, died in a disaster several years ago. Hikari leaves Kohei''s room as it was, prepares food on the anniversary of his death, carefully cleans his body in the bath, has flirting sex with the phantom Kohei in a naked apron like a newlywed ... and wakes up from that dream. He returned to the everyday world and was silently doing his job at the fishery cooperative.', 'Kohei Hayasaka''s lover, Kohei, died in a disaster several years ago. Hikari leaves Kohei''s room as it was, prepares food on the anniversary of his death, carefully cleans his body in the bath, has flirting sex with the phantom Kohei in a naked apron like a newlywed ... and wakes up from that dream. He returned to the everyday world and was silently doing his job at the fishery cooperative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4BD38JVd8dXc4TyyKqoq3WyMFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831944'),
  ('632742603562999133', 'Nahir', 2024, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Hernán Guerschuny, Lionel Diacovetzky, Malén P. Bourdieu', 'Sofía Wilhelmi', 'Valentina Zenere, Simón Hempe, César Bordón, Mónica Antonópulos, Nacho Gadano, Felipe Canullan Weise, Ramiro Vayo, Darío Levy', null, 'One of the most controversial cases in recent years in Argentina, this movie is based on the true story of Nahir Galarza and the murder of her boyfriend that rocked the country. The youngest woman to be convicted and sentenced to life in prison in Argentina, but questions still remain- was this a crime of passion, or is the truth still yet to be fully discovered?', 'One of the most controversial cases in recent years in Argentina, this movie is based on the true story of Nahir Galarza and the murder of her boyfriend that rocked the country. The youngest woman to be convicted and sentenced to life in prison in Argentina, but questions still remain- was this a crime of passion, or is the truth still yet to be fully discovered?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lCerAA6lArxaVskPqR586GJqB5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234783'),
  ('409014975939199660', 'Nahuel and the Magic Book', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Germán Acuña', 'Germán Acuña, Juan Pablo Sepúlveda', 'Consuelo Pizarro, Vanesa Silva, Jorge Lillo, Sebastian Dupont, Marcelo Liapiz, Sergio Schmied, Sandro Larenas', 'G', 'Nahuel lives with his father in a fishing town, yet he has a deep fear of the sea. One day, he finds a magical book that seems to be the solution to this problem, but a dark sorcerer is after it and captures Nahuel''s father. This is where his journey to rescue his father and overcome his fears begins.', 'Nahuel lives with his father in a fishing town, yet he has a deep fear of the sea. One day, he finds a magical book that seems to be the solution to this problem, but a dark sorcerer is after it and captures Nahuel''s father. This is where his journey to rescue his father and overcome his fears begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwWz3biJXjhJmn5WCjocGCVG3k2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:706663'),
