  ('806179342054052301', 'Naked Childhood', 1969, 'Drama', 'Maurice Pialat, Claude Beausoleil', 'Arlette Langmann, Maurice Pialat', 'Michel Terrazon, Raoul Billerey, Pierrette Deplanque, Marie-Louise Thierry, René Thierry, Linda Gutenberg, Henri Puff, Marie Marc', null, 'Handed over to foster care by his mother—who''s unwilling to give up permanent custody—the now-adolescent François understands that nothing in life is permanent, and his increasingly erratic actions reflect this knowledge.', 'Handed over to foster care by his mother—who''s unwilling to give up permanent custody—the now-adolescent François understands that nothing in life is permanent, and his increasingly erratic actions reflect this knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cD6WpamMeCdMoinljqnj5c6YrF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31345'),
  ('509335982276708649', 'Naked Citizen', 1985, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Başar Sabuncu, Ertunç Şenkay', 'Başar Sabuncu', 'Şener Şen, Nilgün Akçaoğlu, Pekcan Koşar, Zihni Küçümen, Candan Sabuncu, Kamran Usluer, Bilge Zobu, Ertuğrul Bilda', null, 'A family man, driven to the edge by his inability to financially support his family, is found running about on the street naked. Suddenly, he turns into a nationwide celebrity and an inspiration for millions of people in poverty.', 'A family man, driven to the edge by his inability to financially support his family, is found running about on the street naked. Suddenly, he turns into a nationwide celebrity and an inspiration for millions of people in poverty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mofgrvRQ41WomkXFNnBoVpFUTyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219217'),
  ('601319986724337723', 'Naked Fear', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Grace, Thom Eberhardt, Taylor Phillips', 'Christine Vasquez', 'Joe Mantegna, Danielle De Luca, Evan Adrian, J.D. Garfield, Mel MacKaron, Jenny Marlowe, Arron Shiver, Kevin Wiggins', 'R', 'Diana arrives in a town to start a new job. She''s threatened into working as an exotic dancer. She''s later kidnapped and let loose naked in the wilderness as prey for the psycho hunter, like many women before her. Will she survive?', 'Diana arrives in a town to start a new job. She''s threatened into working as an exotic dancer. She''s later kidnapped and let loose naked in the wilderness as prey for the psycho hunter, like many women before her. Will she survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/niJO1FhGO5rjBHJgrht0xAve1QU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30155'),
  ('1007813263871033247', 'Naked Girl Killed in the Park', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alfonso Brescia, Alfonso Nieva', 'Peter Skerl, Gianni Martucci', 'Robert Hoffmann, Irina Demick, Pilar Velázquez, Howard Ross, Patrizia Adiutori, Adolfo Celi, Philippe Leroy, Agustín Bescos', null, 'Johan Wallenberger, a rich financier, is killed in the House of Horrors at an amusement park in Madrid. His insurance company assign Chris Buyer, one of their best agents, to investigate because a few days prior to his death, the businessman took out a million dollar life insurance policy. Chris ingratiates himself with Catherine, Wallenberger''s beautiful daughter, and it emerges that she is being plagued by a blackmailer. Chris is invited to the Wallenbergers'' country house and is soon the centre of attention for several attractive women. Meanwhile, the plot thickens...', 'Johan Wallenberger, a rich financier, is killed in the House of Horrors at an amusement park in Madrid. His insurance company assign Chris Buyer, one of their best agents, to investigate because a few days prior to his death, the businessman took out a million dollar life insurance policy. Chris ingratiates himself with Catherine, Wallenberger''s beautiful daughter, and it emerges that she is being plagued by a blackmailer. Chris is invited to the Wallenbergers'' country house and is soon the centre of attention for several attractive women. Meanwhile, the plot thickens...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9F0nYS4WiFfWNxNAWlL3r0GUgaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105111'),
  ('1109922195474474646', 'Naked Gun 33⅓: The Final Insult', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Peter Segal, Robert M. Stevens, John Hockridge', 'David Zucker, Pat Proft, Robert LoCash', 'Leslie Nielsen, Priscilla Presley, George Kennedy, O. J. Simpson, Fred Ward, Kathleen Freeman, Anna Nicole Smith, Ellen Greene', 'PG-13', 'Frank Drebin is persuaded out of retirement to go undercover in a state prison. There he has to find out what top terrorist, Rocco, has planned for when he escapes. Adding to his problems, Frank''s wife, Jane, is desperate for a baby.', 'Frank Drebin is persuaded out of retirement to go undercover in a state prison. There he has to find out what top terrorist, Rocco, has planned for when he escapes. Adding to his problems, Frank''s wife, Jane, is desperate for a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0AYsdgkudR9P5fNV5AjzbwQt8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36593'),
  ('258995039576989231', 'Naked in New York', 1993, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daniel Algrant, Joey Forsyte, Robert C. Albertell', 'John Warren, Daniel Algrant', 'Eric Stoltz, Mary-Louise Parker, Ralph Macchio, Jill Clayburgh, Tony Curtis, Timothy Dalton, Lynne Thigpen, Kathleen Turner', 'R', 'Naked in New York begins in the car of grown up Jake, he is talking to us about his girlfriend, Joanne, and to whom you can turn to for help while facing life. From there it flashes back to his memories of his parents, college, house across from a squirrel infested peanut factory, best friend, writing career and Joanne.', 'Naked in New York begins in the car of grown up Jake, he is talking to us about his girlfriend, Joanne, and to whom you can turn to for help while facing life. From there it flashes back to his memories of his parents, college, house across from a squirrel infested peanut factory, best friend, writing career and Joanne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAufFGm2Qly8TYrhy4me9X35B7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11800'),
  ('694490434014647640', 'Naked Killer', 1992, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Leung Baak-Kin, Ching Shu-Ching, Peter Pau Tak-Hai', 'Wong Jing', 'Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Simon Yam, Carrie Ng Ka-Lai, Yiu Wai, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Madoka Sugawara, Dick Lau Tik-Chi, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong', 'R', 'A young woman is trained by a professional assassin to become her partner in crime.', 'A young woman is trained by a professional assassin to become her partner in crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9V3lIqF0fyQfMe4CUl86N0nQfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26877'),
  ('454637488865780691', 'Naked Lies', 1998, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Ralph E. Portillo, Jacob Eleasari, Freddy Noriega', 'Jalee Bailey, D. Alvelo, Michael Edwards', 'Shannon Tweed, Fernando Allende, Steven Bauer, Hugo Stiglitz, Jay Baker, Michael Rose, Mineko Mori, Jaqueline Fernandez', 'R', 'FBI agent Cara Landry is sent on an undercover assignment to gather evidence on Damian Medina, a Mexican casino owner running a counterfeiting operation for the Cali drug cartel...', 'FBI agent Cara Landry is sent on an undercover assignment to gather evidence on Damian Medina, a Mexican casino owner running a counterfeiting operation for the Cali drug cartel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oItmWltYVVrD7CaYpAkEmhTWfll.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57782'),
  ('500301398167234849', 'Naked Lunch', 1991, 'Crime, Drama', 'Peter Suschitzky, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'Peter Weller, Judy Davis, Ian Holm, Julian Sands, Roy Scheider, Monique Mercure, Nicholas Campbell, Michael Zelniker', 'R', 'Blank-faced bug killer Bill Lee and his dead-eyed wife, Joan, like to get high on Bill''s pest poisons while lounging with Beat poet pals. After meeting the devilish Dr. Benway, Bill gets a drug made from a centipede. Upon indulging, he accidentally kills Joan, takes orders from his typewriter-turned-cockroach, ends up in a constantly mutating Mediterranean city and learns that his hip friends have published his work -- which he doesn''t remember writing.', 'Blank-faced bug killer Bill Lee and his dead-eyed wife, Joan, like to get high on Bill''s pest poisons while lounging with Beat poet pals. After meeting the devilish Dr. Benway, Bill gets a drug made from a centipede. Upon indulging, he accidentally kills Joan, takes orders from his typewriter-turned-cockroach, ends up in a constantly mutating Mediterranean city and learns that his hip friends have published his work -- which he doesn''t remember writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u01kh5jKUWjhom76mguRqUgdvja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2742'),
  ('590818211897642160', 'Naked Poison', 2000, 'Crime, Horror', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Cash Chin Man-Kei', 'Samuel Leung Cheuk-Moon, Gwennie Tam, Sophie Ngan Chin-Man, Sze-Ma Wah-Lung, CoCo Chow Ka-Yu, Wong Chi-Wang, Nelson Cheung Hok-Yun', null, 'Nerdy office worker Min gets his kicks taking sneaky snaps of his female co-workers, spying on his neighbours having rough sex, and coating himself in oil before bashing one out to internet porn; things change, however, when he mixes ingredients from his late grandfather''s medicine shop to create the ultimate aphrodisiac/date-rape drug, which he uses to satisfy both his sexual urges and his desire for revenge on office bullies Winnie and Peter.', 'Nerdy office worker Min gets his kicks taking sneaky snaps of his female co-workers, spying on his neighbours having rough sex, and coating himself in oil before bashing one out to internet porn; things change, however, when he mixes ingredients from his late grandfather''s medicine shop to create the ultimate aphrodisiac/date-rape drug, which he uses to satisfy both his sexual urges and his desire for revenge on office bullies Winnie and Peter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2WlXZkUxliOVPw23TujDeUu65E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105904'),
  ('1109999275149327637', 'Naked Poison II', 2002, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Batman Hung', 'Tin-Tai Kam', 'Sophie Ngan Chin-Man, Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Matthew Ng Ting, Ruby Wong Jo-Yi, CoCo Chow Ka-Yu', null, 'During the murder of her boyfriend, Ann is hit and loses her ability to remember more than the previous 15 minutes at any given time. But she swears to find the murderer and recall her past with the aid of her tattooes, which provide her with vital information. Starting with a blank canvas, she must make sense of the people around her--a cop, a business woman, a divorcee, and a transsexual--in order to make put the pieces together', 'During the murder of her boyfriend, Ann is hit and loses her ability to remember more than the previous 15 minutes at any given time. But she swears to find the murderer and recall her past with the aid of her tattooes, which provide her with vital information. Starting with a blank canvas, she must make sense of the people around her--a cop, a business woman, a divorcee, and a transsexual--in order to make put the pieces together', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yiOslzzNdkB7mSc5zX4Vz2dnSFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368534'),
  ('598306446111574374', 'Naked Rose', 1994, 'Drama', 'Yeung Jing, Yeh Ching-Piao', 'Yang Tzu-chi', 'Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Dassey Wong Wing-Fong, Fong Si-Ting, Shing Fui-On, Wang Hsi-Hua, Li Yu-Fen, Yau Hiu-Ying, Hung Cho', null, 'A story of innocence in a cruel world. Kitty is a young ingenue down on her luck and about to be evicted from her apartment for being arrears in her rent when she is saved by a police inspector who offers to pay her rent. Meanwhile she gets a job in a modelling agency and meets Tony, an arrogant photographer who believes that commercialism will sully his art and that he will not prostitute his artistic standards to their demands. The police inspector is corrupt and sells our young innnocent to a brothel owner Helen who in a magnaminous gesture tears up the contract confiding that she too was once young and innocent. A muddled story line leads to the rapprochement of Kitty and Tony who find love in each others arms.', 'A story of innocence in a cruel world. Kitty is a young ingenue down on her luck and about to be evicted from her apartment for being arrears in her rent when she is saved by a police inspector who offers to pay her rent. Meanwhile she gets a job in a modelling agency and meets Tony, an arrogant photographer who believes that commercialism will sully his art and that he will not prostitute his artistic standards to their demands. The police inspector is corrupt and sells our young innnocent to a brothel owner Helen who in a magnaminous gesture tears up the contract confiding that she too was once young and innocent. A muddled story line leads to the rapprochement of Kitty and Tony who find love in each others arms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEDcMNIsVIV6ou0PhNOIFsViVMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665700'),
  ('211677694010044702', 'Naked Singularity', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sara Blechman, Tess Raih, Alex Backus', 'David Matthews, Chase Palmer', 'John Boyega, Olivia Cooke, Bill Skarsgård, Ed Skrein, Linda Lavin, Tim Blake Nelson, Kyle Mooney, Robert Christopher Riley', 'R', 'When a successful New York public defender loses his first case, he is pulled into a drug heist by a former client in an effort to beat the broken system at its own game.', 'When a successful New York public defender loses his first case, he is pulled into a drug heist by a former client in an effort to beat the broken system at its own game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJwnO2Tou9hwgy1olFn3JcCj7Sx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624789'),
  ('42039003588816489', 'Naked Soldier', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Marco Mak Chi-Sin, Tony Miu Kin-Fai, Cheung Man-Po', 'Wong Jing', 'Jennifer Tse Ting-Ting, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Ankie Beilke, Andy On Chi-Kit, Philip Ng Wan-Lung, Jiang Luxia, Lena Lin, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang', null, 'A gorgeous lethal killer, brainwashed by the villain, makes a startling discovery in a mission to eliminate a person she can in no way imagine.', 'A gorgeous lethal killer, brainwashed by the villain, makes a startling discovery in a mission to eliminate a person she can in no way imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDJGfBDpaS6NppZxwOobDNXMkF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127329'),
  ('323922785688756974', 'Naked Souls', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lyndon Chubbuck, Eric J. Goldstein, Phil Robinson', 'Frank Dietz, Randolf Turrow', 'Brian Krause, Pamela Anderson, David Warner, Dean Stockwell, Clayton Rohner, Justina Vail Evans, Victor Talmadge, Elizabeth Low', 'R', 'Edward is busy trying to unlock the secrets of reading and recording people''s thoughts. He is very involved with his work leaving little room for girlfriend Britt. Longstreet comes along and offers Edward a place to do his research and have unlimited funding. There are, however, ulterior motives as Edward is also somehow unlocking the secrets of eternal life.', 'Edward is busy trying to unlock the secrets of reading and recording people''s thoughts. He is very involved with his work leaving little room for girlfriend Britt. Longstreet comes along and offers Edward a place to do his research and have unlimited funding. There are, however, ulterior motives as Edward is also somehow unlocking the secrets of eternal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nW8KRQHeqWkr1kc7IBCfx3l4Lr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79950'),
  ('950224662793828761', 'Naked Tango', 1990, 'Romance, Drama', 'Leonard Schrader, David Rubin, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Leonard Schrader', 'Vincent D''Onofrio, Mathilda May, Fernando Rey, Tony Payne, Henry W. Holmes Jr., Esai Morales, Josh Mostel, Sergio Lerer', 'R', 'When a young European woman assumes a false identity in 1920s Argentina, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'When a young European woman assumes a false identity in 1920s Argentina, she gets more than she bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVGEZrsaNsSudakEp6Q46AqKs45.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60801'),
