  ('711626426084753771', 'Naked Under the Moon', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'Louie Quirino, Lav Diaz', 'Lav Diaz', 'Klaudia Koronel, Joel Torre, Elizabeth Oropesa, Ronnie Lazaro, Julio Díaz, Isabel Granada, Mike Magat, Lui Manansala', null, 'A young woman recalls how her father (a fallen priest), her mother (a woman with a secret past) and her teenage sister returned with her to live in their ancestral home after the family business failed. She was plagued with mysterious problems of sleepwalking and began a romance with a young man who tried to cure her.', 'A young woman recalls how her father (a fallen priest), her mother (a woman with a secret past) and her teenage sister returned with her to live in their ancestral home after the family business failed. She was plagued with mysterious problems of sleepwalking and began a romance with a young man who tried to cure her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvgbvOZXM7kgiAfJZvKQpJUPVo1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219435'),
  ('154958951048103211', 'Naked Vengeance', 1985, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Cirio H. Santiago', 'Reilly Askew', 'Deborah Tranelli, Kaz Garas, Carmen Argenziano, Bill McLaughlin, Ed Crick, George E. Mahlberg, Helen McNeely, Henry Strzalkowski', 'R', 'After witnessing her husband''s brutal murder, Carla travels to her parents'' home in a small mountain town to start over. When she''s repeatedly harassed by redneck locals, Carla seeks help from the town sheriff but is met with indifference. This continues until Carla''s finally attacked, raped, and her parents executed by the twisted townies. Carla, after escaping a mental hospital, resolves to get bloody revenge.', 'After witnessing her husband''s brutal murder, Carla travels to her parents'' home in a small mountain town to start over. When she''s repeatedly harassed by redneck locals, Carla seeks help from the town sheriff but is met with indifference. This continues until Carla''s finally attacked, raped, and her parents executed by the twisted townies. Carla, after escaping a mental hospital, resolves to get bloody revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/svvvIuMOqoHkIkrDi2ifZlVnT4c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84474'),
  ('536396746430142199', 'Naked Violence', 1969, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Fernando Di Leo, Franco Villa', 'Marino Onorati', 'Pier Paolo Capponi, Nieves Navarro, Marzio Margine, Renato Lupi, Enzo Liberti, Giuliano Manetti, Danika La Loggia, Anna Maria La Rovere', null, 'Some youngsters rape and kill their teacher; but they won''t tell their motivation. The police detective on the case feels some sinister influence behind the young murderers.', 'Some youngsters rape and kill their teacher; but they won''t tell their motivation. The police detective on the case feels some sinister influence behind the young murderers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjbtDJ8FDLjJckGjoLkdku2UOIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28321'),
  ('299487690347387266', 'Naked Weapon', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Choi Sung-Fai', 'Wong Jing', 'Maggie Q, Anya, Daniel Wu, Li Fei, Almen Wong Pui-Ha, Andrew Lin Hoi, Cheng Pei-Pei, Monica Lo Suk-Yee', 'R', 'A mysterious woman, known as Madame M, kidnaps forty pre-teen girls and transports them to a remote island to train them as the most deadly assassins. CIA operative Jack Chen follows the case for 6 years with no leads, but when a series of assassinations begin to occur, Jack suspects that Madame M is back in business.', 'A mysterious woman, known as Madame M, kidnaps forty pre-teen girls and transports them to a remote island to train them as the most deadly assassins. CIA operative Jack Chen follows the case for 6 years with no leads, but when a series of assassinations begin to occur, Jack suspects that Madame M is back in business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEkFMDlIosqroIO8yBBIKZWoGRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10855'),
  ('684169846626842440', 'Naked Weekend', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, José F. Aguayo', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Lina Morgan, Alfredo Landa, Máximo Valverde, Haydée Balza, Antonio Ozores, Toco Gómez, Helga Liné, África Pratt', null, 'Angustias, a hotel maid, and Rodolfo, play boy who will spend a few days in that hotel with Octavia, witness how a wealthy lady, seeking to steal her jewelry by thieves, is accidentally killed by her lover in a discussion.', 'Angustias, a hotel maid, and Rodolfo, play boy who will spend a few days in that hotel with Octavia, witness how a wealthy lady, seeking to steal her jewelry by thieves, is accidentally killed by her lover in a discussion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bri5OTcqKg8fX9Qmwzli5N6ZQ7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75492'),
  ('290508524663569038', 'Naked You Die', 1968, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Antonio Margheriti, Fausto Zuccoli, Nando Angelini', 'Antonio Margheriti, Franco Bottari, Mario Bava', 'Mark Damon, Eleonora Brown, Sally Smith, Patrizia Valturri, Ludmila Lvova, Luciano Pigozzi, Franco De Rosa, Vivian Stapleton', null, 'A woman is strangled in the bath by a black-gloved killer who disposes of her body in a large trunk. The trunk is delivered to St. Hilda College, an exclusive finishing school. Betty-Anne, one of the female students, is strangled in the school cellar. The police, led by Inspector Durand, are called in to investigate. Suspects include La Floret, the voyeuristic gardener; Di Brazzi, the new swimming instructor; Mrs. Clay, the summer school French mistress; an old professor who collects birds; and a philandering young teacher called Richard. The murders continue but Jill, a keen amateur detective, helps the police identify the unlikely killer...', 'A woman is strangled in the bath by a black-gloved killer who disposes of her body in a large trunk. The trunk is delivered to St. Hilda College, an exclusive finishing school. Betty-Anne, one of the female students, is strangled in the school cellar. The police, led by Inspector Durand, are called in to investigate. Suspects include La Floret, the voyeuristic gardener; Di Brazzi, the new swimming instructor; Mrs. Clay, the summer school French mistress; an old professor who collects birds; and a philandering young teacher called Richard. The murders continue but Jill, a keen amateur detective, helps the police identify the unlikely killer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlqfdUCZIRuLjf9tENwutABuH5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28064'),
  ('1049339079107058272', 'Näköradiomiehen ihmeelliset siekailut', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Mauno Kuusla, Kari Sohlberg, Ere Kokkonen', 'Spede Pasanen, Jukka Virtanen, Ere Kokkonen', 'Spede Pasanen, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Leo Jokela, Simo Salminen, Danny, Tamara Lund', null, 'TV studio organizer Mikko Syvärinen becomes the admired comedian K. Ovimikko through a series of mishaps. However, Mikko''s popularity wanes when he switches from door comedy to window comedy. His show is taken off the air, his girlfriend leaves him, and he loses his apartment. Once again, Mikko sets out to rebuild his TV career by becoming a producer again.', 'TV studio organizer Mikko Syvärinen becomes the admired comedian K. Ovimikko through a series of mishaps. However, Mikko''s popularity wanes when he switches from door comedy to window comedy. His show is taken off the air, his girlfriend leaves him, and he loses his apartment. Once again, Mikko sets out to rebuild his TV career by becoming a producer again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5IAxfRWRIb2d1kXPgXi2oP8wBe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55498'),
  ('344426253250817732', 'Naksha', 2006, 'Action, Adventure', 'Sachin Bajaj, Vijay Kumar Arora, Udai Prakash Singh', 'Milap Zaveri, Tushar Hiranandani', 'Sunny Deol, Vivek Oberoi, Sameera Reddy, Jackie Shroff', null, '20 years after the death of an archaeologist, Kapil Malhotra, his younger son, Vicky attempts to uncover his father''s mission with the help of an ancient map.', '20 years after the death of an archaeologist, Kapil Malhotra, his younger son, Vicky attempts to uncover his father''s mission with the help of an ancient map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WdMoSzM8P3ZkmYIo8xzZl7ypZf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236007'),
  ('824963330560479197', 'Nalu on the Border', 2017, 'Drama', 'Heloísa Passos, Carolina Pereira, Nana Baptista', 'Michele Frantz, Cristiane Oliveira', 'Maria Galant, Marat Descartes, Verónica Perrotta, Áurea Baptista, Amélia Bittencourt, Jorge Esmoris, Fabiana Amorim, Liane Venturella', null, 'Nalu lives with Ruben, her father, in a small country town near the Brazilian border with Uruguay. When Ruben realizes that his daughter is becoming a woman, an ambiguous closeness begins to develop between them.', 'Nalu lives with Ruben, her father, in a small country town near the Brazilian border with Uruguay. When Ruben realizes that his daughter is becoming a woman, an ambiguous closeness begins to develop between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OcoQk6DJ6RQPRkSMBT3DSMka5W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417561'),
  ('763334030527407965', 'Namak Halaal', 1982, 'Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Prakash Mehra', 'Prakash Mehra', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shashi Kapoor, Smita Patil, Parveen Babi, Om Prakash, Waheeda Rehman, Suresh Oberoi, Kamal Kapoor', null, 'Young Arjun is brought up by his Daddu (paternal grandfather). His Daddu decides for him to go to the city in search of a new job and life. While in the city he meets up with Bhairon who guides him into an interview in a 5-star hotel owned by Raja.', 'Young Arjun is brought up by his Daddu (paternal grandfather). His Daddu decides for him to go to the city in search of a new job and life. While in the city he meets up with Bhairon who guides him into an interview in a 5-star hotel owned by Raja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPaT9BUc8RiBVdZ05VLTDuwdr56.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51615'),
  ('296980184625838037', 'Namak Haraam', 1973, 'Drama, Action', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Nityananda Datta', 'D.N. Mukherjee, Gulzar', 'Rajesh Khanna, Amitabh Bachchan, Simi Garewal, Rekha, Asrani, A.K. Hangal, Durga Khote, Om Shivpuri', null, 'Somu and Vicky decide to exact revenge on the union leader, Bipinlal Pandey. However, when Somu understands the plight of the workers, it creates a rift between the two friends.', 'Somu and Vicky decide to exact revenge on the union leader, Bipinlal Pandey. However, when Somu understands the plight of the workers, it creates a rift between the two friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxWROB2onweG7ykCccyVVIf4OGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160148'),
  ('686172935234368520', 'Namaste England', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Vipul Amrutlal Shah, Yiannis Manolopoulos, Honey Trehan', 'Suresh Nair', 'Parineeti Chopra, Arjun Kapoor, Aditya Seal, Anil Charanjeett, Satish Kaushik, Alankrita Sahai, Ammar Taalwala, Joakim Skarli', null, 'Param and Jasmeet fall in love and they get married. Their perfect romance gets disturbed by Jasmeet’s suppressed ambition however, she has dreams of going to London so that she can pursue her career and build a better life for herself. But Param unable to get a visa and that creates some high drama in their love life.', 'Param and Jasmeet fall in love and they get married. Their perfect romance gets disturbed by Jasmeet’s suppressed ambition however, she has dreams of going to London so that she can pursue her career and build a better life for herself. But Param unable to get a visa and that creates some high drama in their love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePeHuQT0fBdLrOinaAyDBdgd3AO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543692'),
  ('790286255013371609', 'Namaste Wahala', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Hamisha Daryani Ahuja', 'Hamisha Daryani Ahuja', 'Ini Dima-Okojie, Ruslaan Mumtaz, Richard Mofe-Damijo, Joke Silva, Osas Ighodaro, Anee Icha, Sujata Sehgal, Koye Kekere Ekun', null, 'A Nigerian woman and an Indian man won''t let cultural differences get in the way of their romance.', 'A Nigerian woman and an Indian man won''t let cultural differences get in the way of their romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx3p97KAUDaz7PXt9xwlEWn8CZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796649'),
  ('650590765737807243', 'Namastey London', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Vipul Amrutlal Shah', 'Ritesh Shah, Suresh Nair', 'Akshay Kumar, Katrina Kaif, Rishi Kapoor, Clive Standen, Upen Patel, Javed Sheikh, Tiffany Mulheron, Riteish Deshmukh', null, 'On a trip to India, Jasmeet''s father forcefully marries her off to Arjun. However, when they return to London, Jasmeet announces her intention of marrying her boyfriend, Charlie Brown.', 'On a trip to India, Jasmeet''s father forcefully marries her off to Arjun. However, when they return to London, Jasmeet announces her intention of marrying her boyfriend, Charlie Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dO0F66lM1jehIH5bsooKSbdz7xG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20360'),
