  ('127109922752208122', 'Nang Nak', 1999, 'Drama, Romance, Horror', 'Nonzee Nimibutr, Suwimon Techasupinan, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Wisit Sasanatieng', 'Intira Jaroenpura, Winai Kraibutr, Manit Meekaewjaroen, Pramote Suksatit, Pracha Thawongfia, Dome Singmoree', null, 'In a rural village in Thailand, Mak is sent to fight in a war and leaves his pregnant wife, Nak. Mak is injured and barely survives. He returns home to his doting wife and child, or so he thinks.', 'In a rural village in Thailand, Mak is sent to fight in a war and leaves his pregnant wife, Nak. Mak is injured and barely survives. He returns home to his doting wife and child, or so he thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEPxY5GEgo6vUWuJhTpvruhovRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44108'),
  ('92543672538522064', 'Nanga Parbat', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Joseph Vilsmaier, Joseph Vilsmaier, Helmfried Kober', 'Sven Severin, Reinhard Klooss', 'Florian Stetter, Andreas Tobias, Karl Markovics, Volker Bruch, Sebastian Bezzel, Jule Ronstedt, Steffen Schroeder, Michael Kranz', null, 'Drama about the tragic Nanga Parbat expedition by the two Messner brothers in 1970, on which Reinhold Messners younger brother Günther died.', 'Drama about the tragic Nanga Parbat expedition by the two Messner brothers in 1970, on which Reinhold Messners younger brother Günther died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gDuEocmcYBRYtUmEPL7nl34gmz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46636'),
  ('374199152157307266', 'Nanking', 2007, 'Documentary, Drama, History', 'Bill Guttentag, Dan Sturman, John Junkerman', 'Bill Guttentag, Dan Sturman, Elisabeth Bentley', 'Hugo Armstrong, Rosalind Chao, Stephen Dorff, John Getz, Mariel Hemingway, Michelle Krusiec, Chris Mulkey, Woody Harrelson', 'R', 'The story of the rape of Nanking, one of the most tragic events in history. In 1937, the invading Japanese army murdered over 200,000 and raped tens of thousands of Chinese. In the midst of this horror, a small group of Western expatriates banded together to save 250,000. Nanking shows the tremendous impact individuals can make on the course of history.', 'The story of the rape of Nanking, one of the most tragic events in history. In 1937, the invading Japanese army murdered over 200,000 and raped tens of thousands of Chinese. In the midst of this horror, a small group of Western expatriates banded together to save 250,000. Nanking shows the tremendous impact individuals can make on the course of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64Zh7gcfnpcfga3p36fGiEzKAqR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17181'),
  ('455874772869347794', 'Nanny', 2022, 'Horror, Drama', 'Joseph Feld, Nikyatu Jusu, Rina Yang', 'Nikyatu Jusu', 'Anna Diop, Michelle Monaghan, Sinqua Walls, Morgan Spector, Rose Decker, Leslie Uggams, Olamide Candide Johnson, Jahleel Kamara', 'R', 'Aisha, a Senegalese immigrant who takes a job as a nanny for a wealthy white family in New York City, finds herself consumed by unsettling visions and a growing rage.', 'Aisha, a Senegalese immigrant who takes a job as a nanny for a wealthy white family in New York City, finds herself consumed by unsettling visions and a growing rage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPhXHRudGxsXIQq1WM6oVePkFIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843932'),
  ('363966028837839170', 'Nanny Cam', 2014, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nancy Leopardi, Andrew Russo', 'Brian McAuley', 'Laura Allen, India Eisley, Cam Gigandet, Renée Felice Smith, Richard Portnow, Farrah Mackenzie, Carol Herman, Andy Mackenzie', null, 'Linda has a seemingly perfect marriage with her rugged and handsome husband Mark and an adorable 8 year old daughter, Chloe. But when Chloe is injured by an elderly babysitter who has slipped into dementia, Linda wants to ensure that her child is never hurt again. Initially, Heather, the new babysitter, seems like the ideal addition to this practically perfect family. But Heather is a schemer who exploits the cracks in Mark and Linda''s relationship, and delights in the resulting chaos. As Linda later learns, to her horror, Heather''s intentions go far beyond the mischievous.', 'Linda has a seemingly perfect marriage with her rugged and handsome husband Mark and an adorable 8 year old daughter, Chloe. But when Chloe is injured by an elderly babysitter who has slipped into dementia, Linda wants to ensure that her child is never hurt again. Initially, Heather, the new babysitter, seems like the ideal addition to this practically perfect family. But Heather is a schemer who exploits the cracks in Mark and Linda''s relationship, and delights in the resulting chaos. As Linda later learns, to her horror, Heather''s intentions go far beyond the mischievous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hq2dnfrDy8xYBEGN0WItqn4uVWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314996'),
  ('4022677562315722', 'Nanny McPhee', 2005, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Henry Braham, Kirk Jones', 'Emma Thompson', 'Emma Thompson, Colin Firth, Kelly Macdonald, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Eliza Bennett, Jennifer Rae Daykin, Raphaël Coleman, Samuel Honywood', 'PG', 'Widower Cedric Brown hires Nanny McPhee to care for his seven rambunctious children, who have chased away all previous nannies. Taunted by Simon and his siblings, Nanny McPhee uses mystical powers to instill discipline. And when the children''s great-aunt and benefactor, Lady Adelaide Stitch, threatens to separate the kids, the family pulls together under the guidance of Nanny McPhee.', 'Widower Cedric Brown hires Nanny McPhee to care for his seven rambunctious children, who have chased away all previous nannies. Taunted by Simon and his siblings, Nanny McPhee uses mystical powers to instill discipline. And when the children''s great-aunt and benefactor, Lady Adelaide Stitch, threatens to separate the kids, the family pulls together under the guidance of Nanny McPhee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tommndfI0W62teXwSmXdmVZ7gz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11283'),
  ('628459355859254676', 'Nanny McPhee and the Big Bang', 2010, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Susanna White, Mike Eley', 'Emma Thompson', 'Emma Thompson, Asa Butterfield, Lil Woods, Oscar Steer, Rosie Taylor-Ritson, Eros Vlahos, Ralph Fiennes, Maggie Gyllenhaal', 'PG', 'Nanny McPhee appears at the door of a harried young mother who is trying to run the family farm while her husband is away at war. But once she’s arrived, Nanny discovers that the children are fighting a war of their own against two spoiled city cousins who have just moved in. Relying on everything from a flying motorcycle and a statue that comes to life to a tree-climbing piglet and a baby elephant, Nanny uses her magic to teach her mischievous charges five new lessons.', 'Nanny McPhee appears at the door of a harried young mother who is trying to run the family farm while her husband is away at war. But once she’s arrived, Nanny discovers that the children are fighting a war of their own against two spoiled city cousins who have just moved in. Relying on everything from a flying motorcycle and a statue that comes to life to a tree-climbing piglet and a baby elephant, Nanny uses her magic to teach her mischievous charges five new lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cgHfgBXVZmVR63AhwJ82R1kAFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35019'),
  ('199144220561965813', 'Nanook of the North', 1922, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Robert Flaherty, Robert Flaherty', 'Robert Flaherty', 'Allakariallak, Alice Nevalinga, Cunayou, Allegoo, Allee', null, 'This pioneering documentary film depicts the lives of the indigenous Inuit people of Canada''s northern Quebec region. Although the production contains some fictional elements, it vividly shows how its resourceful subjects survive in such a harsh climate, revealing how they construct their igloo homes and find food by hunting and fishing. The film also captures the beautiful, if unforgiving, frozen landscape of the Great White North, far removed from conventional civilization.', 'This pioneering documentary film depicts the lives of the indigenous Inuit people of Canada''s northern Quebec region. Although the production contains some fictional elements, it vividly shows how its resourceful subjects survive in such a harsh climate, revealing how they construct their igloo homes and find food by hunting and fishing. The film also captures the beautiful, if unforgiving, frozen landscape of the Great White North, far removed from conventional civilization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WAboi1QbKu41WkyGxQVNpXwwxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669'),
  ('569893510919990757', 'Nanpakal Nerathu Mayakkam', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Lijo Jose Pellissery, Theni Eashwar', 'S. Hareesh', 'Mammootty, ''Poo'' Ram, Ashokan, Ramya Suvi, Ramya Pandian, Devaki, Rajesh Sharma, T. Suresh Babu', null, 'A group of Malayali travellers, returning to Kerala by bus after their visit to Velankanni, all doze off in a lazy nap after lunch. One of the travelers, James, stops the bus in a village in Tamil Nadu. He starts behaving like a native of the place and speaking in Tamil, confusing his fellow passengers and the villagers alike. He walks amidst faith, delusion, dream and trance, followed by others.', 'A group of Malayali travellers, returning to Kerala by bus after their visit to Velankanni, all doze off in a lazy nap after lunch. One of the travelers, James, stops the bus in a village in Tamil Nadu. He starts behaving like a native of the place and speaking in Tamil, confusing his fellow passengers and the villagers alike. He walks amidst faith, delusion, dream and trance, followed by others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29lETTae7slJPteKkLt6Rdu5g7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876845'),
  ('855096821437335692', 'Nantucket Noel', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Kirsten Hansen, Sean Cox', 'Kirsten Hansen, Alex Wright, Erin Rodman', 'Sarah Power, Trevor Donovan, Payton Lepinski, Daniel Bacon, Fiona Vroom, Candice Hunter, Bruce Dawson, Heather-Claire Nortey', 'G', 'During the Seaside Noel celebrations, Christin learns of a developer who is planning to tear down the wharf that is home to her toy store. Tensions rise as she falls for the developer''s son, Andy.', 'During the Seaside Noel celebrations, Christin learns of a developer who is planning to tear down the wharf that is home to her toy store. Tensions rise as she falls for the developer''s son, Andy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBpmDCdW1UehU1EfjGReth7F6tZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874122'),
  ('774850943300613965', 'Nanu Ki Jaanu', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'S. R. Sathish Kumar, Faraz Haider', 'Manu Rishi Chadha', 'Abhay Deol, Patralekhaa, Brijendra Kala, Rajesh Sharma, Manoj Pahwa, Manu Rishi Chadha, Sapna Choudhary', null, 'Nanu is a land mafia who illegally grabs people''s property with the help of his friends. But his life witnesses a 360-degree change after he takes an injured girl to hospital. Some unusually inexplicable things start happening with him and soon he realizes that he is not the only one living in his flat. There is an uninvited guest also.', 'Nanu is a land mafia who illegally grabs people''s property with the help of his friends. But his life witnesses a 360-degree change after he takes an injured girl to hospital. Some unusually inexplicable things start happening with him and soon he realizes that he is not the only one living in his flat. There is an uninvited guest also.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4NEpiQ8ebXEKui0V1zduz7L7y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515189'),
  ('401185087744511342', 'Não Se Preocupe, Nada Vai Dar Certo!', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Hugo Carvana, Julio Carvana, Lulu Corrêa', 'Paulo Halm', 'Tarcísio Meira, Gregório Duvivier, Flávia Alessandra, Herson Capri, Ângela Vieira, Antonio Pedro, Guilherme Piva, Hugo Carvana', null, 'Lalau (Gregorio Duvivier) is presented by the country''s interior with his show jokes, whose main theme is her father, Ramon Velasco (Tarcisio Meira), an actor who always gets into shenanigans. One day, when present in Ceará, Stan receives a tempting proposal by Flora (Flávia Alessandra), which offers $ 100,000 so he pretends to be a famous guru in a motivational speech in Rio de Janeiro. He accepts and goes to Rio without telling his father. After seeing his son on the cover of a newspaper, Ramon decides to go after him and creates many characters to ensure their part.', 'Lalau (Gregorio Duvivier) is presented by the country''s interior with his show jokes, whose main theme is her father, Ramon Velasco (Tarcisio Meira), an actor who always gets into shenanigans. One day, when present in Ceará, Stan receives a tempting proposal by Flora (Flávia Alessandra), which offers $ 100,000 so he pretends to be a famous guru in a motivational speech in Rio de Janeiro. He accepts and goes to Rio without telling his father. After seeing his son on the cover of a newspaper, Ramon decides to go after him and creates many characters to ensure their part.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AsEpkZpDsnLgZPSQgADZwouKHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78299'),
  ('1072845031457119248', 'Não Vai Ter Golpe!', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Alexandre Santos, Fred Rauh', 'Fred Rauh, Alexandre Santos', 'Kim Kataguiri, Fernando Holiday, Arthur do Val, Renan Santos, Pedro D''Eyrot, Luiz Felipe Pondé, Carlos Andreazza, Alexandre Borges', null, '"People on the street will not end in anything." How many times have you heard this phrase? Even so, at each protest, you took to the streets, invited people, mobilized. Why? What was the strange stubbornness that made you strive without the slightest idea if it would work? This is the story we want to tell. Not only MBL''s history, but yours. You saw, lived and won. And now you can remember how it all started…', '"People on the street will not end in anything." How many times have you heard this phrase? Even so, at each protest, you took to the streets, invited people, mobilized. Why? What was the strange stubbornness that made you strive without the slightest idea if it would work? This is the story we want to tell. Not only MBL''s history, but yours. You saw, lived and won. And now you can remember how it all started…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/872wX6ND9lOGx7mCYGPmOePYZFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618431'),
  ('337435264975345853', 'Não Vamos Pagar Nada', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Leticia Prisco, Julio Constantini, Nayana Gouvea', 'Renato Fagundes', 'Samantha Schmütz, Edmilson Filho, Flávia Reis, Fernando Caruso, Flávio Bauraqui, Leandro Soares, Criolo, Paulinho Serra', null, 'Life is not easy for anyone and the money is getting shorter for Antonia, who is unemployed. But she doesn''t lose her sense of humor even when she gets into a huge mess. Outraged by the increase in prices in the only market in the neighborhood, which on top of that no longer accepts credit, the housewife sets up a scandal and ends up infecting other customers who, like her, have no money to pay the bill.', 'Life is not easy for anyone and the money is getting shorter for Antonia, who is unemployed. But she doesn''t lose her sense of humor even when she gets into a huge mess. Outraged by the increase in prices in the only market in the neighborhood, which on top of that no longer accepts credit, the housewife sets up a scandal and ends up infecting other customers who, like her, have no money to pay the bill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0izXc21pFtf98dwiiudIGmm4lX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:750520'),
  ('632132263808507048', 'Naomi -reverse-', 2024, 'Drama', 'Tadaaki Horai', 'Tadaaki Horai', 'Yuki Mamiya, Yuta Hayashi, Airi Aoki, Momoka Ayukawa, Sakura, Fumio Moriya, Mai Sadagawa, Yuka Masuda', null, 'Naomi is a teacher who lives with a younger man named Yuzuru. On the day they met, she found him sitting by the side of the road, alone. Naomi felt that he resembled a thrown-away cat, and decided that she couldn''t just leave him there. After that, she moved into a bigger house, taught him to study, and spent her meager salary on expenses for the two of them. There was no physical relationship between the two of them. She had simply taken pity on the poor man and given him a home, and now she would watch over him as he began to mature. At least, that was what she''d thought... But even while Yuzuru''s wild ways were a source of frustration to her, she found herself falling for his charms... Sometimes she looks back and wonders what she should''ve done on the day she met him. She wants to open up to someone, but there''s no one to open up to.', 'Naomi is a teacher who lives with a younger man named Yuzuru. On the day they met, she found him sitting by the side of the road, alone. Naomi felt that he resembled a thrown-away cat, and decided that she couldn''t just leave him there. After that, she moved into a bigger house, taught him to study, and spent her meager salary on expenses for the two of them. There was no physical relationship between the two of them. She had simply taken pity on the poor man and given him a home, and now she would watch over him as he began to mature. At least, that was what she''d thought... But even while Yuzuru''s wild ways were a source of frustration to her, she found herself falling for his charms... Sometimes she looks back and wonders what she should''ve done on the day she met him. She wants to open up to someone, but there''s no one to open up to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohaNz7wOLoJ1JdjrQdXETtTWAIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1296778'),
  ('305402631293883724', 'Naomi & Wynonna: Love Can Build a Bridge', 1995, 'Music, Drama, TV Movie', 'Bobby Roth', 'Rama Laurie Stagner', 'Kathleen York, Viveka Davis, Bruce Greenwood, Melinda Dillon, Megan Ward, Cari Shayne, Elisabeth Moss, Dolly Parton', null, 'This is a true story about the relationship between a mother and her daughter, and their struggle to make it to the top in the music world. It is about hopes and dreams... about relationships and about growing up.', 'This is a true story about the relationship between a mother and her daughter, and their struggle to make it to the top in the music world. It is about hopes and dreams... about relationships and about growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YLBzkKDy2nijqw34IwMaYIBwFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:303321'),
  ('89628322292651644', 'Naomi and Ely''s No Kiss List', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kristin Hanggi, Anka Malatynska', 'Amy Andelson, Emily Meyer', 'Victoria Justice, Pierson Fodé, Matthew Daddario, Ryan Ward, Griffin Newman, Monique Coleman, Danny Flaherty, Gary Betsworth', null, 'The bonds between Naomi and Ely are tested when they fall for the same guy.', 'The bonds between Naomi and Ely are tested when they fall for the same guy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8DH0vkVIaJthWowgdkeacmUUs3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306952'),
  ('1035116109931189492', 'Naples in Veils', 2017, 'Thriller', 'Gian Filippo Corticelli, Ferzan Özpetek, Luca Federico', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Gianni Romoli, Valia Santella', 'Giovanna Mezzogiorno, Alessandro Borghi, Anna Bonaiuto, Peppe Barra, Biagio Forestieri, Lina Sastri, Isabella Ferrari, Luisa Ranieri', null, 'In a Naples suspended between magic and superstition, madness and rationality, a mystery envelops the existence of Adriana, overwhelmed by a sudden love and a violent crime.', 'In a Naples suspended between magic and superstition, madness and rationality, a mystery envelops the existence of Adriana, overwhelmed by a sudden love and a violent crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fAHWAowDiG9jxTrPmLGZvadtmR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485894'),
  ('1097728952339480533', 'Naples to New York', 2024, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Pierfrancesco Favino, Dea Lanzaro, Antonio Guerra, Anna Ammirati, Anna Lucia Pierro, Omar Benson Miller, Tomas Arana, Antonio Catania', null, 'In the immediate post-war period, amidst the rubble of a poverty-ridden Naples, two kids, Carmine and Celestina, try to survive as best they can by helping each other out. One night, they secretly board a ship bound for New York to reach Celestina’s sister, who emigrated to America several years earlier. The two children join the many Italian emigrants seeking a new life in America and arrive in an unknown metropolis, which, after several misadventures, they will learn to call home.', 'In the immediate post-war period, amidst the rubble of a poverty-ridden Naples, two kids, Carmine and Celestina, try to survive as best they can by helping each other out. One night, they secretly board a ship bound for New York to reach Celestina’s sister, who emigrated to America several years earlier. The two children join the many Italian emigrants seeking a new life in America and arrive in an unknown metropolis, which, after several misadventures, they will learn to call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1e4WBvQ2eM2S94SNpev0P5PG2Ge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112637'),
  ('781962427086461511', 'Napo', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Renan Dos Passos, Bruna Bastos, Gustavo Ribeiro', 'Gabriela Antonia Rosa, Gustavo Ribeiro', null, null, 'John, unable to understand the illness that drives his grandfather between past and present states, stumbles into an old album full of photographs. The images guide his imagination, transforming his grandfather’s memories into drawings that shape their relationship into a history of memory-building and remembrance.', 'John, unable to understand the illness that drives his grandfather between past and present states, stumbles into an old album full of photographs. The images guide his imagination, transforming his grandfather’s memories into drawings that shape their relationship into a history of memory-building and remembrance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqL2SPLZ126ouvHe3iaynVObmLy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:749958'),
  ('1062585815806903987', 'Napoleon', 1927, 'Drama, History, War', 'Abel Gance, Viktor Tourjansky, Pierre Danis', 'Abel Gance', 'Albert Dieudonné, Nicolas Roudenko, Edmond van Daële, Alexandre Koubitzky, Antonin Artaud, Abel Gance, Gina Manès, Nicolas Koline', null, 'A biopic of Napoleon Bonaparte, tracing the Corsican''s career from his schooldays (where a snowball fight is staged like a military campaign) to his flight from Corsica, through the French Revolution (where a real storm is intercut with a political storm) and the Terror, culminating in his triumphant invasion of Italy in 1797.', 'A biopic of Napoleon Bonaparte, tracing the Corsican''s career from his schooldays (where a snowball fight is staged like a military campaign) to his flight from Corsica, through the French Revolution (where a real storm is intercut with a political storm) and the Terror, culminating in his triumphant invasion of Italy in 1797.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGupJ1ZO07BWco8YGjBHk90hYWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42536'),
  ('302807687572834812', 'Napoleon', 1955, 'Drama, History, War', 'Pierre Montazel, Sacha Guitry', 'Sacha Guitry', 'Daniel Gélin, Michèle Morgan, Raymond Pellegrin, Sacha Guitry, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Jeanne Boitel, Gilbert Bokanowski, Pierre Brasseur', null, 'The film follows the life of Napoleon from his early life in Corsica to his death at Saint Helena. The film is notable for its use of location shooting for numerous scenes, especially at the French estates of Malmaison and Fontainebleau, the Palace of Versailles, and sites of Napoleonic battles including Austerlitz and Waterloo.', 'The film follows the life of Napoleon from his early life in Corsica to his death at Saint Helena. The film is notable for its use of location shooting for numerous scenes, especially at the French estates of Malmaison and Fontainebleau, the Palace of Versailles, and sites of Napoleonic battles including Austerlitz and Waterloo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frKF1ZFc7KUf0NyUSAtNy2uSXPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43320'),
  ('1084223637415622633', 'Napoleon', 1995, 'Adventure, Family', 'Mario Andreacchio, Roger Dowling, Kieran Weir', 'Mario Andreacchio, Michael Bourchier, Mark Saltzman', 'Jamie Croft, Philip Quast, Carole Skinner, Susan Lyons, Blythe Danner, Coralie Sawade, Catherine Lambert, Brenton Whittle', 'G', 'The adventures of Golden Retriever pup Napoleon and his friend, the parrot Birdo Lucci.', 'The adventures of Golden Retriever pup Napoleon and his friend, the parrot Birdo Lucci.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3wcjhGgC9usb8MhrKNeVjIr1Lz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44381'),
  ('236495181947148074', 'Napoleon', 2023, 'History, War, Romance', 'Dariusz Wolski, Denis Schnegg, Raymond Kirk', 'David Scarpa', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Vanessa Kirby, Tahar Rahim, Rupert Everett, Mark Bonnar, Paul Rhys, Ben Miles, Riana Duce', 'R', 'An epic that details the checkered rise and fall of French Emperor Napoleon Bonaparte and his relentless journey to power through the prism of his addictive, volatile relationship with his wife, Josephine.', 'An epic that details the checkered rise and fall of French Emperor Napoleon Bonaparte and his relentless journey to power through the prism of his addictive, volatile relationship with his wife, Josephine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytFOXyghxLzAM4KZyazDdEkM66q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:753342'),
  ('246583477139038252', 'Napoleon and Me', 2006, 'Comedy, History', 'Paolo Virzì, Gianluca Greco, Henrique Laplaine', 'Paolo Virzì, Furio Scarpelli, Giacomo Scarpelli', 'Daniel Auteuil, Elio Germano, Monica Bellucci, Francesca Inaudi, Sabrina Impacciatore, Valerio Mastandrea, Massimo Ceccherini, Omero Antonutti', null, 'Elba island, 1814. Martino is a young teacher, idealist and strongly anti Napoleon, in love with the beautiful and noble Baroness Emily. The young man finds himself serving as librarian to the Great Emperor in exile, whom he deeply hates, yet soon begins recording Napoleon''s memoirs, getting to know and learning to value the man behind the myth. Among seductions and affairs, expectations and fears, he will craft a precise portrait that nevertheless will not manage to hide a final, inevitable, disappointment.', 'Elba island, 1814. Martino is a young teacher, idealist and strongly anti Napoleon, in love with the beautiful and noble Baroness Emily. The young man finds himself serving as librarian to the Great Emperor in exile, whom he deeply hates, yet soon begins recording Napoleon''s memoirs, getting to know and learning to value the man behind the myth. Among seductions and affairs, expectations and fears, he will craft a precise portrait that nevertheless will not manage to hide a final, inevitable, disappointment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xPVy5Jp7Lwc9RSnYGlJHM2EoggK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24180'),
  ('1042323228367913214', 'Napoleon and Samantha', 1972, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Bernard McEveety, Monroe P. Askins', 'Stewart Raffill', 'Michael Douglas, Jodie Foster, Johnny Whitaker, Will Geer, Henry Jones, Vito Scotti, Ellen Corby, Mary Wickes', 'G', 'Two young children, who, rather than part with an old pet lion who was once a circus performer, go on a perilous mountain trek to stay with a recluse friend.', 'Two young children, who, rather than part with an old pet lion who was once a circus performer, go on a perilous mountain trek to stay with a recluse friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOjTiTeNYPQzUdRiBkQMUB1iRwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42486'),
