  ('817321717390908083', 'Napoleon Dynamite', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Munn Powell, Jared Hess, Isabel Farah', 'Jared Hess, Jerusha Hess', 'Jon Heder, Efren Ramirez, Tina Majorino, Aaron Ruell, Jon Gries, Haylie Duff, Emily Kennard Dunn, Shondrella Avery', 'PG', 'A listless and alienated teenager decides to help his new friend win the class presidency in their small western high school, while he must deal with his bizarre family life back home.', 'A listless and alienated teenager decides to help his new friend win the class presidency in their small western high school, while he must deal with his bizarre family life back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Iv6Uwa2SBLN0dSGM00rdrwN4MJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8193'),
  ('122817752571704440', 'Napoli milionaria', 1962, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Eduardo De Filippo', 'Eduardo De Filippo', 'Antonio Casagrande, Eduardo De Filippo, Carlo Lima, Regina Bianchi, Angela Pagano', null, 'In Naples, during World War II, Amalia Jovine, in order to survive, smuggles food and coffee in her crowded and dilapidated basement, in partnership with Settebellizze. Her husband Gennaro disapproves, but does not prevent Amalia from continuing her trafficking...', 'In Naples, during World War II, Amalia Jovine, in order to survive, smuggles food and coffee in her crowded and dilapidated basement, in partnership with Settebellizze. Her husband Gennaro disapproves, but does not prevent Amalia from continuing her trafficking...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRLXPscsmmciSa6OqYPlOPNcWHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356009'),
  ('870412555177947694', 'Napoli milionaria!', 2023, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Luca Miniero', 'Eduardo De Filippo', 'Massimiliano Gallo, Vanessa Scalera, Al Fenderico, Andrea Solimena, Michele Venitucci, Vincenzo Nemolato, Nunzia Schiano, Toni Laudadio', null, 'Naples, 1942. To feed her family and respond to her husband Gennaro''s inertia, Amalia is forced to enter the black market. To save his wife from prison, the man fakes his own death.', 'Naples, 1942. To feed her family and respond to her husband Gennaro''s inertia, Amalia is forced to enter the black market. To save his wife from prison, the man fakes his own death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF7UQ5RqFvSBd9stc0gOXlIkzD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1216937'),
  ('749652362531457488', 'Nappily Ever After', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Alar Kivilo, Haifaa al-Mansour', 'Gina Prince-Bythewood', 'Sanaa Lathan, Ricky Whittle, Ernie Hudson, Camille Guaty, Lyriq Bent, Lynn Whitfield, Catherine Dyer, Brittany S. Hall', null, 'After an accident at the hair salon, Violet realizes she''s not living life to the fullest. A soulful barber helps her put the pieces back together.', 'After an accident at the hair salon, Violet realizes she''s not living life to the fullest. A soulful barber helps her put the pieces back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxXsGqxUwSxypffv8hn3r332jf4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519035'),
  ('705528678069588436', 'Napping Princess', 2017, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Koji Tanaka, Kazuchika Kise, Motonobu Hori', 'Kenji Kamiyama', 'Mitsuki Takahata, Yosuke Eguchi, Shinnosuke Mitsushima, Rie Kugimiya, Tomoya Maeno, Wataru Takagi, Hideki Takahashi, Arata Furuta', null, 'Japan, 2020, a few days before the opening of the Tokyo Olympics. Although she should be studying for her final exams, Kokone, a schoolgirl who lives in a small town with her widowed father, a mysterious and talented mechanic, falls asleep often, anywhere, anytime, entering, over and over, a dream-world where a squad of fantastic motorized contraptions fights against magic, a world close to reality where she will find out the keys of her true past.', 'Japan, 2020, a few days before the opening of the Tokyo Olympics. Although she should be studying for her final exams, Kokone, a schoolgirl who lives in a small town with her widowed father, a mysterious and talented mechanic, falls asleep often, anywhere, anytime, entering, over and over, a dream-world where a squad of fantastic motorized contraptions fights against magic, a world close to reality where she will find out the keys of her true past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9d27l5z9B2zyqoEtKkieBcbclMG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428288'),
  ('157732477878666897', 'Naqaab', 2007, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla, Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla', null, 'Akshaye Khanna, Bobby Deol, Urvashi Sharma, Archana Puran Singh', null, 'The story revolves around the life of Sophia (Urvashi Sharma) who lives in Goa. When she is stalked and then attacked by a rapist named Rakesh, Sophia re-locates to Dubai. Here she rents a room in a villa near Jumeirah Beach, owned by wealthy star Karan Oberoi (Bobby Deol). Six months later he proposes to her, and she accepts. Shortly before the marriage, she meets with an unemployed actor, Vicky Malhotra (Akshay Khanna), and is attracted to him, but decides to go ahead and marry Karan. At the altar, she changes her mind, ditches him and decides to move in with Vicky. But things take a turn for the worse.', 'The story revolves around the life of Sophia (Urvashi Sharma) who lives in Goa. When she is stalked and then attacked by a rapist named Rakesh, Sophia re-locates to Dubai. Here she rents a room in a villa near Jumeirah Beach, owned by wealthy star Karan Oberoi (Bobby Deol). Six months later he proposes to her, and she accepts. Shortly before the marriage, she meets with an unemployed actor, Vicky Malhotra (Akshay Khanna), and is attracted to him, but decides to go ahead and marry Karan. At the altar, she changes her mind, ditches him and decides to move in with Vicky. But things take a turn for the worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yb9pluBcX7xK1yPOKtpLgGCTg7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277608'),
  ('879736637689788204', 'Naqoyqatsi', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Godfrey Reggio, Jon Kane, Russell Lee Fine', null, 'Marlon Brando, Elton John, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Madonna, Adolf Hitler, Bill Clinton, Fidel Castro, Martin Luther King Jr.', 'PG', 'A visual montage portrait of our contemporary world dominated by globalized technology and violence.', 'A visual montage portrait of our contemporary world dominated by globalized technology and violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buDo6FcSlOVEQJomKB0IviNV0Do.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21925'),
  ('392546333181891010', 'Naram Garam', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hrishikesh Mukherjee, Jaywant Pathare', 'Shanu Bannerjee, D.N. Mukherjee', 'Amol Palekar, Swaroop Sampat, Utpal Dutt, Shatrughan Sinha, Kiran Vairale, Javed Khan, Anand, Padma Chauhan', null, 'An impoverished employee tries to prevent his superiors and employers from marrying his sweetheart.', 'An impoverished employee tries to prevent his superiors and employers from marrying his sweetheart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoBt6cziVCnf35hijHhMgO2qnes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84693'),
  ('460015966294142291', 'Naran', 2005, 'Action, Drama', 'Joshiy, Shaji Kumar', 'Ranjan Pramod', 'Mohanlal, Madhu, Siddique, Jagathy Sreekumar, Innocent, Bhavana, Devayani, Mamukkoya', null, 'Velayudhan, an orphan, is loved by the people in his village, as he keeps it free from unsavoury people and practices. But the local moneylender and politician get jealous and try to get rid of him.', 'Velayudhan, an orphan, is loved by the people in his village, as he keeps it free from unsavoury people and practices. But the local moneylender and politician get jealous and try to get rid of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qW2lHQDelSLMbQO69DBsedIvyGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151639'),
  ('609362864740517773', 'Narasimham', 2000, 'Action, Family, Thriller', 'Shaji Kailas, Sanjeev Shankar', 'Ranjith', 'Mohanlal, Thilakan, N F Varghese, Jagathy Sreekumar, Kanaka, Mammootty, Kalabhavan Mani, Maniyanpilla Raju', null, 'Poovalli Induchoodan (Mohanlal) is sentenced for six years prison life for murdering his classmate. Induchoodan, the only son of Justice Maranchery Karunakara Menon (Thilakan) was framed in the case by Manapally Madhavan Nambiar (Narayanan Nair) and his crony DYSP Sankaranarayanan (Bheeman Raghu) to take revenge on idealist judge Menon who had earlier given jail sentence to Manapally in a corruption case. The story begins with Induchoodan released and his father & mother coming to stay with him.', 'Poovalli Induchoodan (Mohanlal) is sentenced for six years prison life for murdering his classmate. Induchoodan, the only son of Justice Maranchery Karunakara Menon (Thilakan) was framed in the case by Manapally Madhavan Nambiar (Narayanan Nair) and his crony DYSP Sankaranarayanan (Bheeman Raghu) to take revenge on idealist judge Menon who had earlier given jail sentence to Manapally in a corruption case. The story begins with Induchoodan released and his father & mother coming to stay with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmMjbV5sc2p4ttKWGyBACqTZwwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193932'),
  ('121420118016104825', 'Narc', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Alex Nepomniaschy, Joe Carnahan', 'Joe Carnahan', 'Jason Patric, Ray Liotta, Chi McBride, Krista Bridges, John Ortiz, Busta Rhymes, Richard Chevolleau, Alan van Sprang', 'R', 'Narcotics Sergeant Nick Tellis, on leave after a trauma, is called back to investigate the murder of fellow undercover operative Michael Calvess, joined by the victim''s unpredictable and brutal ex-partner, Henry Oak. Working together in the back alleys of Detroit, Tellis and Oak delve into a dark investigation that leads them to uncover shocking secrets and question the corruption and morality within the department, encountering unorthodox methods and a brutal truth about Calvess''s death.', 'Narcotics Sergeant Nick Tellis, on leave after a trauma, is called back to investigate the murder of fellow undercover operative Michael Calvess, joined by the victim''s unpredictable and brutal ex-partner, Henry Oak. Working together in the back alleys of Detroit, Tellis and Oak delve into a dark investigation that leads them to uncover shocking secrets and question the corruption and morality within the department, encountering unorthodox methods and a brutal truth about Calvess''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uGHFyVdMQKvIXlsLAoXa5nOUGF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11022'),
  ('1134665519019651853', 'Narcissus', 1983, null, 'Norman McLaren, David De Volpi, Donald McWilliams', null, 'Jean-Louis Morin, Sylvie Kinal, Sylvain Lafortune', null, 'In this short film by Norman McLaren, dancers enact the Greek tragedy of Narcissus, the beautiful youth whose excessive self-love condemned him to a trapped existence. Skilfully merging film, dance and music, the film is a compendium of the techniques McLaren acquired over a lifetime of experimentation.', 'In this short film by Norman McLaren, dancers enact the Greek tragedy of Narcissus, the beautiful youth whose excessive self-love condemned him to a trapped existence. Skilfully merging film, dance and music, the film is a compendium of the techniques McLaren acquired over a lifetime of experimentation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnzzCc0KBqfUZfhCfqdAgBqsy3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257563'),
  ('411770576404011246', 'Narcissus and Goldmund', 2020, 'Drama', 'Benedict Neuenfels, Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Robert Gold, Stefan Ruzowitzky', 'Sabin Tambrea, Jannis Niewöhner, Emilia Schüle, Uwe Ochsenknecht, Jessica Schwarz, Roxane Duran, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Sunnyi Melles', null, 'In the dark middle ages, young unruly Goldmund is sent to a monastery by his father to atone for the sins of his mother, who abandoned them. There, he meets Narcissus, a brilliant, scholarly novice who is introverted and aloof. A unique and deep life-long friendship is born. Narcissus chooses to remain detached from the world in prayer and meditation. Goldmund, passionate, sensual and impulsive, runs away from the monastery to live a picaresque wanderer’s life, his amorous and artistic adventures leading him to discover the extremes of both ecstasy and pain. Several thrilling years pass until one day these friends cross paths again...', 'In the dark middle ages, young unruly Goldmund is sent to a monastery by his father to atone for the sins of his mother, who abandoned them. There, he meets Narcissus, a brilliant, scholarly novice who is introverted and aloof. A unique and deep life-long friendship is born. Narcissus chooses to remain detached from the world in prayer and meditation. Goldmund, passionate, sensual and impulsive, runs away from the monastery to live a picaresque wanderer’s life, his amorous and artistic adventures leading him to discover the extremes of both ecstasy and pain. Several thrilling years pass until one day these friends cross paths again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPQjMwhoHDdKfbGNOb4ilMWm6l2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644852'),
  ('487344950148611664', 'Narcissus and Psyche', 1980, 'Drama', 'Gábor Bódy, István Hildebrand', 'Sándor Weöres', 'Patricia Adriani, Udo Kier, György Cserhalmi, Ágnes Horváth, Éva Tóth, Dénes Ujlaki, János Derzsi, János Pilinszky', null, 'Narcisus and Psyche is based on a novel by Sandor Weores which was adapted by Vilmos Csaplar and director Gabor Body for a feature-length film. Borrowing the character of Psyche from mythology and placing her in Europe in the 19th century, the authors give her a "modern" life. She is an attractive young woman - and remains so throughout the film, in spite of one hardship after another. Psyche is libidinous, and her prurient interests shock her staid contemporaries.', 'Narcisus and Psyche is based on a novel by Sandor Weores which was adapted by Vilmos Csaplar and director Gabor Body for a feature-length film. Borrowing the character of Psyche from mythology and placing her in Europe in the 19th century, the authors give her a "modern" life. She is an attractive young woman - and remains so throughout the film, in spite of one hardship after another. Psyche is libidinous, and her prurient interests shock her staid contemporaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VWJj2Kimrpyi8XLubYggybglDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8778'),
  ('943569943652475983', 'Narco', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Gilles Lellouche, Tristan Aurouet', 'Gilles Lellouche', 'Guillaume Canet, Zabou Breitman, Guillaume Gallienne, François Berléand, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Vincent Rottiers, Léa Drucker, Gilles Lellouche', null, 'Gustave Klopp suffers from narcolepsy, he can fall asleep everwhere at anytime whithout warning. Living a simple life with his wife Pam and his best friend Lenny Bar, Gus decides to undergo therapy sessions and finds out that he can make incredible comics from his dreams.', 'Gustave Klopp suffers from narcolepsy, he can fall asleep everwhere at anytime whithout warning. Living a simple life with his wife Pam and his best friend Lenny Bar, Gus decides to undergo therapy sessions and finds out that he can make incredible comics from his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4Ea1P4Ig5B48hZl9owRshUepVs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20200'),
  ('794336825907023908', 'Narco Cultura', 2013, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Shaul Schwarz, Shaul Schwarz', 'Shaul Schwarz', null, 'R', 'To a growing number of Mexicans and Latinos in the Americas, narco-traffickers have become iconic outlaws and the new models of fame and success. They represent a pathway out of the ghetto, nurturing a new American dream fueled by the war on drugs. Narco Cultura looks at this explosive phenomenon from within, exposing cycles of addiction to money, drugs, and violence that are rapidly gaining strength on both sides of the U.S.-Mexico border', 'To a growing number of Mexicans and Latinos in the Americas, narco-traffickers have become iconic outlaws and the new models of fame and success. They represent a pathway out of the ghetto, nurturing a new American dream fueled by the war on drugs. Narco Cultura looks at this explosive phenomenon from within, exposing cycles of addiction to money, drugs, and violence that are rapidly gaining strength on both sides of the U.S.-Mexico border', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEnzEThFH7hdh2l88IdkPz62NOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159012'),
  ('312387143203765797', 'Narcopolis', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'James Watson, Justin Trefgarne, Christopher Moon', 'Justin Trefgarne', 'Elliot Cowan, Élodie Yung, Jonathan Pryce, Robert Bathurst, James Callis, Cosima Shaw, Molly Gaisford, Gethin Anthony', null, 'In the near future, Frank, a police officer, discovers that the legalization of all recreational drugs comes with a price.', 'In the near future, Frank, a police officer, discovers that the legalization of all recreational drugs comes with a price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puxZMIhfaIzRqBzu0J64soz5ewv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301228'),
  ('691584694356446493', 'Narcos', 1992, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Ferrara, Tiziana Gagnor', 'Armenia Balducci, Giuseppe Ferrara', 'Juan José Pinero, José Maldonado, Cristobal Cornes, Adriana Sforza, Aldo Sambrell', null, 'Three drug traffickers become worried when the realize they may have outlived their usefulness to their boss.', 'Three drug traffickers become worried when the realize they may have outlived their usefulness to their boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZenUR45Ka0uO7c92t9P3DQTvuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341087'),
  ('560712967570816058', 'Narcotic', 1933, 'Crime', 'Dwain Esper, Vival Sodar''t', 'Hildegarde Stadie', 'Harry Cording, Joan Dix, Patricia Farley, Jean Lacy, J. Stuart Blackton Jr., Paul Panzer, Miami Alvarez, Charles Bennett', null, 'A once-promising doctor begins a downward spiral, finding himself in opium dens, a carnival freak show, and drugs parties.', 'A once-promising doctor begins a downward spiral, finding himself in opium dens, a carnival freak show, and drugs parties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3yJFP0e16Bk2JWx1O8QEuPFuT6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91730'),
