  ('707130944977077283', 'Naruto OVA 3: Hidden Leaf Village Grand Sports Festival!', 2004, 'Action, Animation, Comedy', 'Yasunori Ebina, Hayato Date', 'Akatsuki Yamatoya', 'Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Chie Nakamura, Showtaro Morikubo, Nana Mizuki', null, 'The genin of Konoha are having a sports day filled with races, obstacle courses and of course the relay and the prize is a paid vacation for the winner. Unfortunately Naruto and his stomach are getting him into trouble again.', 'The genin of Konoha are having a sports day filled with races, obstacle courses and of course the relay and the prize is a paid vacation for the winner. Unfortunately Naruto and his stomach are getting him into trouble again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iltYXp5YaCNnmuVor4GjRN3o2f3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619432'),
  ('139459943730095431', 'Naruto OVA 6: The Cross Roads', 2009, 'Animation, Action', 'Yuzo Sato', 'Yuka Miyata', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Noriaki Sugiyama, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kujira, Nobutoshi Canna, Takehito Koyasu', null, 'Naruto: The Cross Roads (Za Kurosurozu) is the sixth Naruto OVA. It uses the same CGI graphics as Naruto: Ultimate Ninja Storm and was released during Naruto: Shippuden. This OVA premiered at the Jump Festa Anime Tour 2009. Between the Prologue - Land of Waves and Chunin Exams arcs, Team 7 is waiting for Kakashi, who is late again, to start a new mission (B-ranked as Sasuke states). The team sets off while Kakashi explains that Genmai from the Inaho Village is missing, who has vanished in the hills.', 'Naruto: The Cross Roads (Za Kurosurozu) is the sixth Naruto OVA. It uses the same CGI graphics as Naruto: Ultimate Ninja Storm and was released during Naruto: Shippuden. This OVA premiered at the Jump Festa Anime Tour 2009. Between the Prologue - Land of Waves and Chunin Exams arcs, Team 7 is waiting for Kakashi, who is late again, to start a new mission (B-ranked as Sasuke states). The team sets off while Kakashi explains that Genmai from the Inaho Village is missing, who has vanished in the hills.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKAMgd2DXDlBrpTlvKqRSk15Api.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:699249'),
  ('1048989900263385823', 'Naruto OVA 7: Naruto, the Genie, and the Three Wishes, Believe It!', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Takashi Ikehata', null, 'Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Chie Nakamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Showtaro Morikubo, Nana Mizuki, Yōichi Masukawa, Koichi Tochika', null, 'Naruto discovers a genie''s bottle while he and the gang are at a genin grill party. When everyone finds out about the genie''s ability to grant wishes, the ultimate chase begins.', 'Naruto discovers a genie''s bottle while he and the gang are at a genin grill party. When everyone finds out about the genie''s ability to grant wishes, the ultimate chase begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrtdE8Uqx39Pq9d24e9Geq1mzuy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609197'),
  ('145615728053887526', 'Naruto OVA 8: Naruto x UT', 2011, 'Animation', 'Toshiyuki Tsuru', null, null, null, 'Naruto x UT is the eighth Naruto OVA. Approximately 200,000 copies of this OVA were distributed by Uniqlo to promote a line of Naruto-themed shirts designed by Masashi Kishimoto in conjunction with Studio Pierrot. It shows the aftermath between a fight between Naruto and Sasuke and shows clips of their times together and the story so far.', 'Naruto x UT is the eighth Naruto OVA. Approximately 200,000 copies of this OVA were distributed by Uniqlo to promote a line of Naruto-themed shirts designed by Masashi Kishimoto in conjunction with Studio Pierrot. It shows the aftermath between a fight between Naruto and Sasuke and shows clips of their times together and the story so far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQ0jGjzJBGIobDcWXxbB3EsVR5J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698940'),
  ('126223072228985100', 'Naruto OVA 9: Chunin Exam on Fire! and Naruto vs. Konohamaru!', 2011, 'Animation, Action', 'Hayato Date', 'Masashi Kishimoto', 'Junko Takeuchi, Ikue Otani, Kazuhiko Inoue, Akira Ishida, Showtaro Morikubo, Chie Nakamura, Romi Park, Yasuyuki Kase', null, 'Naruto faces off against his old pupil Konohamaru in a tournament during the chuunin entrance exams.', 'Naruto faces off against his old pupil Konohamaru in a tournament during the chuunin entrance exams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imvclUHRdAte5RUZQl3FLXK0zIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189349'),
  ('1032508514013031045', 'Naruto Shippuden the Movie', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Hajime Kamegaki, Yasunori Ebina, Mamoru Sasaki', 'Junki Takegami', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Yōichi Masukawa, Koichi Tochika, Ayumi Fujimura, Keisuke Oda, Daisuke Kishio, Fumiko Orikasa', 'PG-13', 'Demons that once almost destroyed the world, are revived by someone. To prevent the world from being destroyed, the demon has to be sealed and the only one who can do it is the shrine maiden Shion from the country of demons, who has two powers; one is sealing demons and the other is predicting the deaths of humans. This time Naruto''s mission is to guard Shion, but she predicts Naruto''s death. The only way to escape it, is to get away from Shion, which would leave her unguarded, then the demon, whose only goal is to kill Shion will do so, thus meaning the end of the world. Naruto decides to challenge this "prediction of death."', 'Demons that once almost destroyed the world, are revived by someone. To prevent the world from being destroyed, the demon has to be sealed and the only one who can do it is the shrine maiden Shion from the country of demons, who has two powers; one is sealing demons and the other is predicting the deaths of humans. This time Naruto''s mission is to guard Shion, but she predicts Naruto''s death. The only way to escape it, is to get away from Shion, which would leave her unguarded, then the demon, whose only goal is to kill Shion will do so, thus meaning the end of the world. Naruto decides to challenge this "prediction of death."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDkct38sSFSWJIATlfJw0l3QOIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20982'),
  ('543817383678489228', 'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: Blood Prison', 2011, 'Thriller, Animation, Action, Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Koji Yabuno, Yasuhiko Kanezuka, Yasuhiko Kanezuka', 'Akira Higashiyama', 'Junko Takeuchi, Mie Sonozaki, Masaki Terasoma, Chie Nakamura, Rikiya Koyama, Kazuhiko Inoue, Yuichi Nakamura, Kengo Kawanishi', 'PG-13', 'After his capture for attempted assassination of the Raikage, leader of Kumogakure, as well as killing Jōnin from Kirigakure and Iwagakure, Naruto is imprisoned in Hōzukijou: A criminal containment facility known as the Blood Prison. Mui, the castle master, uses the ultimate imprisonment technique to steal power from the prisoners, which is when Naruto notices his life has been targeted. Thus begins the battle to uncover the truth behind the mysterious murders and prove Naruto''s innocence.', 'After his capture for attempted assassination of the Raikage, leader of Kumogakure, as well as killing Jōnin from Kirigakure and Iwagakure, Naruto is imprisoned in Hōzukijou: A criminal containment facility known as the Blood Prison. Mui, the castle master, uses the ultimate imprisonment technique to steal power from the prisoners, which is when Naruto notices his life has been targeted. Thus begins the battle to uncover the truth behind the mysterious murders and prove Naruto''s innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WT7zYFpe0fsbg6TitppiHddWAh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75624'),
  ('242853017635526275', 'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: Bonds', 2008, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action', 'Mamoru Sasaki, Hirofumi Masuda, Hirofumi Suzuki', 'Masahiro Hikokubo', 'Junko Takeuchi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Chie Nakamura, Unsho Ishizuka, Motoko Kumai, Kazuhiko Inoue, Rikiya Koyama, Showtaro Morikubo', 'PG-13', 'A mysterious group of ninjas makes a surprise attack on the Konohagakure, which takes great damage. The nightmare of another Shinobi World War could become a reality. Sasuke, who was still a missing nin from Konoha trying to kill his brother, Itachi, appears for the second time in front of Naruto at an unknown location to prevent it from happening.', 'A mysterious group of ninjas makes a surprise attack on the Konohagakure, which takes great damage. The nightmare of another Shinobi World War could become a reality. Sasuke, who was still a missing nin from Konoha trying to kill his brother, Itachi, appears for the second time in front of Naruto at an unknown location to prevent it from happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBqEiQbbfyt4MWR3NhDZMbS4Wp8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17581'),
  ('1054215601010394400', 'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Lost Tower', 2010, 'Adventure, Action, Animation', 'Masahiko Murata, Kumiko Horikoshi, Yasuhiko Kanezuka', 'Junki Takegami', 'Junko Takeuchi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Chie Nakamura, Satoshi Hino, Rikiya Koyama, Nobuaki Fukuda, Kenji Hamada', 'PG-13', 'Assigned on a mission to capture Mukade, a missing-nin, Naruto Uzumaki sets out for the once glorious historic ruins of "Ouran", where he pursues and corners the rouge ninja. Mukade''s goal is revealed to be a dormant leyline within the ruins; he unleashes the power of the leyline, causing a light to envelop Naruto, sending him into the past, 20 years before the series began. When Naruto awakens, he comes into contact with the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze.', 'Assigned on a mission to capture Mukade, a missing-nin, Naruto Uzumaki sets out for the once glorious historic ruins of "Ouran", where he pursues and corners the rouge ninja. Mukade''s goal is revealed to be a dormant leyline within the ruins; he unleashes the power of the leyline, causing a light to envelop Naruto, sending him into the past, 20 years before the series began. When Naruto awakens, he comes into contact with the Fourth Hokage, Minato Namikaze.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6e2YvN1tQK4xQHlmy7GJTuXOt2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50723'),
  ('596059377099657410', 'Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Will of Fire', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Animation', 'Masahiko Murata, Chikara Sakurai, Hirofumi Suzuki', 'Junki Takegami', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Kazuhiko Inoue, Romi Park, Satoshi Hino, Showtaro Morikubo, Kentaro Ito, Ryoka Yuzuki', 'PG-13', 'Ninjas with bloodline limits begin disappearing in all the countries and blame points toward the fire nation. By Tsunade''s order, Kakashi is sacrificed to prevent an all out war. After inheriting charms left by Kakashi, Naruto fights through friends and foes to prevent his death while changing the minds of those who''ve inherited the will of fire.', 'Ninjas with bloodline limits begin disappearing in all the countries and blame points toward the fire nation. By Tsunade''s order, Kakashi is sacrificed to prevent an all out war. After inheriting charms left by Kakashi, Naruto fights through friends and foes to prevent his death while changing the minds of those who''ve inherited the will of fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZzdFmztwmg0FUOVCMa7vReHhQN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36728'),
  ('399896009241027274', 'Naruto Shippuden: Dreamers Fight', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Christopher C. Cowan, Christopher C. Cowan, Haile Lee', null, 'Donald Mills, Brendon Huor, James Young, Haile Lee', null, 'The story takes place after the Pain saga, with Naruto becoming the acknowledged village hero he''s always sought out to be.', 'The story takes place after the Pain saga, with Naruto becoming the acknowledged village hero he''s always sought out to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6K56NNy1dmvBXPbC3Lue3siQnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1222742'),
  ('323885707281666684', 'Naruto the Movie: Guardians of the Crescent Moon Kingdom', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Action', 'Toshiyuki Tsuru, Chikara Sakurai, XinHong Wu', 'Toshiyuki Tsuru', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Yōichi Masukawa, Kazuhiko Inoue, Akio Otsuka, Kyousuke Ikeda, Rokuro Naya, Marika Hayashi', 'PG-13', 'Naruto Uzumaki, Kakashi Hatake, Sakura Haruno, and Rock Lee are assigned to protect the prince of the Land of the Moon, Michiru, during his world trip; other escorts had been hired, but quit due to being treated poorly. The Land of the Moon is a very wealthy nation, so Michiru tends to buy whatever he wants, and has a very materialistic worldview. His Hikaru, also acts in much the same manner.', 'Naruto Uzumaki, Kakashi Hatake, Sakura Haruno, and Rock Lee are assigned to protect the prince of the Land of the Moon, Michiru, during his world trip; other escorts had been hired, but quit due to being treated poorly. The Land of the Moon is a very wealthy nation, so Michiru tends to buy whatever he wants, and has a very materialistic worldview. His Hikaru, also acts in much the same manner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mmKiJ93x6uhTwJlrxCoY38R4qo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18861'),
  ('1117912919447993939', 'Naruto the Movie: Legend of the Stone of Gelel', 2005, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Tetsuya Nishio, Tatsuya Tomaru, Yasunori Ebina', 'Hirotsugu Kawasaki, Yuka Miyata', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Gaamon Kai, Akira Ishida, Showtaro Morikubo, Takako Honda, Yasuyuki Kase, Sachiko Kojima', 'PG-13', 'Naruto, Shikamaru, and Sakura are executing their mission of delivering a lost pet to a certain village. However, right in the midst of things, troops led by the mysterious knight, Temujin, attack them. In the violent battle, the three become separated. Temujin challenges Naruto to a fight and at the end of the fierce battle, both fall together from a high cliff...', 'Naruto, Shikamaru, and Sakura are executing their mission of delivering a lost pet to a certain village. However, right in the midst of things, troops led by the mysterious knight, Temujin, attack them. In the violent battle, the three become separated. Temujin challenges Naruto to a fight and at the end of the fierce battle, both fall together from a high cliff...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itKMldwL6uhUZYO3X78NOFU4zzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16910'),
  ('27906720297463340', 'Naruto the Movie: Ninja Clash in the Land of Snow', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Animation, Adventure', 'Tensai Okamura, Hiroto Tanaka, Mamoru Sasaki', 'Yuka Miyata', 'Junko Takeuchi, Chie Nakamura, Noriaki Sugiyama, Kazuhiko Inoue, Hidehiko Ishizuka, Yuhko Kaida, Hirotaka Suzuoki, Ikuo Nishikawa', 'PG-13', 'Naruto is thrilled when he is sent on a mission to protect his favorite actress, Yukie Fujikaze, on the set of her new movie, The Adventures of Princess Gale. But when the crew ventures out to film in the icy, foreboding Land of Snow, Yukie mysteriously flees! Naruto and his squad set off to find her... unaware that three Snow Ninja lie in wait, with a sinister purpose that will force Yukie to face her hidden past!', 'Naruto is thrilled when he is sent on a mission to protect his favorite actress, Yukie Fujikaze, on the set of her new movie, The Adventures of Princess Gale. But when the crew ventures out to film in the icy, foreboding Land of Snow, Yukie mysteriously flees! Naruto and his squad set off to find her... unaware that three Snow Ninja lie in wait, with a sinister purpose that will force Yukie to face her hidden past!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUNRUeSNzm8LktH4HRaYiAReB6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16907'),
  ('832643182212464550', 'Naruto to Boruto: The Live 2019', 2019, 'Animation', null, null, null, null, '“NARUTO to BORUTO THE LIVE 2019”, a special event for the 20th anniversary of the first publication of “NARUTO” series in Weekly Shonen Jump!! Featuring live performances by artists performing the theme songs of both “NARUTO” and “BORUTO: NARUTO NEXT GENERATIONS”, anime cast members reading original story episodes, and more.', '“NARUTO to BORUTO THE LIVE 2019”, a special event for the 20th anniversary of the first publication of “NARUTO” series in Weekly Shonen Jump!! Featuring live performances by artists performing the theme songs of both “NARUTO” and “BORUTO: NARUTO NEXT GENERATIONS”, anime cast members reading original story episodes, and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OkxtHotJnegiBbWQSz8fD60NEc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:638566'),
  ('723427608210589010', 'Naruto: The Lost Story - Mission: Protect the Waterfall Village!', 2003, 'Animation, Action, Adventure', 'Satoru Kobayashi, Atsuho Matsumoto, Hideki Hashimoto', 'Katsuyuki Sumisawa', 'Junko Takeuchi, Kazuhiko Inoue, Chie Nakamura, Noriaki Sugiyama, Isshin Chiba, Naoya Uchida', null, 'Naruto and his friends must get back a jug of stolen holy water from a band of higher class ninjas.', 'Naruto and his friends must get back a jug of stolen holy water from a band of higher class ninjas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbN4UeCFUYL3xl1YRhI3LqMuVrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410685'),
  ('37978929341498795', 'Narvik', 2022, 'War, Drama, History, Action', 'John-Erling Holmenes Fredriksen, Erik Skjoldbjærg', 'Christopher Grøndahl', 'Kristine Cornelie M. Hartgen, Carl Martin Eggesbø, Christoph Gelfert Mathiesen, Henrik Mestad, Mathilde Holtedahl Cuhra, Stig Henrik Hoff, Kari Bremnes, Christoph Bach', 'R', 'April, 1940. The eyes of the world are on Narvik, a small town in northern Norway, a source of the iron ore needed for Hitler''s war machine. Through two months of fierce winter warfare, the German leader is dealt with his first defeat.', 'April, 1940. The eyes of the world are on Narvik, a small town in northern Norway, a source of the iron ore needed for Hitler''s war machine. Through two months of fierce winter warfare, the German leader is dealt with his first defeat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iTqTgxTNs1AIaSmxh0zD3RMaFNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:619930'),
  ('339266770352379003', 'Nas Ondas da Fé', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Marcelo Brasil, Felipe Joffily, Isabel Nessimian', 'Lusa Silvestre, Marcelo Adnet', 'Marcelo Adnet, Letícia Lima, Otávio Müller, Thelmo Fernandes, Tonico Pereira, Stepan Nercessian, Nando Cunha, Débora Lamm', null, 'Hickson lived off the books, running from one place to another to make a living. His only great achievement in life had been to win over his wife Jéssika, an evangelical hairdresser and his girlfriend since childhood. The two lead a life without great prospects in the suburbs of Rio de Janeiro until Hickson gets a job at an evangelical radio station. With luck, talent and the help of Jessica, he soon becomes a pastor and has a meteoric rise in the church. But with fame and money comes envy. What now Hickson?', 'Hickson lived off the books, running from one place to another to make a living. His only great achievement in life had been to win over his wife Jéssika, an evangelical hairdresser and his girlfriend since childhood. The two lead a life without great prospects in the suburbs of Rio de Janeiro until Hickson gets a job at an evangelical radio station. With luck, talent and the help of Jessica, he soon becomes a pastor and has a meteoric rise in the church. But with fame and money comes envy. What now Hickson?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fddUEnP5pII7U1f09pQVjw9Gv4v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850167'),
  ('710806207109238825', 'Nas: Time Is Illmatic', 2014, 'Documentary, Music', 'One9, Frank Larson', 'Erik Parker', 'Nas, Alicia Keys, Busta Rhymes, Q-Tip, Pete Rock, Fab 5 Freddy, M.C. Serch, Marley Marl', null, 'Time Is Illmatic is a feature length documentary film that delves deep into the making of Nas'' 1994 debut album, Illmatic, and the social conditions that influenced its creation.', 'Time Is Illmatic is a feature length documentary film that delves deep into the making of Nas'' 1994 debut album, Illmatic, and the social conditions that influenced its creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3LCII4SY82fE5KMk8g9kzC851f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256503'),
  ('773977238329098501', 'NASCAR: The IMAX Experience', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Simon Wincer, James Neihouse, Robert Donaldson', 'Mark Bechtel', 'Kiefer Sutherland, Jeff Gordon, Tony Stewart, Jimmie Johnson, Dale Earnhardt Jr., Matt Kenseth, Mark Martin, Ryan Newman', null, 'A big-screen look into one of America''s most successful entertainment industries, NASCAR racing.', 'A big-screen look into one of America''s most successful entertainment industries, NASCAR racing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Mru3dVA8nlKrHCiQpuvDGz4Zbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13443'),
  ('106216258926617758', 'Naseeb', 1981, 'Drama', 'Manmohan Desai', 'Sayed Sultan', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Shatrughan Sinha, Rishi Kapoor, Hema Malini, Reena Roy, Kim, Amjad Khan, Kader Khan', null, 'The lives of friends Namdev, Raghu, Damu and Jaggi take a turn for the worse when they win a lottery. Raghu and Damu murder Jaggi and frame Namdev who later returns to seek revenge.', 'The lives of friends Namdev, Raghu, Damu and Jaggi take a turn for the worse when they win a lottery. Raghu and Damu murder Jaggi and frame Namdev who later returns to seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDUddLemim047H3V9tNrkhTotOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67605'),
  ('486882862758710312', 'Nash Bridges', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Greg Beeman', 'Carlton Cuse, Bill Chais', 'Don Johnson, Cheech Marin, Joe Dinicol, Diarra Kilpatrick, Angela Kovács, Paul James, Alexia Garcia, Bonnie Somerville', 'PG-13', 'Nash Bridges continues to run San Francisco''s SIU in 2020 while confronting a changing city, a new boss, and a world in which police work focuses on modern data-crunching and predictive policing. Although the world around him has changed, Nash hasn''t.', 'Nash Bridges continues to run San Francisco''s SIU in 2020 while confronting a changing city, a new boss, and a world in which police work focuses on modern data-crunching and predictive policing. Although the world around him has changed, Nash hasn''t.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vurdUj29Sjj2CGHhrVWoiHFKIGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891219'),
  ('331927634108384073', 'Nasha', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Amit Saxena, James Fowlds', null, 'Poonam Pandey, Shivam Patil, Ranbir Chakma, Vishal Bhonsle, Sheetal Singh, Rohan Khurana, Mohit Chauhan', null, 'A teenage boy becomes smitten with his new drama teacher and pursues her, despite the perilous risks of being found out.', 'A teenage boy becomes smitten with his new drama teacher and pursues her, despite the perilous risks of being found out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwGh7LGoJy4YVTg5y674uRl4N4H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215383'),
  ('170582568156353093', 'Nasha Natasha', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Martín Sastre', 'Martín Sastre', 'Natalia Oreiro, Facundo Arana, Ricardo Mollo, Valeria Lorca, Merlín Atahualpa Mollo Oreiro', null, 'International pop star Natalia Oreiro returns to western Europe for a non-stop concert tour through seventeen cities around the former USSR, traveling in the Orient Express. In this first person journey, Natalia also explores her personal and intimate life that started in a blue-collar neighborhood in Montevideo, Uruguay, and went into becoming a world-wide star and a Russian icon.', 'International pop star Natalia Oreiro returns to western Europe for a non-stop concert tour through seventeen cities around the former USSR, traveling in the Orient Express. In this first person journey, Natalia also explores her personal and intimate life that started in a blue-collar neighborhood in Montevideo, Uruguay, and went into becoming a world-wide star and a Russian icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqznyoMCbkxbxy7epNtxZxwD5vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730420'),
  ('451963589935575491', 'Nashville', 1975, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Paul Lohmann, Robert Altman, Alan Rudolph', 'Joan Tewkesbury', 'David Arkin, Barbara Baxley, Ned Beatty, Karen Black, Ronee Blakley, Timothy Brown, Keith Carradine, Geraldine Chaplin', 'R', 'The intersecting stories of twenty-four characters—from country star to wannabe to reporter to waitress—connect to the music business in Nashville, Tennessee.', 'The intersecting stories of twenty-four characters—from country star to wannabe to reporter to waitress—connect to the music business in Nashville, Tennessee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twl4ovyjb8muFKvZmcCDzPR0hy1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3121'),
  ('609340263678635522', 'Nashville Girl', 1976, 'Drama, Music', 'Gus Trikonis, Irv Goodnoff', null, 'Monica Gayle, Glenn Corbett, Roger Davis, Johnny Rodriguez, Jesse White, Marcie Barkin, Shirley Jo Finney, Judith Roberts', 'R', 'A Kentucky-born maiden realizes her dream of becoming a country music star. However, she discovers that her single-minded determination has caused her to lose things far more precious than fame or money when she gets involved with a group of corrupt music executives.', 'A Kentucky-born maiden realizes her dream of becoming a country music star. However, she discovers that her single-minded determination has caused her to lose things far more precious than fame or money when she gets involved with a group of corrupt music executives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tdXhMvLB40P4WbqYo5jaezjaMGc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80656'),
  ('937856620776575718', 'Nasty Baby', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jeffrey M. Weber, Daniel Lugo, Sebastián Silva', 'Sebastián Silva', 'Sebastián Silva, Kristen Wiig, Tunde Adebimpe, Reg E. Cathey, Mark Margolis, Agustín Silva, Alia Shawkat, Lillias White', 'R', 'A gay couple enlists the help of their friend Polly to create a baby. Meanwhile, they must also contend with their homophobic neighbour who becomes a big nuisance.', 'A gay couple enlists the help of their friend Polly to create a baby. Meanwhile, they must also contend with their homophobic neighbour who becomes a big nuisance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkD4rBw2YK9o2fTizPYDMBV9fRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308077'),
  ('465779104165981696', 'Nasty Quacks', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'A doting father gives a cute little duckling to his little daughter. That duckling grows up to become Daffy Duck, who soon develops quite a night life, which he loudly explains at breakfast, in the process of eating everything in sight. When the exasperated father''s attempts at violently removing Daffy fail, he tries one final measure to drive Daffy away...', 'A doting father gives a cute little duckling to his little daughter. That duckling grows up to become Daffy Duck, who soon develops quite a night life, which he loudly explains at breakfast, in the process of eating everything in sight. When the exasperated father''s attempts at violently removing Daffy fail, he tries one final measure to drive Daffy away...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q55OCw8CkL8J43v8sQJ3JJ9EDXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236971'),
  ('604578463807498120', 'Nastya', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Pavel Lebeshev, Yusup Daniyalov', 'Aleksandr Volodin, Alexander Adabashyan, Georgiy Daneliya', 'Polina Kutepova, Irina Markova, Valery Nikolaev, Evgeni Leonov, Aleksandr Abdulov, Galina Petrova, Nina Ter-Osipyan, Natalya Shchukina', null, 'A young Russian store clerk has a drab existence in times of shortages and is berated by her ailing mother for not seeing men. So she brings home an unknown young man who she met on the tram. She dreams many things but pines for this man.', 'A young Russian store clerk has a drab existence in times of shortages and is berated by her ailing mother for not seeing men. So she brings home an unknown young man who she met on the tram. She dreams many things but pines for this man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/693A4DCaaxYrDkTEk0EiNfWqKFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27927'),
  ('605743590113408515', 'Nastya and Egor', 1989, 'Documentary', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Владимир Романенко', 'Aleksei Balabanov', 'Nastya Poleva, Egor Belkin, Vyacheslav Butusov, Leonid Porokhnya, Aleksandr Pantykin', null, 'The main characters of the film are members of the group "Nastya" Nastya Poleva and Yegor Belkin. The half-hour half-documentary tape included footage taken by Balabanov in 1985-1990. In addition to the main characters, the documentary footage captured many prominent figures of Sverdlovsk rock club, in particular Vyacheslav Butusov, Leonid Porokhnyu, and local actors.', 'The main characters of the film are members of the group "Nastya" Nastya Poleva and Yegor Belkin. The half-hour half-documentary tape included footage taken by Balabanov in 1985-1990. In addition to the main characters, the documentary footage captured many prominent figures of Sverdlovsk rock club, in particular Vyacheslav Butusov, Leonid Porokhnyu, and local actors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45TCBRrgeGLJvFlpzUjTM9vPpEP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523707'),
  ('929993299428009276', 'Nasu: Summer in Andalusia', 2003, 'Animation, Action', 'Kitaro Kosaka, Hisao Shirai, Masafumi Mima', 'Kitaro Kosaka', 'Yo Oizumi, Eiko Koike, Minoru Hirano, Yoshihiro Okada, Hiroaki Hirata, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Daigo Kousei, Yūshi Satō', null, 'Pepe Benengeli is a second-class cyclist, only there to support the star member of the team. This summer he is participating in the Tour of Spain, which passes through the streets of his hometown of Andalusia. In a coincidence, his brother and ex-girlfriend are getting married on the same day as the climax of the race. Pepe, who left his hometown after suffering a breakdown, is determined to achieve something special on this day.', 'Pepe Benengeli is a second-class cyclist, only there to support the star member of the team. This summer he is participating in the Tour of Spain, which passes through the streets of his hometown of Andalusia. In a coincidence, his brother and ex-girlfriend are getting married on the same day as the climax of the race. Pepe, who left his hometown after suffering a breakdown, is determined to achieve something special on this day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcwIb5YEfTeVqCRJXNL8Ai1RcEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60843'),
  ('479355271633576976', 'Natacha (Almost) Air Hostess', 2025, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Nicolas Massart, Noémie Saglio, Tatum Drouilhat', 'Noémie Saglio, Laurent Turner', 'Camille Lou, Vincent Dedienne, Didier Bourdon, Elsa Zylberstein, Antoine Gouy, Fabrice Luchini, Isabelle Adjani, Anne Charrier', null, 'France, 1963. Since she was a child, Natacha has dreamed of freedom and adventure. Her dream has a name: air hostess. She admires the women who fly the world, with no ties, no husbands, and no cooking to do. Despite all her efforts Natacha does not match the walking fantasy that an air hostess is supposed to embody at the time. She''s too... or not enough... whatever it is, she hasn''t got it!', 'France, 1963. Since she was a child, Natacha has dreamed of freedom and adventure. Her dream has a name: air hostess. She admires the women who fly the world, with no ties, no husbands, and no cooking to do. Despite all her efforts Natacha does not match the walking fantasy that an air hostess is supposed to embody at the time. She''s too... or not enough... whatever it is, she hasn''t got it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXK0ORuAgYq54CH7UjWjX9UnNk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1266781'),
  ('568170529458849196', 'Natale a 4 zampe', 2012, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Paolo Costella, Giovanni Galasso', 'Gianluca Bomprezzi, Paolo Costella, Enrico Oldoini', 'Massimo Boldi, Maurizio Mattioli, Biagio Izzo, Paola Tiziana Cruciani, Cinzia Mascoli, Andrea Montovoli, Lucrezia Piaggio, Loredana De Nardis', null, 'In a well-known ski resort, a couple has the brilliant idea to open a "4-legged hotel" where people can stay during the Christmas holidays in the company of their beloved pets. Trouble begins when the place is invaded by dogs, cats, rabbits, ferrets and parrots (not to mention their owners!).', 'In a well-known ski resort, a couple has the brilliant idea to open a "4-legged hotel" where people can stay during the Christmas holidays in the company of their beloved pets. Trouble begins when the place is invaded by dogs, cats, rabbits, ferrets and parrots (not to mention their owners!).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aAaw9lArnIRta6EEh5gzzVOjrRC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151728'),
  ('510447817233617912', 'Natale a Beverly Hills', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Alexa Sheehan, Daniele Massaccesi', 'Alessandro Bencivenni, Paolo Logli, Domenico Saverni', 'Christian De Sica, Michelle Hunziker, Sabrina Ferilli, Massimo Ghini, Alessandro Gassmann, Gianmarco Tognazzi, Paolo Conticini, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio', null, 'Carlo descends on his former lover''s unsuspecting family and the scheming Rocco tries to break up his old rival Marcello''s wedding.', 'Carlo descends on his former lover''s unsuspecting family and the scheming Rocco tries to break up his old rival Marcello''s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XkhgSNga06JO5JFcbkn2KT9mRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33282'),
  ('641090523927000284', 'Natale a New York', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Daniele Massaccesi, Matteo Parenti', 'Alessandro Bencivenni, Domenico Saverni, Neri Parenti', 'Christian De Sica, Claudio Bisio, Sabrina Ferilli, Massimo Ghini, Fabio De Luigi, Elisabetta Canalis, Alessandro Siani, Paolo Ruffini', null, 'Lillo (Christian De Sica) married Milena, one of the richest women in Europe. The marriage contract provides that Lillo undertakes to never cheat on her, under penalty of divorce and not even a penny of alimony. But one day he meets Barbara (Sabrina Ferilli) and it''s immediately irresistible passion... Filippo Vessato (Fabio De Luigi) is a young surgeon who, to make a career, is forced to suffer the harassment of his head, Professor Benci (Claudio Bisio). Filippo is about to go to New York to get married and Benci does not miss an opportunity to further harass him by asking him to bring a gift to his son, a "model" student at Riverside College.', 'Lillo (Christian De Sica) married Milena, one of the richest women in Europe. The marriage contract provides that Lillo undertakes to never cheat on her, under penalty of divorce and not even a penny of alimony. But one day he meets Barbara (Sabrina Ferilli) and it''s immediately irresistible passion... Filippo Vessato (Fabio De Luigi) is a young surgeon who, to make a career, is forced to suffer the harassment of his head, Professor Benci (Claudio Bisio). Filippo is about to go to New York to get married and Benci does not miss an opportunity to further harass him by asking him to bring a gift to his son, a "model" student at Riverside College.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyoY3HBLnmelCIiTU2TKlN7f3Kp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42435'),
  ('435385107979845584', 'Natale a Rio', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Gino Sgreva', 'Neri Parenti, Marco Martani, Alessandro Bencivenni', 'Christian De Sica, Michelle Hunziker, Fabio De Luigi, Massimo Ghini, Paolo Conticini, Vittorio Emanuele Propizio, Ludovico Fremont, Caterina Sylos Labini', null, 'Fabio is in love with his colleague Linda, but she has never even seen him until he''s mistaken for her boyfriend. Paolo and Mario leave for a luxurious vacation in Rio de Janeiro for Christmas, without knowing that their sons have booked a trip for the same low-cost destination and, for a problem of homonymy between fathers and sons, the two holidays are exchanged.', 'Fabio is in love with his colleague Linda, but she has never even seen him until he''s mistaken for her boyfriend. Paolo and Mario leave for a luxurious vacation in Rio de Janeiro for Christmas, without knowing that their sons have booked a trip for the same low-cost destination and, for a problem of homonymy between fathers and sons, the two holidays are exchanged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b77Mv9O2Nw1ZAxm2uX0LeAPogmX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42437'),
  ('91093267594585479', 'Natale Col Boss', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Volfango De Biasi, Tani Canevari', 'Volfango De Biasi, Francesco Marioni, Tiziana Martini', 'Lillo Petrolo, Claudio Gregori, Paolo Ruffini, Francesco Mandelli, Giulia Bevilacqua, Gianfelice Imparato, Francesco Di Leva, Peppino Di Capri', null, 'Alex and Dino are two enstablished plastic surgeons used to change their patients'' physical aspect with a few cuts of scalpel. Leo and Cosimo are two clumsy cops on the trails of a powerful and dangerous boss of which no one knows the face. All these five characters will stumble upon each other''s life, in a comedy full of misunderstandings, twists and laughs, where, in the end, everyone will try to save his own "face".', 'Alex and Dino are two enstablished plastic surgeons used to change their patients'' physical aspect with a few cuts of scalpel. Leo and Cosimo are two clumsy cops on the trails of a powerful and dangerous boss of which no one knows the face. All these five characters will stumble upon each other''s life, in a comedy full of misunderstandings, twists and laughs, where, in the end, everyone will try to save his own "face".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7zwlkEx037UPlzLp6yiCSVYV8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:372823'),
  ('1107744699295143356', 'Natale da chef', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Barbara Giordani, Gino Sgreva, Neri Parenti', 'Gianluca Bomprezzi, Domenico Saverni, Alessandro Bencivenni', 'Massimo Boldi, Dario Bandiera, Rocío Muñoz Morales, Paolo Conticini, Francesca Chillemi, Enzo Salvi, Barbara Foria, Maurizio Casagrande', null, 'A bizarre group consisting of a refined chef with unusual recipes, an assistant cook with taste disturbances and an improvised pastry chef takes part in a competition between chefs to win the contract for the G7.', 'A bizarre group consisting of a refined chef with unusual recipes, an assistant cook with taste disturbances and an improvised pastry chef takes part in a competition between chefs to win the contract for the G7.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60psKQ3kOsMladtW7yQw9Zz3NM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487562'),
  ('549665704752108959', 'Natale in casa Cupiello', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Timiana Scalzone, Giuseppe Eusepi, Augusto Tescione', 'Edoardo De Angelis, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Sergio Castellitto, Pina Turco, Antonio Milo, Adriano Pantaleo, Marina Confalone, Giuseppe Brunetti, Toni Laudadio, Alessio Lapice', null, 'Based on the tragicomedy written by Edoardo de Filippo in 1931, Christmas at the Cupiello''s captures a life episode of a middle-class Italian family around Christmas. Shot in Neapolitan language, the movie has a whimsical charm.', 'Based on the tragicomedy written by Edoardo de Filippo in 1931, Christmas at the Cupiello''s captures a life episode of a middle-class Italian family around Christmas. Shot in Neapolitan language, the movie has a whimsical charm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SWjIbWpI9CiKHCWIvfO856cWfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:769110'),
