  ('842874614279613989', 'Natale in India', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Neri Parenti', 'Marco Martani, Neri Parenti, Fausto Brizzi', 'Massimo Boldi, Christian De Sica, Enzo Salvi, Biagio Izzo, Max Cavallari, Bruno Arena, Paolo Conticini, Clarissa Burt', null, 'Destinies intertwined for two antithetical people who meet during a trip to India, where lots of misunderstandings and funny situations will take place.', 'Destinies intertwined for two antithetical people who meet during a trip to India, where lots of misunderstandings and funny situations will take place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anOwIDAfs93mWVY4ZX6LQdbjXbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42433'),
  ('1087582956170396427', 'Natale in Sudafrica', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Luciano Tovoli', 'Paolo Logli, Neri Parenti, Domenico Saverni', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Ghini, Giorgio Panariello, Belén Rodríguez, Max Tortora, Serena Autieri, Barbara Tabita, Laura Esquivel', null, 'Carlo, on vacation in South Africa with his second wife Susanna meets her younger brother Giorgio.', 'Carlo, on vacation in South Africa with his second wife Susanna meets her younger brother Giorgio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ePKo8IRbu8eSnVDXvMv8w2cXkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60556'),
  ('795453618532259415', 'Natale sul Nilo', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Lorenzo Molossi, Jorge Calvo, Nacho Fernández de Tejada', 'Marco Martani, Fausto Brizzi, Lorenzo De Luca', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Enzo Salvi, Biagio Izzo, Bruno Arena, Max Cavallari, Mabel Lozano, Nuria De La Fuente', null, 'A womanizing lawyer follows his wife and son to a trip to Egypt in a last-ditch effort to make up for his infidelities. Also travelling to Egypt is a bumbling police chief who''s desperate to keep his rebellious daughter from becoming a showgirl. The two meet during a Nile cruise. Calamity ensues.', 'A womanizing lawyer follows his wife and son to a trip to Egypt in a last-ditch effort to make up for his infidelities. Also travelling to Egypt is a bumbling police chief who''s desperate to keep his rebellious daughter from becoming a showgirl. The two meet during a Nile cruise. Calamity ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgeIKAhuSWqxcrFRq9lqybpiLmx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42432'),
  ('1118681250492799846', 'Natalie', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Joo Kyeong-joong', 'Joo Kyeong-joong, Kim Wook', 'Lee Sung-jae, Kim Ji-hoon, Hyeon-jin, Kim Gi-yeon, Kim Eun-Kyeong, Kang Jin-joo', null, 'People who have build a wall around themselves. A sculptor Jun-hyeok, an art critic Min-woo, and a modern dance student Mi-ran. A mystery melodrama about the love and secrets of the three people.', 'People who have build a wall around themselves. A sculptor Jun-hyeok, an art critic Min-woo, and a modern dance student Mi-ran. A mystery melodrama about the love and secrets of the three people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wx406KY45z8LuaqcroOmcV6XnQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56607'),
  ('158828754030756505', 'Natalie - Endstation Babystrich', 1994, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Nicoline Mössner, Dieter Chill, Herrmann Zschoche', 'Christina Christoff, Marius del Mestre', 'Anne-Sophie Briest, Nina Hoger, Udo Schenk, Annekathrin Lange, Volkert Kraeft, Falk-Willy Wild, Melanie Rühmann, Tobias Nath', null, '14 years old Natalie seems to live in a completely healthy and wealthy family. However she feels lost: her parents spend most of their time for her younger, sick sister. So she grows more and more lonely. After an argument with her father she runs away from home. In her quest for care and nearness, she ends up with souteneur Nico.', '14 years old Natalie seems to live in a completely healthy and wealthy family. However she feels lost: her parents spend most of their time for her younger, sick sister. So she grows more and more lonely. After an argument with her father she runs away from home. In her quest for care and nearness, she ends up with souteneur Nico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56I9gZ6z3zrtJSHXa8TGxyREtWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36990'),
  ('201523198623810200', 'Natalie II - Die Hölle nach dem Babystrich', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Heidi Kranz, Mike Gast', 'Manfred Grunert, Charlotte Gruner', 'Anne-Sophie Briest, Nina Hoger, Udo Schenk, Lisa Kreuzer, Lars Gärtner, Petra Kelling', null, 'After a long stay in the clinic, Natalie Schneider returns home. When her friend Annemarie secretly sleeps at the Schneider''s and steals money from Peter, a scandal breaks out. Natalie takes the train to Frankfurt.', 'After a long stay in the clinic, Natalie Schneider returns home. When her friend Annemarie secretly sleeps at the Schneider''s and steals money from Peter, a scandal breaks out. Natalie takes the train to Frankfurt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byu6wiEglJzcq90FX8kJIkZOB3a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36904'),
