  ('466700444782034908', 'Nate and Hayes', 1983, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ferdinand Fairfax, Tony Imi, Michael Horton', 'David Odell, John Hughes', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Michael O''Keefe, Jenny Seagrove, Max Phipps, Grant Tilly, Peter Rowley, William Johnson, Mark Hadlow', 'PG', 'Nathaniel Williamsen is taken to an island mission with his fiancee Sophie. Their ship, the Rona, is captained by the roguish Bully Hayes, who also takes a liking to Sophie. When Sophie is kidnapped by slave trader Ben Pease "Nate" teams with Hayes in order to find her.', 'Nathaniel Williamsen is taken to an island mission with his fiancee Sophie. Their ship, the Rona, is captained by the roguish Bully Hayes, who also takes a liking to Sophie. When Sophie is kidnapped by slave trader Ben Pease "Nate" teams with Hayes in order to find her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OOBsIGn5DrpZL12YxFBpA8hO5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35432'),
  ('575373350620044833', 'Nate Bargatze: Hello World', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Mike Lavin', 'Nate Bargatze', 'Nate Bargatze', 'G', 'Grammy nominated comedian Nate Bargatze delivers his family friendly take on a variety of topics including disadvantages of being the first born, the challenges of playing golf with your wife, and what happens when a bald eagle touches your head', 'Grammy nominated comedian Nate Bargatze delivers his family friendly take on a variety of topics including disadvantages of being the first born, the challenges of playing golf with your wife, and what happens when a bald eagle touches your head', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kOenGdO6Ig5tHQPZ5FErMkmmlV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1080787'),
  ('120324537050773172', 'Nate Bargatze: The Greatest Average American', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Troy Miller', 'Nate Bargatze', 'Nate Bargatze', null, 'Tennessee-born comedian, actor, and podcast host Nate Bargatze is back with his second hour-long Netflix original comedy special, Nate Bargatze: The Greatest Average American. Nate reflects on being part of the Oregon Trail generation, meeting his wife while working at Applebee''s and the hilariously relatable moments of being a father and husband.', 'Tennessee-born comedian, actor, and podcast host Nate Bargatze is back with his second hour-long Netflix original comedy special, Nate Bargatze: The Greatest Average American. Nate reflects on being part of the Oregon Trail generation, meeting his wife while working at Applebee''s and the hilariously relatable moments of being a father and husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7X0FS5F5qyJK1nyxpIIlzYJtM1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799573'),
  ('558478818676910500', 'Nathalie Granger', 1973, 'Drama', 'Marguerite Duras, Ghislain Cloquet', null, 'Lucia Bosè, Jeanne Moreau, Luce Garcia-Ville, Gérard Depardieu, Valerie Mascolo, Nathalie Bourgeois, Dionys Mascolo, Ghislain Cloquet', null, 'With little or no embellishment, filmmaker Marguerite Duras offers a simple, often wordless chronicle of a woman''s day. She and her friend are seen doing yard work, talking about their families and receiving the occasional visitor. The brightest spot in the day is when a washing machine salesman comes to call.', 'With little or no embellishment, filmmaker Marguerite Duras offers a simple, often wordless chronicle of a woman''s day. She and her friend are seen doing yard work, talking about their families and receiving the occasional visitor. The brightest spot in the day is when a washing machine salesman comes to call.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5yrKbNHG67C0HggbcJw0OMIhAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4747'),
  ('258128857531089792', 'Nathalie: Escape from Hell', 1978, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Alain Payet, Alain Hardy', null, 'Patrizia Gori, Jacqueline Laurent, Jack Taylor, Jacques Marbeuf, Rudy Lenoir, Claudine Beccarie, Richard Lemieuvre, Guy Bonnafoux', null, 'When a Russian doctor (Patrizia Gori) falls foul of the Nazis, she finds herself imprisoned at Fort Stilberg, a luxury brothel for German top brass where the women are overseen by sadistic SS officer Helga Hortz (Jacqueline Laurent). The doctor''s medical skills bring her to the attention of Nazi Lieutenant Erik Mueller (Jack Taylor), who saves the lovely lady from becoming one of the establishment''s ''hostesses'' by assigning her to the infirmary.', 'When a Russian doctor (Patrizia Gori) falls foul of the Nazis, she finds herself imprisoned at Fort Stilberg, a luxury brothel for German top brass where the women are overseen by sadistic SS officer Helga Hortz (Jacqueline Laurent). The doctor''s medical skills bring her to the attention of Nazi Lieutenant Erik Mueller (Jack Taylor), who saves the lovely lady from becoming one of the establishment''s ''hostesses'' by assigning her to the infirmary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d93oiCPUSB6Yq92LOqVdM3BRmuB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107397'),
  ('581745953546255598', 'Nathalie...', 2003, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Jacques Fieschi, François-Olivier Rousseau, Anne Fontaine', 'Fanny Ardant, Emmanuelle Béart, Gérard Depardieu, Wladimir Yordanoff, Judith Magre, Rodolphe Pauly, Évelyne Dandry, Aurore Auteuil', null, 'Paris doctor Catherine starts to think her husband, Bernard, is having an affair when she hears an unfamiliar woman''s message on his voice mail. Hoping to learn more about his extramarital activities, Catherine heads to a strip club, where she hires call girl Nathalie to have a fling with Gerard. As the affair progresses, Nathalie gives Catherine regular status reports, and the relationship between the women evolves from business to personal.', 'Paris doctor Catherine starts to think her husband, Bernard, is having an affair when she hears an unfamiliar woman''s message on his voice mail. Hoping to learn more about his extramarital activities, Catherine heads to a strip club, where she hires call girl Nathalie to have a fling with Gerard. As the affair progresses, Nathalie gives Catherine regular status reports, and the relationship between the women evolves from business to personal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29cGC3wI4RtumU8suSs7U4IAS2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38376'),
  ('432616187475307248', 'Nati 2 volte', 2019, null, 'Pierluigi Di Lallo, Claudio Zamarion', 'Pierluigi Di Lallo, Riccardo Graziosi, Francesco Colangelo', 'Fabio Troiano, Euridice Axén, Rosalinda Celentano, Gabriele Cirilli, Catena Fiorello, Marco Palvetti, Francesco Pannofino, Nini Salerno', null, 'A trans-sexual man return to his hometown to finish the bureaucratic process to become officially a male. But the public servant who should implement this simple bureaucratic operation is Giorgio, his first and only boyfriend.', 'A trans-sexual man return to his hometown to finish the bureaucratic process to become officially a male. But the public servant who should implement this simple bureaucratic operation is Giorgio, his first and only boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ut8Z28ZLPNopbj0fjBHCEejMDL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649239'),
  ('295729634517535427', 'Nati stanchi', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Dominick Tambasco, Federico Marsicano, Samad Zarmandili', 'Francesco Bruni, Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Stefania Bonafede, Marica Coco, Luigi Maria Burruano, Gilberto Idonea, Costantino Carrozza, Dario D''Ambrosi', null, 'Salvo and Valentino are two happy Sicilian friends, who do not want to work, because they know that if they find a permanent job, their girlfriends will ask them to marry them.', 'Salvo and Valentino are two happy Sicilian friends, who do not want to work, because they know that if they find a permanent job, their girlfriends will ask them to marry them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pfmKsjxgWSGflGuVDXXZn46hDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38537'),
  ('42855782452298754', 'National Anthem', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luke Gilford, Katelin Arizmendi, Jessica Dickard', 'Kevin Best, Luke Gilford, David Largman Murray', 'Charlie Plummer, Eve Lindley, Rene Rosado, Mason Alexander Park, Robyn Lively, Joey DeLeon, Lee Knight, Fernando Casablancas', 'R', 'A 21-year old construction worker in rural New Mexico joins a community of queer ranchers and rodeo performers in search of their own version of the American dream.', 'A 21-year old construction worker in rural New Mexico joins a community of queer ranchers and rodeo performers in search of their own version of the American dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUFTNOFBoJzCGu8c9XRJAy7G6xu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1082543'),
  ('108416782109503190', 'National Champions', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ric Roman Waugh, Michael Saunders, Jimmy Waltrip', 'Adam Mervis', 'Stephan James, J.K. Simmons, Alexander Ludwig, Lil Rel Howery, Tim Blake Nelson, Andrew Bachelor, David Koechner, Jeffrey Donovan', 'R', 'A star quarterback ignites a players’ strike hours before the biggest game of the year in order to fight for fair compensation, equality, and respect for the athletes who put their bodies and health on the line for their schools.', 'A star quarterback ignites a players’ strike hours before the biggest game of the year in order to fight for fair compensation, equality, and respect for the athletes who put their bodies and health on the line for their schools.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRj82OOTJ8bmtUJDap9tNnswF0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823425'),
  ('904838913731523343', 'National Class Category Up to 785ccm', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Goran Marković', 'Goran Marković', 'Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Bogdan Diklić, Gorica Popović, Milivoje ''Mića'' Tomić, Olivera Marković, Maja Lalević, Aleksandar Berček, Irfan Mensur', null, 'One week in life of Branimir Mitrovic "Floyd", a young rally driver from the National class (up to 785cc), dreaming of promotion to the higher category. He lives a carefree life of a Belgrade dandy boy, neglecting his girlfriend, avoiding his draft calls, and refusing to deal with any life responsibility in general. The decisive race on Saturday is only what he cares about.', 'One week in life of Branimir Mitrovic "Floyd", a young rally driver from the National class (up to 785cc), dreaming of promotion to the higher category. He lives a carefree life of a Belgrade dandy boy, neglecting his girlfriend, avoiding his draft calls, and refusing to deal with any life responsibility in general. The decisive race on Saturday is only what he cares about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ves5WIpBR1KMoc6mSyBJ6DQliYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144973'),
  ('578550351796720840', 'National Family', 2023, 'Comedy, Action', 'Marcelo Tobar', 'Marcelo Tobar, Emiliano Tonatiuh Rocha Minter, Santiago Mohar Volkow', 'Silvia Navarro, Gilberto Barraza, Claudia Ríos, Jero Medina, Jesús Zavala, Lucía Madariaga, Aketzaly Verástegui, Roberto Andrade', null, 'Don Poli, the patriarch of a family embedded in politics, faces the change of party in his state - after a hundred years in power - losing all his privileges. Humiliated and angry, he threatens to disinherit his family and leave to rebuild his life. This forces his children (Kippy, Ramses and Belén) to take extreme measures to ensure their future, causing everything that could go wrong to turn out worse.', 'Don Poli, the patriarch of a family embedded in politics, faces the change of party in his state - after a hundred years in power - losing all his privileges. Humiliated and angry, he threatens to disinherit his family and leave to rebuild his life. This forces his children (Kippy, Ramses and Belén) to take extreme measures to ensure their future, causing everything that could go wrong to turn out worse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSAzrJ0AjFZLUCcHT8YAnuD7egp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1209450'),
  ('490904276574711381', 'National Geographic: Journey to the Edge of the Universe', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Yavar Abbas', 'Nigel Henbest', 'Alec Baldwin, Sean Pertwee', 'G', 'In one single, epic camera move we journey from Earth''s surface to the outermost reaches of the universe on a grand tour of the cosmos, to explore newborn stars, distant planets, black holes and beyond.', 'In one single, epic camera move we journey from Earth''s surface to the outermost reaches of the universe on a grand tour of the cosmos, to explore newborn stars, distant planets, black holes and beyond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14mR0hzWv9gU1oU61hBbCRyo4QE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17210'),
  ('516966532417195226', 'National Heritage', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, José Luis García-Berlanga, Carlos Suárez', 'Luis García Berlanga, Rafael Azcona', 'Agustín González, Luis Escobar, Luis Ciges, José Luis López Vázquez, Amparo Soler Leal, Alfredo Mayo, José Lifante, Mary Santpere', null, 'After the death of General Franco, the Leguineche family leaves their estate of Los Tejadillos, where they have remained for decades in voluntary exile, with the purpose of returning to Madrid to actively participate in the social events of the aristocracy and to get closer to the closest circle of the Spanish monarch. The obsession of the old marquis is centered on getting in touch with the most illustrious surnames, to ascend socially and to resume the pomp and courtly life that his family lost a long time ago. To this end, he decides to move into an old palace he owns, located in the center of the capital, but not before overcoming the difficulties posed by his wife, who deeply hates both her husband and her son. To regain control of the palace, the Marquis of Leguineche tries to handicap his wife, arguing an incurable mental illness, and then undertake a reform of the place in order to adapt it to aristocratic life.', 'After the death of General Franco, the Leguineche family leaves their estate of Los Tejadillos, where they have remained for decades in voluntary exile, with the purpose of returning to Madrid to actively participate in the social events of the aristocracy and to get closer to the closest circle of the Spanish monarch. The obsession of the old marquis is centered on getting in touch with the most illustrious surnames, to ascend socially and to resume the pomp and courtly life that his family lost a long time ago. To this end, he decides to move into an old palace he owns, located in the center of the capital, but not before overcoming the difficulties posed by his wife, who deeply hates both her husband and her son. To regain control of the palace, the Marquis of Leguineche tries to handicap his wife, arguing an incurable mental illness, and then undertake a reform of the place in order to adapt it to aristocratic life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggtpWtXpuCGY2B5yoShkOwuy4Ig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98609'),
  ('1067871722662152607', 'National III', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Luis García Berlanga, Carlos Suárez, Miguel Gil', 'Rafael Azcona, Luis García Berlanga', 'Luis Ciges, Luis Escobar, Agustín González, José Luis López Vázquez, Amparo Soler Leal, José Luis de Vilallonga, Chus Lampreave, María Luisa Ponte', null, 'In order to solve economic problems, "Leguineche" family decide to move to France with their limited belongings.', 'In order to solve economic problems, "Leguineche" family decide to move to France with their limited belongings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YcCss6LOnWsKS9HvbEfAe2QwHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97272'),
  ('400566402308048838', 'National Lampoon Presents Dorm Daze', 2003, 'Comedy', 'David Hillenbrand, Scott Hillenbrand, Philip D. Schwartz', 'Patrick Casey, Josh Miller', 'Tatyana Ali, Boti Bliss, Gable Carr, Patrick Cavanaugh, James DeBello, Marieh Delfino, Tony Denman, Danielle Fishel', 'R', 'When a foreign-exchange student and a hooker - both named Dominique - show up on a college campus, the unsuspecting student body is in for the education of a lifetime!', 'When a foreign-exchange student and a hooker - both named Dominique - show up on a college campus, the unsuspecting student body is in for the education of a lifetime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Aey8eozhVGgiDK37k8UzqwNV8m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18113'),
  ('1004822432211641275', 'National Lampoon Presents: Endless Bummer', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Sam Pillsbury, Jane Jenkins', 'John ''J.D.'' Drury, John Francis Sullivan, Sam Pillsbury', 'Joan Jett, Jules Bruff, James Remar, Matthew Lillard, Jane Leeves, Vanessa Angel, Richmond Arquette, Andrew Lewis Caldwell', 'R', 'From National Lampoon, the masters of raunchy comedy, comes a summer tale of beers, babes, and bros! In the surf town of Ventura, California, JD''s surf board is stolen by a surfer from Los Angeles...a crime that cannot go unpunished. Gathering his friends and the local surf hero, Mike Mooney, they take a road trip to LA to get the surfboard back, then return to Ventura for the wildest summer party ever!', 'From National Lampoon, the masters of raunchy comedy, comes a summer tale of beers, babes, and bros! In the surf town of Ventura, California, JD''s surf board is stolen by a surfer from Los Angeles...a crime that cannot go unpunished. Gathering his friends and the local surf hero, Mike Mooney, they take a road trip to LA to get the surfboard back, then return to Ventura for the wildest summer party ever!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aez4qjFTRvhwkWOt7vuLTsBLf1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250622'),
  ('312233632906249188', 'National Lampoon''s Christmas Vacation', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jeremiah S. Chechik, Thomas E. Ackerman, Charlie Picerni', 'John Hughes', 'Chevy Chase, Beverly D''Angelo, Juliette Lewis, Johnny Galecki, John Randolph, Diane Ladd, E.G. Marshall, Doris Roberts', 'PG-13', 'It''s Christmastime, and the Griswolds are preparing for a family seasonal celebration. But things never run smoothly for Clark, his wife Ellen, and their two kids. Clark''s continual bad luck is worsened by his obnoxious family guests, but he manages to keep going, knowing that his Christmas bonus is due soon.', 'It''s Christmastime, and the Griswolds are preparing for a family seasonal celebration. But things never run smoothly for Clark, his wife Ellen, and their two kids. Clark''s continual bad luck is worsened by his obnoxious family guests, but he manages to keep going, knowing that his Christmas bonus is due soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oat42hUw8XzKYUmfy0YLAxYd484.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5825'),
  ('479007826610822782', 'National Lampoon''s European Vacation', 1985, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Amy Heckerling, Robert Paynter, Don French', 'John Hughes, Robert Klane', 'Chevy Chase, Beverly D''Angelo, Dana Hill, Jason Lively, Victor Lanoux, Eric Idle, John Astin, Paul Bartel', 'PG-13', 'The Griswolds win a vacation to Europe on a game show, and so pack their bags for the continent. They do their best to catch the flavor of Europe, but they just don''t know how to be be good tourists. Besides, they have trouble taking holidays in countries where they CAN speak the language.', 'The Griswolds win a vacation to Europe on a game show, and so pack their bags for the continent. They do their best to catch the flavor of Europe, but they just don''t know how to be be good tourists. Besides, they have trouble taking holidays in countries where they CAN speak the language.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZL7g1oSDrA0Lx5wcHpEl99MYKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11418'),
  ('477322427133660292', 'National Lampoon''s Favorite Deadly Sins', 1995, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Denis Leary, David Jablin, Anthony Jannelli', 'Lee Biondi, Ann Lembeck, Michael Barrie', 'Andrew Dice Clay, Denis Leary, Joe Mantegna, Farrah Forke, Cassidy Rae, Annabella Sciorra, Tanya Pohlkotte, Tanya Roberts', 'R', 'America''s three top leisure-time activities come roaring to life in National Lampoon''s Favorite Deadly Sins. This film consists of three short stories: Greed (Joe Mantegna), Anger (Andrew Clay) and Lust (Denis Leary).', 'America''s three top leisure-time activities come roaring to life in National Lampoon''s Favorite Deadly Sins. This film consists of three short stories: Greed (Joe Mantegna), Anger (Andrew Clay) and Lust (Denis Leary).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAjAHW1uL1T7YUtZLAEpi8FSkW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152206'),
  ('814338677490478024', 'National Lampoon''s Gold Diggers', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Thomas L. Callaway, Gary Preisler, David N. Schrager', 'Gary Preisler', 'Will Friedle, Chris Owen, Nikki Ziering, Louise Lasser, Renée Taylor, Rudy De Luca, Jack Ong, J.J. Cole', 'PG-13', 'Calvin and Leonard, two broke losers, are arrested for trying to rob rich old sisters Doris and Betty. The women have a change of heart, drop the charges and invite the the boys over to their mansion. Calvin decides he and Leonard should marry the women, and, when they soon die, live off the inheritance. The ladies, however, have run into their own financial troubles and wed the boys with plans of murdering them for insurance money.', 'Calvin and Leonard, two broke losers, are arrested for trying to rob rich old sisters Doris and Betty. The women have a change of heart, drop the charges and invite the the boys over to their mansion. Calvin decides he and Leonard should marry the women, and, when they soon die, live off the inheritance. The ladies, however, have run into their own financial troubles and wed the boys with plans of murdering them for insurance money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOCAfLSo6hkAIdWRCvNwquwsPwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44181'),
  ('619240911020159059', 'National Lampoon''s Last Resort', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Rafal Zielinski, Peter Benison, Scott Harris', 'Damian Lee, Patrick Labyorteaux', 'Corey Feldman, Corey Haim, Robert Mandan, Maureen Flannigan, Demetra Hampton, Geoffrey Lewis, Milton Selzer, Eda Reiss Merin', 'PG-13', 'Sam and Dave are living the boring life until they are beckoned to Sam''s uncle''s Island. When they get there (still not quite sure how that worked) they are compelled by beautiful women and a dastardly enemy of the Island. After accidentally convincing Sam''s uncle to sign away rights to his island, they must somehow fix the problem.', 'Sam and Dave are living the boring life until they are beckoned to Sam''s uncle''s Island. When they get there (still not quite sure how that worked) they are compelled by beautiful women and a dastardly enemy of the Island. After accidentally convincing Sam''s uncle to sign away rights to his island, they must somehow fix the problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3ycFo3qKhF9SDERN1PQq4bJeIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49338'),
  ('1137689736258652297', 'National Lampoon''s Loaded Weapon 1', 1993, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Peter Deming, Gene Quintano, Ken Goch', 'Gene Quintano, Don Holley', 'Emilio Estevez, Samuel L. Jackson, Jon Lovitz, Tim Curry, Kathy Ireland, Frank McRae, William Shatner, Dhiru Shah', 'PG-13', 'An LA detective is murdered because she has microfilm with the recipe to make cocaine cookies. Two cops partner to find and stop the fiends before they can dope the nation by distributing their wares via the ''Wilderness Girls'' cookie drive.', 'An LA detective is murdered because she has microfilm with the recipe to make cocaine cookies. Two cops partner to find and stop the fiends before they can dope the nation by distributing their wares via the ''Wilderness Girls'' cookie drive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/moP0nyVWVisqSeH6nMewWyIPV6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9644'),
  ('821342048185989309', 'National Lampoon''s Movie Madness', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Bob Giraldi, Henry Jaglom, Tak Fujimoto', 'Shary Flenniken, Pat Mephitis, Ellis Weiner', 'Peter Riegert, Diane Lane, Candy Clark, Teresa Ganzel, Irene Cagen, Schnootie Neff, Andy Shakman, Tamar Howard', 'R', 'A parody of film genres composed of three shorts, spoofing personal growth films, glossy soap operas, and police stories.', 'A parody of film genres composed of three shorts, spoofing personal growth films, glossy soap operas, and police stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryHfEsFm366Y1bXYi1GepZbPtOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33782'),
  ('749408074328010200', 'National Lampoon''s Senior Trip', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Kelly Makin, François Protat, Charles Braive', 'Roger Kumble, I. Marlene King', 'Matt Frewer, Valerie Mahaffey, Lawrence Dane, Tommy Chong, Jeremy Renner, Rob Moore, Eric Edwards, Kevin McDonald', 'R', 'While on detention, a group of misfits and slackers have to write a letter to the President explaining what is wrong with the education system. There is only one problem, the President loves it! Hence, the group must travel to Washington to meet the Main Man.', 'While on detention, a group of misfits and slackers have to write a letter to the President explaining what is wrong with the education system. There is only one problem, the President loves it! Hence, the group must travel to Washington to meet the Main Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3QpB4KpMKRnZnsJOsemOZHDoQKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27993'),
  ('402634026045878144', 'National Lampoon''s The Legend of Awesomest Maximus', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Jeff Kanew, John Darbonne', 'Jason Burinescu', 'Will Sasso, Kristanna Loken, Sophie Monk, Khary Payton, Ian Ziering, Gary Lundy, Rip Torn, Tony Cox', 'R', 'A clueless Trojan general must meet an unbeatable Greek warrior on the battlefield.', 'A clueless Trojan general must meet an unbeatable Greek warrior on the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IsqWxYEmF4BWTQyIj1nCOgpTvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51261'),
  ('425195229735909196', 'National Lampoon''s TV: The Movie', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Sam Macaroni, Edward A. Gutentag, Mark G. Mathis', 'Preston Lacy, Sam Macaroni', 'Steve-O, Preston Lacy, Jason ''Wee Man'' Acuña, Chris Pontius, Clifton Collins Jr., Jacob Vargas, Dian Bachar, Lee Majors', 'R', 'A celebration of the ever increasing depravity of television in our society-- it''s a channel surfing adventure through the most utterly ridiculous spoofed television programming and commercials.', 'A celebration of the ever increasing depravity of television in our society-- it''s a channel surfing adventure through the most utterly ridiculous spoofed television programming and commercials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/saBExhxD7B0r5v5sj4yWzfSPojQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39163'),
  ('618124081417611199', 'National Lampoon''s Vacation', 1983, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Victor J. Kemper, Harold Ramis, Dick Ziker', 'John Hughes', 'Chevy Chase, Beverly D''Angelo, Anthony Michael Hall, Imogene Coca, Randy Quaid, Dana Barron, Eddie Bracken, Brian Doyle-Murray', 'R', 'Clark Griswold is on a quest to take his family to the Walley World theme park for a vacation, but things don''t go exactly as planned.', 'Clark Griswold is on a quest to take his family to the Walley World theme park for a vacation, but things don''t go exactly as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q3DvoqY06yZnRp9faH6uge7n7VP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11153'),
  ('63802499522291821', 'National Lampoon''s Van Wilder', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'James R. Bagdonas, Walt Becker, Michael A. Allowitz', 'Brent Goldberg, David Wagner', 'Ryan Reynolds, Tara Reid, Tim Matheson, Kal Penn, Teck Holmes, Daniel Cosgrove, Deon Richmond, Alex Burns', 'R', 'Van Wilder has been attending college for far too many years and is scared to graduate, but Van’s father eventually realizes what is going on. When he stops paying his son''s tuition fees, Van must come up with the money if he wants to stay in college, so he and his friends come up with a great fund-raising idea – throwing parties. However, when the college magazine finds out and reporter Gwen is sent to do a story on Van Wilder, things get a little complicated.', 'Van Wilder has been attending college for far too many years and is scared to graduate, but Van’s father eventually realizes what is going on. When he stops paying his son''s tuition fees, Van must come up with the money if he wants to stay in college, so he and his friends come up with a great fund-raising idea – throwing parties. However, when the college magazine finds out and reporter Gwen is sent to do a story on Van Wilder, things get a little complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IvM4qnzlo62oLmS54FtyRt54ze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11452'),
  ('686381613804493413', 'National Mechanics', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luis Alcoriza, Álex Phillips Jr.', 'Luis Alcoriza', 'Manolo Fábregas, Lucha Villa, Héctor Suárez, Sara García, Alma Muriel, Pancho Córdova, Aurora Clavel, Fabiola Falcón', null, 'A mechanic takes his family to a car race and a series of events occur which brings problems, betrayals, violence and the unexpected death of an elderly person.', 'A mechanic takes his family to a car race and a series of events occur which brings problems, betrayals, violence and the unexpected death of an elderly person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzDD0xoabcBpPra3YlcP1pWs20i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186066'),
  ('1080557581708057240', 'National Security', 2003, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Dennis Dugan, Oliver Wood, Bruce Franklin', 'David Ronn, Jay Scherick', 'Martin Lawrence, Steve Zahn, Colm Feore, Bill Duke, Eric Roberts, Timothy Busfield, Robinne Lee, Brett Cullen', 'PG-13', 'Earl Montgomery, a bombastic police academy reject, and Hank Rafferty, a disgraced, mild-mannered cop, can''t seem to escape each other. They met on opposite sides of the law during a routine traffic stop that escalated out of control; now as lowly security guards they''re thrown together to bust a smuggling operation.', 'Earl Montgomery, a bombastic police academy reject, and Hank Rafferty, a disgraced, mild-mannered cop, can''t seem to escape each other. They met on opposite sides of the law during a routine traffic stop that escalated out of control; now as lowly security guards they''re thrown together to bust a smuggling operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qZP18uhHFEgJEGEJUQwRPAKQPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11078'),
  ('24807285878784917', 'National Security', 2012, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Jeong Sang-hyeop, Chung Ji-young, Seo Min-soo', 'Chung Ji-young, Jeong Sang-hyeop', 'Park Won-sang, Lee Kyung-young, Dong Bang-woo, Kim Eui-sung, Seo Dong-soo, Kim Joong-ki, Lee Chun-hee, Moon Sung-keun', null, 'On September 4, 1984, democracy movement leader Kim Jong Tae is arrested and taken to an infamous interrogation facility in Namyeong-dong. For the next 22 days, he would be cruelly and continuously tortured in all manners by interrogators intent on forcing him to confess to communist collaboration.', 'On September 4, 1984, democracy movement leader Kim Jong Tae is arrested and taken to an infamous interrogation facility in Namyeong-dong. For the next 22 days, he would be cruelly and continuously tortured in all manners by interrogators intent on forcing him to confess to communist collaboration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tA8rDKlPd7S8roqL9kf1bP2Ygep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162146'),
  ('1012618525776592280', 'National Sexuality Management Committee', 2018, 'Romance', 'Gyeom Ji-san', null, 'Lee Chae-dam, Kim Ah-rang, Kang Min-woo, Lee Soo, Min Do-yoon', null, 'To prevent the national crisis of childbirth, the State makes the Sex Life Management Committee. When a couple (Doyoon Min, Arang Kim) could not get pregnant, the person in charge of the National Sex Life Management Committee (Chaedam Lee, Minwoo Kang) was dispatched to encourage pregnancy. Since the officials in charge are experts in this area, they have been given the role of evangelists who hold the wrong position and convey the correct sexual knowledge.', 'To prevent the national crisis of childbirth, the State makes the Sex Life Management Committee. When a couple (Doyoon Min, Arang Kim) could not get pregnant, the person in charge of the National Sex Life Management Committee (Chaedam Lee, Minwoo Kang) was dispatched to encourage pregnancy. Since the officials in charge are experts in this area, they have been given the role of evangelists who hold the wrong position and convey the correct sexual knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYbwhNgyhVaBrUT2e0qeytHhy1a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716586'),
  ('886332658847942069', 'National Theatre Live: Inter Alia', 2025, 'Drama', 'Justin Martin, Naomi Downham, Alastair Coomer', 'Suzie Miller', 'Rosamund Pike, Jamie Glover, Jasper Talbot, Charles Dark, Esma Akar, Louisa Clein, Liliana Argenio-Winch, Ella Critchell', 'NR', 'Jessica Parks is a smart Crown Court Judge at the top of her career. Behind the robe, she is a karaoke fiend, loving wife and a supportive parent. When an event threatens to throw her life completely off balance, can she hold her family upright?', 'Jessica Parks is a smart Crown Court Judge at the top of her career. Behind the robe, she is a karaoke fiend, loving wife and a supportive parent. When an event threatens to throw her life completely off balance, can she hold her family upright?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IBpj6oU9BFcUGesv1QH2LvEb01.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1454209'),
  ('953945780636474950', 'National Treasure', 2004, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Eric Engler, Jon Turteltaub, Caleb Deschanel', 'Cormac Wibberley, Jim Kouf, Marianne Wibberley', 'Nicolas Cage, Diane Kruger, Justin Bartha, Sean Bean, Jon Voight, Harvey Keitel, Christopher Plummer, David Dayan Fisher', 'PG', 'Modern treasure hunters, led by archaeologist Ben Gates, search for a chest of riches rumored to have been stashed away by George Washington, Thomas Jefferson and Benjamin Franklin during the Revolutionary War. The chest''s whereabouts may lie in secret clues embedded in the Constitution and the Declaration of Independence, and Gates is in a race to find the gold before his enemies do.', 'Modern treasure hunters, led by archaeologist Ben Gates, search for a chest of riches rumored to have been stashed away by George Washington, Thomas Jefferson and Benjamin Franklin during the Revolutionary War. The chest''s whereabouts may lie in secret clues embedded in the Constitution and the Declaration of Independence, and Gates is in a race to find the gold before his enemies do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxL6E4GBOPUG6CdkO9cUQN5VMwI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2059'),
  ('1204916387088317', 'National Treasure: Book of Secrets', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Mystery, Thriller', 'Geoffrey Hansen, Christina Fong, Drew Boughton', 'Cormac Wibberley, Marianne Wibberley', 'Nicolas Cage, Diane Kruger, Justin Bartha, Ed Harris, Jon Voight, Helen Mirren, Harvey Keitel, Bruce Greenwood', 'PG', 'Benjamin Franklin Gates and Abigail Chase re-team with Riley Poole and, now armed with a stack of long-lost pages from John Wilkes Booth''s diary, Ben must follow a clue left there to prove his ancestor''s innocence in the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.', 'Benjamin Franklin Gates and Abigail Chase re-team with Riley Poole and, now armed with a stack of long-lost pages from John Wilkes Booth''s diary, Ben must follow a clue left there to prove his ancestor''s innocence in the assassination of Abraham Lincoln.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dc9F1vNOGbgeZrO9ejNkbgHPlfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6637'),
  ('961373839329409558', 'National Velvet', 1945, 'Drama, Family', 'Clarence Brown, Leonard Smith', 'Theodore Reeves, Helen Deutsch', 'Mickey Rooney, Donald Crisp, Elizabeth Taylor, Anne Revere, Angela Lansbury, Jackie ''Butch'' Jenkins, Juanita Quigley, Reginald Owen', 'G', 'Mi Taylor is a young wanderer and opportunist who finds himself in the quiet English countryside home of the Brown family. The youngest daughter, Velvet, has a passion for horses and when she wins the spirited steed Pie in a town lottery, Mi is encouraged to train the horse.', 'Mi Taylor is a young wanderer and opportunist who finds himself in the quiet English countryside home of the Brown family. The youngest daughter, Velvet, has a passion for horses and when she wins the spirited steed Pie in a town lottery, Mi is encouraged to train the horse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUQfP3s967V3SIAbyomNT8z8MIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17641'),
  ('1112906051261524996', 'Nationale 7', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-Pierre Sinapi, Jean-Paul Meurisse', 'Anne-Marie Catois, Jean-Pierre Sinapi', 'Nadia Kaci, Olivier Gourmet, Saïd Taghmaoui, Chantal Neuwirth, Lionel Abelanski, Gérald Thomassin, Nadine Marcovici, Julien Boisselier', null, 'In a nursing home for disabled near Toulon, René is unanimously hated by all. With fifty years and suffering from myopathy, has an irascible, rebellious character. But not resist provocations candor and uprightness of Julie, a special educator rookie. He confesses he wants to make love to a woman before her degenerative disease definitely catch it. Then Julie goes after one of the prostitutes who work in caravans along the N7.', 'In a nursing home for disabled near Toulon, René is unanimously hated by all. With fifty years and suffering from myopathy, has an irascible, rebellious character. But not resist provocations candor and uprightness of Julie, a special educator rookie. He confesses he wants to make love to a woman before her degenerative disease definitely catch it. Then Julie goes after one of the prostitutes who work in caravans along the N7.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y50LVIWmLTvMBAaxSqcKDgRuoKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81852'),
  ('1086296668404329510', 'Native Land', 1942, 'Drama, History', 'Leo Hurwitz, Paul Strand, Paul Strand', 'Leo Hurwitz, Ben Maddow, Paul Strand', 'Paul Robeson, Fred Johnson, Mary George, John Rennick, Amelia Romano, Houseley Stevenson, Louis Grant, James Hanney', null, 'By the start of World War II, Paul Robeson had given up his lucrative mainstream work to participate in more socially progressive film and stage productions. Robeson committed his support to Paul Strand and Leo Hurwitz’s political semidocumentary Native Land. With Robeson’s narration and songs, this beautifully shot and edited film exposes violations of Americans’ civil liberties and is a call to action for exploited workers around the country. Scarcely shown since its debut, Native Land represents Robeson’s shift from narrative cinema to the leftist documentaries that would define the final chapter of his controversial film career.', 'By the start of World War II, Paul Robeson had given up his lucrative mainstream work to participate in more socially progressive film and stage productions. Robeson committed his support to Paul Strand and Leo Hurwitz’s political semidocumentary Native Land. With Robeson’s narration and songs, this beautifully shot and edited film exposes violations of Americans’ civil liberties and is a call to action for exploited workers around the country. Scarcely shown since its debut, Native Land represents Robeson’s shift from narrative cinema to the leftist documentaries that would define the final chapter of his controversial film career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8BoBKWSxZmTjFiE16ITjjzoSNac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44787'),
  ('97435011702836829', 'Native Son', 1951, 'Drama', 'Pierre Chenal, Antonio Merayo', 'Pierre Chenal', 'Richard Wright, Jean Wallace, Gloria Madison, Nicholas Joy, Willa Pearl Curtis, Ruth Robert, Charles Cane, George D. Green', 'NR', 'In 1940s Chicago, a young black man takes a job as a chauffeur to a white family, which takes a turn for the worse when he accidentally kills the teenage daughter of the couple and then tries to cover it up.', 'In 1940s Chicago, a young black man takes a job as a chauffeur to a white family, which takes a turn for the worse when he accidentally kills the teenage daughter of the couple and then tries to cover it up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ah4FStCZc4NIdt0jST8VYybGw4Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151435'),
