  ('701479277162791840', 'Native Son', 2019, 'Drama', 'Rashid Johnson, Matthew Libatique, Jake Heineke', 'Suzan-Lori Parks', 'Ashton Sanders, Margaret Qualley, Nick Robinson, KiKi Layne, Bill Camp, Sanaa Lathan, Elizabeth Marvel, David Alan Grier', null, 'A young black man named Bigger Thomas takes a job working for a highly influential Chicago family, a decision that will change the course of his life forever.', 'A young black man named Bigger Thomas takes a job working for a highly influential Chicago family, a decision that will change the course of his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVF6CnjXLqAjK2crI1ielma18TW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512199'),
  ('456890446519534556', 'Nativity 2: Danger in the Manger!', 2012, 'Comedy, Family', 'Debbie Isitt, Sean Van Hales', 'Debbie Isitt', 'David Tennant, Marc Wootton, Pam Ferris, Jessica Hynes, Joanna Page, Jason Watkins, Ian McNeice, Ben Wilby', null, 'This sequel to the popular British comedy sees a new teacher (David Tennant) take over. When he enters his school in the National ''Song for Christmas'' Competition, he and his pregnant wife, and the schoolchildren, embark on an epic road trip that ends up with a birth and a donkey, where he must embrace his fears and become a hero.', 'This sequel to the popular British comedy sees a new teacher (David Tennant) take over. When he enters his school in the National ''Song for Christmas'' Competition, he and his pregnant wife, and the schoolchildren, embark on an epic road trip that ends up with a birth and a donkey, where he must embrace his fears and become a hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6FkBNdHWsRdt45HYMex7QYJOdN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139380'),
  ('961243382988747525', 'Nativity 3: Dude, Where''s My Donkey?!', 2014, 'Comedy, Family', 'Debbie Isitt, Sean Van Hales', 'Debbie Isitt', 'Martin Clunes, Marc Wootton, Catherine Tate, Jason Watkins, Susie Blake, Adam Garcia, Celia Imrie, Ben Wilby', null, 'This Christmas the pupils of St Bernadette''s and their much-loved, madcap teacher Mr. Poppy are back for their biggest adventure yet involving fantastic flashmobs, excitable elves, Christmas carols and of course Archie the donkey! When their new teacher Mr. Shepherd loses his memory and forgets all about Christmas, as well as his fiancée Sophie and the whereabouts of the beloved Archie, it''s up to the pupils of St Bernadette''s to save the day. Led by the ever enthusiastic Mr Poppy, they embark on a Christmas journey like never before - but time is against them if they are to help Mr Shepherd get to New York in time for his magical yuletide wedding!', 'This Christmas the pupils of St Bernadette''s and their much-loved, madcap teacher Mr. Poppy are back for their biggest adventure yet involving fantastic flashmobs, excitable elves, Christmas carols and of course Archie the donkey! When their new teacher Mr. Shepherd loses his memory and forgets all about Christmas, as well as his fiancée Sophie and the whereabouts of the beloved Archie, it''s up to the pupils of St Bernadette''s to save the day. Led by the ever enthusiastic Mr Poppy, they embark on a Christmas journey like never before - but time is against them if they are to help Mr Shepherd get to New York in time for his magical yuletide wedding!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19Noi6WCSFZJ5YVS6mlSWpiVeXX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295049'),
  ('630707583424453066', 'Nativity!', 2009, 'Comedy, Family', 'Debbie Isitt, Sean Van Hales, Jody Eldred', 'Debbie Isitt', 'Martin Freeman, Ashley Jensen, Marc Wootton, Pam Ferris, Jason Watkins, Ricky Tomlinson, Alan Carr, John Sessions', null, 'Paul, charged with directing his school''s Nativity play, falsely boasts that his ex-girlfriend plans to turn the production into a film.', 'Paul, charged with directing his school''s Nativity play, falsely boasts that his ex-girlfriend plans to turn the production into a film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2APY35DdgOmQIJlVpnjI7Kanjyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49522'),
