  ('1083836300347403954', 'Nato a Casal di Principe', 2017, 'Drama', 'Bruno Oliviero', 'Maurizio Braucci, Massimiliano Virgilio', 'Alessio Lapice, Massimiliano Gallo, Donatella Finocchiaro, Francesco Pellegrino, Paolo Marco Caterino, Antonio Pennarella, Liliana Fiorelli, Antonella Stefanucci', null, 'In the late 1980s, Amedeo Letizia, a young 20 something Italian, leaves his hometown of Casal di Principe to pursue a career in acting in Rome. While he''s making his debut, his younger brother Paolo is kidnapped by armed men. Amedeo comes back, this return being an infernal descent into his past and his region''s contradictions.', 'In the late 1980s, Amedeo Letizia, a young 20 something Italian, leaves his hometown of Casal di Principe to pursue a career in acting in Rome. While he''s making his debut, his younger brother Paolo is kidnapped by armed men. Amedeo comes back, this return being an infernal descent into his past and his region''s contradictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjdUn3mprcGeIp66q3GqVan6Evo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473670'),
  ('491055670319392534', 'Natsume''s Book of Friends the Movie: Ephemeral Bond', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Miyuki Ooshiro, Ena Nishikawa, Miyuki Ooshiro', 'Sadayuki Murai', 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kazuma Horie, Ryohei Kimura, Hisayoshi Suganuma, Rina Sato, Akemi Okamura, Akira Ishida', null, 'Natsume has been busy, navigating between humans and Yokai when he coincidentally reunites with an old classmate, Yuki. It brings back painful memories of a certain Yokai. Meanwhile, Natsume also became acquainted with Yorie Tsumura, a woman in the memories of a Yokai whose name he had returned. Yorie knew much about Reiko, but now lived a peaceful life with her only son, Mukuo. Being with this family was comforting for Natsume, but apparently a mysterious Yokai has been lurking in their town. On the way back from investigating, a “Yokai seed” that had latched itself to Nyanko Sensei drops into the Fujiwaras’ garden and grows overnight into a fruit tree. When Nyanko Sensei eats a fruit that is somehow shaped like himself, he suddenly splits into three!', 'Natsume has been busy, navigating between humans and Yokai when he coincidentally reunites with an old classmate, Yuki. It brings back painful memories of a certain Yokai. Meanwhile, Natsume also became acquainted with Yorie Tsumura, a woman in the memories of a Yokai whose name he had returned. Yorie knew much about Reiko, but now lived a peaceful life with her only son, Mukuo. Being with this family was comforting for Natsume, but apparently a mysterious Yokai has been lurking in their town. On the way back from investigating, a “Yokai seed” that had latched itself to Nyanko Sensei drops into the Fujiwaras’ garden and grows overnight into a fruit tree. When Nyanko Sensei eats a fruit that is somehow shaped like himself, he suddenly splits into three!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LVV47JaRHa1OXrQv5l6XSyfW50.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507411'),
  ('990514245647064877', 'Natsume''s Book of Friends: The Waking Rock and the Strange Visitor', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Miyuki Ooshiro, Hideki Ito, Eri Yamazaki', 'Sadayuki Murai, Takahiro Omori', 'Hiroshi Kamiya, Kazuhiko Inoue, Kazuma Horie, Takaya Kuroda, Akemi Okamura, Cho, Hisako Kanemoto', null, 'The film will be made up of two stories: "Ishi Okoshi" and "Ayashiki Raihousha." In "Ishi Okoshi," Natsume meets a small youkai called Mitsumi in a forest. Mitsumi is entrusted to wake up the divine youkai "Iwatetsu" from its deep slumber. Mitsumi weighs on Natsume''s mind, so he sets out to help Mitsumi with his task. In "Ayashiki Raihousha," a mysterious visitor appears in front of Tanuma. Nearly every day, the visitor visits Tanuma, talks to him a little, and then leaves. Natsume, who knows the visitor is a youkai, worries for Tanuma, but Tanuma enjoys these exchanges with the youkai. The youkai means no harm, but Tanuma''s health slowly starts to deteriorate.', 'The film will be made up of two stories: "Ishi Okoshi" and "Ayashiki Raihousha." In "Ishi Okoshi," Natsume meets a small youkai called Mitsumi in a forest. Mitsumi is entrusted to wake up the divine youkai "Iwatetsu" from its deep slumber. Mitsumi weighs on Natsume''s mind, so he sets out to help Mitsumi with his task. In "Ayashiki Raihousha," a mysterious visitor appears in front of Tanuma. Nearly every day, the visitor visits Tanuma, talks to him a little, and then leaves. Natsume, who knows the visitor is a youkai, worries for Tanuma, but Tanuma enjoys these exchanges with the youkai. The youkai means no harm, but Tanuma''s health slowly starts to deteriorate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPbXjQCskGTgHLPiuaOrP7VgFtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773621'),
  ('554063018529475672', 'Natty Knocks', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dwight H. Little', 'Benjamin Olson', 'Bill Moseley, Danielle Harris, Robert Englund, Charlotte Fountain-Jardim, Thomas Robie, Noen Perez, Channah Zeitung, Joey Bothwell', 'R', 'On Halloween Eve, Britt and the kids she is babysitting have to survive the horror of serial killer Abner Honeywell, who is himself the traumatized son of B-movie horror legend "Natty Knocks".', 'On Halloween Eve, Britt and the kids she is babysitting have to survive the horror of serial killer Abner Honeywell, who is himself the traumatized son of B-movie horror legend "Natty Knocks".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPqcRBBb4PpE0WyHwQZdlTjfLXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:960469'),
  ('35372120821449247', 'Natural Born Killers', 1994, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson', 'David Veloz, Richard Rutowski, Oliver Stone', 'Woody Harrelson, Juliette Lewis, Robert Downey Jr., Tommy Lee Jones, Tom Sizemore, Rodney Dangerfield, Edie McClurg, Jared Harris', 'R', 'Two victims of traumatized childhoods become lovers and serial murderers irresponsibly glorified by the mass media.', 'Two victims of traumatized childhoods become lovers and serial murderers irresponsibly glorified by the mass media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEKZwT91gxvkAoyPgpNXo8W5fu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241'),
  ('848477287693997790', 'Natural Born Liar', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Baroux, Arnaud Stefani, Alain Braconnier', 'Olivier Baroux, Émile Gaudreault, Eric K. Boulianne', 'Tarek Boudali, Artus, Pauline Clément, Catherine Hosmalin, Karim Belkhadra, Florence Muller, Louise Coldefy, Bertrand Usclat', null, 'Jerome, 35, is a yacht salesman in Nice. But if you listen to him, in his spare time Jerome is also an astronaut, a karate world champion and a close friend of Miss Universe. As a matter of fact Jerome is a compulsive liar: he lies to everyone about everything! No one believes him, but that doesn’t prevent him from accumulating more lies. But one day Jerome wakes up to find out that all his lies have come true... and it’s just the beginning of the troubles ...!', 'Jerome, 35, is a yacht salesman in Nice. But if you listen to him, in his spare time Jerome is also an astronaut, a karate world champion and a close friend of Miss Universe. As a matter of fact Jerome is a compulsive liar: he lies to everyone about everything! No one believes him, but that doesn’t prevent him from accumulating more lies. But one day Jerome wakes up to find out that all his lies have come true... and it’s just the beginning of the troubles ...!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6onhfIc1qxGGX5qOSKxJXkQqdnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829165'),
  ('879349165829777408', 'Natural City', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Byung-chun Min, Lee Jun-gyu', 'Byung-chun Min', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Lee Jae-eun, Rin Seo, Jung Eun-pyo, Jung Doo-hong, Kim Eul-dong, Go Ju-hui, Chang Yun', null, 'Two cops, R and Noma, hunt down renegade cyborgs. Cyborgs are used as commandos by the military, as lust objects and for companionship. Normaly they have a limited lifespan of three years but black market technology is being developed to be able to transfer a cyborg''s artificial intelligence into human host. This drives R to find a suitable host for his expiring cyborg Ria.', 'Two cops, R and Noma, hunt down renegade cyborgs. Cyborgs are used as commandos by the military, as lust objects and for companionship. Normaly they have a limited lifespan of three years but black market technology is being developed to be able to transfer a cyborg''s artificial intelligence into human host. This drives R to find a suitable host for his expiring cyborg Ria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjuRpVj192XZvREDBu8Yrygp45x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14573'),
  ('487203360155881638', 'Natural Disasters', 2020, 'Drama', 'Tine DiLucia, Connie Shi', 'Connie Shi', 'Quinn Franzen, Alyssa Kempinski, Yessenia Rivas', null, 'After attempting her first threesome, Sammy begins to question her relationship, her sexuality, and herself.', 'After attempting her first threesome, Sammy begins to question her relationship, her sexuality, and herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4tDqbdcyhjro61AWbIwDVNVsQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740056'),
  ('682655064199661409', 'Natural Enemies', 1979, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jeff Kanew, Richard E. Brooks', 'Jeff Kanew', 'Hal Holbrook, Louise Fletcher, Peter Armstrong, Elizabeth Berridge, José Ferrer, Viveca Lindfors, Alisha Fontaine, Steve Austin', null, 'Paul Steward, editor of a scientific journal, considers his life to be an empty failure. Awake one morning after a sleepless night, he comes to a decision: this evening he will take a rifle and shoot and kill his wife, their three children and then himself.', 'Paul Steward, editor of a scientific journal, considers his life to be an empty failure. Awake one morning after a sleepless night, he comes to a decision: this evening he will take a rifle and shoot and kill his wife, their three children and then himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3vbLXDbvalOrs4IxpaOgyplii5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106729'),
  ('751657812584208355', 'Natural Enemy', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Douglas Jackson, Rodney Gibbons, Michael A. Williams', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'Donald Sutherland, William McNamara, Lesley Ann Warren, Joe Pantoliano, Tia Carrere, Christian Tessier, Lenore Zann, Rosemary Dunsmore', null, 'A businessman (Donald Sutherland) has a hotshot young new partner (William McNamara). What he doesn''t realize is that his new partner is the son of his second wife, adopted into an abusive family at birth and now a raving psychopath out to murder his natural mother for whom he blames the miseries of his lifetime.', 'A businessman (Donald Sutherland) has a hotshot young new partner (William McNamara). What he doesn''t realize is that his new partner is the son of his second wife, adopted into an abusive family at birth and now a raving psychopath out to murder his natural mother for whom he blames the miseries of his lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4n2MqhQ0WakX4QyCBNgRxEA0rS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32449'),
  ('830063155094646924', 'Natural History Suite', 1967, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Zdeněk Šibrava', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'An eight-part animated portrait of various species, accompanied by a different style of music. The various parts are: Aquatilia (foxtrot), Hexapoda (bolero), Pisces (blues), Reptilia (tarantella), Aves (tango), Mammalia (minuet), Simiae (polka) and Homo (waltz). Each animation mixes drawings, pictures, real animals and animated skeletons.', 'An eight-part animated portrait of various species, accompanied by a different style of music. The various parts are: Aquatilia (foxtrot), Hexapoda (bolero), Pisces (blues), Reptilia (tarantella), Aves (tango), Mammalia (minuet), Simiae (polka) and Homo (waltz). Each animation mixes drawings, pictures, real animals and animated skeletons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqK2LDKmQTbj2oi1BabuXngP0YB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19001'),
  ('273839595126524150', 'Natural Lefty', 2022, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Allocca, Francesco di Pierro, Giulio Donato', 'Salvatore Allocca, Emiliano Corapi, Massimo De Angelis', 'Claudia Gerini, Alessio Perinelli, Francesco Colella, Katia Ricciarelli, Alessio Vassallo, Giandomenico Cupaiuolo, Alessandro Bressanello, Stefano Scandaletti', null, 'A widowed mother, tries desperately to get an entry into the ruthless world of professional football for her 12-yer-old son.', 'A widowed mother, tries desperately to get an entry into the ruthless world of professional football for her 12-yer-old son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aD90zj1B0r8R9WZdqpIcHZiJkgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:831034'),
  ('757250163848930167', 'Natural Light', 2021, 'War, Drama, History', 'Dénes Nagy, Tamás Dobos', 'Dénes Nagy', 'Szabó Ferenc, Tamás Garbacz, László Bajkó, Gyula Franczia, Stuhl Erno, Zsolt Fodor, Csaba Nánási, Krisztián Kozó', null, 'World War II, occupied Soviet Union. István Semetka is a simple Hungarian farmer who serves as a Sub-Lieutenant in a special unit scouting for partisan groups. On their way to a remote village, his company falls under enemy fire. As the commander is killed, Semetka has to overcome his fears and take command of the unit as he is dragged into a chaos that he cannot control.', 'World War II, occupied Soviet Union. István Semetka is a simple Hungarian farmer who serves as a Sub-Lieutenant in a special unit scouting for partisan groups. On their way to a remote village, his company falls under enemy fire. As the commander is killed, Semetka has to overcome his fears and take command of the unit as he is dragged into a chaos that he cannot control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yws7TVzBWNK6zvrfRuD2TFFCFwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669661'),
  ('417890727847135148', 'Natural Sciences', 2014, 'Drama', 'Sebastián Ferrero, Matías Lucchesi', 'Gonzalo Salaya, Matías Lucchesi', 'Paula Galinelli Hertzog, Paola Barrientos, Alvin Astorga, Sergio Boris, Arturo Goetz, Vanessa Weinberg', null, 'In a rural school in the middle of the mountains, a girl who is starting to become a woman feels the profound need to discover her true identity. She does not know who her father is and she is determined to find him, but her mother does not approve it. The hostility of winter in such a harsh place turns this desire into a real threat: freezing in the middle of nowhere. Going behind the backs of the school authorities and the girl''s mother, her teacher decides to help her. They set off on this quest for truth, but it is not going to be an easy journey... Their only clue is a small, rusty plate.', 'In a rural school in the middle of the mountains, a girl who is starting to become a woman feels the profound need to discover her true identity. She does not know who her father is and she is determined to find him, but her mother does not approve it. The hostility of winter in such a harsh place turns this desire into a real threat: freezing in the middle of nowhere. Going behind the backs of the school authorities and the girl''s mother, her teacher decides to help her. They set off on this quest for truth, but it is not going to be an easy journey... Their only clue is a small, rusty plate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/br1ogbHAthia4NwNz1sXABuErpY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259843'),
  ('300481016248956884', 'Natural Selection', 2016, 'Drama, Crime', 'Chad L. Scheifele, Brandon Ripley', 'Chad L. Scheifele', 'Mason Dye, Ryan Munzert, Anthony Michael Hall, Katherine McNamara, Amy Carlson, Esther Zynn, Tyler Elliot Burke, Ryan Boudreau', null, 'Tyler is a young man who is desperately seeking direction from a world that seems to have abandoned him. Searching for answers he looks to his new friend Indrid who appears to have it all figured out.', 'Tyler is a young man who is desperately seeking direction from a world that seems to have abandoned him. Searching for answers he looks to his new friend Indrid who appears to have it all figured out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acuvfhljS3xlRw6fSOIMXjmJ2Qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364690'),
  ('374893824736218220', 'Nature of Love', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Justin Sebastian, Marita Grabiak', 'Barbara Kymlicka, Uma Incrocci', 'Emilie Ullerup, Christopher Russell, Donna Benedicto, Eric Gustafsson, Erin Boyes, Catherine Lough Haggquist', null, 'City girl Katie is writing a magazine feature on a glamping resort. Far from sporty, she faces her fears trying the camp’s activities with help from Will, a rugged outdoorsman and nature guide.', 'City girl Katie is writing a magazine feature on a glamping resort. Far from sporty, she faces her fears trying the camp’s activities with help from Will, a rugged outdoorsman and nature guide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDs9boSQ07zSKMeR6IFAXmUQh63.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677211'),
