  ('235844656209226729', 'Nazi Love Camp 27', 1977, 'Drama', 'Mario Caiano, Sergio Martinelli, Eduardo Salerno', 'Mario Caiano', 'Sirpa Lane, Giancarlo Sisti, Roberto Posse, Gianfilippo Carcano, Piero Lulli, Marzia Ubaldi, Renata Moar, Isabella Russo', 'R', 'When World War II breaks out, two German lovers are cruelly separated. While he is sent to fight at the front, she, a Jewish girl, is sent to a concentration camp where humiliation and death have been elevated to a sinister art.', 'When World War II breaks out, two German lovers are cruelly separated. While he is sent to fight at the front, she, a Jewish girl, is sent to a concentration camp where humiliation and death have been elevated to a sinister art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1m2EtnJJLy1KiDju3mV73O5Ta8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32300'),
  ('997955152720105085', 'Nazi Overlord', 2018, 'Action, Horror, Mystery', 'Brendan Petrizzo, Scotty Mullen, Rob Pallatina', 'Scotty Mullen', 'Tom Sizemore, Dominique Swain, Anthony Jensen, Andrew Liberty, Greg Furman, Damian Joseph Quinn, Michael Claman, Matthew Amerman', 'NR', 'A D-Day rescue mission turns ugly when a band of Allied soldiers battle with horrific experiments created by the Nazis.', 'A D-Day rescue mission turns ugly when a band of Allied soldiers battle with horrific experiments created by the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLL6Uy6QUskX7NgZOq4XAFQcuog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:561546'),
  ('1117264999435581127', 'Nazi Supersoldier', 2024, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Ahmed Chaer, Ugur Dogan, Alexander Lentner', 'Ahmed Chaer', 'Erkan Sulcani, Linus Gomolka, Roman Boeer de Garcez, Leontin Slavkov, Antonia Catharina Düwel, Leah Herold, Georges Khoukaz, Jakob Pinter', null, 'A group of journalism students ventures into a remote forest and awakens a long-frozen World War II experiment a superhuman Nazi soldier. Hunted through cursed woods where trust crumbles and survival is slim, they soon learn that some sins demand blood.', 'A group of journalism students ventures into a remote forest and awakens a long-frozen World War II experiment a superhuman Nazi soldier. Hunted through cursed woods where trust crumbles and survival is slim, they soon learn that some sins demand blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3daBOc5ZcICXMzAVNhzJTSgweaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301122'),
  ('1061569630401848783', 'Nazis at the Center of the Earth', 2012, 'Adventure, Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Joseph J. Lawson, Alexander Yellen, Tim Gagliardo', 'Paul Bales', 'Dominique Swain, Jake Busey, Trevor Kuhn, Lilan Bowden, Marlene Okner, Jon Kondelik, Jordan James Smith, Christopher Karl Johnson', 'R', 'A group of researchers in Antarctica are abducted by a platoon of masked soldiers and dragged into a hidden continent in the center of the Earth. There, they discover that surviving Nazi soldiers are plotting an invasion of Earth to revive the Third Reich.', 'A group of researchers in Antarctica are abducted by a platoon of masked soldiers and dragged into a hidden continent in the center of the Earth. There, they discover that surviving Nazi soldiers are plotting an invasion of Earth to revive the Third Reich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/navS5NXLXdfjkovl5iQoCvGoROB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100089'),
  ('126535847629367234', 'Nazis in the CIA', 2013, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Dirk Pohlmann', 'Dirk Pohlmann', 'Till C. Hagen, Klaus Barbie, Allen Dallas, Stefano Delle Chiaie, Paul Dickopf, Wilhelm Dietl, John Dinges, Karl Bernd Esser', null, 'Florian Hartung and Dirk Pohlmann have reconstructed a previously unknown dimension of the collaboration between Nazis and the CIA in the Cold War. Drawing upon recently released documents, the film exposes for the first time a perfidious, worldwide net that reaches deep into the power structures of the Federal Republic of Germany. Lending their authority to the fact-finders’ mission are high-ranking statesmen, journalists and historians.', 'Florian Hartung and Dirk Pohlmann have reconstructed a previously unknown dimension of the collaboration between Nazis and the CIA in the Cold War. Drawing upon recently released documents, the film exposes for the first time a perfidious, worldwide net that reaches deep into the power structures of the Federal Republic of Germany. Lending their authority to the fact-finders’ mission are high-ranking statesmen, journalists and historians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6ynt6LOQCMSl6W5fe938ar69EW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499580'),
  ('805164158503521596', 'Nazty Nuisance', 1943, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Glenn Tryon, Robert Pittack', 'Clarence Marks, Earle Snell', 'Bobby Watson, Joe Devlin, Frank Faylen, Johnny Arthur, Emory Parnell, Jean Porter, Ian Keith', 'NR', 'Germany''s Adolf Hitler, with his Axis-stooges, Italy''s Mussolini and Japan''s Suki Yama, although he tried to avoid taking them, is on his way, via submarine, to a tropical country to negotiate a treaty with the High Chief Paj Mab. However, an American P.T-boat crew is already there and have some plans for schickenbit-grubber and his buddies.', 'Germany''s Adolf Hitler, with his Axis-stooges, Italy''s Mussolini and Japan''s Suki Yama, although he tried to avoid taking them, is on his way, via submarine, to a tropical country to negotiate a treaty with the High Chief Paj Mab. However, an American P.T-boat crew is already there and have some plans for schickenbit-grubber and his buddies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NAaG3Cmthegvwe6ZAcyN45iVw5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100814'),
