  ('1109419148444208842', 'Nebahat The Driver', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Süreyya Duru', 'Attila İlhan, Duygu Sağıroğlu', 'Fatma Girik, İzzet Günay, Münir Özkul, Ali Şen, Kayhan Yıldızoğlu, Metin Serezli, Oya Peri, Nedret Güvenç', null, 'Having to bring money to her home after her father''s death, Nebahat starts working as a driver, a completely male-dominated job.', 'Having to bring money to her home after her father''s death, Nebahat starts working as a driver, a completely male-dominated job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T6MjOk7UvkTyjGbfI5QhB1Ga59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479018'),
