  ('981857386393908769', 'Necessary Evil: Super-Villains of DC Comics', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Scott Devine, J.M. Kenny', 'J.M. Kenny, Scott Devine', 'Christopher Lee, Guillermo del Toro, Zack Snyder, Clancy Brown, Kevin Conroy, Richard Donner, Andrea Romano, Jim Lee', 'NR', 'A documentary detailing the epic Rogues'' Gallery of DC Comics from The Joker and Lex Luthor, Sinestro, Darkseid and more, this documentary will explore the Super Villains of DC Comics.', 'A documentary detailing the epic Rogues'' Gallery of DC Comics from The Joker and Lex Luthor, Sinestro, Darkseid and more, this documentary will explore the Super Villains of DC Comics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwmQO1KieVUWLqgP4PMyl1r4fVZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229979'),
  ('456368890295278957', 'Necessary Roughness', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Stan Dragoti, John Hockridge, Peter Stein', 'Rick Natkin, David Fuller', 'Scott Bakula, Robert Loggia, Harley Jane Kozak, Larry Miller, Héctor Elizondo, Sinbad, Fred Thompson, Rob Schneider', 'PG-13', 'When the Texas State University Fightin'' Armadillos football team is disqualified for cheating and poor grades, the University is forced to pick from a team that actually goes to school. Will they even win a single game?', 'When the Texas State University Fightin'' Armadillos football team is disqualified for cheating and poor grades, the University is forced to pick from a team that actually goes to school. Will they even win a single game?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZsD4izDMKbV1KTRUQ5UVWZrnLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20704'),
