  ('725269651726871488', 'Necrology', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Standish Lawder', null, null, null, 'The faces of a 5:00 PM crowd descending via the Pan Am building escalators in one continuous shot. In old-fashioned black and white, these faces stare into the empty space, in the 5:00 PM tiredness and mechanical impersonality, like faces from the grave.', 'The faces of a 5:00 PM crowd descending via the Pan Am building escalators in one continuous shot. In old-fashioned black and white, these faces stare into the empty space, in the 5:00 PM tiredness and mechanical impersonality, like faces from the grave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz6ggHxcE2rjZGpuQ2LrVPpLEmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111161'),
  ('61177910231818366', 'Necromancer', 1988, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dusty Nelson, Eric Cayla, Richard Clabaugh', 'William T. Naud', 'Elizabeth Kaitan, John Tyler, Rhonda Dorton, Stan Hurwitz, Lisa Beth Wilson, Ed Wright, Russ Tamblyn, David Flynn', 'R', 'Julie, a college student, is sexually assaulted by two fellow students. Desperate for revenge, she makes contact with a necromancer, who begins using her demonic powers to get rid of any guy Julie hates.', 'Julie, a college student, is sexually assaulted by two fellow students. Desperate for revenge, she makes contact with a necromancer, who begins using her demonic powers to get rid of any guy Julie hates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9oGVJtvYInHpBIOYny1LsrmNCtM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110976'),
  ('1099042213868999999', 'Necromancer', 2005, 'Horror, Crime, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Piyapan Choopetch, Nattawut Kittikhun', 'Piyapan Choopetch, Kittikorn Liasirikun', 'Chatchai Plengpanich, Akara Amarttayakul, Tom Dundee, Prasart Thongaram, Nattawut Eurmpornwanich, Worrasit Cheepsatit, Anocha Kulwong, Sompong Tawee', null, 'Using his powerful knowledge of black magic, corrupt former cop and necromancer Itti manages to escape from prison. The case is assigned to Lieutenant Santi, who is tasked with tracking down the escapee. Sensing Itti''s supernatural powers, Santi soon realizes that to confront and capture him, he will have to transform himself into a necromancer.', 'Using his powerful knowledge of black magic, corrupt former cop and necromancer Itti manages to escape from prison. The case is assigned to Lieutenant Santi, who is tasked with tracking down the escapee. Sensing Itti''s supernatural powers, Santi soon realizes that to confront and capture him, he will have to transform himself into a necromancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsOGX3un6KCcEoEf89JZOAxvtWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247674'),
  ('1109484062976238402', 'Necromancer 2020', 2019, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Nattawut Kittikhun, Piyapan Choopetch, Woramat Na Garasin', 'Piyapan Choopetch, Adirek Watleela', 'Prin Suparat, Chatchai Plengpanich, Jirayu Thantrakul, Sinjai Plengpanich, Chicha Amatayakul, Pitchapa Phanthumchinda, Sahatchai Chumrum, Nuttanun Kunnawatt', null, 'Win has to master powerful sorcery to seek revenge against the people who attacked him for his father''s amulet. However, a satanic cult gets in his way and corrupts his girlfriend''s mind.', 'Win has to master powerful sorcery to seek revenge against the people who attacked him for his father''s amulet. However, a satanic cult gets in his way and corrupts his girlfriend''s mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kvAPIS6vAlLHQnALhSzidBqzhaM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628044'),
  ('480359711930635252', 'Necromancy', 1972, 'Horror', 'Bert I. Gordon, Winton C. Hoch', 'Bert I. Gordon', 'Orson Welles, Pamela Franklin, Lee Purcell, Michael Ontkean, Harvey Jason, Lisa James, Sue Bernard, Carl Solomon', 'PG', 'After Lori suffers a stillbirth, her husband Frank obtains a job with a northern California toy company. Frank''s new boss, the mysterious Mr. Cato, explains that Frank''s position will involve magic. Cato, who seemingly holds enormous influence over the town, pursues the power of necromancy and believes that Lori holds the key that will help him resurrect his own dead son.', 'After Lori suffers a stillbirth, her husband Frank obtains a job with a northern California toy company. Frank''s new boss, the mysterious Mr. Cato, explains that Frank''s position will involve magic. Cato, who seemingly holds enormous influence over the town, pursues the power of necromancy and believes that Lori holds the key that will help him resurrect his own dead son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQHyzMR8t9lR1eB1e2Nyt6J31IP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42487'),
  ('228325731836306863', 'Necromentia', 2009, 'Horror', 'Pearry Reginald Teo, Darin Meyer', 'Stephanie Joyce', 'Layton Matthews, Chad Grimes, Santiago Craig, Zelieann Rivera, Cole Braxton, Zach Cümer, Crow Garrett, Nathan Ginn', 'NR', 'A off-world look at the superstitious repercussions of tattooing an Ouija Board on your body. Hagen, who has a dead wife believes that he can revive her from the dead. Travis, a man who lost his brother and wants to join him in the after life. Morbius, a bartender who is betrayed by those he loves comes back from the dead to take revenge.', 'A off-world look at the superstitious repercussions of tattooing an Ouija Board on your body. Hagen, who has a dead wife believes that he can revive her from the dead. Travis, a man who lost his brother and wants to join him in the after life. Morbius, a bartender who is betrayed by those he loves comes back from the dead to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4kTEqDXomDKYqNBjcsoQKIElepD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24505'),
  ('62321702068977653', 'Necronomicon', 1993, 'Horror', 'Christophe Gans, Shusuke Kaneko, Brian Yuzna', 'Brent V. Friedman, Christophe Gans, Kazunori Ito', 'Jeffrey Combs, Tony Azito, Juan Fernández, Brian Yuzna, Bruce Payne, Belinda Bauer, Richard Lynch, Maria Ford', 'R', 'H.P. Lovecraft anthology is divided into four segments: "The Library" which is the wraparound segment involving Lovecraft''s research into the Book of The Dead and his unwitting release of a monster and his writing of the following horror segments "The Drowned", "The Cold", and "Whispers".', 'H.P. Lovecraft anthology is divided into four segments: "The Library" which is the wraparound segment involving Lovecraft''s research into the Book of The Dead and his unwitting release of a monster and his writing of the following horror segments "The Drowned", "The Cold", and "Whispers".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azUXnXC40LKxatud3sO8DvH1xR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32998'),
  ('532165199495578195', 'Necronomicon – The Book of Hell', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Santiago Guidi, André Sittoni, Marcelo Schapces', 'Marcelo Schapces, Ricardo Romero, Luciano Saracino', 'Diego Velázquez, María Laura Cali, Victoria Maurette, Nico García, Claudio Da Passano, Claudio Martínez Bel, Luis Ventura, Juan Sasturain', null, 'A librarian founds a copy of the fabled Necronomicon, only unleash hell on earth.', 'A librarian founds a copy of the fabled Necronomicon, only unleash hell on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9C4UhSXlsttDtidd14IBc3AaiKB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514622'),
  ('1034270834615613210', 'Necrophile Passion', 2013, 'Horror', 'Tom Heidenberg', 'Tom Heidenberg', 'Günther Brandl, Eldrid Remy, Katharina Buchberger, Sandra Pucher', null, 'Solitary and alone, left by his girlfriend, after being treated badly by her, a young man finds a female body in the woods. His conscience tells him to call the police, but something inside him, something evil commands him to take the corpse with him and satisfy his darkest desires. His Life is total pieces of trash and only the love to the female corpse gives him the power to continue his life. But he hasn''t finished with his girlfriend yet and so he decides that it''s time to get his revenge once and for all. Who will be the winner in this love triangle? The man, the woman or the corpse?', 'Solitary and alone, left by his girlfriend, after being treated badly by her, a young man finds a female body in the woods. His conscience tells him to call the police, but something inside him, something evil commands him to take the corpse with him and satisfy his darkest desires. His Life is total pieces of trash and only the love to the female corpse gives him the power to continue his life. But he hasn''t finished with his girlfriend yet and so he decides that it''s time to get his revenge once and for all. Who will be the winner in this love triangle? The man, the woman or the corpse?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4uTVr9zukiTEQsQuER8fzHLJHb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:233881'),
  ('19777689181405803', 'Necropolis', 1970, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Franco Brocani, Franco Lecca, Caroline Laure', 'Franco Brocani', 'Nicoletta Machiavelli, Tina Aumont, Pierre Clémenti, Paul Jabara, Carmelo Bene, Bruno Corazzari, Paolo Graziosi, Louis Waldon', null, 'Frankenstein''s monster gropes towards the awareness that his mind is a universe; Attila, naked on a white horse, liberates his people from their ignominy; the ultra-caustic Viva bemoans the frustrations of married life and drifts into the elegiac persona of the Bloody Countess Bathory; Louis Waldon is a hip American tourist searching for the (missing) Mona Lisa.', 'Frankenstein''s monster gropes towards the awareness that his mind is a universe; Attila, naked on a white horse, liberates his people from their ignominy; the ultra-caustic Viva bemoans the frustrations of married life and drifts into the elegiac persona of the Bloody Countess Bathory; Louis Waldon is a hip American tourist searching for the (missing) Mona Lisa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pAoToc0TckZ0Nk4Rfq72CSyTE3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201604'),
  ('626336577814318991', 'Necropolis', 1986, 'Horror', 'Bruce Hickey, Arthur D. Marks, Rebecca Rothbaum', 'Bruce Hickey', 'LeeAnne Baker, Jacquie Fitz, Michael Conte, William K. Reed, Paul Ruben, Andrew Bausili, Gy Mirano, Letnam Yekim', 'R', 'A reincarnated "Satanic Witch" from New Amsterdam, circa 1600''s comes back to revive her cult members by sucking the life force out of people.', 'A reincarnated "Satanic Witch" from New Amsterdam, circa 1600''s comes back to revive her cult members by sucking the life force out of people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVY1TUU0uktvkRHLlTpiTDeit8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75077'),
  ('192710464636397941', 'Necropolis', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bob Heuisler Jr., Ondra Berry II, Eric L. Jones', 'Ondra Berry II', 'Noel Gugliemi, Scott Swope, Tim Rook, Kevin Tan, Eric Martinez', null, 'A former soldier and orphan navigate a pandemic-ravaged world to reach Site R, battling marauders and government agents hunting them for a dangerous secret. Their survival tests humanity in "Necropolis."', 'A former soldier and orphan navigate a pandemic-ravaged world to reach Site R, battling marauders and government agents hunting them for a dangerous secret. Their survival tests humanity in "Necropolis."', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FyPIyrZ6u0HKztH0zJbvMtw7q2xt.jpg', 'plex:movie:necropolis-2026'),
  ('517203744283923863', 'Necropolis Symphony', 2014, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Fantasy', 'Daniele Aldrovandi, Tarsila Araújo, Daniel Chaia', 'Juliana Rojas', 'Eduardo Gomes, Luciana Paes, Hugo Villavicenzio, Paulo Jordão, Germano Melo, Luís Mármora, Adriana Mendonça, Antonio Velloso', 'PG', 'In the city of São Paulo, the routine of gravedigger apprentice Deodato changes when a new working girl arrives at the cemetery. Together, they must re-register the abandoned tombs, but strange events make the apprentice wonder about the consequences of messing with the dead.', 'In the city of São Paulo, the routine of gravedigger apprentice Deodato changes when a new working girl arrives at the cemetery. Together, they must re-register the abandoned tombs, but strange events make the apprentice wonder about the consequences of messing with the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IGRxaEUtxTzLI0P5lnXhbIg1QN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288436'),
  ('481911993880860098', 'Nectar', 2014, 'Drama', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović, Manuel Dacosse', 'Lucile Hadžihalilović', 'Olga Riazanova, Karl Sarafidis, Aude-Laurence Clermont Biver, Brigitte Lo Cicero', null, 'A round chamber in a park, where five women perform a ritual they know well. The queen gives her nectar. Yet a new cycle is already under way.', 'A round chamber in a park, where five women perform a ritual they know well. The queen gives her nectar. Yet a new cycle is already under way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atQ3hkBm6JBFCYDOtQKlWB9HWA7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385856'),
  ('1147489822075995628', 'Ned Kelly', 1970, 'Drama, Action, Western', 'Tony Richardson, Gerry Fisher', 'Tony Richardson, Ian Jones', 'Mick Jagger, Clarissa Kaye-Mason, Mark McManus, Ken Goodlet, Frank Thring, Bruce Barry, Tony Bazell, Allen Bickford', 'PG', 'Unable to support his family in the Australian outback, a man turns to stealing horses in order to make money. He gets more deeply drawn into the outlaw life, and eventually becomes involved in murders. Based on the life of famed 19th-century Australian outlaw Ned Kelly.', 'Unable to support his family in the Australian outback, a man turns to stealing horses in order to make money. He gets more deeply drawn into the outlaw life, and eventually becomes involved in murders. Based on the life of famed 19th-century Australian outlaw Ned Kelly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnOunMa3i3L915F5eBxJvjkMCYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38978'),
  ('940424666142258088', 'Ned Kelly', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Oliver Stapleton, Gregor Jordan, Brad Shield', 'John Michael McDonagh', 'Heath Ledger, Orlando Bloom, Geoffrey Rush, Naomi Watts, Joel Edgerton, Laurence Kinlan, Philip Barantini, Kerry Condon', 'R', 'After getting threatened by Kelly''s friends and family, Constable Fitzpatrick places the blame on Ned Kelly and exaggerates what happened. With the biggest ever award available, Kelly and his gang set into the wild, to remain hidden from everyone who seeks them. Even if it means having his family arrested, the members of the Kelly Gang stay hidden and plan a way to get their names cleared.', 'After getting threatened by Kelly''s friends and family, Constable Fitzpatrick places the blame on Ned Kelly and exaggerates what happened. With the biggest ever award available, Kelly and his gang set into the wild, to remain hidden from everyone who seeks them. Even if it means having his family arrested, the members of the Kelly Gang stay hidden and plan a way to get their names cleared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmGQsMbXKELzD4n78uMoCsgJPi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10544'),
  ('33974037920063741', 'Neds', 2010, 'Drama', 'Peter Mullan, Roman Osin', 'Peter Mullan', 'Conor McCarron, Mhairi Anderson, Martin Bell, Joe Cassidy, Linda Cuthbert, Alex Donald, John Joe Hay, Gary Lewis', null, 'NEDs (Non Educated Delinquents) is the story of a young man’s journey from prize-winning schoolboy to knife-carrying teenager. Struggling against the low expectations of those around him, John McGill changes from victim to avenger, scholar to NED, altar boy to glue sniffer. When he attempts to change back again, his new reality and recent past make conformity near impossible and violent self determination near inevitable.', 'NEDs (Non Educated Delinquents) is the story of a young man’s journey from prize-winning schoolboy to knife-carrying teenager. Struggling against the low expectations of those around him, John McGill changes from victim to avenger, scholar to NED, altar boy to glue sniffer. When he attempts to change back again, his new reality and recent past make conformity near impossible and violent self determination near inevitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a964EBCChUHims8RxfU1LC0rws0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55785'),
  ('538018956004195167', 'Nee Forever', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ashok Kumar Kalaivani', 'Ashok Kumar Kalaivani', 'chella, Sudharshan Govind, Y. G. Mahendran, Archana Ravi, Nizhalgal Ravi', null, 'A Gen Z couple meets via dating app. Their relationship unfolds with unexpected consequences.', 'A Gen Z couple meets via dating app. Their relationship unfolds with unexpected consequences.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BN2ZlZGRlYWItOWE1YS00Mjg2LWJiNDktMWJmN2VlYmUyM2M0XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:nee-forever'),
  ('440820527629892073', 'Need for Speed', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Scott Waugh, Shane Hurlbut', 'George Gatins', 'Aaron Paul, Dominic Cooper, Imogen Poots, Kid Cudi, Rami Malek, Ramón Rodríguez, Harrison Gilbertson, Dakota Johnson', 'PG-13', 'The film revolves around a local street-racer who partners with a rich and arrogant business associate, only to find himself framed by his colleague and sent to prison. After he gets out, he joins a New York-to-Los Angeles race to get revenge. But when the ex-partner learns of the scheme, he puts a massive bounty on the racer''s head, forcing him to run a cross-country gauntlet of illegal racers in all manner of supercharged vehicles.', 'The film revolves around a local street-racer who partners with a rich and arrogant business associate, only to find himself framed by his colleague and sent to prison. After he gets out, he joins a New York-to-Los Angeles race to get revenge. But when the ex-partner learns of the scheme, he puts a massive bounty on the racer''s head, forcing him to run a cross-country gauntlet of illegal racers in all manner of supercharged vehicles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/45D153Bk0bNwonV1w5IBBvqssPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136797'),
  ('250497848101927802', 'Needful Things', 1993, 'Drama, Horror', 'Fraser Clarke Heston, Tony Westman, Helen Jarvis', 'W.D. Richter', 'Max von Sydow, Ed Harris, Bonnie Bedelia, J.T. Walsh, Valri Bromfield, Ray McKinnon, Lisa Blount, Shane Meier', 'R', 'A mysterious new shop opens in a small town which always seems to stock the deepest desires of each shopper, with a price far heavier than expected.', 'A mysterious new shop opens in a small town which always seems to stock the deepest desires of each shopper, with a price far heavier than expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RxE6kd1ky4689WxqX6CHEpIWya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10657'),
  ('191616412737942765', 'Needing You...', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Johnnie To, Wai Ka-Fai, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Wai Ka-Fai, Yau Nai-Hoi', 'Andy Lau, Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Fiona Leung Ngai-Ling, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Benz Hui Siu-Hung, Gabriel Harrison, Florence Kwok Siu-Wan, Lam Suet', null, 'Wah and Kinki both work at a computer company. Despite not getting on too well initially, their friendship develops into romance when they get to know each other after a while.', 'Wah and Kinki both work at a computer company. Despite not getting on too well initially, their friendship develops into romance when they get to know each other after a while.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enjH5yOV0GDFemPwqMpNDAd7Q0b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45418'),
  ('167681116350639364', 'Needle', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Stephen F. Windon, John V. Soto', 'John V. Soto, Anthony Egan', 'Travis Fimmel, Ben Mendelsohn, Murray Bartlett, Michael Dorman, Jane Badler, Jessica Marais, Nathaniel Buzolic, John Jarratt', 'R', 'College student Ben inherits a curious old mechanical box that churns out voodoo dolls. When a shadowy figure starts using the box to murder Ben''s friends, he must find the killer.', 'College student Ben inherits a curious old mechanical box that churns out voodoo dolls. When a shadowy figure starts using the box to murder Ben''s friends, he must find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxVJLWNMGyOXPG5P8KULdoWHHPg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49347'),
  ('58367988487093984', 'Needle in a Timestack', 2021, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Ramsey Nickell, John Ridley', 'John Ridley', 'Leslie Odom Jr., Cynthia Erivo, Freida Pinto, Jadyn Wong, Orlando Bloom, Ulka Simone Mohanty, Elizabeth Weinstein, Gourav Shah', 'R', 'Nick and Janine live in bliss until her ex warps time to try to tear them apart by using Nick''s old girlfriend. As Nick''s memories and reality disappear, he must decide what he''s willing to sacrifice to save -- or let go of -- everything he loves.', 'Nick and Janine live in bliss until her ex warps time to try to tear them apart by using Nick''s old girlfriend. As Nick''s memories and reality disappear, he must decide what he''s willing to sacrifice to save -- or let go of -- everything he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjGYOszxlaUAe6EC5yZ4Q8l3aVL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452019'),
  ('1059415649310712210', 'Needle Park Baby', 2020, 'Drama', 'Pierre Monnard, Darran Bragg', 'André Küttel', 'Luna Mwezi, Sarah Spale, Jerry Hoffmann, Lea Whitcher, Anouk Petri, Michael Schertenleib, Delio Malär, Emilio Marchisella', null, 'Spring 1995 - after the closure of the Needle Park and the public drug scene in Zurich, eleven-year-old Mia and her heroin addicted mother Sandrine are relocated to the countryside. While caring for her mother, Mia spends time with her imaginary friend and a gang of local teenage misfits. These friendships finally give her the strength to rebel and break free from her abusive mother.', 'Spring 1995 - after the closure of the Needle Park and the public drug scene in Zurich, eleven-year-old Mia and her heroin addicted mother Sandrine are relocated to the countryside. While caring for her mother, Mia spends time with her imaginary friend and a gang of local teenage misfits. These friendships finally give her the strength to rebel and break free from her abusive mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CQ55klM6jjoJ3Po8Xb3YCejyla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656704'),
  ('394751260749889914', 'Neelakasham Pachakadal Chuvanna Bhoomi', 2013, 'Adventure, Thriller, Romance', 'Sameer Thahir, Girish Gangadharan, Syam Sasi', 'Hashir Mohamed', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Sunny Wayne, Bala Hijam, Ena Saha, Dhritiman Chatterjee, Shane Nigam, Joy Mathew, Vanitha Krishnachandran', null, 'Kasi and Suni are close friends who studied together in an engineering college. Assi, who comes to Kerala to study engineering under the North East quota falls in love with Kasi. Certain incidents that follow set Kasi and Suni on a road trip to Nagaland on two motorcycles. The incidents that happen during this road adventure forms the film.', 'Kasi and Suni are close friends who studied together in an engineering college. Assi, who comes to Kerala to study engineering under the North East quota falls in love with Kasi. Certain incidents that follow set Kasi and Suni on a road trip to Nagaland on two motorcycles. The incidents that happen during this road adventure forms the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKvrZ53FBY9EzH2kLy4KdeyPpub.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209419'),
  ('371581963054899750', 'Neerja', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ram Madhvani, Mitesh Mirchandani', 'Saiwyn Quadras', 'Sonam Kapoor Ahuja, Shabana Azmi, Shekhar Ravjiani, Yogendra Tiku, Jim Sarbh, Abrar Zahoor, Ali Baldiwala, Kavi Shastri', null, 'Neerja is a portrayal on the life of the courageous Neerja Bhanot, who sacrificed her life while protecting the lives of 359 passengers on the Pan Am flight 73 in 1986. The flight was hijacked by a terrorist organization.', 'Neerja is a portrayal on the life of the courageous Neerja Bhanot, who sacrificed her life while protecting the lives of 359 passengers on the Pan Am flight 73 in 1986. The flight was hijacked by a terrorist organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alDRJWHI1TfqB9ev6cMbVE5P92x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376869'),
  ('352774728408437266', 'Neeyat', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Anu Menon, Andreas Neo', 'Advaita Kala, Girvani Dhyani, Priya Venkataraman', 'Vidya Balan, Ram Kapoor, Rahul Bose, Neeraj Kabi, Niki Aneja Walia, Shahana Goswami, Amrita Puri, Dipannita Sharma', null, 'When an exiled billionaire mysteriously dies at his birthday party at a Scottish castle, the prime suspects are his close family and friends, each with a motive to kill him.​ CBI officer Mira Rao must use all her skill to unravel the mystery where nothing is what it seems and everyone hides a secret or two.', 'When an exiled billionaire mysteriously dies at his birthday party at a Scottish castle, the prime suspects are his close family and friends, each with a motive to kill him.​ CBI officer Mira Rao must use all her skill to unravel the mystery where nothing is what it seems and everyone hides a secret or two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHLEle6lz50GH97D7bAcingUlxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:968748'),
