  ('807196177135721714', 'Negative Happy Chain Saw Edge', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Takuji Kitamura, Tatsuro Koike', 'Hirotoshi Kobayashi', 'Hayato Ichihara, Megumi Seki, Haruma Miura, Yōsuke Asari, Itsuji Itao, Hiromi Shinjo, Aya Kiguchi, Maho Nonami', null, 'One day, apathetic high school student Yosuke meets a beautiful girl named Eri. Eri does battle every night with an indestructible, chainsaw-wielding maniac, “Chainsaw Man”. As Yosuke and Eri bond, he eventually joins the fight. Features CG effects by the talents behind the “Death Note” series. Based on the best-selling novel by Tatsuhiko Takimoto.', 'One day, apathetic high school student Yosuke meets a beautiful girl named Eri. Eri does battle every night with an indestructible, chainsaw-wielding maniac, “Chainsaw Man”. As Yosuke and Eri bond, he eventually joins the fight. Features CG effects by the talents behind the “Death Note” series. Based on the best-selling novel by Tatsuhiko Takimoto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uejeeUpkvRxQRWBOPTrbQrmZfSp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36172'),
  ('629536865378401890', 'Negative Space', 2017, 'Animation, Drama', 'Ru Kuwahata, Max Porter, Nadine Buss', 'Ru Kuwahata, Max Porter', 'Albert Birney', null, 'Even though Sam''s father is hardly ever home because he is often away on business trips, he is able to connect with his son by teaching him how to pack a suitcase.', 'Even though Sam''s father is hardly ever home because he is often away on business trips, he is able to connect with his son by teaching him how to pack a suitcase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzC44MFxDP9J5sfAmbtL5SDWLCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461303'),
  ('828341678755203511', 'Negociador', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Borja Cobeaga, Jon D. Domínguez, Iñaki Beraza', 'Borja Cobeaga', 'Ramón Barea, Josean Bengoetxea, Carlos Areces, Melina Matthews, Jöns Pappila, Santi Ugalde, Gorka Aguinagalde, María Cruickshank', 'PG-13', 'Manu Aranguren is a Basque politician who acts as a mediator for the Spanish government in its negotiations with ETA. Far from being a solemn, calculated occasion, unexpected occurrences, slip-ups or misunderstandings soon kick in to influence the dialogue. And the personal relationship between negotiators will be key in solving the conflict.', 'Manu Aranguren is a Basque politician who acts as a mediator for the Spanish government in its negotiations with ETA. Far from being a solemn, calculated occasion, unexpected occurrences, slip-ups or misunderstandings soon kick in to influence the dialogue. And the personal relationship between negotiators will be key in solving the conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dVuGcjIKlH37tGPjWBplyumLkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292631'),
  ('512769208230147007', 'Neige', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, TV Movie', 'Christophe Moulin, Laurent Tuel, Philippe Piffeteau', 'Quoc Dang Tran, Clémence Madeleine-Perdrillat', 'Frédéric Diefenthal, Murielle Huet des Aunay, Louis Bernard, Etienne Diallo, Marie Bouvet, Esther Gaumont, Fanny Guidecoq, Franck Adrien', null, 'Several notables from the Chamonix region are found murdered in their homes. To move forward with investigation, police captain Thomas Delhaye decides to release Juliette Hémon from prison, imprisoned for a strangely similar case.', 'Several notables from the Chamonix region are found murdered in their homes. To move forward with investigation, police captain Thomas Delhaye decides to release Juliette Hémon from prison, imprisoned for a strangely similar case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raevFcJSIIuvXN4W9hSZPATgfAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:959112'),
  ('513371266528042878', 'Neighbor', 2009, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert A. Masciantonio, Jeff Schirmer', 'Robert A. Masciantonio', 'America Olivo, Christian Campbell, Mink Stole, Lauren Rooney, Pete Postiglione, Joe Aniska, Sarah McCarron, Amy Rutledge', null, 'A mysterious new girl arrives in posh suburban neighborhood and quickly sets out to terrorize the town. As she starts breaking into homes and torturing the occupants, they begin to realize that she isn''t just another girl next door.', 'A mysterious new girl arrives in posh suburban neighborhood and quickly sets out to terrorize the town. As she starts breaking into homes and torturing the occupants, they begin to realize that she isn''t just another girl next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3uhTRXHkoHwkgDQVYvsLrzA6Rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41203'),
  ('111634798706876924', 'Neighborhood Watch', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Duncan Skiles, Luke McCoubrey', 'Sean Farley', 'Jeffrey Dean Morgan, Jack Quaid, Malin Åkerman, Cecile Cubiló, Harrison Stone, Porsche Kemp, Griffin Hood, Tim Casper', 'R', 'When a mentally ill young man thinks he witnesses an abduction and the police refuse to believe him, he reluctantly turns to his next door neighbor – a bitter, retired security guard – to help him find the missing woman.', 'When a mentally ill young man thinks he witnesses an abduction and the police refuse to believe him, he reluctantly turns to his next door neighbor – a bitter, retired security guard – to help him find the missing woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1KcNdCrz5s3ruij9eiT5IARter.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208983'),
