  ('608721063521150498', 'Neighbors', 1920, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton, Elgin Lessley', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Virginia Fox, Joe Roberts, Joe Keaton, Edward F. Cline, Jack Duffy', null, 'The Romeo and Juliet story played out in a tenement neighborhood with Buster and Virginia''s families hating each other over the fence separating their buildings.', 'The Romeo and Juliet story played out in a tenement neighborhood with Buster and Virginia''s families hating each other over the fence separating their buildings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1UjHdeHAIS3vlgmdiwP5ITKVu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51358'),
  ('749777157205692155', 'Neighbors', 1981, 'Comedy', 'John G. Avildsen, Yudi Bennett, Paula Mazur', 'Larry Gelbart', 'John Belushi, Kathryn Walker, Cathy Moriarty, Dan Aykroyd, Tim Kazurinsky, Tino Insana, Henry Judd Baker, Igors Gavon', 'R', 'One man''s quiet suburban life takes a sickening lurch for the worse when a young couple move into the deserted house next door. From the word go it is obvious these are not the quiet professional types who *should* be living in such a nice street. As more and more unbelievable events unfold, our hero starts to question his own sanity... and those of his family.', 'One man''s quiet suburban life takes a sickening lurch for the worse when a young couple move into the deserted house next door. From the word go it is obvious these are not the quiet professional types who *should* be living in such a nice street. As more and more unbelievable events unfold, our hero starts to question his own sanity... and those of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJ9AU7JY4lbda7EeXA0ONncV5Dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19507'),
  ('856472787352367156', 'Neighbors', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Nicholas Stoller, Brandon Trost, Jeff Dashnaw', 'Brendan O''Brien, Andrew J. Cohen', 'Seth Rogen, Zac Efron, Rose Byrne, Dave Franco, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Jerrod Carmichael, Ike Barinholtz, Carla Gallo', 'R', 'A couple with a newborn baby face unexpected difficulties after they are forced to live next to a fraternity house.', 'A couple with a newborn baby face unexpected difficulties after they are forced to live next to a fraternity house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sN1RU08CMi8xkRIibremh3AOdgw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195589'),
  ('279661891012197259', 'Neighbors 2: Sorority Rising', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Nicholas Stoller, Michael J. Moore, Matt Haggerty', 'Nicholas Stoller, Andrew J. Cohen, Seth Rogen', 'Seth Rogen, Zac Efron, Rose Byrne, Chloë Grace Moretz, Dave Franco, Ike Barinholtz, Lisa Kudrow, Selena Gomez', 'R', 'A sorority moves in next door to the home of Mac and Kelly Radner who have a young child. The Radner''s enlist their former nemeses from the fraternity to help battle the raucous sisters.', 'A sorority moves in next door to the home of Mac and Kelly Radner who have a young child. The Radner''s enlist their former nemeses from the fraternity to help battle the raucous sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyjcLLwxuRXACbglIbwWwaXK9DN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325133'),
  ('107408888182792612', 'Neighbour No. 13', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Yasuo Inoue', 'Hajime Kado', 'Shido Nakamura, Shun Oguri, Hirofumi Arai, Yumi Yoshimura, Tomoya Ishii, Minoru Matsumoto, Gekidan Hitori, Mitsu Murata', null, 'Juzo Murasaki is a young man traumatized by his experience of bullying at school. He returns to his hometown and takes a job on a building site with his old nemesis Toru Akai. But Juzo''s trauma has created a monster; he harbors a second personality, Neighbor No. 13, a vicious, brutal and disfigured character intent on exacting a painful revenge on his bully.', 'Juzo Murasaki is a young man traumatized by his experience of bullying at school. He returns to his hometown and takes a job on a building site with his old nemesis Toru Akai. But Juzo''s trauma has created a monster; he harbors a second personality, Neighbor No. 13, a vicious, brutal and disfigured character intent on exacting a painful revenge on his bully.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mp3oMd6WswqWqUJvBnbFK3ljicl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84251'),
  ('94903552514207312', 'Neighbours', 1952, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Norman McLaren, Wolf Koenig', 'Norman McLaren', 'Grant Munro, Jean Paul Ladouceur', null, 'In this Oscar-winning short film, Norman McLaren employs the principles normally used to put drawings or puppets into motion to animate live actors. The story is a parable about two people who come to blows over the possession of a flower.', 'In this Oscar-winning short film, Norman McLaren employs the principles normally used to put drawings or puppets into motion to animate live actors. The story is a parable about two people who come to blows over the possession of a flower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwYAnFU6GFAFwnYAIscE5KVWqVr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51406'),
  ('27524138629782806', 'Neil Young & Crazy Horse: Rust Never Sleeps', 1979, 'Music, Documentary', 'Neil Young, Paul Goldsmith, David Myers', null, 'Neil Young, Ralph Molina, Billy Talbot, Frank Sampedro', 'PG', 'Concert film covering Neil Young''s October 22 1978 concert performance at the Cow Palace with nearly 20 songs (including two versions of "Hey Hey, My My," his nod to the punk movement), acoustic and electric (with long-time companions Crazy Horse), dating back to his Buffalo Springfield days ("I Am a Child") and continuing through popular solo numbers like "Cinnamon Girl" and the extended "Like a Hurricane."', 'Concert film covering Neil Young''s October 22 1978 concert performance at the Cow Palace with nearly 20 songs (including two versions of "Hey Hey, My My," his nod to the punk movement), acoustic and electric (with long-time companions Crazy Horse), dating back to his Buffalo Springfield days ("I Am a Child") and continuing through popular solo numbers like "Cinnamon Girl" and the extended "Like a Hurricane."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdObkSIZLMd7Oiq7mBMgnSqrqK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38119'),
  ('1095436414088010972', 'Neil Young: Heart of Gold', 2006, 'Documentary, Music', 'Jonathan Demme, Ellen Kuras', null, 'Neil Young, Emmylou Harris, Ben Keith, Spooner Oldham, Rick Rosas, Karl T. Himmel, Chad Cromwell, Wayne Jackson', 'PG', 'In March 2005, Neil Young was diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. Four days before he was scheduled for a lifesaving operation, he headed to Nashville, where he wrote and recorded the country folk album Prairie Wind with old friends and family members. After the successful operation and recovery period, he returned to Nashville that August to play at the famed Ryman Auditorium, once again gathering together friends and family for this special performance.', 'In March 2005, Neil Young was diagnosed with a brain aneurysm. Four days before he was scheduled for a lifesaving operation, he headed to Nashville, where he wrote and recorded the country folk album Prairie Wind with old friends and family members. After the successful operation and recovery period, he returned to Nashville that August to play at the famed Ryman Auditorium, once again gathering together friends and family for this special performance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7DPRQN44hihnaijY69OWOVGqNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15675'),
  ('383087514059696762', 'Neither Seen Nor Recognized', 1958, 'Comedy, Family', 'Yves Robert, Jacques Letellier', 'Yves Robert, Jacques Celhay, Jean Marsan', 'Louis de Funès, Noëlle Adam, Frédéric Duvallès, Claude Rich, Moustache, Pierre Mondy, Madeleine Barbulée, Roland Armontel', null, 'In a small French village, everything would be quiet if the local wildlife cop was not being ridiculed by a smart poacher.', 'In a small French village, everything would be quiet if the local wildlife cop was not being ridiculed by a smart poacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j5cIpS6rlLNnwmWwCt3jOLSuJ61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44521'),
