  ('1063062487439147273', 'Nekromantik', 1988, 'Drama, Horror', 'Uwe Bohrer, Jörg Buttgereit', 'Franz Rodenkirchen, Jörg Buttgereit', 'Beatrice Manowski, Harald Lundt, Colloseo Schulzendorf, Volker Hauptvogel, Patricia Leipold, Franz Rodenkirchen, Daktari Lorenz, Jörg Buttgereit', null, 'A necrophilic street sweeper who cleans up after grisly accidents brings home a corpse for him and his girlfriend to enjoy sexually, but is dismayed to see that she prefers the corpse over him.', 'A necrophilic street sweeper who cleans up after grisly accidents brings home a corpse for him and his girlfriend to enjoy sexually, but is dismayed to see that she prefers the corpse over him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZZGYPcpRKg3zcdgF9Pua2pxKxI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11822'),
