  ('917186915526085624', 'Nel bagno delle donne', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Vito Frangione, Marco Castaldi', 'Alessio Lauria, Marco Alessi', 'Luca Vecchi, Daphne Scoccia, Francesca Reggiani, Niccolò Senni, Paolo Triestino, Luis Molteni, Nino Frassica, Stella Egitto', null, 'Giacomo, the main character, 35 years of laziness, is a man who doesn''t know and doesn''t want to fight. He is a introvert curmudgeon, a little bit nerd but not very social, who walks with the look downward on his device without giving to the people what they would like from him: only a little bit of attention and enthusiasm. He loses his job, he is left by his wife and coincidentally he remains closed in the women''s bathroom of the art-house cinema, together with the owner''s small dog.', 'Giacomo, the main character, 35 years of laziness, is a man who doesn''t know and doesn''t want to fight. He is a introvert curmudgeon, a little bit nerd but not very social, who walks with the look downward on his device without giving to the people what they would like from him: only a little bit of attention and enthusiasm. He loses his job, he is left by his wife and coincidentally he remains closed in the women''s bathroom of the art-house cinema, together with the owner''s small dog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRE81LZpPX4ne30DS700jOpKqCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774581'),
