  ('54438403197064406', 'Nemesis', 1992, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action', 'Albert Pyun, Ronnie Rondell Jr., George Parra', 'Rebecca Charles, Albert Pyun', 'Olivier Gruner, Tim Thomerson, Deborah Shelton, Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Merle Kennedy, Nicholas Guest, Vincent Klyn, Yuji Okumoto', 'R', 'In the future, chaos is rampant as ''information terrorists'' threaten to destroy order in society. Alex is a part-man, part-machine LAPD cop who is the best at what he does. When one of the terrorists calls him a machine, Alex questions his humanity and decides to leave the force. His final assignment is to apprehend an old colleague who has stolen some data. However, there is more than meets the eye and Alex must question his allegiance.', 'In the future, chaos is rampant as ''information terrorists'' threaten to destroy order in society. Alex is a part-man, part-machine LAPD cop who is the best at what he does. When one of the terrorists calls him a machine, Alex questions his humanity and decides to leave the force. His final assignment is to apprehend an old colleague who has stolen some data. However, there is more than meets the eye and Alex must question his allegiance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znPIbermRgSXgjArNxhO8mb0Ba6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24230'),
  ('992331863303503745', 'Nemesis 2: Nebula', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Mathew Dunne', 'Albert Pyun', 'Sue Price, Chad Stahelski, Tina Cote, Earl White, Jahi J.J. Zuri, Karen Studer, Shelton Baily, Jon H. Epstein', 'R', 'It has been 73 years since Alex failed and the Humans lost the Cyborg Wars. Since then, the Humans have been enslaved. Scientists have developed a new DNA strain, which could signal the end of the Cyborgs, and they inject it into a volunteer. When the Cyborgs learn of the woman and the baby they list both for termination.', 'It has been 73 years since Alex failed and the Humans lost the Cyborg Wars. Since then, the Humans have been enslaved. Scientists have developed a new DNA strain, which could signal the end of the Cyborgs, and they inject it into a volunteer. When the Cyborgs learn of the woman and the baby they list both for termination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfBROAe2wXgbB7NbksvVvT49vZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63105'),
  ('305716631720272097', 'Nemesis 3: Time Lapse', 1996, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Albert Pyun, Jon H. Epstein, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'Albert Pyun', 'Sue Price, Tim Thomerson, Norbert Weisser, Xavier Declie, Sharon Bruneau, Debbie Muggli, Ursula Sarcev, Earl White', 'R', 'In this wasteland of despair the path to redemption is not clear. But Alex – a mutant created with super human DNA – carries the seed of hope for all mankind. In a struggle for domination that will never end, the Cyborg enemy – designed by humans as weapons without a soul – will not stop until this divine spark of humanity is eliminated. The Cyborgs are back, here and now, and stronger than ever. The terror has returned and we must face what they bring…', 'In this wasteland of despair the path to redemption is not clear. But Alex – a mutant created with super human DNA – carries the seed of hope for all mankind. In a struggle for domination that will never end, the Cyborg enemy – designed by humans as weapons without a soul – will not stop until this divine spark of humanity is eliminated. The Cyborgs are back, here and now, and stronger than ever. The terror has returned and we must face what they bring…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZzIf2ddfXBO6d6zWToBk9tHM47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107096'),
  ('557477223097570632', 'Nemesis 4: Cry of Angels', 1996, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Albert Pyun, George Mooradian, Sazzy Lee Calhoun', 'Albert Pyun', 'Sue Price, Norbert Weisser, Nicholas Guest, Simon Poland, Andrew Divoff, Blanka Čopíková, Michal Gučík, Andrej Lehota', null, 'Alex shoots again. She has to kill a man, but shoots the wrong one. A high ransom is set on her, so she is visited by some head hunters. Well, she only could sit and wait and hope for a friend''s help.', 'Alex shoots again. She has to kill a man, but shoots the wrong one. A high ransom is set on her, so she is visited by some head hunters. Well, she only could sit and wait and hope for a friend''s help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7BWMXdlc9pPeppmxaFlDm6pF33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60173'),
  ('286331837170334227', 'Nemesis Game', 2003, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Jesse Warn, Aaron Morton', 'Jesse Warn', 'Carly Pope, Ian McShane, Adrian Paul, Rena Owen, Brendan Fehr, Jay Baruchel, Vanessa Guy, Michael Kinney', 'R', 'Sara Novak is an introverted college student with a few skeletons in her closet. Shying away from classmates, she prefers to spend time with Vern, an older comic store owner who shares her passion for mind games and riddles. But when the riddles she solves lead to the deaths of those around her, she realizes the riddles are more than a simple game.....', 'Sara Novak is an introverted college student with a few skeletons in her closet. Shying away from classmates, she prefers to spend time with Vern, an older comic store owner who shares her passion for mind games and riddles. But when the riddles she solves lead to the deaths of those around her, she realizes the riddles are more than a simple game.....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CwK46VeembPAiT6IdF2Z2BjNbG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45877'),
  ('442936519308090570', 'Nemurubaka: Hypnic Jerks', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Yugo Sakamoto, Masaki Watanabe', 'Aya Satsuki, Yugo Sakamoto', 'Shiori Kubo, Yuna Taira, Keito Tsuna, Kouhei Higuchi, Usagi, Yōhei Gima, Yuki Takao, Dai Hasegawa', null, 'The story centers on the daily life of college dorm roommates Yumi Irisu and Ruka Kujirai. Ruka, the older of the two, is constantly penniless despite her being active in a band. Irisu works part-time at a second-hand bookstore.', 'The story centers on the daily life of college dorm roommates Yumi Irisu and Ruka Kujirai. Ruka, the older of the two, is constantly penniless despite her being active in a band. Irisu works part-time at a second-hand bookstore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMdzXMKbZxYeA0pbLngaJQq9bYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1357797'),
  ('241433855223434826', 'Nenapugala Maathu Madhura', 2026, null, 'Afzal Superstars', 'Afzal Superstars', 'Ranveer, Vasishta Bantanur, Rani Angadi, Aravind, Ranvitha Channappa', null, 'Anthology weaving four stories about four friends. Blends mystery, suspense, and humor while exploring modern youth experiences and relationships.', 'Anthology weaving four stories about four friends. Blends mystery, suspense, and humor while exploring modern youth experiences and relationships.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYTIxYjlmOGYtNDI0Yi00NTJmLWJkZDktZTQwNmNkMjQ0YTI5XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:nenapugala-maathu-madhura'),
  ('220214318756364786', 'Nenè', 1977, 'Drama', 'Salvatore Samperi, Pasqualino De Santis, Giorgio Basile', 'Alessandro Parenzo, Salvatore Samperi', 'Leonora Fani, Tino Schirinzi, Paola Senatore, Sven Valsecchi, Vittoria Valsecchi, Alberto Cancemi, Rita Savagnone, Ugo Tognazzi', null, 'In the Catholic and traditionalist Italy, two teenagers covertly discover new prohibited games.', 'In the Catholic and traditionalist Italy, two teenagers covertly discover new prohibited games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZytQbLRGP2z9Th8k2JGHy7VBHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80206'),
  ('495761059385219818', 'Neneh Superstar', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ramzi Ben Sliman', 'Ramzi Ben Sliman', 'Oumy Bruni Garrel, Maïwenn, Aïssa Maïga, Steve Tientcheu, Cédric Kahn, Alexandre Steiger, Richard Sammel, Nathalie Richard', null, 'Born to dance, Neneh is a 12-year-old black girl who dreams of entering the Paris Opera Ballet School. Despite her enthusiasm, she will have to redouble her efforts to escape from her condition and be accepted by the director of the school, Marianne Bellage, the guarantor of traditions and the bearer of a secret that links her to the little ballerina.', 'Born to dance, Neneh is a 12-year-old black girl who dreams of entering the Paris Opera Ballet School. Despite her enthusiasm, she will have to redouble her efforts to escape from her condition and be accepted by the director of the school, Marianne Bellage, the guarantor of traditions and the bearer of a secret that links her to the little ballerina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7hstgJPoSnxcE2cpfOmO2tjpoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1008430'),
  ('628359404701312771', 'Nenette and Boni', 1997, 'Drama', 'Claire Denis, Agnès Godard', 'Claire Denis, Jean-Pol Fargeau', 'Grégoire Colin, Alice Houri, Jacques Nolot, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Vincent Gallo, Alex Descas, Mounir Aïssa, Christophe Carmona', null, 'Teenage siblings Nenette and Boni were raised apart as a result of their parents'' divorce. Their mother, who doted on her son Boni, has died. He works for an interesting couple as a pizza baker, and is surprised and enraged when his younger sister, having run away from boarding school, suddenly turns up. There''s a problem that they must confront.', 'Teenage siblings Nenette and Boni were raised apart as a result of their parents'' divorce. Their mother, who doted on her son Boni, has died. He works for an interesting couple as a pizza baker, and is surprised and enraged when his younger sister, having run away from boarding school, suddenly turns up. There''s a problem that they must confront.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tiYchxwSkLI80TaAgmHLUEBx0B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99002'),
  ('1137288178999886892', 'Neo Chinpira 2: Zoom Goes the Bullet', 1991, null, 'Banmei Takahashi, Kazuhiro Miyoshi', 'Takuya Nishioka, Banmei Takahashi', 'Show Aikawa, Shiori Sakura, Chikako Aoyama, Rikiya Yasuoka, Tatsuo Yamada, Ren Osugi, Yukino Tobita, Shirō Shimomoto', null, 'In the sequel to 1990''s classic Neo Chinpira, Junko (Sho Aikawa) attempts to take out Kazama and then goes on the run. However, he quickly begins to feel homesick, and returns home to find that almost everything has changed. Noriko is now a bar mama with a lavish lifestyle, Yumeko is nowhere to be found, and his boss (Toru Minegishi) seems to have sinister plans involving Junko and his uncle (Jo Shishido).', 'In the sequel to 1990''s classic Neo Chinpira, Junko (Sho Aikawa) attempts to take out Kazama and then goes on the run. However, he quickly begins to feel homesick, and returns home to find that almost everything has changed. Noriko is now a bar mama with a lavish lifestyle, Yumeko is nowhere to be found, and his boss (Toru Minegishi) seems to have sinister plans involving Junko and his uncle (Jo Shishido).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNxItOXexbqwpXBSOGbrH6VHsS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458376'),
  ('150593417646744522', 'Neo Chinpira: Zoom Goes the Bullet', 1990, 'Crime, Action', 'Banmei Takahashi, Kazuhiro Miyoshi, Kazuhiro Miyoshi', 'Takuya Nishioka', 'Show Aikawa, Chikako Aoyama, Joe Shishido, Toru Minegishi, Rikiya Yasuoka, Kenji Takaoka, Shirō Shimomoto, Shōhei Yamamoto', null, 'Junko pretends to be a yakuza and gets more than he bargained for when he is tasked with avenging the murder of a fellow gang member. If he turns the task down, he will face the consequences for betrayal.', 'Junko pretends to be a yakuza and gets more than he bargained for when he is tasked with avenging the murder of a fellow gang member. If he turns the task down, he will face the consequences for betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMd41OUDkxPCdxbgMG4hE9ggDre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444996'),
