  ('902985817754479785', 'Neon Bull', 2016, 'Drama', 'Gabriel Mascaro, Marcelo Caetano, Diego García', 'Marcelo Gomes, Cesar Turim, Daniel Bandeira', 'Juliano Cazarré, Alyne Santana, Maeve Jinkings, Vinícius de Oliveira, Carlos Pessoa, Samya de Lavor, Josinaldo da Silva, Abigail Pereira', null, 'Iremar works at the rodeo in North East of Brazil. From his home, the truck he uses to transport the animals, he dreams of a future in the region''s booming clothing industry.', 'Iremar works at the rodeo in North East of Brazil. From his home, the truck he uses to transport the animals, he dreams of a future in the region''s booming clothing industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5UZOBQBxofQguD2jGgHxvZjqiLI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314029'),
