  ('185417400613100369', 'Neon Genesis Evangelion: Death and Rebirth', 1997, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Hideaki Anno, Kazuya Tsurumaki, Masayuki', 'Akio Satsukawa', 'Megumi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Yuko Miyamura, Kotono Mitsuishi, Fumihiko Tachiki, Koichi Yamadera, Miki Nagasawa, Takehito Koyasu', 'NR', 'Originally a collection of clips from the Neon Genesis Evangelion TV series, Death was created as a precursor to the re-worked ending of the series. Rebirth was intended as that re-worked ending, but after production overruns Rebirth became only the first half of the first part of The End of Evangelion, with some minor differences.', 'Originally a collection of clips from the Neon Genesis Evangelion TV series, Death was created as a precursor to the re-worked ending of the series. Rebirth was intended as that re-worked ending, but after production overruns Rebirth became only the first half of the first part of The End of Evangelion, with some minor differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXBjqzo6c4NyLuJtqOiH39kswji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21832'),
  ('172315114516762179', 'Neon Genesis Evangelion: The End of Evangelion', 1997, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Drama, Fantasy', 'Masayuki, Shunji Suzuki, Hideaki Anno', 'Hideaki Anno', 'Megumi Ogata, Megumi Hayashibara, Kotono Mitsuishi, Yuko Miyamura, Fumihiko Tachiki, Miki Nagasawa, Takehito Koyasu, Hiro Yuuki', 'NR', 'SEELE orders an all-out attack on NERV, aiming to destroy the Evas before Gendo can advance his own plans for the Human Instrumentality Project. Shinji is pushed to the limits of his sanity as he is forced to decide the fate of humanity.', 'SEELE orders an all-out attack on NERV, aiming to destroy the Evas before Gendo can advance his own plans for the Human Instrumentality Project. Shinji is pushed to the limits of his sanity as he is forced to decide the fate of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6G24dqI4WgUtChhWjfnI4lnmiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18491'),
  ('797789203756707469', 'Neon Maniacs', 1986, 'Horror', 'Joseph Mangine, Joseph Mangine, Oliver Wood', 'Mark Patrick Carducci', 'Clyde Hayes, Leilani Sarelle, Donna Locke, Andrew Divoff, Marta Kober, Trish Doolan, Victor Brandt, David Muir', 'R', 'A group of teenagers in San Francisco discover a nest of homicidal monsters living in a tower of the Golden Gate Bridge, but when they try to tell authorities, no one believes them.', 'A group of teenagers in San Francisco discover a nest of homicidal monsters living in a tower of the Golden Gate Bridge, but when they try to tell authorities, no one believes them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OOORWY2makxH498NqmhGEYWKKC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26676'),
  ('1056597808150159101', 'Neppuu Kairiku Bushi Road', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Masayuki Sakoi, Eiji Inomoto, Hajime Takakuwa', 'Ukyo Kodachi, Norimitsu Kaiho', 'Megumi Han, KENN, Unsho Ishizuka, Shuta Morishima, Kohsuke Toriumi, Tomo Saeki, Chihiro Suzuki, Izumi Kitta', null, 'An asteroid collision brought with it a deadly menace known as "Shinobi." Faced with destruction, humanity retreated to land reclaimed from the sea. The one ray of hope is a device that can fight the Shinbo called "The Mechanical Divine General." Ame, the princess of the refugees, and Suō, who carries the blood of the Yagyū family, must awaken its power in order to save the world.', 'An asteroid collision brought with it a deadly menace known as "Shinobi." Faced with destruction, humanity retreated to land reclaimed from the sea. The one ray of hope is a device that can fight the Shinbo called "The Mechanical Divine General." Ame, the princess of the refugees, and Suō, who carries the blood of the Yagyū family, must awaken its power in order to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4sivdXbMaiKcyiv9KcUELPRU3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243914'),
  ('183675524764173910', 'Neptune Frost', 2022, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Music, Fantasy', 'Anisia Uzeyman, Anisia Uzeyman, Saul Williams', 'Saul Williams', 'Cheryl Isheja, Bertrand Ninteretse, Eliane Umuhire, Elvis Ngabo, Rebecca Mucyo, Trésor Niyongabo, Eric Ngangare, Cecile Kayiregawa', null, 'In the hilltops of Burundi, a group of escaped coltan miners form an anti-colonialist computer hacker collective. From their camp in an otherworldly e-waste dump, they attempt a takeover of the authoritarian regime exploiting the region''s natural resources – and its people. When an intersex runaway and an escaped coltan miner find each other through cosmic forces, their connection sparks glitches within the greater divine circuitry.', 'In the hilltops of Burundi, a group of escaped coltan miners form an anti-colonialist computer hacker collective. From their camp in an otherworldly e-waste dump, they attempt a takeover of the authoritarian regime exploiting the region''s natural resources – and its people. When an intersex runaway and an escaped coltan miner find each other through cosmic forces, their connection sparks glitches within the greater divine circuitry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emlTdAiMcJDomw6Tjz2lFCSen8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:671109'),
  ('892371293139876341', 'Neptune''s Daughter', 1949, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Edward Buzzell, Charles Rosher', 'Dorothy Kingsley', 'Esther Williams, Red Skelton, Ricardo Montalban, Betty Garrett, Keenan Wynn, Xavier Cugat, Ted de Corsia, Mike Mazurki', 'NR', 'Scatterbrained Betty Barrett mistakes masseur Jack Spratt for Jose O''Rourke, the captain of the South American polo team. Spratt goes along with the charade, but the situation becomes more complicated when they fall in love. Meanwhile, Betty''s sensible older sister Eve fears Betty''s heart will be broken when Jose returns to South America. She arranges to meet with the real O''Rourke and love soon blossoms between them as well.', 'Scatterbrained Betty Barrett mistakes masseur Jack Spratt for Jose O''Rourke, the captain of the South American polo team. Spratt goes along with the charade, but the situation becomes more complicated when they fall in love. Meanwhile, Betty''s sensible older sister Eve fears Betty''s heart will be broken when Jose returns to South America. She arranges to meet with the real O''Rourke and love soon blossoms between them as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9O19EfkPl9FCmGh6QfklCDcoIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43437'),
  ('492196623242376883', 'Neram', 2013, 'Comedy, Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Anend C Chandran, Alphonse Puthren', 'Alphonse Puthren', 'Nivin Pauly, Nazriya Nazim, Bobby Simha, Krishna Shankar, Ananth Nag, Lalu Alex, Thambi Ramaiah, Shammi Thilakan', null, 'Mathew is a graduate in software engineering, but is now jobless. He is waiting for his good time to get a good job. Mathew has borrowed some money as loan. Now he cannot give it back as he has no job. Mathew''s childhood friend Jeena Johnykkutty is ready to help him as she could. She has a job. Her father Johnykkutty does not like Mathew and he always tries to trouble Mathew whenever he gets a chance. At this time Mathew''s good time arrives; but along with it many problems too. The gripping events that follow plot the rest of ''Neram''.', 'Mathew is a graduate in software engineering, but is now jobless. He is waiting for his good time to get a good job. Mathew has borrowed some money as loan. Now he cannot give it back as he has no job. Mathew''s childhood friend Jeena Johnykkutty is ready to help him as she could. She has a job. Her father Johnykkutty does not like Mathew and he always tries to trouble Mathew whenever he gets a chance. At this time Mathew''s good time arrives; but along with it many problems too. The gripping events that follow plot the rest of ''Neram''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cA5OgwysDaFmMGeEjUEG59aVoMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190742'),
  ('919194835700356743', 'Nereden Çıktı Bu Velet', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden, Cahit Engin', 'Osman F. Seden, Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar', 'Zeki Alasya, Metin Akpınar, Hale Soygazi, Melek Ayberk, Murad Koçyiğit, Turgut Boralı, Yılmaz Gruda, Nisa Serezli', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DgT1JeRq6xMqtfxdYdL1NDUjPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484979'),
  ('1010762972816760684', 'Nero and Poppea - An Orgy of Power', 1982, 'Drama, History', 'Bruno Mattei, Antonio Passalia', 'Antonio Passalia, Bruno Mattei', 'Piotr Stanislas, Françoise Blanchard, Gino Turini, Mario Novelli, Susanna Forgione, Caterina Catambrone, Sandro Zambito, Guido Scalzone', null, 'As the Roman Empire slowly declines, Caesar Nero indulges himself in every known debauchery, including incest with his mother.', 'As the Roman Empire slowly declines, Caesar Nero indulges himself in every known debauchery, including incest with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jw8FnD90l0sQQSDX1MJMvJsz3Qk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158622'),
  ('1039389973322933939', 'Nero, or The Fall of Rome', 1909, 'History, Drama', 'Luigi Maggi, Giovanni Vitrotti, Arturo Ambrosio', 'Arrigo Frusta', 'Alberto Capozzi, Lydia De Roberti, Luigi Maggi, Mirra Principi, Ercole Vaser, Ernesto Vaser, Serafino Vite, Mario Voller-Buzzi', null, 'Roman emperor Nero is used to getting what he wants. He has grown tired of his wife Octavia, and has become infatuated with Poppea. He succeeds in making Poppea the new empress, but soon he faces opposition from an outraged populace. Informed of the danger of an imminent popular uprising, Nero orders to set fire to the city, which he watches from a terrace, rejoicing and playing his lyra.', 'Roman emperor Nero is used to getting what he wants. He has grown tired of his wife Octavia, and has become infatuated with Poppea. He succeeds in making Poppea the new empress, but soon he faces opposition from an outraged populace. Informed of the danger of an imminent popular uprising, Nero orders to set fire to the city, which he watches from a terrace, rejoicing and playing his lyra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SNpAKeVJkRlE3BMHuBlH9RjsEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127108'),
  ('647569851702846139', 'Nero''s Mistress', 1956, 'Comedy, History', 'Steno, Luigi Vanzi, Lucio Fulci', 'Diego Fabbri, Sandro Continenza, Steno', 'Alberto Sordi, Vittorio De Sica, Brigitte Bardot, Gloria Swanson, Ciccio Barbi, Giorgia Moll, Memmo Carotenuto, Mino Doro', 'NR', 'Nero is on holiday at the seaside. Poppea, Seneca and many other guests are with him. Nero is preparing a great show where he will be the star. When Agrippina, his mother, arrives with her German praetorians and decides Nero has to conquer Britain, she is asking for trouble. Many attempts of murder and poisoning will happen on the eve of his great show.', 'Nero is on holiday at the seaside. Poppea, Seneca and many other guests are with him. Nero is preparing a great show where he will be the star. When Agrippina, his mother, arrives with her German praetorians and decides Nero has to conquer Britain, she is asking for trouble. Many attempts of murder and poisoning will happen on the eve of his great show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ef2iofxA3DSrnuyZZvTP9h4Ei5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82057'),
  ('734185825746188271', 'Nerone', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Romano Scandariato, Sergio Martinelli, Mario Castellacci', 'Pier Francesco Pingitore, Mario Castellacci', 'Pippo Franco, Maria Grazia Buccella, Paola Tedesco, Oreste Lionello, Enrico Montesano, Paola Borboni, Gianfranco D''Angelo, Paolo Stoppa', null, 'Parody of real life events of the Roman emperor Nero.', 'Parody of real life events of the Roman emperor Nero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJgt77YwUwmWri6uwLpfkXIB3Gl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243676'),
  ('24884126852715759', 'Nerrukku Ner', 1997, 'Drama, Family', 'Vasanth, K. V. Anand', 'Vasanth', 'Vijay, Suriya, Simran, Kausalya, Raghuvaran, Manivannan, Vivek, Prakash Raj', null, 'Raghu and Shanti are divorced couple which sparks problems between both respective younger brothers.', 'Raghu and Shanti are divorced couple which sparks problems between both respective younger brothers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziOIIjYY6826RebWErF5bDDtlrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66197'),
  ('351282916913259005', 'Neru', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Satheesh Kurup, Jeethu Joseph, S. A. Bhaskaran', 'Santhi Mayadevi, Jeethu Joseph', 'Mohanlal, Priyamani, Anaswara Rajan, Siddique, K. B. Ganesh Kumar, Jagadish, Santhi Mayadevi, Nandhu', null, '''Neru'' is an enthralling legal and emotional drama that delves into the life of Sara, a blind sculpture artist on a quest for justice following a harrowing incident. Against the backdrop of the Indian legal system, this gripping story takes viewers through a rollercoaster of emotions, unveiling layers of deceit and ultimately exploring themes of redemption.', '''Neru'' is an enthralling legal and emotional drama that delves into the life of Sara, a blind sculpture artist on a quest for justice following a harrowing incident. Against the backdrop of the Indian legal system, this gripping story takes viewers through a rollercoaster of emotions, unveiling layers of deceit and ultimately exploring themes of redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktzJcMp4J1XssMgpZoQp0aFSrpC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1164370'),
  ('325806114155561108', 'Neruda', 2016, 'Drama', 'Eduardo Castro, Sebastián Radic, Víctor Rojas', 'Guillermo Calderón', 'Gael García Bernal, Luis Gnecco, Mercedes Morán, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Diego Muñoz, Alejandro Goic, Pablo Derqui, Marcelo Alonso', 'R', 'It’s 1948 and the Cold War has arrived in Chile. In the Congress, prominent Communist Senator and popular poet Pablo Neruda accuses the government of betraying the Party and is stripped of his parliamentary immunity by President González Videla. The Chief of Investigative Police instructs inspector Óscar Peluchonneau to arrest the poet. Neruda tries to escape from the country with his wife, the painter Delia del Carril, but they are forced to go underground.', 'It’s 1948 and the Cold War has arrived in Chile. In the Congress, prominent Communist Senator and popular poet Pablo Neruda accuses the government of betraying the Party and is stripped of his parliamentary immunity by President González Videla. The Chief of Investigative Police instructs inspector Óscar Peluchonneau to arrest the poet. Neruda tries to escape from the country with his wife, the painter Delia del Carril, but they are forced to go underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WwGjSjEEyP7NrgrI97o3mCezvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351454'),
  ('632075445615051873', 'Nerve', 2016, 'Mystery, Adventure, Crime', 'Ariel Schulman, Henry Joost, Michael Simmonds', 'Jessica Sharzer', 'Emma Roberts, Dave Franco, Emily Meade, Miles Heizer, Juliette Lewis, Kimiko Glenn, mgk, Marc John Jefferies', 'PG-13', 'Industrious high school senior Vee Delmonico has had it with living life on the sidelines. When pressured by friends to join the popular online game Nerve, Vee decides to sign up for just one dare in what seems like harmless fun. But as she finds herself caught up in the thrill of the adrenaline-fueled competition partnered with a mysterious stranger, the game begins to take a sinister turn with increasingly dangerous acts, leading her into a high stakes finale that will determine her entire future.', 'Industrious high school senior Vee Delmonico has had it with living life on the sidelines. When pressured by friends to join the popular online game Nerve, Vee decides to sign up for just one dare in what seems like harmless fun. But as she finds herself caught up in the thrill of the adrenaline-fueled competition partnered with a mysterious stranger, the game begins to take a sinister turn with increasingly dangerous acts, leading her into a high stakes finale that will determine her entire future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmSpHC0CSNyNll9WhlwWYuwoQ28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328387'),
  ('747848014756824166', 'Nerves', 1919, 'Drama', 'Robert Reinert, Helmar Lerski', 'Robert Reinert', 'Eduard von Winterstein, Lia Borré, Erna Morena, Paul Bender, Lili Dominici, Rio Ellbon, Margarete Tondeur, Paul Burgen', null, 'The film tries to capture the "nervous epidemic" caused by war and misery which "drives people mad". This unique portrait of the life in 1919 Germany, filmed on location in Munich, describes the cases of different people from all levels of society: Factory owner Roloff, who loses his mind in view of catastrophies and social disturbances; teacher John, who is the hero of the masses; and Marja who turns into a radical revolutionary.', 'The film tries to capture the "nervous epidemic" caused by war and misery which "drives people mad". This unique portrait of the life in 1919 Germany, filmed on location in Munich, describes the cases of different people from all levels of society: Factory owner Roloff, who loses his mind in view of catastrophies and social disturbances; teacher John, who is the hero of the masses; and Marja who turns into a radical revolutionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaENDjnfdpmfMzyfMCvj8AzozII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168907'),
  ('157703795135878876', 'Neşeli Günler', 1978, 'Comedy, Family', 'Orhan Aksoy', 'Sadık Şendil', 'Münir Özkul, Adile Naşit, Şener Şen, Mürüvvet Sim Caymaz, Ayşen Gruda, Ahmet Sezerel, Oya Aydoğan, İhsan Yüce', null, 'Years after a divorce divides their family in half, six siblings encounter each other by chance and try to get their parents back together.', 'Years after a divorce divides their family in half, six siblings encounter each other by chance and try to get their parents back together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNpqrXxHfFptO1N7lBZredY97AG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53206'),
  ('836730175933199366', 'Nesio', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Alan Coton', 'Alan Coton', 'Jorge Adrián Espíndola, Tenoch Huerta Mejía, César Jaime, Claudette Maillé', null, 'It is a light and amusing story about Nemesio, a small time drug dealer who has never managed to get away from his mother or his childhood traumas, and carries on his back the stigma of a born loser. This he struggles to overcome, but finds it impossible. By intent or otherwise, Nesio becomes involved in a homicide and an impossible love with a masked woman wrestler. All of this framed by downtown Mexico City.', 'It is a light and amusing story about Nemesio, a small time drug dealer who has never managed to get away from his mother or his childhood traumas, and carries on his back the stigma of a born loser. This he struggles to overcome, but finds it impossible. By intent or otherwise, Nesio becomes involved in a homicide and an impossible love with a masked woman wrestler. All of this framed by downtown Mexico City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcKEEgmb5fhBGlpoGGZfKxIz4Cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119276'),
  ('851444365507541300', 'Nessuno deve sapere', 1973, 'Drama', 'Mario Landi', 'Marco Oxman, Renzo Genta', 'Roger Fritz, Stefania Casini, Corrado Olmi', null, 'The Calabrian ''ndrangheta holds control of public works and is behind an inexorable chain of murders and retaliations. A Milanese engineer in his sports car is tragically involved in these events.', 'The Calabrian ''ndrangheta holds control of public works and is behind an inexorable chain of murders and retaliations. A Milanese engineer in his sports car is tragically involved in these events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yMVUeZrFjeYT8LqZUIg59yotjd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:518707'),
