  ('669963491783797799', 'Nestor, the Long-Eared Christmas Donkey', 1977, 'Animation, Family', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller', 'Roger Miller, Eric Stern, Paul Frees, Brenda Vaccaro, Linda Gary, Don Messick, Iris Rainer, Shelly Hines', 'G', 'Nestor the donkey is a bit of an oddity--his long ears are enough for six donkeys and stretch all the way to the ground. One night, when Nestor is locked out in the cold, he begins to wander the desert.', 'Nestor the donkey is a bit of an oddity--his long ears are enough for six donkeys and stretch all the way to the ground. One night, when Nestor is locked out in the cold, he begins to wander the desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vx9q5vezpk2PJfMartzwHsMNdIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26537'),
  ('54744294586718241', 'Nestore, l''ultima corsa', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alberto Sordi, Armando Nannuzzi, Walter Italici', 'Rodolfo Sonego, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Eros Pagni, Matteo Ripaldi, Cinzia Cannarozzo, Simona Caparrini, Tatiana Farnese, Rosa Pianeta, Paki Valente', null, 'Gaetano works in the historic center of Rome. During the summer months he keeps his nephew Aurelio, a nine-year-old, as a helper.', 'Gaetano works in the historic center of Rome. During the summer months he keeps his nephew Aurelio, a nine-year-old, as a helper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVAdTqh66wtIwAs3lU9Dd9ihcdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82487'),
  ('415559964309172135', 'Net I Die', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Weeratham Preedee', null, 'Sarunthorn Klaiudom, Chicha Amatayakul, Pitt Karchai, Suchada Pramoulkan, Rusameekae Fagerlund, Kritsana Maroukasonti, Anothai Niruttimetee, Rungtawan Chaiha', null, 'Monica, a big internet celebrity hangs herself live on her video channel. A year later idols start dying horribly. All were tagged in Monica''s last video, including Sa, a former idol-turned-beauty entrepreneur. Sa''s boyfriend Jak investigates. All clues point to Sa''s new facial cream.', 'Monica, a big internet celebrity hangs herself live on her video channel. A year later idols start dying horribly. All were tagged in Monica''s last video, including Sa, a former idol-turned-beauty entrepreneur. Sa''s boyfriend Jak investigates. All clues point to Sa''s new facial cream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhRT30yb4Bkrp0lN8RDyBtYYrRX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469186'),
