  ('806383477573027412', 'NetForce', 1999, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Rob Lieberman', null, 'Scott Bakula, Joanna Going, Xander Berkeley, Brian Dennehy, Kris Kristofferson, CCH Pounder, Judge Reinhold, Alexa PenaVega', null, 'Set in the year 2005, a division of the FBI, called "NetForce" has been initiated to investigate Internet crime. A Bill Gates-type character finds a loophole in his new web browser which enables him to gain control of the Internet. Net-Force, headed by Kristofferson and Bakula''s characters set out to stop him.', 'Set in the year 2005, a division of the FBI, called "NetForce" has been initiated to investigate Internet crime. A Bill Gates-type character finds a loophole in his new web browser which enables him to gain control of the Internet. Net-Force, headed by Kristofferson and Bakula''s characters set out to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7j9wbttMSFC1ZvHzcSmzko6CGqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54373'),
  ('601671803174618400', 'Netherworld', 1992, 'Horror', 'David Schmoeller, Adolfo Bartoli', 'David Schmoeller', 'Michael Bendetti, Denise Gentile, Anjanette Comer, Holly Floria, Robert Sampson, Holly Butler, Alex Datcher', 'R', 'A young man arrives at his father''s mansion in Louisiana to discover that a secretive cult is using winged creatures to raise the dead to do their bidding.', 'A young man arrives at his father''s mansion in Louisiana to discover that a secretive cult is using winged creatures to raise the dead to do their bidding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIGKGn5tA6yPZu5CR6nRXpljsUG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40115'),
