  ('33331401637668880', 'Neurotic Quest for Serenity', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Teodoro Poppovic, Paulinho Caruso, Pierre de Kerchove', 'Paulinho Caruso, Teodoro Poppovic', 'Tatá Werneck, Bruno Gagliasso, Vera Holtz, Daniel Furlan, Luís Lobianco, Ingrid Guimarães, Pedro Wagner, Mário Gomes', null, 'Kika K is a successful star with millions of fans, but behind the scenes, she is in personal and professional crisis: she has to deal with an obsessive fan, a boyfriend with no concept, professional appointments scheduled by the businesswoman and her obsessive-compulsive disorder', 'Kika K is a successful star with millions of fans, but behind the scenes, she is in personal and professional crisis: she has to deal with an obsessive fan, a boyfriend with no concept, professional appointments scheduled by the businesswoman and her obsessive-compulsive disorder', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Kh1iE2Micj0YPVs31ygnTFAT2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361787'),
  ('356285750562695242', 'Neutron the Atomic Superman vs. the Death Robots', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Federico Curiel, Fernando Colín', 'Federico Curiel', 'Wolf Ruvinskis, Julio Alemán, Rosita Arenas, Armando Silvestre, Claudio Brook, Jack Taylor, Roberto Ramírez Garza, Rodolfo Landa', null, 'The evil scientist Dr. Caronte plots to revive the brains of three dead scientists and use them to obtain the formula for the super-powerful neutron bomb. The resulting creation needs blood lots of blood, sending Caronte''s midget assistant Nick and his legion of mutant monsters out to get fresh victims. However, the masked atom-superman Neutron vows to put a stop to Caronte''s deeds.', 'The evil scientist Dr. Caronte plots to revive the brains of three dead scientists and use them to obtain the formula for the super-powerful neutron bomb. The resulting creation needs blood lots of blood, sending Caronte''s midget assistant Nick and his legion of mutant monsters out to get fresh victims. However, the masked atom-superman Neutron vows to put a stop to Caronte''s deeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kMg315Wa2RBnaHIhRHqWw6yqyrk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127675'),
  ('666077936741177', 'Nevada', 1944, 'Western', 'Edward Killy, Harry Mancke, Harry J. Wild', 'Norman Houston', 'Robert Mitchum, Anne Jeffreys, Craig Reynolds, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams, Richard Martin, Harry Woods, Nancy Gates, Sammy McKim', 'NR', 'Just as Nevada wins $7000 in yellowback bills, Ben Ide takes his $7000 and heads out to buy mining equipment. Burridge has his man Powell kill Ide and retrieve the money and Nevada finds Ide just as the posse arrives. Found with the money Nevada is arrested and Burridge now gets Powell to incite the local citizens to lynch Nevada.', 'Just as Nevada wins $7000 in yellowback bills, Ben Ide takes his $7000 and heads out to buy mining equipment. Burridge has his man Powell kill Ide and retrieve the money and Nevada finds Ide just as the posse arrives. Found with the money Nevada is arrested and Burridge now gets Powell to incite the local citizens to lynch Nevada.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spmPNdYNpiDydWu5PWTy5TEndAp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281611'),
  ('865276941625108741', 'Nevada Smith', 1966, 'Western', 'Henry Hathaway, Lucien Ballard', 'John Michael Hayes', 'Steve McQueen, Karl Malden, Brian Keith, Arthur Kennedy, Suzanne Pleshette, Raf Vallone, Janet Margolin, Pat Hingle', 'NR', 'Nevada Smith is the young son of an Indian mother and white father. When his father is killed by three men over gold, Nevada sets out to find them and kill them. The boy is taken in by a gun merchant. The gun merchant shows him how to shoot and to shoot on time and correct.', 'Nevada Smith is the young son of an Indian mother and white father. When his father is killed by three men over gold, Nevada sets out to find them and kill them. The boy is taken in by a gun merchant. The gun merchant shows him how to shoot and to shoot on time and correct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4QJLqSZRnhAb9pezEEIxidVINes.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5921'),
  ('147227877531015581', 'Never a Dull Moment', 1950, 'Romance, Comedy', 'George Marshall, C. Bakaleinikoff, Joseph Walker', 'Doris Anderson, Lou Breslow', 'Irene Dunne, Fred MacMurray, Natalie Wood, William Demarest, Andy Devine, Gigi Perreau, Philip Ober, Jack Kirkwood', null, 'Kay Kingsley, a sophisticated and successful songwriter in New York City. falls in love with a widowed rancher, Chris Heyward, she meets at the Madison Square Garden Rodeo and they get married, and leave for his ranch in the west. Her friends warn her of an early disillusionment with life on a ranch, far away from the glitter and bright lights of Broadway. Kay makes one difficulty adjustment after another, as the ranch is presided over by Chris''s kids, and an incident occurs with a neighbor that prompts Kay to return to her glamorous life in New York. But she soon finds her heart is with Chris and his children.', 'Kay Kingsley, a sophisticated and successful songwriter in New York City. falls in love with a widowed rancher, Chris Heyward, she meets at the Madison Square Garden Rodeo and they get married, and leave for his ranch in the west. Her friends warn her of an early disillusionment with life on a ranch, far away from the glitter and bright lights of Broadway. Kay makes one difficulty adjustment after another, as the ranch is presided over by Chris''s kids, and an incident occurs with a neighbor that prompts Kay to return to her glamorous life in New York. But she soon finds her heart is with Chris and his children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43r7QKEsX2Qg0MJZykCoFMBykhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196862'),
  ('394176068631051921', 'Never a Dull Moment', 1968, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Jerry Paris, William E. Snyder', 'AJ Carothers', 'Dick Van Dyke, Edward G. Robinson, Dorothy Provine, Henry Silva, Tony Bill, Slim Pickens, Jack Elam, Ned Glass', 'G', 'When practicing for a role, actor Jack is mistaken for the killer Ace. He doesn''t realize this until it''s too late and is carried off to gangster boss Leo Smooth, who wants Ace to do a job for him. Fearing for his life, Jack plays his role, but always searching for a way out of the well-guarded house.', 'When practicing for a role, actor Jack is mistaken for the killer Ace. He doesn''t realize this until it''s too late and is carried off to gangster boss Leo Smooth, who wants Ace to do a job for him. Fearing for his life, Jack plays his role, but always searching for a way out of the well-guarded house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10UlHQMSLdUE7s3QQDC33THXjbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25441'),
  ('575149167708209650', 'Never Again as Before', 2005, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Giacomo Campiotti', null, 'Marco Velluti, Natalia Piatti, Federico Battilocchio, Nicola Cipolla, Laura Chiatti, Marco Casu', null, 'Six schoolmates, after their final exams, decide to go together on holiday in the Dolomites, in what will probably be their last summer together before taking different ways. In that time they will learn to know themselves and others better, facing and trying to overcome their fears.', 'Six schoolmates, after their final exams, decide to go together on holiday in the Dolomites, in what will probably be their last summer together before taking different ways. In that time they will learn to know themselves and others better, facing and trying to overcome their fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1csaiGPzFbghzCJGhicsghhShGB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24178'),
  ('1069530109447825914', 'Never Back Down', 2008, 'Drama, Action', 'Jeff Wadlow, Lukas Ettlin, John R. Woodward', 'Chris Hauty', 'Sean Faris, Amber Heard, Cam Gigandet, Djimon Hounsou, Evan Peters, Leslie Hope, Wyatt Smith, Neil Brown Jr.', 'PG-13', 'Jake, full of anger after his father''s death, is just starting to find a place for himself at his new Orlando high school - until Ryan, head of an underground MMA fight club, picks Jake out as a prime opponent. After being trounced by Ryan in front of the entire school, Jake begins training under the firm, moral guidance of a MMA master, where he learns how to fight... and how to avoid a fight. But it becomes obvious that a rematch will be inevitable if Jake wants to stop Ryan and his bullying, once and for all.', 'Jake, full of anger after his father''s death, is just starting to find a place for himself at his new Orlando high school - until Ryan, head of an underground MMA fight club, picks Jake out as a prime opponent. After being trounced by Ryan in front of the entire school, Jake begins training under the firm, moral guidance of a MMA master, where he learns how to fight... and how to avoid a fight. But it becomes obvious that a rematch will be inevitable if Jake wants to stop Ryan and his bullying, once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oRUTyP1QAtGDMvRpKZyuyFPG0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8456'),
  ('94477552086828900', 'Never Back Down 2: The Beatdown', 2011, 'Drama, Action', 'Michael Jai White', 'Chris Hauty', 'Michael Jai White, Gralen Bryant Banks, Alex Meraz, Stacey Asaro, Rus Blackwell, Dean Geyer, Scottie Epstein, Todd Duffee', 'R', 'Four fighters from different backgrounds come together to train under an ex MMA rising star and then ultimately have to fight each other and the traitor in their midst.', 'Four fighters from different backgrounds come together to train under an ex MMA rising star and then ultimately have to fight each other and the traitor in their midst.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VjtTMQpfy9GxMyjUfuYTfyatZz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70006'),
  ('737051461024043971', 'Never Back Down: No Surrender', 2016, 'Drama, Action', 'Larnell Stovall, Ross W. Clarkson, Michael Jai White', 'Michael Jai White, Chris Hauty', 'Michael Jai White, Josh Barnett, Gillian White, Nathan Jones, Damian Mavis, Aaron Brumfield, Elidh MacQueen, Creighton Mark Johnson', 'R', 'Picking up after the events of Never Back Down 2, former MMA champion Case Walker is on the comeback trail to become champion once again.', 'Picking up after the events of Never Back Down 2, former MMA champion Case Walker is on the comeback trail to become champion once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHVswTDHAvq9Npi0XCZ0qVMSiM2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391757'),
  ('259796334107041682', 'Never Back Down: Revolt', 2021, 'Action', 'Oliver Loncraine, Kellie Madison', 'Audrey Arkins', 'Olivia Popica, Michael Bisping, Brooke Johnston, Diana Hoyos, Neetu Chandra, James Faulkner, Lee Charles, Raffaello Degruttola', 'R', 'An amateur fighter is lured by a trafficking syndicate specializing in elite underground fighting where her brutal captor forces her to fight or face certain death.', 'An amateur fighter is lured by a trafficking syndicate specializing in elite underground fighting where her brutal captor forces her to fight or face certain death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icAG01wZyy1ZpS3UEnPReph3jMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763025'),
  ('838073089307414243', 'Never Been Chris''d', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jeff Beesley', 'Joie Botkin', 'Janel Parrish, Pascal Lamothe-Kipnes, Tyler Hynes, Linda Ko, Samantha Kendrick, Henriette Ivanans, Uchenna Nkwonta, Quinn Greene', 'G', 'Best friends Naomi and Liz return home for the holidays and simultaneously enter a love triangle when they both reconnect with their high school crush Chris Silver.', 'Best friends Naomi and Liz return home for the holidays and simultaneously enter a love triangle when they both reconnect with their high school crush Chris Silver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1T35Q7w80sH63d5Y6FbREm2hKv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180663'),
  ('1053705246144466938', 'Never Been Kissed', 1999, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Raja Gosnell, Alex Nepomniaschy, Anette Haellmigk', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein', 'Drew Barrymore, David Arquette, Molly Shannon, Michael Vartan, Jessica Alba, John C. Reilly, James Franco, Octavia Spencer', 'PG-13', 'Josie Geller, a baby-faced junior copywriter at the Chicago Sun-Times, must pose as a student at her former high school to research contemporary teenage culture. With the help of her brother, Rob, Josie infiltrates the inner circle of the most popular clique on campus. But she hits a major snag in her investigation -- not to mention her own failed love life -- when she falls for her dreamy English teacher, Sam Coulson.', 'Josie Geller, a baby-faced junior copywriter at the Chicago Sun-Times, must pose as a student at her former high school to research contemporary teenage culture. With the help of her brother, Rob, Josie infiltrates the inner circle of the most popular clique on campus. But she hits a major snag in her investigation -- not to mention her own failed love life -- when she falls for her dreamy English teacher, Sam Coulson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BngDhDNfbBjhVFWDT2yMve32vi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11355'),
  ('364862622575972041', 'Never Cry Werewolf', 2008, 'Horror', 'Jason Detheridge, Curtis Petersen, Kim MacLachlan', 'John Sheppard', 'Nina Dobrev, Kevin Sorbo, Peter Stebbings, Spencer Van Wyck, Melanie Leishman, Kim Bourne, Sean O''Neill, Nahanni Johnstone', 'PG-13', 'Loren doesn''t like her new neighbor, Jared, or his vicious dog. Along with her friend Steven, Loren spies on Jared and begins to suspect he''s a werewolf, responsible for a rash of disappearances. But Jared is watching her just as closely because Loren reminds him of his dead wife. As a full-moon night nears, Loren enlists the help of TV star Redd Tucker, who knows how to hunt -- and who believes her werewolf theory.', 'Loren doesn''t like her new neighbor, Jared, or his vicious dog. Along with her friend Steven, Loren spies on Jared and begins to suspect he''s a werewolf, responsible for a rash of disappearances. But Jared is watching her just as closely because Loren reminds him of his dead wife. As a full-moon night nears, Loren enlists the help of TV star Redd Tucker, who knows how to hunt -- and who believes her werewolf theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7jZwDFv2ExZvfmPuh9m7vFF4RW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29896'),
  ('3076471263909247', 'Never Cry Wolf', 1983, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Carroll Ballard, John Houston, Hiro Narita', 'Richard Kletter, Sam Hamm, Curtis Hanson', 'Charles Martin Smith, Zachary Ittimangnaq, Samson Jorah, Hugh Webster, Brian Dennehy', 'PG', 'A scientific researcher, sent on a government study: The Lupus Project, must investigate the possible "menace" of wolves in the north. To do so, he must survive in the wilderness for six months on his own. In the course of these events, he learns about the true beneficial and positive nature of the wolf species.', 'A scientific researcher, sent on a government study: The Lupus Project, must investigate the possible "menace" of wolves in the north. To do so, he must survive in the wilderness for six months on his own. In the course of these events, he learns about the true beneficial and positive nature of the wolf species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e61tGxVtobTQuFPmAC7xWwdC4O1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14280'),
  ('253911158360523895', 'Never Die Alone', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ernest R. Dickerson', 'James Gibson', 'DMX, David Arquette, Michael Ealy, Drew Sidora, Antwon Tanner, Luenell, Clifton Powell, Tommy Lister Jr.', 'R', 'A drug kingpin''s rise and tragic fall is witnessed vicariously by a reporter who uses the criminal''s diary as the basis for his new book.', 'A drug kingpin''s rise and tragic fall is witnessed vicariously by a reporter who uses the criminal''s diary as the basis for his new book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLN6zs2ySlekfdXS7mZ6uujTSBi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20304'),
  ('583412516918017414', 'Never Ending Story', 2012, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Joung Yong-ju, Kang Seung-gi', 'Park Eun-kyo, Joung Yong-ju', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Jung Ryeo-won, Yu Seon, Park Ki-woong, Kwon Hae-hyo, Don Lee, Lee Kan-hee, Cha Tae-hyun', null, 'A man and a woman who is only given so much time to live fall in love and resolves heart aching love into a bright and cheerful one.', 'A man and a woman who is only given so much time to live fall in love and resolves heart aching love into a bright and cheerful one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99s38PF3dqqUpof22jm777H9zqk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92507'),
  ('537450551227875379', 'Never Ever', 2016, 'Drama', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Hirsch', 'Julia Roy', 'Mathieu Amalric, Julia Roy, Jeanne Balibar, Victoria Guerra, José Neto, Elmano Sancho, Hugo Pedro, Rui Morisson', null, 'Based on Don DeLillo''s novella "The Body Artist," the film swirls around a self-centered filmmaker who, during a screening of one of his films, wanders into an adjoining gallery and becomes mesmerized by a young performance artist. Dumping his leading lady and long-time lover, Rey embarks on a wild and delirious affair with the equally willing Laura, who jumps on the back of his motorcycle and rides with him into instantaneous love.', 'Based on Don DeLillo''s novella "The Body Artist," the film swirls around a self-centered filmmaker who, during a screening of one of his films, wanders into an adjoining gallery and becomes mesmerized by a young performance artist. Dumping his leading lady and long-time lover, Rey embarks on a wild and delirious affair with the equally willing Laura, who jumps on the back of his motorcycle and rides with him into instantaneous love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0NnFOUHynDV5cPqguHmTQjvng3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250326'),
  ('1009121095592052369', 'Never Fear', 1950, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ida Lupino, Archie Stout', 'Collier Young, Ida Lupino', 'Sally Forrest, Keefe Brasselle, Hugh O''Brian, Eve Miller, Lawrence Dobkin, Rita Lupino, Herbert Butterfield, Stanley Waxman', null, 'A dancer who has just gotten engaged to her partner and choreographer and is about to embark on a major career is devastated to learn that she has contracted polio.', 'A dancer who has just gotten engaged to her partner and choreographer and is about to embark on a major career is devastated to learn that she has contracted polio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzUscrLysCJFQMHatNOF9TJ7FBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121197'),
