  ('18639843459849506', 'Never Give a Sucker an Even Break', 1941, 'Comedy', 'Edward F. Cline, Charles Van Enger', 'Prescott Chaplin, John T. Neville', 'W.C. Fields, Gloria Jean, Leon Errol, Billy Lenhart, Kenneth Brown, Margaret Dumont, Susan Miller, Franklin Pangborn', 'NR', 'Never Give a Sucker an Even Break is a 1941 film about a man who wants to sell a film story to Esoteric Studios. On the way he gets insulted by little boys, beaten up for ogling a woman, and abused by a waitress. W. C. Fields'' last starring role in a feature-length film.', 'Never Give a Sucker an Even Break is a 1941 film about a man who wants to sell a film story to Esoteric Studios. On the way he gets insulted by little boys, beaten up for ogling a woman, and abused by a waitress. W. C. Fields'' last starring role in a feature-length film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHCpKHEBfSGygsZ54RnDOh5s8Ky.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28789'),
  ('727937050763230255', 'Never Goin'' Back', 2018, 'Comedy', 'William Sydney, Augustine Frizzell, Greta Zozula', 'Augustine Frizzell', 'Maia Mitchell, Camila Morrone, Kyle Mooney, Joel Allen, Kendal Smith, Matthew Holcomb, Liz Cardenas, Michelle Sherrill', 'R', 'Angela and Jessie are best friends intent on taking a wild beach trip, but when their roommate loses all of their money in a drug scam, the girls -- blissfully stoned -- go to increasingly daring and absurd lengths to get it back.', 'Angela and Jessie are best friends intent on taking a wild beach trip, but when their roommate loses all of their money in a drug scam, the girls -- blissfully stoned -- go to increasingly daring and absurd lengths to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ytp5pmHFVvAesnL2SJecxgV8W2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490005'),
  ('643188913360108754', 'Never Gonna Snow Again', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michał Englert, Anne-Sophie Puget, Agata Trzebuchowska', 'Małgorzata Szumowska, Michał Englert', 'Alec Utgoff, Maja Ostaszewska, Agata Kulesza, Weronika Rosati, Katarzyna Figura, Łukasz Simlat, Andrzej Chyra, Krzysztof Czeczot', null, 'Zenia is an industrious Ukrainian migrant worker in Poland who makes house calls as a masseur to the needy and aspirational residents of a middle-class gated community near Warsaw. He is privy to all of their problems, anxieties and secrets – and something of an unwitting guru figure. Zenia’s grounded spirituality, apparent healing powers and broad shoulders make him an object of lust for many of the lost souls in the community.', 'Zenia is an industrious Ukrainian migrant worker in Poland who makes house calls as a masseur to the needy and aspirational residents of a middle-class gated community near Warsaw. He is privy to all of their problems, anxieties and secrets – and something of an unwitting guru figure. Zenia’s grounded spirituality, apparent healing powers and broad shoulders make him an object of lust for many of the lost souls in the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vzp2uKcS7JYwOOFKh022MOamCpK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726151'),
  ('298505016410162059', 'Never Grow Old', 2019, 'Western', 'Ivan Kavanagh, Piers McGrail, Valérie Wery', 'Ivan Kavanagh', 'Emile Hirsch, John Cusack, Déborah François, Danny Webb, Tim Ahern, Blake Berris, Manon Capelle, Sam Louwyck', 'R', 'An Irish undertaker profits when outlaws take over a peaceful town, but his own family come under threat as the death toll increases dramatically.', 'An Irish undertaker profits when outlaws take over a peaceful town, but his own family come under threat as the death toll increases dramatically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WGh8RtXOCG6Onrju1SBO67fCGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498743'),
  ('946466839019143088', 'Never in My Life!', 2004, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Ryszard Zatorski, Tomasz Dobrowolski', 'Ilona Łepkowska', 'Danuta Stenka, Artur Żmijewski, Joanna Jabłczyńska, Joanna Brodzik, Krzysztof Kowalewski, Marta Lipińska, Rafał Królikowski, Jan Frycz', null, 'Judyta is a middle-aged housewife whose peaceful life suddenly falls apart due to divorce. But soon she finds the strength to carry on fighting for her happiness, a place in the sun and love of her life.', 'Judyta is a middle-aged housewife whose peaceful life suddenly falls apart due to divorce. But soon she finds the strength to carry on fighting for her happiness, a place in the sun and love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xA9vz0LdYFXf6lhIwWSDqgmWmvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143240'),
  ('847729308945476666', 'Never Kiss a Man in a Christmas Sweater', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Nelson Talbot, Graham Talbot, Allan Harmon', null, 'Ashley Williams, Niall Matter, Lisa MacFadden, Brendon Zub, Bethel Lee, Matthew MacCaull, Kayden Magnuson, Calix Fraser', null, 'Single mom Maggie is facing Christmas alone until Lucas crashes into her life and becomes an unexpected house guest. Together they overcome Christmas while finding comfort in their growing bond.', 'Single mom Maggie is facing Christmas alone until Lucas crashes into her life and becomes an unexpected house guest. Together they overcome Christmas while finding comfort in their growing bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7VyM9eU0MoP4KA81meqt7UJoZAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746034'),
  ('711983580605769378', 'Never Let Go', 1960, 'Thriller, Crime', 'John Guillermin, Christopher Challis, Eric Saw', 'Alun Falconer', 'Richard Todd, Peter Sellers, Elizabeth Sellars, Adam Faith, Carol White, Mervyn Johns, Noel Willman, David Lodge', 'PG', 'John Cummings, an unsuccessful cosmetics salesman, has his unpaid-for car stolen by one of the hoods in the employ of Lionel Meadows, the sadistic organizer of a London car conversion racket. The car was not insured, and since the police appear indifferent to his plight, Cummings decides to find it himself -- and gets himself involved in an underworld battle.', 'John Cummings, an unsuccessful cosmetics salesman, has his unpaid-for car stolen by one of the hoods in the employ of Lionel Meadows, the sadistic organizer of a London car conversion racket. The car was not insured, and since the police appear indifferent to his plight, Cummings decides to find it himself -- and gets himself involved in an underworld battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F3QYIboc5JFy58wMXxJwCypQIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36631'),
  ('711678878901606545', 'Never Let Go', 2024, 'Horror', 'Alexandre Aja, Maxime Alexandre, Dan Miller', 'Ryan Grassby, Kevin Coughlin', 'Halle Berry, Anthony B. Jenkins, William Catlett, Percy Daggs IV, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Christin Park, Stephanie Lavigne, Cadence Compton', 'R', 'As an evil takes over the world beyond their front doorstep, the only protection for a mother and her twin sons is their house and their family’s protective bond.', 'As an evil takes over the world beyond their front doorstep, the only protection for a mother and her twin sons is their house and their family’s protective bond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iwUoM3y77fov7bKyFMwpGMzRHyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:814889'),
  ('866261192128866762', 'Never Let Me Go', 1953, 'Romance, Drama, Thriller', 'Robert Krasker, Delmer Daves', 'Ronald Millar, George Froeschel', 'Clark Gable, Gene Tierney, Richard Haydn, Bernard Miles, Anna Valentina, Kenneth More, Belita, Karl Stepanek', 'NR', 'An American reporter falls in love with a Russian ballet dancer.', 'An American reporter falls in love with a Russian ballet dancer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9rAI5E7CF2TUoILjhwvrzGvfqB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47303'),
  ('614752597240713856', 'Never Let Me Go', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Adam Kimmel, Mark Romanek, Jo Tew', 'Alex Garland', 'Carey Mulligan, Keira Knightley, Andrew Garfield, Izzy Meikle-Small, Ella Purnell, Charlie Rowe, Sally Hawkins, Charlotte Rampling', 'R', 'As children, Kathy, Ruth, and Tommy spend their childhood at an idyllic and secluded English boarding school. As they grow into adults, they must come to terms with the complexity and strength of their love for one another while also preparing for the haunting reality awaiting them.', 'As children, Kathy, Ruth, and Tommy spend their childhood at an idyllic and secluded English boarding school. As they grow into adults, they must come to terms with the complexity and strength of their love for one another while also preparing for the haunting reality awaiting them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7okcm65P7WfpF3f0HiQBFTsvcXV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42188'),
  ('1024939011798529389', 'Never Mind the Wall', 2001, 'Drama, Romance', 'Connie Walther, Peter Nix', 'Natja Brunckhorst', 'Anna Bertheau, Antonio Wannek, Tim Sanders, Carmen Simone Birk, Luise Helm, Aaron Hildebrand, Michael Krabbe, Nora Tschirner', null, 'Germany 1982: The country is divided into two parts. Nele, coming from West-Germany, travels to East-Germany where she meets Captain, singer of a band. They fall in love with each other, but the regime "takes care" of their relationship, meaning: They can not see each other again. Germany 1990: The country is reunited. Nele starts searching their lost love...', 'Germany 1982: The country is divided into two parts. Nele, coming from West-Germany, travels to East-Germany where she meets Captain, singer of a band. They fall in love with each other, but the regime "takes care" of their relationship, meaning: They can not see each other again. Germany 1990: The country is reunited. Nele starts searching their lost love...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2yUWOZ3qSa6CSLbTwWgTFSTZmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10698'),
