  ('945209285732856893', 'Never on the First Night', 2014, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Laurent Dailland, Mélissa Drigeard', 'Mélissa Drigeard, Vincent Juillet', 'Alexandra Lamy, Mélanie Doutey, Julie Ferrier, Jean-Paul Rouve, Grégory Fitoussi, Julien Boisselier, Michel Vuillermoz, Arnaud Henriet', null, 'Julie, a woman who is unlucky in love despite her bubbly demeanor. Her job at a bookstore takes an interesting twist when she discovers a book titled "Happiness Can Be Learned," and she sets out to fix her love life once and for all.', 'Julie, a woman who is unlucky in love despite her bubbly demeanor. Her job at a bookstore takes an interesting twist when she discovers a book titled "Happiness Can Be Learned," and she sets out to fix her love life once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1GWYmch5Amwr5CJ84h1m9e59D5P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241875'),
  ('1140705483742555996', 'Never on Tuesday', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Claudia Christian, Andrew Lauer, Peter Berg, Nicolas Cage, Gilbert Gottfried, Dave Anderson, Mark Garbarino, Melvyn Pearls', 'R', 'Matt and Eddie are two young men from the mid-west travelling to California to see the sights - primarily semi-clad women on beaches. They hop into their car and head off through the desert...', 'Matt and Eddie are two young men from the mid-west travelling to California to see the sights - primarily semi-clad women on beaches. They hop into their car and head off through the desert...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocUYeyrxgqU0xq0l6bjaIzUPeY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112019'),
