  ('747692762998105494', 'Never Rarely Sometimes Always', 2020, 'Drama', 'Eliza Hittman, Hélène Louvart, Alejandro Ramia', 'Eliza Hittman', 'Sidney Flanigan, Talia Ryder, Théodore Pellerin, Ryan Eggold, Sharon Van Etten, Eliazar Jimenez, David Buneta, Christian Clements', 'PG-13', 'A pair of teenage girls in rural Pennsylvania travel to New York City to seek out medical help after an unintended pregnancy.', 'A pair of teenage girls in rural Pennsylvania travel to New York City to seek out medical help after an unintended pregnancy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yiSyQhhjTFphhfCUcn05tCQxyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595671'),
  ('897320036088701374', 'Never Say Die', 2017, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Zhang Chiyu', 'Zhang Chiyu, Si''ao Dai, Yuyue Shen', 'Allen, Ma Li, Teng Shen, Xue Haowen, Chang Yuan, Yin Zheng, Wang Zhi, Wang Chengsi', null, 'A boxer and a journalist accidentally exchange bodies after they are struck by current, embarking a series of adventures.', 'A boxer and a journalist accidentally exchange bodies after they are struck by current, embarking a series of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7lhHL8puIpgxtxBhFj8mKVeB9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479306'),
  ('751693834905341821', 'Never Say Goodbye', 1946, 'Comedy', 'James V. Kern, Leo F. Forbstein, Bertram Tuttle', 'James V. Kern, I. A. L. Diamond', 'Errol Flynn, Eleanor Parker, Lucile Watson, S.Z. Sakall, Forrest Tucker, Donald Woods, Peggy Knudsen, Tom D''Andrea', 'NR', 'Phil and Ellen Gayley have been divorced for a year, and their 7-year old daughter, Flip, is very unhappy that her parents are not together. Flip starts a correspondence with a Marine, sending a picture of her beautiful mother as the author of Flip''s flirtatious letters. When the Marine shows up to meet his pen pal, Ellen takes the opportunity to make her ex-husband jealous.', 'Phil and Ellen Gayley have been divorced for a year, and their 7-year old daughter, Flip, is very unhappy that her parents are not together. Flip starts a correspondence with a Marine, sending a picture of her beautiful mother as the author of Flip''s flirtatious letters. When the Marine shows up to meet his pen pal, Ellen takes the opportunity to make her ex-husband jealous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9hnpYMH4do0dRJXPSc20O26qQy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61151'),
  ('968600395641808739', 'Never Say Goodbye', 1956, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jerry Hopper, Douglas Sirk, Maury Gertsman', 'Charles Hoffman', 'Rock Hudson, Cornell Borchers, George Sanders, Shelley Fabares, Ray Collins, David Janssen, Helen Wallace, John Wengraf', 'NR', 'In present-day U.S., Dr. Michael Parker, a prominent surgeon, unexpectedly runs into his German-born wife whom he thought was dead. Victor, an artist and his "dead" wife''s now boyfriend, berates Dr. Parker for "killing" her. The bulk of the story flashes back to Austria during World War II as we learn how Dr. Parker met and married his wife, and the one mistake that may have cost him his family.', 'In present-day U.S., Dr. Michael Parker, a prominent surgeon, unexpectedly runs into his German-born wife whom he thought was dead. Victor, an artist and his "dead" wife''s now boyfriend, berates Dr. Parker for "killing" her. The bulk of the story flashes back to Austria during World War II as we learn how Dr. Parker met and married his wife, and the one mistake that may have cost him his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymmGTMFxEjwiO6PXb200WzVRtcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187533'),
  ('247625607793808269', 'Never Say Never', 2023, 'Drama, Action', 'Anlei Li, Luo Pan, Yuanzhang Zhuang', 'Qi Qi, Wang Baoqiang', 'Wang Baoqiang, Shi Pengyuan, Chen Yongsheng, Wang Xun, Zhang Yitong, Hu Haofan, Hu Ma, Debowen Zhou', 'NR', 'A former boxing champion takes decides to break a few rules and train orphans from China''s remote countryside in order to give them a future.', 'A former boxing champion takes decides to break a few rules and train orphans from China''s remote countryside in order to give them a future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj8JmcJhqShEm5pdBCpOevAjFzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1112175'),
  ('415833291856080280', 'Never Say Never Again', 1983, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller', 'Irvin Kershner, Leslie Dilley, Douglas Slocombe', 'Lorenzo Semple Jr.', 'Sean Connery, Klaus Maria Brandauer, Max von Sydow, Barbara Carrera, Kim Basinger, Bernie Casey, Alec McCowen, Edward Fox', 'PG', 'James Bond returns as the secret agent 007 to battle the evil organization SPECTRE. Bond must defeat Largo, who has stolen two atomic warheads for nuclear blackmail. But Bond has an ally in Largo''s girlfriend, the willowy Domino, who falls for Bond and seeks revenge.', 'James Bond returns as the secret agent 007 to battle the evil organization SPECTRE. Bond must defeat Largo, who has stolen two atomic warheads for nuclear blackmail. But Bond has an ally in Largo''s girlfriend, the willowy Domino, who falls for Bond and seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhoAL4o1STGgLbLxJ9r1ijfyHC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36670'),
  ('77966554789761536', 'Never Say... Never!', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Eduardo Serra, Eric Civanyan', 'Cabot Philippe, Eric Civanyan', 'Jean Dujardin, Mélanie Doutey, Gérard Jugnot, Marie-France Santon, Patrick Haudecœur, Lorella Cravotta, Jacques Herlin, Jean-Luc Porraz', null, 'Paris, 1830. Valentin loses himself in alcohol, gambling and women. He does not believe in life and especially not in love. His uncle Van Buck believes only in the virtues of money and trade. Everything separates them until the day when Van Buck, to improve his public image, wants to make Valentin marry the young and impoverished Baroness Cécile. Valentin, who has absolutely no desire to get married, bets that he can easily seduce her in 24 hours and thus prove that she, like all the others, is not worth loving... But Cécile, who believes in true love, will prove much more difficult to woo than envisaged and Valentin will have to use all possible stratagems to try and win his bet. The game of cat and mouse starts... But who is the cat?', 'Paris, 1830. Valentin loses himself in alcohol, gambling and women. He does not believe in life and especially not in love. His uncle Van Buck believes only in the virtues of money and trade. Everything separates them until the day when Van Buck, to improve his public image, wants to make Valentin marry the young and impoverished Baroness Cécile. Valentin, who has absolutely no desire to get married, bets that he can easily seduce her in 24 hours and thus prove that she, like all the others, is not worth loving... But Cécile, who believes in true love, will prove much more difficult to woo than envisaged and Valentin will have to use all possible stratagems to try and win his bet. The game of cat and mouse starts... But who is the cat?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9eQRLNWKpW5GM4nUHSuWvFkeud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40004'),
  ('979401781947502642', 'Never Sleep Again: The Elm Street Legacy', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Andrew Kasch, Daniel Farrands', null, 'Heather Langenkamp, Robert Englund, Wes Craven, Robert Shaye, Lisa Wilcox, John Saxon, Clu Gulager, Alice Cooper', null, 'For decades, Freddy Krueger has slashed his way through the dreams of countless youngsters, scaring up over half a billion dollars at the box office across eight terrifying, spectacular films.', 'For decades, Freddy Krueger has slashed his way through the dreams of countless youngsters, scaring up over half a billion dollars at the box office across eight terrifying, spectacular films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjo0erw7vqzI3gGfbapCkZjxehV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37757'),
  ('970859633679852988', 'Never So Few', 1959, 'War, Drama, Adventure', 'John Sturges, William H. Daniels, Robert E. Relyea', 'Millard Kaufman', 'Frank Sinatra, Gina Lollobrigida, Charles Bronson, Steve McQueen, Peter Lawford, Paul Henreid, Brian Donlevy, Kipp Hamilton', null, 'A U.S. military troop takes command of a band of Burmese guerillas during World War II.', 'A U.S. military troop takes command of a band of Burmese guerillas during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ix9ImZOS1KPedJSlyVfrhQQ2BK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4820'),
  ('1125384032034665069', 'Never Take Sweets from a Stranger', 1960, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Cyril Frankel, Freddie Francis, John Peverall', 'John Hunter', 'Patrick Allen, Gwen Watford, Janina Faye, Felix Aylmer, Niall MacGinnis, Michael Gwynn, Alison Leggatt, Bill Nagy', null, 'Peter Carter, his wife Sally and their young daughter Jean move to a sleepy Canadian village, where Peter has been hired as a school principal. Their idyll is shattered when Jean becomes the victim of an elderly, and extremely powerful, paedophile. The film was neither a box office nor a critical success, it garnered criticism for breaking a significant public taboo.', 'Peter Carter, his wife Sally and their young daughter Jean move to a sleepy Canadian village, where Peter has been hired as a school principal. Their idyll is shattered when Jean becomes the victim of an elderly, and extremely powerful, paedophile. The film was neither a box office nor a critical success, it garnered criticism for breaking a significant public taboo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TC93BMF6XwDqSfzbSiGibYcWl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80151'),
  ('102600746917524338', 'Never Talk to Strangers', 1995, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Peter Hall, Elemér Ragályi, Myron Hoffert', 'Lewis A. Green, Jordan Rush', 'Rebecca De Mornay, Antonio Banderas, Dennis Miller, Len Cariou, Harry Dean Stanton, Eugene Lipinski, Martha Burns, Beau Starr', 'R', 'Sarah Taylor, a police psychologist, meets a mysterious and seductive young man, Tony Ramirez, and falls in love with him. As a cause of this relationship, she changes her personality when she begins to receive anonymous telephone calls.', 'Sarah Taylor, a police psychologist, meets a mysterious and seductive young man, Tony Ramirez, and falls in love with him. As a cause of this relationship, she changes her personality when she begins to receive anonymous telephone calls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naZWa06duMvKr4dLrPGgl9yrPZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48781'),
  ('667448439231925322', 'Never to Lose', 2005, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Son Hee Chang', 'Ki Seung-tae', 'Huh Joon-ho, Jang Hang-seon, Tae-wook Kim, Kim Min-jun, Yoon Tae-young, Nam Sang-mi, Yoon Ji-hye', null, '“Never to Lose” concerns the men of Homicide Unit 3, who are in dire straits at the moment. While Unit 3’s cops are full of ambition and talent, they never seem to crack a case. The team is comprised of Detective Koh, a 15 year veteran, Detective Kim (Min-jun Kim), a rookie eager to make a name for himself, Detective Koh, a married man who spends more time on the job than with his wife, and Detective Ryung ( Sang-mi Nam ), who can’t get taken seriously by her peers because she’s a woman. While at a party with his girlfriend, Kim happens upon information about a drug deal that could get the team the respect they’ve been looking for. But what the team gets into turns out to be not just a big drug bust, but a case that makes Homicide Unit 3 the target of the largest drug lord in Korea .', '“Never to Lose” concerns the men of Homicide Unit 3, who are in dire straits at the moment. While Unit 3’s cops are full of ambition and talent, they never seem to crack a case. The team is comprised of Detective Koh, a 15 year veteran, Detective Kim (Min-jun Kim), a rookie eager to make a name for himself, Detective Koh, a married man who spends more time on the job than with his wife, and Detective Ryung ( Sang-mi Nam ), who can’t get taken seriously by her peers because she’s a woman. While at a party with his girlfriend, Kim happens upon information about a drug deal that could get the team the respect they’ve been looking for. But what the team gets into turns out to be not just a big drug bust, but a case that makes Homicide Unit 3 the target of the largest drug lord in Korea .', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aW9IoFjWzBoEQfCdGzx4efisvMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77504'),
  ('134287398842996792', 'Never Too Late For Love', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Maurizio Calvesi, Giulia Di Battista', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Marco Pettenello', 'Gianni Di Gregorio, Stefania Sandrelli, Alfonso Santagata, Alberto Testone, Mauro Lamantia, Agnese Nano, Simone Colombari, Andrea Cosentino', null, 'Astolfo, a retired professor evicted from his apartment, decides to move into an old noble but decrepit palace, the last remnant of his family patrimony in a remote village of Abruzzo, where he hasn''t been for decades. Soon enough, as a newcomer, he befriends a vagabond, a retired chef and a young handyman. A group of four live harmoniously at his place when he comes across Stefania, a charming and generous woman of his age. Astolfo falls in love and struggles with feelings he thought belonged to the past. Encouraged by his loyal group, Astolfo makes a brave step and learns delightedly that it''s never too late to fall in love.', 'Astolfo, a retired professor evicted from his apartment, decides to move into an old noble but decrepit palace, the last remnant of his family patrimony in a remote village of Abruzzo, where he hasn''t been for decades. Soon enough, as a newcomer, he befriends a vagabond, a retired chef and a young handyman. A group of four live harmoniously at his place when he comes across Stefania, a charming and generous woman of his age. Astolfo falls in love and struggles with feelings he thought belonged to the past. Encouraged by his loyal group, Astolfo makes a brave step and learns delightedly that it''s never too late to fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovzsVBaa5ISfkpbEK6jGltkOh74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890583'),
  ('718495220949695356', 'Never Too Young to Die', 1986, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Gil Bettman, David Worth, Karen Gaviola', 'Steven Paul, Anthony Foutz, Stuart Paul', 'John Stamos, Vanity, Gene Simmons, George Lazenby, Robert Englund, Peter Kwong, Ed Brock, John Anderson', 'NR', 'Secret agent Drew Stargrove is brutally murdered by the ruthless hermaphrodite gang leader Velvet Von Ragnar. The murdered secret agent''s son, Lance Stargrove is thrust into the dangerous and intriguing world of secret agents and espionage when he seeks revenge. Danja Deerling teams up with Lance as his sidekick and love interest.', 'Secret agent Drew Stargrove is brutally murdered by the ruthless hermaphrodite gang leader Velvet Von Ragnar. The murdered secret agent''s son, Lance Stargrove is thrust into the dangerous and intriguing world of secret agents and espionage when he seeks revenge. Danja Deerling teams up with Lance as his sidekick and love interest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zWdiRzjw5XNevv4GAV8znwNUDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27408'),
  ('456764069988503616', 'Never Too Young to Dream', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Gustavo Loza, Chava Cartas', 'Carolina Rivera', 'Héctor Suárez, Plutarco Haza, Lumi Cavazos, Rodolfo Arias, Diego Luna, Nora Velázquez, Giovani Florido, Luis Felipe Tovar', null, 'A group of kids have a dream: to play a football championship and to win. Their dream is going to be fulfilled by Don Pepe, an old guy with lots of expectations for his kids.', 'A group of kids have a dream: to play a football championship and to win. Their dream is going to be fulfilled by Don Pepe, an old guy with lots of expectations for his kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2jZthAnaQwVlOeykycmiMqcjZqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205998'),
  ('711907719814682476', 'Never Wave at a WAC', 1953, 'Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Ben Chapman', 'Ken Englund', 'Rosalind Russell, Paul Douglas, Marie Wilson, William Ching, Arleen Whelan, Leif Erickson, Hillary Brooke, Charles Dingle', 'NR', 'A divorced socialite decides to join the Army because she hopes it will enable her to see more of her boyfriend, a Colonel. She soon encounters many difficulties with the Army lifestyle. Moreover, her ex-husband is working as a consultant with the Army, and he uses his position to disrupt her romantic plans by making her join a group of WACs who are testing new equipment.', 'A divorced socialite decides to join the Army because she hopes it will enable her to see more of her boyfriend, a Colonel. She soon encounters many difficulties with the Army lifestyle. Moreover, her ex-husband is working as a consultant with the Army, and he uses his position to disrupt her romantic plans by making her join a group of WACs who are testing new equipment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxACeyEVq2eV273RfMtxh2iafqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107236'),
  ('212079827559494945', 'Never Weaken', 1921, 'Comedy', 'Fred C. Newmeyer, Walter Lundin', 'H.M. Walker', 'Harold Lloyd, Mildred Davis, Roy Brooks, Mark Jones, Charles Stevenson, William Gillespie, Helen Gilmore', 'NR', 'A young man schemes to drum up business for his girlfriend''s employer but after seeing her being intimate with another man, he attempts to commit suicide.', 'A young man schemes to drum up business for his girlfriend''s employer but after seeing her being intimate with another man, he attempts to commit suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ro8eWzMVPvJv93i7VSkugYsIxWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44405'),
  ('141478080407960917', 'Never-Ending Man: Hayao Miyazaki', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Kaku Arakawa', 'Kaku Arakawa', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Toshio Suzuki, Yukinori Nakamura, Nobuo Kawakami, Atsushi Okui, Michiyo Yasuda, Yuhei Sakuragi', null, 'A look at legendary Japanese animator Hayao Miyazaki following his retirement in 2013.', 'A look at legendary Japanese animator Hayao Miyazaki following his retirement in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUgt8hmdGt3Z4sjCqrxZXYI5aGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459414'),
  ('865143187972736526', 'Neverknock', 2017, 'Thriller, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Wilson, Scott McClellan', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Dominique Provost-Chalkley, Jodelle Ferland, Kiana Madeira, Varun Saranga, Lola Flanery, Eliana Jones, Nicholas Campbell, Kiriana Stanton', null, 'In 1986, three teens were brutally murdered after knocking on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane. The killer was never found. Over the next forty years, rumors turned to legend, and while few will admit to believing the stories, kids are still warned never knock on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane for fear of what may answer. On this Halloween night, Grace and her friends are going to wish they’d heeded the warnings and never knocked…', 'In 1986, three teens were brutally murdered after knocking on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane. The killer was never found. Over the next forty years, rumors turned to legend, and while few will admit to believing the stories, kids are still warned never knock on the door of 59 Oakwood Lane for fear of what may answer. On this Halloween night, Grace and her friends are going to wish they’d heeded the warnings and never knocked…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q8zBaiGFagwxKoQKhjg0irpgBax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480405'),
  ('379108940424824415', 'Neverlake', 2014, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Edoardo Petti, Riccardo Paoletti', 'Carlo Longo, Manuela Cacciamani', 'Daisy Keeping, Joy Tanner, David Brandon, Martin Kashirokov, Stefano Patti, Lisa Ruth Andreozzi, Alice Belardi, Ricardo Bonno', null, 'On a trip home to visit her father, Jenny is thrown into a world of mystery, horror and legend when she is called upon by 3000 year old spirits of the Neverlake to help return their lost artifacts and save the lives of missing children.', 'On a trip home to visit her father, Jenny is thrown into a world of mystery, horror and legend when she is called upon by 3000 year old spirits of the Neverlake to help return their lost artifacts and save the lives of missing children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1geR9xZaNkwjE4gEdBdvzg8PC9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270221'),
  ('595669550523383182', 'Nevermind', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Eros Puglielli, Alfredo Betrò', 'Giulia Gianni, Francesca Sambataro, Eros Puglielli', 'Paolo Sassanelli, Andrea Sartoretti, Giulia Michelini, Massimo Poggio, Alberto Molinari, Lucia Gravante, Gualtiero Burzi, Renato Scarpa', null, 'A lawyer with a deplorable habit; a sitter struggling with her disturbing new job; a childhood friend who''s hiding something; a chef with an unspeakable desire; a psychologist haunted by a tow truck... In each segment, a normal person suffers extremely weird, disturbing and paradoxical situations. These situations may seem incredible, yet they happen.', 'A lawyer with a deplorable habit; a sitter struggling with her disturbing new job; a childhood friend who''s hiding something; a chef with an unspeakable desire; a psychologist haunted by a tow truck... In each segment, a normal person suffers extremely weird, disturbing and paradoxical situations. These situations may seem incredible, yet they happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frmhKi787HQW9uJXBHOPF7YkroR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571844'),
  ('526188286941814737', 'Neverwas', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Joshua Michael Stern, Michael Grady', 'Joshua Michael Stern', 'Ian McKellen, Aaron Eckhart, Brittany Murphy, Nick Nolte, Jessica Lange, William Hurt, Bill Bellamy, Alan Cumming', 'PG-13', 'Zach Riley is a psychiatrist, who leaves a job at a prestigious university, to take up a job at the privately run mental institution, Millwood. What he doesn''t reveal at the time of his appointment is that this was the very place where his novelist father, T.L. Pierson, spent many years of his life.', 'Zach Riley is a psychiatrist, who leaves a job at a prestigious university, to take up a job at the privately run mental institution, Millwood. What he doesn''t reveal at the time of his appointment is that this was the very place where his novelist father, T.L. Pierson, spent many years of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJVHrTJtGsSrWFNzVmKaoC71v33.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22473'),
  ('762295413543076572', 'Nevia', 2019, 'Drama', 'Nunzia De Stefano, Guido Michelotti', 'Chiara Atalanta Ridolfi, Nunzia De Stefano', 'Virginia Apicella, Pietra Montecorvino, Rosy Franzese, Pietro Ragusa, Franca Abategiovanni, Lola Bello Durojaiye, Gianfranco Gallo', null, 'Nevia, a 17-years-old girl from a poor trailer park family in Naples, joins a circus, trying to escape from her situation.', 'Nevia, a 17-years-old girl from a poor trailer park family in Naples, joins a circus, trying to escape from her situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0xAxYRyLGOlxBfU7fjqkvpqIOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618226'),
  ('176750344574727913', 'Nevrland', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'Gregor Schmidinger, Jo Molitoris, Georg Mayrhofer', 'Gregor Schmidinger', 'Simon Frühwirth, Paul Forman, Josef Hader, Wolfgang Hübsch, Anton Noori, Markus Schleinzer, Carl Achleitner, Max Meyr', null, '17-year-old Jakob wants nothing more than to feel alive. Uncontrollable anxiety attacks prevent him from doing so and force him to escape into virtual worlds. One night, he meets 26-year-old Kristjan in a cam chat. Their encounter marks the beginning of a transpersonal journey to the wounds of their souls.', '17-year-old Jakob wants nothing more than to feel alive. Uncontrollable anxiety attacks prevent him from doing so and force him to escape into virtual worlds. One night, he meets 26-year-old Kristjan in a cam chat. Their encounter marks the beginning of a transpersonal journey to the wounds of their souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQRXrjGfINHaiyi3I35hjulBTcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:571032'),
  ('105215774782829865', 'New', 2024, 'Drama', 'Zhenia Kazankina, Luda Kuropiatnikova', 'Zhenia Kazankina, Sofia Boteva', 'Daria Mureeva, Vanda Konisevich', null, 'Outskirts of Moscow. A girl comes to an unfamiliar apartment to look after a dog. After a while, she realizes that the owner of the apartment has disappeared. She finds herself into a series of people that have been taking care of the dog for years in that same apartment, creating a weird community around this strange absence of the owner.', 'Outskirts of Moscow. A girl comes to an unfamiliar apartment to look after a dog. After a while, she realizes that the owner of the apartment has disappeared. She finds herself into a series of people that have been taking care of the dog for years in that same apartment, creating a weird community around this strange absence of the owner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDFD6JON4iErwP09OQiPVWRrbfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1275232'),
  ('824599258709349879', 'New Adventures of a Yankee in King Arthur''s Court', 1988, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Viktor Gres, Oleksandr Yanovskyi, Eduard Timlin', 'Mikhail Roshchin, Viktor Gres', 'Sergey Koltakov, Albert Filozov, Elena Finogeeva, Aleksandr Kaydanovskiy, Anastasiya Vertinskaya, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Evdokiya Germanova, Vladimir Soshalsky', null, 'The plane of the American pilot Hank Morgan got lost in time. The pilot falls into temporary loop and finds himself at the era of the glorious King Arthur. Here he is destined to meet the legendary knights of the Round Table and the insidious Queen Morgana - the sister of the king, the beautiful Sandy and the wise Wizard. He will find himself in the rags of a slave and in knightly armor, to witness the greatness and death of the kingdom.', 'The plane of the American pilot Hank Morgan got lost in time. The pilot falls into temporary loop and finds himself at the era of the glorious King Arthur. Here he is destined to meet the legendary knights of the Round Table and the insidious Queen Morgana - the sister of the king, the beautiful Sandy and the wise Wizard. He will find himself in the rags of a slave and in knightly armor, to witness the greatness and death of the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvT3r6IAqeRvHlU2uvgLQrvRkDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106250'),
  ('982950269419217396', 'New Alcatraz', 2001, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Phillip J. Roth, Todd Barron', 'Terri Neish, Phillip J. Roth', 'Dean Cain, Lisa Lackey, Mark Sheppard, Dean Biasucci, Craig Wasson, Grand L. Bush, Richard Tanner, Amandah Reyne', 'R', 'Paleontologist Robert Trenton is called to Northeastern Antarctica near the Indian Ocean to help the FBI build an underground maximum-security military base and prison for the world''s most dangerous criminals and terrorists, which is dubbed "New Alcatrax" by the staff. While building the prison, the staff accidentally awaken and unleash a prehistoric Boa Constrictor from its 200 year hibernation.', 'Paleontologist Robert Trenton is called to Northeastern Antarctica near the Indian Ocean to help the FBI build an underground maximum-security military base and prison for the world''s most dangerous criminals and terrorists, which is dubbed "New Alcatrax" by the staff. While building the prison, the staff accidentally awaken and unleash a prehistoric Boa Constrictor from its 200 year hibernation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KV8f6SYBXGo2G5L82FyYJunhl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110004'),
  ('1002417049990223666', 'New Battles Without Honor and Humanity 1', 1974, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku', 'Fumio Kōnami, Misao Arai', 'Bunta Sugawara, Hiroki Matsukata, Nobuo Kaneko, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Tsunehiko Watase, Kunie Tanaka, Reiko Ike, Yōko Koizumi', null, 'Bunta Sugawara is Miyoshi, a low-level assassin of the Yamamori gang who is sent to jail after a bungled hit. While in stir, family member Aoki attempts to seize power from the boss, and Miyoshi finds himself stuck between the two factions with no honorable way out.', 'Bunta Sugawara is Miyoshi, a low-level assassin of the Yamamori gang who is sent to jail after a bungled hit. While in stir, family member Aoki attempts to seize power from the boss, and Miyoshi finds himself stuck between the two factions with no honorable way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llwcKJy5Ptqog3I1cRbOk17qbn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67567'),
  ('67792962354818651', 'New Battles Without Honor and Humanity 2: Head of the Boss', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tôru Nakajima', 'Susumu Saji, Kōji Takada, Yōzō Tanaka', 'Bunta Sugawara, Meiko Kaji, Tsunehiko Watase, Yuriko Hishimi, Rena Ichinose, Sanae Nakahara, Asei Kobayashi, Junkichi Orimoto', null, 'The seventh in the shocking "Jingi Naki Tatakai" movie series, which exposes the true lives of the yakuza that is hidden by a mask of "jingi". The next stage of this continuing drama is the Kanmon Channel where the Owada and the Kyoei groups are battling for territorial rights and drug smuggling. The Owada sends their man, Tetsu, and his friend Shuji to kill the Kyoei boss. With the promise of fame and riches, Shuji takes the fall and goes to jail for 7 years. But when he''s released, he discovers that he and Tetsu have been all but forgotten by the Owada. Feeling betrayed, Shuji takes matters into his own hands and becomes an unsuspecting pawn in an internal conflict and an assassination attempt on the Owada boss. And now angered, Shuji seeks revenge...', 'The seventh in the shocking "Jingi Naki Tatakai" movie series, which exposes the true lives of the yakuza that is hidden by a mask of "jingi". The next stage of this continuing drama is the Kanmon Channel where the Owada and the Kyoei groups are battling for territorial rights and drug smuggling. The Owada sends their man, Tetsu, and his friend Shuji to kill the Kyoei boss. With the promise of fame and riches, Shuji takes the fall and goes to jail for 7 years. But when he''s released, he discovers that he and Tetsu have been all but forgotten by the Owada. Feeling betrayed, Shuji takes matters into his own hands and becomes an unsuspecting pawn in an internal conflict and an assassination attempt on the Owada boss. And now angered, Shuji seeks revenge...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41omrFdUKnjELfL3lqoh8HoUxcE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67568'),
  ('30808491958617121', 'New Battles Without Honor and Humanity 3: Last Days of the Boss', 1976, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Kinji Fukasaku', 'Kōji Takada', 'Bunta Sugawara, Chieko Matsubara, Kōji Wada, Kenichi Sakuragi, Takeo Chii, Isao Bitō, Koji Nanjo, Takuzō Kawatani', null, 'The eighth sequel of the series by the successful “Fukasaku and Bunta” collaboration revolves around the men of a lesser organization that are constantly bullied by the upper organization and “bleed in vain” in gang wars.', 'The eighth sequel of the series by the successful “Fukasaku and Bunta” collaboration revolves around the men of a lesser organization that are constantly bullied by the upper organization and “bleed in vain” in gang wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57gqQ44mMujHL95f2KkOuC1vEAJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67569'),
  ('281836109534172703', 'New Beginnings', 2023, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Philippe Lefebvre, Diane Capo, Corentin Bourrat', 'Maria Pourchet', 'Franck Dubosc, Karin Viard, Tom Leeb, Clotilde Courau, Youssef Hajdi, Louise Orry-Diquéro, Clémentine Baert, Bérengère Krief', null, 'Alain and Diane have been together for 30 years. In his mind, Alain is still 30 years old. But the equation 30 years of routine feelings, empty nest (and incidentally a job where being 50 is like an incurable disease) creates a much less euphoric effect for Diane. She oscillates between depression and free fall - and the first one who says "hormonal" she smokes. Alain loves Diane like crazy and love is proof. He''s going to do something crazy for her, something to make her feel vital again, to make her heart beat and youthfulness pulsate. The crazy thing? Leave her. The risk with electroshock ? Unknown: either it wakes up or it burns. They will take it, with their eyes closed.', 'Alain and Diane have been together for 30 years. In his mind, Alain is still 30 years old. But the equation 30 years of routine feelings, empty nest (and incidentally a job where being 50 is like an incurable disease) creates a much less euphoric effect for Diane. She oscillates between depression and free fall - and the first one who says "hormonal" she smokes. Alain loves Diane like crazy and love is proof. He''s going to do something crazy for her, something to make her feel vital again, to make her heart beat and youthfulness pulsate. The crazy thing? Leave her. The risk with electroshock ? Unknown: either it wakes up or it burns. They will take it, with their eyes closed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhBv37kJBloQeZZpjOdBMwcXvBV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:998642'),
  ('678190394357690724', 'New Best Friend', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Zoe Clarke-Williams, Tom Priestley Jr.', 'Victoria Strouse', 'Mia Kirshner, Meredith Monroe, Dominique Swain, Rachel True, Scott Bairstow, Taye Diggs, Oliver Hudson, Glynnis O''Connor', 'R', 'Alicia is a poor girl starting college. Hadley, Julianne and Sydney are three well-off girls in a row house. Classes begin and Alicia is paired with Hadley to work on a sociology class project. At first rejected, Alicia is finally accepted into Hadley''s clique where she is introduced to a world of privilege and dangerous thrills. But her attempts to become one of them ultimately land her in the hospital.', 'Alicia is a poor girl starting college. Hadley, Julianne and Sydney are three well-off girls in a row house. Classes begin and Alicia is paired with Hadley to work on a sociology class project. At first rejected, Alicia is finally accepted into Hadley''s clique where she is introduced to a world of privilege and dangerous thrills. But her attempts to become one of them ultimately land her in the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfLukUjlYMvKSlYysdJeNKI8EVN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44373'),
  ('912658162743122690', 'New Biz in the Hood', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laurent Dailland, Mohamed Hamidi, Grégory Bruneau', 'Khaled Amara, Mohamed Hamidi, Michaël Souhaité', 'Gilles Lellouche, Malik Bentalha, Sabrina Ouazani, Camille Lou, Anne-Elisabeth Blateau, Loïc Legendre, Hugo Becker, Harmandeep Palminder', null, 'Fred Bartel is the charismatic boss of a trendy Parisian communication agency, Happy Few. After a heated tax audit, he was forced by the administration to relocate overnight his company in La Courneuve. Fred and his team meet Samy, a young suburb who will quickly propose to teach them the rules and practices to adopt in this new environment.', 'Fred Bartel is the charismatic boss of a trendy Parisian communication agency, Happy Few. After a heated tax audit, he was forced by the administration to relocate overnight his company in La Courneuve. Fred and his team meet Samy, a young suburb who will quickly propose to teach them the rules and practices to adopt in this new environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2WTpc0HpC2fSIFJu6fLe7oyx2t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547388'),
  ('79731156600780641', 'New Blood', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Michael Hurst, Howard Rothschild, Pazz Neglia', 'Michael Hurst', 'John Hurt, Nick Moran, Carrie-Anne Moss, Shawn Wayans, Joe Pantoliano, Goûchy Boy, A.C. Peterson, Eugene Robert Glazer', 'R', 'Alan White is a desperate man; his daughter must have a heart transplant to live. He gets an unexpected visit from his adult son, Danny, a criminal who hasn''t spoken to his family in years. Danny lost track of a man marked for death and is afraid to face his merciless crime boss. In Danny''s plight, Alan sees a way to save both of his children, already prepared to die in order to donate his heart to his daughter, he will stand in for Danny''s escaped hostage.', 'Alan White is a desperate man; his daughter must have a heart transplant to live. He gets an unexpected visit from his adult son, Danny, a criminal who hasn''t spoken to his family in years. Danny lost track of a man marked for death and is afraid to face his merciless crime boss. In Danny''s plight, Alan sees a way to save both of his children, already prepared to die in order to donate his heart to his daughter, he will stand in for Danny''s escaped hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yCpUp4TM0RBEUcD0Jj6DXV4GpcV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193594'),
  ('254293229614315563', 'New Book', 1975, 'Drama', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', 'Zbigniew Rybczyński', null, null, 'Nine cameras set up in a local neighborhood are displayed simultaneously as a man buys a new book.', 'Nine cameras set up in a local neighborhood are displayed simultaneously as a man buys a new book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0WDRGKq8InlpClT4ZG1GpQ7iJe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331489'),
  ('492364240353180196', 'New Boy', 2007, 'Drama', 'Steph Green, Eleonora McNamara, P.J. Dillon', 'Roddy Doyle, Steph Green', 'Olutunji Ebun-Cole, Simon O''Driscoll, Fionn O''Shea, Sinead Maguire, Norma Sheahan, Byron Kumbala, Sade Oyewole, Daniel Culleton', null, 'A young African boy with a haunting backstory starts school in Ireland and quickly finds out exactly what it means to be the new kid. Winner of Best Narrative Short at the 2008 Tribeca Film Festival and nominated for an Oscar.', 'A young African boy with a haunting backstory starts school in Ireland and quickly finds out exactly what it means to be the new kid. Winner of Best Narrative Short at the 2008 Tribeca Film Festival and nominated for an Oscar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWbx4W09bBDNfJYOTBHpzX0Hr53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143150'),
  ('407322263723962880', 'New Delhi', 1987, 'Thriller', 'Joshiy, Jayanan Vincent', 'Dennis Joseph', 'Mammootty, Sumalatha, Urvashi, Suresh Gopi, Thyagarajan, Vijayaraghavan, Devan, Jagannatha Varma', null, 'A journalist is illegally jailed for exposing two corrupt politicians, He exacts revenge through his new mysterious newspaper.', 'A journalist is illegally jailed for exposing two corrupt politicians, He exacts revenge through his new mysterious newspaper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLlqnlmYZHY8YxzQ4A1573uC0tW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277992'),
  ('810347178250188472', 'New Dimension! Crayon Shin-chan the Movie: Battle of Supernatural Powers ~Flying Sushi~', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Hitoshi One', 'Hitoshi One', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Suzuki Mogura, Tori Matsuzaka, Mizukawa Katamari', null, '40-years ago, there was a prophecy claiming that in the year of “20” and “23”, two emitting lights would come to the Earth from outer space. And the dark light with strong power will bring out a huge disaster. In the summer of 2023, as predicted, two mysterious lights approach Japan and descend on Kasukabe. The white light hits Shin-chan, which makes him get a superpower. Meanwhile, a man called Mitsuru Hiriya, has been bathed in dark light and has acquired psychic powers begins to run amok. A man who wants the destruction of the world, Hiriya VS A happy-go-lucky kindergarten child, Shinnosuke. A superpower battle is going to begin!', '40-years ago, there was a prophecy claiming that in the year of “20” and “23”, two emitting lights would come to the Earth from outer space. And the dark light with strong power will bring out a huge disaster. In the summer of 2023, as predicted, two mysterious lights approach Japan and descend on Kasukabe. The white light hits Shin-chan, which makes him get a superpower. Meanwhile, a man called Mitsuru Hiriya, has been bathed in dark light and has acquired psychic powers begins to run amok. A man who wants the destruction of the world, Hiriya VS A happy-go-lucky kindergarten child, Shinnosuke. A superpower battle is going to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a56Fm2YWrlnqlC3TIgDvCJdzlKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059572'),
  ('939868759757409714', 'New Dragon Gate Inn', 1992, 'Action, Thriller', 'Raymond Lee Wai-Man, Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Charcoal Tan', 'Maggie Cheung, Brigitte Lin, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Donnie Yen, Yen Shi-Kwan, Yuen Cheung-Yan, Lau Shun, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah', 'NR', 'During the Ming Dynasty, power-crazed eunuch Tso Siu Yan rules his desert region of China as if he were Emperor, ruthlessly thwarts plots against him and sets a trap for one of his enemies at the Dragon Gate Inn.', 'During the Ming Dynasty, power-crazed eunuch Tso Siu Yan rules his desert region of China as if he were Emperor, ruthlessly thwarts plots against him and sets a trap for one of his enemies at the Dragon Gate Inn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCkdnfVu08gM87KcbEOURyymAtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40213'),
  ('718801693063847966', 'New Dubai', 2014, 'Drama', 'Matheus da Rocha Pereira, Gustavo Vinagre', 'Gustavo Vinagre', 'Gustavo Vinagre, Bruno D''Ugo, Hugo Guimarães, Fernando Maia, Caetano Gotardo, Daniel Prates, Herman Barck, Marta Vinagre', null, 'In a middle-class neighbourhood in a city in the countryside of Brazil, the real estate speculation is a menace to the affective memory of a group of friends. Their answer to this imminent transformation is to fuck in the construction sites. And what about love? Is love just a construction?', 'In a middle-class neighbourhood in a city in the countryside of Brazil, the real estate speculation is a menace to the affective memory of a group of friends. Their answer to this imminent transformation is to fuck in the construction sites. And what about love? Is love just a construction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6muPGyLRhu7tiGnLt5msDqBVknR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:313534'),
  ('524512947233370296', 'New Earth', 1933, 'Documentary', 'Joris Ivens', 'Joris Ivens', 'Joris Ivens', null, 'The film is a documentary portraying a struggle as man tries to subdue nature. To prevent flooding and for purposes of land reclamation, the people of the Netherlands struggle and succeed in building a breaker, thereby eliminating the wild inland body of water once known as the Zuider Zee (now called Ijsselmeer).', 'The film is a documentary portraying a struggle as man tries to subdue nature. To prevent flooding and for purposes of land reclamation, the people of the Netherlands struggle and succeed in building a breaker, thereby eliminating the wild inland body of water once known as the Zuider Zee (now called Ijsselmeer).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wfnRkuAdGBx8OMxnprnJAkU8N5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129394'),
  ('403930332578983459', 'New Eden', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Alan Metzger, Geoffrey Erb', 'Alan Metzger', 'Stephen Baldwin, Lisa Bonet, Tobin Bell, Michael Bowen, Janet Hubert, M.C. Gainey, Kate McGregor-Stewart, Abraham Verduzco', null, 'Prisoners are dumped on a sand planet dubbed Earth 21-523 where most are immediately killed by the sand people and the remainder struggle for existence. That is until a new prisoner arrives with ideas of providing irrigation of the desert. But he still must first fight the nomadic sand people.', 'Prisoners are dumped on a sand planet dubbed Earth 21-523 where most are immediately killed by the sand people and the remainder struggle for existence. That is until a new prisoner arrives with ideas of providing irrigation of the desert. But he still must first fight the nomadic sand people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ju6gadJFQT2JwuzWYwu8B1ya6zM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215760'),
  ('189041982148925470', 'New Fist of Fury', 1976, 'Action, Thriller', 'Chen Jung-Shu, Chan Chung-Yuen, Lo Wei', 'Lo Wei, Pan Lei', 'Jackie Chan, Nora Miao, Chan Sing, Henry Luk Yat-Lung, Yi Ming, Sun Lan, Liu Ming, Cheng Siu-Siu', null, 'A brother and sister escape from Japanese-occupied Shanghai to Japanese-occupied Taiwan, to stay with their grandfather who runs a Kung-Fu school there. However, the master of a Japanese Kung- Fu school in Taiwan has plans to bringing all other schools on the island under his domination, and part of his plan involves the murder of the grandfather.', 'A brother and sister escape from Japanese-occupied Shanghai to Japanese-occupied Taiwan, to stay with their grandfather who runs a Kung-Fu school there. However, the master of a Japanese Kung- Fu school in Taiwan has plans to bringing all other schools on the island under his domination, and part of his plan involves the murder of the grandfather.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Uk4Crwwuz3OHeEtOZIRxFSgSxY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18666'),
  ('874934726319290845', 'New Fist of the North Star: The Cursed City', 2003, 'Animation, Action', 'Haruo Sotozaki, Takashi Watanabe', 'Nobuhiko Horie', 'Takehito Koyasu, Yurika Hino, Akimitsu Takase, GACKT, Unsho Ishizuka, Tomoe Hanba, Hideyuki Tanaka, Seiji Sasaki', null, 'In the 21st century, a nuclear war turned most of the Earth''s surface into a desert wasteland, which also resulted in the contamination of the Earth''s water supply. A man named Sanga has built the fortified haven of the "Last Land", where he rules as its dictator by monopolizing the city''s uncontaminated water supply. When he learns that the neighboring residents of Freedom Village are trying to dig up a well for their own, Sanga sends his underlings to sabotage their effort. Kenshiro, master of Hokuto Shinken, gets involved in the conflict between the two regions after saving Tobi, an informant hired by Freedom Village.', 'In the 21st century, a nuclear war turned most of the Earth''s surface into a desert wasteland, which also resulted in the contamination of the Earth''s water supply. A man named Sanga has built the fortified haven of the "Last Land", where he rules as its dictator by monopolizing the city''s uncontaminated water supply. When he learns that the neighboring residents of Freedom Village are trying to dig up a well for their own, Sanga sends his underlings to sabotage their effort. Kenshiro, master of Hokuto Shinken, gets involved in the conflict between the two regions after saving Tobi, an informant hired by Freedom Village.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBpuAb43Wght0XBZQJsWDSCbIfR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120985'),
  ('815314607011310319', 'New Fist of the North Star: The Forbidden Fist', 2003, 'Animation, Action', 'Takashi Watanabe', 'Nobuhiko Horie', 'Takehito Koyasu, Yurika Hino, Akimitsu Takase, Romi Park', null, 'The Last Land has crumbled at the hands of Kenshiro, but in order to save the young Lord Doha, the powerful hero must travel through a land haunted by murderous demons in this sequel to the hit anime Fist of the North Star. Lord Doha has fallen ill, and if he doesn''t receive a rare serum within a few short days he will certainly die. Though the serum is a two-day trip in both directions, Sara reveals that there is a shorter path running through Cliffland but it is haunted by vicious demons. As Kenshiro bravely makes way for the dreaded Cliffland, a new fighter named Seiji arrives in Last Land pursued by evil Clifflanders and vowing to reclaim Sanga''s legacy.', 'The Last Land has crumbled at the hands of Kenshiro, but in order to save the young Lord Doha, the powerful hero must travel through a land haunted by murderous demons in this sequel to the hit anime Fist of the North Star. Lord Doha has fallen ill, and if he doesn''t receive a rare serum within a few short days he will certainly die. Though the serum is a two-day trip in both directions, Sara reveals that there is a shorter path running through Cliffland but it is haunted by vicious demons. As Kenshiro bravely makes way for the dreaded Cliffland, a new fighter named Seiji arrives in Last Land pursued by evil Clifflanders and vowing to reclaim Sanga''s legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68xgjMSyt2wzyF54bExOuMEvCvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247541'),
  ('935872806512186896', 'New Fist of the North Star: When a Man Carries Sorrow', 2004, 'Animation, Action', 'Takashi Watanabe', 'Nobuhiko Horie', 'Takehito Koyasu, Yurika Hino, Akimitsu Takase, Romi Park', null, 'Destruction and betrayal take center stage in the latest installment of the New Fist of the North Star series. When Kenshiro returns to find the city in ruins and its citizens tormented, his pain is compounded when he is betrayed and imprisoned by Tobi. As Tobi prepares a brutal assault on Seiji, Kenshiro must summon all of his strength to break free and take put a halt to his former friend''s destructive scheme.', 'Destruction and betrayal take center stage in the latest installment of the New Fist of the North Star series. When Kenshiro returns to find the city in ruins and its citizens tormented, his pain is compounded when he is betrayed and imprisoned by Tobi. As Tobi prepares a brutal assault on Seiji, Kenshiro must summon all of his strength to break free and take put a halt to his former friend''s destructive scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spKjfBXMSMbSO5HTvdjpcG5UjeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247543'),
  ('827215384163916076', 'New Folder 2', 2015, 'Drama', 'Hwang Sang-won', null, 'Yoon Sul-hee, Lee Doo-yeon, Kim Soo-ji, Amy, Shin Hwa-chul, Yang Geun-seok', null, 'Ho-jae has the building, the house, the fancy car that his parents left to him to manage as they live abroad for business. Ho-Jae was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. Ho-jae who pretends to be a dutiful son in front of his parents. He enjoys casual sex with women. For Ho-jae who had been living a life all his friends were envious of, there is a sudden wrench in the works. Did he play his con too well? His mother asks his aunt to introduce him to some nice girls. A sexy aunt and a devious nephew... their dangerous cohabitation starts!', 'Ho-jae has the building, the house, the fancy car that his parents left to him to manage as they live abroad for business. Ho-Jae was born with a silver spoon in his mouth. Ho-jae who pretends to be a dutiful son in front of his parents. He enjoys casual sex with women. For Ho-jae who had been living a life all his friends were envious of, there is a sudden wrench in the works. Did he play his con too well? His mother asks his aunt to introduce him to some nice girls. A sexy aunt and a devious nephew... their dangerous cohabitation starts!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAp9J9WhZSY0zGhq0D9ufk1zj9p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397469'),
  ('59957262972581594', 'New Frontier', 1939, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Reggie Lanning, William Lava', 'Betty Burbridge, Luci Ward', 'John Wayne, Ray Corrigan, Raymond Hatton, Jennifer Jones, Eddy Waller, Sammy McKim, LeRoy Mason, Harrison Greene', 'NR', 'The Three Mesquiteers convince a group of settlers to exchange their present property for some which, unbeknownst to our goodguys, is going to be worthless. They are captured before they can warn the ranchers.', 'The Three Mesquiteers convince a group of settlers to exchange their present property for some which, unbeknownst to our goodguys, is going to be worthless. They are captured before they can warn the ranchers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUM48xaxoNcghPqQZ9NTemqXZw4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53719'),
  ('233139703477507174', 'New Gods: Yang Jian', 2022, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Zhao Ji', 'Chen Mu-Chuan', 'Kai Wang, Ji Guanlin, Lihong Li, Li Lanling, Zhao Yi, Liu Xiaoyu, Wen jingyuan, Shuiyu Tang', 'NR', 'Fifteen hundred years after the war of gods, the heaven declined. Yang Jian, the God of Erlang, made a living by working as a catcher. One day, Yang Jian was ordered to hunt down a young man, his own nephew.', 'Fifteen hundred years after the war of gods, the heaven declined. Yang Jian, the God of Erlang, made a living by working as a catcher. One day, Yang Jian was ordered to hunt down a young man, his own nephew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW5dFOemV4d7hxTcVI2bu4u0C9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844075'),
