  ('1061749905204758272', 'New Year''s Eve', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Garry Marshall, Charles Minsky', 'Katherine Fugate', 'Hilary Swank, Robert De Niro, Michelle Pfeiffer, Josh Duhamel, Sarah Jessica Parker, Zac Efron, Lea Michele, Ashton Kutcher', 'PG-13', 'The lives of several couples and singles in New York intertwine over the course of New Year''s Eve.', 'The lives of several couples and singles in New York intertwine over the course of New Year''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TroWD1BdcLEL7Ycqv4kkCRw7KJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62838'),
  ('570089951883004425', 'New Year''s Eve', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Ozan Açıktan', 'Gülse Birsel', 'Şebnem Bozoklu, Fatih Artman, Gülse Birsel, Kubilay Tunçer, Cengiz Bozkurt, Derya Karadaş, Alina Boz, Ayta Sözeri', null, 'With the hope that the pandemic is coming to an end, Didem has been preparing for a New Year’s Eve celebration for over a month. All her loved ones can finally get together and make up for the lost time, but the lockdown announcement has her plans blown off course. Ozan is determined to let his wife have the celebration she deserves. He invites their neighbors to the party, and the fun begins.', 'With the hope that the pandemic is coming to an end, Didem has been preparing for a New Year’s Eve celebration for over a month. All her loved ones can finally get together and make up for the lost time, but the lockdown announcement has her plans blown off course. Ozan is determined to let his wife have the celebration she deserves. He invites their neighbors to the party, and the fun begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWTdKXItojRjozaoCOv4zmBGxzO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1052918'),
  ('925704397026251346', 'New Year''s Eve At Bob''s', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Alain Derobe', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Jacques Audiard, Yves Stavrides', 'Guy Bedos, Jean Rochefort, Michel Galabru, Agnès Soral, Mireille Darc, Bernard Fresson, Thierry Magnier, Sam Karmann', null, 'On New Year''s Eve, among the tower blocks of a huge housing estate in Paris, strange people - each for a different reason - are looking for the home of a man called Bob.', 'On New Year''s Eve, among the tower blocks of a huge housing estate in Paris, strange people - each for a different reason - are looking for the home of a man called Bob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQpquOrSTGShKiFm328RVeOd1ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144557'),
