  ('145561999411351864', 'New York', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Kabir Khan, Aseem Mishra, Ali Abbas Zafar', 'Sandeep Srivastava', 'John Abraham, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Katrina Kaif, Irrfan Khan, Aidan Wagner, Nawazuddin Siddiqui, Samrat Chakrabarti, Ali Quli Mirza', null, 'New York is a contemporary story of friendship set against the larger than life backdrop of a city often described as the centre of the world. Omar has gone abroad for the first time in his life and soon enough he begins to see and love America through the eyes of his American friends - Sam and Maya. It is the story of these three friends discovering a new world together.', 'New York is a contemporary story of friendship set against the larger than life backdrop of a city often described as the centre of the world. Omar has gone abroad for the first time in his life and soon enough he begins to see and love America through the eyes of his American friends - Sam and Maya. It is the story of these three friends discovering a new world together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFp4MiFPNGPiLOnl5zZGnS13jAL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19616'),
  ('513185188262429202', 'New York Confidential', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Russell Rouse, Eddie Fitzgerald', 'Russell Rouse, Clarence Greene', 'Broderick Crawford, Richard Conte, Marilyn Maxwell, Anne Bancroft, J. Carrol Naish, Onslow Stevens, Barry Kelley, Mike Mazurki', null, 'Story follows the rise and subsequent fall of the notorious head of a New York crime family, who decides to testify against his pals in order to avoid being killed by his fellow cohorts.', 'Story follows the rise and subsequent fall of the notorious head of a New York crime family, who decides to testify against his pals in order to avoid being killed by his fellow cohorts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8Rs5DVWsX37I1wbg8ZrsmeikCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35958'),
  ('215490926932460757', 'New York Minute', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Greg Gardiner, Dennie Gordon, Conrad E. Palmisano', 'Bill Collage, Emily Fox, Adam Cooper', 'Ashley Olsen, Mary-Kate Olsen, Eugene Levy, Andy Richter, Riley Smith, Jared Padalecki, Drew Pinsky, Darrell Hammond', 'PG', 'Top student Jane Ryan heads to Manhattan for a college-scholarship competition. Her rebellious twin Roxy Ryan goes along to crash a video shoot. But anything can happen - and does - in a romp involving a pursuing truant officer, a smuggler, hunkalicious guys and the girls'' realization that when the chips are down, a sister can be the best friend of all.', 'Top student Jane Ryan heads to Manhattan for a college-scholarship competition. Her rebellious twin Roxy Ryan goes along to crash a video shoot. But anything can happen - and does - in a romp involving a pursuing truant officer, a smuggler, hunkalicious guys and the girls'' realization that when the chips are down, a sister can be the best friend of all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/px9hV6w6XzAjGdxCRUAUasAHQsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11025'),
  ('1127104168118590093', 'New York Ninja', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Kurtis Spieler, John Liu, Aaron Kleinman', 'Arthur Schweitzer, Kurtis Spieler, John Liu', 'John Liu, Don Wilson, Adrienne Meltzer, Linnea Quigley, Vince Murdocco, Leon Isaac Kennedy, Cynthia Rothrock, Michael Berryman', 'NR', 'A sound technician''s pregnant wife is brutally murdered while witnessing a kidnapping in broad daylight. Dressing as a white ninja, he takes to the streets as a sword-wielding vigilante hell bent on cleaning up the streets of New York City.', 'A sound technician''s pregnant wife is brutally murdered while witnessing a kidnapping in broad daylight. Dressing as a white ninja, he takes to the streets as a sword-wielding vigilante hell bent on cleaning up the streets of New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oXECgPkTPx98EZWcaCpHH3Rdhv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:870219'),
  ('359464021248616102', 'New York Stories', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Joseph P. Reidy, Vebe Borge, Néstor Almendros', 'Richard Price, Francis Ford Coppola, Sofia Coppola', 'Nick Nolte, Rosanna Arquette, Patrick O''Neal, Mae Questel, Steve Buscemi, Talia Shire, Giancarlo Giannini, Heather McComb', 'PG', 'Three tales of love, ambition, and neurosis unfold in the city that never sleeps. In "Life Lessons" (Martin Scorsese), a tormented painter channels heartbreak into his art. In "Life Without Zoë" (Francis Ford Coppola), a precocious 12-year-old navigates privilege and loneliness in a Manhattan hotel. And in "Oedipus Wrecks" (Woody Allen), a man’s domineering mother literally becomes a looming presence over New York.', 'Three tales of love, ambition, and neurosis unfold in the city that never sleeps. In "Life Lessons" (Martin Scorsese), a tormented painter channels heartbreak into his art. In "Life Without Zoë" (Francis Ford Coppola), a precocious 12-year-old navigates privilege and loneliness in a Manhattan hotel. And in "Oedipus Wrecks" (Woody Allen), a man’s domineering mother literally becomes a looming presence over New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mViGEH5dfsAnUgJmce1RJkFycAi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9686'),
