  ('917270998265467846', 'New York, I Love You', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jiang Wen, Mira Nair, Shunji Iwai', 'Hu Hong, Meng Yao, Suketu Mehta', 'Natalie Portman, Hayden Christensen, Bradley Cooper, Ethan Hawke, Shia LaBeouf, Andy Garcia, Orlando Bloom, Chris Cooper', 'R', 'New York, I Love You delves into the intimate lives of New Yorkers as they grapple with, delight in and search for love. Journey from the Diamond District in the heart of Manhattan, through Chinatown and the Upper East Side, towards the Village, into Tribeca, and Brooklyn as lovers of all ages try to find romance in the Big Apple.', 'New York, I Love You delves into the intimate lives of New Yorkers as they grapple with, delight in and search for love. Journey from the Diamond District in the heart of Manhattan, through Chinatown and the Upper East Side, towards the Village, into Tribeca, and Brooklyn as lovers of all ages try to find romance in the Big Apple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnuoA0R0kUCu88xZGiv2mK02Hoz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12572'),
  ('900116862862598201', 'New York, N.Y.', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon, Raymond Depardon', null, 'Raymond Depardon', null, 'It is slow, succinct and absolutely riveting. With his photojournalist''s eye, and simple but inspired camera work, Depardon plunges us into both the sounds and silences of a day and a night in the city.', 'It is slow, succinct and absolutely riveting. With his photojournalist''s eye, and simple but inspired camera work, Depardon plunges us into both the sounds and silences of a day and a night in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cByuW0sLDqMSM9meSoQKVk6mSL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128470'),
  ('782848513175375922', 'New York, New York', 1977, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Mel Dellar, Michael Grillo, Martin Scorsese', 'Fred Ebb', 'Liza Minnelli, Robert De Niro, Lionel Stander, Barry Primus, Mary Kay Place, George Memmoli, Dick Miller, Murray Moston', 'PG', 'An egotistical saxophone player and a young singer meet on V-J Day and embark upon a strained and rocky romance, even as their careers begin a long uphill climb.', 'An egotistical saxophone player and a young singer meet on V-J Day and embark upon a strained and rocky romance, even as their careers begin a long uphill climb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1nD40aUcPAxYdE1WxERrTjZuFGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12637'),
