  ('13825746172734016', 'New Zealand - Home of Middle-earth - Part 3', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Cast and crew members discuss New Zealand being an ideal filming location for the "Hobbit" films. Comes with the extended version of ''The Battle of the Five Armies''.', 'Cast and crew members discuss New Zealand being an ideal filming location for the "Hobbit" films. Comes with the extended version of ''The Battle of the Five Armies''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uQHL26gbQbBGmKH8nVLkhiCbTw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:388754'),
