  ('859238322938178819', 'Newcastle', 2008, 'Romance, Drama', 'Dan Castle, Richard Michalak, Tony Gilbert', 'Dan Castle', 'Lachlan Buchanan, Xavier Samuel, Reshad Strik, Kirk Jenkins, Israel Cannan, Ben Milliken, Debra Ades, Rebecca Breeds', 'R', '17-year old Jesse lives in the shadow of his older brother Victor''s failure to become surfing''s Next Big Thing. Even when he''s in his natural habitat of magnificent surf breaks, his blue-collar future is brought home by the coal barges that constantly line his horizon. Jesse has the natural skills to surf his way out of this reality and onto the international circuit but can he overcome his equally natural ability to sabotage himself? A momentous weekend away with his mates that includes first love and tragedy leads him to discover what''s really important, and also to the performance of a lifetime.', '17-year old Jesse lives in the shadow of his older brother Victor''s failure to become surfing''s Next Big Thing. Even when he''s in his natural habitat of magnificent surf breaks, his blue-collar future is brought home by the coal barges that constantly line his horizon. Jesse has the natural skills to surf his way out of this reality and onto the international circuit but can he overcome his equally natural ability to sabotage himself? A momentous weekend away with his mates that includes first love and tragedy leads him to discover what''s really important, and also to the performance of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47XuBP7OAoRMEtaxJkxRM7vOtee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40502'),
  ('741354446912332396', 'Newman Laugh-O-Grams', 1921, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Walt Disney', null, 'Walt Disney', null, 'A short film depicting Walt Disney sitting at his desk drawing a series of still cartoons and simple animations in a satirical newsreel format. A compilation of four cartoons about Kansas City are presented: "Cleaning Up!!?," "Kansas City Girls Are Rolling Their Own Now," "Did You Ever Take a Ride Over Kansas City Street in a Fliver" and "Kansas City''s Spring Clean-Up."', 'A short film depicting Walt Disney sitting at his desk drawing a series of still cartoons and simple animations in a satirical newsreel format. A compilation of four cartoons about Kansas City are presented: "Cleaning Up!!?," "Kansas City Girls Are Rolling Their Own Now," "Did You Ever Take a Ride Over Kansas City Street in a Fliver" and "Kansas City''s Spring Clean-Up."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smQwX2jxyuEZzimrVEX9fnpXiZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312815'),
  ('745245155831096649', 'Newness', 2017, 'Romance, Drama', 'Colin Flaherty, Sean Vawter, Sean Stiegemeier', 'Ben York Jones', 'Nicholas Hoult, Laia Costa, Danny Huston, Courtney Eaton, Matthew Gray Gubler, Pom Klementieff, David Selby, Amanda Serra', null, 'In contemporary Los Angeles, two millennials navigating a social media–driven hookup culture begin a relationship that pushes both emotional and physical boundaries.', 'In contemporary Los Angeles, two millennials navigating a social media–driven hookup culture begin a relationship that pushes both emotional and physical boundaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vySlYPqOrI5s8Nu6bzpGKQbotVy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434203'),
  ('211971989542667234', 'News from a Personal War', 1999, 'Documentary, Crime', 'João Moreira Salles, Kátia Lund, Walter Carvalho', 'João Moreira Salles, Kátia Lund', 'Nilton Cerqueira, Carlos Luis Gregório, Paulo Lins, Hélio Luz, Rodrigo Pimentel, Itamar Silva', null, 'A documentary about urban violence in Brazil, especially in Rio de Janeiro. Policemen, drug dealers, and shantytown dwellers get trapped in a daily war that knows no winners.', 'A documentary about urban violence in Brazil, especially in Rio de Janeiro. Policemen, drug dealers, and shantytown dwellers get trapped in a daily war that knows no winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrnjox3BPU9pKWTTKHQeVcncwb7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17359'),
  ('643514931404985557', 'News from Home', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Paule Zadjermann, Jim Asbell', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman', null, 'Impersonal and beautiful images of Akerman''s life in New York are combined with letters from her loving but manipulative mother, read by Akerman herself.', 'Impersonal and beautiful images of Akerman''s life in New York are combined with letters from her loving but manipulative mother, read by Akerman herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWqWaEySdo8hAKJsd1IS9mdnZpF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86814'),
  ('541524885926739480', 'News from Planet Mars', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Dominik Moll, Jean-François Hensgens', 'Gilles Marchand, Dominik Moll', 'François Damiens, Vincent Macaigne, Veerle Baetens, Jeanne Guittet, Tom Rivoire, Léa Drucker, Michel Aumont, Catherine Samie', null, 'Philippe Mars wants to please everyone. He wants to be a good father, a friendly ex-husband, a helpful colleague and an understanding brother. Unfortunately, his little world goes out of its planned orbit. His son becomes a hardcore vegetarian, his daughter a compulsive swot, whilst his sister exhibits giant paintings of their naked parents. At the office he must face the rampages of his mentally unstable colleague Jerôme who one night turns up at his door with a young woman in tow who has just been released from a clinic.', 'Philippe Mars wants to please everyone. He wants to be a good father, a friendly ex-husband, a helpful colleague and an understanding brother. Unfortunately, his little world goes out of its planned orbit. His son becomes a hardcore vegetarian, his daughter a compulsive swot, whilst his sister exhibits giant paintings of their naked parents. At the office he must face the rampages of his mentally unstable colleague Jerôme who one night turns up at his door with a young woman in tow who has just been released from a clinic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/58SCg6PYqrq12uZGyereMBHS4CC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380879'),
  ('533849268003574120', 'News from the Good Lord', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Didier Le Pêcheur, Gérard Simon', 'Artus de Penguern, Didier Le Pêcheur', 'Marie Trintignant, Maria de Medeiros, Christian Charmetant, Jean Yanne, Michel Vuillermoz, Isabelle Candelier, Artus de Penguern, Serge Riaboukine', null, 'When novelist Alessandro Battavia commits suicide, a taxi driver named Evangile and her brother Nord believe they are characters imagined in a novel, probably one written by God.', 'When novelist Alessandro Battavia commits suicide, a taxi driver named Evangile and her brother Nord believe they are characters imagined in a novel, probably one written by God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Z2s0PvkBmRIQET5ZnFZoXzNM98.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78496'),
  ('667176383197006749', 'News Items', 1983, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, null, null, 'This documentary follows the daily life of a section of the police station of the fifth "arrondissement" (district) of Paris.', 'This documentary follows the daily life of a section of the police station of the fifth "arrondissement" (district) of Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wM7RvEJ4nTXVJL5BhreBzL6AgSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133452'),
  ('870776069510666649', 'News of the World', 2020, 'Drama, Western, Adventure', 'Billy W. Ray, Natasha Gerasimova, Jeff Dashnaw', 'Paul Greengrass, Luke Davies', 'Tom Hanks, Helena Zengel, Michael Angelo Covino, Ray McKinnon, Mare Winningham, Elizabeth Marvel, Fred Hechinger, Bill Camp', 'PG-13', 'A Texan traveling across the wild West bringing the news of the world to local townspeople, agrees to help rescue a young girl who was kidnapped.', 'A Texan traveling across the wild West bringing the news of the world to local townspeople, agrees to help rescue a young girl who was kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYQCgVRsQTEfUrP7cW5iAFVYOlh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581032'),
  ('972161584761772280', 'Newsfront', 1978, 'Drama', 'Phillip Noyce', 'Phillip Noyce', 'Bill Hunter, Wendy Hughes, Gerard Kennedy, Chris Haywood, John Ewart, Don Crosby, Angela Punch McGregor, John Clayton', null, 'Two brothers working as news cameramen for competing companies in ''50s Australia find their lives dramatically affected by the constantly changing times in which they live.', 'Two brothers working as news cameramen for competing companies in ''50s Australia find their lives dramatically affected by the constantly changing times in which they live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6voFToDS0tAqXrkNPc2H1nKANo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88285'),
  ('560049303848422117', 'Newsies', 1992, 'Drama, History', 'Andrew Laszlo, Kenny Ortega', 'Noni White, Bob Tzudiker', 'Christian Bale, Bill Pullman, Ann-Margret, Robert Duvall, David Moscow, Luke Edwards, Max Casella, Gabriel Damon', 'PG', 'A week in the life of the exploited, child newspaper sellers in turn-of-the-century New York. When their publisher, Joseph Pulitzer, tries to squeeze a little more profit out of their labours, they organize a strike, only to be confronted with the Pulitzer''s hard-ball tactics.', 'A week in the life of the exploited, child newspaper sellers in turn-of-the-century New York. When their publisher, Joseph Pulitzer, tries to squeeze a little more profit out of their labours, they organize a strike, only to be confronted with the Pulitzer''s hard-ball tactics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ykmCMHzkRSuJucPYeqGA2ampbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15300'),
  ('30457332717333126', 'Newsies', 2017, 'Music, Comedy, Drama, History, Romance', 'Clayton Jacobsen, Jeff Calhoun, Richard J. Hinds', 'Noni White, Bob Tzudiker', 'Jeremy Jordan, Kara Lindsay, Ben Fankhauser, Andrew Keenan-Bolger, Steve Blanchard, Aisha de Haas, Ethan Steiner, Tommy Bracco', 'PG', 'A week in the life of the exploited, child newspaper sellers in turn-of-the-century New York. When their publisher, Joseph Pulitzer, tries to squeeze a little more profit out of their labours, they organize a strike, only to be confronted with the Pulitzer''s hard-ball tactics.', 'A week in the life of the exploited, child newspaper sellers in turn-of-the-century New York. When their publisher, Joseph Pulitzer, tries to squeeze a little more profit out of their labours, they organize a strike, only to be confronted with the Pulitzer''s hard-ball tactics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gw7WM8xZ5xrJp1KniSbrbY9DMI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462477'),
  ('882220964119979807', 'Newsmakers', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Anders Banke, Asya Gusakova, Mikaël Meisen-Dietmann', 'Alexandr Lungin, Chan Hing-Kai, Yip Tin-Shing', 'Andrey Merzlikin, Evgeny Tsyganov, Masha Mashkova, Sergey Garmash, Maksim Konovalov, Aleksey Frandetti, Pavel Klimov, Sergey Vesnin', null, 'A gang of crooks robbing cash collectors, run into a police surveillance team and the inadequate police response results in a gunfight. A TV crew on assignment in the area happens to capture this humiliation on camera, and this example of police incompetence is soon the lead story in every news bulletin. Public confidence in law and order now suffers irreparable harm. The head of the Moscow force welcomes a public search-and-destroy operation against these thugs, the brainchild of Katya, his PR director. She proposes that the capture of this dangerous gang be transformed into a live TV show of a kind never seen before. At this point she cannot know that the gang leader''s life-and-death struggle with the police is destined to lead to a media duel. Besieged in a huge apartment block, the crooks hold hostage a father and his son and daughter. A massive special forces rescue operation is mounted but fails miserably.', 'A gang of crooks robbing cash collectors, run into a police surveillance team and the inadequate police response results in a gunfight. A TV crew on assignment in the area happens to capture this humiliation on camera, and this example of police incompetence is soon the lead story in every news bulletin. Public confidence in law and order now suffers irreparable harm. The head of the Moscow force welcomes a public search-and-destroy operation against these thugs, the brainchild of Katya, his PR director. She proposes that the capture of this dangerous gang be transformed into a live TV show of a kind never seen before. At this point she cannot know that the gang leader''s life-and-death struggle with the police is destined to lead to a media duel. Besieged in a huge apartment block, the crooks hold hostage a father and his son and daughter. A massive special forces rescue operation is mounted but fails miserably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXYJhqYTO48SdqfeAbzEk5eRgQe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37695'),
  ('691941612907084408', 'Newton', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Amit Masurkar, Swapnil S. Sonawane', 'Amit Masurkar, Mayank Tewari', 'Rajkummar Rao, Pankaj Tripathi, Anjali Patil, Raghubir Yadav, Mukesh Prajapati, Sanjay Mishra, Krishna Singh Bisht, Omkar Das Manikpuri', null, 'A government clerk on election duty in a conflict-ridden jungle of Central India tries his best to conduct free and fair voting despite the apathy of security forces and the looming fear of guerrilla attacks by communist rebels.', 'A government clerk on election duty in a conflict-ridden jungle of Central India tries his best to conduct free and fair voting despite the apathy of security forces and the looming fear of guerrilla attacks by communist rebels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubzHA1aXUsWvQJHjvqBCHxzTBi5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439128'),
  ('266482730365794043', 'Next', 1990, 'Animation', 'Barry JC Purves', 'Barry JC Purves', 'Roger Rees, Barry JC Purves', null, 'William Shakespeare, without saying a word, gives a quick run through of all his plays in a very special audition.', 'William Shakespeare, without saying a word, gives a quick run through of all his plays in a very special audition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlei6WySTYX1KuUHQ7RDCtWurx7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209835'),
  ('451136037993235632', 'Next', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Lee Tamahori, David Tattersall, J. Michael Haynie', 'Jonathan Hensleigh, Paul Bernbaum, Gary Goldman', 'Nicolas Cage, Julianne Moore, Jessica Biel, Thomas Kretschmann, Jim Beaver, Tory Kittles, Peter Falk, Enzo Cilenti', 'PG-13', 'Las Vegas showroom magician Cris Johnson has a secret which torments him: he can see a few minutes into the future. Sick of the examinations he underwent as a child and the interest of the government and medical establishment in his power, he lies low under an assumed name in Vegas, performing cheap tricks and living off small-time gambling "winnings." But when a terrorist group threatens to detonate a nuclear device in Los Angeles, government agent Callie Ferris must use all her wiles to capture Cris and convince him to help her stop the cataclysm.', 'Las Vegas showroom magician Cris Johnson has a secret which torments him: he can see a few minutes into the future. Sick of the examinations he underwent as a child and the interest of the government and medical establishment in his power, he lies low under an assumed name in Vegas, performing cheap tricks and living off small-time gambling "winnings." But when a terrorist group threatens to detonate a nuclear device in Los Angeles, government agent Callie Ferris must use all her wiles to capture Cris and convince him to help her stop the cataclysm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtBOCJBCP0MWNjmBwjMAzbwgtTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1738'),
  ('631517479093118228', 'Next Avengers: Heroes of Tomorrow', 2008, 'Animation, Family, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Jay Oliva', 'Christopher L. Yost', 'Noah Crawford, Brenna O''Brien, Aidan Drummond, Dempsey Pappion, Tom Kane, Fred Tatasciore, Michael Adamthwaite, Adrian Petriw', 'PG', 'The children of the Avengers hone their powers and go head to head with the very enemy responsible for their parents'' demise.', 'The children of the Avengers hone their powers and go head to head with the very enemy responsible for their parents'' demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1y4J9HZJoTIMdt77wCq80uXaQJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14613'),
  ('888811154441542571', 'Next Day Air', 2009, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Benny Boom, David A. Armstrong', 'Blair Cobbs', 'Yasmin Deliz, Donald Faison, Yasiin Bey, Mike Epps, Wood Harris, Lauren London, Omari Hardwick, Emilio Rivera', 'R', 'Two inept criminals are mistakenly delivered a package of cocaine and think they''ve hit the jackpot, triggering a series of events that changes ten people''s lives forever.', 'Two inept criminals are mistakenly delivered a package of cocaine and think they''ve hit the jackpot, triggering a series of events that changes ten people''s lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLNzff5sWBWrKU4EI5gf4ZhUBKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18065'),
  ('675724211226325525', 'Next Door', 1990, 'Animation', 'Pete Docter', null, 'Brooke O''Neill', null, 'An old square-headed man tries to watch TV while a little girl makes a playful ruckus outside. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'An old square-headed man tries to watch TV while a little girl makes a playful ruckus outside. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mN4ANoatsXkl9CawiMrNMCvke5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209674'),
  ('299488833984122768', 'Next Door', 2005, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Pål Sletaune, John Andreas Andersen', 'Pål Sletaune', 'Kristoffer Joner, Cecilie A. Mosli, Julia Schacht, Anna Bache-Wiig, Michael Nyqvist, Øystein Martinsen, Odd Arno Midtsjø, Magne Kipperrud', null, 'After Ingrid leaves John, he allows himself to be pulled into a mystical and scary world where it is impossible to separate truth from lies.', 'After Ingrid leaves John, he allows himself to be pulled into a mystical and scary world where it is impossible to separate truth from lies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqS5Y8f6EQy9i9YFuPuTlPRopV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572'),
  ('844249473990694947', 'Next Door', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel Brühl, Jens Harant', 'Daniel Kehlmann', 'Daniel Brühl, Peter Kurth, Rike Eckermann, Aenne Schwarz, Vicky Krieps, Gode Benedix, Justine Hirschfeld, Ole Hermann', null, 'Berlin, the Prenzlauer Berg district. Daniel is a movie star accustomed to success. His loft apartment is stylish and so is his wife, and the nanny has the children under control. Everything is tip-top, bilingual and ready for him to jet off to an audition in London where a role in an American superhero film awaits the celebrated German-Spanish actor. Popping into the local bar on the corner, he finds Bruno sitting there. As transpires by the minute, Bruno has been waiting for this moment for a long time. And so this eternally overlooked man – one of reunification''s losers and a victim of the gentrification of what was once East Berlin – takes his revenge. With Daniel as his target...', 'Berlin, the Prenzlauer Berg district. Daniel is a movie star accustomed to success. His loft apartment is stylish and so is his wife, and the nanny has the children under control. Everything is tip-top, bilingual and ready for him to jet off to an audition in London where a role in an American superhero film awaits the celebrated German-Spanish actor. Popping into the local bar on the corner, he finds Bruno sitting there. As transpires by the minute, Bruno has been waiting for this moment for a long time. And so this eternally overlooked man – one of reunification''s losers and a victim of the gentrification of what was once East Berlin – takes his revenge. With Daniel as his target...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uCDPV0QtbQkKILMzQlCUd7kDnjX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681349'),
  ('20179116082193608', 'Next Door', 2026, 'Drama', 'Michael Fredianelli', 'Michael Fredianelli', 'Trevor B. Nagle, Casey Semple, Michael Fredianelli, Rosanna Wyant, Shauna Richardson', null, 'In a pristine suburb, three couples unravel as abuse, infidelity, drugs, and a missing son resurface.', 'In a pristine suburb, three couples unravel as abuse, infidelity, drugs, and a missing son resurface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5UKeMaxvg0VMfRFFcAFGqwhomd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1661365'),
  ('964049827977920654', 'Next Exit', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mali Elfman, Azuli Anderson', 'Mali Elfman', 'Katie Parker, Rahul Kohli, Rose McIver, Karen Gillan, Tongayi Chirisa, Diva Zappa', null, 'A research scientist who makes national news proving she can track people into the afterlife - Rose sees a way out and Teddy sees his chance to finally make it. These two strangers, both harboring dark secrets, race to join the doctor''s contentious study and leave this life behind.', 'A research scientist who makes national news proving she can track people into the afterlife - Rose sees a way out and Teddy sees his chance to finally make it. These two strangers, both harboring dark secrets, race to join the doctor''s contentious study and leave this life behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1x6VMvCwvs3dLH84N7cSrpT0yt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:964909'),
  ('1036222707194932440', 'Next Exit, Main Street', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Jeremy von Stilb, Travis Cook, Jeffrey Baldo', null, null, null, 'In an effort to discover the depth of the country''s polarization, four recent college graduates decide to travel across the United States gathering stories encompassing the spectrum of life in America. Their goal is to find the human stories behind the nation''s social and political schism, proving that Americans are not tied together by political identity, geographical location or belief systems, but primarily by love, hope and dreams - universal truths.', 'In an effort to discover the depth of the country''s polarization, four recent college graduates decide to travel across the United States gathering stories encompassing the spectrum of life in America. Their goal is to find the human stories behind the nation''s social and political schism, proving that Americans are not tied together by political identity, geographical location or belief systems, but primarily by love, hope and dreams - universal truths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9tEEsEMhaF87acSAuFq91fADyG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:703726'),
  ('861859699503884436', 'Next Floor', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Denis Villeneuve, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Jacques Davidts', 'Jean Marchand, Luc-Martial Dagenais, Neil Kroetsch, Emmanuel Schwartz, Warren ''Slim'' Williams, Jean-Robert Bourdage, Valérie Wiseman, Dennis St John', null, 'During an opulent and luxurious banquet, complete with hordes of servers and valets, eleven pampered guests participate in what appears to be a ritualistic gastronomic carnage. In this absurd and grotesque universe, an unexpected sequence of events destabilizes the endless symphony of abundance.', 'During an opulent and luxurious banquet, complete with hordes of servers and valets, eleven pampered guests participate in what appears to be a ritualistic gastronomic carnage. In this absurd and grotesque universe, an unexpected sequence of events destabilizes the endless symphony of abundance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HBizk472Kb0SY8NM8XTbig2xpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99343'),
  ('44313586794250765', 'Next Friday', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Baffa, Donald Sparks, Tyrone S. Walker', 'Ice Cube', 'Ice Cube, Mike Epps, Justin Pierce, John Witherspoon, Don Curry, Jacob Vargas, Lobo Sebastian, Rolando Molina', 'R', 'A streetwise man flees South Central Los Angeles heading to the suburbs and his lottery-winner uncle and cousin to avoid a neighborhood thug with a grudge who has just escaped from prison. But trouble soon follows and the suburbs will never be the same.', 'A streetwise man flees South Central Los Angeles heading to the suburbs and his lottery-winner uncle and cousin to avoid a neighborhood thug with a grudge who has just escaped from prison. But trouble soon follows and the suburbs will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dP4fYCGQZzg17ta7FvLwJVCwwt9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10471'),
  ('866416701276356477', 'Next Gen', 2018, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Kevin R. Adams, Joe Ksander', 'Ryan W. Smith', 'John Krasinski, Lo Mutuc, Jason Sudeikis, Michael Peña, David Cross, Constance Wu, Kiana Ledé, Anna Akana', 'PG', 'A friendship with a top-secret robot turns a lonely girl''s life into a thrilling adventure as they take on bullies, evil bots and a scheming madman.', 'A friendship with a top-secret robot turns a lonely girl''s life into a thrilling adventure as they take on bullies, evil bots and a scheming madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUDDo5MPWM6rc6COQYhaoRNqvhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523777'),
  ('373453680248371262', 'Next Goal Wins', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Mike Brett, Steve Jamison, Mike Brett', null, 'Thomas Rongen, Jaiyah Saelua, Nicky Salapu, Larry Mana''o, Rawlston Masaniai, Charles Uhrle', null, 'An inspirational story about the power of hope in the face of seemingly insurmountable odds, and an object lesson in what it really means to be a winner in life.', 'An inspirational story about the power of hope in the face of seemingly insurmountable odds, and an object lesson in what it really means to be a winner in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJg8qEBBBc9OwvgkZXiA3hPtZCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256836'),
  ('23239423999885190', 'Next Goal Wins', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Borck, Katie Doyle, Zack Earl Edwards', 'Iain Morris, Taika Waititi', 'Michael Fassbender, Oscar Kightley, Kaimana, David Fane, Rachel House, Beulah Koale, Taika Waititi, Will Arnett', 'PG-13', 'Dutch coach Thomas Rongen attempts the nearly impossible task of turning the American Samoa soccer team from perennial losers into winners.', 'Dutch coach Thomas Rongen attempts the nearly impossible task of turning the American Samoa soccer team from perennial losers into winners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTQCL1zGugIck8MgvJ2lXSrxENR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621587'),
  ('771302209993068672', 'Next of Kin', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Tony Williams, Tony McDonald, Paul Healey', 'Tony Williams, Michael Heath', 'Jacki Kerin, John Jarratt, Alex Scott, Gerda Nicolson, Charles McCallum, Bernadette Gibson, Robert Ratti, Vince Deltito', null, 'After Linda inherits a retirement home, she witnesses a series of strange events which seem connected to a dark and unspeakable evil.', 'After Linda inherits a retirement home, she witnesses a series of strange events which seem connected to a dark and unspeakable evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIgyJIr0TJaolj6hj8PLoGMpxVg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84993'),
  ('234741955729406824', 'Next of Kin', 1984, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Atom Egoyan, Peter Mettler', 'Atom Egoyan', 'Patrick Tierney, Berj Fazalian, Sirvart Fazlian, Arsinée Khanjian, Margaret Loveys, Thomas Tierney, Phil Rash, Paul Babiak', null, 'Twenty-three-year old Peter Foster is an only child who lives at home, where he constantly hears his parents arguing. Because Peter does nothing all day, the family goes to a clinic where a therapist videotapes them. After Peter watches his tape, he views the tape of a troubled Armenian family, who gave their only son away for adoption when they arrived in Canada. Peter decides to visit this family, and he pretends to be their son, Bedros Deryan. The Deryan family welcomes him with open arms, and Peter tries to patch up the poor relationship between George Deryan and his daughter Azah.', 'Twenty-three-year old Peter Foster is an only child who lives at home, where he constantly hears his parents arguing. Because Peter does nothing all day, the family goes to a clinic where a therapist videotapes them. After Peter watches his tape, he views the tape of a troubled Armenian family, who gave their only son away for adoption when they arrived in Canada. Peter decides to visit this family, and he pretends to be their son, Bedros Deryan. The Deryan family welcomes him with open arms, and Peter tries to patch up the poor relationship between George Deryan and his daughter Azah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg0BrrQWAmamyWR8nkD3KYQdvG9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108241'),
  ('542553526125955220', 'Next of Kin', 1989, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John Irvin, Steven Poster, Bruce Moriarty', 'Michael Jenning', 'Patrick Swayze, Liam Neeson, Adam Baldwin, Helen Hunt, Ted Levine, Bill Paxton, Michael J. Pollard, Andreas Katsulas', 'R', 'Truman Gates, a Chicago cop, sets out to find his brother''s killer. Meanwhile, another of his brothers, Briar (a hillbilly) decides to find the killer himself.', 'Truman Gates, a Chicago cop, sets out to find his brother''s killer. Meanwhile, another of his brothers, Briar (a hillbilly) decides to find the killer himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieM9upg9O4agtodEvlZIiuNKZsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27418'),
  ('1049300468524345923', 'Next Room Affair', 2025, 'Drama', 'Christopher Novabos, Jeyow Evangelista, Paulo Estero', 'King Abalos', 'Mhack Morales, Karen Lopez, Paula Santos, Julianne Richards, Roxanne De Vera, Joko Rivera, Krista Miller, Margaret Sison', null, 'Lea, a quiet student, lives next door to couple Ramon and Mara. When she begins witnessing Ramon’s secret affairs, her curiosity turns into a growing fascination that awakens desires she doesn’t fully understand. As her dreams blur with reality, Lea is pulled into a dangerous longing that threatens to upend the lives of everyone around her.', 'Lea, a quiet student, lives next door to couple Ramon and Mara. When she begins witnessing Ramon’s secret affairs, her curiosity turns into a growing fascination that awakens desires she doesn’t fully understand. As her dreams blur with reality, Lea is pulled into a dangerous longing that threatens to upend the lives of everyone around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZp10EseYrSRN7rR920YK1tht9b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1581366'),
  ('524807715955859961', 'Next Sohee', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Kim Il-yeon, Kim Min-jae, July Jung', 'July Jung', 'Kim Si-eun, Bae Doona, Jung Hoe-ryn, Kang Hyun-oh, Bahk Woo-young, Lee In-young, Park Hui-eun, Kim Yong-jun', null, 'A female detective investigates the cause of a high school girl’s death and uncovers a disturbing truth.', 'A female detective investigates the cause of a high school girl’s death and uncovers a disturbing truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNRgBLBc2inQX1Ba72hQjB4Lwk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923344'),
  ('17459661725311560', 'Next Stop Paradise', 1998, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Lucian Pintilie, Călin Ghibu, Andrei Morosanu', 'Radu Aldulescu, Lucian Pintilie, Răsvan Popescu', 'Costel Cașcaval, Dorina Chiriac, Gheorghe Visu, Victor Rebengiuc, Răzvan Vasilescu, Dan Tudor, Doru Ana, Petre Gheorghiu', null, 'Mitu and Elena get to know each other in the course of a vodka drinking contest and discover that they are both dissatisfied with the status quo. Mitu is about to begin military service and Elena is to be married to a man she does not love. They decide they are meant for each other and plan on a different future, one that is on a collision course with the authorities, and start a mad affair.', 'Mitu and Elena get to know each other in the course of a vodka drinking contest and discover that they are both dissatisfied with the status quo. Mitu is about to begin military service and Elena is to be married to a man she does not love. They decide they are meant for each other and plan on a different future, one that is on a collision course with the authorities, and start a mad affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGafgpADv9enlhEenp3r48Ya7Jp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123707'),
  ('997318279474494562', 'Next Stop Wonderland', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Brad Anderson, Michael Ross, Adam Geiger', 'Brad Anderson, Lyn Vaus', 'Hope Davis, Alan Gelfant, Victor Argo, H. Jon Benjamin, Cara Buono, Lawrence Gilliard Jr., Philip Seymour Hoffman, Jason Lewis', 'R', 'Dumped by her loser boyfriend, Erin''s love life hits rock bottom when her overbearing mother places an embarrassing ad in the "personals" section of a local newspaper on her behalf. Erin''s disgust turns to curiosity as she searches for the right guy in a hilarious series of disastrous dates. Meanwhile, a lonely ex-plumber named Alan clumsily searches for his dream job while narrowly missing one chance meeting with Erin after another.', 'Dumped by her loser boyfriend, Erin''s love life hits rock bottom when her overbearing mother places an embarrassing ad in the "personals" section of a local newspaper on her behalf. Erin''s disgust turns to curiosity as she searches for the right guy in a hilarious series of disastrous dates. Meanwhile, a lonely ex-plumber named Alan clumsily searches for his dream job while narrowly missing one chance meeting with Erin after another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6bEY3XUUESEk8me3VUfMAOiLON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41469'),
  ('748689145724047117', 'Next Stop, Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Fantasy, Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Michael Belcher, Dustin Rikert, Phillip Rush', 'Kari Drake, Duane Poole', 'Lyndsy Fonseca, Chandler Massey, Erika Slezak, Eric Freeman, Paige Herschell, Matt Walton, Nicholas Delany, Lea Thompson', 'G', 'Angie wonders what her life would be like if she had married a former boyfriend who became a famous sportscaster. She takes the train home to spend Christmas with her family and inexplicably finds herself 10 years in the past. With the advice of the train''s enigmatic conductor, Angie has the chance to revisit that Christmas and learn what — and who — is truly important to her.', 'Angie wonders what her life would be like if she had married a former boyfriend who became a famous sportscaster. She takes the train home to spend Christmas with her family and inexplicably finds herself 10 years in the past. With the advice of the train''s enigmatic conductor, Angie has the chance to revisit that Christmas and learn what — and who — is truly important to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4Y8hRSAfGiSkGoKvS5sruW40me.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877004'),
  ('896885218677649909', 'Next Stop, Greenwich Village', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonathan Sanger, Terence A. Donnelly, Paul Mazursky', 'Paul Mazursky', 'Lenny Baker, Shelley Winters, Ellen Greene, Lois Smith, Christopher Walken, Dori Brenner, Antonio Fargas, Lou Jacobi', null, 'An aspiring Jewish actor moves out of his parents'' Brooklyn apartment to seek his fortune in the bohemian life of Greenwich Village in 1953.', 'An aspiring Jewish actor moves out of his parents'' Brooklyn apartment to seek his fortune in the bohemian life of Greenwich Village in 1953.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYMvsrCG6qjIoJYPIdgeceDlhDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31913'),
  ('903112506979057178', 'Next Time I''ll Aim for the Heart', 2014, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Cédric Anger, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Cédric Anger', 'Guillaume Canet, Ana Girardot, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Cédric le Maoût, Alice de Lencquesaing, Nicolas Ronchi, Nicolas Carpentier, Pierick Tournier', null, 'Between 1978 and 1979, the inhabitants of the Oise are in fear of a maniac who kills several hitchhikers and escape the police. He was then dubbed "the killer of the Oise" is actually a shy young policeman who will investigate his own murder, only to lose control of the situation.', 'Between 1978 and 1979, the inhabitants of the Oise are in fear of a maniac who kills several hitchhikers and escape the police. He was then dubbed "the killer of the Oise" is actually a shy young policeman who will investigate his own murder, only to lose control of the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxJPhSiJhN5q0BQgNGWlF2yzfPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298459'),
  ('638744478980794009', 'Next Time We Love', 1936, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward H. Griffith, Ralph Slosser, Franz Waxman', 'Melville Baker', 'Margaret Sullavan, James Stewart, Ray Milland, Grant Mitchell, Robert McWade, Anna Demetrio, Ronnie Cosby, Tommy Bond', 'NR', 'A young married couple''s relationship becomes strained when he is assigned overseas as a foreign correspondent and she becomes a major stage star.', 'A young married couple''s relationship becomes strained when he is assigned overseas as a foreign correspondent and she becomes a major stage star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NZenpc6LejMDL6aEnCv1mEOodq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109890'),
  ('172595359772157864', 'Next Year', 2014, 'Drama', 'Vania Leturcq, Virginie Surdej', 'Vania Leturcq, Christophe Morand', 'Constance Rousseau, Jenna Thiam, Julien Boisselier, Kévin Azaïs, Frédéric Pierrot, Aylin Yay, Anne Coesens, Esteban Carvajal-Alegria', null, 'Clotilde and Aude are 18. They have always been best friends, growing up together in the same small village in the South of France. Despite their differences, they have a strong and exclusive friendship. With their contrasts they attract each other, and they seem to be enough for one another. But Clotilde, looking for something else, decides to leave to study in Paris the following year, after the baccalaureate. She takes Aude along with her in this departure far from their roots. Refusing to admit that their paths are separating little by little, Clotilde and Aude persuade themselves that their friendship can survive anything.', 'Clotilde and Aude are 18. They have always been best friends, growing up together in the same small village in the South of France. Despite their differences, they have a strong and exclusive friendship. With their contrasts they attract each other, and they seem to be enough for one another. But Clotilde, looking for something else, decides to leave to study in Paris the following year, after the baccalaureate. She takes Aude along with her in this departure far from their roots. Refusing to admit that their paths are separating little by little, Clotilde and Aude persuade themselves that their friendship can survive anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9luhbbGf7iP5pWdbspT8fIql8vS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314553'),
  ('839139045889313762', 'Next Year at Lake Balaton', 1980, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Herrmann Zschoche, Günter Jaeuthe', 'Inge Heym, Herrmann Zschoche', 'Gudrun Ritter, Peter Bause, Fred Delmare, Günter Schubert, René Rudolph, Kareen Schröter, Odette Bereska, Hannes Stelzer', null, 'Jonas and Ines are in love and want to spend their vacation together camping on the Baltic coast. But Ines’s narrow-minded parents intervene and insist that the young couple joins the family vacation. Problems arise, so everyone ends up traveling to the Bulgarian Black Sea on their own. Along the way, Jonas meets a beautiful Dutch girl who is going to India via Turkey…', 'Jonas and Ines are in love and want to spend their vacation together camping on the Baltic coast. But Ines’s narrow-minded parents intervene and insist that the young couple joins the family vacation. Problems arise, so everyone ends up traveling to the Bulgarian Black Sea on their own. Along the way, Jonas meets a beautiful Dutch girl who is going to India via Turkey…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHJ7ZFtSHnGjERG07KbmxSV8u6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283118'),
  ('394514086837154101', 'Next Year If All Goes Well', 1981, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean-Loup Hubert, Robert Alazraki', 'Josiane Balasko, Jean-Loup Hubert, Gérard Zingg', 'Isabelle Adjani, Thierry Lhermitte, Marie-Anne Chazel, Bernard Crombey, Antoinette Moya, Fred Personne, Mathieu Kassovitz', null, 'Isabelle and Maxime are a pair of lighthearted lovers -- that is, until Isabelle gets the itch for motherhood. When she confesses her desire for a child, Maxime panics. As a cartoonist by trade he is far from financially stable, so he outright rejects the idea of parenthood. What follows is a roller-coaster romance full of recriminations and reconciliations, until Maxime must ultimately decide whether his fear of becoming a parent is a reason to leave.', 'Isabelle and Maxime are a pair of lighthearted lovers -- that is, until Isabelle gets the itch for motherhood. When she confesses her desire for a child, Maxime panics. As a cartoonist by trade he is far from financially stable, so he outright rejects the idea of parenthood. What follows is a roller-coaster romance full of recriminations and reconciliations, until Maxime must ultimately decide whether his fear of becoming a parent is a reason to leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9xIIuRcrX0x8aeM94QH8hSBNAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375356'),
  ('850945281873197989', 'Nezha Conquers the Dragon King', 1979, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Action', 'Yan Dingxian, Wang Shuchen, A Da', 'Wang Shuchen', 'Liang Zhenghui, Qiu Yuefeng, Fu Runsheng, Bi Ke, Wu Jingwei, Yu Ding, Shang Hua', null, 'In Chentang Pass, Nezha, the magical son of General Li Jing, makes enemies with Ao Guang, the Dragon King of East Sea. When he is reported to heaven''s court and his home is threatened, Nezha takes it upon himself to destroy the palace and defeat the dragons. A retelling of the classic chapters from Investiture of The Gods.', 'In Chentang Pass, Nezha, the magical son of General Li Jing, makes enemies with Ao Guang, the Dragon King of East Sea. When he is reported to heaven''s court and his home is threatened, Nezha takes it upon himself to destroy the palace and defeat the dragons. A retelling of the classic chapters from Investiture of The Gods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMThfUmAEsA0K1rZIjW3dqRXv2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74037'),
  ('836655969171360936', 'Nezouh', 2023, 'Drama', 'Hélène Louvart, Soudade Kaadan, Burak Kanbir', 'Soudade Kaadan', 'Hala Zein, Kinda Alloush, Samer Al Masri, Nizar Alani, Nabil Abousalih, Samer Seyyid Ali, Darina Al Joundi', null, 'Even as bombs fall on Damascus, Mutaz refuses to flee to the uncertain life of a refugee. His wife, Hala, and daughter, Zeina, must make the choice whether to stay or leave.', 'Even as bombs fall on Damascus, Mutaz refuses to flee to the uncertain life of a refugee. His wife, Hala, and daughter, Zeina, must make the choice whether to stay or leave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48HyMILHxL2HNAfc41xqM0aB0wL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937741'),
  ('548008808532072008', 'NFT: Cursed Images', 2026, 'Horror', 'Jonas Odenheimer, Michael Edo Keane', 'Jonas Odenheimer', 'Najarra Townsend, David Wayman, Durassie Kiangangu, Amelie Edwards, Nobuse Jnr Uwaifo', null, 'A group of crypto savvy friends begin experiencing strange occurrences after buying into a cursed NFT collection.', 'A group of crypto savvy friends begin experiencing strange occurrences after buying into a cursed NFT collection.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7H7Aqun1GTiMAtlE6Z2DnwxUbo2.jpg', 'plex:movie:nft-cursed-images'),
  ('211101507123882853', 'NH10', 2015, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Jogi Malang, Navdeep Singh, Arvind Kannabiran', 'Sudip Sharma', 'Anushka Sharma, Neil Bhoopalam, Darshan Kumaar, Deepti Naval, Aanchal Sharma, Ravi Jhankal, Ravi Beniwal, Tanya Purohit', 'R', 'Meera and Arjun are professionals living in Gurgaon. On their way to a luxurious desert holiday they stop on a Highway dhaba for dinner, where they witness a young girl being picked up by a bunch of hoodlums. Arjun chooses to step in, unmindful of the danger ahead.', 'Meera and Arjun are professionals living in Gurgaon. On their way to a luxurious desert holiday they stop on a Highway dhaba for dinner, where they witness a young girl being picked up by a bunch of hoodlums. Arjun chooses to step in, unmindful of the danger ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PPUgbQE9UVrgPyMif8urLSIKWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:330431'),
  ('872307968289201772', 'Ni Chana Ni Juana', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama', 'María Elena Velasco, Fernando Colín', 'María Elena Velasco, Tito Novaro', 'María Elena Velasco, Armando Calvo, Carmen Montejo, Rubén Olivares, Leopoldo Salazar, Regino Herrera, Antoni Fonti', null, 'Juana, a peasant girl, is mistaken for her twin sister, Chana, whom she has never met and who is now a famous singer, and is kidnapped in her place by Chana''s ex-husband.', 'Juana, a peasant girl, is mistaken for her twin sister, Chana, whom she has never met and who is now a famous singer, and is kidnapped in her place by Chana''s ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7Q2Tf2A4b1xUAxW4fnRrVAOGEN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286018'),
