  ('637754054187011232', 'Nichts zu verlieren', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Murnberger', null, 'Lisa Wagner, Georg Friedrich, Christopher Schärf, Emily Cox, Johanna Gastdorf, Stefan Merki, Susanne Wolff, Michael Grimm', null, 'The two small-time crooks Tom and Richy want to escape from Europe to a tropical paradise with one last coup. Unfortunately things go wrong. On the run, they hijack a tour bus. As participants on a journey of mourning, the inmates are busy dealing with a great loss. There is a lot of crying on board. However, for very different reasons.', 'The two small-time crooks Tom and Richy want to escape from Europe to a tropical paradise with one last coup. Unfortunately things go wrong. On the run, they hijack a tour bus. As participants on a journey of mourning, the inmates are busy dealing with a great loss. There is a lot of crying on board. However, for very different reasons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuySaTsgZoybdWZvSlJwudAouwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483263'),
  ('920910915251246953', 'Nick and Norah''s Infinite Playlist', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Tom Richmond, Peter Sollett', 'Lorene Scafaria', 'Michael Cera, Kat Dennings, Aaron Yoo, Rafi Gavron, Ari Graynor, Alexis Dziena, Jonathan B. Wright, Zachary Booth', 'PG-13', 'Nick cannot stop obsessing over his ex-girlfriend, Tris, until Tris'' friend Norah suddenly shows interest in him at a club. Thus begins an odd night filled with ups and downs as the two keep running into Tris and her new boyfriend while searching for Norah''s drunken friend, Caroline, with help from Nick''s band mates. As the night winds down, the two have to figure out what they want from each other.', 'Nick cannot stop obsessing over his ex-girlfriend, Tris, until Tris'' friend Norah suddenly shows interest in him at a club. Thus begins an odd night filled with ups and downs as the two keep running into Tris and her new boyfriend while searching for Norah''s drunken friend, Caroline, with help from Nick''s band mates. As the night winds down, the two have to figure out what they want from each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cndxWgZEHnSUtytrMjal97ye34E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12182'),
