  ('354304409501871220', 'Nick Cave & The Bad Seeds: One More Time with Feeling', 2016, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alwin H. Küchler, Benoît Debie, Tom Reynolds', null, 'Nick Cave, Warren Ellis, Jim Sclavunos, Susie Bick, Earl Cave, Andrew Dominik, Martyn Casey, Thomas Wydler', 'PG', 'Andrew Dominik''s One More Time With Feeling is a remarkable black and white documentary which chronicles the creation of Nick Cave & The Bad Seeds'' album Skeleton Tree. Originally a performance based concept, the film evolved into something much more significant as Dominik delved into the tragic backdrop of the writing and recording of the album. The result is stark, fragile and raw, and a true testament to an artist trying to find his way through the darkness. It documents the writing, recording and performing of Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds’ sixteenth studio album, Skeleton Tree.', 'Andrew Dominik''s One More Time With Feeling is a remarkable black and white documentary which chronicles the creation of Nick Cave & The Bad Seeds'' album Skeleton Tree. Originally a performance based concept, the film evolved into something much more significant as Dominik delved into the tragic backdrop of the writing and recording of the album. The result is stark, fragile and raw, and a true testament to an artist trying to find his way through the darkness. It documents the writing, recording and performing of Nick Cave & the Bad Seeds’ sixteenth studio album, Skeleton Tree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/opORnjagpi1KKfGVNX2NuNECdzE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404141'),
  ('358749870196528538', 'Nick Fury: Agent of S.H.I.E.L.D.', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Action, TV Movie', 'Rod Hardy, James Bartle, Brian Giddens', 'David S. Goyer', 'David Hasselhoff, Lisa Rinna, Sandra Hess, Neil Roberts, Garry Chalk, Tracy Waterhouse, Tom McBeath, Ron Canada', 'NR', 'Marvel''s hard-boiled hero is brought back to fight the menace of Hydra after exiling himself in the Yukon since the end of the Cold War. The children of the former Hydra head, Baron Von Stucker, have taken charge of the terrorist organization. Under the lead of his vicious daughter, Viper, Hydra has seized a deadly virus and threatens the destruction of America.', 'Marvel''s hard-boiled hero is brought back to fight the menace of Hydra after exiling himself in the Yukon since the end of the Cold War. The children of the former Hydra head, Baron Von Stucker, have taken charge of the terrorist organization. Under the lead of his vicious daughter, Viper, Hydra has seized a deadly virus and threatens the destruction of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4T0YjvnBaMASZkkRKxMIe6IoWO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27460'),
  ('35225990511903847', 'Nick Knight', 1989, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Farhad Mann, Frank Beascoechea, John Syrjamaki', 'James D. Parriott', 'Rick Springfield, John Kapelos, Robert Harper, Richard Fancy, Laura Johnson, Craig Richard Nelson, Fran Ryan, Cec Verrell', null, 'Detective Nick Knight is investigating a series of murders in which the bodies are found drained of blood - but the most recent one doesn''t fit the pattern. Instead it involves the cure that Nick has been searching for for decades, so that he himself can face the light of day. Later remade as the first two episodes of Forever Knight.', 'Detective Nick Knight is investigating a series of murders in which the bodies are found drained of blood - but the most recent one doesn''t fit the pattern. Instead it involves the cure that Nick has been searching for for decades, so that he himself can face the light of day. Later remade as the first two episodes of Forever Knight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zY2PU241BjD6rK77uMlHEsKbsw6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53428'),
  ('1119212668751643283', 'Nick Kroll: Little Big Boy', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Bill Benz, Dylan Sanford', 'Nick Kroll', 'Nick Kroll', 'R', 'Nick Kroll shares his comedian origin story, his first heartbreak, his strange hypnosis experience and the trash-talking celebrity voice in his head.', 'Nick Kroll shares his comedian origin story, his first heartbreak, his strange hypnosis experience and the trash-talking celebrity voice in his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSj702X4rpNWHbUVI9gsT54iB09.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1016234'),
  ('1110659655833711246', 'Nick of Time', 1995, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'John Badham, Roy H. Wagner, D.J. Caruso', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Johnny Depp, Courtney Chase, Charles S. Dutton, Christopher Walken, Roma Maffia, Peter Strauss, Gloria Reuben, Marsha Mason', 'R', 'An ordinary man is suddenly forced into a plot to kill a politician in exchange for his kidnapped daughter''s freedom.', 'An ordinary man is suddenly forced into a plot to kill a politician in exchange for his kidnapped daughter''s freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A1FJwUVg84sQSjHVz5jVMXQvifJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2086'),
  ('215665100910833835', 'Nick the Sting', 1976, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Fernando Di Leo, Roberto Gerardi, Angelo Vicari', 'Alberto Silvestri', 'Luc Merenda, Lee J. Cobb, Gabriele Ferzetti, Luciana Paluzzi, Dagmar Lassander, Isabella Biagini, Fred Williams, Mario Pisu', null, 'Nick Hezard, a young con man, wants to avenge the death of a friend of his and organizes a swindle trying to cheat Robert Turner, an American businessman he thinks responsible for his friend''s death. He succeeds in getting a hundred thousand swiss francs and uses them to carry out the second part of his plan.', 'Nick Hezard, a young con man, wants to avenge the death of a friend of his and organizes a swindle trying to cheat Robert Turner, an American businessman he thinks responsible for his friend''s death. He succeeds in getting a hundred thousand swiss francs and uses them to carry out the second part of his plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynejEwhsW27Nn2lV4qcPiOjawcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127092'),
  ('413745867031747176', 'Nick: Off Duty', 2016, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy, Mystery', 'Christian Alvart, Christof Wahl', 'Christoph Darnstädt', 'Til Schweiger, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Fahri Yardım, Stefanie Stappenbeck, Luna Schweiger, Ulas Kilic, Erdal Yıldız, Berrak Tüzünataç', null, 'Day in, day out, Niklas ‘Nick’ Tschiller and his partner Yalcin Gümer investigate crimes that are happening in Hamburg. But at some point even the policeman needs a break to spend time with his daughter Lenny. Then it says: Tschiller a.D. - out of service - goodbye to Hamburg. However, simply relaxing is easier said than done, because crime never sleeps and a new, very personal case throws a spanner in the works for Nick''s plans for a well-deserved break. Even on vacation, the criminal investigator is not sure about his job and so a wild journey soon takes him across Europe, including to Istanbul and Moscow.', 'Day in, day out, Niklas ‘Nick’ Tschiller and his partner Yalcin Gümer investigate crimes that are happening in Hamburg. But at some point even the policeman needs a break to spend time with his daughter Lenny. Then it says: Tschiller a.D. - out of service - goodbye to Hamburg. However, simply relaxing is easier said than done, because crime never sleeps and a new, very personal case throws a spanner in the works for Nick''s plans for a well-deserved break. Even on vacation, the criminal investigator is not sure about his job and so a wild journey soon takes him across Europe, including to Istanbul and Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Alnsr3QogNR978tHFRSeC8yIcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348748'),
  ('612103949396251305', 'Nickel and Dime', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sam Karmann, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech', 'Désir Carré, Sam Karmann', 'Gérard Lanvin, Jacques Gamblin, Clovis Cornillac, Etienne Chicot, Florence Pernel, Jean-Paul Bonnaire, André Thorent, Désir Carré', null, 'Jacques is coming home after a long stretch behind bars. The boys are waiting, especially hi longtime friend Francis and new kid on the block Didier. They have a job lined up. but Jacques wants out of the life, Francis would rather be on the stage and wannabe mobster Didier has loser written all over him. Looks like someone''s heading for a fall.', 'Jacques is coming home after a long stretch behind bars. The boys are waiting, especially hi longtime friend Francis and new kid on the block Didier. They have a job lined up. but Jacques wants out of the life, Francis would rather be on the stage and wannabe mobster Didier has loser written all over him. Looks like someone''s heading for a fall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RrmytANLuJjYti71DFkX1MlS9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67380'),
  ('438377362951976980', 'Nickel Boys', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'RaMell Ross, Jomo Fray, Zachery Scherer', 'Joslyn Barnes, RaMell Ross', 'Ethan Herisse, Brandon Wilson, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Hamish Linklater, Gralen Bryant Banks, Fred Hechinger, Jimmie Fails, Luke Tennie', 'PG-13', 'Chronicles the powerful friendship between two young Black teenagers navigating the harrowing trials of reform school together in Florida.', 'Chronicles the powerful friendship between two young Black teenagers navigating the harrowing trials of reform school together in Florida.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu2vmmtStmTNMmSZl2LgrrQpLZo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028196'),
  ('748586175193685146', 'Nickelodeon', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Jack Frost Sanders, Arne Schmidt', 'Peter Bogdanovich, W.D. Richter', 'Ryan O''Neal, Burt Reynolds, Tatum O''Neal, Brian Keith, Stella Stevens, John Ritter, Jane Hitchcock, Jack Perkins', 'PG', 'In the silent film era, attorney Leo Harrigan and gunslinger Buck Greenway are hired to stop an illegal film production. However, they soon team up with the filmmakers and become important players in the show business industry. Leo learns he has a talent for directing, and Buck''s cowboy persona quickly earns him leading-man status — but both men fall for beautiful starlet Kathleen Cooke, leading to a heated personal rivalry.', 'In the silent film era, attorney Leo Harrigan and gunslinger Buck Greenway are hired to stop an illegal film production. However, they soon team up with the filmmakers and become important players in the show business industry. Leo learns he has a talent for directing, and Buck''s cowboy persona quickly earns him leading-man status — but both men fall for beautiful starlet Kathleen Cooke, leading to a heated personal rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gStRD7PNLBjwrw6Tg5b6GxT3qN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104364'),
  ('20059636732265472', 'Nico and Dani', 2000, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cesc Gay', 'Cesc Gay, Tomàs Aragay', 'Fernando Ramallo, Jordi Vilches, Marieta Orozco, Esther Nubiola, Chisco Amado, Ana Gracia, Myriam Mézières, Muntsa Alcañiz', 'NR', 'While his parents are away for the summer, 16-year-old Dani invites his best friend, the irrepressible Nico, to stay for the holidays. Jealously rears its head when Nico appears more interested in the local girls than in Dani. Hot summer nights and too many joints lead to experimentation which neither boy can talk about, a situation complicated by the appearance of the older and openly gay Julián, a published writer and old friend of Dani’s father.', 'While his parents are away for the summer, 16-year-old Dani invites his best friend, the irrepressible Nico, to stay for the holidays. Jealously rears its head when Nico appears more interested in the local girls than in Dani. Hot summer nights and too many joints lead to experimentation which neither boy can talk about, a situation complicated by the appearance of the older and openly gay Julián, a published writer and old friend of Dani’s father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iw5BLbL1rSmya9I6puP1q5dUn81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12806'),
  ('189270514571804835', 'Nico Icon', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Susanne Ofteringer', 'Susanne Ofteringer', 'Nico, Tina Aumont, Christian Aaron Boulogne, Jackson Browne, Jim Morrison, John Cale, Lou Reed, Sterling Morrison', null, 'A look into the many lives of Christa Päffgen, otherwise known as Nico; from cutie German mädchen to the first of the supermodels, to glamorous diva of the Velvet Underground, to cult item, junkie and hag. Many faces for the same woman, whom, you realize, just couldn''t bring herself to care enough to live.', 'A look into the many lives of Christa Päffgen, otherwise known as Nico; from cutie German mädchen to the first of the supermodels, to glamorous diva of the Velvet Underground, to cult item, junkie and hag. Many faces for the same woman, whom, you realize, just couldn''t bring herself to care enough to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3oiJZTB1UP3lj0uSVLdsYfsBbC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124626'),
  ('877449708301154475', 'Nico the Unicorn', 1998, 'Fantasy, Family, Adventure', 'Graeme Campbell, Walter Bal', 'Frank Sacks', 'Kevin Zegers, Anne Archer, Elisha Cuthbert, Pierre Chagnon, Martin Neufeld, Johnny Morina, Maggie Castle, Larry Day', null, 'As an 11-year-old boy struggles to cope with a disability, he finds a pony who gives birth to a unicorn which he takes care of.', 'As an 11-year-old boy struggles to cope with a disability, he finds a pony who gives birth to a unicorn which he takes care of.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWcRYM0GIAYPRvCoPEfI8RH3m7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57752'),
  ('652564275318864034', 'Nico, 1988', 2017, 'Drama, Music', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Crystel Fournier, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli', 'Trine Dyrholm, John Gordon Sinclair, Anamaria Marinca, Sandor Funtek, Thomas Trabacchi, Karina Fernandez, Calvin Demba, Francesco Colella', null, 'Approaching age 50, singer/songwriter Nico leads a solitary existence, far from her days as a Warhol superstar and celebrated vocalist for the Velvet Underground in the 1960s. Her life and career on the fringes, Nico''s new manager convinces her to hit the road again and tour in Europe to promote her latest album. She longs to rebuild a relationship with her son, whose custody she lost long ago.', 'Approaching age 50, singer/songwriter Nico leads a solitary existence, far from her days as a Warhol superstar and celebrated vocalist for the Velvet Underground in the 1960s. Her life and career on the fringes, Nico''s new manager convinces her to hit the road again and tour in Europe to promote her latest album. She longs to rebuild a relationship with her son, whose custody she lost long ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3krhl7ZC1oaIWZXvmVkwvqFx3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473262'),
  ('832253851063049159', 'Nicole Kidman: Eyes Wide Open', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Patrick Boudet', 'Patrick Boudet', 'Gus Van Sant, Michel Ciment, John Cameron Mitchell, Charlotte Lipinska, Anna Smith, Peter Debruge, Tom Cruise, Laurent Stocker', null, 'Nicole Kidman has worked with a host of top directors in a varied career including Gus Van Sant, Jane Campion, Stanley Kubrick, Lars von Trier and Sofia Coppola. A portrait of a fascinatingly ambivalent actress who shines in Hollywood blockbusters as well as auteur cinema, determined to explore, role after role, the female condition.', 'Nicole Kidman has worked with a host of top directors in a varied career including Gus Van Sant, Jane Campion, Stanley Kubrick, Lars von Trier and Sofia Coppola. A portrait of a fascinatingly ambivalent actress who shines in Hollywood blockbusters as well as auteur cinema, determined to explore, role after role, the female condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNQFovCREAXi0QNiGCScohGI5aZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:975388'),
  ('977553721823402901', 'Nicostratos the Pelican', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Olivier Horlait, Michel Amathieu', 'Eric Boisset, Olivier Horlait', 'Emir Kusturica, Thibault Le Guellec, François-Xavier Demaison, Jade-Rose Parker, Gennadios Patsis, Valériane de Villeneuve', null, 'After his wife died a man refuses to go out and doesn''t want to talk to his only son. Life has no meaning for him. One day his son finds a baby pelican and decides to leave the bird at home. Pelican helps the boy find his father again and revive him back to life ...', 'After his wife died a man refuses to go out and doesn''t want to talk to his only son. Life has no meaning for him. One day his son finds a baby pelican and decides to leave the bird at home. Pelican helps the boy find his father again and revive him back to life ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKdz4SQt4zHuUgYkneo4oPlSBny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79728'),
  ('238843064723851271', 'Nicotina', 2003, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Marcelo Iaccarino, Hugo Rodríguez', 'Martín Salinas', 'Diego Luna, Lucas Crespi, Norman Sotolongo, Marta Belaustegui, Jesús Ochoa, Martha Tenorio, Rosa María Bianchi, José María Yázpik', null, 'A hacker who is spying on a pretty neighbour messes up his assignment to break into Swiss bank accounts for Russian mobsters.', 'A hacker who is spying on a pretty neighbour messes up his assignment to break into Swiss bank accounts for Russian mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Y5O3hU5DpH4Kz1wcPDumGjTkxb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11556'),
  ('1073280764928045753', 'Nie kłam kochanie', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Piotr Wereśniak, Jarosław Żamojda', 'Ilona Łepkowska', 'Piotr Adamczyk, Marta Żmuda-Trzebiatowska, Grażyna Szapołowska, Beata Tyszkiewicz, Magdalena Schejbal, Tomasz Karolak, Sławomir Orzechowski, Lech Wałęsa', null, 'Ania, a sensitive, shy green-architecture student, tends the gardens of an elegant building and finds herself falling for its handsome tenant, Marcin. Ambitious and adept at lying to charm women, Marcin faces a sudden financial crisis he can only escape if his wealthy aunt Nela believes he’s already married, so he must persuade Ania to pose as his wife.', 'Ania, a sensitive, shy green-architecture student, tends the gardens of an elegant building and finds herself falling for its handsome tenant, Marcin. Ambitious and adept at lying to charm women, Marcin faces a sudden financial crisis he can only escape if his wealthy aunt Nela believes he’s already married, so he must persuade Ania to pose as his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ozlZiyFJhyuUGxy4TznWh80HYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38378'),
  ('136124633536830393', 'Night', 1930, 'Animation', 'Walt Disney', null, null, 'NR', 'The moon and two owls sing to the Blue Danube Waltz, celebrating the night. Moths dance around a candle flame, fireflies glow, frogs chorus, and so forth.', 'The moon and two owls sing to the Blue Danube Waltz, celebrating the night. Moths dance around a candle flame, fireflies glow, frogs chorus, and so forth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82bwEXgjPncYrg8LlzKOF46NdP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39092'),
