  ('976955012944030697', 'Night After Night', 1932, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Archie Mayo, Ernest Haller, Henry Hathaway', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Vincent Lawrence', 'George Raft, Constance Cummings, Wynne Gibson, Mae West, Alison Skipworth, Roscoe Karns, Louis Calhern, Bradley Page', 'NR', 'A successful ex-boxer opens a high-class speakeasy in what once was the childhood home of a formerly rich society girl.', 'A successful ex-boxer opens a high-class speakeasy in what once was the childhood home of a formerly rich society girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zXp66XqUpqDWBcdBesQ6CVZOpyc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82169'),
  ('1092242603334066811', 'Night Always Comes', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Benjamin Caron, Damián García, John Nasraway', 'Sarah Conradt', 'Vanessa Kirby, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Zack Gottsagen, Stephan James, Julia Fox, Eli Roth, Randall Park, Michael Kelly', 'R', 'Facing eviction in a city her family can no longer afford, a woman plunges into a desperate and increasingly dangerous all-night search to raise $25,000.', 'Facing eviction in a city her family can no longer afford, a woman plunges into a desperate and increasingly dangerous all-night search to raise $25,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jDo1nG7rtjaaQGpr6e73x9i9Xp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1254624'),
  ('912814041981673800', 'Night and Day', 1946, 'Drama, Music', 'Michael Curtiz, J. Peverell Marley, William V. Skall', 'Charles Hoffman, Leo Townsend, William Bowers', 'Cary Grant, Alexis Smith, Monty Woolley, Ginny Simms, Jane Wyman, Eve Arden, Victor Francen, Alan Hale', null, 'When his first stage show fails, songwriter Cole Porter goes off to fight in WWI until, injured, he lands in a hospital. He impresses nurse Linda Lee with his creativity, but their budding romance must wait as Cole heads home. Back in New York, he mounts a series of popular shows, and when his work brings him back to Europe, he eventually marries Linda. But success doesn''t spare him from marital complications or bad news about a beloved relative.', 'When his first stage show fails, songwriter Cole Porter goes off to fight in WWI until, injured, he lands in a hospital. He impresses nurse Linda Lee with his creativity, but their budding romance must wait as Cole heads home. Back in New York, he mounts a series of popular shows, and when his work brings him back to Europe, he eventually marries Linda. But success doesn''t spare him from marital complications or bad news about a beloved relative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrlKsBUxPwxGr8M8xupI96qrA8j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43485'),
  ('999701722259345611', 'Night and Day', 1991, 'Drama', 'Chantal Akerman, Jean-Claude Neckelbrouck', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Chantal Akerman', 'Guilaine Londez, Thomas Langmann, François Négret, Nicole Colchat, Pierre Laroche, Christian Crahay, Sandrine Laroche, Yves Coméliau', null, 'Jack and Julie live in a bare Parisian flat. By day, they make love; by night, Jack is a taxi driver while Julie wanders the city. One day, Julie meets Joseph, the daytime cabbie, and soon Julie spends her nights with Joseph and her days with Jack.', 'Jack and Julie live in a bare Parisian flat. By day, they make love; by night, Jack is a taxi driver while Julie wanders the city. One day, Julie meets Joseph, the daytime cabbie, and soon Julie spends her nights with Joseph and her days with Jack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jfJJy6HySRQgobatqz5Ymd5DOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108822'),
