  ('896102112873014345', 'Night at the Museum', 2006, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Guillermo Navarro, Shawn Levy, Helen Jarvis', 'Thomas Lennon, Robert Ben Garant', 'Ben Stiller, Carla Gugino, Dick Van Dyke, Mickey Rooney, Bill Cobbs, Jake Cherry, Ricky Gervais, Robin Williams', 'PG', 'Chaos reigns at the natural history museum when night watchman Larry Daley accidentally stirs up an ancient curse, awakening Attila the Hun, an army of gladiators, a Tyrannosaurus rex and other exhibits.', 'Chaos reigns at the natural history museum when night watchman Larry Daley accidentally stirs up an ancient curse, awakening Attila the Hun, an army of gladiators, a Tyrannosaurus rex and other exhibits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDsAAYf6Zn0yiAGJ6lYGs6hoZ4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1593'),
  ('1054898836349085755', 'Night at the Museum: Battle of the Smithsonian', 2009, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Family', 'Shawn Levy, Josh McLaglen, Misha Bukowski', 'Robert Ben Garant, Thomas Lennon', 'Ben Stiller, Amy Adams, Owen Wilson, Hank Azaria, Robin Williams, Christopher Guest, Alain Chabat, Steve Coogan', 'PG', 'Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a pickle now that they''ve been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution. Larry''s (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.', 'Hapless museum night watchman Larry Daley must help his living, breathing exhibit friends out of a pickle now that they''ve been transferred to the archives at the Smithsonian Institution. Larry''s (mis)adventures this time include close encounters with Amelia Earhart, Abe Lincoln and Ivan the Terrible.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9yAQn6TyrA3gv5xZZkiMMoZsiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18360'),
  ('906710942303895027', 'Night at the Museum: Kahmunrah Rises Again', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Matt Danner', 'William Schifrin, Ray DeLaurentis', 'Joshua Bassett, Thomas Lennon, Joseph Kamal, Akmal Saleh, Steve Zahn, Jack Whitehall, Kieran Sequoia, Alice Isaaz', 'PG', 'Nick Daley is following in his father''s footsteps as night watchman at the American Museum of Natural History, so he knows what happens when the sun goes down. But when the maniacal ruler Kahmunrah escapes, it is up to Nick to save the museum once and for all.', 'Nick Daley is following in his father''s footsteps as night watchman at the American Museum of Natural History, so he knows what happens when the sun goes down. But when the maniacal ruler Kahmunrah escapes, it is up to Nick to save the museum once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zo5iCQFZRgpLldUnOHcCHT943Sq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751741'),
  ('729934250309399827', 'Night at the Museum: Secret of the Tomb', 2014, 'Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Shawn Levy, Guillermo Navarro, Josh McLaglen', 'David Guion, Michael Handelman', 'Ben Stiller, Robin Williams, Owen Wilson, Steve Coogan, Ricky Gervais, Dan Stevens, Rebel Wilson, Skyler Gisondo', 'PG', 'When the magic powers of The Tablet of Ahkmenrah begin to die out, Larry Daley spans the globe, uniting favorite and new characters while embarking on an epic quest to save the magic before it is gone forever.', 'When the magic powers of The Tablet of Ahkmenrah begin to die out, Larry Daley spans the globe, uniting favorite and new characters while embarking on an epic quest to save the magic before it is gone forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwgy305K6qDs3D20xUO4OZu1HPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181533'),
