  ('862604303604856150', 'Night Fare', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Julien Seri, Jacques Ballard', 'Cyril Ferment, Julien Seri, Pascal Sid', 'Jonathan Howard, Jonathan Demurger, Fanny Valette, Jess Liaudin, Jean-François Lenogue, Édouard Montoute, Zakariya Gouram, Alix Bénézech', null, 'Luc and his English friend Chris take a taxi to go home after partying hard all evening in Paris. At destination, they run away without paying the fare. They got the wrong driver for this... The taxi goes immediately into hunting mode, chasing them all night, wherever they go. But does he only want his money back?', 'Luc and his English friend Chris take a taxi to go home after partying hard all evening in Paris. At destination, they run away without paying the fare. They got the wrong driver for this... The taxi goes immediately into hunting mode, chasing them all night, wherever they go. But does he only want his money back?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snljK4rCHwcEqiu5zEsYdFuiFda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340030'),
