  ('819731693357405073', 'Night Flight', 2014, 'Drama', 'Leesong Hee-il, Kang Seong-hoon, Yun Ji-woon', 'Leesong Hee-il', 'Kwak Si-yang, Lee Jae-joon, Choi Joon-ha, Kim Chang-hwan, Lee Ik-jun, Park Mi-hyeon, Kim So-hee, Jeong In-gi', null, 'Yong-ju, Gi-woong and Gi-taek used to be best friends in middle school, but in high school, Gi-woong becomes a member of the gang that bullies Gi-taek. As Yong-ju tries to fix this broken relationship, he realizes his special feeling toward Gi-woong.', 'Yong-ju, Gi-woong and Gi-taek used to be best friends in middle school, but in high school, Gi-woong becomes a member of the gang that bullies Gi-taek. As Yong-ju tries to fix this broken relationship, he realizes his special feeling toward Gi-woong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tYhQ4mCrDOu8AXvSC4etOItyXj7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256103'),
