  ('1122559175452685260', 'Night Has a Thousand Eyes', 1948, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'John Farrow, John F. Seitz, Herbert Coleman', 'Barré Lyndon, Jonathan Latimer', 'Edward G. Robinson, Gail Russell, John Lund, Virginia Bruce, William Demarest, Richard Webb, Jerome Cowan, Onslow Stevens', 'NR', 'When heiress Jean Courtland attempts suicide, her fiancée Elliott Carson probes her relationship with John Triton. In flashback, we see how stage mentalist Triton starts having terrifying flashes of true precognition. Now years later, he desperately tries to prevent tragedies in the Courtland family.', 'When heiress Jean Courtland attempts suicide, her fiancée Elliott Carson probes her relationship with John Triton. In flashback, we see how stage mentalist Triton starts having terrifying flashes of true precognition. Now years later, he desperately tries to prevent tragedies in the Courtland family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLbSxx090bM5E1d36b8D5ZMRv7a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26387'),
  ('613829045261054387', 'Night Has Settled', 2014, 'Drama', 'Steve Clark, Adolfo Doring', 'Steve Clark', 'Spencer List, Pilar López de Ayala, Adriana Barraza, Eric Nelson, Courtney Baxter, Tommy Nelson, Heather Braverman, Marlee Roberts', null, 'In 1983, Oliver Nicholas, at thirteen, is well-poised to enter the precocious teenage world of first-sex, vodka and possible-love in New York City when he is traumatized by the stroke of his housekeeper (and only true maternal figure), a sixty-five-year-old Chilean woman named Aida. What was supposed to be an exhilarating and somewhat fearful rite of passage - diving into the exciting, fast-paced world of first experiences - quickly becomes skewed by an incomprehensible depression, and a house of interior horrors. Surrounded by women - his untraditional, Spanish, photographer mother (more interested in the role of confidante than mother) his sister, a comedic, door-slamming tormentor, marked by her parent''s divorce; and Aida, his silver-haired emotional focal point on the verge of death in Lenox Hill Hospital - Oliver struggles to maintain his role as "man of the house" and his sanity.', 'In 1983, Oliver Nicholas, at thirteen, is well-poised to enter the precocious teenage world of first-sex, vodka and possible-love in New York City when he is traumatized by the stroke of his housekeeper (and only true maternal figure), a sixty-five-year-old Chilean woman named Aida. What was supposed to be an exhilarating and somewhat fearful rite of passage - diving into the exciting, fast-paced world of first experiences - quickly becomes skewed by an incomprehensible depression, and a house of interior horrors. Surrounded by women - his untraditional, Spanish, photographer mother (more interested in the role of confidante than mother) his sister, a comedic, door-slamming tormentor, marked by her parent''s divorce; and Aida, his silver-haired emotional focal point on the verge of death in Lenox Hill Hospital - Oliver struggles to maintain his role as "man of the house" and his sanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zx3YZiPUYHwfvNSvcS4TJx27KO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314885'),
  ('167590650525164285', 'Night Hunter', 1996, 'Action, Horror, Drama', 'Rick Jacobson, John B. Aronson, Marco Black', 'William C. Martell', 'Don Wilson, Melanie Smith, Nicholas Guest, Sid Sham, Cash Casey, Maria Ford, Ron Yuan, Michael Cavanaugh', null, 'Jack Cutter is the last in long line of vampire hunters. After killing few vampires in one L.A. restaurant, he is chased both by police and by other vampires. In the process he meets an attractive woman-reporter.', 'Jack Cutter is the last in long line of vampire hunters. After killing few vampires in one L.A. restaurant, he is chased both by police and by other vampires. In the process he meets an attractive woman-reporter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vLZixx4wG2ytwJDmolpaJfA0MA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30755'),
  ('860128125386441972', 'Night Hunter', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Raymond, Puneet Chawla, Michael Barrett', 'David Raymond', 'Henry Cavill, Ben Kingsley, Alexandra Daddario, Stanley Tucci, Brendan Fletcher, Minka Kelly, Nathan Fillion, Mpho Koaho', 'R', 'A Minnesota police officer crosses paths with a committed and tireless vigilante as he follows the trail of a ruthless predator responsible for several abductions and murders.', 'A Minnesota police officer crosses paths with a committed and tireless vigilante as he follows the trail of a ruthless predator responsible for several abductions and murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVYU0x9FRpiJNX7c54ciFnRBVYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441282'),
  ('668528896611712961', 'Night in Paradise', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Park Hoon-jung, Kim Yeong-ho, Jo Yong-Jun', 'Park Hoon-jung', 'Um Tae-goo, Jeon Yeo-been, Cha Seung-won, Lee Ki-young, Park Ho-san, Hyun Bong-sik, Cho Dong-in, Cha Soon-bae', 'R', 'An assassin named Tae-goo is offered a chance to switch sides with his rival Bukseong gang, headed by Chairman Doh. Tae-goo rejects the offer that results in the murder of his sister and niece. In revenge, Tae-goo brutally kills Chairman Doh and his men and flees to Jeju Island where he meets Jae-yeon, a terminally ill woman. Though, the henchman of the Bukseong gang, Executive Ma is mercilessly hunting Tae-goo to take revenge.', 'An assassin named Tae-goo is offered a chance to switch sides with his rival Bukseong gang, headed by Chairman Doh. Tae-goo rejects the offer that results in the murder of his sister and niece. In revenge, Tae-goo brutally kills Chairman Doh and his men and flees to Jeju Island where he meets Jae-yeon, a terminally ill woman. Though, the henchman of the Bukseong gang, Executive Ma is mercilessly hunting Tae-goo to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYCWUAidqgakGETwZkfGxU7CWhL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606523'),
  ('797345468903496094', 'Night Into Morning', 1951, 'Romance, Drama', 'Fletcher Markle', 'Karl Tunberg, Leonard Spigelgass', 'Ray Milland, John Hodiak, Nancy Reagan, Lewis Stone, Jean Hagen, Rosemary DeCamp, Dawn Addams, Jonathan Cott', 'NR', 'Berkeley university professor adjusts (using alcohol) to tragic fire deaths of wife &amp; son.', 'Berkeley university professor adjusts (using alcohol) to tragic fire deaths of wife &amp; son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j87hYhI4flwYq6lPc17ZV4EC1KJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249567'),
  ('779271665789398942', 'Night Is Short, Walk On Girl', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance, Animation, Fantasy', 'Takayuki Hamada, Tomohisa Shimoyama, Nobutake Ito', 'Makoto Ueda', 'Gen Hoshino, Kana Hanazawa, Ami Koshimizu, Aoi Yuuki, Hiroshi Kamiya, Chikara Honda, Hiroyuki Yoshino, Junichi Suwabe', 'PG-13', 'As a group of university students go out for a night on the town, a sophomore known only as "The Girl with Black Hair" experiences a series of surreal encounters with the local nightlife – all the while unaware of the romantic longings of "Senpai", a senior student who has been creating increasingly fantastic and contrived reasons to run into her in an effort to win her heart.', 'As a group of university students go out for a night on the town, a sophomore known only as "The Girl with Black Hair" experiences a series of surreal encounters with the local nightlife – all the while unaware of the romantic longings of "Senpai", a senior student who has been creating increasingly fantastic and contrived reasons to run into her in an effort to win her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cDp45WZNqgAli3u4GTnUhsqFn5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430214'),
  ('725465314243562528', 'Night Journey', 1987, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ömer Kavur', 'Ömer Kavur', 'Aytaç Arman, Macit Koper, Zuhal Olcay, Şahika Tekand, Arslan Kaçar, Orhan Çağman, Nurseli İdiz, Osman Alyanak', null, 'A confused script writer takes refuge in the ruins of a Byzantine church at a remote village while looking for locations for his next film.', 'A confused script writer takes refuge in the ruins of a Byzantine church at a remote village while looking for locations for his next film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bfPxn0g8tMo3OcrDVpOIYCjBc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:287131'),
