  ('225315322726599514', 'Night Killer', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bruno Mattei, Claudio Fragasso', 'Claudio Fragasso, Rossella Drudi', 'Tara Buckman, Peter Hooten, Richard Foster, Mel Davis, Lee Lively, Tova Sardot, Gaby Ford, Claudio Fragasso', null, 'Melanie Beck is the only surviving victim of a killer-rapist who wears a Freddy Krueger-esque mask and claw. Despite having seen the killer''s face, Beck has blocked it from her memory. Becoming suicidal, she tries to kill herself on the beach but is saved by Axel, another rapist sleazeball who keeps her locked in his hotel room. All this builds to a mind blowing conclusion.', 'Melanie Beck is the only surviving victim of a killer-rapist who wears a Freddy Krueger-esque mask and claw. Despite having seen the killer''s face, Beck has blocked it from her memory. Becoming suicidal, she tries to kill herself on the beach but is saved by Axel, another rapist sleazeball who keeps her locked in his hotel room. All this builds to a mind blowing conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2da5wkbFCYdo9cf5Ex0mdcbqPTM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126463'),
  ('240386893974796685', 'Night King', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Ho Miu-Kei, Jay Cheung Wan-Ching', 'Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Sammi Cheng Sau-Man, Louise Wong Tan-Nei, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Yeung Wai-Lun, Renci Yeung, Mandy Tam Man-Huen, Li Sum-Ling', 'NR', 'The once-glamourous Club EJ suddenly experiences a hostile takeover. Much like the nightclub industry, the glory days are over for the club’s manager, despite having stood tall in East Tsim Sha Tsui for decades. To make matters worse, the new CEO is none other than his cutthroat ex-wife.', 'The once-glamourous Club EJ suddenly experiences a hostile takeover. Much like the nightclub industry, the glory days are over for the club’s manager, despite having stood tall in East Tsim Sha Tsui for decades. To make matters worse, the new CEO is none other than his cutthroat ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNeXDdsY02ZODAEUZayNZU7bPRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1602727'),
  ('174074047237760264', 'Night Life', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy', 'David Acomba, Roger Tonry', 'Keith Critchlow', 'Scott Grimes, John Astin, Cheryl Pollak, Anthony Geary, Alan Blumenfeld, Kenneth Ian Davis, Darcy DeMoss, Lisa Fuller', 'R', 'Archie works part-time at his uncle''s mortuary and is harassed by a few of the popular kids because of it. His harassers die in an automobile accident, and the bodies are taken to his uncle''s mortuary. Archie is pulling a late night at the mortuary when he sees a storm brewing. Lightening strikes! They''re alive! The preppie bullies continue to torment him...as zombies!', 'Archie works part-time at his uncle''s mortuary and is harassed by a few of the popular kids because of it. His harassers die in an automobile accident, and the bodies are taken to his uncle''s mortuary. Archie is pulling a late night at the mortuary when he sees a storm brewing. Lightening strikes! They''re alive! The preppie bullies continue to torment him...as zombies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTkBreMkbntUTLn3bakqyJqRD1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26678'),
  ('461772681088986735', 'Night Mail', 1936, 'Documentary', 'Benjamin Britten, Harry Watt, Basil Wright', 'W.H. Auden', 'Arthur Clark, John Grierson, Stuart Legg, Robert Rae', null, 'This documentary short examines the special train on which mail is sorted, dropped and collected on the run, and delivered in Scotland on the overnight run from Euston, London to Glasgow.', 'This documentary short examines the special train on which mail is sorted, dropped and collected on the run, and delivered in Scotland on the overnight run from Euston, London to Glasgow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRZCzgkR02rzN7XHx3iEyXZBEAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77963'),
