  ('905608746643993539', 'Night Must Fall', 1937, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Richard Thorpe, Ray June, Fredric Hope', 'John Van Druten', 'Robert Montgomery, Rosalind Russell, May Whitty, Alan Marshal, Merle Tottenham, Kathleen Harrison, Matthew Boulton, Beryl Mercer', 'NR', 'Wealthy widow Mrs. Bramson notices that her maid is distracted, and when she learns the girl''s fiancé, Danny, is the reason, she summons him in. Mrs. Bramson''s niece Olivia takes a liking to Danny, and comes to believe that he may have been involved in the disappearance of a local woman.', 'Wealthy widow Mrs. Bramson notices that her maid is distracted, and when she learns the girl''s fiancé, Danny, is the reason, she summons him in. Mrs. Bramson''s niece Olivia takes a liking to Danny, and comes to believe that he may have been involved in the disappearance of a local woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSZ8v3cISZpCbHLKLwhTJDHJN13.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91727'),
