  ('441391983846312456', 'Night of Death!', 1980, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Raphaël Delpard, Marcel Combes, Michel Campioli', 'Raphaël Delpard, Richard Joffo', 'Isabelle Goguey, Charlotte de Turckheim, Michel Flavius, Betty Beckers, Jean Ludow, Jeannette Batti, Michel Debrane, Germaine Delbat', null, 'When she takes up her new post at an eerie convalescent home deep in the French countryside, nurse Martine soon discovers that several missing co-workers may have fallen prey to an unspeakable evil rumored to roam the hallways at night. But as Martine looks deeper into the mystery, she suspects the home''s aged residents know more about the menace than they let on.', 'When she takes up her new post at an eerie convalescent home deep in the French countryside, nurse Martine soon discovers that several missing co-workers may have fallen prey to an unspeakable evil rumored to roam the hallways at night. But as Martine looks deeper into the mystery, she suspects the home''s aged residents know more about the menace than they let on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQEX4rzZItSK67tGb7z8u6rmFEA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30559'),
  ('955106649954023234', 'Night of Fear', 1973, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Terry Bourke, Peter Hendry, Michael Lake', 'Terry Bourke', 'Norman Yemm, Carla Hoogeveen, Mike Dorsey, Briony Behets, Peter Armstrong, James Moss, Curt Jansen', null, 'A young girl who has just spent an afternoon playing tennis and making love with a man, gets accidentally run off the road by a truck. Ending up on a dead-end dirt road, her car gets stuck in a ditch, where she starts getting terrorized by a drooling, gibbering psycho, who also has a colony of rats.', 'A young girl who has just spent an afternoon playing tennis and making love with a man, gets accidentally run off the road by a truck. Ending up on a dead-end dirt road, her car gets stuck in a ditch, where she starts getting terrorized by a drooling, gibbering psycho, who also has a colony of rats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GiPAqYadANePPvpLHQoWsJEuKs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86278'),
  ('224009944054070584', 'Night of Horror', 1981, 'Horror', 'Tony Malanowski', 'Rebecca Bach, Gae Schmitt, Tony Malanowski', 'Steve Sandkuhler, Gae Schmitt, Rebecca Bach, Jeff Canfield, Tony Malanowski', null, 'A group of four individuals becomes stranded on a former civil war battlefield, only to be tormented by the spirits of those who lost their lives there.', 'A group of four individuals becomes stranded on a former civil war battlefield, only to be tormented by the spirits of those who lost their lives there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lxHfn68t7HkAclo05sPMO3bKjgp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83818'),
  ('101254737532098054', 'Night of Knots', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül, Olcay Oğuz', 'Şahin Irmak', 'Şahin Irmak, İrem Sak, Gonca Vuslateri, Emre Karayel, Onur Buldu, Duygu Yetiş, Salih Kalyon, Bilge Şen', null, 'A groom kissed in front of a wedding room with a bride who had met and fell in love for years. Both of them are on the same day of marriage, while others in the same building are married in different halls. Things do not go as expected, of course. The two weddings enter each other, the secrets emerge.', 'A groom kissed in front of a wedding room with a bride who had met and fell in love for years. Both of them are on the same day of marriage, while others in the same building are married in different halls. Things do not go as expected, of course. The two weddings enter each other, the secrets emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUP5PNxCOBgfy87lXo6oGYqxyTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505544'),
  ('936348554498468102', 'Night of Red Wine', 1967, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jaime Deu Casas, José María Nunes', 'José María Nunes', 'Serena Vergano, Enrique Irazoqui, Rafael Arcos, Anne Settimó, Mario Gas', null, 'A man and a woman, both disappointed with their partners, meet by chance at the beginning of the night. They will spend the night together drinking red wine in Barcelona''s Chinatown.', 'A man and a woman, both disappointed with their partners, meet by chance at the beginning of the night. They will spend the night together drinking red wine in Barcelona''s Chinatown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sj5dF200MqfKmKwwH55HSWBjIWC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272863'),
  ('196790755612920043', 'Night of Silence', 2012, 'Drama', 'Reis Çelik', null, 'İlyas Salman, Dilan Aksüt, Mayşeker Yücel, Sabri Tutal, Sercan Demirkaya, Ahmet Aydın', null, 'Having just entered puberty, bride (Dilan Aksüt) had been forced to marry with groom (Ilyas Salman) whom returned to his hometown after doing many years of jail time and more than fifty years older than her. At first she was afraid, she cries, even resists, having equipped with patchy and second hand sayings, she did not know what is going to happen to her. Sitting in the nuptial chamber with horror, she will start to face with realities after grandfather-aged groom steps into the room.', 'Having just entered puberty, bride (Dilan Aksüt) had been forced to marry with groom (Ilyas Salman) whom returned to his hometown after doing many years of jail time and more than fifty years older than her. At first she was afraid, she cries, even resists, having equipped with patchy and second hand sayings, she did not know what is going to happen to her. Sitting in the nuptial chamber with horror, she will start to face with realities after grandfather-aged groom steps into the room.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tUdsTvbJAGs2znSroloQ9r7hWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183093'),
  ('470029675040557731', 'Night of Something Strange', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ron Bonk, Jonathan Straiton, Rex Femscared', 'Ron Bonk, Jonathan Straiton, Mean Gene', 'Rebecca C. Kasek, Trey Harrison, Wayne W. Johnson, Toni-Ann Gamble, Michael Merchant, John Walsh, Tarrence Taylor, Nicola Fiore', 'NR', 'Five teenage friends set out for the beach on their Spring Break vacation. Good times are cut short when one of the group, Carrie, contracts a deadly sexual transmitted disease during a bathroom stop. When they stop for the night at an isolated motel, the real terror begins when the STD virus starts running rampant, turning those infected into the living dead.', 'Five teenage friends set out for the beach on their Spring Break vacation. Good times are cut short when one of the group, Carrie, contracts a deadly sexual transmitted disease during a bathroom stop. When they stop for the night at an isolated motel, the real terror begins when the STD virus starts running rampant, turning those infected into the living dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pzLkqluK3CoFBPtLx5fEVeRSaP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362227'),
  ('424571209449599491', 'Night of Terror', 1933, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Benjamin Stoloff, Joseph A. Valentine', 'Lester Neilson, William Jacobs, Beatrice Van', 'Bela Lugosi, Wallace Ford, Sally Blane, Bryant Washburn, Tully Marshall, Gertrude Michael, George Meeker, Matt McHugh', null, 'The heirs to a family fortune are required to attend a seance at the spooky old family mansion. However, throughout the night members of the family are being killed off one by one.', 'The heirs to a family fortune are required to attend a seance at the spooky old family mansion. However, throughout the night members of the family are being killed off one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SqVvkSAbMWwHOoFnpCnuE00l5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138956'),
  ('925863062501636074', 'Night of Terror', 1972, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Jeannot Szwarc, Howard Schwartz, Ramsay King', 'Cliff Gould', 'Martin Balsam, Catherine Burns, Chuck Connors, Donna Mills, Agnes Moorehead, Bart La Rue, Eddie Egan, David Spielberg', null, 'A hired killer hunts down a schoolteacher to get something she has. She doesn''t know what it is, but he''s already killed twice to get it.', 'A hired killer hunts down a schoolteacher to get something she has. She doesn''t know what it is, but he''s already killed twice to get it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agRTZBuKhDz9c74s74PSm0NeYZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247802'),
  ('1120549518381807112', 'Night of the Animated Dead', 2021, 'Animation, Horror', 'Jason Axinn', 'John A. Russo, George A. Romero', 'Josh Duhamel, Dulé Hill, Katharine Isabelle, James Roday Rodriguez, Katee Sackhoff, Will Sasso, Jimmi Simpson, Nancy Travis', 'R', 'An animated retelling of ‘Night of the Living Dead’, in which a group of people in a rural farmhouse struggle to survive the threat of bloodthirsty zombies.', 'An animated retelling of ‘Night of the Living Dead’, in which a group of people in a rural farmhouse struggle to survive the threat of bloodthirsty zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mluarGbxZjgvhe5bteR7P24HHAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858064'),
  ('567227461207725040', 'Night of the Big Heat', 1967, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Terence Fisher, Reginald H. Wyer, Ray Frift', 'Ronald Liles', 'Christopher Lee, Patrick Allen, Peter Cushing, Jane Merrow, Sarah Lawson, William Lucas, Kenneth Cope, Percy Herbert', null, 'While mainland Britain shivers in deepest winter, the northern island of Fara bakes in the nineties, and the boys at the Met station have no more idea what is going on than the regulars at the Swan. Only a stand-offish visting scientist realizes space aliens are to blame.', 'While mainland Britain shivers in deepest winter, the northern island of Fara bakes in the nineties, and the boys at the Met station have no more idea what is going on than the regulars at the Swan. Only a stand-offish visting scientist realizes space aliens are to blame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ok3QCtLJ64WfxS4SroaYqIv3s6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54801'),
  ('519863839505419962', 'Night of the Blood Beast', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bernard L. Kowalski, John M. Nickolaus Jr.', 'Martin Varno', 'John Baer, Angela Greene, Ed Nelson, Georgianna Carter, Michael Emmet, Tyler McVey, Ross Sturlin', null, 'An astronaut returns to Earth as the no-pulse host of an alien monster''s embryos; he is discovered by a loony farmer who find ways to feed his new critter.', 'An astronaut returns to Earth as the no-pulse host of an alien monster''s embryos; he is discovered by a loony farmer who find ways to feed his new critter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgA7DNvk3WuLsicTikuC8v87JTo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109122'),
