  ('772446612274290074', 'Night of the Cobra Woman', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andrew Meyer, Nonong Rasca', 'Andrew Meyer', 'Joy Bang, Marlene Clark, Roger Garrett, Vic Diaz, Rosemarie Gil, Slash Marks, Vic Silayan, Bert Rivera', 'R', 'After being bitten by a cobra in the Philipines, Lena can turn herself into a snake and she stops aging. The curse comes with a price. The priestess Lena must consume cobra venom and vital young men to stay young.', 'After being bitten by a cobra in the Philipines, Lena can turn herself into a snake and she stops aging. The curse comes with a price. The priestess Lena must consume cobra venom and vital young men to stay young.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEgZGQJuNdD14mtUqikpr9V9XxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54942'),
  ('97427494927579988', 'Night of the Comet', 1984, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Anne H. Ahrens, Thom Eberhardt, Arthur Albert', 'Thom Eberhardt', 'Catherine Mary Stewart, Robert Beltran, Kelli Maroney, Sharon Farrell, Mary Woronov, Geoffrey Lewis, Peter Fox, Michael Bowen', 'PG-13', 'After a comet wipes out most of life on Earth, two Valley Girls find themselves fighting against cannibal zombies and a sinister group of scientists.', 'After a comet wipes out most of life on Earth, two Valley Girls find themselves fighting against cannibal zombies and a sinister group of scientists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNXnLXu73LotJ9APaJZZXflBelQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18462'),
  ('775773312788618945', 'Night of the Creeps', 1986, 'Horror, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Fred Dekker, Robert C. New', 'Fred Dekker', 'Jason Lively, Steve Marshall, Jill Whitlow, Tom Atkins, Wally Taylor, Allan Kayser, Bruce Solomon, Vic Polizos', 'R', 'In 1959, an alien experiment crashes to earth and infects a fraternity member. They freeze the body, but in the modern day, two geeks pledging a fraternity accidentally thaw the corpse, which proceeds to infect the campus with parasites that transform their hosts into killer zombies.', 'In 1959, an alien experiment crashes to earth and infects a fraternity member. They freeze the body, but in the modern day, two geeks pledging a fraternity accidentally thaw the corpse, which proceeds to infect the campus with parasites that transform their hosts into killer zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3s2tQGNb6mhlr1hPZeE5F8IUwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15762'),
  ('301254116740127272', 'Night of the Dark Full Moon', 1972, 'Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Theodore Gershuny, Adam Giffard, Sam Bender', 'Jeffrey Konvitz, Ira Teller, Theodore Gershuny', 'Patrick O''Neal, James Patterson, Mary Woronov, Astrid Heeren, John Carradine, Walter Abel, Fran Stevens, Walter Klavun', 'R', 'A man investigates the grisly crimes that occurred in a former insane asylum, unsettling the locals who all seem to have something to hide.', 'A man investigates the grisly crimes that occurred in a former insane asylum, unsettling the locals who all seem to have something to hide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yNHK5ln8K815S1zNeUyqEG8lqC2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29852'),
  ('1002480019307947922', 'Night of the Demon', 1957, 'Fantasy, Horror, Mystery', 'Jacques Tourneur, Peter Glazier, Edward Scaife', 'Hal E. Chester, Charles Bennett', 'Dana Andrews, Peggy Cummins, Niall MacGinnis, Maurice Denham, Athene Seyler, Liam Redmond, Reginald Beckwith, Ewan Roberts', 'NR', 'American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.', 'American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePAjGAhynpwEI5HbpIrB28ML6lg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25103'),
  ('958218408977778485', 'Night of the Demon', 1980, 'Horror', 'Jim West', 'Jim L. Ball, Mike Williams', 'Michael Cutt, Paul Kelleher, Melanie Graham, Lynn Eastman-Rossi, Eugene Dow, Don Hurst, Bob Collins, Jody Lazarus', 'R', 'An anthropology professor and his students attempt to track down a Bigfoot responsible for a rash of violent murders, only to uncover something even more sinister.', 'An anthropology professor and his students attempt to track down a Bigfoot responsible for a rash of violent murders, only to uncover something even more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyOCBfMFX783oPvwp82meUQn4Sw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40146'),
  ('781432306296432060', 'Night of the Demons', 1988, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Kevin Tenney, David Lewis, Lee Alan McConnell', 'Joe Augustyn', 'Cathy Podewell, Alvin Alexis, Amelia Kinkade, Linnea Quigley, Hal Havins, Billy Gallo, Lance Fenton, Jill Terashita', 'R', 'When partygoers at a deserted funeral home decide to have a séance on Halloween night, they awaken something evil with a thirst for blood.', 'When partygoers at a deserted funeral home decide to have a séance on Halloween night, they awaken something evil with a thirst for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VcJ4wpIx8TO14rXZnYPhzKL7Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24924'),
  ('905816567113022504', 'Night of the Demons', 2009, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Adam Gierasch, Andy Sparaco, Andrew Cohen', 'Joe Augustyn', 'Monica Keena, Edward Furlong, Shannon Elizabeth, John F. Beach, Michael Copon, Diora Baird, Bobbi Sue Luther, Tatyana Kanavka', 'R', 'Angela is throwing a decadent Halloween party at New Orleans'' infamous Broussard Mansion. But after the police break up the festivities, Maddie and a few friends stay behind. Trapped inside the locked mansion gates, the remaining guests uncover a horrifying secret and soon fall victim to seven vicious, blood-thirsty demons.', 'Angela is throwing a decadent Halloween party at New Orleans'' infamous Broussard Mansion. But after the police break up the festivities, Maddie and a few friends stay behind. Trapped inside the locked mansion gates, the remaining guests uncover a horrifying secret and soon fall victim to seven vicious, blood-thirsty demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm6pIvRM91rtJgQb3BlUczLr4qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27646'),
  ('526386063205351451', 'Night of the Demons 2', 1994, 'Horror, Comedy', 'David Lewis, Brian Trenchard-Smith, Carla Rose Ponzio', 'Joe Augustyn', 'Cristi Harris, Darin Heames, Robert Jayne, Merle Kennedy, Amelia Kinkade, Rod McCary, Johnny Moran, Rick Peters', 'R', 'Angela, the hostess from hell, summons her army of teen demons when teenagers from St. Rita''s High School decide to party at the haunted Hull House on Halloween.', 'Angela, the hostess from hell, summons her army of teen demons when teenagers from St. Rita''s High School decide to party at the haunted Hull House on Halloween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0JZ23O4hKJana9mzC0AxKbS7Ko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24925'),
  ('809376461681941528', 'Night of the Demons III', 1997, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jimmy Kaufman, Walter Bal, Kevin Tenney', 'Kevin Tenney', 'Larry Day, Amelia Kinkade, Kristen Holden-Ried, Gregory Calpakis, Tara Slone, Christian Tessier, Joel Gordon, Patricia Rodríguez', 'R', 'When a group of rambunctious teens take refuge in Hull House to escape the law, they soon realize their grave error upon meeting Angela.', 'When a group of rambunctious teens take refuge in Hull House to escape the law, they soon realize their grave error upon meeting Angela.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQ8ope8HVjLrO5G3WXAEgrFvAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40147'),
  ('437064598896272300', 'Night of the Eagle', 1962, 'Horror', 'Sidney Hayers, Reginald H. Wyer', 'Charles Beaumont, Richard Matheson, George Baxt', 'Peter Wyngarde, Janet Blair, Margaret Johnston, Anthony Nicholls, Colin Gordon, Kathleen Byron, Reginald Beckwith, Jessica Dunning', 'NR', 'A woman who may be a witch defends her husband from forces attempting to harm him.', 'A woman who may be a witch defends her husband from forces attempting to harm him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhsE6gYKJjgRCaV7MF0fCsErHzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45714'),
  ('973356167931983192', 'Night of the Felines', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Noboru Tanaka, Kenji Hagiwara, Koji Okamoto', 'Akira Nakano', 'Tomoko Katsura, Ken Yoshizawa, Hidemi Hara, Keiko Maki, Hidetoshi Kageyama, Akemi Yamaguchi, Masuo Kinugasa, Tatsuya Hamaguchi', null, 'Set in a Shinjuku bathhouse brothel, the film uncovers the sexual eccentricities of everyday people. Focusing on three female prostitutes, the colorful, unpredictable look into the hidden underbelly of Japanese nightlife is playful but also unafraid to explore the darker sides of the business. The fleeting nature of relationships in such an environment and the consequences of toying with feelings are presented with a melancholy tinge.', 'Set in a Shinjuku bathhouse brothel, the film uncovers the sexual eccentricities of everyday people. Focusing on three female prostitutes, the colorful, unpredictable look into the hidden underbelly of Japanese nightlife is playful but also unafraid to explore the darker sides of the business. The fleeting nature of relationships in such an environment and the consequences of toying with feelings are presented with a melancholy tinge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qg7XRTcMCHp7KQHOaA6AdSoPGY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129369'),
  ('1126678330129652068', 'Night of the Fox', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Charles Jarrott, Jean-Paul Rabie', 'Bennett Cohen', 'George Peppard, Michael York, John Mills, Deborah Raffin, David Birney, Gottfried John, John Standing, Amadeus August', 'R', 'This classic war movie stars George Peppard and Michael York in a gripping tale of danger, intrigue, and a deadly secret that could determine the fate of millions. U.S. Officer Colonel Hugh Kelso has inside knowledge about the imminent and highly secretive D-Day Invasion. When he washes ashore behind enemy lines, special agents Harry Martineau and Sara Drayton of the Allied Forces must stage a covert rescue to save his life – or end it – before the Germans acquire the valuable information he possesses. Joined by an Italian naval officer and a Jewish actor-turned-German paratrooper, the agents embark on a thrilling rescue mission with a shocking twist.', 'This classic war movie stars George Peppard and Michael York in a gripping tale of danger, intrigue, and a deadly secret that could determine the fate of millions. U.S. Officer Colonel Hugh Kelso has inside knowledge about the imminent and highly secretive D-Day Invasion. When he washes ashore behind enemy lines, special agents Harry Martineau and Sara Drayton of the Allied Forces must stage a covert rescue to save his life – or end it – before the Germans acquire the valuable information he possesses. Joined by an Italian naval officer and a Jewish actor-turned-German paratrooper, the agents embark on a thrilling rescue mission with a shocking twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptREEl2OVBg1WkFPALgXORAUnkZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55287'),
  ('1095059373627122662', 'Night of the Howling Beast', 1975, 'Horror, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Miguel Iglesias, Tomàs Pladevall, José Pascual', 'Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Mercedes Molina, Silvia Solar, Gil Vidal, Luis Induni, Josep Castillo, Ventura Oller, Verónica Miriel', 'R', 'Waldemar, the renowned adventurer, joins an expedition to find the Yeti in the Himalayas. While hiking the mountains, he''s captured by two cannibalistic demon nymphets guarding a remote Buddhist temple and becomes their sex-slave. They transform him into a werewolf setting him loose to roam the mountain where he encounters a sadistic bandit.', 'Waldemar, the renowned adventurer, joins an expedition to find the Yeti in the Himalayas. While hiking the mountains, he''s captured by two cannibalistic demon nymphets guarding a remote Buddhist temple and becomes their sex-slave. They transform him into a werewolf setting him loose to roam the mountain where he encounters a sadistic bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TepFt7kLtQ72fgwzLWhPJo3pQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54112'),
  ('1010164852210074121', 'Night of the Hunted', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Kenny Oliver, Tasha Petty, Franck Khalfoun', 'Rubén Ávila Calvo, David R.L., Glen Freyer', 'Camille Rowe, Aleksandar Popovic, J. John Bieler, Jeremy Scippio, Brian Breiter, Monaia Abdelrahim, Isaiah Reyes, Brenda Nunez', null, 'When an unsuspecting woman stops at a remote gas station in the dead of night, she''s made the plaything of a sociopath sniper with a secret vendetta. To survive, she must not only dodge his bullets and fight for her life, but also figure out who wants her dead and why.', 'When an unsuspecting woman stops at a remote gas station in the dead of night, she''s made the plaything of a sociopath sniper with a secret vendetta. To survive, she must not only dodge his bullets and fight for her life, but also figure out who wants her dead and why.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84YOsylmgr181BHrTKlmaKs8IzV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160003'),
  ('478512275943400317', 'Night of the Hunter', 1991, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Horror', 'David Greene, Ron Orieux', null, 'Richard Chamberlain, Diana Scarwid, Burgess Meredith, Reid Binion, Amy Bebout, Ray McKinnon, Mary Nell Santacroce, Ed Grady', null, 'A false preacher ingratiates himself with a dead man''s family to find where he hid the money from a robbery.', 'A false preacher ingratiates himself with a dead man''s family to find where he hid the money from a robbery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/snmBQbFeKgAyLkYHshKFnKWEsQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243714'),
  ('319972728716497804', 'Night of the Juggler', 1980, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Butler, Ron Walsh, Michael Haley', 'Rick Natkin, William W. Norton', 'James Brolin, Cliff Gorman, Richard S. Castellano, Linda Miller, Barton Heyman, Sully Boyar, Julie Carmen, Abby Bluestone', 'R', 'When a twisted psychotic kidnaps a young girl, mistaking her for the daughter of a wealthy developer, her father, a hardened ex-cop, doggedly hunts them through New York''s seamy streets.', 'When a twisted psychotic kidnaps a young girl, mistaking her for the daughter of a wealthy developer, her father, a hardened ex-cop, doggedly hunts them through New York''s seamy streets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fv9LeLgbzR08UHjGyfbsEKf5JkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44686'),
  ('747405308818572424', 'Night of the Killer Bears', 2022, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Kanphong Banjongphinij, Wade Muller, Nuanphan Sornsree', 'Lee Thongkham, Kanphong Banjongphinij, Sorawi Alapach', 'Khemanit Jamikorn, Sattaphong Phiangphor, Sananthachat Thanapatpisal, Patchata Janngeon, Panisara Rikulsurakan, Akalavut Mankalasut, Teerapong Liaorakwong, Chanagun Arpornsutina', null, 'After not seeing each other for a long time, 5 teenage friends living in the city of Bangkok go on a vacation together, staying at a quiet resort isolated from the city. Things take a dark turn, when it’s revealed each of them have hidden secrets and unbeknownst to the group, there is someone observing them.', 'After not seeing each other for a long time, 5 teenage friends living in the city of Bangkok go on a vacation together, staying at a quiet resort isolated from the city. Things take a dark turn, when it’s revealed each of them have hidden secrets and unbeknownst to the group, there is someone observing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vGkjjQlX0yF7uTj3D3UPG3xtT0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1005804'),
  ('50958487417905164', 'Night of the Kings', 2021, 'Drama', 'Philippe Lacôte, Tobie Marier Robitaille', 'Philippe Lacôte', 'Koné Bakary, Steve Tientcheu, Digbeu Jean Cyrille, Rasmané Ouédraogo, Issaka Sawadogo, Denis Lavant, Abdoul Karim Konaté, Macel Anzian', null, 'A young man is sent to "La Maca," a prison in the middle of the Ivorian forest ruled by its inmates. As tradition goes with the rising of the red moon, he is designated by the Boss to be the new "Roman" and must tell a story to the other prisoners. Learning what fate awaits him, he begins to narrate the mystical life of the legendary outlaw named "Zama King" and has no choice but to make his story last until dawn.', 'A young man is sent to "La Maca," a prison in the middle of the Ivorian forest ruled by its inmates. As tradition goes with the rising of the red moon, he is designated by the Boss to be the new "Roman" and must tell a story to the other prisoners. Learning what fate awaits him, he begins to narrate the mystical life of the legendary outlaw named "Zama King" and has no choice but to make his story last until dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkY6Agn4sucxm2VHrPBk7pQah7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660958'),
