  ('127648117323397537', 'Night of the Scarecrow', 1995, 'Horror', 'Jeff Burr, Dan Golden, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Dan Mazur, Reed Steiner', 'Elizabeth Barondes, John Mese, Stephen Root, Bruce Glover, Dirk Blocker, Howard Swain, Gary Lockwood, John Hawkes', 'R', 'A group of drunk teenagers accidently set free the spirit of a warlock, which possesses a scarecrow. The scarecrow goes on a bloody rampage killing the descendents of the men who had killed the warlock a century before. A newcomer and the daughter of the mayor try to stop it before it is too late and the warlock can reincarnate...', 'A group of drunk teenagers accidently set free the spirit of a warlock, which possesses a scarecrow. The scarecrow goes on a bloody rampage killing the descendents of the men who had killed the warlock a century before. A newcomer and the daughter of the mayor try to stop it before it is too late and the warlock can reincarnate...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6crY4HAR2MZQMmWVzLP8Yel37I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55537'),
  ('774418004071626266', 'Night of the Scorpion', 1972, 'Horror', 'Alfonso Balcázar', 'Giovanni Simonelli', 'Nuria Torray, Teresa Gimpera, José Antonio Amor, Daniela Giordano, Gioia Desideri, Alicia Tomás, Osvaldo Genazzani, Carlo Gentili', null, 'This Spanish-Italian co-production tells the story of a man who feels deep guilt for the death of his wife: he, an alcoholic, is convinced that he accidentally caused her fatal fall in their house while he was drunk. He finds a new wife, but he is unable to cope with his first wife''s death. Furthermore, the maid and his sister do not accept the new woman in the household. After a while, bodies begin turn up ... and the grave of the man''s first wife is empty!', 'This Spanish-Italian co-production tells the story of a man who feels deep guilt for the death of his wife: he, an alcoholic, is convinced that he accidentally caused her fatal fall in their house while he was drunk. He finds a new wife, but he is unable to cope with his first wife''s death. Furthermore, the maid and his sister do not accept the new woman in the household. After a while, bodies begin turn up ... and the grave of the man''s first wife is empty!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjyExIe9EwkvntTLcq8sWX27lhj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104906'),
