  ('133812178230667077', 'Night on the Galactic Railroad', 1985, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Gisaburō Sugii, Nobuo Koyama', 'Minoru Betsuyaku', 'Mayumi Tanaka, Chika Sakamoto, Junko Hori, Kaori Nakahara, Yoshie Shimamura, Reiko Niimura, Ayumi Ishijo, Ayako Hori', null, 'Giovanni currently lives a dreary life of near non-stop work. At school, his peers ridicule him incessantly, and his employer at work is distant and cold. As his isolation from society becomes unbearable, he suddenly finds himself on a train heading far away from his miserable home. Accompanied by Campanella, an acquaintance from school, Giovanni embarks on a journey that will define the rest of his life.', 'Giovanni currently lives a dreary life of near non-stop work. At school, his peers ridicule him incessantly, and his employer at work is distant and cold. As his isolation from society becomes unbearable, he suddenly finds himself on a train heading far away from his miserable home. Accompanied by Campanella, an acquaintance from school, Giovanni embarks on a journey that will define the rest of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhuPBTDmQzFCK7ZkWeIzrFY4dXL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37585'),
