  ('332896889799497524', 'Night Owl', 1993, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jeffrey Arsenault, Neil Shapiro, Howard Krupa', 'Jeffrey Arsenault', 'John Leguizamo, Lisa Napoli, David Roya, Caroline Munro, Ali Thomas, James Raftery, Holly Woodlawn, Yul Vazquez', null, 'A vampire in the East Village picks up women, and while having sex with them kills them and drinks their blood. Meanwhile, a young Puerto Rican guy begins searching the Village for his sister, who is one of the vampire''s victims.', 'A vampire in the East Village picks up women, and while having sex with them kills them and drinks their blood. Meanwhile, a young Puerto Rican guy begins searching the Village for his sister, who is one of the vampire''s victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uZXipDUOfUSefT5iKWURpYPag1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30753'),
  ('128557412249098639', 'Night Owls', 1930, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott', 'H.M. Walker', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Edgar Kennedy, James Finlayson, Anders Randolf', 'NR', 'Policeman Edgar Kennedy is told by his chief he better stop a string of burglaries that have been happening on his watch or else he will get the sack. He persuades vagrants Stan and Ollie to rob the chief''s house so he can regain his reputation by catching them. The policeman promises to later get the boys off. Things do not go as planned.', 'Policeman Edgar Kennedy is told by his chief he better stop a string of burglaries that have been happening on his watch or else he will get the sack. He persuades vagrants Stan and Ollie to rob the chief''s house so he can regain his reputation by catching them. The policeman promises to later get the boys off. Things do not go as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdCyRFkJgTPlu8gcgKhHywx1KDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48889'),
  ('732525374590108340', 'Night Owls', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Hood, Adrian Peng Correia, Cyndi Martin', 'Seth Goldsmith, Charles Hood', 'Adam Pally, Rosa Salazar, Rob Huebel, Tony Hale, Peter Krause', 'R', 'After workaholic Kevin has a drunken one night stand with the beautiful train-wreck Madeline, he''s horrified to discover that she''s actually his boss'' jilted ex-mistress. When she takes a bottle of sleeping pills, Kevin is forced to keep her awake... and over the course of the night the two begin to fall for each other.', 'After workaholic Kevin has a drunken one night stand with the beautiful train-wreck Madeline, he''s horrified to discover that she''s actually his boss'' jilted ex-mistress. When she takes a bottle of sleeping pills, Kevin is forced to keep her awake... and over the course of the night the two begin to fall for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRzddgMNFWfoYbE0hiyWxYNt5Gg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324291'),
  ('564102374159393249', 'Night Passage', 1957, 'Western', 'James Neilson, James Curtis Havens, Marshall Green', 'Borden Chase', 'James Stewart, Audie Murphy, Dan Duryea, Dianne Foster, Elaine Stewart, Brandon De Wilde, Jay C. Flippen, Herbert Anderson', 'NR', 'Grant MacLaine, a former railroad troubleshooter, lost his job after letting his outlaw, the Utica Kid, escape. After spending five years wandering the west and earning his living playing the accordion, he is given a second chance by his former boss.', 'Grant MacLaine, a former railroad troubleshooter, lost his job after letting his outlaw, the Utica Kid, escape. After spending five years wandering the west and earning his living playing the accordion, he is given a second chance by his former boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jb9YcoP4c4kM2n1w37JyYELms2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25381'),
  ('416660817380102414', 'Night Patrol', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Jackie Kong', 'Murray Langston, Jackie Kong, Bill Osco', 'Linda Blair, Pat Paulsen, Jaye P. Morgan, Murray Langston, Billy Barty, Pat Morita, Jack Riley, Kitten Natividad', 'R', 'Melvin White, a neurotic, accident-prone cop who gets demoted to the night shift, secretly moonlights as the Unknown Comic, an anonymous stand-up comedian who performs with a paper bag over his head. When someone using the same guise commits a string of bar robberies in town, some begin to suspect that White is the culprit.', 'Melvin White, a neurotic, accident-prone cop who gets demoted to the night shift, secretly moonlights as the Unknown Comic, an anonymous stand-up comedian who performs with a paper bag over his head. When someone using the same guise commits a string of bar robberies in town, some begin to suspect that White is the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTYkhu0dT09EDbuI0VActNjkuEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73621'),
  ('1051527335219563660', 'Night Patrol', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Action', 'Ryan Prows, Benjamin Kitchens', 'Ryan Prows, Tim Cairo, Jake Gibson', 'Jermaine Fowler, Justin Long, Phil Brooks, Dermot Mulroney, Freddie Gibbs, RJ Cyler, YG, Nicki Micheaux', 'R', 'An L.A. cop discovers a local task force is hiding a secret that puts the residents of his childhood neighborhood in danger.', 'An L.A. cop discovers a local task force is hiding a secret that puts the residents of his childhood neighborhood in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNqLzACU9ez2ehDalTFDPjZiC4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1323625'),
  ('1088023175763093118', 'Night People', 1954, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Nunnally Johnson, Charles G. Clarke', 'Nunnally Johnson, W.R. Burnett', 'Gregory Peck, Broderick Crawford, Anita Björk, Rita Gam, Walter Abel, Buddy Ebsen, Max Showalter, Jill Esmond', 'NR', 'A US intelligence officer, stationed in Germany, is caught in a political dilemma when the Russians kidnap a young Army private, the son of prominent American businessman. In exchange for the soldier''s return, the Russians attempt to barter a trade for an elderly German couple who they want for treason.', 'A US intelligence officer, stationed in Germany, is caught in a political dilemma when the Russians kidnap a young Army private, the son of prominent American businessman. In exchange for the soldier''s return, the Russians attempt to barter a trade for an elderly German couple who they want for treason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSnj3IUJWTtGCls0glpVnuyLkvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76372'),
  ('324954445523327568', 'Night Raiders', 2021, 'Science Fiction', 'Daniel Grant, Danis Goulet, Rob Cotterill', 'Danis Goulet', 'Elle-Máijá Tailfeathers, Brooklyn Letexier-Hart, Alex Tarrant, Amanda Plummer, Gail Maurice, Violet Nelson, Shaun Sipos, Eric Osborne', 'NR', 'The year is 2043. A military occupation controls disenfranchised cities in post-war North America. Children are property of the State. A desperate Cree woman joins an underground band of vigilantes to infiltrate a State children’s academy and get her daughter back. Night Raiders is a female-driven dystopian drama about resilience, courage and love.', 'The year is 2043. A military occupation controls disenfranchised cities in post-war North America. Children are property of the State. A desperate Cree woman joins an underground band of vigilantes to infiltrate a State children’s academy and get her daughter back. Night Raiders is a female-driven dystopian drama about resilience, courage and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wCjGxpp6jGtaef0PNGy66Vdoco0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795778'),
  ('979708778121779774', 'Night Rhythms', 1992, 'Thriller', 'Gregory Dark, Eric Small, Keith Barefoot', 'Alan Gries, Robyn Sullivent, Andrew W. Garroni', 'Martin Hewitt, David Carradine, Sam J. Jones, Deborah Driggs, Delia Sheppard, Tracy Tweed, Jamie Summers, Julie Strain', null, 'Nick, a late night DJ, has sex with a listener that he''s invited to the station. The session goes out over the air until something goes wrong. Nick wakes up to find a dead body and himself framed. Nick now tries to prove his innocence.', 'Nick, a late night DJ, has sex with a listener that he''s invited to the station. The session goes out over the air until something goes wrong. Nick wakes up to find a dead body and himself framed. Nick now tries to prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49jA8HZZtpDpDN6hPw943wdfEOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39087'),
  ('82394865211615756', 'Night Ride', 2019, 'Drama', 'Frédéric Farrucci', 'Frédéric Farrucci, Benjamin Charbit, Nicolas Journet', 'Guang Huo, Camélia Jordana, Xun Liang, Maurice Cheng, Xinglong Zhao, Qiqian Xie, Zhiwei Ren, Tien Shué', null, 'Jin is a young illegal Chinese immigrant in Paris. He works in a fraudulent taxi scheme for the Triads. The only memory of his past as a DJ in Beijing is the inspiring sophisticated electro music he plays in his car when he drives. One night, Naomi, a troubling and stunning escort and stripper, gets in his car. Intrigued by the young driver, falling for his music, she decides to make him her exclusive driver. But as they grow closer, Jin will have to betray dangerous people.', 'Jin is a young illegal Chinese immigrant in Paris. He works in a fraudulent taxi scheme for the Triads. The only memory of his past as a DJ in Beijing is the inspiring sophisticated electro music he plays in his car when he drives. One night, Naomi, a troubling and stunning escort and stripper, gets in his car. Intrigued by the young driver, falling for his music, she decides to make him her exclusive driver. But as they grow closer, Jin will have to betray dangerous people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2h3QsKHbBJX3afxiZQnG30wFmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:636831'),
  ('673570272297481584', 'Night Ride', 2020, 'Drama', 'Eirik Tveiten', 'Eirik Tveiten', 'Sigrid Kandal Husjord, Ola Hoemsnes Sandum, Axel Barø Aasen, Jon Vegard Hovdal, Rafat Haska, Øyvind Uhlving', null, 'A cold night in December. Ebba waits for the tram to go home after a party, but the ride takes an unexpected turn.', 'A cold night in December. Ebba waits for the tram to go home after a party, but the ride takes an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v8SQQt7vlyvEwimhUT273HeBD8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715714'),
  ('638796893821609380', 'Night Ripper', 1986, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Cesare Ferrario', 'Fulvio Ricciardi, Cesare Ferrario', 'Leonard Mann, Bettina Giovannini, Gabriele Tinti, Federico Pacifici, Lydia Mancinelli, Alberto Di Stasio, Francesca Muzio, Anna Orso', null, 'A string of sex murders has been plaguing Florence for almost 15 years, in which a serial killer brutally murders couples who are sneaking "a quickie" in public areas. A writer who is doing research for a book about the crimes sets out to uncover the identity of the killer, aided by his beautiful girlfriend. Based on a true story.', 'A string of sex murders has been plaguing Florence for almost 15 years, in which a serial killer brutally murders couples who are sneaking "a quickie" in public areas. A writer who is doing research for a book about the crimes sets out to uncover the identity of the killer, aided by his beautiful girlfriend. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIpsYLpT0qXKkqfhjms6MWZpjzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108079'),
  ('690149340001847161', 'Night Runner', 2009, 'Thriller', 'Gerardo Herrero, Alfredo Mayo', 'Nicolás Saad', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Miguel Ángel Solá, Érica Rivas, Jorge Sabaté, Marta Lubos, Manuel Vicente, Roberto Vallejos, Magela Zanotta', null, 'Eduardo, manager of an insurance company, is under a lot of stress and that''s why he runs, especially when he is about to explode. One day, returning from an unsuccessful business trip, he meets a mysterious man at the airport who presents himself as a friend and benefactor and encourages Eduardo to change his life and be free', 'Eduardo, manager of an insurance company, is under a lot of stress and that''s why he runs, especially when he is about to explode. One day, returning from an unsuccessful business trip, he meets a mysterious man at the airport who presents himself as a friend and benefactor and encourages Eduardo to change his life and be free', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jZywWyyw52VMb9gzokib35VdBl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48920'),
  ('466765640299965970', 'Night School', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ken Hughes, Mark Irwin', 'Ruth Avergon', 'Leonard Mann, Rachel Ward, Drew Snyder, Joseph R. Sicari, Nicholas Cairis, Karen MacDonald, Annette Miller, Bill McCann', 'R', 'A Boston police detective investigates a series of gruesome decapitations of various college coeds, committed by a helmeted, black-leather clad serial killer.', 'A Boston police detective investigates a series of gruesome decapitations of various college coeds, committed by a helmeted, black-leather clad serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uW7b1TW4dLSbmplgIdyRxoEI7dQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54118'),
  ('92642755871365964', 'Night School', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Malcolm D. Lee, Greg Gardiner, Elyse Archie', 'John Hamburg, Nicholas Stoller, Matthew Kellard', 'Kevin Hart, Tiffany Haddish, Rob Riggle, Romany Malco, Taran Killam, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Al Madrigal, Mary Lynn Rajskub', 'PG-13', 'Teddy Walker is a successful salesman whose life takes an unexpected turn when he accidentally blows up his place of employment. Forced to attend night school to get his GED, Teddy soon finds himself dealing with a group of misfit students, his former high school nemesis and a feisty teacher who doesn''t think he''s too bright.', 'Teddy Walker is a successful salesman whose life takes an unexpected turn when he accidentally blows up his place of employment. Forced to attend night school to get his GED, Teddy soon finds himself dealing with a group of misfit students, his former high school nemesis and a feisty teacher who doesn''t think he''s too bright.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQVIQDc3foTPodZw0ie1Or0CXBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454293'),
  ('646649449073892960', 'Night Screams', 1987, 'Horror', 'Allen Plone, Eric Anderson', 'Mitch Brian, Dillis L. Hart II', 'Joseph Paul Manno, Ron Thomas, Randy Lundsford, Megan Wyss, Janette Caldwell, John Hines, Diana Martin, Jerry Goehring', null, 'A football star throws a party for his friends. Two insane killers escape from a nearby asylum on that same night, and in their efforts to elude authorities, wind up at the party.', 'A football star throws a party for his friends. Two insane killers escape from a nearby asylum on that same night, and in their efforts to elude authorities, wind up at the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MtJyBGLn1uvaeO3JSLKaaVM1Ea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85156'),
  ('962592946166337058', 'Night Shadow', 1989, 'Horror', 'Randolph Cohlan', null, 'Brenda Vance, Stuart Quan, Rick Scott, Tom Boylan, Kato Kaelin, Aldo Ray, Jeannette Lewis, Alta LaFlame', null, 'Alex, an up-and-coming TV journalist, returns to her hometown of Danford as local police attempt to cope with a series of brutal murders. The small town plunges into a state of panic and the murders--clearly the work of a monster, more beast than man--continue... until Alex comes face to face with the evil itself.', 'Alex, an up-and-coming TV journalist, returns to her hometown of Danford as local police attempt to cope with a series of brutal murders. The small town plunges into a state of panic and the murders--clearly the work of a monster, more beast than man--continue... until Alex comes face to face with the evil itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdMslXlDD2JMfC4Z9mm25p48lGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42906'),
  ('132305920637389726', 'Night Shadows', 1984, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'John "Bud" Cardos, Alfred Taylor, Mel A. Bishop', 'John C. Kruize, Peter Z. Orton, Michael Jones', 'Wings Hauser, Bo Hopkins, Jody Medford, Lee Montgomery, Marc Clement, Cary Guffey, Jennifer Warren, Danny Nelson', 'R', 'When two brothers, Josh and Mike, go to a small southern town for a vacation, they find most of the residents either dead or missing. When Mike himself goes missing, Josh teams up with the local sheriff and an attractive school teacher to find him until Josh discovers that the whole town and most of it''s people have been infected by a form of toxic waste, and they have all turned into toxic vampires whom prowl the streets at night for human blood!', 'When two brothers, Josh and Mike, go to a small southern town for a vacation, they find most of the residents either dead or missing. When Mike himself goes missing, Josh teams up with the local sheriff and an attractive school teacher to find him until Josh discovers that the whole town and most of it''s people have been infected by a form of toxic waste, and they have all turned into toxic vampires whom prowl the streets at night for human blood!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hpgDqHb72lv0ldw4JzkwbnTd4eW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40026'),
  ('967475869670202892', 'Night Shapes', 1999, 'Drama', 'Andreas Dresen, Andreas Höfer', 'Andreas Dresen', 'Meriam Abbas, Dominique Horwitz, Oliver Breite, Susanne Bormann, Michael Gwisdek, Horst Krause, Axel Prahl, Ursula Karusseit', null, 'The Pope is in town and the night of his stay is anything but heavenly for some of Berlin′s inhabitants. Rich and poor, down-and-outs and policemen, street kids and taxi drivers - in their search for a little bit of happiness, they all end up on an amusing and at times harrowing odyssey through the labyrinth of the big city.', 'The Pope is in town and the night of his stay is anything but heavenly for some of Berlin′s inhabitants. Rich and poor, down-and-outs and policemen, street kids and taxi drivers - in their search for a little bit of happiness, they all end up on an amusing and at times harrowing odyssey through the labyrinth of the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gy7UA2Bab03x26JhxegK0qj8WRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10211'),
  ('241040351798030939', 'Night Shift', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Ron Howard, James Crabe', 'Lowell Ganz, Babaloo Mandel', 'Henry Winkler, Michael Keaton, Shelley Long, Gina Hecht, Pat Corley, Bobby Di Cicco, Nita Talbot, Basil Hoffman', 'R', 'A nebbish of a morgue attendant gets shunted back to the night shift where he is shackled with an obnoxious neophyte partner who dreams of the "one great idea" for success. His life takes a bizarre turn when a prostitute neighbor complains about the loss of her pimp. His partner, upon hearing the situation, suggests that they fill that opening themselves using the morgue at night.', 'A nebbish of a morgue attendant gets shunted back to the night shift where he is shackled with an obnoxious neophyte partner who dreams of the "one great idea" for success. His life takes a bizarre turn when a prostitute neighbor complains about the loss of her pimp. His partner, upon hearing the situation, suggests that they fill that opening themselves using the morgue at night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iS78MFtMDwWDP748juZQBK57C9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14742'),
  ('220828184630933192', 'Night Shift', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Yves Angelo', 'Claire Barré, Anne Fontaine', 'Omar Sy, Virginie Efira, Grégory Gadebois, Payman Maadi, Anne-Pascale Clairembourg, Cédric Vieira, Thierry Levaret, Emmanuel Barrouyer', null, 'Three officers are tasked with escorting an illegal immigrant to Charles de Gaulle airport, where he will be forced onto a plane and sent back to his homeland. But when they find out about the truth, they have to make a difficult choice.', 'Three officers are tasked with escorting an illegal immigrant to Charles de Gaulle airport, where he will be forced onto a plane and sent back to his homeland. But when they find out about the truth, they have to make a difficult choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52KQaRQiEIZ9TE4P5iIrRIK7Wej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660330'),
  ('1108994770873149692', 'Night Shift', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Benjamin China, Paul China, Mac Fisken', 'Benjamin China, Paul China', 'Phoebe Tonkin, Lamorne Morris, Madison Hu, Lauren Bowles, Patrick Fischler, Christopher Denham, Connor Price, Jess Varley', null, 'A young woman working her first night shift at a remote motel begins to suspect that she is being followed by a dangerous character from her past. As the night progresses and increasingly supernatural events occur, she quickly finds out that nothing is what it appears to be.', 'A young woman working her first night shift at a remote motel begins to suspect that she is being followed by a dangerous character from her past. As the night progresses and increasingly supernatural events occur, she quickly finds out that nothing is what it appears to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shsdw00R6RwkGsUmT7O5cKhmLqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829038'),
  ('910036575585168714', 'Night Shift', 2024, 'Horror', 'Rigoberto Castañeda, Daniel Blanco, Diego Cohen', 'Rigoberto Castañeda', 'Paulina Gaitán, Tony Dalton, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Enoc Leaño, Fernanda Echevarría del Rivero, Iazua Larios, Patricia Maqueo, Azul Guaita', 'R', 'A young nurse with a domestic abuse past starts working the night shift at a small hospital, where, during the night, the ghost of a nurse materializes.', 'A young nurse with a domestic abuse past starts working the night shift at a small hospital, where, during the night, the ghost of a nurse materializes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jnX2JQIbYwCLhHenhQFBFw6fozR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208808'),
  ('712254014117704921', 'Night Shot', 2018, 'Horror, Drama', 'Adel Zitoun, Hugo König', null, 'Nathalie Couturier, Hugo König', 'NR', 'A haunting in real time. A beautiful young woman is subjected to a grueling night of terror - all accomplished in one take, as she investigates paranormal reports at an abandoned facility.', 'A haunting in real time. A beautiful young woman is subjected to a grueling night of terror - all accomplished in one take, as she investigates paranormal reports at an abandoned facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vCLhAxLfRJFIXGv6X82jl5zKZDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574466'),
  ('790196517112424118', 'Night Skies', 2007, 'Drama, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Roy Knyrim, Steve Adcock, Jeff Fuller', 'Eric Miller', 'Jason Connery, A. J. Cook, George Stults, Ashley Peldon, Joseph Sikora, Gwendoline Yeo, Michael Dorn, Jerry L. Jackson', null, 'On March 13th, 1997 one of the largest UFO sightings ever recorded took place across the southwestern United States...', 'On March 13th, 1997 one of the largest UFO sightings ever recorded took place across the southwestern United States...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jfA02o3Q8MrWukpxzoTwq18IiDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18040'),
  ('975070338778975804', 'Night Slaves', 1970, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Ted Post, Floyd Joyer', null, 'James Franciscus, Lee Grant, Scott Marlowe, Andrew Prine, Tisha Sterling, Leslie Nielsen, Morris Buchanan, Elisha Cook Jr.', 'NR', 'A man and his wife stumble upon a town whose inhabitants turn into zombies and head for the edge of town every night... he seems to be the only one unaffected. What is happening to the townsfolk? Who is the mysterious young woman he keeps seeing? Why isn''t he affected?', 'A man and his wife stumble upon a town whose inhabitants turn into zombies and head for the edge of town every night... he seems to be the only one unaffected. What is happening to the townsfolk? Who is the mysterious young woman he keeps seeing? Why isn''t he affected?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdLClFDcu0Bvm0x0Zh7Ty3pAEVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217085'),
  ('887541173369573218', 'Night Stage', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Suspense', 'Marcio Reolon, Filipe Matzembacher, Luciana Baseggio', 'Marcio Reolon, Filipe Matzembacher', 'Gabriel Faryas, Cirillo Luna, Henrique Barreira, Ivo Müller, Larissa Sanguiné', 'Not Rated', 'An ambitious actor and a successful politician start a secret affair, and together they discover their fetish for having sex in public places. The closer they get to their dream of fame, the more they feel the urge to put themselves at risk.', 'An ambitious actor and a successful politician start a secret affair, and together they discover their fetish for having sex in public places. The closer they get to their dream of fame, the more they feel the urge to put themselves at risk.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F6%2Fgracenote%2F6a8027c09582553c01a72ec50ced22a1.jpg', 'plex:movie:night-stage'),
  ('342519463327822592', 'Night Sun', 1990, 'Drama', 'Paolo Taviani, Vittorio Taviani, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Tonino Guerra, Vittorio Taviani, Paolo Taviani', 'Julian Sands, Nastassja Kinski, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Rüdiger Vogler, Massimo Bonetti, Sonia Gessner, Riccardo Parisio Perrotti, Margarita Lozano', null, 'Based on Leo Tolstoy''s novel, Father Sergius, Night Sun stars Julian Sands as Sergio, a nobleman in 18th-century Italy who is expected to marry a duchess, Nastassja Kinski. Upon learning that she was previously the King''s mistress, Sergio turns his back on society and becomes a monk. While at the hermitage he tries to resist all sexual temptations before him and soon becomes known as a miracle worker. Eventually he succumbs to a young seductress and knowing he is undeserving of the adulation, leaves the hermitage to travel around as a homeless beggar.', 'Based on Leo Tolstoy''s novel, Father Sergius, Night Sun stars Julian Sands as Sergio, a nobleman in 18th-century Italy who is expected to marry a duchess, Nastassja Kinski. Upon learning that she was previously the King''s mistress, Sergio turns his back on society and becomes a monk. While at the hermitage he tries to resist all sexual temptations before him and soon becomes known as a miracle worker. Eventually he succumbs to a young seductress and knowing he is undeserving of the adulation, leaves the hermitage to travel around as a homeless beggar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aeuSwFFIgeydJ63lcTkdGVFQd9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47223'),
  ('944963371866438210', 'Night Swim', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Charlie Sarroff, Phil DeSanti, James Moran', 'Bryce McGuire', 'Wyatt Russell, Kerry Condon, Amélie Hoeferle, Gavin Warren, Nancy Lenehan, Ellie Araiza, Rahnuma Panthaky, Eddie Martinez', 'PG-13', 'Forced into early retirement by a degenerative illness, former baseball player Ray Waller moves into a new house with his wife and two children. He hopes that the backyard swimming pool will be fun for the kids and provide physical therapy for himself. However, a dark secret from the home''s past soon unleashes a malevolent force that drags the family into the depths of inescapable terror.', 'Forced into early retirement by a degenerative illness, former baseball player Ray Waller moves into a new house with his wife and two children. He hopes that the backyard swimming pool will be fun for the kids and provide physical therapy for himself. However, a dark secret from the home''s past soon unleashes a malevolent force that drags the family into the depths of inescapable terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSkfBGdxdialBMM7P02V4hcI6Ij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1072342'),
  ('238780916901889509', 'Night Teeth', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller, Action', 'Eben Bolter, Adam Randall', 'Brent Dillon', 'Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Debby Ryan, Lucy Fry, Raúl Castillo, Alfie Allen, Sydney Sweeney, Megan Fox, Alexander Ludwig', 'R', 'A college student moonlighting as a chauffeur picks up two mysterious women for a night of party-hopping across LA. But when he uncovers their bloodthirsty intentions—and their dangerous, shadowy underworld—he must fight to stay alive.', 'A college student moonlighting as a chauffeur picks up two mysterious women for a night of party-hopping across LA. But when he uncovers their bloodthirsty intentions—and their dangerous, shadowy underworld—he must fight to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i8SJSdjAqd6PI5lPxhPaYKhUU3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669671'),
  ('761228174283360545', 'Night Terror', 1977, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'E.W. Swackhamer, Frank Beascoechea, Vilis Lapenieks', 'Carl Gabler, Richard DeNeut', 'Valerie Harper, Richard Romanus, Nicholas Pryor, John Quade, Michael Tolan, Beatrice Manley, Quinn Cummings, Damon Bradley Raskin', null, 'A housewife flees from a policeman''s killer on the road between Phoenix and Denver.', 'A housewife flees from a policeman''s killer on the road between Phoenix and Denver.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQ2iiR1PqGbiFCEk7pO3RI7eUQV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106284'),
  ('570667536679242109', 'Night Terrors', 1993, 'Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Amnon Salomon', 'Rom Globus, Daniel Matmor', 'Robert Englund, Zoe Trilling, Chandra West, Alona Kimhi, Juliano Mer-Khamis, William Finley, Irit Sheleg, Niv Cohen', null, 'A woman visiting her father in Egypt becomes involved with the Marquis de Sade''s descendant and his terrifying cult.', 'A woman visiting her father in Egypt becomes involved with the Marquis de Sade''s descendant and his terrifying cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SJy6LdrlsxIE91ZGG1dFuzmRFg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78247'),
  ('324288076231085817', 'Night Tide', 1961, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance, Horror', 'Vilis Lapenieks, Curtis Harrington, Floyd Crosby', 'Curtis Harrington', 'Dennis Hopper, Linda Lawson, Gavin Muir, Luana Anders, Marjorie Eaton, Tom Dillon, H.E. West, Marjorie Cameron', 'NR', 'A young sailor falls in love with a mysterious woman performing as a mermaid on the local pier. As they become entwined, he comes to suspect the woman might be a real mermaid who lures men to a watery death during the full moon. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2007.', 'A young sailor falls in love with a mysterious woman performing as a mermaid on the local pier. As they become entwined, he comes to suspect the woman might be a real mermaid who lures men to a watery death during the full moon. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 2007.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd8pTcZQNRBFrShJoCQUWnJxmZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38775'),
  ('1094389168624279001', 'Night Train', 1959, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jerzy Kawalerowicz, Mieczysław Waśkowski, Anita Janeczkowa', 'Jerzy Kawalerowicz, Jerzy Lutowski', 'Lucyna Winnicka, Leon Niemczyk, Teresa Szmigielówna, Zbigniew Cybulski, Helena Dąbrowska, Ignacy Machowski, Roland Głowacki, Aleksander Sewruk', null, 'Two strangers, Jerzy and Marta, accidentally end up holding tickets for the same sleeping chamber on an overnight train to the Baltic Sea coast. Also on board is Marta''s spurned lover, who will not leave her alone. When the police enter the train in search of a murderer on the lam, rumors fly and everything seems to point toward one of the main characters as the culprit.', 'Two strangers, Jerzy and Marta, accidentally end up holding tickets for the same sleeping chamber on an overnight train to the Baltic Sea coast. Also on board is Marta''s spurned lover, who will not leave her alone. When the police enter the train in search of a murderer on the lam, rumors fly and everything seems to point toward one of the main characters as the culprit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXGYPncEtLSBOO3fdHSmqofwLCU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38898'),
  ('949787109636601403', 'Night Train', 2007, 'Drama', 'Diao Yinan, Dong Jinsong', 'Diao Yinan', 'Liu Dan, Qi Dao, Xu Wei, Wu Yuxi, Meng Haiyan, Wang Zhengjia, Rongcai Fu, Chao Ji', null, 'Wu Hongyan is a female bailiff in a regional court in West China dealing with women awaiting execution—more often than not, sentenced for crimes of passion. Every weekend, without much luck, she looks for love at the Good Luck Matchmaking dance, until she meets the husband of one of her prisoners.', 'Wu Hongyan is a female bailiff in a regional court in West China dealing with women awaiting execution—more often than not, sentenced for crimes of passion. Every weekend, without much luck, she looks for love at the Good Luck Matchmaking dance, until she meets the husband of one of her prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJGvDuYppSbdvjKL7UzEiOe93sz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17342'),
  ('677626211431825643', 'Night Train', 2009, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Brian King, Christopher Popp', 'Brian King', 'Danny Glover, Steve Zahn, Leelee Sobieski, Geoff Bell, Matthias Schweighöfer, Togo Igawa, Richard O''Brien, Constantine Gregory', 'R', 'Two Passengers and the conductor discover that a person has passed away on their Night Train cabin. They come across valuable diamonds on his person, that they decide to keep for themselves...', 'Two Passengers and the conductor discover that a person has passed away on their Night Train cabin. They come across valuable diamonds on his person, that they decide to keep for themselves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HD6zcvzQqc3xQtRm1NULuIHFYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14549'),
  ('208710485511264203', 'Night Train', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Joel Layogan, Shane Stanley', 'CJ Walley', 'Danielle Chuchran, Diora Baird, Joe Lando, Abraham Benrubi, Joseph D. Reitman, Ivan Sergei, Brent Bailey, Kevin Joy', 'PG-13', 'Mother Holly McCord is driven to extremes to save the life of her young son. Even if it means hauling black market drugs in her souped-up truck, with the Feds in hot pursuit. With two bounties on her head and her son’s life on the line, Holly climbs behind the wheel of “Night Train,” ready to outrun, out gun, and outlast them all.', 'Mother Holly McCord is driven to extremes to save the life of her young son. Even if it means hauling black market drugs in her souped-up truck, with the Feds in hot pursuit. With two bounties on her head and her son’s life on the line, Holly climbs behind the wheel of “Night Train,” ready to outrun, out gun, and outlast them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZFSc3BqUyAvuakHSs7qaWJZnGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007427'),
  ('125600170515996484', 'Night Train to Lisbon', 2013, 'Mystery, Romance, Thriller', 'Bille August, Filip Zumbrunn', 'Greg Latter, Ulrich Herrmann', 'Jeremy Irons, Mélanie Laurent, Jack Huston, Martina Gedeck, Tom Courtenay, August Diehl, Bruno Ganz, Lena Olin', 'R', 'Raimund Gregorius, having saved a beautiful Portuguese woman from leaping to her death, stumbles upon a mesmerizing book by a Portuguese author, which compels him to suddenly abandon the boring life he has led for years and to embark on an enthralling adventure. In search of the author, Gregorius acts as detective, pulling together pieces of a puzzle that involves political and emotional intrigue and the highest possible stakes. His voyage is one that transcends time and space, delving into the realms of history, medicine and love, all in search of true meaning to his life.', 'Raimund Gregorius, having saved a beautiful Portuguese woman from leaping to her death, stumbles upon a mesmerizing book by a Portuguese author, which compels him to suddenly abandon the boring life he has led for years and to embark on an enthralling adventure. In search of the author, Gregorius acts as detective, pulling together pieces of a puzzle that involves political and emotional intrigue and the highest possible stakes. His voyage is one that transcends time and space, delving into the realms of history, medicine and love, all in search of true meaning to his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vrOC9TUgXOrXMBicEoxFXSutvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160139'),
  ('1069466475625573300', 'Night Train to Munich', 1940, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'Carol Reed, Otto Kanturek, Roy Ward Baker', 'Sidney Gilliat, Frank Launder', 'Margaret Lockwood, Rex Harrison, Paul Henreid, Basil Radford, Naunton Wayne, James Harcourt, Felix Aylmer, Wyndham Goldie', 'NR', 'Czechoslovakia, March 1939, on the eve of World War II. As the German invaders occupy Prague, inventor Axel Bomasch manages to flee and reach England; but those who need to put his knowledge at the service of the Nazi war machine, in order to carry out their evil plans of destruction, will stop at nothing to capture him.', 'Czechoslovakia, March 1939, on the eve of World War II. As the German invaders occupy Prague, inventor Axel Bomasch manages to flee and reach England; but those who need to put his knowledge at the service of the Nazi war machine, in order to carry out their evil plans of destruction, will stop at nothing to capture him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fi6Vh72FSrps1eqKG0zj5DIv190.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41597'),
  ('917170015498708883', 'Night Train to Paris', 1964, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Douglas, Arthur Lavis', 'Harry Spalding', 'Leslie Nielsen, Aliza Gur, Dorinda Stevens, Eric Pohlmann, Edina Ronay, André Maranne, Jennifer White, Cyril Raymond', null, 'Former OSS officer Alan Holiday, now living in London, is visited on New Year''s Eve by Catherine Carrel who says she is a close friend of Jules Lemoine who served with Holiday during the war. Lemoine urgently requests that Holiday go to Paris on a secret mission. Lemoine visits and wants Alan to deliver a reel of tape which he gives him, and keeps a fake reel himself to deceive enemy agents. Lemoine is killed and the fake tape stolen. Holiday, poses as an assistant to photographer Louis Vernay, and they take three models along to further the ruse.', 'Former OSS officer Alan Holiday, now living in London, is visited on New Year''s Eve by Catherine Carrel who says she is a close friend of Jules Lemoine who served with Holiday during the war. Lemoine urgently requests that Holiday go to Paris on a secret mission. Lemoine visits and wants Alan to deliver a reel of tape which he gives him, and keeps a fake reel himself to deceive enemy agents. Lemoine is killed and the fake tape stolen. Holiday, poses as an assistant to photographer Louis Vernay, and they take three models along to further the ruse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nyHDAgpwJzYIzPRYHUWDGW2p5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262509'),
  ('552329250499640411', 'Night Train to Venice', 1996, 'Thriller, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Armando Nannuzzi, Carlo U. Quinterio', 'Toni Hirtreiter, Leo Tichat', 'Hugh Grant, Tahnee Welch, Malcolm McDowell, Kristina Söderbaum, Rachel Rice, Evelyn Opela, Samy Langs, Murphy McLaren', null, 'The Orient Express, on its night trip from Munich to Venice, is full because of the beginning of the carnival in Venice. Between the passengers are a young writer, an actress, and her daughter, an elderly dancer, five neo-nazi punks, and a strange man that seems to have some kind of influence over them through their dreams.', 'The Orient Express, on its night trip from Munich to Venice, is full because of the beginning of the carnival in Venice. Between the passengers are a young writer, an actress, and her daughter, an elderly dancer, five neo-nazi punks, and a strange man that seems to have some kind of influence over them through their dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWSgspSR2hUapwXqKgWwk3CpHH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78051'),
  ('7680308859795302', 'Night Trap', 1993, 'Thriller, Horror', 'David A. Prior, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'David A. Prior', 'Robert Davi, Michael Ironside, Mike Starr, Lesley-Anne Down, Lydie Denier, Margaret Avery, John Amos, Mickey Jones', 'R', 'A New Orleans cop tries to track down and stop a vicious and demonic killer whom has sold his soul to the devil for invulnerability and immortality.', 'A New Orleans cop tries to track down and stop a vicious and demonic killer whom has sold his soul to the devil for invulnerability and immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCmvKXAOECLaCxzzXZVyMx1Ogvo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322505'),
  ('100459771571559163', 'Night Trip', 1982, 'Drama', 'Nick van den Boezem', 'Marc Fiolet', 'Tim Beekman, Peter Broekaert, Abel Claassen, Cox Habbema, Mies de Heer, Cees Heyne, Marnix Kappers', null, '12-year-old Thomas takes rowing lessons and grows rather fond of his teacher. He idolizes his trainer – and when the boy discovers that the person he felt such a love for lied to him in order to sleep with his mother – his heart is broken. It''s hard for him to understand why his trainer would prefer to be intimate with his mother than to be with him.', '12-year-old Thomas takes rowing lessons and grows rather fond of his teacher. He idolizes his trainer – and when the boy discovers that the person he felt such a love for lied to him in order to sleep with his mother – his heart is broken. It''s hard for him to understand why his trainer would prefer to be intimate with his mother than to be with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzDujowkBmjqUDF8mYlZ1NglMkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134226'),
  ('1048155091615423355', 'Night Vision', 1997, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Gil Bettman, Trey Smith', 'Michael Thomas Montgomery', 'Fred Williamson, Cynthia Rothrock, Robert Forster, Frank Pesce, Amanda Welles, Willie Gault, Bushwick Bill, Rodger Boyce', null, 'A psycho serial killer who videotapes each of his bloody conquests is on the loose, and it''s up to alcoholic motorcycle cop Dak and his new tough-as-nails partner, Kristen, to bring him to justice. But as the body count increases, so does the danger.', 'A psycho serial killer who videotapes each of his bloody conquests is on the loose, and it''s up to alcoholic motorcycle cop Dak and his new tough-as-nails partner, Kristen, to bring him to justice. But as the body count increases, so does the danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udMCiuFs5uwDTxh9wNCaxyNO8Ja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239350'),
  ('984575154432874733', 'Night Visions', 1990, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Wes Craven, Peter Stein', 'Wes Craven, Thomas Baum', 'James Remar, Loryn Locklin, Penny Johnson Jerald, Mitch Pileggi, Francis X. McCarthy, Jon Tenney, Bruce MacVittie, Angela Alvarado', null, 'A Los Angeles detective teams up with a psychic to hunt down a serial killer.', 'A Los Angeles detective teams up with a psychic to hunt down a serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDiQRWawE9RiYOL1cc9gg1hhKAc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111835'),
  ('643744641950175637', 'Night Visitor', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rupert Hitzig', 'Randal Viscovich', 'Derek Rydall, Allen Garfield, Kathleen Bailey, Jovanni Brascia, Brooke Bundy, Ann Dane, Scott Fults, Henry Gibson', null, 'A teenager insists he saw a satanist kill the call girl next door, and tries to prove it.', 'A teenager insists he saw a satanist kill the call girl next door, and tries to prove it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xi7yGnDksIf0Kiu8xfqCITJLU93.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89535'),
  ('952736294783958531', 'Night Watch', 1973, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'Brian G. Hutton, Billy Williams', 'Tony Williamson, Evan Jones', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Laurence Harvey, Billie Whitelaw, Robert Lang, Tony Britton, Bill Dean, Michael Danvers-Walker, Rosario Serrano', 'PG', 'A woman recovering from a nervous breakdown tries to convince her husband and and the local London police that she has witnessed a murder in the abandoned house next door.', 'A woman recovering from a nervous breakdown tries to convince her husband and and the local London police that she has witnessed a murder in the abandoned house next door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuWf1nMHYkKegwJB0iOzbPuiKkO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40387'),
  ('988493046885555080', 'Night Watch', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, TV Movie', 'David Jackson, Michael Negrin', 'David Jackson', 'Pierce Brosnan, Alexandra Paul, William Devane, Lim Kay Siu, Michael Shannon, Irene Ng, Hidde Maas, Tom Jansen', 'R', 'UN agents Mike Graham and Sabrina Carver are sent by their director Nick Caldwell to investigate the theft of Rembrandt''s painting, "The Night Watch". The trail takes them from Amsterdam to Hong Kong and involves them in not only art theft and forgery, but the high-tech schemes of Martin Schraeder and his Korean cohort Mao Yixin', 'UN agents Mike Graham and Sabrina Carver are sent by their director Nick Caldwell to investigate the theft of Rembrandt''s painting, "The Night Watch". The trail takes them from Amsterdam to Hong Kong and involves them in not only art theft and forgery, but the high-tech schemes of Martin Schraeder and his Korean cohort Mao Yixin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B3RWyjuiMcug49aw65h0F6wjDQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38651'),
  ('1144144578829801061', 'Night Watch', 2004, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller', 'Sergey Trofimov, Timur Bekmambetov, Pavel Perepyolkin', 'Timur Bekmambetov', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Vladimir Menshov, Galina Tyunina, Mariya Poroshina, Zhanna Friske, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Rimma Markova, Mariya Mironova', 'R', 'Among normal humans live the "Others" possessing various supernatural powers. They are divided up into the forces of light and the forces of the dark, who signed a truce several centuries ago to end a devastating battle. Ever since, the forces of light govern the day while the night belongs to their dark opponents. In modern day Moscow the dark Others actually roam the night as vampires while a "Night Watch" of light forces, among them Anton, the movie''s protagonist, try to control them and limit their outrage', 'Among normal humans live the "Others" possessing various supernatural powers. They are divided up into the forces of light and the forces of the dark, who signed a truce several centuries ago to end a devastating battle. Ever since, the forces of light govern the day while the night belongs to their dark opponents. In modern day Moscow the dark Others actually roam the night as vampires while a "Night Watch" of light forces, among them Anton, the movie''s protagonist, try to control them and limit their outrage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWdfItjr9tZtsSgjkqB8YhORF8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3040'),
  ('6992333556453739', 'Night Watch', 2005, 'Drama', 'Edgardo Cozarinsky, Javier Miquelez', 'Edgardo Cozarinsky', 'Gonzalo Heredia, Mariana Anghileri, Rafael Ferro, Darío Tripicchio, Gregory Dayton, Susana Varela, Jana Boková, Diego Cunill', 'R', 'A long night''s journey into day: Victor, a street hustler in the Santa Fe and Pueyrredón neighborhoods of Buenos Aires, from the evening of November 1, All Saints Day, to the dawn of November 2, All Souls Day. Victor''s odyssey takes him from clients to friends to a gay gym then a hotel room and an all-night café. He plays pick-up soccer with kids whose parents are going through trash or waiting in parks. A vendor gives him a chrysanthemum. It seems he''s being followed, and on the night streets, death is close at hand. Can Victor survive until dawn?', 'A long night''s journey into day: Victor, a street hustler in the Santa Fe and Pueyrredón neighborhoods of Buenos Aires, from the evening of November 1, All Saints Day, to the dawn of November 2, All Souls Day. Victor''s odyssey takes him from clients to friends to a gay gym then a hotel room and an all-night café. He plays pick-up soccer with kids whose parents are going through trash or waiting in parks. A vendor gives him a chrysanthemum. It seems he''s being followed, and on the night streets, death is close at hand. Can Victor survive until dawn?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtgdwlqLW2agtAHnkkzOCeceDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41924'),
  ('935238605748455801', 'Night Will Fall', 2014, 'Documentary', 'André Singer', 'Lynette Singer', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Jasper Britton, Toby Haggith, Richard Dimbleby, Winston Churchill, Alfred Hitchcock, Sidney Bernstein', 'NR', 'When Allied forces liberated the Nazi concentration camps in 1944-45, their terrible discoveries were recorded by army and newsreel cameramen, revealing for the first time the full horror of what had happened. Making use of British, Soviet and American footage, the Ministry of Information’s Sidney Bernstein (later founder of Granada Television) aimed to create a documentary that would provide lasting, undeniable evidence of the Nazis’ unspeakable crimes. He commissioned a wealth of British talent, including editor Stewart McAllister, writer and future cabinet minister Richard Crossman – and, as treatment advisor, his friend Alfred Hitchcock. Yet, despite initial support from the British and US Governments, the film was shelved, and only now, 70 years on, has it been restored and completed by Imperial War Museums under its original title "German Concentration Camps Factual Survey".', 'When Allied forces liberated the Nazi concentration camps in 1944-45, their terrible discoveries were recorded by army and newsreel cameramen, revealing for the first time the full horror of what had happened. Making use of British, Soviet and American footage, the Ministry of Information’s Sidney Bernstein (later founder of Granada Television) aimed to create a documentary that would provide lasting, undeniable evidence of the Nazis’ unspeakable crimes. He commissioned a wealth of British talent, including editor Stewart McAllister, writer and future cabinet minister Richard Crossman – and, as treatment advisor, his friend Alfred Hitchcock. Yet, despite initial support from the British and US Governments, the film was shelved, and only now, 70 years on, has it been restored and completed by Imperial War Museums under its original title "German Concentration Camps Factual Survey".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEsfJbN5BBw1wlqCvzxuBLGwitt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290802'),
  ('897159983956953665', 'Night Without Sleep', 1952, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Roy Ward Baker, Lucien Ballard, Lionel Newman', 'Frank Partos', 'Gary Merrill, Linda Darnell, Hildegard Knef, Joyce Mackenzie, June Vincent, Donald Randolph, Hugh Beaumont, Mae Marsh', null, 'Upon awaking in the morning, a man finds his thoughts clouded by the possibility that he committed a murder.', 'Upon awaking in the morning, a man finds his thoughts clouded by the possibility that he committed a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tJ36codDm1DixT8DL23zYCppl4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4459'),
  ('451580925850825604', 'Night World', 1932, 'Drama', 'Hobart Henley, Merritt B. Gerstad', 'Richard Schayer', 'Lew Ayres, Mae Clarke, Boris Karloff, Dorothy Revier, Russell Hopton, Hedda Hopper, Clarence Muse, Dorothy Peterson', 'NR', '"Happy" MacDonald and his unfaithful wife own a Prohibition era night club. On this eventful night, he is threatened by bootleggers, and the club''s star dancer falls in love with a young socialite who drinks to forget a personal tragedy, among other incidents.', '"Happy" MacDonald and his unfaithful wife own a Prohibition era night club. On this eventful night, he is threatened by bootleggers, and the club''s star dancer falls in love with a young socialite who drinks to forget a personal tragedy, among other incidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DjPYMkXA1hxRO65IpzfKZmXoIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266279'),
  ('663678335450000455', 'Night Zoo', 1987, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jean-Claude Lauzon, Guy Dufaux', 'Jean-Claude Lauzon', 'Gilles Maheu, Roger Le Bel, Lynne Adams, Lorne Brass, Germain Houde, Corrado Mastropasqua, Jerry Snell, Denys Arcand', null, 'Marcel, recently released from prison, attempt to rebuild his relationship with his girlfriend Julie (now a prostitute) and especially his father Albert (who thinks he''s been away on a long trip abroad), while being pursued by two corrupt cops (one of whom bears a longstanding grudge against him) for drug money he''s alleged to possess.', 'Marcel, recently released from prison, attempt to rebuild his relationship with his girlfriend Julie (now a prostitute) and especially his father Albert (who thinks he''s been away on a long trip abroad), while being pursued by two corrupt cops (one of whom bears a longstanding grudge against him) for drug money he''s alleged to possess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7WEZTqguGWRDEmUR3IXyiOoYK0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106630'),
  ('299631116793427677', 'Night''s End', 2022, 'Horror', 'Jennifer Reeder', 'Brett Neveu', 'Geno Walker, Kate Arrington, Felonious Munk, Michael Shannon, Lawrence Grimm, Daniel Kyri, Theo Germaine, Morgan S. Reesh', 'NR', 'An anxious shut-in unwittingly moves into a haunted apartment and hires a mysterious stranger to perform an exorcism which takes a horrific turn.', 'An anxious shut-in unwittingly moves into a haunted apartment and hires a mysterious stranger to perform an exorcism which takes a horrific turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxu7T1zFeVEUDcbhk3sOkLYa2CR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933908'),
  ('123082635572638687', 'Night''s Tightrope', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Yukiko Mishima, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Kana Matsui, Yukiko Mishima', 'Tsubasa Honda, Mizuki Yamamoto, Mackenyu, Goro Inagaki, Ryo Sato, Kazuya Kojima, Fusako Urabe, Shizuka Ishibashi', null, 'Yuki is a 2nd year high school student. She volunteers at a paediatrics ward for her summer vacation, because she wants to witness the moment a person dies. She got that thought after feeling envious of a transfer student''s story of seeing a friend''s dead body. Yuki has friend named Atsuko. She was bullied in the past and has anxiety issues. She volunteers at a nursing home for her summer vacation, hoping that she will gain courage if she sees the moment a person dies.', 'Yuki is a 2nd year high school student. She volunteers at a paediatrics ward for her summer vacation, because she wants to witness the moment a person dies. She got that thought after feeling envious of a transfer student''s story of seeing a friend''s dead body. Yuki has friend named Atsuko. She was bullied in the past and has anxiety issues. She volunteers at a nursing home for her summer vacation, hoping that she will gain courage if she sees the moment a person dies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1oxdNR5Qk7sQKV8VFQSSnerQqh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392882'),
  ('911486294037374573', 'Nightalk', 2022, 'Thriller, Romance, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Donald Shebib, Gregory Bennett', 'Claude Harz, Donald Shebib', 'Ashley Bryant, Al Mukadam, Ted Hallett, Art Hindle, Emily Andrews, Kent Sheridan, Rena Polley, William Poulin', null, 'A female cop goes undercover on a phone-sex app to solve a murder investigation as she risks becoming the killer''s next victim.', 'A female cop goes undercover on a phone-sex app to solve a murder investigation as she risks becoming the killer''s next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irCAwc1BoBtY0qTtG9nuRMgwdcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013910'),
  ('242908639199648840', 'Nightbeast', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Dohler, Richard Geiwitz, Tony Malanowski', 'Don Dohler', 'Tom Griffith, Jamie Zemarel, Karin Kardian, George Stover, Don Leifert, Anne Frith, Eleanor Herman, Richard Dyszel', 'R', 'A creature from outer space, nightbeast, crash lands in Baltimore and starts a killing spree that quickly escelates.', 'A creature from outer space, nightbeast, crash lands in Baltimore and starts a killing spree that quickly escelates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96rfNcCELHP1hKNtI5zQy21dwZO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66881'),
  ('54352083036414498', 'Nightbirds', 1970, 'Drama', 'Andy Milligan, Andy Milligan', 'Andy Milligan', 'Berwick Kaler, Julie Shaw, Elaine Shore, Bill Clancy, Bay White, Johnathan Borkai, Felicity Sentance, Susan Joyce', null, 'While living rough on the streets of London''s East End, a young man named Dink encounters the mysterious Dee and they begin a relationship. When tenderness gives way to cruelty, they become consumed by darkness.', 'While living rough on the streets of London''s East End, a young man named Dink encounters the mysterious Dee and they begin a relationship. When tenderness gives way to cruelty, they become consumed by darkness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/EL6FvaYrIrtJldQp2SMZENHIhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106871'),
