  ('724642108406471342', 'Nightmare', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ahn Byeong-ki, Lee Seok-hyun, Choi Sung-won', 'Ahn Byeong-ki', 'Choi Jung-yoon, Ha Ji-won, Yoo Ji-tae, Yu Jun-sang, Kim Gyu-ri, Jung Jun, Jo Hye-yeong, Su-jin Jang', null, 'Hye-jin''s homecoming should have been a joyous occasion. She was especially happy to see her childhood friend again, the shy Eun-ju. However, when a secret is revealed, harsh words are exchanged. These words deeply affect Eun-ju and,in the next scene, we see her plummeting from a 30-story building. In a flashback provided by Seon-ae, we learn that the ghost of Eun-ju is hunting down all of Hye-jin''s friends and killing them. Is this possible or is a more worldly force at work? What is this mysterious tape that everyone is asking about?', 'Hye-jin''s homecoming should have been a joyous occasion. She was especially happy to see her childhood friend again, the shy Eun-ju. However, when a secret is revealed, harsh words are exchanged. These words deeply affect Eun-ju and,in the next scene, we see her plummeting from a 30-story building. In a flashback provided by Seon-ae, we learn that the ghost of Eun-ju is hunting down all of Hye-jin''s friends and killing them. Is this possible or is a more worldly force at work? What is this mysterious tape that everyone is asking about?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pddhGTJzA2GVaHv1Ol1GUsgGT0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39498'),
