  ('306650378116026977', 'Nightmare Cinema', 2018, 'Horror', 'Mick Garris, Alejandro Brugués, Ryuhei Kitamura', 'Sandra Becerril, Alejandro Brugués, Lawrence C. Connolly', 'Mickey Rourke, Sarah Elizabeth Withers, Elizabeth Reaser, Zarah Mahler, Faly Rakotohavana, Maurice Benard, Mariela Garriga, Mark Grossman', 'R', 'A series of down-on-their-luck individuals enter the decrepit and spine-chilling Rialto theater, only to have their deepest and darkest fears brought to life on the silver screen by The Projectionist – a mysterious, ghostly figure who holds the nightmarish futures of all who attend his screenings.', 'A series of down-on-their-luck individuals enter the decrepit and spine-chilling Rialto theater, only to have their deepest and darkest fears brought to life on the silver screen by The Projectionist – a mysterious, ghostly figure who holds the nightmarish futures of all who attend his screenings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ftdhL4zamDnjSD4TML1ES79DueX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480100'),
  ('776575482617140009', 'Nightmare City', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Riccardo Petrazzi, Hans Burmann, Umberto Lenzi', 'Piero Regnoli, Luis María Delgado, Antonio Cesare Corti', 'Hugo Stiglitz, Laura Trotter, Maria Rosaria Omaggio, Francisco Rabal, Sonia Viviani, Eduardo Fajardo, Stefania D''Amario, Ugo Bologna', 'R', 'In a nameless European city, a local reporter and his doctor wife try to escape from hordes of blood thirsty zombies, undead people exposed to nuclear radioactivity, while the military leaders fight a losing war of attrition against the relentless atomic zombies.', 'In a nameless European city, a local reporter and his doctor wife try to escape from hordes of blood thirsty zombies, undead people exposed to nuclear radioactivity, while the military leaders fight a losing war of attrition against the relentless atomic zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbOkO2kxxfISyBWPCSKsVJS0MFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28319'),
  ('226359813964768650', 'Nightmare Detective', 2007, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shinya Tsukamoto, Takayuki Shida', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Hisakatsu Kuroki', 'Ryuhei Matsuda, Hitomi, Masanobu Ando, Yoshio Harada, Shinya Tsukamoto, Ren Osugi, Kôji Tsukamoto', null, 'When a number of suicide victims slash themselves in their sleep, detective Keiko Kirishima is called to investigate.', 'When a number of suicide victims slash themselves in their sleep, detective Keiko Kirishima is called to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thfveexklQEuFf0X9Y1MGYYkr3l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43713'),
