  ('59353678567440056', 'Nightmare in Badham County', 1976, 'Drama, Action, TV Movie, Crime, Thriller', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Don Goldman, Frank Stanley', 'Jo Heims', 'Deborah Raffin, Lynne Moody, Chuck Connors, Fionnula Flanagan, Tina Louise, Robert Reed, Della Reese, Lana Wood', 'R', 'Two UCLA coeds have engine trouble in small Southern town. When they spurn the local sheriff''s advances he arranges for them to be taken to the women''s prison on trivial charges (the judge is a cousin), where they must endure atrocities at the hands of the administrators of the prison and the prison guards.', 'Two UCLA coeds have engine trouble in small Southern town. When they spurn the local sheriff''s advances he arranges for them to be taken to the women''s prison on trivial charges (the judge is a cousin), where they must endure atrocities at the hands of the administrators of the prison and the prison guards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c1xnZmU1NgIAAdIOlEJ49rPK9p8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98134'),
  ('907987267706696818', 'Nightmare in Wax', 1969, 'Horror', 'Bud Townsend, Glen R. Smith', 'Rex Carlton', 'Cameron Mitchell, Anne Helm, Scott Brady, Berry Kroeger, Victoria Carroll, Phillip Baird, John "Bud" Cardos, Virgil Frye', 'R', 'The disfigured curator of a wax museum murders his enemies and then uses their bodies as exhibits in his museum.', 'The disfigured curator of a wax museum murders his enemies and then uses their bodies as exhibits in his museum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVUveholmPpHpZbBfUaWTGqRkiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27496'),
  ('432136417043228619', 'Nightmare Man', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Rolfe Kanefsky, Paul Deng', 'Rolfe Kanefsky', 'Tiffany Shepis, Blythe Metz, Luciano Szafir, Aaron Sherry, Jack Sway, James Ferris, Richard Moll, Robert Donavan', 'R', 'Ellen receives an exotic mask by mistake and begins to have waking nightmares and hallucinations. Her husband and doctors believe she is a paranoid schizophrenic and take her to a psychiatric ward. On the way to the hospital the car breaks down, her husband rushes off to get gas, and the Nightmare Man appears. Ellen escapes and stumbles upon a country house where two young couples are spending the weekend. They do not know if the killer is real or just a figment of Ellen''s tortured mind nor if the killer is outside or already inside the house.', 'Ellen receives an exotic mask by mistake and begins to have waking nightmares and hallucinations. Her husband and doctors believe she is a paranoid schizophrenic and take her to a psychiatric ward. On the way to the hospital the car breaks down, her husband rushes off to get gas, and the Nightmare Man appears. Ellen escapes and stumbles upon a country house where two young couples are spending the weekend. They do not know if the killer is real or just a figment of Ellen''s tortured mind nor if the killer is outside or already inside the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRHFRKWF7Q2fqOp439iMyecfcCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24409'),
  ('120821401174327667', 'Nightmare on the 13th Floor', 1990, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Walter Grauman, Tom Richmond', 'J.D. Feigelson, Dan DiStefano', 'Michele Greene, John Karlen, Louise Fletcher, James Brolin, Alan Fudge, Terri Treas, Alan Haufrect, Juliana Donald', 'PG-13', 'In this made-for-cable television horror thriller, a travel writer visits a historic hotel to write a story about it and inadvertently finds herself on the 13th floor where she witnesses a Satanic rite and tangles with an axe-wielding killer. She escapes, but no one believes her story because the hotel has no 13th floor.', 'In this made-for-cable television horror thriller, a travel writer visits a historic hotel to write a story about it and inadvertently finds herself on the 13th floor where she witnesses a Satanic rite and tangles with an axe-wielding killer. She escapes, but no one believes her story because the hotel has no 13th floor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r60QI9Cd1QlZ1Dp8dwZSMS5KKXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115666'),
  ('1042989624882709468', 'Nightmare Radio: The Night Stalker', 2023, 'Horror', 'Carlos Goitia, Ryan J. Thompson, Lorcan Finnegan', 'Camilo Zaffora, Taz Pereyra', 'Paula Brasca, Agustin Olcese, Valeria San Martin, Michael Lorz, Sean Weil, Nancy Nagrant, Pooya Mohseni, Marie Ruane', null, 'A late-night radio DJ with a program where people call to tell her real horror stories, soon will find out how far an obsessed fan is willing to go.', 'A late-night radio DJ with a program where people call to tell her real horror stories, soon will find out how far an obsessed fan is willing to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/safosm5GTGKpJQxudigMv8HOIwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035798'),
