  ('190815804229589314', 'Nightmare Weekend', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Henri Sala, Robert M. Baldwin, Denis Gheerbrant', 'George Faget-Benard', 'Debbie Laster, Dale Midkiff, Debra Hunter, Andrea Thompson, Robert John Burke, Karen Mayo-Chandler, Preston Maybank, Kimberley Stahl', null, 'A female scientist performs experiments on three college girls that turn them into drooling, murderous mutants.', 'A female scientist performs experiments on three college girls that turn them into drooling, murderous mutants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPndIgw2VyGbtVZfGeWV4wDGGnJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119592'),
  ('832892181005974236', 'Nightmares', 1979, 'Drama', 'Wojciech Marczewski, Wiesław Zdort', 'Wojciech Marczewski, Pavel Hajný', 'Piotr Łysak, Tomasz Hudziec, Hanna Skarżanka, Maria Chwalibóg, Teresa Marczewska, Bronisław Pawlik, Janusz Michałowski, Wiktor Sadecki', null, 'Set before the first World War in part of Poland under Austrian occupation, the story of a young boy in primary school who later grows up to become a rebellious, poetic-minded teen in the same school when the national movement toward liberation is under way. The story of a country where church and state work together to suppress the human spirit.', 'Set before the first World War in part of Poland under Austrian occupation, the story of a young boy in primary school who later grows up to become a rebellious, poetic-minded teen in the same school when the national movement toward liberation is under way. The story of a country where church and state work together to suppress the human spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBmzKkglkNsr6VxehZq6D4UFEBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108710'),
  ('311845610788823251', 'Nightmares', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John D. Lamond, Garry Wapshott', 'Colin Eggleston', 'Jenny Neumann, Gary Sweet, Nina Landis, Max Phipps, John-Michael Howson, Edmund Pegge, Sue Jones, Adele Lewin', null, 'A little girl named Cathy tries to keep her mother from making out with a man while driving one day, and she inadvertently causes her mother''s death in the car crash. 16 years later, Cathy has changed her name to Helen and has become a psychotic actress. Things are going fine until horrible things starts to happened with the cast of her new play.', 'A little girl named Cathy tries to keep her mother from making out with a man while driving one day, and she inadvertently causes her mother''s death in the car crash. 16 years later, Cathy has changed her name to Helen and has become a psychotic actress. Things are going fine until horrible things starts to happened with the cast of her new play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/434R1OAMAFX2r6PTcdTgv0Gq79i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85184'),
  ('590931148258050031', 'Nightmares', 1983, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joseph Sargent, Mario DiLeo, Gerald Perry Finnerman', 'Christopher Crowe, Jeffrey Bloom', 'Cristina Raines, Emilio Estevez, Lance Henriksen, Richard Masur, Veronica Cartwright, Moon Unit Zappa, Tony Plana, Joe Lambie', 'R', 'A collection of short stories. In one a woman who leaves her house late at night to drive to the store while a killer is loose encounters some problems. In the second an arcade whiz kid''s obsession with a game leads to deadly consequences. In the third a small town priest loses his faith and decides to leave town, but in the desert is stalked by a mysterious black pick-up truck. In the final story, a family''s problem with a rat is larger than they think.', 'A collection of short stories. In one a woman who leaves her house late at night to drive to the store while a killer is loose encounters some problems. In the second an arcade whiz kid''s obsession with a game leads to deadly consequences. In the third a small town priest loses his faith and decides to leave town, but in the desert is stalked by a mysterious black pick-up truck. In the final story, a family''s problem with a rat is larger than they think.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7spL1SrfmAWQ0O2m2u459WsuSkV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42114'),
  ('139459107661288792', 'Nightmares', 2022, 'Horror', 'Đinh Công Hiếu', null, 'Phương Anh Đào, Quách Ngọc Tuyên, Hiếu Nguyễn, Oanh Kiều, Hoàng Phúc', null, 'A successful young doctor is constantly haunted by nightmares about a mysterious killer who seems to not only be chasing her in her dreams.', 'A successful young doctor is constantly haunted by nightmares about a mysterious killer who seems to not only be chasing her in her dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyVcHgdCqlgv9ZMU1jhTATpvcz5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682201'),
  ('62092807727261407', 'Nightmares Come at Night', 1973, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Jesús Franco, José Climent, Manuel Merino', 'Jesús Franco, Josyane Gibert', 'Diana Lorys, Paul Müller, Jack Taylor, Colette Giacobine, Andrea Montchal, Howard Vernon, Soledad Miranda', null, 'Diana Lorys, Collette Jack and Soledad Miranda star in this sexy thriller about two alluring dancers, Cincia and Anne, who embark on an erotically charged partnership. But when Anne starts to have nightmares that feature her as a murderous killer, she begins to lose her grip on reality. Or is reality merely rearing its ugly head in her dreams? She''s determined find out what''s causing this turmoil before something deadly happens.', 'Diana Lorys, Collette Jack and Soledad Miranda star in this sexy thriller about two alluring dancers, Cincia and Anne, who embark on an erotically charged partnership. But when Anne starts to have nightmares that feature her as a murderous killer, she begins to lose her grip on reality. Or is reality merely rearing its ugly head in her dreams? She''s determined find out what''s causing this turmoil before something deadly happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaeGvGz5bx6LFtvD14OBJ7cuYAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119357'),
  ('373586648735909203', 'Nightmares in Red, White and Blue', 2009, 'Documentary, Horror', 'Andrew Monument, Michael Bratkowski', 'Joseph Maddrey', 'Lance Henriksen, Larry Cohen, Joe Dante, John Carpenter, Darren Lynn Bousman, Mick Garris, Tom McLoughlin, George A. Romero', null, 'An exploration of the appeal of horror films, with interviews of many legendary directors in the genre.', 'An exploration of the appeal of horror films, with interviews of many legendary directors in the genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lI1MdPIr8zghXVGvOX7J2k3YJt5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43065'),
  ('602161249626133345', 'Nightmaster', 1988, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Mark Joffe, Martin McGrath', 'Michael McGennan', 'Tom Jennings, Nicole Kidman, Vince Martin, Joanne Samuel, Jeremy Shadlow, Craig Pearce, Alex Broun, Paul Gleeson', null, 'Robbie and his girlfriend, Amy, are among a group of students who play their private night games in the romantic thriller that catapulted Kidman to center stage. On screen throughout, Kidman discovers what will happen when a friendly game becomes real life ... and real life becomes a deadly game.', 'Robbie and his girlfriend, Amy, are among a group of students who play their private night games in the romantic thriller that catapulted Kidman to center stage. On screen throughout, Kidman discovers what will happen when a friendly game becomes real life ... and real life becomes a deadly game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1ZKwv42jzF6V6vgJQx8kcNrTjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71730'),
  ('900889502429168494', 'Nightride', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama', 'David Bird, Stephen Fingleton', 'Ben Conway', 'Moe Dunford, Joana Ribeiro, Gerard Jordan, Ciaran Flynn, John Travers, Stephen Rea, Andrew Simpson, Ellie O''Halloran', null, 'In this single shot thriller, we''re in the driver''s seat with small-time dealer Budge as he tries to pull one last deal with cash borrowed from a dangerous loan shark. When the handover goes catastrophically wrong, Budge finds himself in a race against time to find his missing product and get a new buyer before the loan shark tracks him down.', 'In this single shot thriller, we''re in the driver''s seat with small-time dealer Budge as he tries to pull one last deal with cash borrowed from a dangerous loan shark. When the handover goes catastrophically wrong, Budge finds himself in a race against time to find his missing product and get a new buyer before the loan shark tracks him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8WILe0aNn4QhiNQA0hIFltuti9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865371'),
  ('1132618563506390173', 'Nights and Days', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Jerzy Antczak, Stanisław Loth', 'Jerzy Antczak', 'Jadwiga Barańska, Jerzy Bińczycki, Stanisława Celińska, Ewa Dałkowska, Władysław Hańcza, Elżbieta Karkoszka, Bogusław Sochnacki, Zygmunt Zintel', null, 'A family saga of Barbara Ostrzeńska-Niechcic and Bogumił Niechcic against the backdrop of the January Uprising of 1863 and World War I. The film is a rather straightforward and faithful adaptation of a novel by Maria Dabrowska with the same title. The plot is woven around the changing fortunes of a noble (upper-class) Niechcic family in the pre-WWI Poland. There are two main crossing threads: a social history one and an existential one.', 'A family saga of Barbara Ostrzeńska-Niechcic and Bogumił Niechcic against the backdrop of the January Uprising of 1863 and World War I. The film is a rather straightforward and faithful adaptation of a novel by Maria Dabrowska with the same title. The plot is woven around the changing fortunes of a noble (upper-class) Niechcic family in the pre-WWI Poland. There are two main crossing threads: a social history one and an existential one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6VkoEYSSNwSqVMyfskAB1K4ndW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110369'),
  ('485264604777286247', 'Nights and Weekends', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joe Swanberg, Greta Gerwig, Matthias Grunsky', 'Greta Gerwig, Joe Swanberg', 'Greta Gerwig, Joe Swanberg, Jay Duplass, Lynn Shelton, Kent Osborne, Elizabeth Donius, Alison Bagnall, Ellen Stagg', 'NR', 'A man and woman must face the tension that builds between them during a long-distance relationship.', 'A man and woman must face the tension that builds between them during a long-distance relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFPvD0dxmqrfKu0qqAgzGVEfCn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48204'),
  ('355304028354975079', 'Nights in Rodanthe', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'George C. Wolfe, Affonso Beato', 'Ann Peacock, John Romano', 'Diane Lane, Richard Gere, Christopher Meloni, Viola Davis, Becky Ann Baker, Scott Glenn, Linda Molloy, Pablo Schreiber', 'PG-13', 'Adrienne is trying to decide whether to stay in her unhappy marriage or not, and her life changes when Paul, a doctor who is travelling to reconcile with his estranged son, checks into an inn where she is staying.', 'Adrienne is trying to decide whether to stay in her unhappy marriage or not, and her life changes when Paul, a doctor who is travelling to reconcile with his estranged son, checks into an inn where she is staying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyB5BeSNJUcWwKN7ypCMjbvnarq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14326'),
