  ('81507101536874547', 'Nikola Tesla: The Genius Who Lit the World', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Ljubo Vujovic', null, null, null, 'Nikola Tesla is considered the father of our modern technological age and one of the most mysterious and controversial scientists in history.', 'Nikola Tesla is considered the father of our modern technological age and one of the most mysterious and controversial scientists in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVZungPk7qtl7vFNz5WstuRNvOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27279'),
  ('1141649063718428721', 'Nikté', 2009, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Ricardo Arnaiz', null, 'Sherlyn, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Eduardo Manzano, Silverio Palacios, Regina Orozco, Maya Zapata, Pierre Angelo, Alex Lora', null, 'Nikté is an orphan girl with a very difficult character who wants to be important and, to achieve this, she deceives her people by pretending to be the princess announced in a prophecy. What she does not know is that this will require much more than she can offer and that to fulfill it she will live many adventures, where she will learn that to be the greatest, first you have to be the smallest.', 'Nikté is an orphan girl with a very difficult character who wants to be important and, to achieve this, she deceives her people by pretending to be the princess announced in a prophecy. What she does not know is that this will require much more than she can offer and that to fulfill it she will live many adventures, where she will learn that to be the greatest, first you have to be the smallest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQvsuMVNwurhOis6yC6a39ADkQZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298453'),
  ('85686734874213502', 'Nil Battey Sannata', 2016, 'Drama, Family', 'Ashwiny Iyer Tiwari', 'Pranjal Choudhary, Neeraj Singh, Ashwiny Iyer Tiwari', 'Swara Bhasker, Ratna Pathak Shah, Pankaj Tripathi, Riya Shukla, Sanjay Suri, Vishal Nath, Neha Prajapati, Prashant Tiwari', null, 'Behind the magnificent Taj Mahal lies a cluster of dingy homes where Chanda (35), a domestic help, lives with her 14-year-old daughter Appu. Chanda aspires and dreams that her daughter will study and embrace a better fate. When Appu tells her she wants to quit school and become a maid like her, Chanda takes a strong decision: she will herself go back to school, and even join the class of her daughter.', 'Behind the magnificent Taj Mahal lies a cluster of dingy homes where Chanda (35), a domestic help, lives with her 14-year-old daughter Appu. Chanda aspires and dreams that her daughter will study and embrace a better fate. When Appu tells her she wants to quit school and become a maid like her, Chanda takes a strong decision: she will herself go back to school, and even join the class of her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvsPtLdIFM4lsjFX5CQ1X6yjzSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361249'),
  ('1103254526971284664', 'Nil by Mouth', 1997, 'Drama', 'Gary Oldman, Ron Fortunato, Finn McGrath', 'Gary Oldman', 'Ray Winstone, Kathy Burke, Charlie Creed-Miles, Laila Morse, Edna Doré, Chrissie Cotterill, Jon Morrison, Jamie Foreman', 'R', 'The family of Raymond, his wife Val and her brother Billy live in working-class London district. Also in their family is Val and Billy''s mother Janet and grandmother Kath. Billy is a drug addict and Raymond kicks him out of the house, making him live on his own. Raymond is generally a rough and even violent person, and that leads to problems in the life of the family.', 'The family of Raymond, his wife Val and her brother Billy live in working-class London district. Also in their family is Val and Billy''s mother Janet and grandmother Kath. Billy is a drug addict and Raymond kicks him out of the house, making him live on his own. Raymond is generally a rough and even violent person, and that leads to problems in the life of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRW2hoYmXgloWehdBQxAdbKu4Jn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21252'),
  ('764733596933404469', 'Nilakanta', 2026, 'Action', 'Rakesh Madhavan, Sravan G Kumar', 'Rakesh Madhavan', 'Anil Inamadugu, M. K. S. Manoj, Guduru Krishna, Mahendran, Yashna Chowdary', null, 'In the village of Saraswathipuram, education is sacred. Nilakanta, a humble tailor, grows up wise and kind, believing in karma. Fate turns cruel, and he must bravely fight his greatest rival-destiny itself to survive. It tests his courage.', 'In the village of Saraswathipuram, education is sacred. Nilakanta, a humble tailor, grows up wise and kind, believing in karma. Fate turns cruel, and he must bravely fight his greatest rival-destiny itself to survive. It tests his courage.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fz4g0yDlh2ApKrcBnTWV0RxbtLiC.jpg', 'plex:movie:nilakanta'),
  ('95859361829593206', 'Nilave', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, Music', 'Sowmith Poladi, Sai K. Vennam, Kalyan Nayak', 'Suneel Sagar', 'Shreyasi Sen, Harsha Chemudu, Sowmith Poladi', null, 'Nilave traces the journey of Arjun, a lonely and emotionally anxious young man searching for companionship. In a world of fleeting connections, he discovers a magical love and goes to extraordinary lengths to make it eternal.', 'Nilave traces the journey of Arjun, a lonely and emotionally anxious young man searching for companionship. In a world of fleeting connections, he discovers a magical love and goes to extraordinary lengths to make it eternal.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmjWnen4MwSnQdkVauA2JuAUT6nG.jpg', 'plex:movie:nilave'),
  ('213540630376710952', 'Nils Karlsson Pyssling', 1990, 'Family', 'Staffan Götestam, Rolf Lindström, Maria Kiisk', 'Staffan Götestam', 'Oskar Löfkvist, Jonatan Lindoff, Britta Pettersson, Charlie Elvegård, Ulla Sallert', null, 'Based on the novel with the same name by Astrid Lindgren. Lonely little Bertil befriends the tiny Nils Karlsson-Däumling, who lives in a mouse hole under his bed and teaches him a magic spell to shrink down and share wondrous adventures in his secret world. Their idyllic fun, however, is threatened by the sinister rat Schofeline, forcing Bertil to summon all his newfound courage.', 'Based on the novel with the same name by Astrid Lindgren. Lonely little Bertil befriends the tiny Nils Karlsson-Däumling, who lives in a mouse hole under his bed and teaches him a magic spell to shrink down and share wondrous adventures in his secret world. Their idyllic fun, however, is threatened by the sinister rat Schofeline, forcing Bertil to summon all his newfound courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEgkIQ64RIZ18rw9Fk2rCW3Yxm4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30583'),
