  ('382512101377137432', 'Nina', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Heitor Dhalia, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Marçal Aquino, Heitor Dhalia', 'Guta Stresser, Myrian Muniz, Juliana Galdino, Sabrina Greve, Luíza Mariani, Wagner Moura, Guilherme Weber, Lázaro Ramos', null, 'After losing her job, an unstable woman sinks further and further into a violent fantasy world.', 'After losing her job, an unstable woman sinks further and further into a violent fantasy world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrNAhc4sY2OKgw4GlkCR9fvW6Ii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33636'),
