  ('235868055710446668', 'Nina', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Andrea Jaurrieta, María Rodrigo', 'Andrea Jaurrieta', 'Patricia López Arnaiz, Darío Grandinetti, Aina Picarolo, Iñigo Aranburu, Mar Sodupe, Ramon Agirre, Silvia de Pé, Leyre Berrocal', null, 'After thirty years, Nina decides to return to the seaside town where she grew up to confront the man who changed her life and to whom the town now pays homage. The reunion with her origins, with her memories and with Blas, a childhood friend, will make her question whether revenge is the only way.', 'After thirty years, Nina decides to return to the seaside town where she grew up to confront the man who changed her life and to whom the town now pays homage. The reunion with her origins, with her memories and with Blas, a childhood friend, will make her question whether revenge is the only way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4Dr3pExlz2qiRdQVpOPtxxzo3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1244872'),
  ('816075384903508671', 'Nina and the Hedgehog''s Secret', 2023, 'Animation, Family', 'Alain Gagnol, Jean-Loup Felicioli', 'Alain Gagnol', 'Audrey Tautou, Guillaume Canet, Loan Longchamp, Keanu Peyran, Guillaume Bats, Patrick Ridremont, Saabo Balde, Hugues Boucher', null, 'The world of 10-year old Nina has been in turmoil since her father lost his job. Despite weeks of strike, his factory closed down. The manager had tampered with the accounts and precipitated its collapse. But rumour has it that a nest-egg remains hidden somewhere in the factory. Nina and her friend Mehdi spring into action to help Nina’s dad out. This tale of our times, which is also a coming-of-age story, stages the interaction between the concerns of children and those of adults.', 'The world of 10-year old Nina has been in turmoil since her father lost his job. Despite weeks of strike, his factory closed down. The manager had tampered with the accounts and precipitated its collapse. But rumour has it that a nest-egg remains hidden somewhere in the factory. Nina and her friend Mehdi spring into action to help Nina’s dad out. This tale of our times, which is also a coming-of-age story, stages the interaction between the concerns of children and those of adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTcu3kpwwDaqps600BECW3g16hw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588524'),
