  ('1075684104708219587', 'Nina Takes a Lover', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alan Jacobs, Frank Simeone, Kelley Clement', 'Alan Jacobs', 'Laura San Giacomo, Paul Rhys, Michael O''Keefe, Cristi Conaway, Fisher Stevens, Alan Lightner, Vincent Lars, Carter Collins', null, 'Laura San Giacomo stars in this sexy comedy about adultery. When Nina''s (San Giacomo) husband goes out of town for several weeks on a business trip, Nina hooks up with a photographer. Told from a reporter''s point of view, his interviews with Nina and the photographer provide comic insights. Stars Laura San Giacomo, Paul Rhys, Michael O''Keefe, Fisher Stevens and more.', 'Laura San Giacomo stars in this sexy comedy about adultery. When Nina''s (San Giacomo) husband goes out of town for several weeks on a business trip, Nina hooks up with a photographer. Told from a reporter''s point of view, his interviews with Nina and the photographer provide comic insights. Stars Laura San Giacomo, Paul Rhys, Michael O''Keefe, Fisher Stevens and more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ouiE82bOuBl4IeEnY2gJe8teQFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131957'),
  ('222762848778121778', 'Nina Wu', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Midi Z, Florian Zinke', 'Midi Z, Wu Ke-xi', 'Wu Ke-xi, Vivian Sung, Hsia Yu-chiao, Shih Ming-shuai, Tong Chih-wei, Lee Lee-zen, Hsieh Ying-shiuan, Rexen Cheng', null, 'After years toiling in bit-parts, an actress finally gets her break with a leading role in a spy thriller. The part is challenging, not least because it calls for explicit sex scenes, and the director is often hard on her. But both the industry and the press think the results are sensationally good.', 'After years toiling in bit-parts, an actress finally gets her break with a leading role in a spy thriller. The part is challenging, not least because it calls for explicit sex scenes, and the director is often hard on her. But both the industry and the press think the results are sensationally good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qTSzURG8uSIVaYf4cW5GUqIIIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595923'),
