  ('902832571599196449', 'Ninette', 2005, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Garci, Raúl Pérez Cubero', 'José Luis Garci, Miguel Mihura, Horacio Valcárcel', 'Carlos Hipólito, Elsa Pataky, Enrique Villén, Beatriz Carvajal, Fernando Delgado, Mar Regueras, Miguel Rellán, Javivi', null, 'Andrés, a dowdy Spaniard, goes to Paris on holiday, hoping to meet a pretty French girl. His wishes may come true after meeting Ninette, his landlord''s sensual and possessive young daughter.', 'Andrés, a dowdy Spaniard, goes to Paris on holiday, hoping to meet a pretty French girl. His wishes may come true after meeting Ninette, his landlord''s sensual and possessive young daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8giGO1Bt8tts0cleW2PwHTaK4XR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79051'),
