  ('1060519078983182823', 'Ningen Shikkaku: Director''s Cut-ban', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, History', 'Morio Asaka', null, 'Masato Sakai', null, 'A theatrical film version of Madhouse''s Aoi Bungaku Series anime. The film will re-edit the four episodes based on Osamu Dazai''s No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) novel, which have character designs inspired by manga artist and novel illustrator Takeshi Obata. This "director''s cut" will include new "navigation" footage which is being created specifically for the film with narrator Masato Sakai.', 'A theatrical film version of Madhouse''s Aoi Bungaku Series anime. The film will re-edit the four episodes based on Osamu Dazai''s No Longer Human (Ningen Shikkaku) novel, which have character designs inspired by manga artist and novel illustrator Takeshi Obata. This "director''s cut" will include new "navigation" footage which is being created specifically for the film with narrator Masato Sakai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gex4YI4aS3ZhFZxN94ui5193RZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74799'),
  ('658129177432028582', 'Ninguém Entra, Ninguém Sai', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Hsu Chien', 'Paulo Halm', 'Letícia Lima, Emiliano D''Ávila, Paulinho Serra, Danielle Winits, Tatsu Carvalho, João Côrtes, Bella Piero, Mariana Santos', null, 'At a Rio de Janeiro motel, an unexpected emergency places all the guests under quarantine. The problem? Not everyone is supposed to be there.', 'At a Rio de Janeiro motel, an unexpected emergency places all the guests under quarantine. The problem? Not everyone is supposed to be there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUV6DQrYBlJFvdmRoiDssxyU42g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435803'),
  ('573829515832011497', 'Ninì Tirabusciò: The Woman Who Invented the Move', 1970, 'Comedy', 'Marcello Fondato, Carlo Di Palma', 'Marcello Fondato', 'Monica Vitti, Gastone Moschin, Pierre Clémenti, Peppino De Filippo, Carlo Giuffrè, Sylva Koscina, Angela Luce, Rosita Pisano', null, 'Comedy set at the time of King Umberto I of Monza (Italy) about Maria Sarti, aka Ninì Tirabusciò, actress/singer who caused a scandal with her raunchy dancing.', 'Comedy set at the time of King Umberto I of Monza (Italy) about Maria Sarti, aka Ninì Tirabusciò, actress/singer who caused a scandal with her raunchy dancing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/54aRsKaOSO8Pv5kwsZhy69JUD2Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210613'),
  ('325389741970186646', 'Ninja', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson, Emil Topuzov', 'Michael Hurst, Boaz Davidson', 'Scott Adkins, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Mika Hijii, Todd Jensen, Garrick Hagon, Togo Igawa, Miles Anderson, Valentin Ganev', 'R', 'A westerner named Casey, studying Ninjutsu in Japan, is asked by the Sensei to return to New York to protect the legendary Yoroi Bitsu, an armored chest that contains the weapons of the last Koga Ninja.', 'A westerner named Casey, studying Ninjutsu in Japan, is asked by the Sensei to return to New York to protect the legendary Yoroi Bitsu, an armored chest that contains the weapons of the last Koga Ninja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tKjH1IQVeUmHOlxZinQdjFHkFVG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25602'),
  ('419516578651896191', 'Ninja Academy', 1989, 'Comedy, Action', 'Nico Mastorakis, Steven Shaw', 'Jonathan D. Gift', 'Will Egan, Gerald Okamura, Kelly Randall, Michael David, Jeff Robinson, Kathleen Stevens, Robert Factor, Art Camacho', 'R', 'Echoing the comic tone of the "Police Academy" films, Ninja Academy boasts an ensemble cast of hilarious characters, bonding while training hard, playing hard and ultimately, losing hard-- In the tough, unforgiving world of martial arts.', 'Echoing the comic tone of the "Police Academy" films, Ninja Academy boasts an ensemble cast of hilarious characters, bonding while training hard, playing hard and ultimately, losing hard-- In the tough, unforgiving world of martial arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZu9iMYsRDajOMMI146lFt6hy5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92496'),
  ('335081015127178111', 'Ninja Assassin', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'James McTeigue, Karl Walter Lindenlaub, Chad Stahelski', 'Matthew Sand, J. Michael Straczynski', 'Rain, Naomie Harris, Ben Miles, Rick Yune, Sho Kosugi, Randall Duk Kim, Sung Kang, Lee Joon', 'R', 'Ninja Assassin follows Raizo, one of the deadliest assassins in the world. Taken from the streets as a child, he was transformed into a trained killer by the Ozunu Clan, a secret society whose very existence is considered a myth. But haunted by the merciless execution of his friend by the Clan, Raizo breaks free from them and vanishes. Now he waits, preparing to exact his revenge.', 'Ninja Assassin follows Raizo, one of the deadliest assassins in the world. Taken from the streets as a child, he was transformed into a trained killer by the Ozunu Clan, a secret society whose very existence is considered a myth. But haunted by the merciless execution of his friend by the Clan, Raizo breaks free from them and vanishes. Now he waits, preparing to exact his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipJ4mgqse6uoTRsDyU3TXmva1rt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22832'),
  ('731794213014422576', 'Ninja Champion', 1986, 'Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Raymond Kim Si-Hyeon', 'Jang Cheon-ho', 'Bruce Baron, Pierre Tremblay, Phillip Ching, Jack Lam, Nancy Chang, Richard Harrison, James Chan, Dragon Lee', null, 'A couple camping in the woods is attacked by a trio of thugs and the wife is beaten and raped. A few months after the assault, she is hunting down the three (who happen to be diamond smugglers) by posing as a dealer looking to sell some stolen merchandise. Meanwhile, her Interpol agent husband is doing some tracking of his own in the hopes of bringing them to justice. As they make their plans, a group of ninjas is watching from afar, waiting to make their move. A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1985 Korean Film "밤을 벗기는 독장미" (Poisonous Rose Stripping The Night) with new ninja scenes.', 'A couple camping in the woods is attacked by a trio of thugs and the wife is beaten and raped. A few months after the assault, she is hunting down the three (who happen to be diamond smugglers) by posing as a dealer looking to sell some stolen merchandise. Meanwhile, her Interpol agent husband is doing some tracking of his own in the hopes of bringing them to justice. As they make their plans, a group of ninjas is watching from afar, waiting to make their move. A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1985 Korean Film "밤을 벗기는 독장미" (Poisonous Rose Stripping The Night) with new ninja scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gE73MJh6JroCyakFBlajTn1RtDw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94652'),
  ('167355660552322671', 'Ninja Cheerleaders', 2008, 'Action, Comedy', 'David Presley, Richard Briglia', 'David Presley', 'Trishelle Cannatella, Ginny Weirick, Maitland McConnell, George Takei, Michael Paré, Michael FitzGibbon, Larry Poindexter, Natasha Jai', 'R', '3 college cheerleaders use their martial arts know-how to save their Sensei from mafia kidnappers, but must keep their extra curricular activities a secret in order to make it into an Ivy League school.', '3 college cheerleaders use their martial arts know-how to save their Sensei from mafia kidnappers, but must keep their extra curricular activities a secret in order to make it into an Ivy League school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jWrGBdET2FIcWi2hOPqQbyRhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19829'),
  ('355939910204230968', 'Ninja Gaiden', 1991, 'Animation, Action, Crime', 'Mamoru Kanbe, Mitsunobu Yoshida, Osamu Horiuchi', 'Tomofumi Nobe', 'Keiichi Nanba, Norio Wakamoto, Yumi Touma, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Shinji Ogawa', null, 'A long time ago, there was a war between the Evil God and the Dragon God. The war finally came to an end when a Dragon Ninja, who had the power of the Dragon God, sealed away the Evil God.Several thousand years later, in New York, a young ninja named Ryu is attacked by a couple of men in black suits wearing white masks. He notices that they are related to someone worshiping the same Evil God of the past and resolves to fight against them before the Evil God is unsealed again.', 'A long time ago, there was a war between the Evil God and the Dragon God. The war finally came to an end when a Dragon Ninja, who had the power of the Dragon God, sealed away the Evil God.Several thousand years later, in New York, a young ninja named Ryu is attacked by a couple of men in black suits wearing white masks. He notices that they are related to someone worshiping the same Evil God of the past and resolves to fight against them before the Evil God is unsealed again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDAqafEBgoO7xeRFH43ObgRQqf5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146006'),
  ('314702090092681139', 'Ninja Hunter', 1987, 'Action, Fantasy', 'James Wu Kuo-Ren, Wang Chi-Sheng', null, 'Alexander Lo Rei, Mark Lung, Jack Long Shi-Chia, William Yen Ming-Chang, Chen Shan, Chung Ling, Ma Chang, Chu Ben-Ke', null, 'The plot centres around Wu Tang villain, Abbot White, who wants to destroy the Shaolin monks and become supreme martial artist. In order to do so, he teams up with a clan of Ninjas, led by three masters – gold lamé ninja, white mustachioed ninja and black ninja – and succeeds in destroying the Shaolin temple and most of its inhabitants. However, there are some survivors. It is their job to pass on the knowledge of the Shaolin finger jab to a new generation, who must defeat the ninjas and Abbott White if peace and order is to be restored.', 'The plot centres around Wu Tang villain, Abbot White, who wants to destroy the Shaolin monks and become supreme martial artist. In order to do so, he teams up with a clan of Ninjas, led by three masters – gold lamé ninja, white mustachioed ninja and black ninja – and succeeds in destroying the Shaolin temple and most of its inhabitants. However, there are some survivors. It is their job to pass on the knowledge of the Shaolin finger jab to a new generation, who must defeat the ninjas and Abbott White if peace and order is to be restored.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OlZMxb9zLYgZnyGlx23CQ0xLm0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39879'),
  ('396816384044683369', 'Ninja III: The Domination', 1984, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Sam Firstenberg, Hanania Baer', 'James R. Silke', 'Sho Kosugi, Lucinda Dickey, Jordan Bennett, David Chung, Dale Ishimoto, James Hong, Bob Craig, Pamela Ness', 'R', 'An aerobics instructor becomes a ruthless assassin after being possessed by a slain ninja''s spirit, leading to a showdown with a martial arts expert.', 'An aerobics instructor becomes a ruthless assassin after being possessed by a slain ninja''s spirit, leading to a showdown with a martial arts expert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uUMJelRS3CGFehLyspQOS1R4z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28148'),
  ('53320200351795919', 'Ninja in the Dragon''s Den', 1982, 'Action, Comedy', 'Corey Yuen', 'Corey Yuen, Ng See-Yuen', 'Conan Lee, Hiroyuki Sanada, Hwang Jang-Lee, Tai Bo, Hiroshi Tanaka, Kwon Yeong-Moon, Ma Chin-Ku, Tien Feng', null, 'A Japanese master of ninjutsu and a Chinese expert in kung fu, put their differences aside after their master is killed by a mortal enemy.', 'A Japanese master of ninjutsu and a Chinese expert in kung fu, put their differences aside after their master is killed by a mortal enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gILpX25f0WoPNmKNpTZ3rVOq6Fi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18813'),
  ('816813919406155214', 'Ninja Kids!!!', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Family', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Kaori Ohtagaki', 'Yoshio Urasawa', 'Seishirou Katou, Roi Hayashi, Susumu Terajima, Mikijiro Hira, Takahiro Miura, Arata Furuta, Anne Watanabe, Tamao Nakamura', null, 'The film stars Seishiro Kato as Rantaro who is sent to a ninja training school by his parents. During the summer, their teacher is invaded by a group of rival ninjas culminating in a race to ring a bell on top of a mountain.', 'The film stars Seishiro Kato as Rantaro who is sent to a ninja training school by his parents. During the summer, their teacher is invaded by a group of rival ninjas culminating in a race to ring a bell on top of a mountain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKn7MYf8e0UKtDa7FQgVJFSeEZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95576'),
  ('796536874910145689', 'Ninja Operation - Knight and Warrior', 1987, 'Action', 'Godfrey Ho', 'Stephen So', 'Richard Harrison, Alphonse Beni, Stuart Smith, Grant Temple, Nathalie Mandière, Paulo Tocha, Ma Sha, Scott Smith', null, 'When police officer Alvin loses both his star witness and his wife to drug kingpin (and ninja assassin) Rudolph, he vows to get revenge. Travelling to Hong Kong, hot on Rudolph''s trail, he teams up with local investigators Gordon, Vivian and Jackie. Meanwhile, a young street punk named Edmund is hunting for the man who killed his father. Could they all possibly be searching for the same person? A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Taiwanese Film 女太保 (A Rouge Girl) with new ninja scenes.', 'When police officer Alvin loses both his star witness and his wife to drug kingpin (and ninja assassin) Rudolph, he vows to get revenge. Travelling to Hong Kong, hot on Rudolph''s trail, he teams up with local investigators Gordon, Vivian and Jackie. Meanwhile, a young street punk named Edmund is hunting for the man who killed his father. Could they all possibly be searching for the same person? A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Taiwanese Film 女太保 (A Rouge Girl) with new ninja scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5jI566mcs4iCYvbBXhJgGZatZGG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149869'),
  ('812752334007758971', 'Ninja Scroll', 1993, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action', 'Yasunori Honda, Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Yutaka Minowa', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri', 'Koichi Yamadera, Emi Shinohara, Takeshi Aono, Daisuke Gori, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo, Akimasa Omori, Gara Takashima, Norio Wakamoto', 'NR', 'Jubei is a masterless ninja who travels the land alone, lending his services to those with gold—or a worthy cause. His fearsome abilities have served him well, but a plot to overthrow the government threatens to end his wandering ways—and possibly his life.', 'Jubei is a masterless ninja who travels the land alone, lending his services to those with gold—or a worthy cause. His fearsome abilities have served him well, but a plot to overthrow the government threatens to end his wandering ways—and possibly his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzZEnaXwv4wss2QalEo4Uf9BAwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14282'),
  ('265646171799266349', 'Ninja Terminator', 1986, 'Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Raymond Chang, Godfrey Ho', 'Godfrey Ho', 'Richard Harrison, Jack Lam, Hwang Jang-Lee, Phillip Ko Fai, Jonathan Wattis, Maria Francesca, Chiang Tao, Jack Suen Kwok-Ming', null, 'The hunt is on to gain the fabulous super-strength of ninja sorcery, after three top students of the Ninja Empire each steals one of the sections of the Golden Ninja Warrior statuette. On the case is interpol agent, Jaguar Wong, who must make sure that whoever re-unites the pieces uses the power for doing good not evil. A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Korean Film "스타페리의 不請客" (Uninvited Guest of The Star Ferry) with new ninja scenes.', 'The hunt is on to gain the fabulous super-strength of ninja sorcery, after three top students of the Ninja Empire each steals one of the sections of the Golden Ninja Warrior statuette. On the case is interpol agent, Jaguar Wong, who must make sure that whoever re-unites the pieces uses the power for doing good not evil. A Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Korean Film "스타페리의 不請客" (Uninvited Guest of The Star Ferry) with new ninja scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YkYpKxTQVq4gna3qTztwwwo8YF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40027'),
  ('552728654248440569', 'Ninja the Final Duel', 1986, 'Action, Adventure', 'Robert Tai, Alexander Lo Rei, Tommy Tong Yue-Tai', 'Robert Tai', 'Alexander Lo Rei, Li Yi-Min, William Yen Ming-Chang, Wang Hsieh, Wang Chi-Sheng, Eugene Thomas, Alan Li Hai-Hsing, Yuk Hin', null, 'The Ji Ho Ninja clan vow to destroy the monks of Shaolin temple. To do so they must first perfect many of their techniques in order to ensure the battle will be won. The temple finds protection from monks who set out to save it.', 'The Ji Ho Ninja clan vow to destroy the monks of Shaolin temple. To do so they must first perfect many of their techniques in order to ensure the battle will be won. The temple finds protection from monks who set out to save it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcvsb7FOaDVVzc3gnwOcrmHhtg6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40388'),
  ('901671381295470849', 'Ninja the Protector', 1986, 'Drama, Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Raymond Chang', 'Godfrey Ho', 'Richard Harrison, David Bowles, Warren Chan, Morna Lee, Clifford Allen, Vera Chang, Mike Tien, Joyce Chow', null, 'Two brothers, Warren and David, try to defeat the evil forger who is making their lives a misery.', 'Two brothers, Warren and David, try to defeat the evil forger who is making their lives a misery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4LO4UolnsMSbTi73lVxt6Rucze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52972'),
  ('41126587945110463', 'Ninja Wars', 1982, 'Action, Drama', 'Kōsei Saitō, Fujio Morita, Isao Yoshiwara', 'Ei Ogawa', 'Hiroyuki Sanada, Jun Miho, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Sonny Chiba, Noriko Watanabe, Strong Kongo, Mikio Narita, Gajirō Satō', null, 'A fortuneteller prophesizes that whoever marries the beautiful Ukio will become the ruler of the world. Naturally, this makes her very popular with those vying for power, particularly the insatiably greedy Lord Donjo. Only the ninja Jotaro can stop Donjo''s plan, but to do so, he must first battle the deadly team of "Devil Monks" serving the lord. Will Jotaro succeed in his mission? And if so, will Ukio marry him, thus making him the ruler of the world?', 'A fortuneteller prophesizes that whoever marries the beautiful Ukio will become the ruler of the world. Naturally, this makes her very popular with those vying for power, particularly the insatiably greedy Lord Donjo. Only the ninja Jotaro can stop Donjo''s plan, but to do so, he must first battle the deadly team of "Devil Monks" serving the lord. Will Jotaro succeed in his mission? And if so, will Ukio marry him, thus making him the ruler of the world?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJscFYCLnPlaFBAzwkqXAqJeXd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52970'),
  ('163397516122364900', 'Ninja, A Band of Assassins', 1962, 'Action', 'Satsuo Yamamoto, Yasukazu Takemura, Eiji Nishizawa', 'Hajime Takaiwa', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Yūnosuke Itō, Shiho Fujimura, Katsuhiko Kobayashi, Saburo Date, Kō Nishimura, Kyôko Kishida, Reiko Fujiwara', null, 'Warlord Oda Nobunaga seeks to unite a fractured Japan. A young man trained in the arts of ninjitsu is manipulated by a ninja master into attempting to assassinate the warlord before he completes his task.', 'Warlord Oda Nobunaga seeks to unite a fractured Japan. A young man trained in the arts of ninjitsu is manipulated by a ninja master into attempting to assassinate the warlord before he completes his task.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/873pKABUbSjj2ckdmK9yidvyvHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31297'),
  ('70176072863334069', 'Ninja: Shadow of a Tear', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Tim Man, Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson', 'David N. White', 'Scott Adkins, Kane Kosugi, Mika Hijii, Shun Sugata, Vithaya Pansringarm, Mukesh Bhatt, Tim Man, Jawed Berni', 'R', 'Fight everyone and trust no one: it''s the code of survival practiced by martial-arts master Casey Bowman after his life of domestic bliss is shattered by a savage act of violence. Vowing revenge, the fearless American stealthily tracks the killer from Osaka to Bangkok to Rangoon with the help of a wise and crafty sensei. His only clues: a series of victims whose necks bear the distinctive mark of strangulation by barbed wire. Fighting to avenge as well as to survive, Casey must sharpen his razor-like responses and take his battle skills to the next level, even using deep meditation to fake his own death. His target: the sinister drug lord Goro, who is flooding the streets with deadly meth cooked at his remote jungle factory. To prepare for his ultimate confrontation, Casey must finally become an invisible warrior worthy of the name Ninja. But just when his prey is cornered, an unexpected twist shows Casey that his battle is only beginning: he truly can trust no one.', 'Fight everyone and trust no one: it''s the code of survival practiced by martial-arts master Casey Bowman after his life of domestic bliss is shattered by a savage act of violence. Vowing revenge, the fearless American stealthily tracks the killer from Osaka to Bangkok to Rangoon with the help of a wise and crafty sensei. His only clues: a series of victims whose necks bear the distinctive mark of strangulation by barbed wire. Fighting to avenge as well as to survive, Casey must sharpen his razor-like responses and take his battle skills to the next level, even using deep meditation to fake his own death. His target: the sinister drug lord Goro, who is flooding the streets with deadly meth cooked at his remote jungle factory. To prepare for his ultimate confrontation, Casey must finally become an invisible warrior worthy of the name Ninja. But just when his prey is cornered, an unexpected twist shows Casey that his battle is only beginning: he truly can trust no one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4i1wzuyFXv6NHREAy4fPPGSH7E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180894'),
  ('513730285583749611', 'Ninjababy', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marianne Bakke, Yngvild Sve Flikke, Inga H. Sætre', 'Yngvild Sve Flikke, Inga H. Sætre', 'Kristine Kujath Thorp, Nader Khademi, Arthur Berning, Tora Christine Dietrichson, Silya Nymoen, Herman Tømmeraas, Trine Wiggen, Janne Heltberg', 'R', 'When Rakel finds out she''s six months pregnant after a one-night stand, her world changes. She is absolutely not ready to be a mother, but since abortion is no longer an option, adoption is the only answer. That''s when Ninjababy, an animated character who makes Rakel''s life a living hell, turns up.', 'When Rakel finds out she''s six months pregnant after a one-night stand, her world changes. She is absolutely not ready to be a mother, but since abortion is no longer an option, adoption is the only answer. That''s when Ninjababy, an animated character who makes Rakel''s life a living hell, turns up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KVHtTIWFmUqzT6HtPGLOMPQQen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654074'),
  ('616786548746448346', 'Nino', 2025, 'Drama', 'Pauline Loquès, Lucie Baudinaud, Alice Cavillan', 'Maud Ameline', 'Théodore Pellerin, Salomé Dewaels, Jeanne Balibar, William Lebghil, Balthazar Billaud, Camille Rutherford, Estelle Meyer, Victoire du Bois', null, 'Nino is a young man on a journey to reconnect with the world and himself in the streets of Paris, following the suggestion of his doctors. In three days, he will face a major challenge.', 'Nino is a young man on a journey to reconnect with the world and himself in the streets of Paris, following the suggestion of his doctors. In three days, he will face a major challenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7kmHzYxMnKuSqTD1XIwW0qg9hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1313229'),
  ('523463804562757331', 'Nino in Paradise', 2026, 'Drama', 'Laurent Micheli, Florian Berutti', 'Laurent Micheli, Clara Bourreau, Capucine Johannin', 'Oscar Högström, Mara Taquin, Bilal Hassani, Théo Augier, Rusen Houssin', null, 'After a catastrophic night, 20-year-old Nino Paradis flees but returns to square one. He reconnects with love interest Lale and friends Malik and Charlie. They endure dead-end jobs and drug-filled nights while Nino struggles for survival.', 'After a catastrophic night, 20-year-old Nino Paradis flees but returns to square one. He reconnects with love interest Lale and friends Malik and Charlie. They endure dead-end jobs and drug-filled nights while Nino struggles for survival.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fvy3Va7gmdca5OkcsoErfKWokfbb.jpg', 'plex:movie:nino-in-paradise'),
  ('342292271985778293', 'NiNoKuni', 2019, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Ryota Itoh, Kazuhiko Shibuya, Takeshi Iida', 'Akihiro Hino', 'Kento Yamazaki, Mackenyu, Mei Nagano, Koichi Yamadera, Yuki Kaji, Masatô Ibu, Kenjiro Tsuda, Tsuyoshi Muro', 'PG-13', 'Adapted from the video game series of the same name, NiNoKuni follows high school peers Yuu and Haru who must travel between two separate yet parallel worlds to help save their childhood friend, Kotona, whose life is in danger. In this magical quest complicated by love, the three teens will be tasked with making the ultimate choice.', 'Adapted from the video game series of the same name, NiNoKuni follows high school peers Yuu and Haru who must travel between two separate yet parallel worlds to help save their childhood friend, Kotona, whose life is in danger. In this magical quest complicated by love, the three teens will be tasked with making the ultimate choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud6YOdHjRFFJInlpwpPRr9bFOFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594188'),
  ('571383638647185262', 'Ninotchka', 1939, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Lubitsch, William H. Daniels, Douglas Shearer', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder, Walter Reisch', 'Greta Garbo, Melvyn Douglas, Ina Claire, Bela Lugosi, Sig Ruman, Felix Bressart, Alexander Granach, Gregory Gaye', 'NR', 'A stern Russian woman sent to Paris on official business finds herself attracted to a man who represents everything she is supposed to detest.', 'A stern Russian woman sent to Paris on official business finds herself attracted to a man who represents everything she is supposed to detest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4MkgNqZyodYwBDNbZ64MF9tVEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1859'),
  ('167390621952844168', 'Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger Shushuuto: The Movie', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Katsuya Watanabe, Michihiro Takeda', 'Junichi Miyashita', 'Shun Shioya, Nao Nagasawa, Kohei Yamamoto, Yujiro Shirakawa, Nobuo Kyô, Taiki Matsuno, Ken Nishida, Shoko Takada', null, 'The second film outing of the Hurricaneger team. Hurricaneger the theatrical movie introduces new, original hardware and characters, including "Tenrai Senpuujin," the Gattai Robot. Sayaka Yoshino guest stars!', 'The second film outing of the Hurricaneger team. Hurricaneger the theatrical movie introduces new, original hardware and characters, including "Tenrai Senpuujin," the Gattai Robot. Sayaka Yoshino guest stars!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dcBQFJTBqtAcOpfRytRGcDMAI4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200395'),
  ('155608271800500428', 'Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger vs. Gaoranger', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Noboru Takemoto, Michihiro Takeda, Hirofumi Ishigaki', 'Naoyuki Sakai', 'Shun Shioya, Nao Nagasawa, Kohei Yamamoto, Yujiro Shirakawa, Nobuo Kyô, Taiki Matsuno, Noboru Kaneko, Takeru Shibaki', null, 'Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger vs. Gaoranger is the team-up movie between Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger and Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger. This can easily fit in between after Sixth Spear, Satarakura and Shurikenger''s introduction and before Third Spear, Manmaruba''s original death and Super Karakuri Beast Revolver Mammoth''s introduction. The only continuity error is the appearance of Manmaruba''s motorcycle since his later clone was the one who used it in the series.', 'Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger vs. Gaoranger is the team-up movie between Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger and Hyakujuu Sentai Gaoranger. This can easily fit in between after Sixth Spear, Satarakura and Shurikenger''s introduction and before Third Spear, Manmaruba''s original death and Super Karakuri Beast Revolver Mammoth''s introduction. The only continuity error is the appearance of Manmaruba''s motorcycle since his later clone was the one who used it in the series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPIVRn93nTHbjezRvfmWWdatzdn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200388'),
  ('302851138453214669', 'Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger: 10 YEARS AFTER', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Katsuya Watanabe', 'Junichi Miyashita', 'Shun Shioya, Nao Nagasawa, Kohei Yamamoto, Yujiro Shirakawa, Nobuo Kyô, Koumi Hashimoto, Ken Nishida, Azusa Yamamoto', null, 'A space ninja group initiate mysterious bombings around the world - from Paris, to Egypt, China, and many others. Nanami and Kouta followed the series of incidents, but were surprised to see a familiar figure appearing before them! It was mentioned that a mistake was made from a battle 10 years ago. This is a V-Cinema, direct to video, movie to commemorate the 10th anniversary of Ninpu Sentai Hurricaneger.', 'A space ninja group initiate mysterious bombings around the world - from Paris, to Egypt, China, and many others. Nanami and Kouta followed the series of incidents, but were surprised to see a familiar figure appearing before them! It was mentioned that a mistake was made from a battle 10 years ago. This is a V-Cinema, direct to video, movie to commemorate the 10th anniversary of Ninpu Sentai Hurricaneger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pjaL6QD0cJxjsYz02sa3K5NnXqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228720'),
  ('1116594155988378720', 'Nintendo Quest', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Robert McCallum', 'Robert McCallum', 'Jay Bartlett, Robert McCallum, Billy Mitchell, Walter Day, Patrick Scott Patterson, Rachel lara, Warren Davis, Tommy Tallarico', null, 'Homer''s Odyssey meets King of Kong as two über geeks try to collect all 678 officially licensed Nintendo Entertainment System game cartridges in 30 days, WITHOUT the aid of online purchasing.', 'Homer''s Odyssey meets King of Kong as two über geeks try to collect all 678 officially licensed Nintendo Entertainment System game cartridges in 30 days, WITHOUT the aid of online purchasing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuQp2QX1a6zyZtvrAa7YTTEEjTT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267955'),
  ('389815221344102069', 'Niram', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kamal', 'Iqbal Kuttippuram', 'Kunchacko Boban, Shalini, Jomol, Boban Alummoodan, Lalu Alex, Devan, Ambika, Babu Swamy', null, 'The film is about a special friendship between a boy and girl, Aby (Kunchacko Boban) and Sona (Shalini). Aby and Sona are childhood friends but they have no romance between them. It was too late when they realized their romance.', 'The film is about a special friendship between a boy and girl, Aby (Kunchacko Boban) and Sona (Shalini). Aby and Sona are childhood friends but they have no romance between them. It was too late when they realized their romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Asv6QRFipiIUksIo2P2Egi6mHeo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352559'),
  ('593150712222380538', 'Nirvana', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Gabriele Salvatores, Italo Petriccione, Fabrizio Donvito', 'Gabriele Salvatores', 'Christopher Lambert, Diego Abatantuono, Sergio Rubini, Stefania Rocca, Amanda Sandrelli, Emmanuelle Seigner, Claudio Bisio, Antonio Catania', 'R', 'Jimi, a computer game designer, finds that his latest product has been infected by a virus which has given consciousness to the main character of the game, Solo. Tormented by the memory of his fled girlfriend Lisa and begged by Solo to end its useless "life", Jimi begins a search for people who can help him both to discover what happened to Lisa and to delete his game before it is released.', 'Jimi, a computer game designer, finds that his latest product has been infected by a virus which has given consciousness to the main character of the game, Solo. Tormented by the memory of his fled girlfriend Lisa and begged by Solo to end its useless "life", Jimi begins a search for people who can help him both to discover what happened to Lisa and to delete his game before it is released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UXk8P1qY3PadOdSj5qk1qBXWMy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8765'),
  ('261644092242044885', 'Nirvana - Unplugged In New York (MTV Version)', 1993, 'Music', 'Beth McCarthy-Miller', null, 'Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic, Dave Grohl, Pat Smear, Lori Goldston, Curt Kirkwood, Cris Kirkwood', null, 'Nirvana Unplugged in New York 45min Original MTV Version', 'Nirvana Unplugged in New York 45min Original MTV Version', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vrfPiaA62QZj0ygOrmoaMMFF65u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122233'),
  ('1083245828919157805', 'Nirvana: Live And Loud', 1993, 'Music, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Beth McCarthy-Miller', null, 'Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic, Dave Grohl, Pat Smear', null, 'Just under a month after the taping of the legendary ''Unplugged'', Nirvana would go on to record a concert for MTV during their ''In Utero'' tour........it would be their last.', 'Just under a month after the taping of the legendary ''Unplugged'', Nirvana would go on to record a concert for MTV during their ''In Utero'' tour........it would be their last.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kyp4pVHhfDwDuBkO2HQUdzVNBC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123511'),
  ('383092828195933015', 'Nirvana: Live at Reading', 2009, 'Music, Documentary', 'Toru Uehara', null, 'Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic, Dave Grohl, Tony Hodgkinson', null, 'This was the band''s second performance at the music festival and their first since the success of ''Nevermind'' had elevated them to the position of what magazines called the "biggest" rock band in the world. It was also sadly their final concert in the United Kingdom.', 'This was the band''s second performance at the music festival and their first since the success of ''Nevermind'' had elevated them to the position of what magazines called the "biggest" rock band in the world. It was also sadly their final concert in the United Kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIVIbppsOBBV6HwIgqgVgu5juxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26305'),
  ('280527562251049396', 'Nirvana: Live! Tonight! Sold Out!!', 1994, 'Documentary, Music', 'Kevin Kerslake', null, 'Kurt Cobain, Dave Grohl, Krist Novoselic, Jonathan Ross, Katherine Turman, Chris Robinson, Riki Rachtman, Valerie Potter', null, 'Nirvana''s frontman Kurt Cobain worked on compiling this collection of performances, interviews, and touring clips from 1991 to 1993 but did not finish it before his death in 1994. Bandmembers Dave Grohl and Krist Novoselic completed it with the help of director Kevin Kerslake.', 'Nirvana''s frontman Kurt Cobain worked on compiling this collection of performances, interviews, and touring clips from 1991 to 1993 but did not finish it before his death in 1994. Bandmembers Dave Grohl and Krist Novoselic completed it with the help of director Kevin Kerslake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1x1J8O9mm7uMvFvbPQhaZerbSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32742'),
  ('991125745120755728', 'Nirvana: Unplugged In New York', 1993, 'Music, Documentary', 'Beth McCarthy-Miller', null, 'Kurt Cobain, Krist Novoselic, Dave Grohl, Pat Smear, Lori Goldston, Curt Kirkwood, Cris Kirkwood', 'NR', 'A live album by American rock band Nirvana, the album features an acoustic performance recorded at Sony Music Studios in New York City on 18 November 1993, for the television series MTV Unplugged.', 'A live album by American rock band Nirvana, the album features an acoustic performance recorded at Sony Music Studios in New York City on 18 November 1993, for the television series MTV Unplugged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLoCBBTdPvGIpZc86wby9dMq3Cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18942'),
  ('124629188769051043', 'Nirvanna the Band the Show the Movie', 2026, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Jared Raab, Matt Johnson, Nikolay Michaylov', 'Matt Johnson, Jay McCarrol', 'Matt Johnson, Jay McCarrol, Ben Petrie, Ethan Eng, Michael Scott, Reid Janisse, Steve Hamelin, Luke Lalonde', 'R', 'When their plan to book a show at the Rivoli goes horribly wrong, Matt and Jay accidentally travel back to the year 2008.', 'When their plan to book a show at the Rivoli goes horribly wrong, Matt and Jay accidentally travel back to the year 2008.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sm5TGX8WbnCd9Uo26cLyTxVwA1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154538'),
  ('515372449430705772', 'Nise: The Heart of Madness', 2016, 'Drama', 'Leonardo Rocha, Cecília Carvalhal, Roberto Berliner', 'Maurício Lissovski, Roberto Berliner, Flávia Castro', 'Glória Pires, Julio Adrião, Claudio Jaborandy, Fabrício Boliveira, Roberta Rodrigues, Flávio Bauraqui, Fernando Eiras, Charles Fricks', null, 'After being released from prison, Dr. Nise da Silveira is back at work in a psychiatric hospital on the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro where she refuses to employ the new and violent electroshock in the treatment of schizophrenics. Ridiculed by doctors, she is forced to take on the abandoned Sector for Occupational Therapy, where she would start a revolution through paintings, animals and love.', 'After being released from prison, Dr. Nise da Silveira is back at work in a psychiatric hospital on the outskirts of Rio de Janeiro where she refuses to employ the new and violent electroshock in the treatment of schizophrenics. Ridiculed by doctors, she is forced to take on the abandoned Sector for Occupational Therapy, where she would start a revolution through paintings, animals and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDEu2l4xvmhVuLerpHzzz2i1lgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363103'),
  ('320273926492467356', 'Nisekoi: False Love', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Hayato Kawai, Yoshimasa Fujie', 'Noriaki Sugihara, Shota Koyama', 'Kento Nakajima, Ayami Nakajo, Natsumi Ikema, Haruka Shimazaki, Yuta Kishi, Kaede Aono, GENKING, Marika Matsumoto', null, 'Raku Ichijo (Kento Nakajima) is an only son and a high school student. His father is the leader of yakuza group Shuei-gumi. Raku Ichijo doesn''t like to fight and he studies hard. His dream is to become a public official. One day, he passes the entrance gate at his high school and is kicked inadvertently by Chitoge Kirisaki (Ayami Nakajo). She is a new transfer student at the school. Chitoge Kirisaki is the only daughter of a rival gang leader. To keep the peace between the rival gangs led by their fathers, Raku Ichijo and Chitoge Kirisaki decide to act as boyfriend and girlfriend. --asianwiki', 'Raku Ichijo (Kento Nakajima) is an only son and a high school student. His father is the leader of yakuza group Shuei-gumi. Raku Ichijo doesn''t like to fight and he studies hard. His dream is to become a public official. One day, he passes the entrance gate at his high school and is kicked inadvertently by Chitoge Kirisaki (Ayami Nakajo). She is a new transfer student at the school. Chitoge Kirisaki is the only daughter of a rival gang leader. To keep the peace between the rival gangs led by their fathers, Raku Ichijo and Chitoge Kirisaki decide to act as boyfriend and girlfriend. --asianwiki', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7JDXBMNrh1pvcN6aSX5FLR0vRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520541'),
  ('733046686125900528', 'Nishabd', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Urvashi Shah, Abhishek Vaidya', 'Kusum Punjabi', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Jiah Khan, Shraddha Arya, Aftab Shivdasani, Nassar, Revathi', null, 'Vijay enjoys the good life: happily married, wealthy and a beautiful daughter. However, one summer, when his daughter brings a friend back to stay, their familial bliss is shattered.', 'Vijay enjoys the good life: happily married, wealthy and a beautiful daughter. However, one summer, when his daughter brings a friend back to stay, their familial bliss is shattered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37vLWXhFPlDmO2N0RhAeyEMn7e9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20535'),
  ('293194515870683698', 'Nishant', 1975, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shyam Benegal', 'Vijay Tendulkar', 'Shabana Azmi, Girish Karnad, Anant Nag, Amrish Puri, Satyadev Dubey, Smita Patil, Naseeruddin Shah, Mohan Agashe', null, 'A man whose wife is abducted seeks to have the culprits prosecuted for their crime, but no one will help him. Meanwhile, the wife—abused and berated by her abductors—cannot bring herself to face her husband.', 'A man whose wife is abducted seeks to have the culprits prosecuted for their crime, but no one will help him. Meanwhile, the wife—abused and berated by her abductors—cannot bring herself to face her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdZmPBU6bkF6JFSvGUo3MbhhDa5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198524'),
  ('1116942920532155684', 'Nishi Ginza Station', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shōhei Imamura, Kirio Urayama, Kumenobu Fujioka', 'Shōhei Imamura', 'Frank Nagai, Shinichi Yanagisawa, Hisano Yamaoka, Masahiko Shimazu, Kō Nishimura, Kotoe Hatsui, Shoichi Ozawa, Kyoko Hori', null, 'This short comedy concerns the extramarital affair of a drugstore owner. It is based on a popular song by the star of the film, Frank Nagai.', 'This short comedy concerns the extramarital affair of a drugstore owner. It is based on a popular song by the star of the film, Frank Nagai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAZt5Oe7LQn8tdtwKHH89bnzOlS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46150'),
  ('1053733957086422138', 'Nit-Witty Kitty', 1951, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Lillian Randolph', 'NR', 'Tom has amnesia and believes he''s a mouse. Jerry, finding him more obnoxious as a fellow rodent than as a cat, seeks to cure him with a blow to the head.', 'Tom has amnesia and believes he''s a mouse. Jerry, finding him more obnoxious as a fellow rodent than as a cat, seeks to cure him with a blow to the head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkJinLCkQjpDOBOIuYI537EXIaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74530'),
  ('813095249147643837', 'Nitaboh', 2004, 'Animation, History, Music', 'Hiroshi Kugimiya, Akio Nishizawa', 'Akio Nishizawa', 'Takateru Murata, Akio Otsuka, Hiroaki Hirata, Masako Katsuki, Satoshi Hino, Rokuro Naya, Ikuko Tani', null, 'At a young age, Nitaroh is stricken with an illness that leaves him blind. He inherits the shamisen guitar once used by his mother and is taught its basics by a blind travelling shamisen player. In time with the help of friends old and new, he walks the paths that leads to his ultimate fate - that of founder of the Tsugaru style of shamisen play.', 'At a young age, Nitaroh is stricken with an illness that leaves him blind. He inherits the shamisen guitar once used by his mother and is taught its basics by a blind travelling shamisen player. In time with the help of friends old and new, he walks the paths that leads to his ultimate fate - that of founder of the Tsugaru style of shamisen play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVtd6mEU52zPWmFXwMDGN95FmiT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20062'),
  ('990699117784937351', 'Nitemare', 1980, 'Animation', 'John Lasseter', 'John Lasseter', null, 'NR', 'A child, who is afraid, of the dark forms a unique relationship with the objects that once frightened him.', 'A child, who is afraid, of the dark forms a unique relationship with the objects that once frightened him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCt2UXFJD6Zkf8pyaA8rdCllC6U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208658'),
  ('435836992506607654', 'Nitram', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Germain McMicking, Nathan Croft, Oliver Tummel', 'Shaun Grant', 'Caleb Landry Jones, Judy Davis, Anthony LaPaglia, Sean Keenan, Essie Davis, Phoebe Taylor, Lucy-Rose Leonard, Annabel Marshall-Roth', null, 'Based on true events, "Nitram" lives with his parents in suburban Australia in the mid-90s. He lives a life of isolation and frustration at never fitting in. As his anger grows, he begins a slow descent into a nightmare that culminates in the most heinous of acts.', 'Based on true events, "Nitram" lives with his parents in suburban Australia in the mid-90s. He lives a life of isolation and frustration at never fitting in. As his anger grows, he begins a slow descent into a nightmare that culminates in the most heinous of acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9dGkbHpSM254QhoLNxetvszcHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:797457'),
  ('640335167911416376', 'Nitrate Kisses', 1992, 'Documentary', 'Barbara Hammer, Barbara Hammer', 'Barbara Hammer', 'Barbara Hammer, Peter Cramer, Frances Lorraine', null, 'Essay documentary explores eroded emulsions and images for lost vestiges of lesbian and gay culture. First feature by a pioneer of lesbian cinema, Hammer weaves gay and lesbian couples with footage that unearths the forbidden and invisible history of a marginalized people.', 'Essay documentary explores eroded emulsions and images for lost vestiges of lesbian and gay culture. First feature by a pioneer of lesbian cinema, Hammer weaves gay and lesbian couples with footage that unearths the forbidden and invisible history of a marginalized people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5dy2LpDzKLYqKN3HCf3X4XZMW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162680'),
  ('1106606464066200365', 'Nitro', 2007, 'Action', 'Alain Desrochers, Jean Frenette, Bruce Chun', 'Alain Desrochers, Benoît Guichard', 'Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Lucie Laurier, Martin Matte, Raymond Bouchard, Myriam Tallard, Antoine Desrochers, Tony Conte, Réal Bossé', null, 'Max leads a good life with Alice and their son Théo; that is until Alice is threatened with death while waiting for a heart transplant. Max promises Théo that he will save Alice, but to keep his word he must find a heart, and fast. Since time is running out and he must find a solution, Max decides to reconnect with his troubled past. His decision will change his life in ways he could never imagine', 'Max leads a good life with Alice and their son Théo; that is until Alice is threatened with death while waiting for a heart transplant. Max promises Théo that he will save Alice, but to keep his word he must find a heart, and fast. Since time is running out and he must find a solution, Max decides to reconnect with his troubled past. His decision will change his life in ways he could never imagine', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYiHJHIAkrdEQ8qQITARkBKslnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16143'),
  ('872252420282459395', 'Nitro Circus: The Movie', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Documentary', 'Jeremy Rawle, Gregg Godfrey', 'Jeremy Rawle, Gregg Godfrey, Travis Pastrana', 'Travis Pastrana, Jolene Van Vugt, Tommy Passemante, Jeremy Rawle, Gregg Godfrey, Greg Powell, Erik Roner, Jim DeChamp', 'PG-13', 'You will see Travis Pastrana and the whole Nitro Circus crew perform some of the most ridiculous, awe-inspiring, and simply insane stunts ever caught on camera. Coming to you in three dimensional glory, it will feel like you are there sitting shotgun with the crew.', 'You will see Travis Pastrana and the whole Nitro Circus crew perform some of the most ridiculous, awe-inspiring, and simply insane stunts ever caught on camera. Coming to you in three dimensional glory, it will feel like you are there sitting shotgun with the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofDDFfZ40dnGUPyjaDSPwqCQ12K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110112'),
  ('610222623924450738', 'Nitro Rush', 2016, 'Action', 'Tobie Marier Robitaille, Alain Desrochers', 'Martin Girard', 'Guillaume Lemay-Thivierge, Raymond Bouchard, Antoine Desrochers, Michel Charette, Madeleine Péloquin, Alexandre Goyette, Antoine Olivier Pilon, Jean-Nicolas Verreault', null, 'Max learns that his 17-year-old son Theo has just been recruited by a criminal organization. Desperate to get him out of this situation, Max escapes from prison. He discovers that Theo and his best friend Charly have fallen under the control of Daphne, an alluring femme fatale, who is taking advantage of the teens’ expert computer skills to plan a bold and risky burglary. Quickly understanding he’ll be unable to persuade his son to walk away from it all, Max joins the team in order to protect them.', 'Max learns that his 17-year-old son Theo has just been recruited by a criminal organization. Desperate to get him out of this situation, Max escapes from prison. He discovers that Theo and his best friend Charly have fallen under the control of Daphne, an alluring femme fatale, who is taking advantage of the teens’ expert computer skills to plan a bold and risky burglary. Quickly understanding he’ll be unable to persuade his son to walk away from it all, Max joins the team in order to protect them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xndXcYyZ3OePSLKdVBevQZKPsXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412361'),
  ('107179910060874718', 'Nix', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Ryan Broomberg, Cambria Hankin', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Woodrow Wilson Hancock III, Skyler Caleb', 'James Zimbardi, Dee Wallace, Michael Paré, Angie Teodora Dick, Skyler Caleb, Niesha Renee Guilbot, Angela Cole, Michael Devorzon', null, 'When a mysterious entity manifests itself, a family finds themselves on a scary and dark journey into their own self-created madness.', 'When a mysterious entity manifests itself, a family finds themselves on a scary and dark journey into their own self-created madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmAFOmkhsTXJlRptAgoKn77Odue.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844380'),
  ('591917356116626892', 'Nixon', 1995, 'Drama, History', 'Oliver Stone, Robert Richardson, Maggie Murphy', 'Oliver Stone, Stephen J. Rivele, Christopher Wilkinson', 'Anthony Hopkins, Joan Allen, Powers Boothe, Ed Harris, Bob Hoskins, E.G. Marshall, David Paymer, David Hyde Pierce', 'R', 'A look at President Richard M. Nixon—a man carrying the fate of the world on his shoulders while battling the self-destructive demands from within—spanning his troubled boyhood in California to the shocking Watergate scandal that would end his Presidency.', 'A look at President Richard M. Nixon—a man carrying the fate of the world on his shoulders while battling the self-destructive demands from within—spanning his troubled boyhood in California to the shocking Watergate scandal that would end his Presidency.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz2MTGr2wpDZLirgV2rGHBdA2t3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10858'),
  ('418188645976705329', 'Niyazi Gül Dörtnala', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Hakan Algül, Gökhan Atılmış', 'Ata Demirer, Vedat Özdemiroğlu, Öğünç Ersöz', 'Ata Demirer, Demet Akbağ, Şebnem Bozoklu, Ayşenil Şamlıoğlu, Levent Ülgen, Kıvanç Baran Arslan, Tolga Coşkun, Ferit Kaya', null, 'Professor Niyazi Gül is an animal-loving veterinarian who possesses the unique ability to speak with animals. Living a quiet life in İzmir while developing a secret formula with his assistant, Hediye, his world is turned upside down when Sultan and Rıza drag him into a chaotic horse racing scheme.', 'Professor Niyazi Gül is an animal-loving veterinarian who possesses the unique ability to speak with animals. Living a quiet life in İzmir while developing a secret formula with his assistant, Hediye, his world is turned upside down when Sultan and Rıza drag him into a chaotic horse racing scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nLAFwuC1w3uHvarpRMwyynp0LW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340426'),
  ('475661618310216689', 'Njan Gandharvan', 1991, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'P. Padmarajan, Venu', 'P. Padmarajan', 'Nitish Bharadwaj, Suparna Anand, M G Soman, K. B. Ganesh Kumar, Philomina, Vinduja Menon, Thezni Khan', null, 'The film is an esoteric fantasy about a girl and her passion for a celestial lover, who keeps appearing from a wooden statue that she found on a beach but is invisible to others.', 'The film is an esoteric fantasy about a girl and her passion for a celestial lover, who keeps appearing from a wooden statue that she found on a beach but is invisible to others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXmnQ3eQ0YQScIKbMzE0TBW7FUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255317'),
