  ('537066732418904344', 'No Home Movie', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman', 'Chantal Akerman, Natalia Akerman, Sylvaine Akerman', null, 'Akerman films her mother Natalia, an elderly woman of Polish origin, in her Brussels apartment. For two hours, we will see them eating, chatting and sharing memories, sometimes accompanied by Sylvaine, Chantal''s sister. Also, and to show how small the world has become, Chantal remains in contact with her mother at other times of the year via Skype from lands as far away from Belgium as Oklahoma or New York.', 'Akerman films her mother Natalia, an elderly woman of Polish origin, in her Brussels apartment. For two hours, we will see them eating, chatting and sharing memories, sometimes accompanied by Sylvaine, Chantal''s sister. Also, and to show how small the world has become, Chantal remains in contact with her mother at other times of the year via Skype from lands as far away from Belgium as Oklahoma or New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gj9F81jdks53jXribP50lxqnCnv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:354388'),
  ('374647449623830941', 'No Hunting', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Jack Hannah, Bill Thompson, Milt Schaffer', 'NR', 'Donald''s "hunting spirit" takes him on a hunting trip. Unfortunately, everybody else seems to have the same idea.', 'Donald''s "hunting spirit" takes him on a hunting trip. Unfortunately, everybody else seems to have the same idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDqapSk5DFbTSfFNigWAAxfnMzs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67138'),
  ('238907603265427616', 'No Impact Man', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Laura Gabbert, Justin Schein', null, 'Colin Beavan, Michelle Conlin', 'NR', 'Follow the Manhattan-based Beavan family as they abandon their high consumption 5th Avenue lifestyle and try to live a year while making no net environmental impact.', 'Follow the Manhattan-based Beavan family as they abandon their high consumption 5th Avenue lifestyle and try to live a year while making no net environmental impact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYnXmhbViEOsZlMED0UvHhdJws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30873'),
  ('594849640759991095', 'No Kids', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bruno Roberti, Ariel Winograd, Renata Biagiola', 'Mariano Vera, Pablo Solarz', 'Diego Peretti, Maribel Verdú, Guadalupe Manent, Martín Piroyansky, Horacio Fontova, Marina Bellati, Guillermo Arengo, Pablo Rago', null, 'Gabriel has been separated for four years now. Since then his 8 year old daughter is the center of his life. Completely avoiding getting involved in a new romantic relationship, Gabriel focus all his energy in his daughter and work. This plan gets spoiled when Vicky, a platonic love from his adolescence, now a beautiful and independent woman appears in his life. When romance is about to start, she puts one condition: She would never get involved with a man with children. She just does not want children in her life. When Gabriel is confronted with this, he says he has no children. From that moment on his life becomes a torment, playing every trick at hand in order to hide his child and belongings from Vicky in every date.', 'Gabriel has been separated for four years now. Since then his 8 year old daughter is the center of his life. Completely avoiding getting involved in a new romantic relationship, Gabriel focus all his energy in his daughter and work. This plan gets spoiled when Vicky, a platonic love from his adolescence, now a beautiful and independent woman appears in his life. When romance is about to start, she puts one condition: She would never get involved with a man with children. She just does not want children in her life. When Gabriel is confronted with this, he says he has no children. From that moment on his life becomes a torment, playing every trick at hand in order to hide his child and belongings from Vicky in every date.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ABPcRThqfqv7o9ohhkLKEc6gZ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342163'),
  ('1014630431485672096', 'No Land''s Song', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Ayat Najafi, Koohyar Kalari, Sarah Blum', 'Ayat Najafi', 'Sara Najafi, Sayeh Sodeyfi, Parvin Azimi, Imed Alibi, Chakad Fesharaki', null, 'In Iran, since the 1979 Islamic revolution, women are no longer allowed to sing in public as soloists - at least in front of men. Defying censorship and taboos, the young composer Sara Najafi is determined to organize an official concert for solo female singers. In order to support their fight, Sara and her friends invite three French female singers, Elise Caron, Jeanne Cherhal and Emel Mathlouthi, to join them in Tehran and collaborate on their musical project, re-opening a musical bridge between Europe and Iran. Are they going to succeed and finally be gathered in Tehran, sing together, on stage and without restrictions, and to open a door towards a new freedom of women in Iran ?', 'In Iran, since the 1979 Islamic revolution, women are no longer allowed to sing in public as soloists - at least in front of men. Defying censorship and taboos, the young composer Sara Najafi is determined to organize an official concert for solo female singers. In order to support their fight, Sara and her friends invite three French female singers, Elise Caron, Jeanne Cherhal and Emel Mathlouthi, to join them in Tehran and collaborate on their musical project, re-opening a musical bridge between Europe and Iran. Are they going to succeed and finally be gathered in Tehran, sing together, on stage and without restrictions, and to open a door towards a new freedom of women in Iran ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2230XBPTwLn5BttjLxsESF1XlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339568'),
  ('581052725114757117', 'No Limit', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'Simon Christidis, James Canal, Alice Di Giacomo', 'David M. Rosenthal', 'Camille Rowe, Sofiane Zermani, César Domboy, Laurent Fernandez, Zacharie Chasseriaud, Natalie Mitson, Muriel Combeau, Alexandre Poole', null, 'Roxana Aubrey decides to drop her studies and escape her life in Paris for a free diving course in the south of France. She is quickly pulled into a life that reaches new depths brought by the weight of an ocean''s descent.', 'Roxana Aubrey decides to drop her studies and escape her life in Paris for a free diving course in the south of France. She is quickly pulled into a life that reaches new depths brought by the weight of an ocean''s descent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96ZYNAVN5RhBJqkijYkgFjQA630.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:911129'),
  ('501941734182110872', 'No Lo Escuches', 2024, null, 'Alexmir Dordelly', null, null, null, 'In the early 1990s, a group of friends escape their daily routine and hit the road for a fun weekend getaway. Anthony and his friends arrive at an abandoned housing complex ready to have a blast. However, an unknown entity suddenly fills the sky and influences the friends'' behavior, unleashing a night of terror and turning it into an inexplicable and deadly experience.', 'In the early 1990s, a group of friends escape their daily routine and hit the road for a fun weekend getaway. Anthony and his friends arrive at an abandoned housing complex ready to have a blast. However, an unknown entity suddenly fills the sky and influences the friends'' behavior, unleashing a night of terror and turning it into an inexplicable and deadly experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wMckWiOI0YIiww5ho31eB1a7qd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1480904'),
  ('190071428561483852', 'No Longer Heroine', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Takashi Komatsu', 'Erika Yoshida', 'Mirei Kiritani, Kento Yamazaki, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Ayano Fukuda, Miwako Wagatsuma, Maryjun Takahashi, Akira Nakao, Shingo Yanagisawa', null, 'Hatori Matsuzaki is a female high school student. She has a crush on her childhood friend Rita Terasaka and believes he will eventually choose her as her heroine, but Rita Terasaka begins dating Miho Adachi. Meanwhile, the most popular male student, Kosuke Hiromitsu takes an interest in Hatori Matsuzaki.', 'Hatori Matsuzaki is a female high school student. She has a crush on her childhood friend Rita Terasaka and believes he will eventually choose her as her heroine, but Rita Terasaka begins dating Miho Adachi. Meanwhile, the most popular male student, Kosuke Hiromitsu takes an interest in Hatori Matsuzaki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lg4lHPvbNMZ0QiROTQ2Q7TrwsA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341540'),
  ('551457640400508885', 'No Longer Human', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mika Ninagawa, Ryuto Kondo', 'Kaeko Hayafune', 'Shun Oguri, Rie Miyazawa, Erika Sawajiri, Fumi Nikaido, Ryo Narita, Yudai Chiba, Koji Seto, Kengo Kora', null, 'The story of Osamu Dazai, one of Japan''s most celebrated novelists, absorbed in alcohol and love; married and in a relationship with two other lovers.', 'The story of Osamu Dazai, one of Japan''s most celebrated novelists, absorbed in alcohol and love; married and in a relationship with two other lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFxXZQpmHLNCIBOYEZXs70HbXs0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567591'),
  ('289952150214753939', 'No Longer Kids', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Samir Al Asfory, Fathi Abd El Aal', 'Bahgat Kamar', 'Saeed Saleh, Hassan Mostafa, Ahmed Zaki, Younes Shalaby, Karima Mokhtar, Nadia Shukry', null, 'The play tells the story of four siblings trying to stop their father from leaving his family for another woman after one of them accidentally finds a love letter from an unknown woman to their father.', 'The play tells the story of four siblings trying to stop their father from leaving his family for another woman after one of them accidentally finds a love letter from an unknown woman to their father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUX45pVeOjNS1VNs0NlHCBZBOZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56334'),
  ('454364349683937345', 'No Looking Back', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edward Burns', 'Edward Burns', 'Lauren Holly, Edward Burns, Jon Bon Jovi, Blythe Danner, Connie Britton, Ellen McElduff, Jennifer Esposito, Kathleen Doyle', 'R', 'Charlie returns to his old town where he meets his ex-girlfriend again and tries to get her back.', 'Charlie returns to his old town where he meets his ex-girlfriend again and tries to get her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrhlaUJn8y9rRKhvVRraOhbNSIz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93350'),
  ('374771217140967416', 'No Looking Back', 2022, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Timofey Shpak, Anastasiya Anosova, Kseniya Makarova', 'Kirill Sokolov', 'Viktoriya Korotkova, Sofya Krugova, Anna Mikhalkova, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Olga Lapshina, Danil Steklov, Vitaliy Khaev, Igor Grabuzov', null, 'After four years in prison, Olya decides to start over. And first of all she wants to get her ten-year-old daughter back. However, the overbearing grandma isn''t letting her grandchild go without a fight. The family conflict quickly gets out of control and turns into a wild chase. And it definitely won''t end well for everyone.', 'After four years in prison, Olya decides to start over. And first of all she wants to get her ten-year-old daughter back. However, the overbearing grandma isn''t letting her grandchild go without a fight. The family conflict quickly gets out of control and turns into a wild chase. And it definitely won''t end well for everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lPLbDbX0bO2bGbqreYHcH45FpR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591662'),
  ('244288848891800986', 'No Love Lost', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erwan Le Duc', 'Erwan Le Duc', 'Nahuel Pérez Biscayart, Céleste Brunnquell, Maud Wyler, Mohammed Louridi, Mercedes Dassy, Alexandre Steiger, Camille Rutherford, Noémie Lvovsky', null, 'Étienne is barely twenty when he falls in love with Valérie. They are hardly any more when their daughter Rosa is born. And then, one day, Valérie leaves and never returns. He chooses not to make a drama of it and builds a happy life for him and his child. Sixteen years later, when Rosa is about to lead her own life, Étienne recognizes his wife in a television report. The past brutally resurfaces, and father and daughter are propelled into one last chaotic family journey.', 'Étienne is barely twenty when he falls in love with Valérie. They are hardly any more when their daughter Rosa is born. And then, one day, Valérie leaves and never returns. He chooses not to make a drama of it and builds a happy life for him and his child. Sixteen years later, when Rosa is about to lead her own life, Étienne recognizes his wife in a television report. The past brutally resurfaces, and father and daughter are propelled into one last chaotic family journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOq2Z3O7ubFTWxotBdtLLDtBjgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989238'),
  ('214920383616540861', 'No Man of God', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, History', 'Karina Silva, Amber Sealey', 'C. Robert Cargill', 'Elijah Wood, Luke Kirby, Aleksa Palladino, Robert Patrick, W. Earl Brown, Gilbert Owuor, Christian Clemenson, Hugo Armstrong', 'NR', 'The complicated relationship that formed between the FBI analyst Bill Hagmaier and serial killer Ted Bundy during Bundy''s final years on death row.', 'The complicated relationship that formed between the FBI analyst Bill Hagmaier and serial killer Ted Bundy during Bundy''s final years on death row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr8wtSX1IGV7vLocSMzPnqGvsjq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716594'),
  ('37612786209313392', 'No Man of Her Own', 1932, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Wesley Ruggles, Leo Tover, William Kaplan', 'Maurine Dallas Watkins, Milton Herbert Gropper', 'Clark Gable, Carole Lombard, Dorothy Mackaill, Grant Mitchell, Elizabeth Patterson, George Barbier, J. Farrell MacDonald, Tommy Conlon', 'NR', 'An on-the-lam New York card shark marries a small-town librarian who thinks he''s a businessman.', 'An on-the-lam New York card shark marries a small-town librarian who thinks he''s a businessman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLaI6pxeXBQAI2JroGC2faPuD4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36513'),
