  ('849330122434327748', 'No More Bets', 2023, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shen Ao, Wang Tianxing', 'Zhang Yifan, Xu Luyang', 'Zhang Yixing, Wang Chuanjun, Yong Mei, Zhou Ye, Jin Chen, Darren Wang, Sunny Sun, Carmen Tong Ka-Man', 'NR', 'A depressed programmer and a model decide to seek gold as a seemingly good job opportunity, but they inadvertently become involved in a well-planned Internet scam.', 'A depressed programmer and a model decide to seek gold as a seemingly good job opportunity, but they inadvertently become involved in a well-planned Internet scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GPgQAzJRmbsrd3UvnkBJikefzp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1121612'),
  ('651630260795055046', 'No More Mr. Nice Guy', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Detlev Buck, Roger Heeremann', 'Ernst Kahl, Detlev Buck', 'Joachim Król, Horst Krause, Konstantin Kotlyarov, Sophie Rois, Detlev Buck, Heinrich Giskes, Ingo Naujoks, Jan-Gregor Kremp', null, 'The brothers Kipp and Most set off to inherit their grandmother''s estate. Along the way, they meet Viktor, a deserted Russian soldier who kidnaps them, and Nadine, who joins them voluntarily. On their way to their inheritance, the protagonists get into some seemingly hopeless situations.', 'The brothers Kipp and Most set off to inherit their grandmother''s estate. Along the way, they meet Viktor, a deserted Russian soldier who kidnaps them, and Nadine, who joins them voluntarily. On their way to their inheritance, the protagonists get into some seemingly hopeless situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yR3XAi4V1KZyJxiYfeII6a6DpWX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6553'),
  ('265595970780469756', 'No More School', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Marco Petry, Axel Block', 'Stefan Wood, Marco Petry', 'Daniel Brühl, Jasmin Schwiers, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Mina Tander, Tim Egloff, Lavinia Wilson, Christian Näthe, Axel Stein', null, 'The last three weeks of school life have begun: After the Abitur, Germany''s leaving certificate, the friends and schoolmates of Gymnasium Kerkheim (Kerkheim High) will not see each other again so soon. It is a hard time for Markus and his girl Sandra from a lower grade, as he wants to hang out with his old friends, whereas she wants him to be there for her. It''s an even harder time for Dirk, who is to be expelled from school if he fails the math exam that is coming up around midday, and it is the hardest time for Michael, who is a perfect pupil, but has no fun in life at all - and doesn''t even know it yet. When Steven calls out a party to celebrate his letter of exemption from the army, they all get together for one of the last real cool events ever.', 'The last three weeks of school life have begun: After the Abitur, Germany''s leaving certificate, the friends and schoolmates of Gymnasium Kerkheim (Kerkheim High) will not see each other again so soon. It is a hard time for Markus and his girl Sandra from a lower grade, as he wants to hang out with his old friends, whereas she wants him to be there for her. It''s an even harder time for Dirk, who is to be expelled from school if he fails the math exam that is coming up around midday, and it is the hardest time for Michael, who is a perfect pupil, but has no fun in life at all - and doesn''t even know it yet. When Steven calls out a party to celebrate his letter of exemption from the army, they all get together for one of the last real cool events ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbGTIhLDCjnY6QvopLZ37DGvTdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9565'),
  ('578911786671800982', 'No Name on the Bullet', 1959, 'Action, Thriller, Western', 'Jack Arnold, Harold Lipstein, John Sherwood', 'Gene L. Coon', 'Audie Murphy, Charles Drake, Joan Evans, Virginia Grey, Warren Stevens, R.G. Armstrong, Willis Bouchey, Edgar Stehli', null, 'When hired killer John Gant rides into Lordsburg, the town''s folk become paranoid as each leading citizen has enemies capable of using the services of a professional killer for personal revenge.', 'When hired killer John Gant rides into Lordsburg, the town''s folk become paranoid as each leading citizen has enemies capable of using the services of a professional killer for personal revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lqajhCQhtyzDfj7vKAfpVVw68B8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51997'),
  ('829183737985309635', 'No Night Is Too Long', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Tom Shankland, Paul Sarossy', 'Kevin Elyot', 'Lee Williams, Marc Warren, Mikela J. Mikael, Beverley Breuer, Emily Holmes, Harry Rob Bruner, Salvatore Antonio, Philip Granger', null, 'A chance meeting, a stolen kiss and a sudden flare of passion sets a handsome young university student on a journey of betrayal, heartbreak and murder.', 'A chance meeting, a stolen kiss and a sudden flare of passion sets a handsome young university student on a journey of betrayal, heartbreak and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81uNqDEDFrM9NmdOigwQIjXNF2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65830'),
  ('745922629434846173', 'No No Sleep', 2015, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Liao Pen-jung, Chang Jhong-yuan', null, 'Lee Kang-sheng, Masanobu Ando', null, 'In 2015, Tsai Ming-Liang was once again invited by the Hong Kong International Film Festival to make the opening short film. This time, he selected Shibuya station in Tokyo as his main filming location and invited the famous Japanese actor Masanobu Ando to appear alongside Lee Kang-Sheng. They sleep separately at a capsule hotel and cleanse themselves at a public bath. Their fatigued bodies yearn for sleep but restless minds keep them for falling asleep. "No No Sleep" won the Best Director Award at the Taipei Film Festival.', 'In 2015, Tsai Ming-Liang was once again invited by the Hong Kong International Film Festival to make the opening short film. This time, he selected Shibuya station in Tokyo as his main filming location and invited the famous Japanese actor Masanobu Ando to appear alongside Lee Kang-Sheng. They sleep separately at a capsule hotel and cleanse themselves at a public bath. Their fatigued bodies yearn for sleep but restless minds keep them for falling asleep. "No No Sleep" won the Best Director Award at the Taipei Film Festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dBS3hTFZ6sO6NPXqI3L8nvXYWB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340448'),
  ('889925470885527538', 'No One Gets Out Alive', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stephen Murphy, James McGeown, Liam Lock', 'Jon Croker, Fernanda Coppel', 'Cristina Rodlo, Marc Menchaca, David Figlioli, Claudia Coulter, David Barrera, Moronkę Akinola, Mitchell Mullen, Vala Norén', 'R', 'An immigrant in search of the American dream is forced to take a room in a boarding house and soon finds herself in a nightmare from which she can''t escape.', 'An immigrant in search of the American dream is forced to take a room in a boarding house and soon finds herself in a nightmare from which she can''t escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZUostLcCZYgcuBuAjmuSkBggiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:740925'),
  ('263832672794345252', 'No One Heard the Scream', 1973, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Francisco Fraile, Eloy de la Iglesia', 'Gabriel Moreno Burgos, Antonio Fos, Eloy de la Iglesia', 'Carmen Sevilla, Vicente Parra, María Asquerino, Antonio Casas, Tony Isbert, Goyo Lebrero, Felipe Solano, Ramón Lillo', null, 'Elisa witnesses her neighbor, Miguel, dump his wife''s corpse into an elevator shaft and is forced to be his prime accomplice to get rid of the body. The situation slowly spirals as a relationship forms between them, followed by the unforeseen return of Elisa''s current lover.', 'Elisa witnesses her neighbor, Miguel, dump his wife''s corpse into an elevator shaft and is forced to be his prime accomplice to get rid of the body. The situation slowly spirals as a relationship forms between them, followed by the unforeseen return of Elisa''s current lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5xKemGiJdI5KyvKqTbgHOKqP5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29338'),
  ('898207424362819082', 'No One Killed Jessica', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Anay Goswami', 'Raj Kumar Gupta, Amitabh Bhattacharya', 'Rani Mukerji, Vidya Balan, Myra Karn, Neil Bhoopalam, Mohammed Zeeshan Ayyub, Satyadeep Misra, Yogendra Tiku, Purnendu Bhattacharya', null, 'The true story of model Jessica Lall who was shot dead in a restaurant and the campaign to bring her killer to justice.', 'The true story of model Jessica Lall who was shot dead in a restaurant and the campaign to bring her killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIFJXzzfG2sRxCn1T03WVN0gl9v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53569'),
  ('355628651682830721', 'No One Knows About Persian Cats', 2009, 'Drama, Music', 'Bahman Ghobadi, Mehdi Pourmoussa, Sepehr Mikaeilian', 'Hossein Mortezaeiyan, Roxana Saberi, Bahman Ghobadi', 'Negar Shaghaghi, Ashkan Koshanejad, Hamed Behdad, Babak Mirzakhani, Kosh Mirzahi, Bahman Ghobadi', null, 'Iranian musicians Negar and Ashkan look for band members to play at a London concert ... and the visa that allows them to leave Tehran to do so.', 'Iranian musicians Negar and Ashkan look for band members to play at a London concert ... and the visa that allows them to leave Tehran to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhsZEUHpo6hRw4IKJE5qL2oRiUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51413'),
  ('55994377729016591', 'No One Lives', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ryuhei Kitamura, Daniel Pearl, Geanina Vasilescu', 'David Cohen', 'Luke Evans, Adelaide Clemens, Laura Ramsey, Lee Tergesen, Derek Magyar, America Olivo, Beau Knapp, Lindsey Shaw', 'R', 'A gang of ruthless highway killers kidnap a wealthy couple traveling cross country only to shockingly discover that things are not what they seem.', 'A gang of ruthless highway killers kidnap a wealthy couple traveling cross country only to shockingly discover that things are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9wDmRcQngl9Jo7Go3EU7f2W15m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123109'),
  ('180694990376916015', 'No One Loves Anyone For More Than Two Years', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Clovis Mello', 'Rodrigo Vasconcelos, Marina Meira, Paula Santos', 'Gabriela Duarte, Marcelo Faria, Cláudio Gabriel, Julianne Trevisol, Pedro Brício, Michel Melamed, Branca Messina, Ernani Moraes', null, '"No one loves anyone for more than two years" is an adaptation of Nelson Rodrigues'' work about five couples that live in Brazil in the early 60''s, who are seen by the society as conventional people, but whose intimate lives turn out to be morally questionable.', '"No one loves anyone for more than two years" is an adaptation of Nelson Rodrigues'' work about five couples that live in Brazil in the early 60''s, who are seen by the society as conventional people, but whose intimate lives turn out to be morally questionable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPkpQo594Aw4FC0RD5qKdYxR2qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361790'),
  ('751775104981386720', 'No One Will Know', 2025, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Vincent Maël Cardona, Pierre-François Créancier, Marie Levent', 'Vincent Maël Cardona, Olivier Demangel, Dominique Baumard', 'Pio Marmaï, Sofiane Zermani, Panayotis Pascot, Lucie Zhang, Joseph Olivennes, Maria de Medeiros, Némo Schiffman, Patrice Tépasso', null, 'All begins in a rundown bar outside of Paris where a regular man realizes he has a winning lottery ticket only to be shot in a crime that needs to be quickly covered up.', 'All begins in a rundown bar outside of Paris where a regular man realizes he has a winning lottery ticket only to be shot in a crime that needs to be quickly covered up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dusHHiyU3UV4M5WZiUwecudCn25.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1205648'),
  ('665654200144274166', 'No One Will Notice You''re Naked', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Angelo Filippini', 'Steno, Giulio Scarnicci, Raimondo Vianello', 'Lando Buzzanca, Pamela Tiffin, Renzo Marignano, Gigi Ballista, Rita Forzano, Steffen Zacharias, Dominique Boschero, Alessandro Figurelli', null, 'Rosario Trapanese is determined to show he is not the typical old-fashion Sicilian. When his firm sends him to Denmark, a more sexual liberated nation than Italy, he immediately adopts the Danish "free-sexual-taboo" way of life. He meets and married Karen and succeeded to come back in Italy. Once here, he discovers Karen did a porn movie and his determination on being open minded is over. The typical Sicilian jealousy drives him crazy. Anyway, after a while, Rosario understands that what his wife did before to meet him it has not to be an issue for him. Karen confesses Rosario she signed a contract for a second movie and she could refuse only by paying a fine. The couple doesn''t have enough money so they need to find a solution. And what a solution!', 'Rosario Trapanese is determined to show he is not the typical old-fashion Sicilian. When his firm sends him to Denmark, a more sexual liberated nation than Italy, he immediately adopts the Danish "free-sexual-taboo" way of life. He meets and married Karen and succeeded to come back in Italy. Once here, he discovers Karen did a porn movie and his determination on being open minded is over. The typical Sicilian jealousy drives him crazy. Anyway, after a while, Rosario understands that what his wife did before to meet him it has not to be an issue for him. Karen confesses Rosario she signed a contract for a second movie and she could refuse only by paying a fine. The couple doesn''t have enough money so they need to find a solution. And what a solution!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zWLjZ0EDeDnaadqWRiZHorB7FTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201383'),
  ('858024174612989548', 'No One Will Play with Me', 1976, 'Drama', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', null, null, 'A darkly humorous short documentary about a preschool-age boy ostracised from interactions with his classmates until a girl who has become interested in his pet crow provides the link to social acceptance.', 'A darkly humorous short documentary about a preschool-age boy ostracised from interactions with his classmates until a girl who has become interested in his pet crow provides the link to social acceptance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQuPU9EqIvOyTnsubnlLkugCv5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128410'),
  ('371289005256460505', 'No One Will Save You', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Brian Duffield, Aaron Morton, Jason Blumenfeld', 'Brian Duffield', 'Kaitlyn Dever, Elizabeth Kaluev, Zack Duhame, Lauren L. Murray, Geraldine Singer, Dane Rhodes, Evangeline Rose, Dari Lynn Griffin', 'PG-13', 'A lonely woman battles extraterrestrials who threaten her future while forcing her to face her past.', 'A lonely woman battles extraterrestrials who threaten her future while forcing her to face her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehGIDAMaYy6Eg0o8ga0oqflDjqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820609'),
  ('69575470797406910', 'No One Would Tell', 1996, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Noel Nosseck', 'Steven Loring', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Fred Savage, Gregory Alan Williams, Heather McComb, Sally Jessy Raphael, Rodney Eastman, Season Hubley, Michelle Phillips', 'PG', 'Shy sixteen-year-old Stacy Collins can''t believe that the most popular guy in school, an attractive athlete named Bobby Tennison, is interested in her. At first she is flattered by his constant attention, but then he becomes possessive and jealous-telling her who she can speak to and what she can wear. Threats escalate into violence when Bobby thinks Stacy has stepped out of line. Soon she is walking on egg shells and living in fear. Having seen the tell-tale bruises, Stacy''s best friend convinces her to break things off with Bobby-but in a moment of weakness, Stacy goes to meet him. It will be the last time she is seen alive.', 'Shy sixteen-year-old Stacy Collins can''t believe that the most popular guy in school, an attractive athlete named Bobby Tennison, is interested in her. At first she is flattered by his constant attention, but then he becomes possessive and jealous-telling her who she can speak to and what she can wear. Threats escalate into violence when Bobby thinks Stacy has stepped out of line. Soon she is walking on egg shells and living in fear. Having seen the tell-tale bruises, Stacy''s best friend convinces her to break things off with Bobby-but in a moment of weakness, Stacy goes to meet him. It will be the last time she is seen alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTjhj2v2HWeccSION78O8x9R8OC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72116'),
  ('1121814975330091715', 'No One Writes to the Colonel', 1999, 'Drama', 'Arturo Ripstein, Mayra Segura, Guillermo Granillo', 'Paz Alicia Garciadiego', 'Fernando Luján, Marisa Paredes, Salma Hayek Pinault, Rafael Inclán, Ernesto Yáñez, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Esteban Soberanes, Patricia Reyes Spíndola', 'NR', 'Every Friday, the Colonel puts on his only suit and goes to the dock to await a letter announcing the arrival of his pension. But the townsfolk all know that this pension will never come. His wife also knows it, and even he knows it. But he is still waiting, living with the pain of the death of his son.', 'Every Friday, the Colonel puts on his only suit and goes to the dock to await a letter announcing the arrival of his pension. But the townsfolk all know that this pension will never come. His wife also knows it, and even he knows it. But he is still waiting, living with the pain of the death of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1KxUgvZEB4tJLL4rVursK5WKCRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120129'),
  ('881801194083748065', 'No One''s with the Calves', 2022, 'Drama', 'Sabrina Sarabi, Max Preiss', 'Sabrina Sarabi', 'Saskia Rosendahl, Rick Okon, Godehard Giese, Hendrik Heutmann, Enno Trebs, Peter Moltzen, Anne Weinknecht, Elisa Schlott', null, 'Five houses, one bus stop, cows and nothing but fields. 24-year-old Christin lives on the farm of her long-term boyfriend Jan. The exciting post-reunification years that defined her childhood are long gone. Her relationship is loveless. She keeps the cherry liqueur close at hand. In the shimmering heat of summer, time seems to stand still – until 46-year-old wind energy engineer, Klaus, arrives.', 'Five houses, one bus stop, cows and nothing but fields. 24-year-old Christin lives on the farm of her long-term boyfriend Jan. The exciting post-reunification years that defined her childhood are long gone. Her relationship is loveless. She keeps the cherry liqueur close at hand. In the shimmering heat of summer, time seems to stand still – until 46-year-old wind energy engineer, Klaus, arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4bFO5DxTSGGSVqB85mdHz59rTj0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846803'),
  ('457145809337128104', 'No Orchids for Miss Blandish', 1948, 'Crime', 'St. John Legh Clowes, Gerald Gibbs', 'St. John Legh Clowes, James Hadley Chase', 'Jack La Rue, Hugh McDermott, Linden Travers, Walter Crisham, MacDonald Parke, Danny Green, Lilli Molnar, Charles Goldner', null, 'A sheltered heiress is abducted on her wedding night by a trio of cheap hoods.', 'A sheltered heiress is abducted on her wedding night by a trio of cheap hoods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB9moW3XkdCZ0lXn3hWVUgAaSJw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35986'),
  ('242875626182724941', 'No Ordinary Heist', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Colin McIvor', 'Colin McIvor, Aisling Corristine', 'Eddie Marsan, Éanna Hardwicke, Michelle Fairley, Eva Birthistle, Forrest Bothwell', null, 'Based on the true 2004 Northern Bank robbery, two feuding bank employees are forced to execute Ireland''s biggest heist after criminals kidnap their families and threaten to kill them.', 'Based on the true 2004 Northern Bank robbery, two feuding bank employees are forced to execute Ireland''s biggest heist after criminals kidnap their families and threaten to kill them.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FeA2uQxSMqyljAtt920084tDrw6G.jpg', 'plex:movie:no-ordinary-heist'),
  ('827530193302867784', 'No Ordinary Love‎', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Doug Witkins', null, 'Smith Forté, Ericka Klein, Robert Pecora, Koing Kuoch, Mark S. Larson', null, 'No desire is forbidden in this twisted suspense-comedy about a group of sexually ambivalent 20-somethings living in the Hollywood Hills. Kevin shares space with a male stripper, a girl who dreams of becoming a rock star and an orphaned teenager -- and none of them pay any rent. But after another renter falls to his death in a drunken stupor, Kevin''s landlady -- who also happens to be his mother -- threatens to evict him.', 'No desire is forbidden in this twisted suspense-comedy about a group of sexually ambivalent 20-somethings living in the Hollywood Hills. Kevin shares space with a male stripper, a girl who dreams of becoming a rock star and an orphaned teenager -- and none of them pay any rent. But after another renter falls to his death in a drunken stupor, Kevin''s landlady -- who also happens to be his mother -- threatens to evict him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uoH2zovbhozeSCJCtG0WmnO3Pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50060'),
  ('859233758920581261', 'No Other Choice', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Park Chan-wook, Kim Woo-hyung, Kim Min-jae', 'Park Chan-wook, Lee Kyoung-mi, Don McKellar', 'Lee Byung-hun, Son Ye-jin, Park Hee-soon, Lee Sung-min, Yeom Hye-ran, Cha Seung-won, Kim Woo-seung, Choi So-yul', 'R', 'After being laid off and humiliated by a ruthless job market, a veteran paper mill manager descends into violence in a desperate bid to reclaim his dignity.', 'After being laid off and humiliated by a ruthless job market, a veteran paper mill manager descends into violence in a desperate bid to reclaim his dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sBpxTGLzKnvPSVtL5yQYpSxvKEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639988'),
  ('905178120315446406', 'No Other Land', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Basel Adra, Hamdan Ballal, Yuval Abraham', 'Basel Adra, Hamdan Ballal, Rachel Szor', 'Basel Adra, Yuval Abraham, Farisa Abu Aram, Nasser Adra, Harun Abu Aram, Kifah Adara', 'NR', 'This film made by a Palestinian-Israeli collective shows the destruction of the occupied West Bank''s Masafer Yatta by Israeli soldiers and the alliance which develops between the Palestinian activist Basel and Israeli journalist Yuval.', 'This film made by a Palestinian-Israeli collective shows the destruction of the occupied West Bank''s Masafer Yatta by Israeli soldiers and the alliance which develops between the Palestinian activist Basel and Israeli journalist Yuval.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7XYieuZg9kMe07i9VI4bfGN4Pw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1232493'),
  ('806639370168099496', 'No Other Love', 2026, 'Romance, Crime, Mystery', 'Yuan Mei, Zeng Jian, Cho Young-wuk', 'Qiang Li', 'Yuan Quan, Geng Le, Ning Jing, Yu Feihong, Qi Xi, Joan Chen, Sun Yue, Shi Ke', null, 'The Pandora''s box opened in the name of love has already been unlocked. When love is consumed by obsession, just how many uncrossable boundaries will one break just to hold onto what they call "love"?', 'The Pandora''s box opened in the name of love has already been unlocked. When love is consumed by obsession, just how many uncrossable boundaries will one break just to hold onto what they call "love"?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGKsrIWhoceXLcVlnZlOUTkuev1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1566589'),
  ('405426389700287595', 'No Pain, No Gain', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Víctor García León, Mischa Lluch, Iñaki Beraza', 'Jonás Trueba, Víctor García León', 'Biel Duran, Bárbara Lennie, Manuel Lozano, Fernando Conde, Assun Planas, Pilar Duque, María Galiana, Enrique San Francisco', null, 'David is a teenager who feels he doesn''t belong to a life where his family, friends and the girl he loves seem not to understand him.', 'David is a teenager who feels he doesn''t belong to a life where his family, friends and the girl he loves seem not to understand him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RJSWGejX5S25ijRoH3fsf8KTn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108707'),
  ('46168037808343897', 'No Parking Hare', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, John T. Smith', 'NR', 'A construction worker wants to blast Bugs out of his rabbit hole so he can build a freeway.', 'A construction worker wants to blast Bugs out of his rabbit hole so he can build a freeway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gfK6hj1WN7SvYqhTOoUufeFGAeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235799'),
  ('739215297203686753', 'No Path Through Fire', 1967, 'Drama, War', 'Gleb Panfilov, Dmitriy Dolinin, Georgiy Salye', 'Yevgeni Gabrilovich, Gleb Panfilov', 'Inna Churikova, Mikhail Kononov, Anatoliy Solonitsyn, Mikhail Gluzskiy, Maya Bulgakova, Yevgeni Lebedev, Mikhail Kokshenov, Anatoli Marenich', null, 'A talented girl is trying to find happiness amidst the Russian revolution of 1917 and the civil war that split the nation.', 'A talented girl is trying to find happiness amidst the Russian revolution of 1917 and the civil war that split the nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4LWrBF8IPfqejNv0IY7g3vCI6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83444'),
  ('882663864466609404', 'No Place Like Home', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lee Grant, Laszlo George, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Sam Blackwell, Ara Watson', 'Christine Lahti, Jeff Daniels, Scott Marlowe, CCH Pounder, Kathy Bates, Anne Pitoniak, Lantz Landry, Kyndra Joy Casper', null, 'A Pittsburgh apartment superintendent loses his job and home when the apartment building where he lives and works at is suddenly destroyed by fire. Daniel and his family moves in with his brother but that doesn''t last for long due to the two families not getting along with each other. The family moves from rundown hotels to homeless shelters as Daniel searches work as a electrician while his wife takes waitress jobs to try to make ends meet.', 'A Pittsburgh apartment superintendent loses his job and home when the apartment building where he lives and works at is suddenly destroyed by fire. Daniel and his family moves in with his brother but that doesn''t last for long due to the two families not getting along with each other. The family moves from rundown hotels to homeless shelters as Daniel searches work as a electrician while his wife takes waitress jobs to try to make ends meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWQokp8VbxRcU8ZP3sIGWR3Ttap.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193592'),
  ('667385391527487203', 'No Place to Go', 2000, 'Drama', 'Hagen Bogdanski, Oskar Roehler', 'Oskar Roehler', 'Hannelore Elsner, Vadim Glowna, Michael Gwisdek, Jasmin Tabatabai, Lars Rudolph, Nina Petri, Tonio Arango, Claudia Geisler-Bading', null, 'Flanders, a famous female author, travels in 1989 after the fall of the Berlin wall into the German capital. She is deeply depressed by the events because she saw the communist state as a very good thing that has now ended. In the joy of these days she finds no one to understand her, so she has to travel back to Munich. After meeting several people, known and unknown, it seems as if there will be no way to go.', 'Flanders, a famous female author, travels in 1989 after the fall of the Berlin wall into the German capital. She is deeply depressed by the events because she saw the communist state as a very good thing that has now ended. In the joy of these days she finds no one to understand her, so she has to travel back to Munich. After meeting several people, known and unknown, it seems as if there will be no way to go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/717vz9TOdNejUm8eHKPxXcCvoW8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10500'),
  ('16135938219061427', 'No Place to Hide', 1974, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Allen Schnitzer', 'Larry Beinhart, Robert Allen Schnitzer', 'Sylvester Stallone, Henry G. Sanders, Tony Page, Vickie Lancaster, Dennis Tate, Barbara Lee Govan, Roy White, Jed Mills', 'PG', 'In New York in the late 60s, a politically motivated group of students plans bombings of company offices who do business with dictators in Middle American countries. But when they contact a known terrorist and bombing specialist, the FBI gets on their track.', 'In New York in the late 60s, a politically motivated group of students plans bombings of company offices who do business with dictators in Middle American countries. But when they contact a known terrorist and bombing specialist, the FBI gets on their track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydQkPclFyaB74lQp32B6xJNgVnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174383'),
  ('930562862629671895', 'No Place to Hide', 1992, 'Thriller', 'Richard Danus', 'Richard Danus', 'Kris Kristofferson, Drew Barrymore, Martin Landau, O. J. Simpson, Illana Diamant, Dey Young, Bruce Weitz, Lilyan Chauvin', 'R', 'Detective Joe Garvey is called in to a mysterious case: a ballerina has been slayed on stage during a performance, it seems she didn''t even fight. At her house Garvey finds her 14 years old precocious sister Tinsel. She''s not very cooperative, so he arranges to have her sent to the orphanage -- until she''s attacked too. He takes her under his wings, and soon both get the attention of a secret organization.', 'Detective Joe Garvey is called in to a mysterious case: a ballerina has been slayed on stage during a performance, it seems she didn''t even fight. At her house Garvey finds her 14 years old precocious sister Tinsel. She''s not very cooperative, so he arranges to have her sent to the orphanage -- until she''s attacked too. He takes her under his wings, and soon both get the attention of a secret organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xsgAsIvzNk761Xdyijiem6LlWl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94005'),
  ('1007711630889849251', 'No Pockets in a Shroud', 1974, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Marcel Weiss, Luc Andrieux', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Alain Moury', 'Jean-Pierre Mocky, Jean Carmet, Michel Constantin, Michel Galabru, Daniel Gélin, Michael Lonsdale, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Martine Sarcey', null, 'In the newspaper he has just founded, journalist Dolannes exposes all the wheeling and dealing and scandals that go on in his town.', 'In the newspaper he has just founded, journalist Dolannes exposes all the wheeling and dealing and scandals that go on in his town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tM4GRg56CICjbpfOiTbmkEpS9aK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64337'),
