  ('838181185476585155', 'No Questions Asked', 1951, 'Drama', 'Harold F. Kress, Harold Lipstein', 'Sidney Sheldon', 'Barry Sullivan, Arlene Dahl, George Murphy, Jean Hagen, Richard Anderson, Moroni Olsen, Danny Dayton, Dick Simmons', 'NR', 'With the help of some seedy gangsters, young attorney Steve Keiver makes some quick cash by bending the law, and in the process, he impresses the mobsters so much that they invite him to work for them on a regular basis. But when Police Inspector Matt Duggan realizes that Steve is working as a middleman for the mob, the young lawyer finds himself in a life-threatening situation. In order to clear his name, he must betray the deadly crooks he''s been working for.', 'With the help of some seedy gangsters, young attorney Steve Keiver makes some quick cash by bending the law, and in the process, he impresses the mobsters so much that they invite him to work for them on a regular basis. But when Police Inspector Matt Duggan realizes that Steve is working as a middleman for the mob, the young lawyer finds himself in a life-threatening situation. In order to clear his name, he must betray the deadly crooks he''s been working for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVGkYk7d7mJKFLATjJyJfCnE7jz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73313'),
  ('240921808592232774', 'No quiero dormir sola', 2012, 'Drama', 'Natalia Beristáin, Dariela Ludlow Deloya', 'Gabriela Vidal, Natalia Beristáin', 'Mariana Gajá, Adriana Roel, Arturo Beristáin, Emma Dib, Leonardo Ortizgris', null, 'Amanda is 33 years old. Her dull life is suddenly altered when she is forced to take care of her old alcoholic grandmother, Dolores, a retired actress who lives on her past glories. Up until now, Amanda has never had much of a relationship with her grandmother.', 'Amanda is 33 years old. Her dull life is suddenly altered when she is forced to take care of her old alcoholic grandmother, Dolores, a retired actress who lives on her past glories. Up until now, Amanda has never had much of a relationship with her grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQvDz8CpOb8QN58bxE9LpMHLovK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143242'),
  ('1020728060790864033', 'No Reason', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Olaf Ittenbach, Axel Rubbel', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Irene Holzfurtner, Matthias Engel, Alexander Gamnitzer, Andreas Pape, Annika Strauss, Ralph Willmann, Markus Hettich, Timothy Balme', 'R', 'Engulfed by anguish, trapped inside an allegory of torment and carnage, Jennifer''s soul seeks the path of awareness and enlightenment when she meets a mysterious masked man.', 'Engulfed by anguish, trapped inside an allegory of torment and carnage, Jennifer''s soul seeks the path of awareness and enlightenment when she meets a mysterious masked man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEPbdn66FkFOOHLxcSX8jJP5hjS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56603'),
  ('531249034893315757', 'No Regret', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leesong Hee-il, Yun Ji-woon, Kang Seong-hoon', 'Leesong Hee-il', 'Kim Nam-gil, Lee Young-hoon, Kim Dong-wook, Jung Seung-kil, Hwang Choon-ha, Park Mi-hyeon, Park Ki-woong, Lee Seung-cheol', null, 'Su-min is an orphan trying to balance work in a factory with study at an art college and an evening job. One night, a rich young businessman makes an advance on him during one of his driving jobs.', 'Su-min is an orphan trying to balance work in a factory with study at an art college and an evening job. One night, a rich young businessman makes an advance on him during one of his driving jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGk0qv3WpOriF0r0ltLOPlDkpsz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33199'),
  ('968350359653437651', 'No Regrets', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andi Wecker, David Schultz, Benjamin Quabeck', 'Benjamin Quabeck, Hendrik Hölzemann', 'Daniel Brühl, Jessica Schwarz, Marie-Lou Sellem, Denis Moschitto, Josef Heynert, Sonja Rogusch, Gerd Croll, Ellis Heiden', null, 'This teenage drama deals with the emotional chaos of a high school graduate at the beginning of a new period of his life. 19-year-old Daniel is frustrated: he wants his great love Luca to be the "first" woman in his life, but she seems to be unreachable, so he is still a virgin. During his community service as a male nurse, his boss Anna falls in love with him and they finally have sex. Suddenly Luca is interested in Daniel...', 'This teenage drama deals with the emotional chaos of a high school graduate at the beginning of a new period of his life. 19-year-old Daniel is frustrated: he wants his great love Luca to be the "first" woman in his life, but she seems to be unreachable, so he is still a virgin. During his community service as a male nurse, his boss Anna falls in love with him and they finally have sex. Suddenly Luca is interested in Daniel...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbSOuvp6NhpApUKY8mB4cDLyV1J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2194'),
  ('359063526381844708', 'No Regrets for Our Youth', 1946, 'Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa, Asakazu Nakai', 'Akira Kurosawa, Eijiro Hisaita, Keiji Matsuzaki', 'Setsuko Hara, Susumu Fujita, Denjirō Ōkōchi, Haruko Sugimura, Eiko Miyoshi, Akitake Kōno, Kokuten Kōdō, Takashi Shimura', null, 'After her anti-fascist professor father is dismissed, Yukie navigates love, political repression, and wartime upheaval—ultimately forging her own path in pre- and post-WWII Japan.', 'After her anti-fascist professor father is dismissed, Yukie navigates love, political repression, and wartime upheaval—ultimately forging her own path in pre- and post-WWII Japan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NEgykELHbMdyDzGSsbUIGZsN9k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43487'),
  ('960996299107517690', 'No Reservations', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Stuart Dryburgh, Scott Hicks, Edward Pisoni', 'Carol Fuchs', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Aaron Eckhart, Abigail Breslin, Patricia Clarkson, Jenny Wade, Bob Balaban, Brían F. O''Byrne, Lily Rabe', 'PG', 'Master chef Kate Armstrong runs her life and her kitchen with intimidating intensity. However, a recipe for disaster may be in the works when she becomes the guardian of her young niece while crossing forks with the brash sous-chef who just joined her staff. Though romance blooms in the face of rivalry, Kate needs to look outside the kitchen to find true happiness.', 'Master chef Kate Armstrong runs her life and her kitchen with intimidating intensity. However, a recipe for disaster may be in the works when she becomes the guardian of her young niece while crossing forks with the brash sous-chef who just joined her staff. Though romance blooms in the face of rivalry, Kate needs to look outside the kitchen to find true happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKqfRSf0DZ0Qey1f9ZHuZfsmXVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3638'),
  ('258010299980135001', 'No Rest for the Brave', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alain Guiraudie, Antoine Héberlé', 'Alain Guiraudie, Frédéric Videau', 'Thomas Suire, Thomas Blanchard, Laurent Soffiati, Vincent Martin, Pierre-Maurice Nouvel, Roger Guidone', null, 'A strange man is involved in a village massacre and drug dealing.', 'A strange man is involved in a village massacre and drug dealing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29VSb1cAAAXHRMOso6rVYQyGKLT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104505'),
  ('531173474323136006', 'No Rest for the Wicked', 2011, 'Thriller', 'Enrique Urbizu, Unax Mendia, Paloma Molina', 'Michel Gaztambide, Enrique Urbizu', 'Jose Coronado, Helena Miquel, Rodolfo Sancho, Juanjo Artero, Pedro Mari Sánchez, Younes Bachir, Nadia Casado, Juan Pablo Shuk', null, 'Madrid, the beginning of the century. One day, the police inspector Santos Trinidad coming home very drunk, is involved in a triple murder. But there is a witness who managed to escape and that could incriminate him. Santos undertakes an investigation to locate and eliminate the witness. Meanwhile, Chacón a judge in charge of investigating the triple murder, meticulously advances in the search for the murderer. Santos and Chacon soon discover that what seemed a simple case of drug trafficking is actually something far more dangerous.', 'Madrid, the beginning of the century. One day, the police inspector Santos Trinidad coming home very drunk, is involved in a triple murder. But there is a witness who managed to escape and that could incriminate him. Santos undertakes an investigation to locate and eliminate the witness. Meanwhile, Chacón a judge in charge of investigating the triple murder, meticulously advances in the search for the murderer. Santos and Chacon soon discover that what seemed a simple case of drug trafficking is actually something far more dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3DI1iu6IYuw3fpOQ83ijKG9e3A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76013'),
  ('735454251441366335', 'No Retreat, No Surrender', 1986, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'David Golia, Corey Yuen, John Huneck', 'Keith W. Strandberg', 'Kurt McKinney, Jean-Claude Van Damme, J.W. Fails, Kathie Sileno, Kim Tae-Jeong, Kent Lipham, Ron Pohnel, Dale Jacoby', 'PG', 'The mob is trying to strongarm local martial arts schools, forcing young Jason Stillwell and his family to move after his father is injured defending their dojo. With his father now rejecting violence, Jason is forced to train on his own to protect himself and his best friend from the members of a rival karate school.', 'The mob is trying to strongarm local martial arts schools, forcing young Jason Stillwell and his family to move after his father is injured defending their dojo. With his father now rejecting violence, Jason is forced to train on his own to protect himself and his best friend from the members of a rival karate school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDwcHvRXIRVCD2RLACEsykzoHPe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12721'),
  ('554489791999886931', 'No Retreat, No Surrender 2: Raging Thunder', 1987, 'Action, Adventure', 'Corey Yuen, Philip Ma Kam-Cheung, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Maria Elena Cellino, Roy Horan, Keith W. Strandberg', 'Loren Avedon, Cynthia Rothrock, Max Thayer, Matthias Hues, Hwang Jang-Lee, Nirut Sirijanya, Perm Hongsakul, Chesda ''Pop'' Smithsuth', 'R', 'In this sequel, Scott Wylde, an American kickboxer, must go to Cambodia to rescue his Vietnamese girlfriend from Russian and Vietnamese troops.', 'In this sequel, Scott Wylde, an American kickboxer, must go to Cambodia to rescue his Vietnamese girlfriend from Russian and Vietnamese troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkcccWO9UtQIzJIGXCT0Maem39o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42012'),
  ('1135792681629425327', 'No Retreat, No Surrender 3: Blood Brothers', 1990, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Lo Yuen-Ming, John Huneck', 'Keith W. Strandberg', 'Loren Avedon, Keith Vitali, Joseph Campanella, Wanda Acuna, Rion Hunter, Luke Askew, Mark Russo, Sherrie Rose', 'R', 'Two feuding brothers (one a policeman, the other a martial arts expert) of different political views, join forces to avenge the death of their father, a retired agent, killed by the mafia.', 'Two feuding brothers (one a policeman, the other a martial arts expert) of different political views, join forces to avenge the death of their father, a retired agent, killed by the mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3r3ENoHaOt4dUrqRKiKa3sqfMa0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36884'),
  ('1018373012500007071', 'No Return', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Miguel Cohan, Hugo Colace', 'Ana Cohan, Miguel Cohan', 'Leonardo Sbaraglia, Martín Slipak, Bárbara Goenaga, Luis Machín, Ana Celentano, Arturo Goetz, Agustín Vázquez, Federico Luppi', null, 'A thriller centered on a man who is accused of a crime he didn''t commit.', 'A thriller centered on a man who is accused of a crime he didn''t commit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf6W92FSnCZuynZb9htc6NC4OXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57019'),
  ('895280565285062978', 'No Returns Accepted', 2018, 'Comedy', 'André Moraes, Hsu Chien, André Lavenère', 'Eugenio Derbez, Ana Maria Moretzsohn, Patrícia Moretzsohn', 'Leandro Hassum, Laura Ramos, Jarbas Homem de Mello, Manuela Kfouri, Giovanna Correa Aiello, Zéu Britto, Maria Bia, Ana Carolina Machado', null, 'Juca Valente owns a kiosk on the coast of São Paulo and just wants to have fun. An eternal flirt, he hates big responsibilities and doesn''t think about having anything serious with anyone. But his life takes an entirely different turn when an American ex-girlfriend dumps a baby on him and disappears. Juca then leaves for the United States with the intention of returning the child, not imagining that he would start liking the idea of being a father.', 'Juca Valente owns a kiosk on the coast of São Paulo and just wants to have fun. An eternal flirt, he hates big responsibilities and doesn''t think about having anything serious with anyone. But his life takes an entirely different turn when an American ex-girlfriend dumps a baby on him and disappears. Juca then leaves for the United States with the intention of returning the child, not imagining that he would start liking the idea of being a father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2I7tRFLss54Kjyq9p0gPf74lXXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494491'),
  ('836297473601237004', 'No Safe Haven', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Ronnie Rondell Jr.', 'Nancy Locke, Wings Hauser', 'Wings Hauser, Robert Tessier, Branscombe Richmond, Robert Ahola, Marina Rice Bader, Harvey Martin, Tom Campitelli, Nancy Locke', 'R', 'When his family is murdered by members of a drug gang, an undercover CIA agent tracks them down, but they escape and flee to their hideout, a fortress in South America. Knowing he can''t count on the local authorities for aid, he calls on one of his fellow CIA agents for help in cracking the fortress, and getting to the gangsters and eliminating them and their leader.', 'When his family is murdered by members of a drug gang, an undercover CIA agent tracks them down, but they escape and flee to their hideout, a fortress in South America. Knowing he can''t count on the local authorities for aid, he calls on one of his fellow CIA agents for help in cracking the fortress, and getting to the gangsters and eliminating them and their leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zssIIlZIZzGiyDMny2UbbaoQiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85256'),
  ('413720625850554358', 'No Sail', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'Donald and Goofy rent a sailboat. This boat is a bit unusual: to rent it, you put a nickel in a slot, and the mast and sail pop up. Unfortunately, after a while, they pop back down. When Donald runs out of nickels, they are marooned. Goofy waves his shirt at a passing cruise ship, but they (and he) mistake this for a friendly greeting. A flying fish lands in the boat; while the boys fight over it, a gull grabs it. They try to bash the gull, which lands atop their heads, with predictable results. Finally, as the sharks circle, they try fishing, with Donald as the unwitting bait. He eventually lands back in the boat, where his bill lands in the coin slot and gives them a way home.', 'Donald and Goofy rent a sailboat. This boat is a bit unusual: to rent it, you put a nickel in a slot, and the mast and sail pop up. Unfortunately, after a while, they pop back down. When Donald runs out of nickels, they are marooned. Goofy waves his shirt at a passing cruise ship, but they (and he) mistake this for a friendly greeting. A flying fish lands in the boat; while the boys fight over it, a gull grabs it. They try to bash the gull, which lands atop their heads, with predictable results. Finally, as the sharks circle, they try fishing, with Donald as the unwitting bait. He eventually lands back in the boat, where his bill lands in the coin slot and gives them a way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7m4lj89JDsdwlvvShz9AotdWRr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67143'),
  ('618624681124688932', 'No Sex Please - We''re British', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Cliff Owen, Ken Hodges, Ariel Levy', 'Anthony Marriott, Brian Cooke, Johnnie Mortimer', 'Ronnie Corbett, Beryl Reid, Arthur Lowe, Ian Ogilvy, Susan Penhaligon, Michael Bates, Cheryl Hall, David Swift', 'NR', 'A porn-store owner orders some new stuff from his supplier, but the delivery address gets mixed with the address of the local Barclays Bank. Here, David (the bank''s assistant manager) and his new wife are shocked when photos, then films and finally two girls are sent to them in their bank-supplied flat. They and the bank''s head cashier then hatch a plan to get rid of the porn—without letting their boss, the local police and David''s mother in on what is happening.', 'A porn-store owner orders some new stuff from his supplier, but the delivery address gets mixed with the address of the local Barclays Bank. Here, David (the bank''s assistant manager) and his new wife are shocked when photos, then films and finally two girls are sent to them in their bank-supplied flat. They and the bank''s head cashier then hatch a plan to get rid of the porn—without letting their boss, the local police and David''s mother in on what is happening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAd05FIQqKuO3kZLz0xLDN1b3ge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131047'),
  ('1093305198724071991', 'No Shame', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Joaquín Oristrell', 'Joaquín Oristrell, Cristina Rota, Dominic Harari', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Candela Peña, Carmen Balagué, Elvira Lindo, Jorge Sanz, Dani Martín, Nur Levi, Nacho Casalvaque', null, 'A movie script is presented to Isabel. After reading it she realizes it''s based on an old love affair she had with movie director Mario Fabra, the author of the script.', 'A movie script is presented to Isabel. After reading it she realizes it''s based on an old love affair she had with movie director Mario Fabra, the author of the script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giVbmDkkXHR6AVt89vEKSbteprL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75688'),
