  ('869817080763119395', 'No Skin Off My Ass', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Bruce LaBruce', 'Bruce LaBruce, G.B. Jones, Klaus von Buecker, Caroline Azar, Beverly Breckenridge, Laurel Pervis, Kate Ashley, Jena von Brücker', 'NR', 'A lonely hairdresser watches the title sequence of "That Cold Day in the Park" then visits a local park to invite a down-and-out skinhead to his apartment. He draws the silent man a bath and talks to him as he soaks. He locks his guest in a bedroom. Next day, the skinhead leaves through the window and visits his sister, who''s making a film called "Sisters of the SLA." He helps with a screen-test. The hairdresser has dreams and fantasies involving the skinhead, the skinhead returns to visit him, and then the filmmaker pays a call on the two men, exposing her brother as faking his silence and pretending a lack of sexual interest. Fantasies can come true.', 'A lonely hairdresser watches the title sequence of "That Cold Day in the Park" then visits a local park to invite a down-and-out skinhead to his apartment. He draws the silent man a bath and talks to him as he soaks. He locks his guest in a bedroom. Next day, the skinhead leaves through the window and visits his sister, who''s making a film called "Sisters of the SLA." He helps with a screen-test. The hairdresser has dreams and fantasies involving the skinhead, the skinhead returns to visit him, and then the filmmaker pays a call on the two men, exposing her brother as faking his silence and pretending a lack of sexual interest. Fantasies can come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxzdWgAsCiw0WMT29Fl4w8njjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36833'),
  ('1087716138785259999', 'No Sleep ''Til Christmas', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Phil Traill', 'Steve Smith, Phil Traill', 'Odette Annable, Dave Annable, Charles Michael Davis, Alphonso McAuley, Sheryl Lee Ralph, Marsha Mason, Sherman Tsang, Tina Jung', null, 'Lizzie, a high-end event planner, lies awake nightly while her devoted fiancé Josh rests peacefully. When a sleep-deprived incident causes her to run into Billy, a low-key bartender who is just as sleepless and frustrated as she is, they discover that they can only fall asleep while next to each other.', 'Lizzie, a high-end event planner, lies awake nightly while her devoted fiancé Josh rests peacefully. When a sleep-deprived incident causes her to run into Billy, a low-key bartender who is just as sleepless and frustrated as she is, they discover that they can only fall asleep while next to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iC3K1xIG5qZBOhjtxt11Oruvj1H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:550097'),
  ('397142379134316659', 'No Small Affair', 1984, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jerry Schatzberg, Vilmos Zsigmond', 'Terence Mulcahy, Craig Bolotin', 'Jon Cryer, Demi Moore, George Wendt, Peter Frechette, E. G. Daily, Ann Wedgeworth, Jeffrey Tambor, Tim Robbins', 'R', 'A 16-year-old aspiring photographer pursues a beautiful "older woman" of 22, a down-on-her-luck rock singer.', 'A 16-year-old aspiring photographer pursues a beautiful "older woman" of 22, a down-on-her-luck rock singer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vwtsHfe7zrkGFD10K7AkhEQk5cE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44772'),
  ('1012411938414501031', 'No Smoking', 1951, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig', null, 'Goofy (again playing George Geef) is a nicotine addict to the extreme. He smokes while doing income tax, before going to bed, after waking up in the morning, and at work. Finally, he decides to quit. He soon learns it''s not as easy as that and everywhere he looks, he is tempted to start again until he finally cracks. He runs everywhere yelling, "Smoke! Smoke! Smoke!" but with no luck. Finally, he asks a man for a cigar and the man gladly gives him one...an exploding cigar which finally has Goofy vowing, "I quit!".', 'Goofy (again playing George Geef) is a nicotine addict to the extreme. He smokes while doing income tax, before going to bed, after waking up in the morning, and at work. Finally, he decides to quit. He soon learns it''s not as easy as that and everywhere he looks, he is tempted to start again until he finally cracks. He runs everywhere yelling, "Smoke! Smoke! Smoke!" but with no luck. Finally, he asks a man for a cigar and the man gladly gives him one...an exploding cigar which finally has Goofy vowing, "I quit!".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tuZm3Yywyl9U2yAt3rW4OcozVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67145'),
  ('601686732479277549', 'No Smoking', 1993, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Alain Resnais', 'Agnès Jaoui, Jean-Pierre Bacri', 'Sabine Azéma, Pierre Arditi, Peter Hudson', null, 'Two actors play eighteen different roles in a story that asks the question: would my life have been different if I hadn''t lit a cigarette?', 'Two actors play eighteen different roles in a story that asks the question: would my life have been different if I hadn''t lit a cigarette?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dMgBWnLnRmYVseagm7XMi2WrXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695792'),
  ('514327475591811732', 'No Smoking', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy', 'David Feiss', 'David Feiss', 'Charlie Adler, Dee Bradley Baker, Jess Harnell, Candi Milo', null, 'Cow must save her brother Chicken after he is sent to Hell for smoking. Short film that later became the Cartoon Network show Cow & Chicken', 'Cow must save her brother Chicken after he is sent to Hell for smoking. Short film that later became the Cartoon Network show Cow & Chicken', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o766gFOPJePGtn4qFCN8LBWHfk2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:504276'),
  ('17333997959164534', 'No Smoking', 2007, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anurag Kashyap, Rohit Khaitan, Rajeev Ravi', 'Anurag Kashyap', 'John Abraham, Ayesha Takia, Paresh Rawal, Ranvir Shorey, Kiku Sharda, Vikramaditya Motwane, Jesse Randhawa, Bipasha Basu', null, 'A heavily addicted smoker is unprepared for the true price he must pay when he asks a guru''s help to kick the habit.', 'A heavily addicted smoker is unprepared for the true price he must pay when he asks a guru''s help to kick the habit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gBiC8PvATw7cMhszMvPVBuTt93M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36204'),
  ('933644875362602166', 'No Songs of Love', 2005, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Sonja Rom, Lars Kraume', 'Lars Kraume', 'Florian Lukas, Jürgen Vogel, Heike Makatsch, Monika Hansen, Thees Uhlmann, Marcus Wiebusch, Felix Gebhard, Thomas Dannemann', null, 'As Tobias, a young director, supposes that his girl-friend Ellen had an affair with his brother Markus, front man of "Hansen", one year ago, he decides to shoot a documentary about the band''s next tour. When Ellen joins the project, everybody''s emotions boil over, although they are observed all the time.', 'As Tobias, a young director, supposes that his girl-friend Ellen had an affair with his brother Markus, front man of "Hansen", one year ago, he decides to shoot a documentary about the band''s next tour. When Ellen joins the project, everybody''s emotions boil over, although they are observed all the time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq1Pbm0SevZBTwUaIIDC5b8CE1i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1539'),
  ('311822601456774953', 'No Stone Unturned', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney', 'Alex Gibney', null, 'PG', 'Ireland''s victory over Italy at the World Cup in New Jersey in 1994, remains a source of Irish pride. But it is haunted by memories of a massacre: terrorists opened fire and killed six innocents while they watched the match in a small village pub in Northern Ireland. Remarkably, no one was ever charged for the crime. For more than twenty years the victims'' families have searched for answers. Now, at last, they may have found them. But what they learn turns a murder mystery into bigger inquiry relevant for us all: what happens when governments cover up the truth?', 'Ireland''s victory over Italy at the World Cup in New Jersey in 1994, remains a source of Irish pride. But it is haunted by memories of a massacre: terrorists opened fire and killed six innocents while they watched the match in a small village pub in Northern Ireland. Remarkably, no one was ever charged for the crime. For more than twenty years the victims'' families have searched for answers. Now, at last, they may have found them. But what they learn turns a murder mystery into bigger inquiry relevant for us all: what happens when governments cover up the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8HLgfeyGzGZeIOGNMUUs5rm3LY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473409'),
  ('738164330843765203', 'No Stranger Than Love', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nick Wernham, Michael LeBlanc', 'Steve Adams', 'Alison Brie, Justin Chatwin, Colin Hanks, Mark Forward, Christopher Cordell, Lisa Berry, Justin Bigelli, Robin Brûlé', null, 'What is stranger than the big hole that opens up in Lucy Sherrington''s living room floor? As it turns out, love.', 'What is stranger than the big hole that opens up in Lucy Sherrington''s living room floor? As it turns out, love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP8ebd45wsV2gbpnYPcNO5Jm4oy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243752'),
