  ('426108247029602384', 'No Time to Die', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Luke Whitelock, Charlotte Leatherland, Arwel Evans', 'Robert Wade, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Neal Purvis', 'Daniel Craig, Léa Seydoux, Rami Malek, Lashana Lynch, Ralph Fiennes, Ben Whishaw, Naomie Harris, Rory Kinnear', 'PG-13', 'Bond has left active service and is enjoying a tranquil life in Jamaica. His peace is short-lived when his old friend Felix Leiter from the CIA turns up asking for help. The mission to rescue a kidnapped scientist turns out to be far more treacherous than expected, leading Bond onto the trail of a mysterious villain armed with dangerous new technology.', 'Bond has left active service and is enjoying a tranquil life in Jamaica. His peace is short-lived when his old friend Felix Leiter from the CIA turns up asking for help. The mission to rescue a kidnapped scientist turns out to be far more treacherous than expected, leading Bond onto the trail of a mysterious villain armed with dangerous new technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUgygt3fscRoKWCV1d0C7FbM9TP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370172'),
  ('792715680702657295', 'No Time to Spy: A Loud House Movie', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Kyle Marshall', 'Jeff Sayers, Whitney Wetta', 'Bentley Griffin, Alex Cazares, Piotr Michael, Brian Stepanek, Amy Sedaris, Jessica DiCicco, Lara Jill Miller, Jill Talley', 'G', 'Lincoln and the Louds are ecstatic to welcome their new Gran-Gran, Myrtle, into the family with a tropical wedding celebration; but the festivities are cut short when an old nemesis from Myrtle''s secret agent past appears on the island.', 'Lincoln and the Louds are ecstatic to welcome their new Gran-Gran, Myrtle, into the family with a tropical wedding celebration; but the festivities are cut short when an old nemesis from Myrtle''s secret agent past appears on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mh4Mk95u7fdY4D4t5kRGQpQbVFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280768'),
